rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the card is not played by end of turn, it remains exiled until end of game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card is face-up when exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact will trigger when Sculpting Steel enters the battlefield. Any "as enters the battlefield" or "enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen artifact will also work. For example, if Sculpting Steel copies an artifact creature with sunburst, the copy will get +1/+1 counters based on the number of different colors of mana used to pay Sculpting Steel\\\'s total cost. If Sculpting Steel copies a noncreature artifact with sunburst, the copy will get charge counters based on the number of different colors of mana used to pay Sculpting Steel\\\'s total cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen artifact is a token, your Sculpting Steel copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Your Sculpting Steel is not considered to be a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen artifact is copying something else (for example, if the chosen artifact is another Sculpting Steel), then your Sculpting Steel enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "Sculpting Steel doesn\'t copy whether the original artifact is tapped or untapped. It also doesn\'t copy any counters on that artifact, any Auras or Equipment attached to that artifact, or any effects that are currently affecting that artifact — you get exactly what\'s printed on the chosen card and nothing more. So if you copy an animated Chimeric Staff, for example, you get a normal, nonanimated Chimeric Staff."}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Sculpting Steel stays on the battlefield as an artifact that doesn\'t do much of anything."}]', "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': "If you give double strike to a creature after either first-strike or normal combat damage has been dealt, it won\'t help that creature deal any additional combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you give double strike to a creature with first strike after first-strike combat damage has been dealt, that creature will also deal damage during the normal combat damage step.\'}]', "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose yourself.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'In Two-Headed Giant, triggers only once per upkeep, not once for each player.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'The second ability puts a counter on each applicable creature regardless of who controls it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "The +1/+1 counter won\'t affect Llanowar Reborn in any way unless another effect turns it into a creature."}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Thousand-Year Elixir doesn’t actually grant haste to creatures you control, nor does it let you attack with them as though they had haste.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': \'A retrace card cast from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the creature it\'s copying — or, if that creature is itself a token, the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield — as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on the creature, nor will it copy other effects that have changed the creature\'s power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You\'re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "If the active player casts a spell that has retrace, that player may cast that card again after it resolves, before another player can remove the card from the graveyard. The active player has priority after the spell resolves, so they can immediately cast a new spell. Since casting a card with retrace from the graveyard moves that card onto the stack, no one else would have the chance to affect it while it\'s still in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered, it\'s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': \'A retrace card cast from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You\'re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "If the active player casts a spell that has retrace, that player may cast that card again after it resolves, before another player can remove the card from the graveyard. The active player has priority after the spell resolves, so they can immediately cast a new spell. Since casting a card with retrace from the graveyard moves that card onto the stack, no one else would have the chance to affect it while it\'s still in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered, it\'s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again."}]', "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If a creature card has “*” in its power or toughness, the ability that defines “*” works in all zones. Note that the card is in your library when Sapling of Colfenor’s ability checks the card’s power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the revealed card is not a creature card, it remains on top of your library.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability results in three sequential events: you gain some life (subject to effects that might alter life gain), then lose some life (subject to other effects that might alter life loss), and then put the card into your hand.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause Sapling of Colfenor to be put into the graveyard. However, Sapling of Colfenor could be put into the graveyard if its toughness becomes 0 or less, if it’s sacrificed, or if you control another Sapling of Colfenor (due to the “legend rule”).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If you cast a spell that’s both white and black, the last two abilities will both trigger. You may use them together to destroy any creature. To do so, put the “destroy” ability on the stack first, then put the “tap” ability on the stack, with each one targeting the same creature. When the abilities resolve, they’ll tap the creature, then destroy it.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The abilities are separate and cumulative. If another creature you control is both of the listed colors, it will get a total of +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The last ability can target any creature, not just a tapped creature (it doesn’t say “target tapped creature”). When the ability resolves, check whether the creature is tapped or not. If it’s tapped, you may destroy it. If it’s not tapped, the ability does nothing.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "Knight of the White Orchid\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The Plains you search for doesn\'t have to be basic. For example, you could put a Sacred Foundry onto the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Basic landcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on a card being basic landcycled. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops a basic landcycling ability from being activated.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Basic landcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with basic landcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Unlike the normal cycling ability, basic landcycling doesn’t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a basic land card. You don’t choose the type of basic land card you’ll find until you’re performing the search. After you choose a basic land card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You can choose not to find a basic land card, even if there is one in your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oran-Rief\'s second ability affects all permanents that are green creatures that entered the battlefield this turn, not just the ones you control."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oran-Rief\'s third ability cares about permanents\' characteristics at the time the ability resolves, not their characteristics at the time they entered the battlefield. For example, if a blue creature enters the battlefield, then is turned green by a spell or ability, then Oran-Rief\'s second ability resolves, you\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sanguine Bond\'s ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Soul Warden or 8 life from Tendrils of Corruption."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Sanguine Bond\'s ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop. If neither of these happen, the game ends in a draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Sanguine Bond\\\'s ability triggers only once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As the token or tokens are created, they check the printed values of the creature they’re copying — or, if that creature is itself a token, the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield — as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy counters on the creature, nor will it copy other effects that have changed the creature’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Rite of Replication resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t get any tokens.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The tokens see each other enter the battlefield. If they have a triggered ability that triggers when a creature enters the battlefield, they’ll all trigger for one another.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'The targeted permanents may be controlled by different players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a targeted permanent has indestructible or regenerates, its controller won\'t get an Elephant token for it. Similarly, if the targeted permanent is destroyed but a replacement effect moves it to a different zone instead of its owner\'s graveyard, its controller won\'t get an Elephant token for it."}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as Chain Reaction resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted player becomes an illegal target by the time Suffer the Past resolves but the targeted cards don’t, you still exile the cards and gain life. The player won’t be lose any life, though.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Suffer the Past’s effect causes a single life-gain event, not a number of separate ones. This matters for cards such as Cradle of Vitality.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The life that’s lost and the life that’s gained are based on the number of cards that are actually exiled, not on the value of X (in case any of the targeted cards somehow leave the graveyard in response and thus can’t be exiled this way).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Paying the activation cost of Elixir of Immortality’s ability doesn’t cause it to leave the battlefield. If you have a way to untap it, you can activate the ability multiple times in response to itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'As the ability resolves, you’ll shuffle Elixir of Immortality into its owner’s library directly from the battlefield, if it’s still there.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Elixir of Immortality is in your graveyard at the time the ability resolves, you’ll still wind up shuffling it into your library because you shuffle your entire graveyard into your library. If it’s anywhere else by that time, including in another player’s graveyard, it remains where it is and you shuffle just your graveyard into your library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s Elixir of Immortality and activate it, the Elixir of Immortality will be shuffled into its owner’s library and the cards in your graveyard will be shuffled into your library. You are considered to have shuffled each affected library (even if, as a shortcut, each player physically shuffles their own library).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Steel Hellkite\'s third ability is activated with X equal to 0, it will destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 0 the appropriate players control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a nonland permanent has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a token that\'s not copying of something else, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'In all cases, ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the permanent was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled those permanents at the time Steel Hellkite dealt combat damage, or if those permanents were even on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Steel Hellkite\'s last ability destroys only nonland permanents whose mana value is exactly equal to X, and only those controlled by players who have been dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The mana value of a permanent is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner, unless it\'s copying something else (see below). The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may activate the last ability even if Steel Hellkite hasn\'t dealt combat damage to any players that turn. If you do, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Venser’s Journal onto the battlefield, you’ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, that X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted artifact is an illegal target by the time the activated ability resolves, the ability doesn\'t resolve. Hoard-Smelter Dragon won\'t get the bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If the activated ability resolves but the targeted artifact isn\'t destroyed (perhaps because it has indestructible or it regenerates), Hoard-Smelter Dragon will still get the bonus."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you control three or more artifacts when Dispatch resolves, you\'ll tap the creature, then exile it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Pristine Talisman has a mana ability. Its ability doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Ichor Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Mycosynth Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If one or more creatures an opponent controls are put into the graveyard at the same time as Sangromancer, Sangromancer’s first ability will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Once you activate the ability and sacrifice an artifact, it’s too late for anyone to respond to try and prevent you from paying the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For Garruk’s second ability, the greatest power among creatures you control is determined when that ability begins resolving.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For Garruk’s third ability, the number of Wurm tokens you put onto the battlefield is determined when that ability begins resolving.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the greatest power among creatures you control is 0 or less, you’ll draw no cards. You won’t discard any cards this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the card is not a land card, it will remain on top of your library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the revealed card is both a creature and a land (such as Dryad Arbor), you’ll put a Saproling creature token and that card onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If that creature deals combat damage to a player at the same time it\'s dealt lethal damage (perhaps because it has trample and was blocked), it will die before the triggered ability resolves and puts +1/+1 counters on it."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Angel of Serenity leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability has resolved, its leaves-the-battlefield ability will trigger and do nothing. Then the enters-the-battlefield ability will resolve and exile the targeted creatures and/or creature cards indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature targeted by the enters-the-battlefield ability dies before that ability resolves, it will become an illegal target even though it may be a creature card in a graveyard when the ability resolves. It won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose the targets as part of putting the enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack. Because that ability includes “you may,” you choose whether to exile the targets when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose up to three total targets from among other creatures on the battlefield and creature cards in graveyards. You may choose zero targets.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "Biomass Mutation overwrites any effects that set the power and/or toughness of a creature you control to a specific value. Effects that modify power and/or toughness but don\'t set them to a specific value (like the one created by Giant Growth), power/toughness changes from counters, and effects that switch a creature\'s power and toughness will continue to apply. For example, say you control a 1/1 creature that\'s getting +4/+2 from an Aura, has a +1/+1 counter on it, and is affected by an effect that switches its power and toughness. This creature is 4/6. If you cast Biomass Mutation with X equal to 4, the creature would become 7/9 (4/4, +4/+2 from the Aura, +1/+1 from the counter, then switch power and toughness)."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'Choosing 0 as the value for X will likely cause creatures you control to become 0/0 and be put into the graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If the creature is an illegal target when Rapid Hybridization tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No Frog Lizard token will be created."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If Rapid Hybridization resolves and the creature isn\'t destroyed (perhaps because it has indestructible), its controller will still get the Frog Lizard token."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Gideon, Champion of Justice’s power and toughness are set to the number of loyalty counters on him when his second ability resolves. They won’t change later in the turn if the number of loyalty counters on him changes.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Gideon, Champion of Justice’s second ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human and Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: Gideon is just a planeswalker type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If Gideon, Champion of Justice becomes a creature due to his second ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If Gideon, Champion of Justice becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any).'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If the first ability doesn’t resolve (perhaps because the target opponent is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve), you won’t put any additional loyalty counters on Gideon, although the loyalty counter you put on him to activate the ability will remain.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Say you activate Gideon, Champion of Justice’s second ability, and then an opponent gains control of him before combat. You may have any of your creatures attack Gideon, Champion of Justice (since he’s still a planeswalker). Then Gideon, Champion of Justice may block (since he’s a creature). He may block any eligible attacking creature, including one that’s attacking him! During combat, he behaves as an attacked planeswalker and/or a blocking creature, as appropriate. For example, he deals combat damage to any creatures he’s blocking, but he doesn’t deal combat damage to any unblocked creatures that are attacking him.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You put a loyalty counter on Gideon, Champion of Justice as part of the cost of activating the first ability. When that ability resolves, you count the number of creatures controlled by the target opponent and put that many additional loyalty counters on Gideon.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon, Champion of Justice after his second ability has resolved, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon, Champion of Justice has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way goes to a zone other than exile or a graveyard, perhaps because one of its abilities says to put it into its owner\'s hand, it won\'t be exiled. This is true even if the card would be put into a graveyard later that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way is countered, it will still be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast one of the target instant or sorcery cards, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast one, it will remain in its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery spell with cipher this way, you may exile the card encoded on a creature you control. If you can\'t, or if you choose not to, the card will end up exiled but not encoded on a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'When casting an instant or sorcery card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'You can choose a number of targets up to the number of opponents you have, one target per opponent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards one at a time, choosing modes, targets and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t control twenty or more artifacts at the beginning of your upkeep, Hellkite Tyrant’s last ability won’t trigger. If it does trigger, it will check again when it tries to resolve. If you don’t control twenty or more artifacts at that time, the ability will do nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'To determine how many additional +1/+1 counters a creature enters the battlefield with, use Master Biomancer’s power as that creature is entering the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, the value of that X is 0.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The mana value of a creature token is 0 unless that token is a copy of another creature, in which case it copies that creature’s mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Protection from creatures means that Teysa, Envoy of Ghosts can’t be the target of abilities of creatures or abilities of creature cards in other zones, such as bloodrush abilities. Teysa also can’t be blocked by creatures, and all damage that would be dealt to Teysa by creatures is prevented.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Teysa’s controller gets the Spirit creature token, not the controller of the creature that dealt combat damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Teysa’s last ability doesn’t target the creature. It will destroy a creature with hexproof or protection from white, for example.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'You get a Spirit creature token even if Teysa’s triggered ability doesn’t destroy the creature (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If you choose the second mode, permanents that come under your control later in the turn will not have indestructible.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Planeswalkers with indestructible will still have loyalty counters removed from them as they are dealt damage. If planeswalker with indestructible has no loyalty counters, it will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard, as the rule that does this doesn\'t destroy the planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': \'Darksteel Mutation causes the enchanted creature to lose all abilities except indestructible at the time it becomes enchanted. Any abilities the creature gains after that point will work normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "Darksteel Mutation doesn\'t affect the enchanted creature\'s colors, if any. It will continue to be whatever color or colors it was before Darksteel Mutation entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "Darksteel Mutation overwrites any previous effects that set the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness to a specific value. Any such effects that start to apply after Darksteel Mutation entered the battlefield will work normally."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': \'Darksteel Mutation overwrites the printed power and toughness of the enchanted creature, as well as any characteristic-defining abilities that define power and/or toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "However, Darksteel Mutation does not overwrite effects that change the enchanted creature\'s power or toughness without setting it to a specific value (such as the ones created by Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem). It also won\'t overwrite the effect of counters."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "In some rare cases, the creature may have subtypes other than creature types before becoming enchanted with Darksteel Mutation. If it had any other artifact subtypes (such as Equipment), it will retain those. If it had any subtypes other than artifact types and creature types (such as Shrine), it won\'t retain those."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "The creature will keep any supertypes it previously had. Notably, if Darksteel Mutation is enchanting a legendary creature, that creature will continue to be legendary. Also, if it\'s enchanting a commander, that creature will continue to be a commander."}, {\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': \'The enchanted creature will be only an artifact and a creature, not any other card types. It will be only an Insect, not any other creature types.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when a creature becomes monstrous won\'t trigger if that creature isn\'t on the battlefield when its monstrosity ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Monstrous isn\'t an ability that a creature has. It\'s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature or loses its abilities, it will continue to be monstrous."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can\'t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The value of each X in Hydra Broodmaster\'s last ability is equal to the value chosen for X when its monstrosity ability was activated."}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Players can’t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn’t tied.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You must vote for one of the available options. You can’t abstain.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can\'t be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "If an effect puts two or more cards on the top or bottom of a library at the same time, the owner of those cards may arrange them in any order. That library\'s owner doesn\'t reveal the order in which the cards go into their library."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The owner of each attacking creature chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of their library. The active player (the player whose turn it is) makes all of their choices first, followed by each other player in turn order.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Hornet Nest’s triggered ability will trigger even if it’s dealt lethal damage. For example, if it’s dealt 7 damage, its ability will trigger and you’ll put seven Insect creature tokens onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "You must choose six different legal targets in order to cast Aether Gale. If some, but not all, of those targets become illegal before Aether Gale resolves, the remaining legal targets will be put into their owners\' hands."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The ability of Daretti’s emblem will return the artifact card only if it’s still in your graveyard when the delayed triggered ability resolves at the beginning of the next end step. If the artifact card left your graveyard before that point (even if it was put back into your graveyard), the ability won’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose which artifact to sacrifice as the second ability resolves. You must sacrifice an artifact if you control at least one at that time. For example, if you control two artifacts when you activate the second ability, but the artifact you intended to sacrifice is destroyed in response, you must sacrifice the other artifact as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose to discard zero cards as the first ability resolves. In that case, you won’t draw any cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The sacrifice isn’t optional. If you control at least one creature, you must sacrifice one. If you control no creatures, you won’t sacrifice one and you won’t draw two cards. The same is true for the chosen opponent.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose the opponents for each effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose which creature card you’re returning to the battlefield, then the chosen opponent chooses which creature card they are returning. These choices aren’t made until Infernal Offering resolves. Neither card is a target of Infernal Offering.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose the same opponent for each of the effects, or you may choose different opponents. None of the affected players are targets of the spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Bolster itself doesn\'t target any creature, though some spells and abilities that bolster may have other effects that target creatures. For example, you could put counters on a creature with protection from white with Abzan Skycaptain\'s bolster ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'You determine which creature to put counters on as the spell or ability that instructs you to bolster resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'Each Siege will have one of the two listed abilities, depending on your choice as it enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Each of the last two abilities is linked to the first ability. They each refer only to the choice made as a result of the first ability. If a permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of one of the Sieges, its controller will make a new choice for that Siege. Which ability the copy has won\'t depend on the choice made for the original permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'The words “Khans” and “Dragons” are anchor words, connecting your choice to the appropriate ability. Anchor words are a new rules concept. “[Anchor word] — [Ability]” means “As long as you chose [anchor word] as this permanent entered the battlefield, this permanent has [ability].” Notably, the anchor word “Dragons” has no connection to the creature type Dragon.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Deathbringer Regent\'s last ability destroys all creatures except Deathbringer Regent, including the five other creatures required for the ability to have an effect."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'If you cast a creature spell that enters the battlefield as a copy of Deathbringer Regent, the enters-the-battlefield ability will trigger (assuming the “five or more other creatures” requirement is also met).\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If the target has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If the target instant or sorcery card becomes an illegal target before Volcanic Vision resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt and Volcanic Vision won’t be exiled.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Managorger Hydra\'s last ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any red instant or sorcery spell you spend the mana on will be copied, not just one that requires targets.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a copy is created, you control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If more than one red mana produced by a Pyromancer’s Goggles is spent to cast a single red instant or sorcery spell, the delayed triggered ability associated with each mana spent will trigger. That many copies will be created. It doesn’t matter if this red mana was produced by one Pyromancer’s Goggles or by multiple Pyromancer’s Goggles.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copied spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one –” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of the copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability will trigger whether Pyromancer’s Goggles is still on the battlefield or not.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The mana produced by Pyromancer’s Goggles can be spent on anything, not just a red instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if you sacrifice a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Because Alhammarret’s Archive is legendary, it’s unlikely that one player will control two. However, if that happens, life gained by that player will be multiplied by four. Three Archives will multiply that life gain by eight, and so on.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If an effect would set your life total to a specific number that’s higher than your current life total, that effect would cause you to gain life equal to the difference. Alhammarret’s Archive will then double the amount of life that effect would cause you to gain. For example, if you have 3 life and an effect says that your life total “becomes 10,” your life total will actually become 17.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If two or more replacement effects would apply to a card-drawing event, the player drawing the card chooses the order in which to apply them.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, only the controller of Alhammarret’s Archive is affected by it. If that player’s teammate gains life, Alhammarret’s Archive will have no effect, even when that life gain is applied to the team’s shared life total.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Similarly, the effects of the last abilities of multiple Archives are cumulative. If you control two, you’ll draw four times the number of cards, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one of the affected types, it can count for any of them. For example, you could choose an artifact creature as the artifact you’re sparing, another creature as the creature, and an enchantment creature as the enchantment. Similarly, you could choose an enchantment creature as both the creature and the enchantment that you’re sparing, even if the player controls another creature and/or another enchantment.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'None of the chosen permanents are targets of Tragic Arrogance.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A land that becomes a creature may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature nor when it entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of a spell with awaken), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Lumbering Falls has been made a 0/0 creature with three +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 6/6 creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'This land is colorless until the last ability gives it colors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A creature with lifelink dealing combat damage is a single life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, the ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it causes your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Drana’s Emissary or 7 life from Nissa’s Renewal.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The emblem created by Ob Nixilis Reignited’s last ability is both owned and controlled by the target opponent. In a multiplayer game, if you own Ob Nixilis Reignited and use him to give one of your opponents an emblem, the emblem remains even if you leave the game.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If no player controls more lands than you do, you\'ll still search and shuffle your library, although you can\'t find any cards."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as Oreskos Explorer\'s triggered ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Creatures that aren’t destroyed this way (perhaps because they regenerated or have indestructible) don’t count toward the life lost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'Each of the “fights” happens at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If Ezuri\'s Predation creates more than one token for any given creature (due to an effect such as the one Doubling Season creates), the extra tokens won\'t fight any creature."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Players can\'t cast spells or activate any abilities in between the Beasts entering the battlefield and fighting the other creatures. If the Beasts entering the battlefield cause any abilities to trigger, those abilities will be put onto the stack after Ezuri\'s Predation is finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'You choose which Beast is fighting which creature an opponent controls.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Once a creature has been legally blocked, activating Kaseto’s ability targeting that creature won’t cause it to become unblocked. It will give it +2/+2 if it’s a Snake, though.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "As Dualcaster Mage\'s triggered ability resolves, it creates a copy of a spell on the stack. The copy isn\'t cast, so abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Dualcaster Mage\'s triggered ability can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn\'t matter who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the copy says that it affects "you," it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an "opponent," it affects an opponent of the copy\\\'s controller, not an opponent of the original spell\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the spell is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional or alternative costs paid for the targeted spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Activating Key to the City\'s ability targeting a creature that has already been blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Key to the City\'s last ability triggers during your untap step, but it\'s put onto the stack at the same time as abilities that trigger at the beginning of your upkeep step. Even though Key to the City\'s ability triggered first, you may order it before or after other abilities you control that are put onto the stack at this time."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can activate Key to the City\'s first ability without targeting any creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {2} only once each time Key to the City\'s triggered ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to draw additional cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For a spell with {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X to determine its mana value. For example, Clash of Wills is an instant spell with mana cost {X}{U}. If you chose 2 as the value of X, then Clash of Wills has mana value 3, and Metallurgic Summonings\'s ability will create a 3/3 token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Metallurgic Summonings\'s first ability resolves and the spell that caused it to trigger has been countered, use that spell\'s mana value as it last existed on the stack to determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Metallurgic Summonings\'s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The number of artifacts you control is checked only as you activate Metallurgic Summonings\'s last ability. It\'s not checked again as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature has indestructible, it isn\'t destroyed this way and you won\'t gain life. If it is destroyed but put into a zone other than a graveyard, you\'ll gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Use the toughness of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life to gain.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a creature has blocked an attacking creature, activating Pia Nalaar\'s last ability won\'t cause the attacking creature to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The “legend rule” cares about legendary permanents with the exact same English name. The Kaladesh™ card Pia Nalaar and the Magic Origins™ card Pia and Kiran Nalaar have different names, so you can control both at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If any of the cards put into your graveyard have {X} in their mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than three cards in your library, the opponent may choose to have you draw three cards. If so, you\'ll lose the game as state-based actions are performed."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "While Combustible Gearhulk\'s triggered ability is resolving, no player may take any actions other than those specified by the Gearhulk. Once the opponent makes a choice, players can\'t cast spells or activate abilities until after the cards are drawn or put into the graveyard and damage has been dealt (if applicable)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Selfless Squire\'s first triggered ability prevents all damage that would be dealt to you this turn after the triggered ability resolves, even if Selfless Squire leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'Selfless Squire\\\'s second triggered ability doesn\\\'t trigger only when damage is prevented by its first triggered ability\\\'s effect. Any effect that uses the word "prevent" will cause it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "The ability of Duelist\'s Heritage triggers whenever any player attacks with one or more creatures, not just when you do. You know which players and planeswalkers the creatures are attacking before you choose the target creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Scrap Trawler and another artifact you control are put into a graveyard at the same time, Scrap Trawler\'s ability triggers for each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact is a copy of another artifact with greater mana value, such as Sculpting Steel copying an artifact with mana value 4, Scrap Trawler\'s ability can target that artifact card in your graveyard when that artifact is put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The target artifact card must have a lesser mana value than the artifact that caused Scrap Trawler\'s ability to trigger by being put into a graveyard. Use the artifact\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield to determine what may be returned."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While on the battlefield or in a graveyard, {X} in an object\'s mana cost is 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The sacrificed Desert will be in your graveyard to be exiled by the last ability of Scavenger Grounds.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you\'ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\'s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Use Champion of Wits\'s power as the first ability resolves to determine if you want to use the ability and how many cards you draw if you do. If you use the ability, you discard two cards regardless of how many cards you draw. If Champion of Wits leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, use its last known power."}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Chandra’s Pyrohelix), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Torment of Hailfire does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Swarm Intelligence can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Swarm Intelligence can copy the spell even if it’s countered before Swarm Intelligence’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as Swarm Intelligence’s own ability) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If Stalking Leonin leaves the battlefield and returns, it\'s considered a new object. You may choose a new opponent and you may activate its last ability again."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If a creature is attacking a planeswalker you control, it\'s not attacking you. Stalking Leonin\'s last ability can\'t target it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you didn\'t choose an opponent when Stalking Leonin entered the battlefield, you can\'t pay the cost to activate its last ability. This will usually happen because you gained control of another player\'s Stalking Leonin or because a creature already on the battlefield became a copy of Stalking Leonin."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple Stalking Leonins, you may choose a different opponent for each one. Be careful to keep track of which opponent is chosen for each Stalking Leonin.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "There are several ways to secretly choose an opponent, including writing that player\'s name on a piece of paper that\'s kept with Stalking Leonin."}]', "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'A player is attacking another player if they control a creature that’s attacking that player. If no creatures are attacking the enchanted player as a Curse’s ability resolves (most likely because they’ve left the battlefield), only the Curse’s controller performs its actions.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Each Curse’s ability triggers only once, no matter how many creatures are attacking the enchanted player.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If you enchant yourself with one of these Curses, you’ll get its effects whenever another player attacks you.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'The triggered ability of these Curses won’t trigger if only a planeswalker controlled by the enchanted player is attacked.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "The entering creature\'s toughness is determined as the ability of Verdant Sun\'s Avatar resolves. If that creature has left the battlefield, use its toughness as it last existed on the battlefield. If the creature\'s toughness was less than 0, your life total won\'t change."}]', "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Casting Sunbird’s Invocation won’t cause its own ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s mana value.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a revealed card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If the spell’s mana value is 0, you do nothing as the ability of Sunbird’s Invocation resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Costly Plunder, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If you cast one of the revealed cards, you do so as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. You can’t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) are not.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'The ability of Sunbird’s Invocation resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve even if that spell is countered. If you cast a spell as part of the resolution of the ability, that spell resolves before the spell that caused the ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card, such as cards with aftermath from the Amonkhet block, is based on the combined mana cost of its two halves. The mana value of the resulting spell is based only on the half you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random as it’s returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Because the first ability doesn’t target the instant or sorcery card, any instants or sorceries put into your graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The instant or sorcery card returned to your hand is chosen at random as Charmbreaker Devils’s first ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won’t yet know what card will be returned.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature with double strike and trample destroys all of its blocking creatures with first-strike combat damage, all of its normal combat damage is assigned to the player or planeswalker that creature\'s attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Crafty Cutpurse won’t retroactively change the control of tokens that have already entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Crafty Cutpurse’s replacement effect is applied before any other replacement effects that would also modify how the token enters the battlefield. For example, if an opponent controls Anointed Procession, your Crafty Cutpurse’s effect applies before that of Anointed Procession and you won’t get twice as many tokens.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If a token would be created tapped and attacking, but the token’s controller isn’t an attacking player, that token is created tapped but not attacking. If a token would be created blocking a creature, but the token’s controller isn’t a defending player, that token is created but isn’t blocking.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If the effect that creates the token also creates a delayed triggered ability, Crafty Cutpurse doesn’t change who controls that ability. For example, if your opponent activates the ability of Kiki-Jiki, Mirror Breaker, that opponent controls the delayed triggered ability. When the ability triggers, that player can’t sacrifice the token, so it remains on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If two or more players each have resolved Crafty Cutpurse’s triggered ability and a token would be created, the token’s would-be controller chooses one of the applicable Crafty Cutpurse effects to apply. Then the new would-be controller of the token repeats this process among the remaining Crafty Cutpurse effects, and so on, until there are no more possible such effects to apply. Each effect can be applied to the token only once this way.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'On the other hand, if the effect that creates the token grants a triggered ability to the token, the player who controls the token at the time the ability triggers will be the player who controls that ability. For example, if your opponent activates the second ability of Jace, Cunning Castaway, the token has the ability. If the ability triggers, you’ll control it, so you’ll have to sacrifice the token.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'The above procedure means that if each player in a two-player game has resolved Crafty Cutpurse’s triggered ability and one would create a token, it really will enter the battlefield under that player’s control. The token would enter the battlefield under player A’s control, so player B’s effect affects it. Now that token would enter the battlefield under player B’s control, so player A’s effect affects it. Each replacement effect has now been used, so the token will enter the battlefield under player A’s control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Brainstorm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Wizard you control may become lethal if Naru leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Fight with Fire does when kicked), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Jaya’s Immolating Inferno does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Naru’s triggered ability can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Jaya’s emblem doesn’t grant you permission to do anything with instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard except cast them. For example, you can’t cycle instant or sorcery cards with cycling from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Mana produced by Jaya’s first ability can be spent among any number of instant and/or sorcery spells.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You choose how many cards to discard while Jaya’s second ability is resolving. You can choose to discard zero cards this way (and then draw zero cards) if you wish.'}, {'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'Because it’s a loyalty ability, Jaya’s first ability isn’t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "If a creature without counters receives enough -1/-1 counters to reduce its toughness to 0 or less, Together Forever\'s ability can\'t be activated before state-based actions put that creature into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': \'If a spell with support has other abilities that target creatures, those abilities and the support ability can target the same creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "If some, but not all, targets for a spell become illegal, the remaining targets are affected as appropriate. If all of a spell\'s targets become illegal, that spell doesn\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': \'Support can target a creature another player controls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "Together Forever\'s activated ability checks whether the target creature has a counter on it as the ability is activated and as the ability resolves. If the creature loses its counters later in the turn, the delayed triggered ability will still return it to its owner\'s hand when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t put more than one +1/+1 counter on any one target using the support action."}]', "[{'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'The activated ability of Victory Chimes is a mana ability and doesn’t use the stack. However, you can’t normally activate mana abilities when another player is asked to pay mana. If you’d like to give someone else mana, you must give them mana before they need it.'}, {'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'Victory Chimes also untaps as normal during your untap step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A creature attacking a planeswalker you control won\'t cause Coveted Jewel\'s last ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Coveted Jewel\'s last ability resolves after blockers are chosen but before combat damage is dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Coveted Jewel\'s last ability triggers after you declare blockers (or declare no blockers at all) if any attacking creatures are unblocked. It doesn\'t matter if some attacking creatures were blocked."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If more than one opponent attacks you at the same time, Coveted Jewel\'s last ability triggers for each of them. You choose which player ends up with Coveted Jewel, but each of them draws three cards and has a chance to activate its mana ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Bloodtracker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many cards you draw. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Bloodtracker and it gets six -1/-1 counters, you\'ll draw three cards. That\'s because Bloodtracker\'s triggered ability checks the creature\'s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If no opponent controls more lands than you, you\'ll search your library and shuffle it, but you won\'t be able to find any Plains cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can find fewer Plains cards than the difference, perhaps because you don\'t have that many Plains cards left in your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apex of Power doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an effect copies Apex of Power, the copy wasn\'t cast at all, so you won\'t add ten mana."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Erratic Cyclops’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the mana value of that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If any exiled cards you own are face down, they have no characteristics. If they’re normally instants or sorceries, they won’t be counted.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The ability that defines Crackling Drake’s power works in all zones.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Living Lore leaves the battlefield, the ability that defines its power and toughness will lose track of the exiled card. Its power and toughness are 0 in other zones.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell puts Living Lore onto the battlefield, that spell is still on the stack while you choose a card to exile. You can’t exile it with Living Lore.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If there are no instant or sorcery cards in your graveyard as Living Lore enters the battlefield, it will enter the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and be put into its owner’s graveyard due to having 0 toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Living Lore’s last ability will trigger whenever it deals combat damage, no matter if that damage is dealt to an opponent, an opposing planeswalker, or a creature it’s blocking or being blocked by. You choose whether to sacrifice Living Lore as that ability resolves. If Living Lore has already left the battlefield, perhaps because it was dealt lethal damage at the same time it dealt damage, you can’t sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Similarly, if the exiled card somehow leaves exile while Living Lore is on the battlefield, it will become a 0/0 creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may cast a sorcery this way even if it’s not your turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Any change to a land\'s type or abilities gained by a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If a creature somehow loses all of its +1/+1 counters, it can adapt again and get more +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Incubation Druid checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn\'t check their costs or legality. For example, Spire of Industry says “{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Activate only if you control an artifact.” If you control Spire of Industry and Incubation Druid, you can tap Incubation Druid for any color of mana. It doesn\'t matter whether you control an artifact, whether you can pay 1 life, or whether Spire of Industry is untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Incubation Druid doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as those of Unclaimed Territory and Guildmages\' Forum. It just produces one mana of the appropriate type, with no restrictions or riders."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "You can always activate an ability that will cause a creature to adapt. As that ability resolves, if the creature has a +1/+1 counter on it for any reason, you simply won\'t put any +1/+1 counters on it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Incongruity tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. No player creates a Frog Lizard token.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Steel Overseer\'s ability puts a +1/+1 counter on each artifact creature you control, including Steel Overseer."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Bloodthirsty Aerialist’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If Bloodthirsty Aerialist is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Bloodthirsty Aerialist triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Impassioned Orator or 4 life from Dawning Angel. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Bloodthirsty Aerialist triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Epicure of Blood’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Epicure of Blood’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 1 life twice.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Epicure of Blood triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Impassioned Orator or 4 life from Dawning Angel. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Epicure of Blood triggers only once.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'If Moldervine Reclamation leaves the battlefield at the same time that one or more creatures you control die, its ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control dies at the same time that your life total becomes 0 or less, you lose the game before Moldervine Reclamation\'s ability can save you."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target card is an illegal target by the time Pulse of Murasa tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 6 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Bloodthirsty Blade has no equip ability. There\'s normally no way to have it attached to your own creature, although certain combinations of other cards make this possible."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You still control Bloodthirsty Blade while it\'s equipped to an opponent\'s creature. You can move it any time you could cast a sorcery; the equipped creature\'s controller can\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Idol of Oblivion\'s first ability even if the token you\'ve created was created before Idol of Oblivion entered the battlefield or if the token has left the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If the chosen player has no instant or sorcery cards in their graveyard, Wildfire Devils’s ability does nothing. You don’t pick a different player.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Momentous Fall, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'The chosen player chooses which card to exile from their graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'The copy of the card is created in exile and cast from exile, not from a graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'You can cast the copy during the resolution of the triggered ability if it’s a sorcery, no matter whose turn it is or which phase it is.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'You can cast the copy only as the triggered ability resolves. If you don’t want to cast it at that time (or you can’t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the copy ceases to exist. You can’t cast it later.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'You choose a player at random and they exile a card all while the triggered ability is resolving. No player may take any actions between the two or between exiling the card and you copying and casting it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If you control your own Pendant of Prosperity and activate its last ability, you’ll draw a card, then you may put a land card onto the battlefield, then you’ll draw a second card, then you may once again put a land card onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Pendant of Prosperity’s owner leaves the game, Pendant of Prosperity leaves the game with them. If Pendant of Prosperity’s controller leaves the game, Pendant of Prosperity is exiled (assuming that player wasn’t also Pendant of Prosperity’s owner).'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'Pendant of Prosperity’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played your land for the turn, and even if it’s not your turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As these lands are entering the battlefield, they check for lands that are already on the battlefield. They won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Scapeshift, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If another effect puts these lands onto the battlefield tapped, they enter tapped, even if you control enough lands with the appropriate basic land type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted by Gluttonous Troll\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice a Food token created by Gluttonous Troll\'s triggered ability to pay for the cost of its activated ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As Taste of Death resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses three creatures they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a player controls three or fewer creatures, that player sacrifices each creature they control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You create three Food tokens, no matter how many creatures were actually sacrificed, even if some or all players sacrificed no creatures.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you are the attacking creature\'s controller, you lose 2 life and gain 2 life. You won\'t lose the game if your life total is 0 in between these two events."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Parasitic Impetus causes you to gain life, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the greatest power among creatures on the battlefield is shared by a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control, you draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you control no creatures, you do nothing as Primal Empathy\'s ability resolves. If there are no creatures on the battlefield at all, you don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with the greatest power, you choose which creature gets a +1/+1 counter while the ability is resolving. Players can\'t take actions in between the time you make this choice and the time that creature has a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You determine whether you draw a card or put a +1/+1 counter only as Primal Empathy\'s triggered ability begins resolving. Players may respond to the ability to try to change which happens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Silversmote Ghoul isn\'t in your graveyard as your end step begins, its first ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 life by the time your end step begins, Silversmote Ghoul\'s first ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Silversmote Ghoul\'s first ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield or in your graveyard when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Abilities that define a * in a creature\'s power and toughness apply while that card is in exile, but abilities that add or subtract power and toughness don\'t. For example, the ability of Crusader of Odric applies to determine Duplicant\'s power and toughness, but the ability of Death\'s Shadow doesn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Duplicant\'s base power and toughness change to the imprinted card\'s power and toughness. Counters and other effects that modify Duplicant\'s power and toughness still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Duplicant\'s power and toughness are constantly updated if the exiled card\'s power and/or toughness change."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a melded permanent or a merged permanent is exiled by Duplicant\'s triggered ability, that ability\'s controller chooses the relative timestamp of the exiled cards. Duplicant looks at the information of the one with the latest timestamp."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "After you draw cards while Shamanic Revelation is resolving, nothing else can happen before you gain the appropriate amount of life. Notably, abilities that trigger when you draw cards won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'ve gained life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As the last ability resolves, you can tap untapped Myr you control even if Myr Battlesphere is no longer on the battlefield by then. If that has happened, Myr Battlesphere won\'t be able to get the +X/+0 bonus, but it will still deal X damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Myr you control as the last ability resolves, not just the Myr tokens you created with the first ability. This includes Myr that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the value for X as the last ability resolves. You can\'t choose a value for X that\'s greater than the number of untapped Myr you control."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Bosh can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its last ability.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If an artifact on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Feed the Swarm tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t lose any life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the permanent\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Humble Defector\'s ability can be activated any time during your turn, including in response to a spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Humble Defector is controlled by a player other than its owner, and its controller leaves the game, the effect giving that player control of Humble Defector ends. Humble Defector will return to the control of the player still in the game who most recently controlled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector isn\'t on the battlefield as its ability resolves, but the target player is still a legal target, the ability will resolve. You\'ll draw two cards, even though the player doesn\'t gain control of Humble Defector."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector\'s owner leaves the game, Humble Defector humbly leaves the game along with that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Opal Palace\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection) and you spend them to cast a commander, that commander enters with two counters for each time it\'s been cast from the command zone this game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The "number of times it\\\'s been cast from the command zone" includes the most recent time. For example, the first time you cast your commander from the command zone in a game, if you spent mana from Opal Palace\\\'s last ability to do so, it will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a player chooses to accept Orzhov Advokist\'s gift, that player can\'t attack you or a planeswalker you control with any creatures during their next turn, even creatures that weren\'t on the battlefield as Orzhov Advokist\'s ability resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Orzhov Advokist\'s ability doesn\'t target the creatures that receive +1/+1 counters. Their controllers choose them as the ability resolves. Players can\'t take actions between making their choices and the +1/+1 counters being placed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Orzhov Advokist\'s effect keeps creatures from attacking you even if Orzhov Advokist leaves the battlefield, if the creature that received counters is no longer on the battlefield, or if an effect has moved those counters off of the creature that received them and put them onto another creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving Orzhov Advokist\'s ability, you choose a creature you control or choose not to put any counters on a creature, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. Then simultaneously each player who chose a creature puts two +1/+1 counters on the creature they chose."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target land is an illegal target by the time Gift of Paradise tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile. They can\'t be cast on later turns, even if Etali attacks again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because all attacking creatures are chosen at once, a creature cast this way can\'t attack during the same combat as Etali, even if it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast any of the exiled cards, you do so as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. You can\'t wait to cast them later in the turn. Timing permissions based on a card\'s type are ignored, and the spells resolve before blockers are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast more than one of the exiled cards, you choose the order in which to cast them. A spell you cast this way can be the target of a later spell you cast this way. However, permanent spells cast this way won\'t resolve until you\'re done casting spells, so the permanents they become can\'t be the target of spells cast this way. For example, if you exile Twincast and Lightning Strike, you can cast Lightning Strike and then cast Twincast targeting it; but if you exile a creature card and an Aura card, you can\'t cast that Aura targeting that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Etali\'s ability are exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because delve isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Delve doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise\'s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can\'t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can\'t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability copies Return to Dust, the copy exiles only the first target artifact or enchantment. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Return to Dust can always target a second artifact or enchantment; it just won\'t exile it if it\'s not your main phase when you cast Return to Dust."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Casting a spell with split second won\'t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can\'t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Split second doesn\'t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If there’s somehow no color chosen for Paradise Plume, its middle ability can’t trigger and its last ability produces no mana. The former doesn’t trigger when colorless spells are cast and the latter doesn’t produce colorless mana.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature card will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature card will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Feldon\'s ability creates multiple tokens due to a replacement effect (such as the one Doubling Season creates), each of those tokens will gain haste and you\'ll sacrifice each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes a copy of, or enters the battlefield as a copy of the token, that creature will copy the creature card the token is copying, except it will also be an artifact. This is true even if the creature card that was copied by Feldon of the Third Path is no longer in the graveyard at that time. However, the new copy won\'t gain haste and you won\'t sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature card (except that the copy is also an artifact) and nothing else.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast a card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast it, it will be put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'When casting an instant or sorcery card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards one at a time, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you choose to shuffle your library, that includes the three cards you just looked at and put back on top of it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "A token that is returned to its owner\'s hand ceases to exist as a state-based action the next time a player would receive priority."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. Timing restrictions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again during the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card for any reason, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend will trigger. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effect that affects when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that could stop you from casting it (such as Revel in Silence\'s effect) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether or not you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack, and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you leave the game, any creatures you\'ve goaded remain goaded until your next turn would have begun. They don\'t immediately stop being goaded and don\'t remain goaded indefinitely."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a creature an opponent controls has been legally blocked, activating Sly Instigator\'s ability won\'t change or undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Breena\'s triggered ability will trigger even if you control no creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the attacking player is one of your opponents and has less life than the player being attacked, then the condition is satisfied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You choose which creature to put +1/+1 counters on as the ability is resolving. Once you make the choice, no player may take actions until the counters are placed.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Dazzling Sphinx\'s triggered ability lets you cast the exiled card during the resolution of the ability. It doesn\'t allow you to wait and cast the card later."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the exiled instant or sorcery card has an {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of {X}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You may choose not to cast the instant or sorcery card that you exiled. In that case, it will be put on the bottom of the library with the rest of the exiled cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Each player, including you, must put a vow counter on a creature they control if able. They can\'t choose to opt out and sacrifice all of their creatures. The creature you put a vow counter on will remember its promise if another player gains control of it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the vow counter is moved to another creature, it won\'t prevent the second creature from attacking normally."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the vow counter is removed from the creature, it can attack as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Even after the ability resolves, you may choose to not pay life rather than pay mana cost of the next spell you cast that turn. However, if you do this, you won\'t have the opportunity to pay life for any other spells you cast that turn (unless you activate the ability again)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the next spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X if you pay life rather than pay its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell for another cost "rather than pay its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Draconic Intervention, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Marshland Bloodcaster\'s ability affects the next spell you cast after the ability has resolved. If you cast any spells in response to the ability, those spells are cast as normal."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a ward ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter if the artifact loses ward (most likely because Bronze Guardian leaves the battlefield in response) before the ability resolves. The controller of the spell or ability will still have to pay {2} or the spell or ability will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Bronze Guardian\'s power applies in all zones, not only while it is on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Everything that is specified by the effect creating the original token or tokens will also be true about the additional token or tokens created by Adrix and Nev\\\'s replacement effect. For example, if an effect tells you to create a token "tapped and attacking" the additional tokens will also be tapped and attacking. Similarly, if an effect creates a token and puts counters on it (such as a Fractal token) the additional token will also get those counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you choose a legendary creature, the copies will also be legendary. If this results in you controlling more than one legendary permanent with the same name, you\'ll put all but one of them into their owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you choose not to apply the replacement effect, you will not get the choice to apply it again until your next turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you create one or more tokens during your turn, and then Esix comes under your control, the replacement effect won\'t apply to any tokens you create the rest of the turn. You\'ll have to wait until your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'This effect applies before anything that modifies how those tokens enter the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'This effect can apply to any token, not just creature tokens. For example, you could replace creating a Treasure token with creating a copy of the chosen creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you play a card this way, it leaves exile and becomes a new object. If it returns to exile later in the turn, you can\'t play it again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "The last ability triggers only if that opponent controls more lands than you after the land enters the battlefield. The ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If that opponent doesn\'t still control more lands than you at that time, the ability won\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "The token gets created before the artifact spell that triggered its creation resolves. Fortunately, the token counts itself, so it\'s at least 1/1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you somehow control two Veyrans (which would be poetic), you casting an instant or sorcery spell causes abilities to trigger three times. A third Veyran (less poetic) causes abilities to trigger four times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Veyran\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger again. Any choices you make as you put the ability on the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Veyran, Voice of Duality\'s last ability causes each of your magecraft abilities, including Veyran\'s own, to trigger an additional time."}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'A creature or creature card with no abilities is one with no rules text at all. This includes true vanilla creatures (including Grizzly Bears, Runeclaw Bear, Bear Cub, and other adorable bear students), face-down creatures, many tokens, and creatures that have lost their abilities. Abilities that function only in zones other than the battlefield count. For example, a creature with cycling {2} is not a creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Auras and Equipment that grant abilities will use the words “gains” or “has,” and they’ll list a keyword ability or an ability in quotation marks. A creature with no abilities affected by such an Aura or Equipment would no longer get the +1/+1 bonus or be able to assign combat damage as though it weren’t blocked. If the Aura or Equipment does not give the creature any abilities, the creature will continue to benefit from Ruxa’s last two abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For each attacking creature you control with no abilities, you decide whether it will assign combat damage to the blocking creatures or if it will assign combat damage to the player or planeswalker it’s attacking. You can’t split damage assignment between them. You make this decision individually for each qualifying creature just before it deals combat damage.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Notably, neither of Ruxa’s last two abilities give any creatures an ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as boast) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Copying abilities doesn’t cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the ability has {X} in its activation cost, the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the ability is modal (that is, it has a bulleted list of modes), the copy will have the same mode(s). You can’t choose new ones.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the ability it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'All counters on a creature are considered when determining the value of X, not only +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For each player, choosing a target creature that player controls is optional.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Your opponents can choose not to pay to attack with a creature with one or more counters on it that attacks “if able.” If there’s no other player or planeswalker to attack, the creature simply doesn’t attack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you gain life" triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life you gain.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a "whenever you gain life" ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You may only pay {B} once for each life gain event.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may only pay {2} once for each life gain event.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield. Any "As [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[This creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Cursed Mirror copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, power and toughness, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If Cursed Mirror somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as a creature, it can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If something else becomes a copy of Cursed Mirror while Cursed Mirror is a copy of a creature, the duration of the effect is not copied. The new copy will still be a creature (with haste) after Cursed Mirror stops being a copy at the end of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, Cursed Mirror copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Copying a token doesn\'t make Cursed Mirror a token. Similarly, if Cursed Mirror itself is a token, copying a nontoken permanent doesn\'t make it stop being a token."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield as a copy of whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'While it is copying a creature, Cursed Mirror does not have "{T}: Add {R}" (unless the creature it\\\'s copying also has that ability).\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the tokens enter the battlefield. Any “As [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[This creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the copied creature is copying something else, the tokens enter the battlefield as whatever that creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the copied creature is itself a token, the tokens created by Rionya copy the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The tokens copy exactly what is printed on the creature and nothing else (unless that creature is a token or is copying something else; see below). They don’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The triggered ability counts all instants and sorceries that were cast before it resolves. If you cast instant spells in response to the ability, those spells will count.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Being a commander is not a copiable characteristic; these effects do not apply to copies of a player’s commander.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'These effects apply to any commanders you control, not just your own commander.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Copying the card doesn’t cause magecraft abilities to trigger, although casting the copies does.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You cast the copies while the delayed triggered ability of Surge to Victory is resolving. Ignore any timing restrictions based on the copies’ card types.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each copy will resolve one at a time. As each copy resolves, if you discarded a nonland card, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target to be dealt damage. That ability will resolve before you deal with the next copy of Fiery Encore.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each copy you create because of storm will cause your magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you have no cards in hand as Fiery Encore resolves, you won’t be able to discard a card, but you will draw a card. No damage will be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each copy you create will cause your magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can choose a spell or ability with multiple targets as long as all of those targets are the same permanent or player.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You control all the copies, and you’ll choose which copy targets which permanent or player. For example, if the original spell says, “Destroy target creature,” you’ll ultimately choose the order in which each creature targeted by a copy is destroyed. Remember that the original spell or ability will resolve after all of the copies.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You copy the spell or ability for every permanent or player it could target. That is, you don’t choose either permanents or players and then make copies based on that.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the instant or sorcery spell has {X} in its mana cost, X is the value chosen for X as the spell was cast.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The wrong card name was inadvertently included in Zaffai’s printed rules text. The text above is correct and the full name of the card is Zaffai, Thunder Conductor.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': '“That spell’s mana value” refers to the spell that caused the ability to trigger, not the card you look at when you scry.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus’s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Each opponent in turn order decides whether or not to create a Treasure token. They will each know the decisions of players before them. Those Treasure tokens are all created at the same time. Then you create your Treasure tokens all at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Ezzaroot Channeler’s second ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 4 life earlier in the turn, creature spells you cast will cost {4} less.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The second ability’s cost reduction can reduce only generic mana in a spell’s total cost. It can’t reduce colored mana requirements.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Ezzaroot Channeler’s second ability). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'For example, if you control four lands, one opponent controls six lands, and another opponent controls seven lands, you will search your library for up to three basic land cards and the first opponent will search their library for one basic land card. The second opponent won’t search their library at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Gyome, Master Chef’s second ability counts all nontoken creatures that entered the battlefield under your control this turn, even if some or all of those creatures are no longer on the battlefield, no longer creatures, or no longer under your control.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The second ability will count Gyome itself on the turn it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability even if the creature is already tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Alibou leaves the battlefield, artifact creatures you control lose haste. If they haven’t been under your control since the turn began and don’t otherwise have haste, they can’t attack that turn. If they’ve already attacked, losing haste won’t remove them from combat and they’ll remain attackers.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you control no tapped artifacts when the triggered ability resolves (perhaps because they were destroyed or had vigilance), no damage will be dealt and you won’t scry.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose a target as Alibou’s triggered ability is put on the stack. If that target isn’t legal as the triggered ability tries to resolve, it doesn’t resolve and you don’t scry.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If Guardian Archon leaves the battlefield and returns, it’s considered a new object. You may choose a new opponent and you may activate its last ability again.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you control more than one Guardian Archon, you may choose a different opponent for each one. Be careful to keep track of which opponent is chosen for each Guardian Archon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you didn’t choose an opponent as Guardian Archon entered the battlefield, you can’t pay the cost to activate the last ability. This will usually happen because you gained control of another player’s Guardian Archon or because a creature already on the battlefield became a copy of Guardian Archon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'In a two-player game, the chosen player won’t be much of a secret.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Protection from a player means all of the following: (1) Neither you nor the target permanent can be the target of spells or abilities controlled by the chosen player. (2) Neither you nor the target permanent can be enchanted or equipped by any Auras or Equipment controlled by the chosen players. (Okay, Fortifications too, if the target permanent is a land.) (3) If the target permanent is a creature, it can’t be blocked by creatures controlled by the chosen player. (4) All damage that would be dealt to you or the target permanent by sources controlled by the chosen player is prevented. The same is true for sources owned by the chosen player that don’t have controllers.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'There are several ways to secretly choose an opponent. Perhaps the most popular way is to write the chosen player’s name on a piece of paper that is kept with Guardian Archon.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a commander is exiled this way, its power will be counted along with the other creatures. Once Oversimplify finishes resolving, that commander’s owner may move it to the command zone.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Oversimplify counts the total power of the creatures as they last existed on the battlefield, not the power of those cards in exile.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a spell with {X} in its mana cost is countered this way, {X} is the value chosen as the spell was cast.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you target a spell that can’t be countered, like Heated Debate, you won’t counter the spell, but you will get to cast a spell with an equal or lesser mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'This can be used to cast either face of a modal double-faced card, but only if the face you are casting has an equal or lesser mana value than the target spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If any artifacts or enchantments were chosen as targets, and all of them are illegal targets as Pest Infestation tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No Pests will be created.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The number of Pests created is equal to twice the chosen value of X, no matter how many artifacts and enchantments were destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If multiple damage prevention effects would apply to combat damage that would be dealt to you, you get to choose the order the prevention effects are applied in.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If one of these Forests is turned face up, the effect making it a Forest land will expire. The face-up permanent will again have its printed name, type line, mana cost, abilities, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the face-down card has morph, you can pay its morph cost to turn it face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The face-down card has no name or colors. Its only type is land, its only subtype is Forest, and its only ability is "{T}: Add {G}."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the creature with mentor leaves the battlefield with mentor on the stack, use its power as that creature last existed on the battlefield to determine whether the target creature has less power.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is no longer less than the attacking creature\'s power as the ability resolves, mentor doesn\'t add a +1/+1 counter. For example, if two 3/3 creatures with mentor attack and both mentor triggers target the same 2/2 creature, the first to resolve puts a +1/+1 counter on it and the second does nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Mentor compares the power of the creature with mentor with that of the target creature at two different times: once as the triggered ability is put onto the stack, and once as the triggered ability resolves. If you wish to raise a creature\'s power so its mentor ability can target a bigger creature, the last chance you have to do so is during the beginning of combat step."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'The last ability counts the number of all kinds of counters, not just +1/+1 counters.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the spell requires targets, you choose the target of the original spell as you cast it. If you create a copy of the spell, you may choose new targets for the copy as you create that copy. Similarly, the opponent you chose to create a copy may choose new targets for that copy as it’s created. In other words, your opponent will know the targets of your original spell and your copy when choosing the new targets, if any, for their copy.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast the spell and choose not to copy it, no opponent will get to copy it either.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you copy a spell with demonstrate, you then immediately choose an opponent. If they copy the spell, it goes on top of the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'This means that if you cast a spell with demonstrate and both you and an opponent copy it, the opponent’s copy will resolve first, then your copy will resolve, and finally the original spell will resolve.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose whether to make a copy as the demonstrate ability resolves. This happens before the original spell resolves. Your copy goes on the stack above the original spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose which creature to bring back after you mill five cards.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You may choose any creature card in your graveyard, not just one that you milled this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the spell requires targets, you choose the target of the original spell as you cast it. If you create a copy of the spell, you may choose new targets for the copy as you create that copy. Similarly, the opponent you chose to create a copy may choose new targets for that copy as it’s created. In other words, your opponent will know the targets of your original spell and your copy when choosing the new targets, if any, for their copy.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast the spell and choose not to copy it, no opponent will get to copy it either.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you copy a spell with demonstrate, you then immediately choose an opponent. If they copy the spell, it goes on top of the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'This means that if you cast a spell with demonstrate and both you and an opponent copy it, the opponent’s copy will resolve first, then your copy will resolve, and finally the original spell will resolve.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You choose whether to make a copy as the demonstrate ability resolves. This happens before the original spell resolves. Your copy goes on the stack above the original spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with multiple {X} mana symbols in its cost, the first ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The mana added by the last ability can be used only to pay costs with at least one {X}, but it can be used to pay for any part of that cost, not just the {X}. That {X} could be in a spell’s total cost, an ability’s activation cost, or a cost you’re asked to pay as a spell or ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The mana added by the last ability doesn’t all have to spent on the same cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with {X} in its cost without paying its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You don’t have to cast an instant or sorcery spell this way. If you don’t, all exiled instant or sorcery cards will be put into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you own multiple commanders on the battlefield and/or in the command zone, you choose one of them as Stinging Study resolves to determine the value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If your commander is under the control of another player as Stinging Study resolves, it is still on the battlefield and will still be used to determine the value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If you put Fractal Harness onto the battlefield without casting it, or if you choose 0 as the value of X, the token you create will be 0/0. Unless something else is raising its toughness, that token will enter the battlefield and die before you could take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a permanent, put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number it already has. Other cards that interact with putting counters on it will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter if Monologue Tax was on the battlefield for the first spell. It also doesn’t matter if that first spell resolved or not.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Nothing special happens on the third spell, fourth spell, and so on.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The ability can trigger once each turn for each opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Players decide and announce in turn order, starting with the active player, whether or not they want to discard their hand. Then, all players who chose to do so discard their hands and draw seven cards. Players later in the turn order will know if players before them are discarding, but they don’t get to see what those players will discard to help them decide whether to discard themselves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Sproutback Trudge’s ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 4 life earlier in the turn, Sproutback Trudge will cost {3}{G}{G}.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The cost reduction can reduce only generic mana in a spell’s total cost. It can’t reduce the cost to cast Sproutback Trudge beyond {G}{G}.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Sproutback Trudge’s first ability). Sproutback Trudge’s mana value is always 9, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You need to gain life before the end step begins for the last ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You still need to pay the cost to cast Sproutback Trudge from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The cards you return are chosen as Revival Experiment resolves. No player can respond to those choices.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'The permanent types are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker. Things like “legendary” or “snow” are supertypes, not types.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'This ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 3 life earlier in the turn, you will gain 2 more life from Essence Pulse and each creature will get -5/-5.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'This ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 3 life earlier in the turn, you’ll gain 2 more life from Blossoming Bogbeast and creatures you control will get +5/+5.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Tivash’s ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 4 life earlier in the turn, you may pay 4 life to create a 4/4 Demon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can’t pay less life than the amount of life you gained to create a smaller but less harmful Demon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You need to gain life before the end step begins for the last ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Your opponent places the counters on both permanents. Therefore, if they also control a Bold Plagiarist, its ability will not trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If Soul Snare\'s ability targets a creature that\'s attacking a planeswalker you control, but that planeswalker is no longer on the battlefield as the ability tries to resolve, the attacking creature will be an illegal target and Soul Snare\'s ability won\'t exile that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Sacrificing Soul Snare is part of the cost to activate the ability. Once you activate the ability, no player can do anything to Soul Snare to stop you from activating it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled by Laelia, the Blade Reforged are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you play a card this way, it leaves exile and becomes a new object. If it returns to exile later in the turn, you can\'t play it again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Laelia, the Blade Reforged has recieved an update to its Oracle text. The official text is listed above. Specifically, its last triggered ability doesn\'t care which player is exiling cards from the library or graveyard. Cards put into exile from your library or graveyard for any reason, such as the delve ability, cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The last ability only triggers once for each time cards are put into exile from your library and/or graveyard, no matter how many cards were exiled at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions while playing the exiled card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}, {\'date\': \'2022-09-09\', \'text\': \'If a player is instructed to exile cards from their library "until" a certain event occurs, that player exiles those cards one at a time. Laelia\\\'s last ability will trigger that many times.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Creatures may still attack planeswalkers you control without their controller paying a cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forgotten Ancient’s first ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. Putting a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient is optional.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forgotten Ancient’s last ability doesn’t target any creatures. You choose how many +1/+1 counters will be moved (and onto which creatures) as the ability resolves. Notably, once the ability starts resolving and you make these choices, no player may take actions until the ability has finished resolving.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Due to a recent rules change to suspend, you are no longer required to cast the suspended card as the second triggered ability of suspend resolves. Instead, as the second triggered ability resolves, you may cast the card. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored. If you don’t cast the card, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that gives you the option to cast the card when the last time counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abfertigen\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nMetallkunst — Schicke diese Kreatur ins Exil, falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Venser fragte sich, ob man noch von einem Teleport-Zauber sprechen könne, wenn das Ziel die Vergessenheit ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519371&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5b52244-ab63-49dd-8032-b6de9fe39c9d\', \'multiverseId\': 519371}, \'multiverseid\': 519371}, {\'name\': \'Despachar\', \'text\': \'Gira la criatura objetivo.\\nMetalurgia — Si controlas tres o más artefactos, exilia esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Venser se preguntaba si se consideraba un hechizo de teletransportación cuando el destino era el olvido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9478c76-b04b-4d43-8393-a2f1382bd76a\', \'multiverseId\': 519619}, \'multiverseid\': 519619}, {\'name\': \'Expédier\', \'text\': \'Engagez une créature ciblée.\\nArt des métaux — Si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts, exilez cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Venser se demandait si on pouvait toujours parler d\'un sort de téléportation quand la destination était le néant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa5e3fba-7046-4f4c-a349-0ec241dbd3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 519867}, \'multiverseid\': 519867}, {\'name\': \'Spedire\', \'text\': \'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\\nMetallurgia — Se controlli tre o più artefatti, esilia quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Venser si chiese se poteva essere chiamata una magia di teletrasporto anche se la destinazione era l\'oblio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22172b9e-5788-4472-8985-a57a7389a3c9\', \'multiverseId\': 520115}, \'multiverseid\': 520115}, {\'name\': \'急送\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\\n金属術 ― あなたがアーティファクト３つ以上をコントロールしているなら、そのクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ヴェンセールは、忘却の彼方へ移動する呪文も瞬間移動と呼んでいいものか悩んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c915df9-df9a-4006-ae54-b27363db2dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 520363}, \'multiverseid\': 520363}, {\'name\': \'Despachar\', \'text\': \'Vire a criatura alvo.\\nMaestria com metais — Se você controlar três ou mais artefatos, exile aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Venser pensou se ainda poderia considerá-la uma mágica de teletransporte quando o destino final era o limbo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41053c17-1105-4631-a87f-4f25e8e493d5\', \'multiverseId\': 520611}, \'multiverseid\': 520611}, {\'name\': \'Высылка\', \'text\': \'Поверните целевое существо.\\nРабота по металлу — Если вы контролируете не менее трех артефактов, изгоните то существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Венсер задумался: можно ли назвать заклинание телепортацией, если оно ведет в забвение?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2778d3c-45a0-4d6d-9482-b7a2a209a642\', \'multiverseId\': 520859}, \'multiverseid\': 520859}, {\'name\': \'迅速了结\', \'text\': \'横置目标生物。\\n金技～如果你操控三个或更多神器，则放逐该生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'既然终点是虚空，凡瑟不太能确定这是否还称得上是传送咒语。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'280af352-0025-4bf4-abcf-a20ba41f6792\', \'multiverseId\': 521107}, \'multiverseid\': 521107}, {\'name\': \'迅速了結\', \'text\': \'橫置目標生物。\\n金技～如果你操控三個或更多神器，則放逐該生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'既然終點是虛空，凡瑟不太能確定這是否還稱得上是傳送咒語。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8072be3e-db49-4768-b63b-6734abd524b6\', \'multiverseId\': 521355}, \'multiverseid\': 521355}]', "[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519598&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c8d1665-6423-420d-84d5-3944be7118b7', 'multiverseId': 519598}, 'multiverseid': 519598}, {'name': 'Estepa aislada', 'text': 'La Estepa aislada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519846&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a39605be-9488-4799-805f-b3caff0fa68f', 'multiverseId': 519846}, 'multiverseid': 519846}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520094&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da15908b-c2e0-41f0-992a-806d823fe227', 'multiverseId': 520094}, 'multiverseid': 520094}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520342&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9756a81-b2da-4b1d-b88d-de3ecb931f66', 'multiverseId': 520342}, 'multiverseid': 520342}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520590&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f73d65d7-6802-45f9-92dc-b1697b40421d', 'multiverseId': 520590}, 'multiverseid': 520590}, {'name': 'Estepe Remota', 'text': 'Estepe Remota entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520838&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4619c8da-d620-42ad-bae7-a0c99ba475a7', 'multiverseId': 520838}, 'multiverseid': 520838}, {'name': 'Далекая Степь', 'text': 'Далекая Степь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}.\\nЦикл {W} ({W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521086&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07a4971c-cd64-4f5a-9f7e-8420461f481d', 'multiverseId': 521086}, 'multiverseid': 521086}, {'name': '远僻草原', 'text': '远僻草原须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}。\\n循环{W}（{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521334&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a31f94bf-f68a-442b-9986-17468d2bec13', 'multiverseId': 521334}, 'multiverseid': 521334}, {'name': '遠僻草原', 'text': '遠僻草原須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{W}。\\n循環{W}（{W}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521582&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34898229-70d5-4cd5-8c46-495643495d3f', 'multiverseId': 521582}, 'multiverseid': 521582}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831d2f71-9f8b-45b5-97d7-a62e943adccf\', \'multiverseId\': 519529}, \'multiverseid\': 519529}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo del olvido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si creaste una ficha este turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrificar el Ídolo del olvido: Crea una ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolora 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Álzate, ser inmenso, y libra al mundo de nuestros enemigos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397d1b80-1975-4b25-b25c-63955fc67915\', \'multiverseId\': 519777}, \'multiverseid\': 519777}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole de l\'oubli : Créez un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Lève-toi, glorieux élu, et purifie le monde de nos ennemis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520025&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e42e3d73-c992-46c6-90d4-32bafa60e015\', \'multiverseId\': 520025}, \'multiverseid\': 520025}, {\'name\': "Idolo dell\'Oblio", \'text\': "{T}: Pesca una carta. Attiva solo se hai creato una pedina in questo turno.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Idolo dell\'Oblio: Crea una pedina creatura Eldrazi 10/10 incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Risvegliati, essere supremo, e purifica il mondo dai nostri nemici!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c85077-f8a9-49c5-bb60-4b98cad262d8\', \'multiverseId\': 520273}, \'multiverseid\': 520273}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8}, {T}, 忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'838f37ed-c986-4acf-b98f-5e36cc1c1d59\', \'multiverseId\': 520521}, \'multiverseid\': 520521}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo do Oblívio\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card. Ative somente se você tiver criado uma ficha neste turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifique Ídolo do Oblívio: Crie uma ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolor 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Erga-se, ó grandioso, e purifique nosso mundo dos inimigos!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ba5ddb-8a29-46d4-b1a4-d6b6d1844634\', \'multiverseId\': 520769}, \'multiverseid\': 520769}, {\'name\': \'Идол Забвения\', \'text\': \'{T}: возьмите карту. Активируйте, только если в этом ходу вы создали фишку.\\n{8}, {T}, пожертвуйте Идола Забвения: создайте одну фишку существа 10/10 бесцветный Эльдрази.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Восстань, о великий, и сотри наших врагов с лица земли!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62043e5a-67cd-4e63-a13b-16245b6d6d39\', \'multiverseId\': 521017}, \'multiverseid\': 521017}, {\'name\': \'佚界雕像\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌。只能于你派出过衍生物的回合中起动。\\n{8}，{T}，牺牲佚界雕像：派出一个10/10无色奥札奇衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「苏醒吧，巨物，再次将敌人从世上彻底涤净！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'529f0ab3-7270-4a7c-8c66-581cda6d4a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 521265}, \'multiverseid\': 521265}, {\'name\': \'佚界雕像\', \'text\': \'{T}：抽一張牌。只能於你派出過衍生物的回合中起動。\\n{8}，{T}，犧牲佚界雕像：派出一個10/10無色奧札奇衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「甦醒吧，巨物，再次將敵人從世上徹底滌淨！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e56cd7c-2302-45de-a24e-160c29ad86a1\', \'multiverseId\': 521513}, \'multiverseid\': 521513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adrix und Nev, Zwillingszauberer\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\\nFalls ein oder mehrere Spielsteine unter deiner Kontrolle erzeugt würden, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Spielsteine erzeugt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e51f3cb7-b76a-4f32-a443-40ac65c767cd\', \'multiverseId\': 518325}, \'multiverseid\': 518325}, {\'name\': \'Ádrix y Nev, conjuradores gemelos\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {2}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\\nSi una o más fichas se fueran a crear bajo tu control, en vez de eso, crea el doble de esas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd252e7b-69a3-4f96-bfa7-7868bc800fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 518335}, \'multiverseid\': 518335}, {\'name\': \'Adrix et Nev, jumemages\', \'text\': "Parade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)\\nSi au moins un jeton devait être créé sous votre contrôle, deux fois ce nombre de jetons sont créés à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518345&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ac37f0-780b-4499-8242-d123db98ec37\', \'multiverseId\': 518345}, \'multiverseid\': 518345}, {\'name\': \'Adrix e Nev, Incantatori Gemelli\', \'text\': \'Egida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\\nSe una o più pedine stanno per essere create sotto il tuo controllo, invece ne vengono create il doppio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c248e57-8959-4b91-a4ce-30645e29092e\', \'multiverseId\': 518355}, \'multiverseid\': 518355}, {\'name\': \'双子唱者、アドリックスとネヴ\', \'text\': \'護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\nあなたのコントロール下でトークン１つ以上が生成されるなら、代わりにその２倍の数のトークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0450be28-2de8-45a0-872a-efc693fa5460\', \'multiverseId\': 518365}, \'multiverseid\': 518365}, {\'name\': \'Adrix e Nev, Conjuradores Gêmeos\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {2} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {2}.)\\nSe uma ou mais fichas seriam criadas sob seu controle, em vez disso, cria-se o dobro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba2641a-8645-4abc-998b-1a1c12523325\', \'multiverseId\': 518375}, \'multiverseid\': 518375}, {\'name\': \'Адрикс и Нев, Двузаклинатели\', \'text\': \'Оберег {2} (Каждый раз, когда это существо становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, отмените то заклинание или способность, если тот игрок не заплатит {2}.)\\nЕсли под вашим контролем должна быть создана одна или несколько фишек, вместо этого создается удвоенное количество тех фишек.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc86d5f8-7a61-47ca-a676-ead3cdbc9980\', \'multiverseId\': 518385}, \'multiverseid\': 518385}, {\'name\': \'双咒法师艾季与涅夫\', \'text\': \'守护{2}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\\n如果将在你的操控下派出一个或数个衍生物，则改为派出两倍数量的该类衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb1c055-679a-4b9d-9676-50b589d878e6\', \'multiverseId\': 518395}, \'multiverseid\': 518395}, {\'name\': \'雙咒法師艾季與涅夫\', \'text\': \'守護{2}（每當此生物成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，除非該玩家支付{2}，否則反擊之。）\\n如果將在你的操控下派出一個或數個衍生物，則改為派出兩倍數量的該類衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a53d3f8-f71b-4527-8938-d4674c5cfd71\', \'multiverseId\': 518405}, \'multiverseid\': 518405}]', "[{'name': 'Adrix und Nev, Zwillingszauberer', 'text': 'Abwehr {2}\\nFalls ein oder mehrere Spielsteine unter deiner Kontrolle erzeugt würden, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Spielsteine erzeugt.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521685&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92ab7db2-1fe0-4183-b403-0205e375b6ce', 'multiverseId': 521685}, 'multiverseid': 521685}, {'name': 'Ádrix y Nev, conjuradores gemelos', 'text': 'Rebatir {2}.\\nSi una o más fichas se fueran a crear bajo tu control, en vez de eso, crea el doble de esas fichas.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521765&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45e51b55-8d9b-4b90-b0d1-2e906012cf79', 'multiverseId': 521765}, 'multiverseid': 521765}, {'name': 'Adrix et Nev, jumemages', 'text': 'Parade {2}\\nSi au moins un jeton devait être créé sous votre contrôle, deux fois ce nombre de jetons sont créés à la place.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : ondin et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521845&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c508a8e-372b-4dc5-8b43-62082a1a5dc6', 'multiverseId': 521845}, 'multiverseid': 521845}, {'name': 'Adrix e Nev, Incantatori Gemelli', 'text': 'Egida {2}\\nSe una o più pedine stanno per essere create sotto il tuo controllo, invece ne vengono create il doppio.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521925&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e03211da-a424-4c3a-8dd9-472400a959b9', 'multiverseId': 521925}, 'multiverseid': 521925}, {'name': '双子唱者、アドリックスとネヴ', 'text': '護法{2}\\nあなたのコントロール下でトークン１つ以上が生成されるなら、代わりにその２倍の数のトークンを生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522005&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85eca318-89ba-441a-9350-063303ac9a6c', 'multiverseId': 522005}, 'multiverseid': 522005}]", '[{\'name\': \'Alhammarrets Archiv\', \'text\': \'Falls du Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten würdest, erhältst du stattdessen doppelt so viele Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nFalls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, abgesehen von der ersten, die du in jedem deiner Ziehsegmente ziehst, ziehe stattdessen zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es enthält die Gesamtheit aller Notizen, Theorien und Erwägungen von Alhammarret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f29a655-ddaf-4149-b195-320acae3b0c7\', \'multiverseId\': 519516}, \'multiverseid\': 519516}, {\'name\': \'Archivo de Alhammarret\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a ganar vidas, en vez de eso, ganas el doble de esas vidas.\\nSi fueras a robar una carta, excepto la primera que robas en tus pasos de robar, en vez de eso, roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Contiene las notas, teorías y reflexiones de Alhammarret en su totalidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d60b963-236e-4996-b08f-10f7893f74dc\', \'multiverseId\': 519764}, \'multiverseid\': 519764}, {\'name\': "Archives d\'Alhammarret", \'text\': \'Si vous deviez gagner des points de vie, vous gagnez deux fois ce nombre de points de vie à la place.\\nSi vous deviez piocher une carte, excepté la première que vous piochez pendant chacune de vos étapes de pioche, piochez deux cartes à la place.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Elles contiennent la totalité des notes, des théories et des réflexions d\'Alhammaret.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520012&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8edb07cd-7629-4123-8512-529310f9dd96\', \'multiverseId\': 520012}, \'multiverseid\': 520012}, {\'name\': \'Archivio di Alhammarret\', \'text\': \'Se stai per guadagnare punti vita, ne guadagni invece il doppio.\\nSe stai per pescare una carta, tranne la prima che peschi in ognuna delle tue sottofasi di acquisizione, pesca invece due carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Custodisce ogni singolo appunto, teoria e riflessione di Alhammarret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9936f4-9501-43ad-8931-faa122047981\', \'multiverseId\': 520260}, \'multiverseid\': 520260}, {\'name\': \'アルハマレットの書庫\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るなら、代わりにあなたはその２倍の点数のライフを得る。\\nあなたがあなたの各ドロー・ステップで引く１枚目のカードでないカード１枚を引くなら、代わりにカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それにはアルハマレットのメモや理論、そして考えのすべてが収められている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2affba71-0864-42fb-b6a5-225ea1077c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 520508}, \'multiverseid\': 520508}, {\'name\': \'Arquivo de Alhammarret\', \'text\': \'Se você for ganhar pontos de vida, em vez disso, ganhará o dobro daquela quantidade em pontos de vida.\\nSe você for comprar um card além do primeiro que você compra em cada uma das suas etapas de compra, em vez disso, compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Ele contém todas as anotações, teorias e reflexões de Alhammarret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023a4120-9815-407c-a71e-a557fe9ca6dc\', \'multiverseId\': 520756}, \'multiverseid\': 520756}, {\'name\': \'Архив Альхаммарета\', \'text\': \'Если вы должны получить определенное количество жизней, вы получаете их вдвое больше вместо этого.\\nЕсли вы должны взять карту помимо первой карты, которую вы берете в каждом вашем шаге взятия карты, вместо этого возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Полное собрание заметок, теорий и размышлений Альхаммарета.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e290693-53dc-48ee-a256-bd9a0b36310c\', \'multiverseId\': 521004}, \'multiverseid\': 521004}, {\'name\': \'阿哈玛瑞特的档案库\', \'text\': \'如果你将获得生命，则改为你获得该数量两倍的生命。\\n如果你将抓一张牌，且这不是你于自己的每个抓牌步骤中所抓的第一张牌，则改为抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它包含阿哈玛瑞特全部的笔记、理论和思考。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a8f3ef-2cdc-4291-9ce7-5e728e13954c\', \'multiverseId\': 521252}, \'multiverseid\': 521252}, {\'name\': \'阿哈瑪瑞特的檔案庫\', \'text\': \'如果你將獲得生命，則改為你獲得該數量兩倍的生命。\\n如果你將抽一張牌，且這不是你於自己的每個抽牌步驟中所抽的第一張牌，則改為抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它包含阿哈瑪瑞特全部的筆記、理論與思考。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'997b918a-ddca-4977-b46e-1cc5a11674d9\', \'multiverseId\': 521500}, \'multiverseid\': 521500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alibou, Uralter Zeuge\', \'text\': \'Andere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, fügt Alibou, Uralter Zeuge, einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu und du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an getappten Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc3357df-d28e-4a6e-b336-c17b336fd0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 518323}, \'multiverseid\': 518323}, {\'name\': \'Álibou, testigo antiguo\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto que controlas ataquen, Álibou, testigo antiguo hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú adivinas X, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos girados que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bfe9401-72f0-4dbc-8b5a-376063d876a8\', \'multiverseId\': 518333}, \'multiverseid\': 518333}, {\'name\': \'Alibou, témoin ancien\', \'text\': "Les autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez attaque, Alibou, témoin ancien inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts engagés que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518343&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a9c2c6-03d3-4356-a0fd-29d4c84687b0\', \'multiverseId\': 518343}, \'multiverseid\': 518343}, {\'name\': \'Alibou, Testimone Antico\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature artefatto che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto che controlli attaccano, Alibou, Testimone Antico infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu profetizzi X, dove X è il numero di artefatti TAPpati che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938aeaf6-539e-49a8-b30b-fe5b6f2c253b\', \'multiverseId\': 518353}, \'multiverseid\': 518353}, {\'name\': \'古代の証人、アリボー\', \'text\': \'これ以外であなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしているつアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体以上が攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。古代の証人、アリボーはそれにＸ点のダメージを与え、あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしていてタップ状態であるアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28dee17b-d204-4bbc-9575-350a727de322\', \'multiverseId\': 518363}, \'multiverseid\': 518363}, {\'name\': \'Alibou, Antiga Testemunha\', \'text\': \'As outras criaturas artefato que você controla têm ímpeto.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas artefato que você controla atacam, Alibou, Antiga Testemunha, causa X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo e você usa vidência X, sendo X o número de artefatos virados que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e3193a4-c8ae-4013-a55c-3dbf36acb849\', \'multiverseId\': 518373}, \'multiverseid\': 518373}, {\'name\': \'Алибу, Древний Свидетель\', \'text\': \'Другие артефакты существа под вашим контролем имеют Ускорение.\\nКаждый раз, когда одно или несколько артефактов существ под вашим контролем атакуют, Алибу, Древний Свидетель наносит X повреждений любой цели и вы предсказываете X, где X — количество повернутых артефактов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd0b95f-d382-42e1-972f-335d5cc214c0\', \'multiverseId\': 518383}, \'multiverseid\': 518383}, {\'name\': \'远古见证人阿力布\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他神器生物具有敏捷异能。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个神器生物攻击时，远古见证人阿力布对任意一个目标造成X点伤害，且你占卜X，X为由你操控且已横置的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c09d06e1-2958-4a43-9b95-e406c4bb5df8\', \'multiverseId\': 518393}, \'multiverseid\': 518393}, {\'name\': \'遠古見證人阿力布\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他神器生物具有敏捷異能。\\n每當由你操控的一個或數個神器生物攻擊時，遠古見證人阿力布對任意一個目標造成X點傷害，且你占卜X，X為由你操控且已橫置的神器數量。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c34360c-c157-417a-ba9f-f1f9a71447bd\', \'multiverseId\': 518403}, \'multiverseid\': 518403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alibou, Uralter Zeuge\', \'text\': \'Andere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, fügt Alibou, Uralter Zeuge, einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu und du wendest Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an getappten Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2152ac69-72a9-4bdb-8a97-db14e753e795\', \'multiverseId\': 521683}, \'multiverseid\': 521683}, {\'name\': \'Álibou, testigo antiguo\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto que controlas ataquen, Álibou, testigo antiguo hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú adivinas X, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos girados que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c104aae-0afc-4a1f-9257-0d5547fb2eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 521763}, \'multiverseid\': 521763}, {\'name\': \'Alibou, témoin ancien\', \'text\': "Les autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez attaque, Alibou, témoin ancien inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts engagés que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e608fce7-edb5-43a8-80d6-f0db2bcc997d\', \'multiverseId\': 521843}, \'multiverseid\': 521843}, {\'name\': \'Alibou, Testimone Antico\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature artefatto che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto che controlli attaccano, Alibou, Testimone Antico infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu profetizzi X, dove X è il numero di artefatti TAPpati che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c078a1-b97e-4288-bae9-7c500a250fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 521923}, \'multiverseid\': 521923}, {\'name\': \'古代の証人、アリボー\', \'text\': \'これ以外であなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体以上が攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。古代の証人、アリボーはそれにＸ点のダメージを与え、あなたは占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしていてタップ状態であるアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69c90849-2fd8-4327-bc5f-49ed8d008707\', \'multiverseId\': 522003}, \'multiverseid\': 522003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anhänger des Gedeihens\', \'text\': \'Der Anhänger des Gedeihens kommt unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners, den du bestimmst, ins Spiel.\\n{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte, dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen. Der Besitzer des Anhängers des Gedeihens zieht eine Karte, dann kann er eine Länderkarte aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eed4dc0-1595-42a7-a34f-50fd44abba74\', \'multiverseId\': 519539}, \'multiverseid\': 519539}, {\'name\': \'Medallón de prosperidad\', \'text\': \'El Medallón de prosperidad entra al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente de tu elección.\\n{2}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano. El propietario del Medallón de prosperidad roba una carta, luego ese jugador puede poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d322b5-bfcc-4fd2-a705-3d5dd32a0e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 519787}, \'multiverseid\': 519787}, {\'name\': \'Pendentif de prospérité\', \'text\': "Le Pendentif de prospérité arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire de votre choix.\\n{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main. Le propriétaire du Pendentif de prospérité pioche une carte, puis ce joueur peut mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain depuis sa main.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520035&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2790b8ef-bdf0-4c67-868f-57f440f211a0\', \'multiverseId\': 520035}, \'multiverseid\': 520035}, {\'name\': \'Medaglione della Prosperità\', \'text\': \'Il Medaglione della Prosperità entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario a tua scelta.\\n{2}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano. Il proprietario del Medaglione della Prosperità pesca una carta, poi quel giocatore può mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla sua mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03041874-dce7-452d-bc08-f0210ba44992\', \'multiverseId\': 520283}, \'multiverseid\': 520283}, {\'name\': \'繁栄のペンダント\', \'text\': \'繁栄のペンダントは、あなたが選んだ対戦相手１人のコントロール下で戦場に出る。\\n{2}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたはあなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。繁栄のペンダントのオーナーはカード１枚を引く。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分の手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b2efc80-d69c-429e-9b78-cf114692379c\', \'multiverseId\': 520531}, \'multiverseid\': 520531}, {\'name\': \'Pingente da Prosperidade\', \'text\': \'Pingente da Prosperidade entra no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente à sua escolha.\\n{2}, {T}: Compre um card. Depois, você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de terreno de sua mão. O dono de Pingente da Prosperidade compra um card e, depois, aquele jogador pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de terreno da própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2072dc7d-304b-4bba-9edb-a16ed462ee59\', \'multiverseId\': 520779}, \'multiverseid\': 520779}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Процветания\', \'text\': \'Амулет Процветания выходит на поле битвы под контролем оппонента по вашему выбору.\\n{2}, {T}: возьмите карту, затем вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы. Владелец Амулета Процветания берет карту, затем тот игрок может положить карту земли из своей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c75d0e4-2b6a-4616-80f1-49f5493ba5d1\', \'multiverseId\': 521027}, \'multiverseid\': 521027}, {\'name\': \'兴旺垂饰\', \'text\': \'于兴旺垂饰进战场时，选择一位对手。兴旺垂饰在该牌手的操控下进战场。\\n{2}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。兴旺垂饰的拥有者抓一张牌，然后该牌手可以将一张地牌从其手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d591658-aa87-45b0-8484-f23b310a0732\', \'multiverseId\': 521275}, \'multiverseid\': 521275}, {\'name\': \'興旺垂飾\', \'text\': \'於興旺垂飾進戰場時，選擇一位對手。興旺垂飾在該玩家的操控下進戰場。\\n{2}，{T}：抽一張牌，然後你可以將一張地牌從你手上放進戰場。興旺垂飾的擁有者抽一張牌，然後該玩家可以將一張地牌從其手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4946e6ee-3b13-45f0-af71-d351304a5f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 521523}, \'multiverseid\': 521523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anrufung des Wolkenfetzers\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 5/5 blauen und roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Er hört und beantwortet jedes Gebet im gesamten Schattenmoor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f604e12a-6b2b-43e9-8658-9d0398b7673b\', \'multiverseId\': 519494}, \'multiverseid\': 519494}, {\'name\': \'Llamar al Rompecielos\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Elemental azul y roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Escucha y responde a todas las plegarias de Páramo Sombrío.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c39c3452-8946-4ad9-8f65-65748097e749\', \'multiverseId\': 519742}, \'multiverseid\': 519742}, {\'name\': \'Appel du briseciel\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature 5/5 bleue et rouge Élémental avec le vol.\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Il entend toutes les oraisons sur Sombrelande et y répond.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519990&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7936f935-300e-4bbd-b23e-116f2bace65b\', \'multiverseId\': 519990}, \'multiverseid\': 519990}, {\'name\': \'Invocare il Solcacielo\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Elementale 5/5 blu e rossa con volare.\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Sente e risponde a ogni preghiera in tutta la Landa Tenebrosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a470d49-38fb-4d36-8244-7c34b0de88fb\', \'multiverseId\': 520238}, \'multiverseid\': 520238}, {\'name\': \'空砕きの呼び声\', \'text\': \'飛行を持ち青であり赤である５/５のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'それはシャドウムーアのあらゆる祈りを聞きとめ叶える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55938634-cc47-411a-9942-2281c864bab5\', \'multiverseId\': 520486}, \'multiverseid\': 520486}, {\'name\': \'Chamar o Rompe-Céu\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura Elemental azul e vermelha 5/5 com voar.\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card do seu cemitério ao descartar um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ele ouve e responde a cada oração em Pântano Sombrio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f629839c-4c9e-46ea-b94d-10e805e36714\', \'multiverseId\': 520734}, \'multiverseid\': 520734}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Неболома\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку существа 5/5 синий и красный Элементаль с Полетом.\\nВозвращение (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища, сбросив карту земли в дополнение к оплате других ее стоимостей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Он внемлет каждой мольбе в Шэдоумуре.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7733d6b2-0045-4373-b67b-d8e960efad72\', \'multiverseId\': 520982}, \'multiverseid\': 520982}, {\'name\': \'召令破空灵\', \'text\': \'派出一个5/5，蓝红双色，具飞行异能的元素衍生生物。\\n追溯（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，但必须支付其所需费用并额外弃一张地牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'暗影荒原的所有祈祷，它都能听闻并反应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a59c8c9-3562-43c5-892a-51ed39506371\', \'multiverseId\': 521230}, \'multiverseid\': 521230}, {\'name\': \'召令破空靈\', \'text\': \'派出一個5/5，藍紅雙色，具飛行異能的元素衍生生物。\\n追溯（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，但必須支付其所需費用並額外棄一張地牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'闇影荒原的所有祈禱，它都能聽聞並反應。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f935e1-f6b8-433a-a9b5-2fc25779e42e\', \'multiverseId\': 521478}, \'multiverseid\': 521478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arashi, der Himmelsteiler\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, der Himmelsteiler, fügt einer fliegenden Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nBlutzoll — {X}{G}{G}, wirf Arashi ab: Arashi fügt jeder fliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5abb9b20-ac22-4c00-a4c9-fa197705625a\', \'multiverseId\': 519468}, \'multiverseid\': 519468}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, el cielo desbaratado\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, el cielo desbaratado hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\\nCanalizar — {X}{G}{G}, descartar a Arashi: Arashi hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7474e9a6-834f-4108-be2b-e159f0e96750\', \'multiverseId\': 519716}, \'multiverseid\': 519716}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, le ciel déchiré\', \'text\': "{X}{G}, {T} : Arashi, le ciel déchiré inflige X blessures à une créature avec le vol ciblée.\\nTransfert — {X}{G}{G}, défaussez-vous d\'Arashi, le ciel déchiré : Arashi, le ciel déchiré inflige X blessures à chaque créature avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519964&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8eb624-6bbd-4236-9025-6b599b60235c\', \'multiverseId\': 519964}, \'multiverseid\': 519964}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, lo Squartacielo\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, lo Squartacielo infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio con volare.\\nIncanalare — {X}{G}{G}, Scarta Arashi: Arashi infligge X danni a ogni creatura con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6001258a-e8df-4aeb-81bc-9d5505233e45\', \'multiverseId\': 520212}, \'multiverseid\': 520212}, {\'name\': \'空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}：飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n魂力 ― {X}{G}{G}, 空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示を捨てる：空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示は飛行を持つ各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18f8c068-488f-4231-a6cb-2d7f811ac588\', \'multiverseId\': 520460}, \'multiverseid\': 520460}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, o Céu em Pedaços\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, o Céu em Pedaços, causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo com voar.\\nCanalizar — {X}{G}{G}, descarte Arashi: Arashi causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f7eaaf-17fe-4ad7-a60c-7e88e08ee9ce\', \'multiverseId\': 520708}, \'multiverseid\': 520708}, {\'name\': \'Араши, Разорванное Небо\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Араши, Разорванное Небо наносит X повреждений целевому существу с Полетом.\\nПроводник — {X}{G}{G}, сбросьте Араши: Араши наносит X повреждений каждому существу с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fa6ebe-697e-4250-ba81-6a4dc1195adc\', \'multiverseId\': 520956}, \'multiverseid\': 520956}, {\'name\': \'烈风阏螺示\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}，{T}：烈风阏螺示对目标具飞行异能的生物造成X点伤害。\\n魂力～{X}{G}{G}，弃掉阏螺示：阏螺示对每个具飞行异能的生物各造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20829ba0-f2dd-411c-87da-22c500b86874\', \'multiverseId\': 521204}, \'multiverseid\': 521204}, {\'name\': \'烈風閼螺示\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}，{T}：烈風閼螺示對目標具飛行異能的生物造成X點傷害。\\n魂力～{X}{G}{G}，棄掉閼螺示：閼螺示對每個具飛行異能的生物各造成X點傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b129a80c-c836-42cb-9481-a889a2ab375f\', \'multiverseId\': 521452}, \'multiverseid\': 521452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faae93c3-ee47-4ee2-905a-171ff56b6b2b\', \'multiverseId\': 519517}, \'multiverseid\': 519517}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208b8751-0018-435e-8e6e-69445957ffe7\', \'multiverseId\': 519765}, \'multiverseid\': 519765}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520013&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'750d0541-2ff9-4b24-90c2-8944d6f44c81\', \'multiverseId\': 520013}, \'multiverseid\': 520013}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7743f7ef-837a-444e-a578-700842fb2f82\', \'multiverseId\': 520261}, \'multiverseid\': 520261}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03fe31b-9ca8-4ee3-88e0-7617de1e9a93\', \'multiverseId\': 520509}, \'multiverseid\': 520509}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': "Começou como uma simples gota d\'água. O Espelho Mágico a cristalizou em algo muito maior.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5aaf14-ddb7-450d-9ce7-542389652d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 520757}, \'multiverseid\': 520757}, {\'name\': \'Магическая Печать\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва это была простая капля воды. Волшебное Зеркало превратило ее в нечто большее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e499b1-7be7-4991-a33f-6128b5d115de\', \'multiverseId\': 521005}, \'multiverseid\': 521005}, {\'name\': \'秘法印记\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它起初就只是水滴。魔法明镜将之晶化为更有用的事物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fc3fbdf-9fd4-4d49-a0d7-f08aa9086514\', \'multiverseId\': 521253}, \'multiverseid\': 521253}, {\'name\': \'秘法印記\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它起初就只是水滴。魔法明鏡將之晶化為更有用的事物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3feea24c-8f27-4c5d-8672-983ecbd31ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 521501}, \'multiverseid\': 521501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armschienen des Kampfmagiers\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile.\\nImmer wenn eine Fähigkeit der ausgerüsteten Kreatur aktiviert wird und falls es keine Manafähigkeit ist, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, kopiere die Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3608f7-2aa7-4a6b-aeba-345edcdf42df\', \'multiverseId\': 518515}, \'multiverseid\': 518515}, {\'name\': \'Brazales de maga de guerra\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que se active una habilidad de la criatura equipada, si no es una habilidad de maná, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, copia esa habilidad. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506e1f21-ee39-4ec6-9975-38ea51a4830e\', \'multiverseId\': 518586}, \'multiverseid\': 518586}, {\'name\': \'Bracelets du mage de bataille\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une capacité de la créature équipée est activée, si ce n\'est pas une capacité de mana, Vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, copiez cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518657&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8201b228-0eb4-496c-b1ba-d63eefd1558b\', \'multiverseId\': 518657}, \'multiverseid\': 518657}, {\'name\': \'Bracciali del Mago Combattente\', \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata ha rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta viene attivata un\'abilità della creatura equipaggiata, se non è un\'abilità di mana, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, copia quella abilità. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nEquipaggiare {2}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5125e6-77eb-4f3d-a803-6a5238c64f39\', \'multiverseId\': 518728}, \'multiverseid\': 518728}, {\'name\': \'戦闘魔道士の篭手\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーの能力が起動されるたび、それがマナ能力でない場合、あなたは「{1}を支払い、その能力をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf99bcc-9fcf-41aa-8875-8496a7450fca\', \'multiverseId\': 518799}, \'multiverseid\': 518799}, {\'name\': \'Braceletes do Mago de Batalha\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem ímpeto.\\nToda vez que uma habilidade da criatura equipada é ativada, se não for uma habilidade de mana, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, copie aquela habilidade. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7019ec64-0b79-44a5-9957-9f71cb575260\', \'multiverseId\': 518870}, \'multiverseid\': 518870}, {\'name\': \'Наручи Боевого Мага\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Ускорение.\\nКаждый раз, когда активируется способность снаряженного существа, вы можете заплатить {1}, если это не мана-способность. Если вы это делаете, скопируйте ту способность. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4d51bd-6f19-4dfb-a6c0-2fab6a30410a\', \'multiverseId\': 518941}, \'multiverseid\': 518941}, {\'name\': \'战巫师护臂\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n每当起动佩带此武具之生物的异能时，若它不是法术力异能，则你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则复制该异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a52c1e99-37dd-45b5-a985-bbbaec167946\', \'multiverseId\': 519012}, \'multiverseid\': 519012}, {\'name\': \'戰巫師護臂\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有敏捷異能。\\n每當起動佩帶此武具之生物的異能時，若它不是魔法力異能，則你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，則複製該異能。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\\n佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1672f2c-573c-497e-a9a5-42f85b018259\', \'multiverseId\': 519083}, \'multiverseid\': 519083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armschienen des Kampfmagiers\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile.\\nImmer wenn eine Fähigkeit der ausgerüsteten Kreatur aktiviert wird und falls es keine Manafähigkeit ist, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, kopiere die Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f334280-055b-48f5-9b38-e80ca2410a08\', \'multiverseId\': 521724}, \'multiverseid\': 521724}, {\'name\': \'Brazales de maga de guerra\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que se active una habilidad de la criatura equipada, si no es una habilidad de maná, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, copia esa habilidad. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac88ea9-0487-4e72-b696-2495a5f6cfc9\', \'multiverseId\': 521804}, \'multiverseid\': 521804}, {\'name\': \'Bracelets du mage de bataille\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une capacité de la créature équipée est activée, si ce n\'est pas une capacité de mana, Vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, copiez cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'797b4d25-316a-4832-b6e7-2a2a8c9287cc\', \'multiverseId\': 521884}, \'multiverseid\': 521884}, {\'name\': \'Bracciali del Mago Combattente\', \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata ha rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta viene attivata un\'abilità della creatura equipaggiata, se non è un\'abilità di mana, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, copia quella abilità. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nEquipaggiare {2}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d64b0f5-946b-4921-a968-600a7f89fa9c\', \'multiverseId\': 521964}, \'multiverseid\': 521964}, {\'name\': \'戦闘魔道士の篭手\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーの能力が起動されるたび、それがマナ能力でない場合、あなたは「{1}を支払い、その能力をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ddb89fe-864c-44c3-9a3a-f810236ae459\', \'multiverseId\': 522044}, \'multiverseid\': 522044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufseher aus Stahl\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lege auf jede Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt wird jetzt schon von unterschiedlichsten Maschinen regiert. Eines Tages werden sie es uns spüren lassen."\\n—Sargis Haz, Tüftler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb4dfa5-9551-43b6-99a8-a514e557421c\', \'multiverseId\': 519550}, \'multiverseid\': 519550}, {\'name\': \'Capataz de acero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura artefacto que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"El mundo ya está dirigido por todo tipo de máquinas. Un día, nos recordarán ese hecho".\\n—Sargis Haz, artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1b67e8-b3c9-4258-aa14-2b7809171969\', \'multiverseId\': 519798}, \'multiverseid\': 519798}, {\'name\': "Brigadier d\'acier", \'text\': \'{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature-artefact que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'« Le monde est déjà dirigé par toutes sortes de machines. Un jour, elles nous le rappelleront. »\\n—Sargis Haz, artificier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5c09cd-5078-4d0c-bd2c-d0f90f295435\', \'multiverseId\': 520046}, \'multiverseid\': 520046}, {\'name\': "Sorvegliante d\'Acciaio", \'text\': \'{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura artefatto che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo ormai è gestito da macchine di ogni genere. Un giorno, ci ricorderanno questo fatto."\\n—Sargis Haz, artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa35e27f-f5a2-465a-b844-ece4acdcb378\', \'multiverseId\': 520294}, \'multiverseid\': 520294}, {\'name\': \'鋼の監視者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている各アーティファクト・クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「世界は既に機械の方式で動いているのよ。いつか、その事実を向こうに思い知らされるんでしょうね。」\\n――工匠、サルギス・ハズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e14635-a8b8-452f-b77d-90aaca63854d\', \'multiverseId\': 520542}, \'multiverseid\': 520542}, {\'name\': \'Supervisor de Aço\', \'text\': \'{T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura artefato que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"O mundo já é governado por todo tipo de máquinas. Um dia, elas nos recordarão disso."\\n— Sargis Haz, artesão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a505fa13-0046-4bf3-b354-52bb07efa9f8\', \'multiverseId\': 520790}, \'multiverseid\': 520790}, {\'name\': \'Стальной Надсмотрщик\', \'text\': \'{T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждый артефакт существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Уже сейчас миром управляют всевозможные машины. В один прекрасный день они напомнят нам об этом».\\n— Саргис Хаз, изобретатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cd14419-1111-4391-aba3-b52c71fb785a\', \'multiverseId\': 521038}, \'multiverseid\': 521038}, {\'name\': \'钢铁督军\', \'text\': \'{T}：在每个由你操控的神器生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「这世界已经靠各种机械来运作着。有一天，它们会提醒我们这事实。」\\n～神器师莎琪亥\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3033f1a3-d1ec-474f-84af-e901ce591619\', \'multiverseId\': 521286}, \'multiverseid\': 521286}, {\'name\': \'鋼鐵督軍\', \'text\': \'{T}：在每個由你操控的神器生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「這世界已經靠各種機械來運作著。有一天，它們會提醒我們這事實。」\\n～神器師莎琪亥\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917306a2-07f9-4f0c-a664-41032e4ed583\', \'multiverseId\': 521534}, \'multiverseid\': 521534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge der Pilger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Auge der Pilger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kor schicken ihre Thopter vor, um zu schauen, ob das Land gerade gute Laune hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7aa31e-62d4-4ddb-900f-ac6dcad2e9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 519540}, \'multiverseid\': 519540}, {\'name\': \'Ojo del peregrino\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ojo del peregrino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Los kor envían a sus tópteros cometa para ver si la tierra está de humor para una visita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df6f17e-c8a8-4d60-acde-9d626ca1d4f2\', \'multiverseId\': 519788}, \'multiverseid\': 519788}, {\'name\': \'Œil du pèlerin\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Œil du pèlerin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "Les kor envoient leurs voiles mécanoptères en éclaireur pour déterminer si la terre est d\'humeur accueillante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520036&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'301a13ce-370a-4dcf-9cef-1214ab9dcefb\', \'multiverseId\': 520036}, \'multiverseid\': 520036}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Pellegrino\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Occhio del Pellegrino entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': \'I kor spediscono sempre i loro alianti totteri per verificare se la terra è di buonumore o meno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51061745-febb-4845-981b-95ef70263dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 520284}, \'multiverseid\': 520284}, {\'name\': \'巡礼者の目\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n巡礼者の目が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'コーは飛行凧を送り込んで、地が歓迎しているかどうかを見る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03956dbd-05f7-45c6-8d14-1b03eece6dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 520532}, \'multiverseid\': 520532}, {\'name\': \'Olho do Peregrino\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Olho do Peregrino entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo em sua mão e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Os kor enviam seus topteroveleiros para verificar se a terra está receptiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f438b23e-09f7-4eb3-b024-b777e7a650f0\', \'multiverseId\': 520780}, \'multiverseid\': 520780}, {\'name\': \'Око Пилигрима\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Око Пилигрима выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, показать ее, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Топтер\', \'flavor\': \'Коры высылают топтеров посмотреть, в хорошем ли настроении пребывает земля.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261ac941-d042-463d-a1ec-d648d4deee66\', \'multiverseId\': 521028}, \'multiverseid\': 521028}, {\'name\': \'朝圣客之眼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当朝圣客之眼进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～振翼机\', \'flavor\': \'寇族派出振翼机升空，打量这块大地是否有意愿接纳他们。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e487aee-427e-46a5-9d33-3e708c8868f0\', \'multiverseId\': 521276}, \'multiverseid\': 521276}, {\'name\': \'朝聖客之眼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當朝聖客之眼進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～振翼機\', \'flavor\': \'寇族派出振翼機升空，打量這塊大地是否有意願接納他們。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4d51ce-bb0b-4a36-b80f-24c05392df78\', \'multiverseId\': 521524}, \'multiverseid\': 521524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Gesicht geschnitten\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl ist.\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Bespucken ist die normale Begrüßung zwischen einer Kreatur und ihrem magischen Ebenbild.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e356da9e-ec16-4441-83ad-7919a5b27a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 519512}, \'multiverseid\': 519512}, {\'name\': \'Imagen escupidora\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura objetivo.\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Escupir es el saludo acostumbrado entre una criatura y su impostor mágico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4262c1ad-f78e-4d4c-8d16-f49a2371badc\', \'multiverseId\': 519760}, \'multiverseid\': 519760}, {\'name\': \'Portrait craché\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature ciblée.\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une créature et son imposteur magique s\'accueillent toujours l\'un l\'autre par un crachat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520008&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5d2308-9abe-4a3f-9d5a-4b2c6fc45073\', \'multiverseId\': 520008}, \'multiverseid\': 520008}, {\'name\': \'Immagine Sputata\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura bersaglio.\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Sputare è il saluto abituale tra una creatura e il suo impostore magico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c2f490-4a48-4891-8388-30e8d3fb0065\', \'multiverseId\': 520256}, \'multiverseid\': 520256}, {\'name\': \'瓜二つ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'瓜を投げあうのが、生き物と魔法の偽物とのよくある挨拶だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bac53c0-356b-4a73-a10c-c3d46dab2dc8\', \'multiverseId\': 520504}, \'multiverseid\': 520504}, {\'name\': \'Cuspido e Escarrado\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura alvo.\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card do seu cemitério ao descartar um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Cuspir é a saudação habitual entre uma criatura e seu impostor mágico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'374d9212-6a9d-44fc-8e85-a4c1b525dfc7\', \'multiverseId\': 520752}, \'multiverseid\': 520752}, {\'name\': \'Разительное Сходство\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией целевого существа.\\nВозвращение (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища, сбросив карту земли в дополнение к оплате других ее стоимостей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Обмен плевками — обычное приветствие между существом и его магическим двойником-самозванцем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab23930b-590a-42d1-a02b-54d5f133a390\', \'multiverseId\': 521000}, \'multiverseid\': 521000}, {\'name\': \'射影\', \'text\': \'派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标生物之复制品。\\n追溯（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，但必须支付其所需费用并额外弃一张地牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'生物碰上自己的法术假冒品时，通常会行互射口水之礼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e50e31f-3a92-4041-a9d5-9690f2f11e37\', \'multiverseId\': 521248}, \'multiverseid\': 521248}, {\'name\': \'射影\', \'text\': \'派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為目標生物之複製品。\\n追溯（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，但必須支付其所需費用並額外棄一張地牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'生物碰上自己的魔法假冒品時，通常會行互射口水之禮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af1de474-ea47-40e7-a7e0-4ac5959346ad\', \'multiverseId\': 521496}, \'multiverseid\': 521496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus und vorbei\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kam auf der Suche nach einer Herausforderung. Alles, was ich fand, warst du."\\n—Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f2c83f-cbd2-4c03-af23-39090e494b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 519515}, \'multiverseid\': 519515}, {\'name\': \'Fin absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vine en busca de un desafío... pero solo te he encontrado a ti".\\n—Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4bc215-fb7b-46ef-9ae9-6f5c83cc64f8\', \'multiverseId\': 519763}, \'multiverseid\': 519763}, {\'name\': \'Destruction totale\', \'text\': \'Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je venais en quête de défi. Mais je n\'ai trouvé que toi. »\\n—Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520011&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3bb1bbe-7b91-4cd4-ac0e-4579dea4adf9\', \'multiverseId\': 520011}, \'multiverseid\': 520011}, {\'name\': \'Fine Assoluta\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono giunto in cerca di una sfida, ma non ho trovato che te."\\n—Zurgo, khan dei Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c38c912-1955-4ced-8961-e4750badb6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 520259}, \'multiverseid\': 520259}, {\'name\': \'完全なる終わり\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺は挑戦を求めて来たというのに。ここにいたのはお前だけというわけか。」\\n――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdea0022-6120-4640-b982-9c8666bbf327\', \'multiverseId\': 520507}, \'multiverseid\': 520507}, {\'name\': \'Fim Absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vim em busca de um desafio. Tudo o que encontrei foi você."\\n— Zurgo, khan dos mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8bc1c53-4b37-4ec1-9c3e-97235876a7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 520755}, \'multiverseid\': 520755}, {\'name\': \'Окончательная Погибель\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я пришел, чтобы найти достойного противника. А нашел только тебя».\\n— Зурго, хан Марду\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78c08ac9-b65c-420d-9aaa-a021f3c03698\', \'multiverseId\': 521003}, \'multiverseid\': 521003}, {\'name\': \'彻底终结\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我来寻求挑战。可我只找到了你。」\\n～玛尔都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e02d35df-bccb-43d7-bed4-03ffc619675b\', \'multiverseId\': 521251}, \'multiverseid\': 521251}, {\'name\': \'徹底終結\', \'text\': \'放逐目標非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我來尋求挑戰。可我只找到了你。」\\n～瑪爾都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce3d695-86d9-463e-947d-0323c9aacf8a\', \'multiverseId\': 521499}, \'multiverseid\': 521499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgrabungsingenieurin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 0/0 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Grab da drüben, du Bolzenkopf!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2cd2d9d-cfa4-4078-b7da-9f1e92ca12d8\', \'multiverseId\': 518482}, \'multiverseid\': 518482}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniera de la excavación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 0/0 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice enano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Que caves por allí, trozo de chatarra!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df99074-245e-4f14-be55-2e974b43d789\', \'multiverseId\': 518553}, \'multiverseid\': 518553}, {\'name\': "Ingénieure d\'excavation", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/0 incolore Construction avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Creuse par là, tête de pioche ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4605e2dd-7eda-45cd-9124-b25167704903\', \'multiverseId\': 518624}, \'multiverseid\': 518624}, {\'name\': \'Ingegnera dello Scavo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 0/0 incolore con "Questa creatura prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Scava laggiù, testa di bullone!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af48f20-68df-4794-b932-4fc0480e1fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 518695}, \'multiverseid\': 518695}, {\'name\': \'発掘現場の技師\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは「{2}を支払い、『このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。』を持つ無色の０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「あそこを掘るのよ、ボルト頭！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c566c4af-140d-4c12-a1ea-de360885f6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 518766}, \'multiverseid\': 518766}, {\'name\': \'Engenheira do Sítio de Escavação\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica de artefato, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Constructo incolor 0/0 com "Esta criatura recebe +1/+1 para cada artefato que você controla".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Escava ali, ô cabeça de prego!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba569fe7-fbb7-4a8e-a1ff-d722bf46f741\', \'multiverseId\': 518837}, \'multiverseid\': 518837}, {\'name\': \'Инженер Раскопок\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание артефакта, вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 0/0 бесцветная Конструкция со способностью «Это существо получает +1/+1 за каждый артефакт под вашим контролем».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Туда копай, железяка дурная!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739ce743-cd78-4c8f-be2b-7fcb882cb412\', \'multiverseId\': 518908}, \'multiverseid\': 518908}, {\'name\': \'挖掘点工程师\', \'text\': \'每当你施放神器咒语时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则派出一个0/0无色组构体衍生神器生物，且具有「你每操控一个神器，此生物便得+1/+1。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「你个螺丝脑袋，去挖那边！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356f4cc7-94f5-4953-89e0-36c4a56f5b72\', \'multiverseId\': 518979}, \'multiverseid\': 518979}, {\'name\': \'挖掘點工程師\', \'text\': \'每當你施放神器咒語時，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，則派出一個0/0無色組構體衍生神器生物，且具有「你每操控一個神器，此生物便得+1/+1。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「你個螺絲腦袋，去挖那邊！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1c3fa7-fb50-4cfa-9aea-37f0615fab36\', \'multiverseId\': 519050}, \'multiverseid\': 519050}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgrabungsingenieurin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 0/0 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521691&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15713ef4-e94f-492a-a38a-b5c47d66664d\', \'multiverseId\': 521691}, \'multiverseid\': 521691}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniera de la excavación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 0/0 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice enano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27e110a-97bf-4c77-a759-c7412d57760f\', \'multiverseId\': 521771}, \'multiverseid\': 521771}, {\'name\': "Ingénieure d\'excavation", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/0 incolore Construction avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a76dc958-c6a8-4d1a-b84a-aefc500d9ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 521851}, \'multiverseid\': 521851}, {\'name\': \'Ingegnera dello Scavo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 0/0 incolore con "Questa creatura prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbb9676-6f85-44c0-bb1f-eb2e18aece6e\', \'multiverseId\': 521931}, \'multiverseid\': 521931}, {\'name\': \'発掘現場の技師\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは「{2}を支払い、『このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。』を持つ無色の０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d4f388-a5cf-4c1b-bed9-bb0995ab6b28\', \'multiverseId\': 522011}, \'multiverseid\': 522011}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgrabungverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert. Spieler können neue Ziele für ihre Kopien bestimmen.)\\nZerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Tretet zurück. Jetzt wird es chaotisch."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb0cf30-f9cb-4f3d-9d66-f7c5b03b5089\', \'multiverseId\': 518483}, \'multiverseid\': 518483}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de excavación\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia. Los jugadores pueden elegir nuevos objetivos para sus copias.)\\nDestruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Su controlador crea dos fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Retírate. Ahora esto se complica".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4fadd85-eb7c-4cc0-b49b-7bb7e4c8a268\', \'multiverseId\': 518554}, \'multiverseid\': 518554}, {\'name\': "Technique d\'excavation", \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi. Les joueurs peuvent choisir de nouvelles cibles pour leurs copies.)\\nDétruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur crée deux jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Reculez. Ça va devenir salissant. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518625&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c4d3d6-b66d-46bc-8d94-accbc3ca3ff8\', \'multiverseId\': 518625}, \'multiverseid\': 518625}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Escavazione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta. I giocatori possono scegliere nuovi bersagli per le proprie copie.)\\nDistruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea due pedine Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai indietro. Potresti sporcarti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2458d1e-12a3-4a25-ba17-27a395e544c0\', \'multiverseId\': 518696}, \'multiverseid\': 518696}, {\'name\': \'発掘の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。両プレイヤーは自分のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。）\\n土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「離れなさい。次は少し散らかりますから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a647411-44b3-41fb-ad5b-2f3eb076255a\', \'multiverseId\': 518767}, \'multiverseid\': 518767}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de Escavação\', \'text\': \'Demonstrar (Quando você conjura esta mágica, você pode copiá-la. Se fizer isso, escolha um oponente para copiá-la também. Os jogadores podem escolher novos alvos para as próprias cópias.)\\nDestrua a permanente não de terreno alvo. Seu controlador cria duas fichas de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Para trás! Nessa parte a coisa complica."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1910fd53-c314-4b70-b60b-f9040822ee16\', \'multiverseId\': 518838}, \'multiverseid\': 518838}, {\'name\': \'Техника Раскопок\', \'text\': \'Демонстрация (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, вы можете скопировать его. Если вы это делаете, выберите оппонента, который также скопирует его. Игроки могут выбрать новые цели для своих копий.)\\nУничтожьте целевой не являющийся землей перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает две фишки Клада.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Отойди назад. Сейчас будет грязно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7706efca-04b9-45aa-9708-d2adcd1e79dc\', \'multiverseId\': 518909}, \'multiverseid\': 518909}, {\'name\': \'挖掘技艺\', \'text\': \'示范（当你施放此咒语时，你可以将其复制。若你如此作，则选择一位对手一同复制。牌手可以为各自的复制品选择新的目标。）\\n消灭目标非地永久物。其操控者派出两个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「退后。这步容易出状况。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc808787-6653-4271-95d4-ea5a0181b984\', \'multiverseId\': 518980}, \'multiverseid\': 518980}, {\'name\': \'挖掘技藝\', \'text\': \'示範（當你施放此咒語時，你可以將其複製。若你如此作，則選擇一位對手一同複製。玩家可以為各自的複製品選擇新的目標。）\\n消滅目標非地永久物。其操控者派出兩個珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「退後。這步容易出狀況。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19837429-7f15-4679-a519-66e500c26cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 519051}, \'multiverseid\': 519051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgrabungverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert. Spieler können neue Ziele für ihre Kopien bestimmen.)\\nZerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521692&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0163a07-7fa2-49b1-b629-374fae74a0af\', \'multiverseId\': 521692}, \'multiverseid\': 521692}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de excavación\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia. Los jugadores pueden elegir nuevos objetivos para sus copias.)\\nDestruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Su controlador crea dos fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'062e9092-d1db-43cf-82b6-8c148f8f500b\', \'multiverseId\': 521772}, \'multiverseid\': 521772}, {\'name\': "Technique d\'excavation", \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi. Les joueurs peuvent choisir de nouvelles cibles pour leurs copies.)\\nDétruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur crée deux jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c350104f-5f3f-4583-8d8c-d5708509d653\', \'multiverseId\': 521852}, \'multiverseid\': 521852}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Escavazione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta. I giocatori possono scegliere nuovi bersagli per le proprie copie.)\\nDistruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea due pedine Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af869e36-79a2-41ba-b53d-6c252d2bdd19\', \'multiverseId\': 521932}, \'multiverseid\': 521932}, {\'name\': \'発掘の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人をにもこれをコピーさせる。両プレイヤーは自分のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。）\\n土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f93d3221-9134-443a-828c-7231cc06fb02\', \'multiverseId\': 522012}, \'multiverseid\': 522012}]', '[{\'name\': \'Autor der Schatten\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Autor der Schatten ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus den Friedhöfen aller Gegner ins Exil. Bestimme eine Nichtland-Karte, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurde. Du kannst die Karte wirken, solange sie im Exil ist, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'787de137-5512-45b1-91ce-aa6864f73494\', \'multiverseId\': 518502}, \'multiverseid\': 518502}, {\'name\': \'Autor de sombras\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Autor de sombras entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas de los cementerios de todos los oponentes. Elige una carta que no sea tierra exiliada de esta manera. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo sombra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25eb008-8658-41ae-b193-270ae83f24d2\', \'multiverseId\': 518573}, \'multiverseid\': 518573}, {\'name\': "Auteur d\'ombres", \'text\': "Quand l\'Auteur d\'ombres arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes des cimetières de tous les adversaires. Choisissez une carte non-terrain exilée de cette manière. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518644&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee761595-af81-4b07-8fbc-f40de971c2ce\', \'multiverseId\': 518644}, \'multiverseid\': 518644}, {\'name\': \'Autore delle Ombre\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Autore delle Ombre entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dai cimiteri di tutti gli avversari. Scegli una carta non terra esiliata in questo modo. Puoi lanciare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciarla.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Ombra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81be106c-a614-46ab-9a03-41cc5520b04c\', \'multiverseId\': 518715}, \'multiverseid\': 518715}, {\'name\': \'影の執筆者\', \'text\': \'影の執筆者が戦場に出たとき、すべての対戦相手の墓地からすべてのカードを追放する。これにより追放された、土地でないカード１枚を選ぶ。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — シェイド・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ed3f46-e152-4de7-a139-04bfa57f2131\', \'multiverseId\': 518786}, \'multiverseid\': 518786}, {\'name\': \'Autor das Sombras\', \'text\': \'Quando Autor das Sombras entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards dos cemitérios de todos os oponentes. Escolha um card não de terreno exilado dessa forma. Você pode conjurar aquele card enquanto ele permanecer exilado, e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar aquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f303cd-566d-49c5-85a2-92bad02907b5\', \'multiverseId\': 518857}, \'multiverseid\': 518857}, {\'name\': \'Автор Теней\', \'text\': \'Когда Автор Теней выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты из кладбищ всех оппонентов. Выберите не являющуюся землей карту, изгнанную таким образом. Вы можете разыграть ту карту, пока она остается в изгнании, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тень Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc0fc75-5f4f-4903-a6b4-927b9b9ed2f2\', \'multiverseId\': 518928}, \'multiverseid\': 518928}, {\'name\': \'黯影著书人\', \'text\': \'当黯影著书人进战场时，放逐所有对手坟墓场中的所有牌。选择一张以此法放逐的非地牌。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阴魂／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd7f8d45-84a5-491b-95c2-5c3cc873402e\', \'multiverseId\': 518999}, \'multiverseid\': 518999}, {\'name\': \'黯影著書人\', \'text\': \'當黯影著書人進戰場時，放逐所有對手墳墓場中的所有牌。選擇一張以此法放逐的非地牌。於該牌持續放逐的時段內，你可以施放該牌，且你可以將魔法力視同任意顏色的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～陰魂／邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b471f00-64f0-4a3c-899f-2c82ebb1b885\', \'multiverseId\': 519070}, \'multiverseid\': 519070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Autor der Schatten\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Autor der Schatten ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus den Friedhöfen aller Gegner ins Exil. Bestimme eine Nichtland-Karte, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurde. Du kannst die Karte wirken, solange sie im Exil ist, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521711&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a450684c-6dde-4e0e-8379-33c2701b8d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 521711}, \'multiverseid\': 521711}, {\'name\': \'Autor de sombras\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Autor de sombras entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas de los cementerios de todos los oponentes. Elige una carta que no sea tierra exiliada de esta manera. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo sombra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091d49ec-90d2-4c71-a041-ec573c7c7c04\', \'multiverseId\': 521791}, \'multiverseid\': 521791}, {\'name\': "Auteur d\'ombres", \'text\': "Quand l\'Auteur d\'ombres arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes des cimetières de tous les adversaires. Choisissez une carte non-terrain exilée de cette manière. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'489ab410-4754-4706-aa77-3a17a00f48d2\', \'multiverseId\': 521871}, \'multiverseid\': 521871}, {\'name\': \'Autore delle Ombre\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Autore delle Ombre entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dai cimiteri di tutti gli avversari. Scegli una carta non terra esiliata in questo modo. Puoi lanciare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciarla.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Ombra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'393e87fe-6126-42ff-9ff2-47d58e22ac90\', \'multiverseId\': 521951}, \'multiverseid\': 521951}, {\'name\': \'影の執筆者\', \'text\': \'影の執筆者が戦場に出たとき、すべての対戦相手の墓地からすべてのカードを追放する。これにより追放された、土地でないカード１枚を選ぶ。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — シェイド・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03f4af4-ec45-49bf-83e5-358cdee9f07e\', \'multiverseId\': 522031}, \'multiverseid\': 522031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avatar der Blühenden Sonne\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Avatar der Blühenden Sonne oder eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Widerstandskraft jener Kreatur dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier, Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Ixallis lebensspendende Strahlen durchdringen uns alle. Wir alle sind das Zeugnis der Stärke und Liebe der Sonne."\\n—Chitlati, Blitzreiterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519491&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e9b8fa5-a5d8-49dc-b825-cb262e3ed84b\', \'multiverseId\': 519491}, \'multiverseid\': 519491}, {\'name\': \'Avatar del Sol Verdeante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Avatar del Sol Verdeante u otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la resistencia de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'"Los rayos fértiles de Ixalli nos dan la vida a todos. Cada uno es un testimonio de la fuerza y el amor del sol".\\n—Chitlati, Jinete del Rayo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da12f56-1864-4e0a-8790-e467a9696469\', \'multiverseId\': 519739}, \'multiverseid\': 519739}, {\'name\': \'Avatar du Soleil verdoyant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Avatar du Soleil verdoyant ou une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'endurance de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure et avatar\', \'flavor\': "« Les rayons fertiles d\'Ixalli nous revigorent. Chacun de nous témoigne de la force et de l\'amour du soleil. »\\n—Chitlati, chevaucheuse d\'éclair", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519987&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23882db2-9d6e-4902-9f6f-9aa178bad226\', \'multiverseId\': 519987}, \'multiverseid\': 519987}, {\'name\': \'Avatar del Sole Verdeggiante\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Avatar del Sole Verdeggiante o un\'altra creatura entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni punti vita pari alla costituzione di quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'"I fertili raggi di Ixalli ci donano la vita. Ognuno di noi è testimonianza del potere e dell\\\'amore del sole."\\n—Chitlati, cavalcatrice del fulmine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7120c941-70f2-43d7-8db2-0abca9e28240\', \'multiverseId\': 520235}, \'multiverseid\': 520235}, {\'name\': \'翠緑の太陽の化身\', \'text\': \'翠緑の太陽の化身かこれ以外のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはそのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜・アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「イクサーリの肥沃な陽光は、私たちに活力を与えてくれる。一人一人が太陽の力と愛の証なのよ。」\\n――稲妻騎手、チトラーティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5850e64-cd05-4767-b21d-4ed9d7f611cd\', \'multiverseId\': 520483}, \'multiverseid\': 520483}, {\'name\': \'Avatar do Sol Verdejante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Avatar do Sol Verdejante ou outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à resistência daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinossauro Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Os férteis raios de Ixalli nos avivam a todos. Cada um de nós é um testemunho da força e do amor do sol."\\n— Chitlati, Ginete do Trovão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46c76a5-a725-4c09-9c12-8b71b3835a46\', \'multiverseId\': 520731}, \'multiverseid\': 520731}, {\'name\': \'Аватара Плодородного Солнца\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Аватара Плодородного Солнца или другое существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете количество жизней, равное выносливости того существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Динозавр Аватара\', \'flavor\': \'«Плодородные лучи Иксалли наполняют нас жизнью. Каждый из нас — свидетельство могущества и любви солнца».\\n— Читлати, наездница молний\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a3a756-7dcb-4a04-9a9d-0cd946a5313c\', \'multiverseId\': 520979}, \'multiverseid\': 520979}, {\'name\': \'青阳化身\', \'text\': \'每当青阳化身或另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你获得等同于该生物防御力的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙／圣者\', \'flavor\': \'「依夏理肥沃的阳光滋养万物。我们每一个人都是烈阳力量与关爱的见证。」\\n～迅雷龙骑奇拉蒂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08a44d0-714b-4f8e-8e51-91eb03dce160\', \'multiverseId\': 521227}, \'multiverseid\': 521227}, {\'name\': \'青陽化身\', \'text\': \'每當青陽化身或另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你獲得等同於該生物防禦力的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龍／聖者\', \'flavor\': \'「依夏理肥沃的陽光滋養萬物。我們每一個人都是烈陽力量與關愛的見證。」\\n～迅雷龍騎奇拉蒂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a5dfa0-c5be-48ea-97a8-3a9d8434f8c7\', \'multiverseId\': 521475}, \'multiverseid\': 521475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nähere dich meinem Turm auf Knien oder verlasse ihn als Asche im Wind."\\n—Gadwick der Alte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcbd803-0008-429f-9a2e-77deb0638310\', \'multiverseId\': 519567}, \'multiverseid\': 519567}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"O hincas la rodilla frente a mi torre o te alejarás de ella como cenizas en el viento".\\n—Gadwick, el Marchito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2775421a-7edb-4443-a9af-c6090c6df3a0\', \'multiverseId\': 519815}, \'multiverseid\': 519815}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Approchez de ma tour un genou à terre, ou quittez-la en cendres au gré du vent. »\\n—Gadwick, le Brisquard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520063&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23c612f-54a9-45ba-8784-208ba146af03\', \'multiverseId\': 520063}, \'multiverseid\': 520063}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Avvicinati in ginocchio alla mia torre o la abbandonerai come cenere al vento."\\n—Gadwick, il Rugoso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbcd0b3-e373-4b7c-a69d-ba04b3ead561\', \'multiverseId\': 520311}, \'multiverseid\': 520311}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「この塔に近付くものはひざまずくがよい。さもなければ灰になり、風に乗って去ることになる。」\\n――老いたる者、ガドウィック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703887c5-9654-4e91-884a-b6832a330e00\', \'multiverseId\': 520559}, \'multiverseid\': 520559}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Ou você dobra os joelhos perante minha torre ou vai embora como cinzas levadas pelo vento."\\n— Gadwick, o Enrugado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b593d816-85c1-49fc-bd20-36044cf178ba\', \'multiverseId\': 520807}, \'multiverseid\': 520807}, {\'name\': \'Командная Башня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Преклони колено, подойдя к моей башне, или же ветер развеет твой пепел».\\n— Гэдвик, Умудренный\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80587470-091a-4008-a74f-77b724953fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 521055}, \'multiverseid\': 521055}, {\'name\': \'指挥塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「近我高塔者，须诚心屈膝求见，否则便会化作轻烟飘去。」\\n～老年法师盖威克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b1e1221-358f-43c3-a664-2f6bfa1d109e\', \'multiverseId\': 521303}, \'multiverseid\': 521303}, {\'name\': \'指揮塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「近我高塔者，須誠心屈膝求見，否則便會化作輕煙飄去。」\\n～老年法師蓋威克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9995619e-2d0f-4aad-a361-375df02dcd68\', \'multiverseId\': 521551}, \'multiverseid\': 521551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begehrtes Juwel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Begehrte Juwel ins Spiel kommt, ziehe drei Karten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge drei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dich angreifen und nicht geblockt werden, zieht der Spieler drei Karten und übernimmt die Kontrolle über das Begehrte Juwel. Enttappe es.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4afbdd3-1d69-43dd-aad8-c1b608f743a1\', \'multiverseId\': 519523}, \'multiverseid\': 519523}, {\'name\': \'Joya codiciada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Joya codiciada entre al campo de batalla, roba tres cartas.\\n{T}: Agrega tres manás de un color cualquiera.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controla un oponente te ataquen y no sean bloqueadas, ese jugador roba tres cartas y gana el control de la Joya codiciada. Enderézala.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'622ddc59-2648-4ad4-9268-6078e09312a6\', \'multiverseId\': 519771}, \'multiverseid\': 519771}, {\'name\': \'Joyau convoité\', \'text\': "Quand le Joyau convoité arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes.\\n{T} : Ajoutez trois manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous attaque et n\'est pas bloquée, ce joueur pioche trois cartes et acquiert le contrôle du Joyau convoité. Dégagez-le.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520019&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397f1169-2ffa-41c6-ab4d-b1794771a137\', \'multiverseId\': 520019}, \'multiverseid\': 520019}, {\'name\': \'Gioiello Ambito\', \'text\': \'Quando il Gioiello Ambito entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca tre carte.\\n{T}: Aggiungi tre mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature controllate da un avversario ti attaccano e non vengono bloccate, quel giocatore pesca tre carte e prende il controllo del Gioiello Ambito. STAPpalo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e9fca2-00b3-45dc-8c2e-e4258356ed42\', \'multiverseId\': 520267}, \'multiverseid\': 520267}, {\'name\': \'切望の宝石\', \'text\': \'切望の宝石が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を引く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。\\n対戦相手１人がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体以上があなたを攻撃してブロックされないたび、そのプレイヤーはカード３枚を引き、切望の宝石のコントロールを得る。これをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1941472-03c7-405d-b76b-47e28c8e04ce\', \'multiverseId\': 520515}, \'multiverseid\': 520515}, {\'name\': \'Joia Cobiçada\', \'text\': \'Quando Joia Cobiçada entrar no campo de batalha, compre três cards.\\n{T}: Adicione três manas de uma cor à sua escolha.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que um oponente controla atacarem você e não forem bloqueadas, aquele jogador comprará três cards e ganhará o controle de Joia Cobiçada. Desvire-a.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b729f9-6e7b-4f5c-96e7-9e9471da051e\', \'multiverseId\': 520763}, \'multiverseid\': 520763}, {\'name\': \'Заветный Самоцвет\', \'text\': \'Когда Заветный Самоцвет выходит на поле битвы, возьмите три карты.\\n{T}: добавьте три маны любого одного цвета.\\nКаждый раз, когда одно или несколько существ под контролем оппонента атакуют вас и не заблокированы, тот игрок берет три карты и получает контроль над Заветным Самоцветом. Разверните его.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0446b955-ef3c-4dd3-ad64-4eb892fde71e\', \'multiverseId\': 521011}, \'multiverseid\': 521011}, {\'name\': \'簇捧珠宝\', \'text\': \'当簇捧珠宝进战场时，抓三张牌。\\n{T}：加三点任意颜色的单色法术力。\\n每当由对手操控的一个或数个生物攻击你且未受阻挡时，该牌手抓三张牌并获得簇捧珠宝的操控权。将之重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27005e5-a356-4383-80ed-5c0431b2f5aa\', \'multiverseId\': 521259}, \'multiverseid\': 521259}, {\'name\': \'簇捧珠寶\', \'text\': \'當簇捧珠寶進戰場時，抽三張牌。\\n{T}：加三點任意顏色的單色魔法力。\\n每當由對手操控的一個或數個生物攻擊你且未受阻擋時，該玩家抽三張牌並獲得簇捧珠寶的操控權。將之重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9304656-d5dd-4072-bcc9-3adec9547e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 521507}, \'multiverseid\': 521507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begierde des Verstands\', \'text\': \'Mische deine Bibliothek. Schicke dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du sie spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519406&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf122bf-baa6-4638-badf-122cc1dea312\', \'multiverseId\': 519406}, \'multiverseid\': 519406}, {\'name\': \'Anhelo de la mente\', \'text\': \'Baraja tu biblioteca. Luego exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56167fa-3518-4670-a248-c7bc93b8c9cb\', \'multiverseId\': 519654}, \'multiverseid\': 519654}, {\'name\': \'À mon seul désir\', \'text\': "Mélangez votre bibliothèque. Puis exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397fc1e0-753d-4716-84b5-7b95a8246615\', \'multiverseId\': 519902}, \'multiverseid\': 519902}, {\'name\': \'Desiderio della Mente\', \'text\': \'Rimescola il tuo grimorio. Poi esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nTempesta (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni magia lanciata prima in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e289b17-2fb6-4f59-9e5d-7822f8f76866\', \'multiverseId\': 520150}, \'multiverseid\': 520150}, {\'name\': \'精神の願望\', \'text\': \'ライブラリーを切り直す。その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、これを、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつき１回コピーする。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d853b1b-03fc-4892-b65e-8e58598825bd\', \'multiverseId\': 520398}, \'multiverseid\': 520398}, {\'name\': \'Desejo da Mente\', \'text\': \'Embaralhe seu grimório. Depois, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode jogar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nRajada (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica conjurada antes dela neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc41658f-cf57-407e-be7a-55db8d0bbf93\', \'multiverseId\': 520646}, \'multiverseid\': 520646}, {\'name\': \'Влечение Разума\', \'text\': \'Перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Затем изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.\\nШторм (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое заклинание, разыгранное в этом ходу до него.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb176b0f-7518-4891-bf7f-f196610282cc\', \'multiverseId\': 520894}, \'multiverseid\': 520894}, {\'name\': \'心之所欲\', \'text\': \'将你的牌库洗牌。然后放逐你的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用该牌且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2388598-fb6b-4c75-ab27-7a65234aab88\', \'multiverseId\': 521142}, \'multiverseid\': 521142}, {\'name\': \'心之所欲\', \'text\': \'將你的牌庫洗牌。然後放逐你的牌庫頂牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用該牌且不需支付其魔法力費用。\\n風暴（當施放此咒語時，本回合於它之前每施放過一個咒語，便將此咒語複製一次。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8d83537-b7cd-4fc0-befb-ef723e2cf294\', \'multiverseId\': 521390}, \'multiverseid\': 521390}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerung der Zitadelle\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Belagerung der Zitadelle ins Spiel kommt, wähle Khane oder Drachen.\\n• Khane — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug legst du zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n• Drachen — Zu Beginn des Kampfes im Zug jedes Gegners tappst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1f2144-982e-4815-b132-2ffa9b5fe6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 519368}, \'multiverseid\': 519368}, {\'name\': \'Asedio a la ciudadela\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Asedio a la ciudadela entre al campo de batalla, elige kans o dragones.\\n• Kans — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n• Dragones — Al comienzo del combate en el turno de cada oponente, gira la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246ec81e-4ea7-4d09-9f9b-f29362cfec1b\', \'multiverseId\': 519616}, \'multiverseid\': 519616}, {\'name\': \'Siège de la citadelle\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Siège de la citadelle arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez Khans ou Dragons.\\n• Khans — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n• Dragons — Au début du combat pendant le tour de chaque adversaire, engagez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616994db-e842-4c9f-bdf6-692d9e8cec06\', \'multiverseId\': 519864}, \'multiverseid\': 519864}, {\'name\': \'Assedio della Roccaforte\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Assedio della Roccaforte entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli Khan o Draghi.\\n• Khan — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n• Draghi — All\'inizio del combattimento nel turno di ogni avversario, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dcab1cc-aec1-47fd-9cd7-ec93b967fd9f\', \'multiverseId\': 520112}, \'multiverseid\': 520112}, {\'name\': \'城塞の包囲\', \'text\': \'城塞の包囲が戦場に出るに際し、カンか龍かを選ぶ。\\n• カン ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n• 龍 ― 各対戦相手のターンの戦闘の開始時に、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'802a798c-29a6-465f-ba99-bae4e79e60f3\', \'multiverseId\': 520360}, \'multiverseid\': 520360}, {\'name\': \'Cerco à Cidadela\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cerco à Cidadela entra no campo de batalha, escolha Khans ou Dragões.\\n• Khans — No início do combate no seu turno, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\n• Dragões — No início do combate no turno de cada oponente, vire a criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2237ab08-e74e-4ea2-a086-0b3b0cf86cb0\', \'multiverseId\': 520608}, \'multiverseid\': 520608}, {\'name\': \'Осада Цитадели\', \'text\': \'При выходе Осады Цитадели на поле битвы выберите Ханов или Драконов.\\n• Ханы — В начале боя во время вашего хода положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\n• Драконы — В начале боя во время хода каждого из оппонентов поверните целевое существо под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da29e537-9ebd-4f6a-bdc5-905bd6bf7416\', \'multiverseId\': 520856}, \'multiverseid\': 520856}, {\'name\': \'围攻殿堂\', \'text\': \'于围攻殿堂进战场时，选择可汗或龙王。\\n•可汗～在你回合的战斗开始时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n•龙王～在每位对手回合的战斗开始时，横置目标由该牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae7b826-e2f7-4e17-92d7-510773a73c06\', \'multiverseId\': 521104}, \'multiverseid\': 521104}, {\'name\': \'圍攻殿堂\', \'text\': \'於圍攻殿堂進戰場時，選擇可汗或龍王。\\n•可汗～在你回合的戰鬥開始時，在目標由你操控的生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n•龍王～在每位對手回合的戰鬥開始時，橫置目標由該玩家操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6abe675-fd9e-4510-9612-ad61c1cca095\', \'multiverseId\': 521352}, \'multiverseid\': 521352}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschwörung des Sonnenvogels\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand wirkst, decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist. Du kannst von den Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e289e94-1399-4b09-8ebb-b62a652d1c63\', \'multiverseId\': 519463}, \'multiverseid\': 519463}, {\'name\': \'Invocación del ave solar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo desde tu mano, muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo. Puedes lanzar un hechizo con valor de maná de X o menos de entre las cartas reveladas de esta manera sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7a6fa2-5d5e-4d2f-aedb-a18d6f14bd06\', \'multiverseId\': 519711}, \'multiverseid\': 519711}, {\'name\': "Invocation de l\'oiseau-soleil", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort depuis votre main, révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort. Vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X révélée de cette manière sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674d0ea4-507d-4fb0-8430-6fb39b1bca9c\', \'multiverseId\': 519959}, \'multiverseid\': 519959}, {\'name\': \'Evocazione della Fenice Solare\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia dalla tua mano, rivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia. Puoi lanciare una magia con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelta tra le carte rivelate in questo modo senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24c16c92-f743-42e6-a310-eaa0038086c1\', \'multiverseId\': 520207}, \'multiverseid\': 520207}, {\'name\': \'太陽鳥の祈祷\', \'text\': \'あなたがあなたの手札から呪文を唱えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードＸ枚を公開する。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。あなたは、それらの公開されたカードの中からマナ総量がＸ以下である呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debff8e1-6ffc-4bb9-8262-1f9b338d927a\', \'multiverseId\': 520455}, \'multiverseid\': 520455}, {\'name\': \'Invocação do Pássaro Solar\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de sua mão, revele os X cards do topo de seu grimório, sendo X o valor de mana daquela mágica. Você pode conjurar uma mágica com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X dentre os cards revelados dessa forma sem pagar seus custos de mana. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c631e1b-837a-487c-9f12-f8d84c1e5589\', \'multiverseId\': 520703}, \'multiverseid\': 520703}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Солнечной Птицы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание из вашей руки, покажите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, где Х — мановая ценность того заклинания. Вы можете разыграть одно находящееся среди показанных таким образом карт заклинание с мановой ценностью не более X без уплаты его мана-стоимости. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce55d6b9-16cd-4411-888a-5115776573ca\', \'multiverseId\': 520951}, \'multiverseid\': 520951}, {\'name\': \'阳禽祝愿\', \'text\': \'每当你从你手上施放咒语时，展示你牌库顶的X张牌，X为该咒语的法术力值。你可以从以此法展示的牌之中施放一个咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34900f61-106b-40b8-9cf4-538f026f5c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 521199}, \'multiverseid\': 521199}, {\'name\': \'陽禽祝願\', \'text\': \'每當你從你手上施放咒語時，展示你牌庫頂的X張牌，X為該咒語的魔法力值。你可以從以此法展示的牌之中施放一個咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5acee60b-f411-407c-ad43-b762db6c75ad\', \'multiverseId\': 521447}, \'multiverseid\': 521447}]', "[{'name': 'Beschützender Augmentierer', 'text': 'Aufblitzen\\nKommandeur-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\\nKommandeure, die du kontrollierst, haben Fluchsicherheit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Troll, Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Nach jahrelanger Forschung hat er schließlich die Formel für den perfekten Faustschlag gefunden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518529&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39bfb24b-1fd4-4f51-a40f-897c119ef219', 'multiverseId': 518529}, 'multiverseid': 518529}, {'name': 'Guardián aumentador', 'text': 'Destello.\\nLas criaturas comandante que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\\nLos comandantes que controlas tienen la habilidad de antimaleficio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero trol', 'flavor': 'Tras años de investigación, por fin descubrió la fórmula del puñetazo perfecto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518600&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1737af6-e917-4c3b-8163-258a90bbee9b', 'multiverseId': 518600}, 'multiverseid': 518600}, {'name': 'Amplificateur gardien', 'text': 'Flash\\nLes créatures Commandant que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\\nLes commandants que vous contrôlez ont la défense talismanique.', 'type': 'Créature : troll et sorcier', 'flavor': 'Après des années de recherche, il trouva enfin la formule du coup de poing parfait.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518671&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87216379-d65f-4fa5-9c0a-ea472dfa562f', 'multiverseId': 518671}, 'multiverseid': 518671}, {'name': 'Potenziatore Guardiano', 'text': 'Lampo\\nLe creature comandante che controlli prendono +2/+2.\\nI comandanti che controlli hanno anti-malocchio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago Troll', 'flavor': 'Dopo anni di ricerca, ha finalmente scoperto la formula per il pugno perfetto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518742&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56d24a53-b72c-4571-bfaa-fa1251b2fa29', 'multiverseId': 518742}, 'multiverseid': 518742}, {'name': '守護の増強者', 'text': '瞬速\\nあなたがコントロールしていて統率者であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての統率者は呪禁を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トロール・ウィザード', 'flavor': '長年におよぶ研究の末、彼は究極の数式を見つけ出した。完璧なパンチの数式を。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518813&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b89a8a6c-9c4a-4e83-8431-5d2eae668c1a', 'multiverseId': 518813}, 'multiverseid': 518813}, {'name': 'Amplificador Guardião', 'text': 'Lampejo\\nAs criaturas comandantes que você controla recebem +2/+2.\\nOs comandantes que você controla têm resistência a magia.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trol Mago', 'flavor': 'Depois de anos de pesquisa, ele finalmente descobriu a fórmula do soco perfeito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518884&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08dc73db-28da-41b8-babb-f121aaa2d839', 'multiverseId': 518884}, 'multiverseid': 518884}, {'name': 'Усилитель Стражников', 'text': 'Миг\\nСущества-командиры под вашим контролем получают +2/+2.\\nКомандиры под вашим контролем имеют Порчеустойчивость.', 'type': 'Существо — Тролль Чародей', 'flavor': 'После долгих лет исследований он наконец вывел формулу идеального удара.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518955&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa34aa13-80aa-430f-a5c8-8b928aaabcab', 'multiverseId': 518955}, 'multiverseid': 518955}, {'name': '守护增现师', 'text': '闪现\\n由你操控的指挥官生物得+2/+2。\\n由你操控的指挥官具有辟邪异能。', 'type': '生物 ～巨魔／法术师', 'flavor': '经过多年研究，他终于解开了挥出完美一拳的方程式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519026&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cf114c3-75d4-45a5-991e-9ff01b93ec12', 'multiverseId': 519026}, 'multiverseid': 519026}, {'name': '守護增現師', 'text': '閃現\\n由你操控的指揮官生物得+2/+2。\\n由你操控的指揮官具有辟邪異能。', 'type': '生物 ～巨魔／魔法師', 'flavor': '經過多年研究，他終於解開了揮出完美一拳的方程式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519097&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1df88956-8e42-4266-b5e4-be0c91eaabab', 'multiverseId': 519097}, 'multiverseid': 519097}]", "[{'name': 'Beschützender Augmentierer', 'text': 'Aufblitzen\\nKommandeur-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\\nKommandeure, die du kontrollierst, haben Fluchsicherheit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Troll, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521738&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '593e79a5-1c08-4949-834b-b1c52dfadeda', 'multiverseId': 521738}, 'multiverseid': 521738}, {'name': 'Guardián aumentador', 'text': 'Destello.\\nLas criaturas comandante que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\\nLos comandantes que controlas tienen la habilidad de antimaleficio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero trol', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521818&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddcca988-f3c4-4298-b091-683b38b5bf83', 'multiverseId': 521818}, 'multiverseid': 521818}, {'name': 'Amplificateur gardien', 'text': 'Flash\\nLes créatures Commandant que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\\nLes commandants que vous contrôlez ont la défense talismanique.', 'type': 'Créature : troll et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521898&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfdb844d-e101-466f-8ade-01d7c746ecb0', 'multiverseId': 521898}, 'multiverseid': 521898}, {'name': 'Potenziatore Guardiano', 'text': 'Lampo\\nLe creature comandante che controlli prendono +2/+2.\\nI comandanti che controlli hanno anti-malocchio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago Troll', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521978&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b75f1968-5606-4580-8fb0-418735b8a23d', 'multiverseId': 521978}, 'multiverseid': 521978}, {'name': '守護の増強者', 'text': '瞬速\\nあなたがコントロールしていて統率者であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての統率者は呪禁を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トロール・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522058&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdbdcf03-621e-4ff2-b74c-aaf9139ad94d', 'multiverseId': 522058}, 'multiverseid': 522058}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem."\\n—Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519442&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6150d62-e5d7-492f-8be5-36bad718040d\', \'multiverseId\': 519442}, \'multiverseid\': 519442}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lugares sagrados ya no son un santuario contra la muerte, y la muerte ya no es un santuario contra nada".\\n—Thalia, caballero cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc701e15-238c-449f-8eb2-4eba705510ff\', \'multiverseId\': 519690}, \'multiverseid\': 519690}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. »\\n—Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519938&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a189a796-a670-41b8-b213-c58e60b9c75a\', \'multiverseId\': 519938}, \'multiverseid\': 519938}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I luoghi sacri non offrono più rifugio dalla morte e la morte non offre più rifugio da nulla."\\n—Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e49f82e-ee4a-49b0-8cec-1afe19af1a14\', \'multiverseId\': 520186}, \'multiverseid\': 520186}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでに安住の地ではありません。」\\n――聖戦騎士、サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cfb7329-d73c-48ab-b0ce-d93701c1a57b\', \'multiverseId\': 520434}, \'multiverseid\': 520434}, {\'name\': \'Ato Blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura no campo de batalha.\\nAto Blasfemo causa 13 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lugares sagrados não são mais refúgios contra a morte, e a morte não é mais refúgio contra nada."\\n— Thalia, Cátara Cavaleira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e41e3cc-e2ba-4f38-8620-51d94b2dda96\', \'multiverseId\': 520682}, \'multiverseid\': 520682}, {\'name\': \'Кощунственный Акт\', \'text\': \'Стоимость разыгрывания этого заклинания уменьшается на {1} за каждое существо на поле битвы.\\nКощунственный Акт наносит 13 повреждений каждому существу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Святые места больше не укрывают от смерти, а смерть больше не становится убежищем ни от чего».\\n— Талия, рыцарь-катар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c12505de-8c6e-42c0-a7f7-3201881759c9\', \'multiverseId\': 520930}, \'multiverseid\': 520930}, {\'name\': \'渎神行径\', \'text\': \'战场上每有一个生物，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n渎神行径对每个生物各造成13点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「圣地不再免于死亡沾惹，死亡也不再免于任何沾惹。」\\n～护教军骑士莎利雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad273b72-53e9-4efa-bfae-30340f1cb35d\', \'multiverseId\': 521178}, \'multiverseid\': 521178}, {\'name\': \'瀆神行徑\', \'text\': \'戰場上每有一個生物，此咒語便減少{1}來施放。\\n瀆神行徑對每個生物各造成13點傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「聖地不再免於死亡沾惹，死亡也不再免於任何沾惹。」\\n～護教軍騎士莎利雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e1867f-279c-4240-bccf-ec0527203efa\', \'multiverseId\': 521426}, \'multiverseid\': 521426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Klinge\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\n{1}: Lege die Blutdürstige Klinge an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Diese Waffe führt die Hand, die sie umklammert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a35417e4-e19d-4af0-9762-27278a43b95c\', \'multiverseId\': 519518}, \'multiverseid\': 519518}, {\'name\': \'Filo sediento de sangre\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\n{1}: Anexa el Filo sediento de sangre a la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Activa esta habilidad solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'El arma blande la mano que la sujeta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27b6cf0d-3028-42fb-bd35-7541d6610d1e\', \'multiverseId\': 519766}, \'multiverseid\': 519766}, {\'name\': \'Lame assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\n{1} : Attachez la Lame assoiffée de sang à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "C\'est l\'arme qui manie la main.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520014&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c40f3f66-ff5c-42f6-ac74-7cae7a92a80b\', \'multiverseId\': 520014}, \'multiverseid\': 520014}, {\'name\': \'Lama Assetata di Sangue\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\n{1}: Assegna la Lama Assetata di Sangue a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Attiva solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "È l\'arma a brandire la mano che la impugna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a2093f-918b-41cb-aa27-7b8532a381a4\', \'multiverseId\': 520262}, \'multiverseid\': 520262}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n{1}：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。血に飢えた刃をそれにつける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'その武器は持つ者の手を利用する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab9af43c-302f-4cd1-9a6f-f202a68a1381\', \'multiverseId\': 520510}, \'multiverseid\': 520510}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina Sedenta de Sangue\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\n{1}: Anexe Lâmina Sedenta de Sangue à criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'A arma empunha a mão que a segura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7ddf3c-b634-4a89-928a-b2530ba0e73d\', \'multiverseId\': 520758}, \'multiverseid\': 520758}, {\'name\': \'Кровожадный Клинок\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\n{1}: прикрепите Кровожадный Клинок к целевому существу под контролем оппонента. Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Это оружие направляет руку того, кто его держит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c637641-62e8-4d5a-a8a3-56d79f2f0721\', \'multiverseId\': 521006}, \'multiverseid\': 521006}, {\'name\': \'渴血之刃\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0且已煽惑。（它每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n{1}：将渴血之刃装备在目标由对手操控的生物上。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'是武器在挥手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20acb425-ab95-4fb9-a16d-ac8e7798c546\', \'multiverseId\': 521254}, \'multiverseid\': 521254}, {\'name\': \'渴血之刃\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0且已煽惑。（它每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n{1}：將渴血之刃裝備在目標由對手操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'是武器在揮手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c09a47b8-2400-4e1b-8ddf-735d0bc655a6\', \'multiverseId\': 521502}, \'multiverseid\': 521502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Luftakrobatin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Blutdürstige Luftakrobatin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Ganz die Zirkusakrobatin, die sie einst war, begeistert sie ihre Opfer bis zum letzten Atemzug mit ihrer Vorstellung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cac2d52-464f-4f8b-bc24-1b6b843863a5\', \'multiverseId\': 519419}, \'multiverseid\': 519419}, {\'name\': \'Acróbata sedienta de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Acróbata sedienta de sangre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Acróbata circense en vida, mata con tal elegancia que incluso sus víctimas se quedan asombradas con su actuación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19c62964-e631-4cba-b534-f57c117966aa\', \'multiverseId\': 519667}, \'multiverseid\': 519667}, {\'name\': \'Voltigeuse assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Voltigeuse assoiffée de sang.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Acrobate dans un cirque de son vivant, elle tue avec une telle grâce que même ses victimes sont sidérées par sa performance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feabfd1d-2c1a-4b0f-bbc3-26e50ee163b0\', \'multiverseId\': 519915}, \'multiverseid\': 519915}, {\'name\': \'Acrobata Assetata di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Acrobata Assetata di Sangue.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': "Acrobata del circo quand\'era in vita, uccide con grazia e fluidità tali da meravigliare perfino le sue vittime con le sue esibizioni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79a2147e-4ca0-479f-9478-1aad569baace\', \'multiverseId\': 520163}, \'multiverseid\': 520163}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた曲芸師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、血に飢えた曲芸師の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'元々はサーカスの演者だった。流れるような動きで命を奪う様に、犠牲者さえも畏敬の念を抱く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9caec6e2-e3c8-4e72-abe9-749a99ddd924\', \'multiverseId\': 520411}, \'multiverseid\': 520411}, {\'name\': \'Trapezista Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Trapezista Sanguinária.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Acrobata circense em vida, ela mata com tal graça e fluidez que até suas vítimas se impressionam com a performance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc7c43c-86c2-45be-8a3c-1ed757324c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 520659}, \'multiverseid\': 520659}, {\'name\': \'Кровожадная Акробатка\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Кровожадную Акробатку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'В жизни она была цирковой акробаткой и теперь убивает с такой изящной грациозностью, что даже ее жертвы остаются в восторге от представления.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d08943f-e936-45f4-8f53-ee8ee61baa8d\', \'multiverseId\': 520907}, \'multiverseid\': 520907}, {\'name\': \'嗜血舞空客\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你获得生命时，在嗜血舞空客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'她生时是马戏团的杂技演员，因而练就了一身流畅华美的杀人技艺，就连遭她毒手的人也对其表演赞叹不已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eef75c1-ff88-4cf3-9fab-52aa15b90cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 521155}, \'multiverseid\': 521155}, {\'name\': \'嗜血舞空客\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當你獲得生命時，在嗜血舞空客上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'她生時是馬戲團的雜技演員，因而練就了一身流暢華美的殺人技藝，就連遭她毒手的人也對其表演讚歎不已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868c3aac-f452-45eb-b228-98859f8fdd77\', \'multiverseId\': 521403}, \'multiverseid\': 521403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutroter Bund\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Blut ist ein Kreislauf. Jeden Tropfen, den ich trinke, muss ein anderer bluten."\\n—Vradeen, Vampir der Nacht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519436&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336b2554-b257-402d-90e0-c560af30def0\', \'multiverseId\': 519436}, \'multiverseid\': 519436}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo sangriento\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, el oponente objetivo pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La sangre es constante. Cada gota que bebo, alguien debe perderla".\\n—Vradeen, nócturnus vampiro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff629b0-c057-4d94-bffb-835c657e1a35\', \'multiverseId\': 519684}, \'multiverseid\': 519684}, {\'name\': \'Lien sanguin\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, un adversaire ciblé perd autant de points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le sang est une constante. Pour chaque goutte que je bois, quelqu\'un saigne. »\\n—Vradeen, nocturnus vampire", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e249a3-b635-43eb-8800-2947d69d8b42\', \'multiverseId\': 519932}, \'multiverseid\': 519932}, {\'name\': \'Legame Sanguigno\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, un avversario bersaglio perde altrettanti punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il sangue è costante. Per ogni goccia che bevo, qualcuno deve sanguinare."\\n—Vradeen, vampiro notturno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4505897e-890c-4a50-b3c2-287a1285c2b7\', \'multiverseId\': 520180}, \'multiverseid\': 520180}, {\'name\': \'血なまぐさい結合\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「血は一定だ。我が一滴飲むためには、誰かが流さねばならぬ。」\\n――吸血鬼の夜侯、ヴラディーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794a9e06-5ce7-407f-8584-9d15d3bc363c\', \'multiverseId\': 520428}, \'multiverseid\': 520428}, {\'name\': \'Pacto de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O sangue é constante. Para cada gota que eu bebo, alguém precisa sangrar."\\n— Vradeen, vampiro noctívago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93250dd-e1e4-428f-aa85-b2ac24faa8fe\', \'multiverseId\': 520676}, \'multiverseid\': 520676}, {\'name\': \'Кровавые Узы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), целевой оппонент теряет столько же жизней.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Количество крови в мире неизменно. Если я пью кровь — значит, кто-то ее теряет».\\n— Врадин, вампир-ноктурнус\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ad3899-1013-46ad-ae8b-1ab7795eba7f\', \'multiverseId\': 520924}, \'multiverseid\': 520924}, {\'name\': \'血色羁绊\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，目标对手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「血量是个定数。我喝的每滴血都流自别人身上。」\\n～暗夜吸血鬼法迪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598c6eb5-4a99-4ce9-8ce5-fbbe39dae20b\', \'multiverseId\': 521172}, \'multiverseid\': 521172}, {\'name\': \'血色羈絆\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，目標對手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「血量是個定數。我喝的每滴血都流自別人身上。」\\n～暗夜吸血鬼法迪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'675c127a-9fbb-4941-9045-5ff5357cbf05\', \'multiverseId\': 521420}, \'multiverseid\': 521420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutschwelger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Fleischig mit einem Hauch von Leder. Ein guter Jahrgang."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519426&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'407367b8-e2a3-474f-988b-01619af4f755\', \'multiverseId\': 519426}, \'multiverseid\': 519426}, {\'name\': \'Sibarita de la sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sabor con cuerpo y suaves notas de piel. Cosecha añeja, sin duda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edfb39b3-1922-4094-86f3-a67431ddeae3\', \'multiverseId\': 519674}, \'multiverseid\': 519674}, {\'name\': \'Épicurien du sang\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': \'« Il a du corps, avec un léger bouquet de cuir. Un grand cru. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519922&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4610f2b-9f8f-4421-8c4e-9ee6a73e1b60\', \'multiverseId\': 519922}, \'multiverseid\': 519922}, {\'name\': \'Epicureo del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carnoso, con una leggera nota di cuoio. Ottima annata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8005fa8-ab1a-4eb2-a178-75cf506d1556\', \'multiverseId\': 520170}, \'multiverseid\': 520170}, {\'name\': \'血の美食家\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、すべての対戦相手は１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「重厚で、かすかな皮の香り。上物だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f26d405-644e-4bfe-ac33-87ac6adda6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 520418}, \'multiverseid\': 520418}, {\'name\': \'Epicurista de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carnoso, com um leve toque de couro. Um bom vintage."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1414477a-4c21-4238-9781-a380916aae25\', \'multiverseId\': 520666}, \'multiverseid\': 520666}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Гурман\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Мясистая, с тонкими нотками кожи. Чудесный сорт».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6511dbd-6272-4fc4-ba32-fcc0ebe66f84\', \'multiverseId\': 520914}, \'multiverseid\': 520914}, {\'name\': \'鲜血饕客\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「肉香浓郁，稍带一丝皮味。实属佳酿。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e1cb69-5e7c-4ac9-b9be-335a6cc5c84d\', \'multiverseId\': 521162}, \'multiverseid\': 521162}, {\'name\': \'鮮血饕客\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，每位對手各失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「肉香濃郁，稍帶一絲皮味。實屬佳釀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d9ae88-3b00-4d69-815c-73f1f2973fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 521410}, \'multiverseid\': 521410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutspurensucher\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutspurensucher.\\nWenn der Blutspurensucher das Spiel verlässt, ziehe für jede +1/+1-Marke auf ihm eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Lauf schnell davon. Je mehr du dich verausgabst, desto stärker spüre ich deinen Herzschlag."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f3fc2b-daa3-4bcc-aaf8-05c0ed208857\', \'multiverseId\': 519420}, \'multiverseid\': 519420}, {\'name\': \'Rastreasangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{B}, pagar 2 vidas: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Rastreasangre.\\nCuando el Rastreasangre deje el campo de batalla, roba una carta por cada contador +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Huye todo lo que quieras. Cuanto más corres, mejor se oye el latido de tu corazón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff12e8a-d917-44e8-8e68-65f742e0fbf5\', \'multiverseId\': 519668}, \'multiverseid\': 519668}, {\'name\': \'Traqueur de sang\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{B}, payez 2 points de vie : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Traqueur de sang.\\nQuand le Traqueur de sang quitte le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Fuyez si vous voulez. Plus vous courez, plus je sens battre votre cœur. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9493d1-d5b4-47a1-858d-b095f9552bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 519916}, \'multiverseid\': 519916}, {\'name\': \'Braccasangue\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{B}, Paga 2 punti vita: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Braccasangue.\\nQuando il Braccasangue lascia il campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni segnalino +1/+1 su di esso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Scappa pure... Più lontano corri, più chiaramente avverto il battito del tuo cuore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37ebc87a-7aa8-406c-9ce2-bf97ca0868f1\', \'multiverseId\': 520164}, \'multiverseid\': 520164}, {\'name\': \'心臓追い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{B}, ２点のライフを支払う：心臓追いの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n心臓追いが戦場を離れたとき、これの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「どこへなりと逃げるがいい。遠くまで走るほど、お前の鼓動をはっきり感じるからな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5612e33-15b3-42f3-a73d-ab306ae28f79\', \'multiverseId\': 520412}, \'multiverseid\': 520412}, {\'name\': \'Hemorrastreador\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{B}, pague 2 pontos de vida: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hemorrastreador.\\nQuando Hemorrastreador deixar o campo de batalha, compre um card para cada marcador +1/+1 nele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuja o quanto quiser. Quanto mais você corre, mais forte eu sinto sua pulsação."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a92f71-302b-43cb-b905-18f7292d9894\', \'multiverseId\': 520660}, \'multiverseid\': 520660}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Следопыт\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{B}, заплатите 2 жизни: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Кровавого Следопыта.\\nКогда Кровавый Следопыт покидает поле битвы, возьмите одну карту за каждый жетон +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Беги, сколько хочешь. Чем дальше ты бежишь, тем громче я слышу стук твоего сердца».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444d0684-adcd-4074-9416-cc833633b3a5\', \'multiverseId\': 520908}, \'multiverseid\': 520908}, {\'name\': \'溯血师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{B}，支付2点生命：在溯血师上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当溯血师离开战场时，其上每有一个+1/+1指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「要逃跑就请便。你跑得越远，我就越能确切地感受到你的心跳。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8149347b-c67a-4b17-8ae4-8f4208164f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 521156}, \'multiverseid\': 521156}, {\'name\': \'溯血師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{B}，支付2點生命：在溯血師上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n當溯血師離開戰場時，其上每有一個+1/+1指示物，便抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「要逃跑就請便。你跑得越遠，我就越能確切地感受到你的心跳。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b8f9f1-8d22-4500-82b6-a1daa74d8f25\', \'multiverseId\': 521404}, \'multiverseid\': 521404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blühende Sumpfbestie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Blühende Sumpfbestie angreift, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden und erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Dezent wie eine Sumpfbestie\\n—Blütenwelk-Redensart; steht für\\n„plump und ungeschickt"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c32f3e-6d2f-462a-b19e-dfa4c1438d84\', \'multiverseId\': 518526}, \'multiverseid\': 518526}, {\'name\': \'Bestia cenagosa floreciente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Bestia cenagosa floreciente ataque, ganas 2 vidas. Luego las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar y obtienen +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Tan sutil como una bestia cenagosa.\\n—Expresión de Flosmarcitus que significa\\n"vulgar y torpe"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3820aa-f25c-4e90-9fba-d69a598b9219\', \'multiverseId\': 518597}, \'multiverseid\': 518597}, {\'name\': \'Bête palustre florissante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Bête palustre florissante attaque, vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Ensuite, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement et gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'Comme une bête palustre dans une échoppe de porcelaine\\n—Dicton de Flestrefleur signifiant\\n« rustre et maladroit »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6966ef77-5a42-4214-85ce-6c8f0a980843\', \'multiverseId\': 518668}, \'multiverseid\': 518668}, {\'name\': \'Fangoterio Fiorito\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Fangoterio Fiorito attacca, guadagni 2 punti vita. Poi le creature che controlli hanno travolgere e prendono +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Discreto come un fangoterio!\\n—Espressione di Germoglioscuro che significa\\n"rozzo e goffo"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51820c5c-634d-44a7-b156-0154b744d00e\', \'multiverseId\': 518739}, \'multiverseid\': 518739}, {\'name\': \'花咲く泥獣\', \'text\': \'花咲く泥獣が攻撃するたび、あなたは２点のライフを得る。その後、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを得て＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'泥獣のように繊細\\n――ウィザーブルームの言い回しで\\n「粗雑で不細工」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcbf6701-f456-4d66-9f90-ce52ed9bcf0d\', \'multiverseId\': 518810}, \'multiverseid\': 518810}, {\'name\': \'Fera-do-pântano Florescente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Fera-do-pântano Florescente ataca, você ganha 2 pontos de vida. Em seguida, as criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar e recebem +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Sutil como uma fera-do-pântano.\\n— expressão Murchaflor para\\n"bruto e desastrado"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54eb33d4-853b-4b36-b35e-c7fb4cf88021\', \'multiverseId\': 518881}, \'multiverseid\': 518881}, {\'name\': \'Цветущий Болотозверь\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Цветущий Болотозверь атакует, вы получаете 2 жизни. Затем существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар и +X/+X до конца хода, где X — количество жизней, полученных вами в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Изящный, как болотозверь\\n— визерблумское выражение, означающее\\n«грубый и неуклюжий»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e3e38a-08ea-4e09-88c7-fb274dee149e\', \'multiverseId\': 518952}, \'multiverseid\': 518952}, {\'name\': \'繁花腐沼兽\', \'text\': \'每当繁花腐沼兽攻击时，你获得2点生命。然后直到回合结束，由你操控的生物获得践踏异能且得+X/+X，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'如腐沼兽般精致\\n～靡华用语，意指\\n「粗糙而笨拙」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49cf4854-4531-4a16-a708-d7ca111c217c\', \'multiverseId\': 519023}, \'multiverseid\': 519023}, {\'name\': \'繁花腐沼獸\', \'text\': \'每當繁花腐沼獸攻擊時，你獲得2點生命。然後直到回合結束，由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能且得+X/+X，X為你本回合中獲得過的生命數量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'如腐沼獸般精緻\\n～靡華用語，意指\\n「粗糙而笨拙」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f4ee6c1-f8aa-4158-bc5d-8f1902c5b8cd\', \'multiverseId\': 519094}, \'multiverseid\': 519094}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blühende Sumpfbestie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Blühende Sumpfbestie angreift, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden und erhalten +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521735&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d895911-a5cb-4b66-8a40-c0b481aadcf3\', \'multiverseId\': 521735}, \'multiverseid\': 521735}, {\'name\': \'Bestia cenagosa floreciente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Bestia cenagosa floreciente ataque, ganas 2 vidas. Luego las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar y obtienen +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4da93f-0d89-4422-b11c-15aed8e32533\', \'multiverseId\': 521815}, \'multiverseid\': 521815}, {\'name\': \'Bête palustre florissante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Bête palustre florissante attaque, vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Ensuite, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement et gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521895&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbcc113-0dba-4f21-8bf4-ab86d4b5c3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 521895}, \'multiverseid\': 521895}, {\'name\': \'Fangoterio Fiorito\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Fangoterio Fiorito attacca, guadagni 2 punti vita. Poi le creature che controlli hanno travolgere e prendono +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82327cef-7724-4097-a17d-e63806b58c97\', \'multiverseId\': 521975}, \'multiverseid\': 521975}, {\'name\': \'花咲く泥獣\', \'text\': \'花咲く泥獣が攻撃するたび、あなたは２点のライフを得る。その後、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを得て＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d08336-8847-48b9-8413-df896e9737cd\', \'multiverseId\': 522055}, \'multiverseid\': 522055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc098275-ee01-4d70-916f-2c5227a9e7ee\', \'multiverseId\': 519564}, \'multiverseid\': 519564}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa2e93e-7cda-4926-9988-8c2dd4a581cd\', \'multiverseId\': 519812}, \'multiverseid\': 519812}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': "Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa217f62-dc32-478a-a1f3-eb22bb108233\', \'multiverseId\': 520060}, \'multiverseid\': 520060}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f138df8-15f5-40f8-87ed-733f11a1c815\', \'multiverseId\': 520308}, \'multiverseid\': 520308}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地からすべてのカードを追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6fb6958-613d-4c8c-98b3-91c5ea72ba9f\', \'multiverseId\': 520556}, \'multiverseid\': 520556}, {\'name\': \'Pântano de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Pântano de Bojuka entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Pântano de Bojuka entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd974256-c03a-404b-b712-e2bec20f685b\', \'multiverseId\': 520804}, \'multiverseid\': 520804}, {\'name\': \'Боджукское Болото\', \'text\': \'Боджукское Болото выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Боджукское Болото выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a950005-ee9b-419b-a784-fe5fa964e52c\', \'multiverseId\': 521052}, \'multiverseid\': 521052}, {\'name\': \'泊卒卡腐沼\', \'text\': \'泊卒卡腐沼须横置进战场。\\n当泊卒卡腐沼进战场时，放逐目标牌手坟墓场中的所有牌。\\n{T}：加{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c193eaba-926e-4b06-bffc-3e8351413280\', \'multiverseId\': 521300}, \'multiverseid\': 521300}, {\'name\': \'泊卒卡腐沼\', \'text\': \'泊卒卡腐沼須橫置進戰場。\\n當泊卒卡腐沼進戰場時，放逐目標玩家墳墓場中的所有牌。\\n{T}：加{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25dc4523-f5a4-43f6-9397-bf7cad883c92\', \'multiverseId\': 521548}, \'multiverseid\': 521548}]', "[{'name': 'Boreas-Streitross', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn das Boreas-Streitross das Spiel verlässt, bestimme einen Gegner, der mehr Länder kontrolliert als du. Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach so vielen Ebene-Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt, und zeige sie offen vor. Bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm den Rest auf deine Hand und mische danach.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Pegasus', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519367&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc181f47-4fdb-4a35-8590-86f172cc1d0c', 'multiverseId': 519367}, 'multiverseid': 519367}, {'name': 'Pegaso boreal', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Pegaso boreal deje el campo de batalla, elige un oponente que controla más tierras que tú. Busca en tu biblioteca una cantidad de cartas de Llanura igual a la diferencia y muéstralas. Pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y el resto en tu mano. Luego baraja.', 'type': 'Criatura — Pegaso', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519615&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a05b01b9-cf5f-4fda-8a89-40e4b5425f94', 'multiverseId': 519615}, 'multiverseid': 519615}, {'name': 'Batailleur de borée', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Batailleur de borée quitte le champ de bataille, choisissez un adversaire qui contrôle plus de terrains que vous. Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque un nombre de cartes de plaine égal à la différence, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et le reste dans votre main, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Créature : pégase', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519863&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68b458c5-d9c9-47bc-b34f-ea929bfc5ad2', 'multiverseId': 519863}, 'multiverseid': 519863}, {'name': 'Destriero della Tramontana', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Destriero della Tramontana lascia il campo di battaglia, scegli un avversario che controlla più terre di te. Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un numero di carte Pianura pari alla differenza, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi le altre alla tua mano, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Creatura — Pegaso', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520111&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ff42652-5693-4f4f-a56b-ed205af02f93', 'multiverseId': 520111}, 'multiverseid': 520111}, {'name': 'ボレアスの軍馬', 'text': '飛行\\nボレアスの軍馬が戦場を離れたとき、あなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている対戦相手１人を選ぶ。あなたのライブラリーから、その差に等しい枚数の平地・カードを探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、残りをあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ペガサス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520359&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a672764-6063-49d4-975d-997123d1ccb9', 'multiverseId': 520359}, 'multiverseid': 520359}, {'name': 'Corcel de Bóreas', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Corcel de Bóreas deixar o campo de batalha, escolha um oponente que controla mais terrenos que você. Procure em seu grimório um número de cards de Planície igual à diferença e revele-os. Coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o restante em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.', 'type': 'Criatura — Pégaso', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520607&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de678a49-990e-4a58-bd07-104154752760', 'multiverseId': 520607}, 'multiverseid': 520607}, {'name': 'Скакун Борея', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Скакун Борея покидает поле битвы, выберите оппонента, контролирующего больше земель, чем вы. Найдите в вашей библиотеке количество карт Равнин, равное разнице, и покажите их. Положите одну из них на поле битвы повернутой, а остальные — в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте библиотеку.', 'type': 'Существо — Пегас', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520855&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11819b21-b959-4210-8d0f-5b25a5937c44', 'multiverseId': 520855}, 'multiverseid': 520855}, {'name': '朔风战马', 'text': '飞行\\n当朔风战马离开战场时，选择一位操控之地比你多的对手。从你的牌库中搜寻等同于该差距数量的平原牌并展示这些牌。将其中一张横置放进战场，其余的牌则置于你手上。然后洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～飞马', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521103&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d348918-0b29-46ef-9e49-2f4e40135440', 'multiverseId': 521103}, 'multiverseid': 521103}, {'name': '朔風戰馬', 'text': '飛行\\n當朔風戰馬離開戰場時，選擇一位操控之地比你多的對手。從你的牌庫中搜尋等同於該差距數量的平原牌並展示這些牌。將其中一張橫置放進戰場，其餘的牌則置於你手上。然後洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～飛馬', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521351&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a483d6d-48da-4f5b-8ddf-83161bbe79b8', 'multiverseId': 521351}, 'multiverseid': 521351}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Boros-Amulett fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b805ed-084c-4092-9b25-8138e3c99bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 519493}, \'multiverseid\': 519493}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto boros\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto boros hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Los permanentes que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f44b422-9ca8-47ab-929e-6cfb87a7f52d\', \'multiverseId\': 519741}, \'multiverseid\': 519741}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Boros\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme de Boros inflige 4 blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\\n• Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519989&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698a537c-51e2-4ab3-affd-ffe8ff42f8e8\', \'multiverseId\': 519989}, \'multiverseid\': 519989}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Boros\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Talismano Boros infligge 4 danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n• I permanenti che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbaf2ed1-c694-44df-babd-f4765547cca7\', \'multiverseId\': 520237}, \'multiverseid\': 520237}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。ボロスの魔除けはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは破壊不能を得る。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143218f8-df10-4401-a247-79257488c96e\', \'multiverseId\': 520485}, \'multiverseid\': 520485}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Boros\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Amuleto Boros causa 4 pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\\n• As permanentes que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n• A criatura alvo ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73b84d4b-b188-4398-8112-ddf94d610b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 520733}, \'multiverseid\': 520733}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Боросов\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Талисман Боросов наносит 4 повреждения целевому игроку или planeswalker\'у.\\n• Перманенты под вашим контролем получают Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\n• Целевое существо получает Двойной удар до конца хода.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6252b72b-852f-4e32-8563-67708074435f\', \'multiverseId\': 520981}, \'multiverseid\': 520981}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•波洛斯护符对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成4点伤害。\\n•由你操控的永久物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n•目标生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdfd06bd-4139-4b81-bfa9-bafc481b844f\', \'multiverseId\': 521229}, \'multiverseid\': 521229}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•波洛斯護符對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成4點傷害。\\n•由你操控的永久物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n•目標生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'925eea4b-1660-49b5-80ee-094b490f7ef8\', \'multiverseId\': 521477}, \'multiverseid\': 521477}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Garnison', 'text': 'Die Boros-Garnison kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boros-Garnison ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519565&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '177745e1-e8b3-420a-87df-e556d0b26dac', 'multiverseId': 519565}, 'multiverseid': 519565}, {'name': 'Fuerte boros', 'text': 'El Fuerte boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Fuerte boros entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519813&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2a2de96-5157-4684-a00d-86420726a0ea', 'multiverseId': 519813}, 'multiverseid': 519813}, {'name': 'Garnison de Boros', 'text': 'La Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520061&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b5b0143-79f1-459e-8852-623314c0cf22', 'multiverseId': 520061}, 'multiverseid': 520061}, {'name': 'Presidio Boros', 'text': 'Il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520309&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b2b612c-c1a8-4d66-9af5-4354a682acce', 'multiverseId': 520309}, 'multiverseid': 520309}, {'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520557&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8fcc641-3540-4224-8ada-6544cd894079', 'multiverseId': 520557}, 'multiverseid': 520557}, {'name': 'Guarnição Boros', 'text': 'Guarnição Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Guarnição Boros entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520805&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb334b69-451e-499c-a80b-fd387f3cd2cb', 'multiverseId': 520805}, 'multiverseid': 520805}, {'name': 'Гарнизон Боросов', 'text': 'Гарнизон Боросов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Гарнизон Боросов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521053&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3238c98-2999-4d52-a656-20a6f5ef72b0', 'multiverseId': 521053}, 'multiverseid': 521053}, {'name': '波洛斯驻防地', 'text': '波洛斯驻防地须横置进战场。\\n当波洛斯驻防地进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{W}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521301&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c10e75ce-3119-4089-974c-cd70fba78504', 'multiverseId': 521301}, 'multiverseid': 521301}, {'name': '波洛斯駐防地', 'text': '波洛斯駐防地須橫置進戰場。\\n當波洛斯駐防地進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{W}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521549&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25759c34-ec78-4cb3-adea-75bbb262f7c3', 'multiverseId': 521549}, 'multiverseid': 521549}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Medaillon\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, opfere das Boros-Medaillon: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir geben diese Abzeichen an unsere Mitsoldaten weiter, als Anerkennung für geleistete Dienste. Dieses hier hatte schon viele Besitzer."\\n—Alovnek, Boros-Gildenmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64174e34-99ab-480d-9bce-03f000e79bdb\', \'multiverseId\': 519519}, \'multiverseid\': 519519}, {\'name\': \'Relicario boros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, sacrificar el Relicario boros: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los entregamos a nuestros compañeros soldados en reconocimiento a sus actos de valor. No estará contigo mucho tiempo".\\n—Alóvnek, mago del gremio boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c6c66c-e712-48c8-bd6a-8dfc051b087d\', \'multiverseId\': 519767}, \'multiverseid\': 519767}, {\'name\': \'Médaillon de Boros\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, sacrifiez le Médaillon de Boros : Piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Nous les transmettons à nos soldats en reconnaissance d\'actes de bravoure. Il ne restera pas longtemps en votre possession. »\\n—Alovnek, ghildmage de Boros", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f6c7c3f-183a-4986-a6fa-f10ada8d9c75\', \'multiverseId\': 520015}, \'multiverseid\': 520015}, {\'name\': \'Medaglione Boros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, Sacrifica il Medaglione Boros: Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Li passiamo ai nostri commilitoni per premiare atti valorosi. Non resterà in mano tua a lungo."\\n—Alovnek, mago della gilda Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042a6aab-e8bc-476d-9f97-b24d0b795ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 520263}, \'multiverseid\': 520263}, {\'name\': \'ボロスのロケット\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, ボロスのロケットを生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「勇敢な行いの証として、仲間の兵士の間でこれを渡し合う。手元に長く留まることはない。」\\n――ボロスのギルド魔道士、アラヴネク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b43b4a5-07f6-4f10-b582-fac0def63592\', \'multiverseId\': 520511}, \'multiverseid\': 520511}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão Boros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, sacrifique Medalhão Boros: Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Passamos esses a nossos colegas de caserna em reconhecimento a feitos valorosos. Não vai ficar com você por muito tempo."\\n— Alovnek, mago da guilda Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9317576b-37b0-432f-9f16-b37e8688011c\', \'multiverseId\': 520759}, \'multiverseid\': 520759}, {\'name\': \'Медальон Боросов\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {R} или {W}.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Медальон Боросов: возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы передаем их нашим солдатам в знак признания их героических подвигов. Надолго он у тебя не останется».\\n— Аловнек, маг гильдии Боросов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83b2acc-12fa-4c64-9237-6ca7df8c8694\', \'multiverseId\': 521007}, \'multiverseid\': 521007}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯坠饰\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}或{W}。\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}，{T}，牺牲波洛斯坠饰：抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「坠饰会在同袍将士之间相传，当作英勇行为的褒奖。你不会一直留着它。」\\n～波洛斯公会法师阿劳涅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650c02de-50e5-40a1-996b-0893e2fefbd7\', \'multiverseId\': 521255}, \'multiverseid\': 521255}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯墜飾\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}或{W}。\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}，{T}，犧牲波洛斯墜飾：抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「墜飾會在同袍將士之間相傳，當作英勇行為的褒獎。你不會一直留著它。」\\n～波洛斯公會法師阿勞涅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05f59c6-149e-4bc4-8799-de41af9dabf6\', \'multiverseId\': 521503}, \'multiverseid\': 521503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bosh der Eisengolem\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{3}{R}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bosh der Eisengolem fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags des geopferten Artefakts zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Während Glissa nach der Wahrheit über Memnarch sucht, will Bosh die tief in seinem Gedächtnis vergrabenen Geheimnisse erforschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98f5084-797d-4831-83e0-53558941d348\', \'multiverseId\': 519520}, \'multiverseid\': 519520}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, gólem de hierro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\n{3}{R}, sacrificar un artefacto: Bosh, gólem de hierro hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual al valor de maná del artefacto sacrificado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Glissa busca la verdad sobre Memnarch, Bosh trata de desenterrar los secretos de su pasado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a51e87a-b129-4e9e-90da-fc0a731e2330\', \'multiverseId\': 519768}, \'multiverseid\': 519768}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, golem de fer\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\n{3}{R}, sacrifiez un artefact : Bosh, golem de fer inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal à la valeur de mana de l\'artefact sacrifié.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : golem\', \'flavor\': \'Alors que Glissa cherche à savoir la vérité sur Memnarch, Bosh cherche à déchiffrer les secrets enfouis au fond de sa mémoire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520016&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c412919b-56c0-4014-bba1-4b2096cabf78\', \'multiverseId\': 520016}, \'multiverseid\': 520016}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, Golem di Ferro\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Bosh, Golem di Ferro infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al valore di mana dell\'artefatto sacrificato.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre Glissa cerca la verità su Memnarch, Bosh cerca di far riemergere i segreti sepolti negli abissi del suo passato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93815a44-02c3-4b53-8dda-b7d519c33942\', \'multiverseId\': 520264}, \'multiverseid\': 520264}, {\'name\': \'鉄のゴーレム、ボッシュ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n{3}{R}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。鉄のゴーレム、ボッシュはそれに、その生け贄に捧げたアーティファクトのマナ総量に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'グリッサがメムナークに関する真実を探すのと同じように、ボッシュも自分の記憶の奥深く埋もれた秘密を探そうとしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e7ffe8-8067-42b8-bbf7-19904adaaf8d\', \'multiverseId\': 520512}, \'multiverseid\': 520512}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, Golem de Ferro\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\n{3}{R}, sacrifique um artefato: Bosh, Golem de Ferro, causa a qualquer alvo dano igual ao valor de mana do artefato sacrificado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto Glissa busca a verdade sobre o Memnarca, Bosh busca resgatar os segredos enterrados nas profundezas de sua memória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c615c38-6083-4d2f-a02b-69adc148e3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 520760}, \'multiverseid\': 520760}, {\'name\': \'Бош, Железный Голем\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\n{3}{R}, пожертвуйте артефакт: Бош, Железный Голем наносит любой цели повреждения, равные мановой ценности пожертвованного артефакта.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'Пока Глисса стремилась узнать истину о Мемнархе, Бош стремился раскрыть тайну своего прошлого.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0c6594e-3b9a-4759-9370-966dcca90979\', \'multiverseId\': 521008}, \'multiverseid\': 521008}, {\'name\': \'铁魔像霸西\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n{3}{R}，牺牲一个神器：铁魔像霸西对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲之神器的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'当格莉莎四处打探关于蒙纳坷的事，霸西也自脑海深处翻拣长埋的记忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f4d5ee-30c1-4c54-bd61-fbec927ab3af\', \'multiverseId\': 521256}, \'multiverseid\': 521256}, {\'name\': \'鐵魔像霸西\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n{3}{R}，犧牲一個神器：鐵魔像霸西對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於所犧牲之神器的魔法力值。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'當格莉莎四處打探關於蒙納坷的事，霸西也自腦海深處翻揀長埋的記憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fda505c-8cb3-42aa-9776-868ee551c1ee\', \'multiverseId\': 521504}, \'multiverseid\': 521504}]', "[{'name': 'Brandgefährlicher Mechakoloss', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nWenn der Brandgefährliche Mechakoloss ins Spiel kommt, kann dich ein Gegner deiner Wahl drei Karten ziehen lassen. Falls er dies nicht tut, millst du drei Karten. Dann fügt der Brandgefährliche Mechakoloss dem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Summe der Manabeträge jener Karten zu.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519446&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75ad80c8-dba7-4ef1-9e50-91737051fe1d', 'multiverseId': 519446}, 'multiverseid': 519446}, {'name': 'Mecatitán combustible', 'text': 'Daña primero.\\nCuando el Mecatitán combustible entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo puede hacer que robes tres cartas. Si ese jugador no lo hace, mueles tres cartas. Luego, el Mecatitán combustible hace una cantidad de daño a ese jugador igual al valor de maná total de esas cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519694&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1e4324c-a76c-41f5-ad2b-fa8ad7c07e2f', 'multiverseId': 519694}, 'multiverseid': 519694}, {'name': 'Carcasse mécanique combustible', 'text': 'Initiative\\nQuand la Carcasse mécanique combustible arrive sur le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé peut vous faire piocher trois cartes. Si le joueur ne le fait pas, vous meulez trois cartes, puis la Carcasse mécanique combustible inflige à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal à la valeur de mana totale de ces cartes.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519942&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69581883-a0e5-46a1-bd8c-d08ed1c83699', 'multiverseId': 519942}, 'multiverseid': 519942}, {'name': 'Meccatitano Combustibile', 'text': 'Attacco improvviso\\nQuando il Meccatitano Combustibile entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio può farti pescare tre carte. Se non lo fa, macini tre carte, poi il Meccatitano Combustibile infligge a quel giocatore danno pari al valore di mana totale di quelle carte.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520190&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd15417b4-f2ec-4091-a319-a43b5b0bb0a9', 'multiverseId': 520190}, 'multiverseid': 520190}, {'name': '焼却の機械巨人', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n焼却の機械巨人が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「あなたはカード３枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。そうしないなら、あなたはカード３枚を切削し、その後焼却の機械巨人はそのプレイヤーに、それらのカードのマナ総量の合計に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520438&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91ed6f2d-28f6-48f6-a4c8-7416093f4808', 'multiverseId': 520438}, 'multiverseid': 520438}, {'name': 'Mecanotitã Combustível', 'text': 'Iniciativa\\nQuando Mecanotitã Combustível entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo pode fazer com que você compre três cards. Se o jogador não o fizer, você triturará três cards e, depois, Mecanotitã Combustível causará àquele jogador dano igual ao valor de mana total daqueles cards.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520686&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ceba7fd-88f5-4097-ab57-4128a8daccad', 'multiverseId': 520686}, 'multiverseid': 520686}, {'name': 'Мехагигант Воспламенения', 'text': 'Первый удар\\nКогда Мехагигант Воспламенения выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент может заставить вас взять три карты. Если тот игрок не делает этого, вы скручиваете три карты, затем Мехагигант Воспламенения наносит тому игроку повреждения, равные суммарной мановой ценности тех карт.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520934&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a43386a-4a40-4042-9df0-f38392448313', 'multiverseId': 520934}, 'multiverseid': 520934}, {'name': '易燃巨械', 'text': '先攻\\n当易燃巨械进战场时，目标对手可以令你抓三张牌。若该牌手未如此作，则你磨三张牌，然后易燃巨械对该牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于这些牌法术力值的总和。', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521182&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec482021-114e-4bd7-a2e4-00cfa7c87b03', 'multiverseId': 521182}, 'multiverseid': 521182}, {'name': '易燃巨械', 'text': '先攻\\n當易燃巨械進戰場時，目標對手可以令你抽三張牌。若該玩家未如此作，則你磨三張牌，然後易燃巨械對該玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於這些牌魔法力值的總和。', 'type': '神器生物 ～組構體', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521430&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '025cda66-36b9-489b-ad64-e5a1551290f3', 'multiverseId': 521430}, 'multiverseid': 521430}]", '[{\'name\': \'Breena die Demagogin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen deiner Gegner angreift und falls jener Gegner mehr Lebenspunkte als ein anderer deiner Gegner hat, zieht der angreifende Spieler eine Karte und du legst zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c9f8da1-da64-46a2-947f-6451325fafda\', \'multiverseId\': 518317}, \'multiverseid\': 518317}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la Demagoga\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque a uno de tus oponentes, si ese oponente tiene más vidas que otro de tus oponentes, ese jugador atacante roba una carta y tú pones dos contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df238cea-c744-42f2-9525-f7bf3269b701\', \'multiverseId\': 518327}, \'multiverseid\': 518327}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la démagogue\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque un de vos adversaires, si cet adversaire a plus de points de vie qu\'un autre de vos adversaires, ce joueur attaquant pioche une carte et vous mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912da84d-acdc-49ab-a461-d21b3c77159e\', \'multiverseId\': 518337}, \'multiverseid\': 518337}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la Demagoga\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore attacca uno dei tuoi avversari, se quell\'avversario ha più punti vita di un altro dei tuoi avversari, il giocatore attaccante pesca una carta e tu metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4769550d-90f4-4253-8b68-3c277c5c082c\', \'multiverseId\': 518347}, \'multiverseid\': 518347}, {\'name\': \'大衆扇動者、ブリーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤー１人があなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、その対戦相手のライフが他のあなたの対戦相手より多い場合、その攻撃プレイヤーはカード１枚を引き、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47be1b65-32d1-49d7-ae17-783539136756\', \'multiverseId\': 518357}, \'multiverseid\': 518357}, {\'name\': \'Brenna, a Demagoga\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um jogador ataca um de seus oponentes, se aquele oponente tiver mais pontos de vida que outro de seus oponentes, aquele jogador atacante compra um card e você coloca dois marcadores +1/+1 em uma criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ave Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86df7ff-2aa3-4f47-b00b-34edb08cf258\', \'multiverseId\': 518367}, \'multiverseid\': 518367}, {\'name\': \'Брина, Демагог\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок атакует одного из ваших оппонентов, если количество жизней того оппонента больше, чем у любого из других ваших оппонентов, тот атакующий игрок берет карту, а вы кладете два жетона +1/+1 на существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Птица Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23cb2070-4521-44fa-a08d-7c8abc3b22f2\', \'multiverseId\': 518377}, \'multiverseid\': 518377}, {\'name\': \'煽动师布莉娜\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一位牌手攻击你的任一对手时，若后者的生命比你的另一位对手多，则该攻击牌手抓一张牌，且你在一个由你操控的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鸟／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1c1c99-5c32-4587-be0f-2203de985635\', \'multiverseId\': 518387}, \'multiverseid\': 518387}, {\'name\': \'煽動師布莉娜\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一位玩家攻擊你的任一對手時，若後者的生命比你的另一位對手多，則该攻擊玩家抽一張牌，且你在一個由你操控的生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～鳥／邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95fe7656-c1e8-402d-8d13-6582273f32af\', \'multiverseId\': 518397}, \'multiverseid\': 518397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Breena die Demagogin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen deiner Gegner angreift und falls jener Gegner mehr Lebenspunkte hat als ein anderer deiner Gegner, zieht der angreifende Spieler eine Karte und du legst zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521677&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e256dfd8-50d7-4796-bd8b-585d156b2775\', \'multiverseId\': 521677}, \'multiverseid\': 521677}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la Demagoga\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque a uno de tus oponentes, si ese oponente tiene más vidas que otro de tus oponentes, ese jugador atacante roba una carta y tú pones dos contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'651c548c-155f-46ed-8837-bce25c770be4\', \'multiverseId\': 521757}, \'multiverseid\': 521757}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la démagogue\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque un de vos adversaires, si cet adversaire a plus de points de vie qu\'un autre de vos adversaires, ce joueur attaquant pioche une carte et vous mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f725883b-5f58-4ecb-b79c-d45e2d58ccb8\', \'multiverseId\': 521837}, \'multiverseid\': 521837}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la Demagoga\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore attacca uno dei tuoi avversari, se quell\'avversario ha più punti vita di un altro dei tuoi avversari, il giocatore attaccante pesca una carta e tu metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1461982b-1de6-4efa-8e0e-4cd359acc7a4\', \'multiverseId\': 521917}, \'multiverseid\': 521917}, {\'name\': \'大衆扇動者、ブリーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤー１人があなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、その攻撃されたプレイヤーのライフが他のあなたの対戦相手１人より多い場合、その攻撃プレイヤーはカード１枚を引き、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e79f947e-480a-4164-8a0b-dfc6115b4678\', \'multiverseId\': 521997}, \'multiverseid\': 521997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzener Wächter\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nAbwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\\nAndere Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\\nDie Stärke des Bronzenen Wächters ist gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518480&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e00863-d4b2-4ec5-91fb-e77918697b33\', \'multiverseId\': 518480}, \'multiverseid\': 518480}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de bronce\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nRebatir {2}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\\nLos otros artefactos que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {2}.\\nLa fuerza del Guardián de bronce es igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8451d8c4-e58d-4c50-8200-2ccac0313e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 518551}, \'multiverseid\': 518551}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de bronze\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nParade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)\\nLes autres artefacts que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.\\nLa force du Gardien de bronze est égale au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518622&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d657071f-0965-45ae-b92d-0b20962064a5\', \'multiverseId\': 518622}, \'multiverseid\': 518622}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano di Bronzo\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nEgida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\\nGli altri artefatti che controlli hanno egida {2}.\\nLa forza del Guardiano di Bronzo è pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'757e5eb4-80be-4403-b50d-eb57329518fe\', \'multiverseId\': 518693}, \'multiverseid\': 518693}, {\'name\': \'青銅の守護者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\nこれ以外であなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトは護法{2}を持つ。\\n青銅の守護者のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5b1173-1e54-4289-b0c9-8d73388f0698\', \'multiverseId\': 518764}, \'multiverseid\': 518764}, {\'name\': \'Guardião de Bronze\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nSalvaguarda {2} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {2}.)\\nOs outros artefatos que você controla têm salvaguarda {2}.\\nO poder de Guardião de Bronze é igual ao número de artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9411ae1-9174-4342-a016-72e8a4f7026e\', \'multiverseId\': 518835}, \'multiverseid\': 518835}, {\'name\': \'Бронзовый Стражник\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nОберег {2} (Каждый раз, когда это существо становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, отмените то заклинание или способность, если тот игрок не заплатит {2}.)\\nДругие артефакты под вашим контролем имеют Оберег {2}.\\nСила Бронзового Стражника равна количеству артефактов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b89cddf-9bf6-4c50-ab67-c36eb786fcf1\', \'multiverseId\': 518906}, \'multiverseid\': 518906}, {\'name\': \'黄铜守护者\', \'text\': \'连击\\n守护{2}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\\n由你操控的其他神器具有守护{2}。\\n黄铜守护者的力量等同于由你操控的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64814ffc-0250-4ffb-b232-f2573443a8f6\', \'multiverseId\': 518977}, \'multiverseid\': 518977}, {\'name\': \'黃銅守護者\', \'text\': \'連擊\\n守護{2}（每當此生物成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，除非該玩家支付{2}，否則反擊之。）\\n由你操控的其他神器具有守護{2}。\\n黃銅守護者的力量等同於由你操控的神器數量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf2ccf5-740d-4a28-b445-cd9519543979\', \'multiverseId\': 519048}, \'multiverseid\': 519048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzener Wächter\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nAbwehr {2}\\nAndere Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\\nDie Stärke des Bronzenen Wächters ist gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521689&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08913695-359c-46e7-b394-7cadb07c1c53\', \'multiverseId\': 521689}, \'multiverseid\': 521689}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de bronce\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nRebatir {2}.\\nLos otros artefactos que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {2}.\\nLa fuerza del Guardián de bronce es igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6742ae-dfb7-41a1-8412-f920f8fe91a4\', \'multiverseId\': 521769}, \'multiverseid\': 521769}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de bronze\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nParade {2}\\nLes autres artefacts que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.\\nLa force du Gardien de bronze est égale au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34fee4ea-7f86-43f5-9c07-9fbe36ed721f\', \'multiverseId\': 521849}, \'multiverseid\': 521849}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano di Bronzo\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nEgida {2}\\nGli altri artefatti che controlli hanno egida {2}.\\nLa forza del Guardiano di Bronzo è pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3821ddb8-1e76-4284-b9db-db77a8fa587b\', \'multiverseId\': 521929}, \'multiverseid\': 521929}, {\'name\': \'青銅の守護者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n護法{2}\\nこれ以外であなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトは護法{2}を持つ。\\n青銅の守護者のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4b74d78-66be-494b-a261-53a1a2a490bc\', \'multiverseId\': 522009}, \'multiverseid\': 522009}]', "[{'name': 'Brunnen der verlorenen Träume', 'text': 'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {X} bezahlen, wobei X kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an dazuerhaltenen Lebenspunkten ist. Falls du dies tust, ziehe X Karten.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Manche behaupten, dass das durch das Ritual des Zurückweisens verloren gegangene Wissen durch das Wasser des Brunnens zurückkehrt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519558&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91f773bc-b309-41d8-b1f0-b40451aaf62d', 'multiverseId': 519558}, 'multiverseid': 519558}, {'name': 'Pozo de los sueños perdidos', 'text': 'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {X}, donde X es menor o igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste. Si lo haces, roba X cartas.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Algunos dicen que el conocimiento perdido durante el ritual de expulsión regresa por las aguas del pozo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519806&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebc6e7c1-5960-49ca-a399-bbee76cd883e', 'multiverseId': 519806}, 'multiverseid': 519806}, {'name': 'Puits des songes perdus', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {X}, X étant inférieur ou égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez X cartes.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'On dit que la connaissance perdue lors du Rituel de la Réprimande revient, distillée dans les eaux du puits.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520054&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41cf40ae-e11d-48f8-906f-4d624000b23e', 'multiverseId': 520054}, 'multiverseid': 520054}, {'name': 'Pozzo dei Sogni Perduti', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {X}, dove X è pari o inferiore ai punti vita guadagnati. Se lo fai, pesca X carte.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Alcuni dicono che la conoscenza perduta durante il Rituale della Disapprovazione venga restituita tramite le acque del pozzo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520302&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '331aac20-e4b3-4bed-b917-ea4dd5a804ab', 'multiverseId': 520302}, 'multiverseid': 520302}, {'name': '失われし夢の井戸', 'text': 'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは「{X}を支払い、カードをＸ枚引く。Ｘはあなたが得たライフの量以下の値である。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '懲戒の儀式の中で失われた知識は、井戸の水から取り戻すことができると言われている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520550&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1a8627e-3c03-45f1-928f-123856a6f0f5', 'multiverseId': 520550}, 'multiverseid': 520550}, {'name': 'Poço dos Sonhos Perdidos', 'text': 'Toda vez que ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {X}, sendo X igual ou inferior à quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou. Se fizer isso, compre X cards.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Alguns dizem que o conhecimento perdido durante o Ritual de Repreensão é devolvido pelas águas do poço.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520798&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4247b092-e1ee-4d9c-aaac-8994e1115839', 'multiverseId': 520798}, 'multiverseid': 520798}, {'name': 'Колодец Потерянных Грез', 'text': 'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), вы можете заплатить {X}, где значение X меньше или равно количеству полученных вами жизней. Если вы это делаете, возьмите X карт.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': 'Говорят, что утраченные во время Ритуала Упреков знания можно вернуть, выпив воды из этого колодца.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521046&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '038a35b7-c070-4237-a50a-2a3c0fed45a9', 'multiverseId': 521046}, 'multiverseid': 521046}, {'name': '迷梦深井', 'text': '每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{X}，X须等于或小于你所获得的生命数量。若你如此作，则抓X张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '传说在训诫仪式之中消失的知识，都会藉由井水涌回。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521294&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca04faeb-d094-4233-8f11-200506a94ebe', 'multiverseId': 521294}, 'multiverseid': 521294}, {'name': '迷夢深井', 'text': '每當你獲得生命時，你可以支付{X}，X須等於或小於你所獲得的生命數量。若你如此作，則抽X張牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '傳說在訓誡儀式之中消失的知識，都會藉由井水湧回。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521542&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7c51fb4-5f9c-43a6-9653-90ebdd6549da', 'multiverseId': 521542}, 'multiverseid': 521542}]", '[{\'name\': \'Champion des Scharfsinns\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Champion des Scharfsinns ins Spiel kommt, kannst du so viele Karten ziehen, wie seine Stärke beträgt. Falls du dies tust, wirf zwei Karten ab.\\nVerewigen {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie-Naga-Zauberer ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519399&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f6f1d2-071f-41c2-9e09-6b5ee9b60685\', \'multiverseId\': 519399}, \'multiverseid\': 519399}, {\'name\': \'Campeona del ingenio\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Campeona del ingenio entre al campo de batalla, puedes robar una cantidad de cartas igual a su fuerza. Si lo haces, descarta dos cartas.\\nEternizar {5}{U}{U}. ({5}{U}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Hechicero Naga Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3256d065-e0e1-4ac0-b57f-e5f83b181123\', \'multiverseId\': 519647}, \'multiverseid\': 519647}, {\'name\': "Championne d\'esprits", \'text\': "Quand la Championne d\'esprits arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez piocher un nombre de cartes égal à sa force. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nÉternalisation {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et naga et sorcier 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : naga et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519895&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc1f34a1-2767-45b9-9cc5-dba7c636ea19\', \'multiverseId\': 519895}, \'multiverseid\': 519895}, {\'name\': "Campionessa d\'Ingegno", \'text\': "Quando la Campionessa d\'Ingegno entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pescare carte pari alla sua forza. Se lo fai, scarta due carte.\\nEternare {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Mago Naga Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03875fa8-28f8-4d48-9958-73027cd85666\', \'multiverseId\': 520143}, \'multiverseid\': 520143}, {\'name\': \'機知の勇者\', \'text\': \'機知の勇者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「これのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。」を選んでもよい。\\n永遠{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}, あなたの墓地からこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストと永遠を持たず黒で４/４でゾンビ・ナーガ・ウィザードであることを除きこれのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08562f63-8c48-4a36-ad68-034f7fcfeed9\', \'multiverseId\': 520391}, \'multiverseid\': 520391}, {\'name\': \'Campeã do Raciocínio\', \'text\': \'Quando Campeã do Raciocínio entra no campo de batalha, você pode comprar uma quantidade de cards igual ao seu poder. Se fizer isso, descarte dois cards.\\nEternizar {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Naga Mago preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Naga Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d69699b-5a9a-40bc-af2d-164308cbd5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 520639}, \'multiverseid\': 520639}, {\'name\': \'Поборница Разума\', \'text\': \'Когда Поборница Разума выходит на поле битвы, вы можете взять количество карт, равное ее силе. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте две карты.\\nУвековечивание {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте одну фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби Нагой Чародеем 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Нага Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84bf85ce-1bc1-4a32-b4a2-c3a9cd051b85\', \'multiverseId\': 520887}, \'multiverseid\': 520887}, {\'name\': \'聪智斗士\', \'text\': \'当聪智斗士进战场时，你可以抓等同于其力量的牌。若你如此作，则弃两张牌。\\n永生{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／那伽／法术师，且没有法术力费用。永生的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～那伽／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41a070db-2719-4f33-917c-60ae8ec6760b\', \'multiverseId\': 521135}, \'multiverseid\': 521135}, {\'name\': \'聰智鬥士\', \'text\': \'當聰智鬥士進戰場時，你可以抽等同於其力量的牌。若你如此作，則棄兩張牌。\\n永生{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／那伽／魔法師，且沒有魔法力費用。永生的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～那伽／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5830064c-fac0-4ffe-a894-541436c17099\', \'multiverseId\': 521383}, \'multiverseid\': 521383}]', '[{\'name\': \'Colfenors Sprössling\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nImmer wenn Colfenors Sprössling angreift, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Widerstandskraft der Karte dazu, verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke und nimmst sie dann auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Baumhirte, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Pläne könnten doch noch Früchte tragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14dc0536-35e1-43ad-bba7-b146f90b58a0\', \'multiverseId\': 519511}, \'multiverseid\': 519511}, {\'name\': \'Retoño de Cólfenor\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nSiempre que el Retoño de Cólfenor ataque, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la resistencia de esa carta y pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza. Luego, ponla en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'Sus planes todavía tienen que dar fruto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2b49e02-79b0-40be-817a-dfc697fdb018\', \'multiverseId\': 519759}, \'multiverseid\': 519759}, {\'name\': \'Arbrisseau de Colfénor\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Arbrisseau de Colfénor attaque, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'endurance de cette carte, vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force, et vous la mettez ensuite dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sylvin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Ses plans n\'ont pas encore fructifié.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520007&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'903a9315-1486-40a2-80a3-ee565a29ecc5\', \'multiverseId\': 520007}, \'multiverseid\': 520007}, {\'name\': \'Talea di Colfenor\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nOgniqualvolta la Talea di Colfenor attacca, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura, guadagni punti vita pari alla costituzione di quella carta, perdi punti vita pari alla sua forza, poi aggiungila alla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi piani possono ancora dare frutti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cbb3507-f527-4354-a064-bd0bdc2ea271\', \'multiverseId\': 520255}, \'multiverseid\': 520255}, {\'name\': \'コルフェノールの若木\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nコルフェノールの若木が攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、あなたはそのカードのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得て、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを失い、その後それをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の計画は実を結ぶかもしれない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb05c9f-2277-489a-99c0-c35b89846a05\', \'multiverseId\': 520503}, \'multiverseid\': 520503}, {\'name\': \'Muda de Colfenor\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nToda vez que Muda de Colfenor atacar, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura, você ganha pontos de vida iguais à resistência daquele card, perde pontos de vida iguais ao poder dele e em seguida o coloca em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ent Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Os planos dela ainda podem dar frutos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7eb9d81-17c8-4360-b56b-d3883ec384f8\', \'multiverseId\': 520751}, \'multiverseid\': 520751}, {\'name\': \'Саженец Колфенора\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nКаждый раз, когда Саженец Колфенора атакует, покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта существа, то вы получаете количество жизней, равное выносливости той карты, теряете количество жизней, равное ее силе, затем кладете ее в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Лесовик Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Ее замыслы еще могут принести плоды.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4625e28c-2b41-4f25-94d1-cb4ebf9e5e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 520999}, \'multiverseid\': 520999}, {\'name\': \'柯芬诺幼苗\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n每当柯芬诺幼苗攻击时，展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是生物牌，则你获得等同于该牌防御力的生命，失去等同于其力量的生命，然后将它置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～树妖／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'她的计划终能开花结果。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a001750-28aa-4b37-a801-1aa57a917100\', \'multiverseId\': 521247}, \'multiverseid\': 521247}, {\'name\': \'柯芬諾幼苗\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n每當柯芬諾幼苗攻擊時，展示你的牌庫頂牌。若它是生物牌，則你獲得等同於該牌防禦力的生命，失去等同於其力量的生命，然後將它置於你手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～樹妖／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'她的計畫終能開花結果。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49888d47-7e7f-4c56-8af6-d3019bbd905e\', \'multiverseId\': 521495}, \'multiverseid\': 521495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Daretti der Schrottkundige\', \'text\': \'+2: Wirf bis zu zwei Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\\n−2: Opfere ein Artefakt. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−10: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe es zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück."\\nDaretti der Schrottkundige kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519447&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c9647b-b735-44de-8caa-e534d35f4f60\', \'multiverseId\': 519447}, \'multiverseid\': 519447}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, sabio de la chatarra\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarta hasta dos cartas, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\\n−2: Sacrifica un artefacto. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n−10: Obtienes un emblema con "Siempre que un artefacto vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla al comienzo del próximo paso final".\\nDaretti, sabio de la chatarra puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09520099-ab70-49d6-8953-d6db90588d78\', \'multiverseId\': 519695}, \'multiverseid\': 519695}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, savant ferrailleur\', \'text\': "+2 : Défaussez-vous de jusqu\'à deux cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes.\\n−2 : Sacrifiez un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n−10 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un artefact est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin. »\\nDaretti, savant ferrailleur peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519943&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bdb19fc-2a7e-48d6-a69b-c9e263cc5574\', \'multiverseId\': 519943}, \'multiverseid\': 519943}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, Esperto di Rottami\', \'text\': \'+2: Scarta fino a due carte, poi pesca altrettante carte.\\n-2: Sacrifica un artefatto. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n-10: Ottieni un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto viene messo nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale".\\nDaretti, Esperto di Rottami può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb27963-ed8e-492c-a528-ed59ce779b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 520191}, \'multiverseid\': 520191}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄の学者、ダレッティ\', \'text\': \'+2：カード最大２枚を捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n－２：アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\n－10：あなたは「アーティファクト１つが戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードを戦場に戻す。」を持つ紋章を得る。\\n屑鉄の学者、ダレッティは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ダレッティ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a05befb-d23b-4677-aee6-b8f79224eb03\', \'multiverseId\': 520439}, \'multiverseid\': 520439}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, Sábio da Sucata\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarte até dois cards e depois compre uma quantidade equivalente de cards.\\n-2: Sacrifique um artefato. Se fizer isso, devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\n-10: Você recebe um emblema com "Toda vez que um artefato for colocado em seu cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha no início da próxima etapa final."\\nDaretti, Sábio da Sucata, pode ser seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07470ad4-a21f-4c3c-a38c-489b25805b28\', \'multiverseId\': 520687}, \'multiverseid\': 520687}, {\'name\': \'Даретти, Мудрец Хлама\', \'text\': \'+2: сбросьте не более двух карт, затем возьмите столько же карт.\\n−2: пожертвуйте артефакт. Если вы это делаете, верните целевую карту артефакта из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\n−10: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Каждый раз, когда артефакт попадает на ваше кладбище с поля битвы, верните ту карту на поле битвы в начале следующего заключительного шага».\\nДаретти, Мудрец Хлама может быть вашим командиром.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Даретти\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3736a36e-341a-4318-bc7b-5808780777e4\', \'multiverseId\': 520935}, \'multiverseid\': 520935}, {\'name\': \'拆解学究达雷迪\', \'text\': \'+2：弃至多两张牌，然后抓等量的牌。\\n−2：牺牲一个神器。如果你如此作，则将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n−10：你获得具有以下异能的徽记～「每当一个神器从战场进入你的坟墓场，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌移回战场。」\\n拆解学究达雷迪可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～达雷迪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af11e11-efc9-4417-8162-9ffd4e3c1d80\', \'multiverseId\': 521183}, \'multiverseid\': 521183}, {\'name\': \'拆解學究達雷迪\', \'text\': \'+2：棄至多兩張牌，然後抽等量的牌。\\n−2：犧牲一個神器。如果你如此作，則將目標神器牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\\n−10：你獲得具有以下異能的徽記～「每當一個神器從戰場進入你的墳墓場，在下一個結束步驟開始時，將該牌移回戰場。」\\n拆解學究達雷迪可用作指揮官。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～達雷迪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20802f19-0dfe-4e6e-acc5-af30f14a3728\', \'multiverseId\': 521431}, \'multiverseid\': 521431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Vergangene erleiden\', \'text\': \'Schicke X Karten deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte verliert der Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ulamogs Tentakel, deren Berührung wie brennendes Eis war, durchsuchten seine Seele und zapften seine Erinnerungen eine nach der anderen an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519438&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973965c9-7a74-41a4-99ae-69c215639a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 519438}, \'multiverseid\': 519438}, {\'name\': \'Sufrir el pasado\', \'text\': \'Exilia X cartas objetivo del cementerio del jugador objetivo. Por cada carta exiliada de esta manera, ese jugador pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los tentáculos de Ulamog, con su tacto de hielo ardiente, vagaron por su alma y quemaron sus recuerdos uno a uno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9c9ce3a-d79d-49cb-9ac0-c3795e87be45\', \'multiverseId\': 519686}, \'multiverseid\': 519686}, {\'name\': \'Subir le passé\', \'text\': "Exilez X cartes ciblées depuis le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, ce joueur perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le feu glacial des tentacules d\'Ulamog fouaillait son âme et poignardait ses souvenirs un par un.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519934&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f88cff-0b69-4a23-9353-dd2a732b0e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 519934}, \'multiverseid\': 519934}, {\'name\': \'Subire il Passato\', \'text\': \'Esilia X carte bersaglio dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio. Per ogni carta esiliata in questo modo, quel giocatore perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I tentacoli di Ulamog, dal tocco come ghiaccio bollente, frugarono nella sua anima e pungolarono i suoi ricordi uno per uno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c881bc-968c-4d07-a5c8-0ce6a439b997\', \'multiverseId\': 520182}, \'multiverseid\': 520182}, {\'name\': \'過去の受難\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人と、そのプレイヤーの墓地からカードＸ枚を対象とする。それらのカードを追放する。これにより追放されたカード１枚につき、そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの触手は、触れれば燃える氷のようで、魂の中を漁り回り、記憶を一つ一つ突き刺していく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f3ebacb-cbbb-43ea-bc3b-3d0e62b7512c\', \'multiverseId\': 520430}, \'multiverseid\': 520430}, {\'name\': \'Sofrer o Passado\', \'text\': \'Exile X cards alvo do cemitério do jogador alvo. Para cada card exilado dessa maneira, aquele jogador perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os tentáculos de Ulamog, com seu toque ardente como o gelo, vasculharam sua alma e fisgaram suas memórias uma a uma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46eb28a6-a368-434b-92a2-1f24a342e118\', \'multiverseId\': 520678}, \'multiverseid\': 520678}, {\'name\': \'Страдать Прошлым\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X целевых карт из кладбища целевого игрока. За каждую изгнанную таким образом карту тот игрок теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Щупальца Уламога, обжигающие словно лед, копошились в его душе и жалили воспоминания, одно за другим.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'686c9981-6169-4a74-bfeb-f9eeb723b829\', \'multiverseId\': 520926}, \'multiverseid\': 520926}, {\'name\': \'往事纠缠\', \'text\': \'将X张目标牌从目标牌手的坟墓场放逐。每以此法放逐一张牌，该牌手便失去1点生命，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫的触手触感有如燃烧的冰，在其灵魂间翻捡，逐一刺激其记忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595d9b66-7fdc-4e43-a9d1-53b3fb04838c\', \'multiverseId\': 521174}, \'multiverseid\': 521174}, {\'name\': \'往事糾纏\', \'text\': \'將X張目標牌從目標玩家的墳墓場放逐。每以此法放逐一張牌，該玩家便失去1點生命，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'鎢拉莫的觸手觸感有如燃燒的冰，在其靈魂間翻撿，逐一刺激其記憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'377cca1c-f0a2-49d8-b736-2608b04db450\', \'multiverseId\': 521422}, \'multiverseid\': 521422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Deekah die Fraktaltheoretikerin\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist.\\n{3}{U}: Ein Kreaturenspielstein deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d0560d-447f-491a-8474-6f858f79aa4e\', \'multiverseId\': 518493}, \'multiverseid\': 518493}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, teórica de los fractales\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\n{3}{U}: La ficha de criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f439f2a-06ca-45ae-b36a-9dccdc0ce7d1\', \'multiverseId\': 518564}, \'multiverseid\': 518564}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, théoricienne fractale\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\n{3}{U} : Un jeton de créature ciblé ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518635&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc706328-15ab-4753-8a80-cac65ba2c66f\', \'multiverseId\': 518635}, \'multiverseid\': 518635}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, Teoreta dei Frattali\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia.\\n{3}{U}: Una pedina creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737674bd-3a48-4bdd-a019-aa6630f0dd29\', \'multiverseId\': 518706}, \'multiverseid\': 518706}, {\'name\': \'フラクタルの理論家、ディーカ\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\n{3}{U}：クリーチャー・トークン１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'389ef07f-bac1-4e0d-8436-efd3914678e5\', \'multiverseId\': 518777}, \'multiverseid\': 518777}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, Teórica dos Fractais\', \'text\': \'Magifício — Toda vez que você conjurar ou copiar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela, sendo X o valor de mana da mágica.\\n{3}{U}: A ficha de criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c0bcfb-9d1a-4e54-8245-63a06050a9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 518848}, \'multiverseid\': 518848}, {\'name\': \'Дика, Теоретик Фракталов\', \'text\': \'Чародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1, где X — мановая ценность того заклинания.\\n{3}{U}: целевая фишка существа не может быть заблокирована в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b0d767f-f4af-475a-a241-9c3770cfe094\', \'multiverseId\': 518919}, \'multiverseid\': 518919}, {\'name\': \'分灵理论师荻卡\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为该咒语的法术力值。\\n{3}{U}：目标衍生生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b45e42-b435-427a-9ce6-e6db6029ccc0\', \'multiverseId\': 518990}, \'multiverseid\': 518990}, {\'name\': \'分靈理論師荻卡\', \'text\': \'魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為該咒語的魔法力值。\\n{3}{U}：目標衍生生物本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c62a22-3623-4b35-ad68-ba31b9d4656e\', \'multiverseId\': 519061}, \'multiverseid\': 519061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Deekah die Fraktaltheoretikerin\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist.\\n{3}{U}: Ein Kreaturenspielstein deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521702&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'207701f5-ffa8-48d3-a520-440daa29122d\', \'multiverseId\': 521702}, \'multiverseid\': 521702}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, teórica de los fractales\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\n{3}{U}: La ficha de criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78ac06f9-2c56-4263-a0e0-0ec036463f39\', \'multiverseId\': 521782}, \'multiverseid\': 521782}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, théoricienne fractale\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\n{3}{U} : Un jeton de créature ciblé ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7558bf-813f-49c1-969d-4f6be7707ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 521862}, \'multiverseid\': 521862}, {\'name\': \'Deekah, Teoreta dei Frattali\', \'text\': \'Artemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia.\\n{3}{U}: Una pedina creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5d0a3b-3039-41c6-b69a-843e11a77e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 521942}, \'multiverseid\': 521942}, {\'name\': \'フラクタルの理論家、ディーカ\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\n{3}{U}：クリーチャー・トークン１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8303692e-a535-4126-9126-f7beb62f32f9\', \'multiverseId\': 522022}, \'multiverseid\': 522022}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demütige Überläuferin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe zwei Karten. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl übernimmt die Kontrolle über die Demütige Überläuferin. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Einst warst du eine Mardu, dein Körper und dein Wille stark. Jetzt müssen wir noch deinen Geist unterweisen."\\n—Houn, Jeskai-Ältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519457&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe8604e1-61d2-4aeb-90bf-7d44bdda50bc\', \'multiverseId\': 519457}, \'multiverseid\': 519457}, {\'name\': \'Desertora humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba dos cartas. El oponente objetivo gana el control de la Desertora humilde. Activa esto solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuiste mardu una vez, por lo que tu cuerpo y tu voluntad son fuertes. Ahora debemos entrenar tu mente".\\n—Hun, anciana jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b738a2fe-3eb9-4587-ab40-9eecef010363\', \'multiverseId\': 519705}, \'multiverseid\': 519705}, {\'name\': \'Humble défecteur\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez deux cartes. Un adversaire ciblé acquiert le contrôle de l\'Humble défecteur. N\'activez que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu étais un Mardu, ton corps et ta volonté sont robustes. Nous devons maintenant entraîner ton esprit. »\\n—Houn, doyen jeskaï\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519953&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144f820b-d9d0-4dc9-86b4-8f8df27ad70c\', \'multiverseId\': 519953}, \'multiverseid\': 519953}, {\'name\': \'Disertrice Umile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca due carte. Un avversario bersaglio prende il controllo della Disertrice Umile. Attiva solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un tempo eri un Mardu, perciò il tuo corpo e la tua volontà sono forti. Ora dobbiamo allenare la tua mente."\\n—Houn, anziano Jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9494ef13-d1cd-4860-91a9-85e1b8aa2a29\', \'multiverseId\': 520201}, \'multiverseid\': 520201}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な離反者\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カード２枚を引く。そのプレイヤーは謙虚な離反者のコントロールを得る。あなたのターンにしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お主はかつてマルドゥであった、故に体と意志は鍛えられている。これからはその精神を鍛えよう。」\\n――ジェスカイの長老、フーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291a0e5b-1775-490d-91a3-f71ab910d625\', \'multiverseId\': 520449}, \'multiverseid\': 520449}, {\'name\': \'Desertora Humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre dois cards. O oponente alvo ganha o controle de Desertora Humilde. Ative apenas durante seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Você foi mardu um dia, seu corpo e sua força de vontade são fortes. Agora precisamos treinar sua mente."\\n— Houn, anciã jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21158afe-25a8-4ac0-938f-63571891e027\', \'multiverseId\': 520697}, \'multiverseid\': 520697}, {\'name\': \'Смиренный Отступник\', \'text\': \'{T}: возьмите две карты. Целевой оппонент получает контроль над Смиренным Отступником. Активируйте только во время вашего хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Раньше ты был из клана Марду, и поэтому твои тело и дух уже сильны. Теперь же мы будем упражнять твой разум».\\n— Хун, старейшина джескайцев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02bff4f6-3a8c-426f-87f3-230863867b44\', \'multiverseId\': 520945}, \'multiverseid\': 520945}, {\'name\': \'谦卑皈宗者\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓两张牌。目标对手获得谦卑皈宗者的操控权。只能于你的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你曾属玛尔都，已有健硕身躯与顽强意志。如今我们必须锻炼你的心灵。」\\n～洁斯凯长老侯恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e597f5f-4250-4e17-a6bb-5d8583e0cc73\', \'multiverseId\': 521193}, \'multiverseid\': 521193}, {\'name\': \'謙卑皈宗者\', \'text\': \'{T}：抽兩張牌。目標對手獲得謙卑皈宗者的操控權。只能於你的回合中起動。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你曾屬瑪爾都，已有健碩身軀與頑強意志。如今我們必須鍛鍊你的心靈。」\\n～潔斯凱長老侯恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbaeb04-ca2a-433b-890f-d70f1ee8ba30\', \'multiverseId\': 521441}, \'multiverseid\': 521441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In jedem Herzen lebt ein Monster. Wir bilden uns nur ein, dass die Zivilisation es zähmt."\\n―Euphemia, Beobachterin des Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519469&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7bbc97b-6a9f-410b-8be9-ec2920f1e499\', \'multiverseId\': 519469}, \'multiverseid\': 519469}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los monstruos habitan en todos los corazones. Solo creemos que la civilización los domestica".\\n—Eufemia, vigilante del nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ccc23af-fa0f-4708-b031-8842b2450c5d\', \'multiverseId\': 519717}, \'multiverseid\': 519717}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Un monstre se cache dans chaque cœur. Nous croyons seulement qu\'il est dompté par la civilisation. »\\n—Euphemia, gardienne du Nexus", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a546092-5bec-4a26-8907-92cc19896156\', \'multiverseId\': 519965}, \'multiverseid\': 519965}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"In ogni cuore risiedono mostri. L\\\'idea che la civiltà li addomestichi è una mera illusione."\\n—Eufemia, guardiana del Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f097021-97be-4c9f-b043-26a8f8ac7ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 520213}, \'multiverseid\': 520213}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物はあらゆる者の心の奥底に潜んでいる。それらを飼い慣らしているのが文明であると我々は考える。」\\n――生息地の見張り、ユーフェミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a2877a-0bc8-475e-ac2d-ea017cd9e618\', \'multiverseId\': 520461}, \'multiverseid\': 520461}, {\'name\': \'Fera Interior\', \'text\': \'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os monstros habitam todos os corações. Nós só achamos que a civilização os doma."\\n― Euphemia, vigia do Nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f334a4e7-1da9-4961-8b39-0b9e5e119f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 520709}, \'multiverseid\': 520709}, {\'name\': \'Зверь Внутри\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«В каждом из нас кроется чудовище. Мы ошибочно полагаем, что цивилизация сумела его укротить».\\n— Эвфемия, страж Ядра\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9fca239-ea84-44a8-ba97-d6ef004141f7\', \'multiverseId\': 520957}, \'multiverseid\': 520957}, {\'name\': \'体内野兽\', \'text\': \'消灭目标永久物。其操控者派出一个3/3绿色野兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个人的心中都潜藏着怪物。我们只是认为文明已将之驯服。」\\n～连结点看守尤菲米娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d24248-29af-4f26-ad64-f1f0827cb0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 521205}, \'multiverseid\': 521205}, {\'name\': \'體內野獸\', \'text\': \'消滅目標永久物。其操控者派出一個3/3綠色野獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每個人的心中都潛藏著怪物。我們只是認為文明已將之馴服。」\\n～連結點看守尤菲米婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8046ca94-06b5-492c-a5d1-d64b4f6f6c12\', \'multiverseId\': 521453}, \'multiverseid\': 521453}]', "[{'name': 'Dreifachtitan', 'text': 'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Dreifachtitan stirbt, erzeuge einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit und einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518546&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3334ef6a-598c-4581-9267-276f0a5f0f09', 'multiverseId': 518546}, 'multiverseid': 518546}, {'name': 'Titán triplicado', 'text': 'Vuela, vigilancia, arrolla.\\nCuando el Titán triplicado muera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3 con la habilidad de volar, una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3 con la habilidad de vigilancia y una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3 con la habilidad de arrollar.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518617&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79da82e0-66ba-41cd-84d6-0d0ee0fa4f37', 'multiverseId': 518617}, 'multiverseid': 518617}, {'name': 'Titan triplet', 'text': 'Vol, vigilance, piétinement\\nQuand le Titan triplet meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem avec le vol, un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem avec la vigilance et un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem avec le piétinement.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518688&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f136c978-d33d-4a13-a0d8-0aed4185e245', 'multiverseId': 518688}, 'multiverseid': 518688}, {'name': 'Titano Triplice', 'text': 'Volare, cautela, travolgere\\nQuando il Titano Triplice muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore con volare, una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore con cautela e una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore con travolgere.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518759&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e910c0bd-47dc-474d-b5c2-a03a96166470', 'multiverseId': 518759}, 'multiverseid': 518759}, {'name': '三重合身のタイタン', 'text': '飛行、警戒、トランプル\\n三重合身のタイタンが死亡したとき、飛行を持つ無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体と、警戒を持つ無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体と、トランプルを持つ無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518830&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caf6c78f-3bc7-4cf5-8b17-1703d8ab3f5b', 'multiverseId': 518830}, 'multiverseid': 518830}, {'name': 'Titã Triplicado', 'text': 'Voar, vigilância, atropelar\\nQuando Titã Triplicado morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Golem incolor 3/3 com voar, uma ficha de criatura artefato Golem incolor 3/3 com vigilância e uma ficha de criatura artefato Golem incolor 3/3 com atropelar.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518901&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9060d211-0330-4ac4-95eb-e6504b70d81d', 'multiverseId': 518901}, 'multiverseid': 518901}, {'name': 'Титан Утроения', 'text': 'Полет, Бдительность, Пробивной удар\\nКогда Титан Утроения умирает, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 3/3 бесцветный Голем с Полетом, одну фишку артефакта существа 3/3 бесцветный Голем с Бдительностью и одну фишку артефакта существа 3/3 бесцветный Голем с Пробивным ударом.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Голем', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518972&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '469ecc50-abac-4ab0-9d0b-8e575fb21e98', 'multiverseId': 518972}, 'multiverseid': 518972}, {'name': '三联泰坦', 'text': '飞行，警戒，践踏\\n当三联泰坦死去时，派出一个3/3无色、具飞行的魔像衍生神器生物，一个3/3无色、具警戒的魔像衍生神器生物和一个3/3无色、具践踏的魔像衍生神器生物。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519043&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2f97d4a-17b9-4f59-ba30-eab2e68760ad', 'multiverseId': 519043}, 'multiverseid': 519043}, {'name': '三聯泰坦', 'text': '飛行，警戒，踐踏\\n當三聯泰坦死去時，派出一個3/3無色、具飛行的魔像衍生神器生物，一個3/3無色、具警戒的魔像衍生神器生物和一個3/3無色、具踐踏的魔像衍生神器生物。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519114&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1b91421-84df-4ef8-bb6b-944701cf2166', 'multiverseId': 519114}, 'multiverseid': 519114}]", "[{'name': 'Dreifachtitan', 'text': 'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Dreifachtitan stirbt, erzeuge einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit und einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521755&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cd0a507-8451-40a8-84f6-1ec212b7c674', 'multiverseId': 521755}, 'multiverseid': 521755}, {'name': 'Titán triplicado', 'text': 'Vuela, vigilancia, arrolla.\\nCuando el Titán triplicado muera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3 con la habilidad de volar, una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3 con la habilidad de vigilancia y una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3 con la habilidad de arrollar.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521835&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20b7d13a-bd1e-4576-a164-11990e56b0dd', 'multiverseId': 521835}, 'multiverseid': 521835}, {'name': 'Titan triplet', 'text': 'Vol, vigilance, piétinement\\nQuand le Titan triplet meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem avec le vol, un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem avec la vigilance et un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem avec le piétinement.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521915&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7745cd9e-b782-44e9-b59f-6130afa07a0b', 'multiverseId': 521915}, 'multiverseid': 521915}, {'name': 'Titano Triplice', 'text': 'Volare, cautela, travolgere\\nQuando il Titano Triplice muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore con volare, una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore con cautela e una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore con travolgere.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521995&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb7a6f00-5927-4208-a20b-ebd3062adc29', 'multiverseId': 521995}, 'multiverseid': 521995}, {'name': '三重合身のタイタン', 'text': '飛行、警戒、トランプル\\n三重合身のタイタンが死亡したとき、飛行を持つ無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体と、警戒を持つ無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体と、トランプルを持つ無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522075&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34e008df-7e72-457f-bdc7-090889447b21', 'multiverseId': 522075}, 'multiverseid': 522075}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dreiste Umformer\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Artefaktkarte aufdeckst. Bringe sie ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Die Dreisten Umformer fügen dir Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl der auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2189fa6-8e27-4465-84e9-1efb3189e4bf\', \'multiverseId\': 518514}, \'multiverseid\': 518514}, {\'name\': \'Remodeladoras audaces\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de artefacto. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Las Remodeladoras audaces te hacen una cantidad de daño igual a la cantidad de cartas mostradas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f3b0eb-2ecb-4920-a2bc-ead4f5e33a12\', \'multiverseId\': 518585}, \'multiverseid\': 518585}, {\'name\': \'Reforgeuses audacieuses\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte d\'artefact. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Les Reforgeuses audacieuses vous infligent un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes révélées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518656&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b592479a-fedd-4c98-b30a-22ab5420246b\', \'multiverseId\': 518656}, \'multiverseid\': 518656}, {\'name\': \'Riplasmatrici Audaci\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta artefatto. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Le Riplasmatrici Audaci ti infliggono danno pari al numero di carte rivelate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22442c1-4b25-424a-a114-8479de25e9d4\', \'multiverseId\': 518727}, \'multiverseid\': 518727}, {\'name\': \'大胆な再製者\', \'text\': \'{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを戦場に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。大胆な再製者はあなたに、これにより公開されたカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b0138c-c23c-4eb0-b0b9-2f9af49ab6d4\', \'multiverseId\': 518798}, \'multiverseid\': 518798}, {\'name\': \'Remoldadoras Audaciosas\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique um artefato: Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de artefato. Coloque aquele card no campo de batalha e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória. Remoldadoras Audaciosas causa a você uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards revelados desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb4b5f0d-a67b-4d38-ba5d-4837d8b0d504\', \'multiverseId\': 518869}, \'multiverseid\': 518869}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкие Преобразовательницы\', \'text\': \'{T}, пожертвуйте артефакт: показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки, пока вы не покажете карту артефакта. Положите ту карту на поле битвы, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке. Дерзкие Преобразовательницы наносят вам повреждения, равные количеству карт, показанных таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85fbff63-0325-41ec-8245-3ecb254b06b5\', \'multiverseId\': 518940}, \'multiverseid\': 518940}, {\'name\': \'斗胆重塑师\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲一个神器：从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张神器牌为止。将该牌放进战场，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。斗胆重塑师对你造成等同于以此法所展示之牌数量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'128216a2-423d-4a6a-bd3b-b38394a21bd6\', \'multiverseId\': 519011}, \'multiverseid\': 519011}, {\'name\': \'斗膽重塑師\', \'text\': \'{T}，犧牲一個神器：從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張神器牌為止。將該牌放進戰場，其餘則以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。斗膽重塑師對你造成等同於以此法所展示之牌數量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27633fa5-3e87-4251-a5b1-cdedc3623721\', \'multiverseId\': 519082}, \'multiverseid\': 519082}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dreiste Umformer\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Artefaktkarte aufdeckst. Bringe sie ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Die Dreisten Umformer fügen dir Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl der auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215c172a-3fba-40e5-815a-4fd06c462cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 521723}, \'multiverseid\': 521723}, {\'name\': \'Remodeladoras audaces\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de artefacto. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Las Remodeladoras audaces te hacen una cantidad de daño igual a la cantidad de cartas mostradas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ab111f-595d-4adb-9f78-fc41bc2ac33d\', \'multiverseId\': 521803}, \'multiverseid\': 521803}, {\'name\': \'Reforgeuses audacieuses\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte d\'artefact. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Les Reforgeuses audacieuses vous infligent un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes révélées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe6f8fa-e74c-445c-8ba6-732ff8c1a4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 521883}, \'multiverseid\': 521883}, {\'name\': \'Riplasmatrici Audaci\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta artefatto. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Le Riplasmatrici Audaci ti infliggono danno pari al numero di carte rivelate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd70c270-03b6-4c5c-96d6-31968516cdf2\', \'multiverseId\': 521963}, \'multiverseid\': 521963}, {\'name\': \'大胆な再製者\', \'text\': \'{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを戦場に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。大胆な再製者はあなたに、これにより公開されたカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54c4666-2aa9-4bfc-b8d7-31044a17b87b\', \'multiverseId\': 522043}, \'multiverseid\': 522043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druidentasche\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Falls es weder eine Länderkarte noch eine Kreaturenkarte ist, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1613fd15-4004-4213-93ce-d74e38a575be\', \'multiverseId\': 519524}, \'multiverseid\': 519524}, {\'name\': \'Saco druídico\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1. Si es una carta de tierra, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla bajo tu control. Si es una carta que no sea tierra ni criatura, ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2944ed48-f542-4338-b388-4a028d9f1de6\', \'multiverseId\': 519772}, \'multiverseid\': 519772}, {\'name\': \'Sacoche druidique\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Si c\'est une carte non-créature non-terrain, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520020&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8c2e699-3d4a-463f-8de6-f1a1829942bb\', \'multiverseId\': 520020}, \'multiverseid\': 520020}, {\'name\': \'Borsa del Druido\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura, crea una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde. Se è una carta terra, mettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. Se è una carta non creatura, non terra, guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8195c103-75b5-4aef-aa82-42174615e64f\', \'multiverseId\': 520268}, \'multiverseid\': 520268}, {\'name\': \'ドルイドの物入れ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それが土地カードであるなら、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それがクリーチャーでも土地でもないカードであるなら、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3e3bd5-1564-48d7-ba2c-1cdb55f7da8d\', \'multiverseId\': 520516}, \'multiverseid\': 520516}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa Druídica\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura, crie uma ficha de criatura Saprófita verde 1/1. Se for um card de terreno, coloque-o no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Se não for um card de criatura nem de terreno, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b8abdef-ca07-492d-af28-9bc804b9c6aa\', \'multiverseId\': 520764}, \'multiverseid\': 520764}, {\'name\': \'Сумка Друида\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта существа, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг. Если это карта земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Если это карта, не являющаяся ни существом, ни землей, вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244c123f-eae9-4003-a45e-0953f1822786\', \'multiverseId\': 521012}, \'multiverseid\': 521012}, {\'name\': \'德鲁伊背包\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：展示你的牌库顶牌。如果它是生物牌，则派出一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。如果它是地牌，则将该牌在你的操控下放进战场。如果它是非生物且非地的牌，则你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11c2c63-9530-40d7-8b3b-96e8dcc31b39\', \'multiverseId\': 521260}, \'multiverseid\': 521260}, {\'name\': \'德魯伊背包\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：展示你的牌庫頂牌。如果它是生物牌，則派出一個1/1綠色腐生物衍生生物。如果它是地牌，則將該牌在你的操控下放進戰場。如果它是非生物且非地的牌，則你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42dee6c-c24c-4e09-adb5-7e73ea5992a7\', \'multiverseId\': 521508}, \'multiverseid\': 521508}]', "[{'name': 'Dschungellichtung', 'text': 'Die Dschungellichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dschungellichtung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519578&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aba4999b-13c5-47da-bb35-66f70057e371', 'multiverseId': 519578}, 'multiverseid': 519578}, {'name': 'Hondonada selvática', 'text': 'La Hondonada selvática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Hondonada selvática entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519826&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87673bab-8b93-46f3-be18-e2e033b11694', 'multiverseId': 519826}, 'multiverseid': 519826}, {'name': 'Dépression de jungle', 'text': 'La Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520074&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ec82531-65dd-4b6f-9b7e-8f92f2edbaa1', 'multiverseId': 520074}, 'multiverseid': 520074}, {'name': 'Conca nella Giungla', 'text': 'La Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520322&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2170d080-dc2e-4dca-8f0c-10e04639459f', 'multiverseId': 520322}, 'multiverseid': 520322}, {'name': 'ジャングルのうろ穴', 'text': 'ジャングルのうろ穴はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジャングルのうろ穴が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520570&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3fee6f3-7a42-44b5-8ac9-a5092da2e428', 'multiverseId': 520570}, 'multiverseid': 520570}, {'name': 'Clareira na Selva', 'text': 'Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520818&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ce86eef-7e61-4dc3-9e64-b25d6d2aa780', 'multiverseId': 520818}, 'multiverseid': 520818}, {'name': 'Лощина в Джунглях', 'text': 'Лощина в Джунглях выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Лощина в Джунглях выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521066&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a19402fe-a19f-4a1b-b349-6f1e4275cf56', 'multiverseId': 521066}, 'multiverseid': 521066}, {'name': '丛林幽谷', 'text': '丛林幽谷须横置进战场。\\n当丛林幽谷进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521314&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '173a8895-2d6b-4045-ba2c-5c4b943d16f8', 'multiverseId': 521314}, 'multiverseid': 521314}, {'name': '叢林幽谷', 'text': '叢林幽谷須橫置進戰場。\\n當叢林幽谷進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521562&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae461f72-3ffd-45a3-bb98-f6ae488d3dfa', 'multiverseId': 521562}, 'multiverseid': 521562}]", '[{\'name\': \'Duplikant\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Wenn der Duplikant ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken.\\nSolange eine Karte, die mit dem Duplikanten ins Exil geschickt wurde, eine Kreaturenkarte ist, hat der Duplikant Stärke, Widerstandskraft und Kreaturentypen der letzten Kreaturenkarte, die mit dem Duplikanten ins Exil geschickt wurde. Er ist immer noch ein Gestaltwandler.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad972aff-3396-46c8-b16e-6c47915d5636\', \'multiverseId\': 519525}, \'multiverseid\': 519525}, {\'name\': \'Duplicante\', \'text\': \'Estampa — Cuando el Duplicante entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo que no sea ficha.\\nMientras la carta exiliada con el Duplicante sea una carta de criatura, el Duplicante tiene la fuerza, resistencia y tipos de criatura de la última criatura exiliada con el Duplicante. Sigue siendo un metamorfo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2fc0251-b71f-46cb-9a58-8b5459ed19af\', \'multiverseId\': 519773}, \'multiverseid\': 519773}, {\'name\': \'Répliquant\', \'text\': "Empreinte — Quand le Répliquant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une créature non-jeton ciblée.\\nTant que la carte exilée par le Répliquant est une carte de créature, le Répliquant a la force, l\'endurance et les types de créature de la dernière carte de créature exilée par le Répliquant. C\'est toujours un changeforme.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520021&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9630d3d-e765-418b-ade8-3d95c1348c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 520021}, \'multiverseid\': 520021}, {\'name\': \'Replicatore\', \'text\': "Imprimere — Quando il Replicatore entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare una creatura non pedina bersaglio.\\nFintanto che una carta esiliata con il Replicatore è una carta creatura, il Replicatore ha la forza, la costituzione e i tipi di creatura dell\'ultima carta creatura esiliata con il Replicatore. È ancora un Polimorfo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894ee949-12a7-4a26-bfd2-5e175e495ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 520269}, \'multiverseid\': 520269}, {\'name\': \'映し身人形\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 映し身人形が戦場に出たとき、トークンでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\nクリーチャー・カードが映し身人形によって追放されているかぎり、映し身人形は、映し身人形によって最後に追放されたクリーチャー・カードのパワーとタフネスとクリーチャー・タイプを持つ。これは多相の戦士でもある。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3401c90-ce98-4f02-b44d-58d3f77fabc1\', \'multiverseId\': 520517}, \'multiverseid\': 520517}, {\'name\': \'Duplicante\', \'text\': \'Estampar — Quando Duplicante entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar a criatura alvo não ficha.\\nEnquanto um card exilado com Duplicante for um card de criatura, Duplicante terá o poder, a resistência e todos os tipos de criatura do último card de criatura exilado com Duplicante. Ele ainda é um Metamorfo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e04f1ba-7942-4bde-8d67-15ed2058a6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 520765}, \'multiverseid\': 520765}, {\'name\': \'Дубликант\', \'text\': \'Отпечаток — Когда Дубликант выходит на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать целевое не являющееся фишкой существо.\\nПока изгнанная Дубликантом карта является картой существа, Дубликант имеет силу, выносливость и типы существа последней карты существа, изгнанной Дубликантом. При этом он остается Имитатором.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e5705a-e0c7-4fae-a48e-16801ca4ffeb\', \'multiverseId\': 521013}, \'multiverseid\': 521013}, {\'name\': \'窃形兽\', \'text\': \'压印～当窃形兽进战场时，你可以放逐目标非衍生物的生物。\\n只要以窃形兽放逐的某张牌是生物牌，窃形兽便具有以窃形兽放逐之最后一张生物牌的力量、防御力和生物类别。它仍然是变形兽。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ce05ae-17d2-4dd9-9544-42cd826074df\', \'multiverseId\': 521261}, \'multiverseid\': 521261}, {\'name\': \'竊形獸\', \'text\': \'壓印～當竊形獸進戰場時，你可以放逐目標非衍生物的生物。\\n只要以竊形獸放逐的某張牌是生物牌，竊形獸便具有以竊形獸放逐之最後一張生物牌的力量、防禦力和生物類別。它仍然是變形獸。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f99b0f02-f9ad-413f-ab53-d864ebb9e9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 521509}, \'multiverseid\': 521509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerweide die Essenzseherin\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Bestimme eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf sie, wie du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten oder verloren hast, je nachdem, welche Zahl größer ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dryade, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518322&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa504d3f-d08c-461b-9316-29d5ed0d0126\', \'multiverseId\': 518322}, \'multiverseid\': 518322}, {\'name\': \'Sauceocaso, vidente de la esencia\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Elige otra criatura objetivo. Pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno o la cantidad de vidas que perdiste este turno, la que sea mayor. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida dríada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c99fefde-93c4-46ce-a85c-f73ea59d9ded\', \'multiverseId\': 518332}, \'multiverseid\': 518332}, {\'name\': "Saulebrune, voyante de l\'essence", \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Choisissez une autre créature ciblée. Mettez sur elle un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci ou au nombre de points de vie que vous avez perdu ce tour-ci, selon le plus élevé des deux. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dryade et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518342&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f739f8-2306-4327-a0e9-935642235820\', \'multiverseId\': 518342}, \'multiverseid\': 518342}, {\'name\': "Salicacea, Veggente dell\'Essenza", \'text\': "{1}, {T}: Scegli un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Metti su di essa un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari all\'ammontare dei punti vita che hai guadagnato o dei punti vita che hai perso in questo turno, a seconda di quale numero sia maggiore. Attiva solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Driade\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e203e7cc-dddf-4f61-959d-0e0a073bf7a1\', \'multiverseId\': 518352}, \'multiverseid\': 518352}, {\'name\': \'本質の予見者、ウィロウダスク\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：これ以外のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に、このターンにあなたが得たライフの点数かこのターンにあなたが失ったライフの点数、どちらか大きい方に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドライアド・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea4e2731-6858-4430-8edc-35e4591b33d1\', \'multiverseId\': 518362}, \'multiverseid\': 518362}, {\'name\': \'Salgueirumbra, Vidente da Essência\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Escolha outra criatura alvo. Coloque nela um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual à quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno ou à quantidade de pontos de vida que você perdeu neste turno, o que for maior. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dríade Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8d02a8-aeb4-4f0e-a561-c245ceca2f69\', \'multiverseId\': 518372}, \'multiverseid\': 518372}, {\'name\': \'Ивохмарь, Провидица Сущности\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: выберите другое целевое существо. Положите на него жетоны +1/+1, количество которых равняется количеству жизней, полученных вами в этом ходу, или количеству жизней, потерянных вами в этом ходу, в зависимости от того, какое значение больше. Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дриада Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01122081-3fd7-4013-8c20-0a14f1e5c61e\', \'multiverseId\': 518382}, \'multiverseid\': 518382}, {\'name\': \'菁华预言师柳霞\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：选择另一个目标生物。在其上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于「你本回合中曾获得的生命」与「你本回合中曾失去的生命」两者间数量较大者。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～树灵／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a4e6c5-73c6-4fc8-8458-37b29668e71a\', \'multiverseId\': 518392}, \'multiverseid\': 518392}, {\'name\': \'菁華預言師柳霞\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：選擇另一個目標生物。在其上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於「你本回合中曾獲得的生命」與「你本回合中曾失去的生命」兩者間數量較大者。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～樹靈德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4cf9bcb-6a4a-4dbc-bb49-55073a162d97\', \'multiverseId\': 518402}, \'multiverseid\': 518402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerweide die Essenzseherin\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Bestimme eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf sie, wie du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten oder verloren hast, je nachdem, welche Zahl größer ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dryade, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521682&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16337e02-20cf-46af-a491-4bc1b1433730\', \'multiverseId\': 521682}, \'multiverseid\': 521682}, {\'name\': \'Sauceocaso, vidente de la esencia\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Elige otra criatura objetivo. Pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno o la cantidad de vidas que perdiste este turno, la que sea mayor. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida dríada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59932acf-0c3c-405a-830e-1ae19789a727\', \'multiverseId\': 521762}, \'multiverseid\': 521762}, {\'name\': "Saulebrune, voyante de l\'essence", \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Choisissez une autre créature ciblée. Mettez sur elle un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci ou au nombre de points de vie que vous avez perdu ce tour-ci, selon le plus élevé des deux. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dryade et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ab3aeb-d25c-4a03-8b25-196136aab18b\', \'multiverseId\': 521842}, \'multiverseid\': 521842}, {\'name\': "Salicacea, Veggente dell\'Essenza", \'text\': "{1}, {T}: Scegli un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Metti su di essa un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari all\'ammontare dei punti vita che hai guadagnato o dei punti vita che hai perso in questo turno, a seconda di quale numero sia maggiore. Attiva solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Driade\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a4f69c-dc0f-459a-b4ea-f6cac39fc5bc\', \'multiverseId\': 521922}, \'multiverseid\': 521922}, {\'name\': \'本質の予見者、ウィロウダスク\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：これ以外のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に、このターンにあなたが得たライフの点数かこのターンにあなたが失ったライフの点数、どちらか大きい方に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドライアド・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5522107e-3549-4f33-a1b5-689234d6b69d\', \'multiverseId\': 522002}, \'multiverseid\': 522002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblick des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht X Karten plus eine zusätzliche Karte für jedes Mal, das er in dieser Partie einen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Kein noch so umfangreiches Einzelstudium kann die Betreuung durch einen Meister ersetzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518490&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4643e83d-124f-4517-9e95-204890d522c2\', \'multiverseId\': 518490}, \'multiverseid\': 518490}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de comandante\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba X cartas más una carta adicional por cada vez que lanzó un comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Por más que estudies en solitario, no hay nada como la tutela de un maestro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5e658f-0294-4672-9b9c-2a42968be8f3\', \'multiverseId\': 518561}, \'multiverseid\': 518561}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité du commandant\', \'text\': "Un joueur ciblé pioche X cartes plus une carte supplémentaire pour chaque fois qu\'il a lancé un commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'étude solitaire, même intensive, ne saurait remplacer la tutelle d\'un maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518632&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0565dfed-e0d3-4bdb-a027-de6a4affac7f\', \'multiverseId\': 518632}, \'multiverseid\': 518632}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione del Comandante\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca X carte più una carta addizionale per ogni volta che ha lanciato un comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Un\'eternità di studio autonomo non può sostituire l\'insegnamento di un maestro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3259f990-2bfb-4ad9-93de-5452f1c060cf\', \'multiverseId\': 518703}, \'multiverseid\': 518703}, {\'name\': \'統率者の眼識\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、Xに、このゲームで自分が統率領域から統率者を唱えた回数を足した枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'どれだけ一人で研究しようとも、師の助言には代えられない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d02ee7-4c00-423c-95b1-326ed073095f\', \'multiverseId\': 518774}, \'multiverseid\': 518774}, {\'name\': \'Visão do Comandante\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra X cards mais um card adicional para cada vez em que conjurou um comandante da zona de comando neste jogo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhuma quantidade de estudos solitários consegue substituir a tutoria de um mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a35576-167f-4c84-b6d6-079fa8e17305\', \'multiverseId\': 518845}, \'multiverseid\': 518845}, {\'name\': \'Проницательность Командира\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок берет X карт плюс одну дополнительную карту за каждый раз, когда он разыгрывал командира из зоны командования в этой партии.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Никакое самостоятельное обучение не может заменить уроки наставника.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de053de-d15c-423f-90e3-cfee6ec539cf\', \'multiverseId\': 518916}, \'multiverseid\': 518916}, {\'name\': \'指挥官洞察\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓X张牌，且其本盘游戏中每从统帅区施放过一次指挥官，便再抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'再努力闭门苦读，也不及大师提点。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b778b3f-26a6-4217-9c59-351b7910e787\', \'multiverseId\': 518987}, \'multiverseid\': 518987}, {\'name\': \'指揮官洞察\', \'text\': \'目標玩家抽X張牌，且其本盤遊戲中每從統帥區施放過一次指揮官，便再抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'再努力閉門苦讀，也不及大師提點。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b3353d-eabc-4b77-a43c-fc8f46c1ff83\', \'multiverseId\': 519058}, \'multiverseid\': 519058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblick des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht X Karten plus eine zusätzliche Karte für jedes Mal, das er in dieser Partie einen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'407af368-337b-41bb-8989-04a0d5f79574\', \'multiverseId\': 521699}, \'multiverseid\': 521699}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de comandante\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba X cartas más una carta adicional por cada vez que lanzó un comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a6e09ce-fca6-49ba-9b28-2b8d4b7a5185\', \'multiverseId\': 521779}, \'multiverseid\': 521779}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité du commandant\', \'text\': "Un joueur ciblé pioche X cartes plus une carte supplémentaire pour chaque fois qu\'il a lancé un commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'026c9158-c19a-40ba-b571-018abd3b9ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 521859}, \'multiverseid\': 521859}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione del Comandante\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca X carte più una carta addizionale per ogni volta che ha lanciato un comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda0cbb8-ab45-4d66-9aea-6544b1f270c1\', \'multiverseId\': 521939}, \'multiverseid\': 521939}, {\'name\': \'統率者の眼識\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、Xに、このゲームで自分が統率領域から統率者を唱えた回数を足した枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f5bd2b-b671-4b9b-917f-83f541f2dfcb\', \'multiverseId\': 522019}, \'multiverseid\': 522019}]', "[{'name': 'Einsame Sandbank', 'text': 'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519581&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62feebcf-381e-4ff8-b820-a47e1b82d1da', 'multiverseId': 519581}, 'multiverseid': 519581}, {'name': 'Banco de arena solitario', 'text': 'El Banco de arena solitario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519829&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f8d5a44-462e-4919-a7c9-44c963b367de', 'multiverseId': 519829}, 'multiverseid': 519829}, {'name': 'Banc de sable isolé', 'text': 'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520077&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45416858-8fe7-4a4c-8d07-cb3ead2d7c83', 'multiverseId': 520077}, 'multiverseid': 520077}, {'name': 'Secca Solitaria', 'text': 'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520325&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bdea1e8-f776-4730-aca3-3a1d353354d2', 'multiverseId': 520325}, 'multiverseid': 520325}, {'name': '孤立した砂州', 'text': '孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520573&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e96fe57d-c8c8-40f1-b26f-48aaadb3aa12', 'multiverseId': 520573}, 'multiverseid': 520573}, {'name': 'Banco de Areia Isolado', 'text': 'Banco de Areia Isolado entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520821&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43724d22-be94-4b31-8f08-8c17fd8aad6a', 'multiverseId': 520821}, 'multiverseid': 520821}, {'name': 'Одинокая Отмель', 'text': 'Одинокая Отмель выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521069&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f89db9ea-cf77-4b21-b284-52701efc36f7', 'multiverseId': 521069}, 'multiverseid': 521069}, {'name': '孤绝沙洲', 'text': '孤绝沙洲须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521317&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '857ea9d6-f82d-46d9-874c-86c153bc05f9', 'multiverseId': 521317}, 'multiverseid': 521317}, {'name': '孤絕沙洲', 'text': '孤絕沙洲須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n循環{U}（{U}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521565&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10fba74f-566d-4457-8069-90204cb7a4ca', 'multiverseId': 521565}, 'multiverseid': 521565}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elixier der Unsterblichkeit\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Du erhältst 5 Lebenspunkte dazu. Mische das Elixier der Unsterblichkeit und deinen Friedhof in die Bibliothek ihrer Besitzer.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Abgefülltes Leben. Nicht so lecker, wie ich es gerne mag, sondern abgestanden, aber es hat den gleichen Effekt."\\n—Baron Sengir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0661f3be-5dff-4645-86ae-a520b709cdb3\', \'multiverseId\': 519526}, \'multiverseid\': 519526}, {\'name\': \'Elixir de inmortalidad\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Ganas 5 vidas. Baraja el Elixir de inmortalidad y tu cementerio en la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Vida embotellada. No tan sabrosa como a la que estoy acostumbrado, más bien rancia, pero tiene el mismo efecto".\\n—Barón Sengir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b67938-c899-4853-a5ef-d4b95facc1be\', \'multiverseId\': 519774}, \'multiverseid\': 519774}, {\'name\': "Élixir d\'immortalité", \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Vous gagnez 5 points de vie. Mélangez l\'Élixir d\'immortalité et votre cimetière dans la bibliothèque de leur propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La vie en bouteille. Certes moins goûteux que ce à quoi je suis habitué, un peu rance, mais l\'effet est le même. »\\n—Baron Sengir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520022&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec9ac8cd-5cd2-4ecc-bbc3-d81e80ca7cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 520022}, \'multiverseid\': 520022}, {\'name\': "Elisir dell\'Immortalità", \'text\': "{2}, {T}: Guadagni 5 punti vita. Rimescola l\'Elisir dell\'Immortalità e il tuo cimitero nei grimori dei rispettivi proprietari.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Vita in bottiglia. Non così saporita come al solito, piuttosto stantia, ma ha lo stesso effetto."\\n—Barone Sengir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1031b1bb-018d-49a4-bb2f-5878c057209f\', \'multiverseId\': 520270}, \'multiverseid\': 520270}, {\'name\': \'不死の霊薬\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたは５点のライフを得る。不死の霊薬とあなたの墓地を、オーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「瓶詰めの生命だ。かつてほど美味ではないし、むしろ味気ないが、効果は変わらぬ。」\\n――センギア男爵\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c65f93-9de1-4f4a-b611-054a633eb8d5\', \'multiverseId\': 520518}, \'multiverseid\': 520518}, {\'name\': \'Elixir da Imortalidade\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Você ganha 5 pontos de vida. Embaralhe Elixir da Imortalidade e seu cemitério no grimório de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Vida engarrafada. Não é tão saborosa quanto aquela a que estou acostumado, é um pouco rançosa... mas tem o mesmo efeito."\\n— Barão Sengir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe7f939-d19a-46bf-9d19-ad6f8fa9fc02\', \'multiverseId\': 520766}, \'multiverseid\': 520766}, {\'name\': \'Эликсир Бессмертия\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: вы получаете 5 жизней. Втасуйте Эликсир Бессмертия и ваше кладбище в библиотеку их владельца.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Хм, жизнь из бутылки. Не так вкусно, как обычно, немного затхлый привкус, но эффект тот же самый».\\n— Барон Сенгир\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bdd40d8-4640-4f3a-826c-898f402f29b8\', \'multiverseId\': 521014}, \'multiverseid\': 521014}, {\'name\': \'永生琼浆\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：你获得5点生命。将永生琼浆与你的坟墓场洗入其拥有者的牌库。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「瓶装的生命。风味不太如我意，也不新鲜，但起码功效相同。」\\n～辛格男爵\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acea0c9f-0750-4b64-9e9f-177c5e498cde\', \'multiverseId\': 521262}, \'multiverseid\': 521262}, {\'name\': \'永生瓊漿\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：你獲得5點生命。將永生瓊漿與你的墳墓場洗入其擁有者的牌庫。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「瓶裝的生命。風味不太如我意，也不新鮮，但起碼功效相同。」\\n～辛格男爵\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6710da63-8384-4f80-ab64-20cb51a88482\', \'multiverseId\': 521510}, \'multiverseid\': 521510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Reinheit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Reinheit ins Spiel kommt, kannst du bis zu drei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl aus dem Spiel und/oder Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus Friedhöfen ins Exil schicken.\\nWenn der Engel der Reinheit das Spiel verlässt, bringe die ins Exil geschickten Karten auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b8870a-0f0a-4e2b-a183-7811c5434ae7\', \'multiverseId\': 519366}, \'multiverseid\': 519366}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de serenidad\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de serenidad entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar hasta otras tres criaturas del campo de batalla y/o cartas de criatura objetivo de los cementerios.\\nCuando el Ángel de serenidad deje el campo de batalla, regresa las cartas exiliadas a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961720ab-a499-4593-8a63-8adb78460bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 519614}, \'multiverseid\': 519614}, {\'name\': \'Ange de la sérénité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de la sérénité arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler jusqu\'à trois autres créatures ciblées du champ de bataille et/ou cartes de créature des cimetières.\\nQuand l\'Ange de la sérénité quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez les cartes exilées dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72bedd1-6256-4e02-ae16-8409de062055\', \'multiverseId\': 519862}, \'multiverseid\': 519862}, {\'name\': \'Angelo della Serenità\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo della Serenità entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare fino a tre altre creature bersaglio dal campo di battaglia e/o carte creatura dai cimiteri.\\nQuando l\'Angelo della Serenità lascia il campo di battaglia, fai tornare le carte esiliate in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4d27c8-ca28-4da8-9439-6a93229e439b\', \'multiverseId\': 520110}, \'multiverseid\': 520110}, {\'name\': \'静穏の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n静穏の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたは戦場からこれ以外のクリーチャーや墓地からクリーチャー・カード合わせて最大３つを対象とする。それらを追放してもよい。\\n静穏の天使が戦場を離れたとき、それらの追放されているカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdf0eac6-3c7f-43dc-a94f-e868f1a31aae\', \'multiverseId\': 520358}, \'multiverseid\': 520358}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Serenidade\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Serenidade entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar até três alvos entre outras criaturas no campo de batalha e/ou cards de criatura em cemitérios.\\nQuando Anjo da Serenidade deixar o campo de batalha, devolva os cards exilados para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f429850-148c-4077-845b-833bfa3f91b2\', \'multiverseId\': 520606}, \'multiverseid\': 520606}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Безмятежности\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Безмятежности выходит на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать до трех других целевых существ с поля битвы и/или карт существ из кладбищ.\\nКогда Ангел Безмятежности покидает поле битвы, верните изгнанные карты в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a57bd64-a366-46c6-b43b-04685039b57e\', \'multiverseId\': 520854}, \'multiverseid\': 520854}, {\'name\': \'清朗天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当清朗天使进战场时，选择若干其他目标战场上的生物和／或坟墓场中的生物牌，上述数量至多为三。你可以将它们从所在区域放逐。\\n当清朗天使离开战场时，将所放逐的牌移回各自拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e49fa29-8e91-4969-a840-3ad3681fb35a\', \'multiverseId\': 521102}, \'multiverseid\': 521102}, {\'name\': \'清朗天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當清朗天使進戰場時，選擇若干其他目標戰場上的生物和／或墳墓場中的生物牌，上述數量至多為三。你可以將它們從所在區域放逐。\\n當清朗天使離開戰場時，將所放逐的牌移回各自擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'640725a5-e34c-4f7f-8de4-1cba956f6951\', \'multiverseId\': 521350}, \'multiverseid\': 521350}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Ruinen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Ruinen ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu zwei Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e43c7a-bcb0-4ff8-971e-67526d0462c1\', \'multiverseId\': 518478}, \'multiverseid\': 518478}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de las ruinas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de las ruinas entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta dos artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5780595-3ab3-491e-9194-ebb208ed2d32\', \'multiverseId\': 518549}, \'multiverseid\': 518549}, {\'name\': \'Ange des ruines\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange des ruines arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à deux artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fac4cc29-099a-4e50-8438-f9e58fa3501d\', \'multiverseId\': 518620}, \'multiverseid\': 518620}, {\'name\': \'Angelo delle Rovine\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo delle Rovine entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a due artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32511cd6-3f4f-4267-8eea-4d86f0e3e4db\', \'multiverseId\': 518691}, \'multiverseid\': 518691}, {\'name\': \'遺跡の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n遺跡の天使が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャント、合わせて最大２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。\\n平地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29546444-23de-4ddf-8bc3-47cae0e64728\', \'multiverseId\': 518762}, \'multiverseid\': 518762}, {\'name\': \'Anjo das Ruínas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo das Ruínas entrar no campo de batalha, exile até dois artefatos e/ou encantamentos alvo.\\nReciclar planície {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc94df1-a650-4cb4-8dd3-166f2087c4dd\', \'multiverseId\': 518833}, \'multiverseid\': 518833}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Руин\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Руин выходит на поле битвы, изгоните не более двух целевых артефактов и/или чар.\\nЦикл Равнин {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb4e772-def5-4363-86ce-ccd7a53e724d\', \'multiverseId\': 518904}, \'multiverseid\': 518904}, {\'name\': \'遗迹天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当遗迹天使进战场时，放逐至多两个目标神器和／或结界。\\n循环平原{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f5c9eb-7de5-4c60-8661-0353e477bd86\', \'multiverseId\': 518975}, \'multiverseid\': 518975}, {\'name\': \'遺跡天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當遺跡天使進戰場時，放逐至多兩個目標神器和／或結界。\\n循環平原{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張平原牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659bb6a9-5c66-47fd-bbbc-02987d593743\', \'multiverseId\': 519046}, \'multiverseid\': 519046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Ruinen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Ruinen ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu zwei Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521687&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a42e282-bc43-45bd-b1b7-06be302a43d8\', \'multiverseId\': 521687}, \'multiverseid\': 521687}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de las ruinas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de las ruinas entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta dos artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc8a99b4-1e0c-4ea7-9854-330c4a3d696a\', \'multiverseId\': 521767}, \'multiverseid\': 521767}, {\'name\': \'Ange des ruines\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange des ruines arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à deux artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2}", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86986ed0-58b5-41bb-b8f0-cedf5cc92ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 521847}, \'multiverseid\': 521847}, {\'name\': \'Angelo delle Rovine\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo delle Rovine entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a due artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\\nCiclopianura {2}", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3458e2ab-50e0-4cef-9ed6-c11cf1c532af\', \'multiverseId\': 521927}, \'multiverseid\': 521927}, {\'name\': \'遺跡の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n遺跡の天使が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャント、合わせて最大２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。\\n平地サイクリング{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e14be844-5aeb-419d-9af0-e392825f0556\', \'multiverseId\': 522007}, \'multiverseid\': 522007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Episches Experiment\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon Spontanzauber und Hexereien mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfe98b8c-a4c0-484a-8882-6e2d07b914e8\', \'multiverseId\': 519499}, \'multiverseid\': 519499}, {\'name\': \'Experimento épico\', \'text\': \'Exilia las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas sin pagar sus costes de maná. Luego, pon en tu cementerio todas las cartas exiliadas de esta manera que no fueron lanzadas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58df981-6865-455c-a179-4ca5bb68bcc5\', \'multiverseId\': 519747}, \'multiverseid\': 519747}, {\'name\': \'Expérience épique\', \'text\': "Exilez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer leur coût de mana. Mettez ensuite toutes les cartes exilées de cette manière qui n\'ont pas été lancées dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519995&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e08c24-488e-42c4-a590-48e8658985d5\', \'multiverseId\': 519995}, \'multiverseid\': 519995}, {\'name\': \'Esperimento Epico\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare magie istantaneo e stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelte tra esse senza pagare il loro costo di mana. Poi metti nel tuo cimitero tutte le carte esiliate in questo modo che non sono state lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7da951-83a2-42ad-ab66-440c73f8ca32\', \'multiverseId\': 520243}, \'multiverseid\': 520243}, {\'name\': \'世紀の実験\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードＸ枚を追放する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下でインスタントやソーサリーである望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、これにより追放し唱えなかったすべてのカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c16409-7a0d-4928-ae67-9ff5bc93f9d6\', \'multiverseId\': 520491}, \'multiverseid\': 520491}, {\'name\': \'Experimento Épico\', \'text\': \'Exile os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode conjurar mágicas instantâneas e feitiços com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X dentre eles sem pagar seus custos de mana. Depois, coloque em seu cemitério todos os cards exilados dessa maneira que não tenham sido conjurados.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ebd8ec-71cc-488f-bf38-f6a42a3ef0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 520739}, \'multiverseid\': 520739}, {\'name\': \'Великий Эксперимент\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть находящиеся среди них мгновенные заклинания и заклинания волшебства с мановой ценностью не более X без уплаты их мана-стоимости. Затем положите все изгнанные таким образом карты, которые не были разыграны, на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cf0d5cd-c91b-440a-bb08-dc22c6e4e819\', \'multiverseId\': 520987}, \'multiverseid\': 520987}, {\'name\': \'壮绝实验\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以从其中施放法术力值等于或小于X的瞬间和法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e1add5c-f289-43fb-b307-1cb490c760d3\', \'multiverseId\': 521235}, \'multiverseid\': 521235}, {\'name\': \'壯絕實驗\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌庫頂的X張牌。你可以從其中施放魔法力值等於或小於X的瞬間和巫術咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。然後將所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fbf8b74-0cf5-4c01-be9f-bb089cfb2609\', \'multiverseId\': 521483}, \'multiverseid\': 521483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbe des Duellanten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen angreifen, kannst du eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges Doppelschlag erhalten lassen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die besten Techniken überdauern ihre Erfinder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c4695c6-991c-4fdd-be82-32840c65d0a7\', \'multiverseId\': 519373}, \'multiverseid\': 519373}, {\'name\': \'Legado del duelista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas ataquen, puedes hacer que la criatura atacante objetivo gane la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Las mejores técnicas sobreviven a sus creadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984fb185-4a25-498d-a372-bd25127cca88\', \'multiverseId\': 519621}, \'multiverseid\': 519621}, {\'name\': \'Héritage de duelliste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque, vous pouvez faire qu\'une créature attaquante ciblée acquière la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleures techniques survivent à leurs créateurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0aa2503-b03c-4661-8fae-d1dfa9f2505b\', \'multiverseId\': 519869}, \'multiverseid\': 519869}, {\'name\': \'Eredità del Duellante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano, puoi far guadagnare doppio attacco a una creatura attaccante bersaglio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le tecniche migliori sopravvivono ai loro inventori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2897c595-1ac0-4433-b377-97771293fe05\', \'multiverseId\': 520117}, \'multiverseid\': 520117}, {\'name\': \'決闘者の遺産\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体以上が攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'最高の技は、作り手亡き後も遺る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b73dacb-e01a-4d12-9107-dc4cbb590175\', \'multiverseId\': 520365}, \'multiverseid\': 520365}, {\'name\': \'Herança de Duelista\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas atacam, você pode fazer com que a criatura atacante alvo ganhe golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'As melhores técnicas sobrevivem a seus criadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252f05f2-319b-40b8-ae8a-5b2712b8fc4f\', \'multiverseId\': 520613}, \'multiverseid\': 520613}, {\'name\': \'Наследие Дуэлянта\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда одно или более существ атакуют, вы можете заставить целевое атакующее существо получить Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Лучшие стили переживают своих создателей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'948a0941-4cdb-4285-8953-ccca17f588ba\', \'multiverseId\': 520861}, \'multiverseid\': 520861}, {\'name\': \'斗客的遗产\', \'text\': \'每当一个或数个生物攻击时，你可以使目标进行攻击的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'最佳招式能流芳千古。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672454ee-7b5c-4f6f-82c8-aefa13d26c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 521109}, \'multiverseid\': 521109}, {\'name\': \'鬥客的遺產\', \'text\': \'每當一個或數個生物攻擊時，你可以使目標進行攻擊的生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'最佳招式能流芳千古。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246f3106-93e2-4576-905a-9b15a2466651\', \'multiverseId\': 521357}, \'multiverseid\': 521357}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519547&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de43f6aa-e3ad-4458-929b-fe1739a827ed', 'multiverseId': 519547}, 'multiverseid': 519547}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519795&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '779bf2aa-46b0-44c5-9f5b-7ef1db52f4e5', 'multiverseId': 519795}, 'multiverseid': 519795}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520043&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75ebf457-0cdd-4b1f-9f28-c1323b157161', 'multiverseId': 520043}, 'multiverseid': 520043}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520291&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc9f5210-0611-4c65-a59b-d45682819c34', 'multiverseId': 520291}, 'multiverseid': 520291}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520539&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18423a81-5cac-4778-9a22-7ca2126a666e', 'multiverseId': 520539}, 'multiverseid': 520539}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solene', 'text': 'Quando Simulacro Solene entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\\nQuando Simulacro Solene morre, você pode comprar um card.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520787&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57ca892a-02bc-422d-8797-5e35e8f17e37', 'multiverseId': 520787}, 'multiverseid': 520787}, {'name': 'Величественный Симулякр', 'text': 'Когда Величественный Симулякр выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\\nКогда Величественный Симулякр умирает, вы можете взять карту.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Голем', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521035&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a3307a3-c23c-457e-bbc1-9b3d02e155fc', 'multiverseId': 521035}, 'multiverseid': 521035}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '当黯色幻影进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n当黯色幻影死去时，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521283&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e2d4a27-2d64-42af-8a01-4a553da7752e', 'multiverseId': 521283}, 'multiverseid': 521283}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '當黯色幻影進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將該牌橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\\n當黯色幻影死去時，你可以抽一張牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521531&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc6beb0c-a724-48e3-a405-c40979fda061', 'multiverseId': 521531}, 'multiverseid': 521531}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erwecken der Vergangenheit\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Artefaktkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Gehören in ein Museum? Ich finde, die Relikte sollten selbst entscheiden, so sie hingehören!"\\n—Quintorius, Kundhort-Magiestudent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2e3c000-0e78-4f90-86ac-d04609133435\', \'multiverseId\': 518542}, \'multiverseid\': 518542}, {\'name\': \'Despertar el pasado\', \'text\': \'Regresa todas las cartas de artefacto de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Que deberían estar en un museo? ¡Creo que ya va siendo hora de dejar que las reliquias elijan dónde quieren estar!".\\n—Quintorius, estudiante de magia de Sapiéntium\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68b5be4-fa07-49f5-a294-3b94bc022b30\', \'multiverseId\': 518613}, \'multiverseid\': 518613}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller le passé\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes d\'artefact depuis votre cimetière. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Sa place est dans un musée ? Je crois que nous devrions laisser les reliques trouver la place qu\'elles veulent ! »\\n—Quintorius, mage-étudiant de Forsapience", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518684&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbfcde94-248f-4e10-997d-ae8fb09f01ec\', \'multiverseId\': 518684}, \'multiverseid\': 518684}, {\'name\': \'Risvegliare il Passato\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte artefatto dal tuo cimitero. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Pezzi da museo? Io credo che le reliquie meritino di andare dove vogliono!"\\n—Quintorius, studente-mago di Archeorocca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af10d21f-611e-44c4-b3d7-73508611a0c6\', \'multiverseId\': 518755}, \'multiverseid\': 518755}, {\'name\': \'過去起こし\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からすべてのアーティファクト・カードを戦場に戻す。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「博物館行きだって？遺物は遺物の望む場所に置くべきだろう！」\\n――ロアホールドの魔道生徒、クイントリウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf72637-a5d2-4ac8-b227-02bf021eb520\', \'multiverseId\': 518826}, \'multiverseid\': 518826}, {\'name\': \'Despertar o Passado\', \'text\': \'Devolva todos os cards de artefato de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Eles ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Museu? Eu acho que devíamos deixar as relíquias ficarem onde bem entendessem!"\\n— Quintorius, aluno-mago de Sapioforte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0106e8db-3b16-4880-b700-1a35d4becffd\', \'multiverseId\': 518897}, \'multiverseid\': 518897}, {\'name\': \'Разбудить Прошлое\', \'text\': \'Верните все карты артефактов из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Они получают Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ей место в музее, говорите? Я считаю, что мы должны позволить реликвиям самим выбирать, где их место!»\\n— Квинториус, студент магии с Лорхолда\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03452e81-3198-470e-8164-5ecd8dc61fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 518968}, \'multiverseid\': 518968}, {\'name\': \'唤醒过往\', \'text\': \'将所有神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「放进博物馆？我觉得我们应让遗宝去到它们自己想去的地方！」\\n～衡鉴修习法师昆托力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c205357-a37f-4233-be95-6e573586332d\', \'multiverseId\': 519039}, \'multiverseid\': 519039}, {\'name\': \'喚醒過往\', \'text\': \'將所有神器牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。它們獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「放進博物館？我覺得我們應讓遺寶去到它們自己想去的地方！」\\n～衡鑑修習法師昆托力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d0b464-32e4-4b2a-aa1f-d8747e57765e\', \'multiverseId\': 519110}, \'multiverseid\': 519110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwecken der Vergangenheit\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Artefaktkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521751&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25fdb56-7f75-49e4-a2a9-06aaf94040e6\', \'multiverseId\': 521751}, \'multiverseid\': 521751}, {\'name\': \'Despertar el pasado\', \'text\': \'Regresa todas las cartas de artefacto de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ceb7bd-f109-4c67-9e35-06c825fe5431\', \'multiverseId\': 521831}, \'multiverseid\': 521831}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller le passé\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes d\'artefact depuis votre cimetière. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0712ce88-1cad-44de-9847-1a5f445a0fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 521911}, \'multiverseid\': 521911}, {\'name\': \'Risvegliare il Passato\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte artefatto dal tuo cimitero. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63618ac-ef64-455a-97ff-6fd3882d9e33\', \'multiverseId\': 521991}, \'multiverseid\': 521991}, {\'name\': \'過去起こし\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からすべてのアーティファクト・カードを戦場に戻す。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24919ff-c45b-435b-a82c-ae3f16772548\', \'multiverseId\': 522071}, \'multiverseid\': 522071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Esix die Fraktalblüte\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDas erste Mal, das du in deinem Zug einen oder mehrere Spielsteine erzeugen würdest, kannst du stattdessen eine andere Kreatur als Esix die Fraktalblüte bestimmen und entsprechend viele Spielsteine erzeugen, die Kopien jener Kreatur sind.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Fraktalwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518326&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a942d77-7db6-492f-b019-4935a2ac70b8\', \'multiverseId\': 518326}, \'multiverseid\': 518326}, {\'name\': \'Ésix, flor de fractales\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa primera vez que fueras a crear una o más fichas durante cada uno de tus turnos, en vez de eso, puedes elegir una criatura que no sea Ésix, flor de fractales y crear esa misma cantidad de fichas que son copias de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Fractal\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08009fb4-2b9f-419b-8ad0-a9c577eb16a6\', \'multiverseId\': 518336}, \'multiverseid\': 518336}, {\'name\': \'Ésix, efflorescence fractale\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa première fois que vous devriez créer au moins un jeton pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez à la place choisir une créature autre qu\'Ésix, efflorescence fractale et créer autant de jetons qui sont des copies de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : fractale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518346&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e5ef76-be06-43df-b2e0-a27dba0f1161\', \'multiverseId\': 518346}, \'multiverseid\': 518346}, {\'name\': \'Esix, Germoglio dei Frattali\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa prima volta che stai per creare una o più pedine durante ogni tuo turno, puoi invece scegliere una creatura diversa da Esix, Germoglio dei Frattali e creare altrettante pedine che sono copie di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Frattale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0414ba3d-0fd3-4db5-b34e-5a4f7f1c97bc\', \'multiverseId\': 518356}, \'multiverseid\': 518356}, {\'name\': \'フラクタルの花、エシックス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの各ターンの間、あなたが最初にトークン１つ以上を生成するなら、あなたは代わりにフラクタルの花、エシックスでないクリーチャー１体を選び、そのクリーチャーのコピーである同じ数のトークンを生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フラクタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2378bed7-59b4-4adb-8e84-d167dd304aab\', \'multiverseId\': 518366}, \'multiverseid\': 518366}, {\'name\': \'Esix, Flor Fractal\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNa primeira vez em que você criaria uma ou mais fichas durante cada um de seus turnos, você pode, em vez disso, escolher uma criatura que não seja Esix, Flor Fractal, e criar aquela quantidade de fichas que sejam cópias daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fractal\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cca3e6d-77a7-4d28-9aa9-33dc7343e603\', \'multiverseId\': 518376}, \'multiverseid\': 518376}, {\'name\': \'Эзикс, Фрактальный Расцвет\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ первый раз, когда вы должны создать одну или несколько фишек во время каждого из ваших ходов, вместо этого вы можете выбрать существо, отличное от Эзикса, Фрактального Расцвета, и создать такое же количество фишек, являющихся копиями того существа.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Фрактал\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9acec20-f35f-435d-aa98-b5b6c713d2f9\', \'multiverseId\': 518386}, \'multiverseid\': 518386}, {\'name\': \'繁盛分灵埃席兹\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n于你的每个回合中你将首度派出一个或数个衍生物时，你可以改为选择繁盛分灵埃席兹以外的某生物，并派出为该生物复制品的衍生物，数量不变。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～分灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba00ba5-2ba8-44fd-a6e7-750820aa903b\', \'multiverseId\': 518396}, \'multiverseid\': 518396}, {\'name\': \'繁盛分靈埃席茲\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n於你的每個回合中你將首度派出一個或數個衍生物時，你可以改為選擇繁盛分靈埃席茲以外的某生物，並派出為該生物複製品的衍生物，數量不變。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～分靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92ec101-97d8-435a-9090-9bf631ed15c7\', \'multiverseId\': 518406}, \'multiverseid\': 518406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Esix die Fraktalblüte\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDas erste Mal, das du in deinem Zug einen oder mehrere Spielsteine erzeugen würdest, kannst du stattdessen eine andere Kreatur als Esix die Fraktalblüte bestimmen und entsprechend viele Spielsteine erzeugen, die Kopien jener Kreatur sind.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Fraktalwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521686&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed78375f-4dc3-43ea-9727-096655004136\', \'multiverseId\': 521686}, \'multiverseid\': 521686}, {\'name\': \'Ésix, flor de fractales\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa primera vez que fueras a crear una o más fichas durante cada uno de tus turnos, en vez de eso, puedes elegir una criatura que no sea Ésix, flor de fractales y crear esa misma cantidad de fichas que son copias de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Fractal\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b381c5-4f2e-49de-8f16-c43e564131fe\', \'multiverseId\': 521766}, \'multiverseid\': 521766}, {\'name\': \'Ésix, efflorescence fractale\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa première fois que vous devriez créer au moins un jeton pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez à la place choisir une créature autre qu\'Ésix, efflorescence fractale et créer autant de jetons qui sont des copies de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : fractale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849f0027-c302-4c70-990a-ca9162eff83f\', \'multiverseId\': 521846}, \'multiverseid\': 521846}, {\'name\': \'Esix, Germoglio dei Frattali\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa prima volta che stai per creare una o più pedine durante ogni tuo turno, puoi invece scegliere una creatura diversa da Esix, Germoglio dei Frattali e creare altrettante pedine che sono copie di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Frattale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6f11ee-4e50-41bf-9838-0671f9a954c8\', \'multiverseId\': 521926}, \'multiverseid\': 521926}, {\'name\': \'フラクタルの花、エシックス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの各ターンの間、あなたが最初にトークン１つ以上を生成するなら、あなたは「代わりにフラクタルの花、エシックスでないクリーチャー１体を選び、そのクリーチャーのコピーである同じ数のトークンを生成する。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フラクタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d07332-5716-4678-8407-7132964f5238\', \'multiverseId\': 522006}, \'multiverseid\': 522006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Etali der Ursturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Etali der Ursturm angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Der Sturm tobt und das Erdreich bricht auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519450&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e55128-c4bd-4cb0-9688-ec9049652404\', \'multiverseId\': 519450}, \'multiverseid\': 519450}, {\'name\': \'Etali, la Tempestad Primigenia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Etali, la Tempestad Primigenia ataque, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador. Luego puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre esas cartas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio anciano\', \'flavor\': \'La tormenta arrecia y la tierra se abre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7a165c-07ae-40ce-9dbb-6fc38f8fb778\', \'multiverseId\': 519698}, \'multiverseid\': 519698}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempête primordiale\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'Etali, Tempête primordiale attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur, puis vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': \'La tempête fait rage et la terre se brise.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d69c117-99b0-4346-b39c-2dd02e8c7a3c\', \'multiverseId\': 519946}, \'multiverseid\': 519946}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempesta Primordiale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Etali, Tempesta Primordiale attacca, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore, poi puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie scelte tra quelle carte senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'La tempesta infuria e la terra si sgretola.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa280153-327f-49a3-84de-de2a2e265708\', \'multiverseId\': 520194}, \'multiverseid\': 520194}, {\'name\': \'原初の嵐、エターリ\', \'text\': \'原初の嵐、エターリが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードをそれぞれ追放する。その後あなたは、それらのカードの中から望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'嵐が怒り大地が裂ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89bbce5a-adec-4ac2-bbef-25abb8b61aea\', \'multiverseId\': 520442}, \'multiverseid\': 520442}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tormenta Primordial\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Etali, Tormenta Primordial, atacar, exile o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador. Em seguida, você pode conjurar qualquer número de mágicas dentre aqueles cards sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dinossauro Ancião\', \'flavor\': \'À fúria da tormenta, a terra fende-se.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce268a5-a29a-41cb-94fb-6231551d5fdc\', \'multiverseId\': 520690}, \'multiverseid\': 520690}, {\'name\': \'Этали, Первозданная Буря\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Этали, Первозданная Буря атакует, изгоните верхнюю карту библиотеки каждого игрока, затем вы можете разыграть любое количество находящихся среди тех карт заклинаний без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Динозавр\', \'flavor\': \'Бушует буря, и земля разверзается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c608f4f6-7df9-450b-954d-ce5621914e28\', \'multiverseId\': 520938}, \'multiverseid\': 520938}, {\'name\': \'始啸埃泰力\', \'text\': \'每当始啸埃泰力攻击时，放逐每位牌手的牌库顶牌，然后你可以从这些牌之中施放任意数量的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'风暴肆虐，大地开裂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56ced5e-2eaf-4ba5-acf4-832e74dda42a\', \'multiverseId\': 521186}, \'multiverseid\': 521186}, {\'name\': \'始嘯埃泰力\', \'text\': \'每當始嘯埃泰力攻擊時，放逐每位玩家的牌庫頂牌，然後你可以從這些牌之中施放任意數量的咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／恐龍\', \'flavor\': \'風暴肆虐，大地開裂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc6042c8-1eb9-46be-9879-7f6bbb2745b1\', \'multiverseId\': 521434}, \'multiverseid\': 521434}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ccf9de-d836-4d97-9313-3bef89e1b5b2\', \'multiverseId\': 519571}, \'multiverseid\': 519571}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos".\\n—Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ed2203-e9a9-4849-82c1-92b58c6b43a3\', \'multiverseId\': 519819}, \'multiverseid\': 519819}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain que votre adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3e865f2-fc4a-40fb-9f7d-e605b0ab2f76\', \'multiverseId\': 520067}, \'multiverseid\': 520067}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli."\\n—Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b78992-c85e-488f-b77a-81b5f2ff0c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 520315}, \'multiverseid\': 520315}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48048aef-936c-41f6-bd15-22d56c96d101\', \'multiverseId\': 520563}, \'multiverseid\': 520563}, {\'name\': \'Pomar Exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi uma manhã estranha. Quando acordamos, nossas árvores haviam sido transformadas. Não sabíamos se deveriam ser regadas ou polidas."\\n— Pulan, pomareiro de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9a37031-7792-4ab9-9b14-7a91baadc358\', \'multiverseId\': 520811}, \'multiverseid\': 520811}, {\'name\': \'Экзотический Сад\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета, которую может производить земля под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Утро было странное. Когда мы проснулись, то обнаружили, что деревья вокруг полностью преобразились. Мы даже не знали, поливать их или полировать».\\n— Пулан, бэнтский садовник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba45e548-9159-4a7e-9dd4-714e79099796\', \'multiverseId\': 521059}, \'multiverseid\': 521059}, {\'name\': \'异国果园\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「那是个奇怪的早晨。我们醒来时，就发现树变了样子。不晓得该要替它浇水还是把它擦亮。」\\n～班特栽果人普兰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3531ef-ac58-446b-8d7d-862609d0e05c\', \'multiverseId\': 521307}, \'multiverseid\': 521307}, {\'name\': \'異國果園\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為由對手操控的地能產生之任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「那是個奇怪的早晨。我們醒來時，就發現樹變了樣子。不曉得該要替它澆水還是把它擦亮。」\\n～班特栽果人普蘭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d84c10-dd30-4d54-b0dd-42aebf644dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 521555}, \'multiverseid\': 521555}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ezuris Hetzjagd\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge für jede Kreatur, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, einen 4/4 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein. Jede der Bestien kämpft gegen eine unterschiedliche jener Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer sich nicht unterwirft, der wird vertilgt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42c73268-06ea-4d5b-9dab-e18293b144c0\', \'multiverseId\': 519471}, \'multiverseid\': 519471}, {\'name\': \'Depredación de Ezuri\', \'text\': \'Por cada criatura que controlan tus oponentes, crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 4/4. Cada una de esas Bestias lucha con una criatura distinta entre esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquellos que no se rindan serán devorados".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe110f3c-df71-4931-8f2d-9ede785c36cb\', \'multiverseId\': 519719}, \'multiverseid\': 519719}, {\'name\': "Cycle alimentaire d\'Ezuri", \'text\': \'Pour chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Bête. Chacune de ces bêtes se bat contre une créature différente.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ceux qui refusent de se soumettre seront dévorés. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519967&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847a1906-f54a-465b-8149-d85e99f09a65\', \'multiverseId\': 519967}, \'multiverseid\': 519967}, {\'name\': \'Predazione di Ezuri\', \'text\': \'Per ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari, crea una pedina creatura Bestia 4/4 verde. Ognuna di quelle Bestie lotta con una creatura diversa fra queste.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi non si sottomette verrà consumato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35191e74-7194-4b09-a8bb-ba510b4a8eae\', \'multiverseId\': 520215}, \'multiverseid\': 520215}, {\'name\': \'エズーリの捕食\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１体の、緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。それらの各ビースト・クリーチャーはそれぞれ、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーのうち別々のものと格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「従わぬ者は、食い尽くされる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db96306f-0a58-4efd-bef1-c9c5cdd50b93\', \'multiverseId\': 520463}, \'multiverseid\': 520463}, {\'name\': \'Predação de Ezuri\', \'text\': \'Para cada criatura que seus oponentes controlam, crie uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 4/4. Cada uma daquelas Bestas luta contra uma criatura diferente entre aquelas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os que não se submeterem serão consumidos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a513076-27f9-4649-a224-f6dcf99ce749\', \'multiverseId\': 520711}, \'multiverseid\': 520711}, {\'name\': \'Хищничество Эзури\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 зеленый Зверь за каждое существо под контролем ваших оппонентов. Каждый из тех Зверей дерется с одним из тех разных существ.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Те, кто не подчинится, будут поглощены».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777e9ae8-5537-444c-99fa-185063d14ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 520959}, \'multiverseid\': 520959}, {\'name\': \'伊祖黎的猎捕\', \'text\': \'所有对手每操控一个生物，你便派出一个4/4绿色野兽衍生生物。这些野兽各与该些生物之一互斗，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「逆我者噬。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7325c8d-7e75-4a37-87db-2ec1ac1d9b05\', \'multiverseId\': 521207}, \'multiverseid\': 521207}, {\'name\': \'伊祖黎的獵捕\', \'text\': \'所有對手每操控一個生物，你便派出一個4/4綠色野獸衍生生物。這些野獸各與該些生物之一互鬥，且不能重複選擇。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「逆我者噬。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d2428d-1cdc-41db-bb9d-262bd795f967\', \'multiverseId\': 521455}, \'multiverseid\': 521455}]', "[{'name': 'Ezzawurz-Wegbahner', 'text': 'Reichweite\\nKreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\\n{T}: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Baumhirte, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518527&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c79db78-fd63-49d2-88c6-3031ce4f511f', 'multiverseId': 518527}, 'multiverseid': 518527}, {'name': 'Canalizador ezzarraíz', 'text': 'Alcance.\\nTe cuesta {X} menos lanzar hechizos de criatura, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\\n{T}: Ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida pueblo-arbóreo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518598&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8bfd884-abfd-48a8-963a-5481204c9002', 'multiverseId': 518598}, 'multiverseid': 518598}, {'name': 'Canaliseur des Ezzaracines', 'text': 'Portée\\nLes sorts de créature que vous lancez coûtent {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.\\n{T} : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : sylvin et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518669&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0f51fb3-1003-4e44-816a-3b66e30cafdb', 'multiverseId': 518669}, 'multiverseid': 518669}, {'name': 'Radicante Incanalatore', 'text': 'Raggiungere\\nLe magie creatura che lanci costano {X} in meno per essere lanciate, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\\n{T}: Guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Silvantropo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518740&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d0e39d2-7fc9-4cb4-8591-a86f23330c95', 'multiverseId': 518740}, 'multiverseid': 518740}, {'name': 'エザルートの媒介者', 'text': '到達\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\\n{T}：あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518811&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcb5fe66-22a2-41c9-8c65-fd4135adc90f', 'multiverseId': 518811}, 'multiverseid': 518811}, {'name': 'Canalizador Radiezza', 'text': 'Alcance\\nAs mágicas de criatura que você conjura custam {X} a menos para serem conjuradas, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\\n{T}: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ent Druida', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518882&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2e75887-0a5b-44a2-bf1c-2efdb45f4fcf', 'multiverseId': 518882}, 'multiverseid': 518882}, {'name': 'Эззарутский Преобразователь', 'text': 'Захват\\nРазыгрываемые вами заклинания существ стоят на {X} меньше, где X — количество жизней, полученных вами в этом ходу.\\n{T}: вы получаете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Существо — Лесовик Друид', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518953&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e801b40e-79e2-4d08-a71b-3dab515530d5', 'multiverseId': 518953}, 'multiverseid': 518953}, {'name': '埃察根通念师', 'text': '延势\\n你施放的生物咒语减少{X}来施放，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\\n{T}：你获得2点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～树妖／德鲁伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519024&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3949e8d0-4167-4ac8-92d3-cf2100d7eaee', 'multiverseId': 519024}, 'multiverseid': 519024}, {'name': '埃察根通念師', 'text': '延勢\\n你施放的生物咒語減少{X}來施放，X為你本回合中獲得過的生命數量。\\n{T}：你獲得2點生命。', 'type': '生物 ～樹妖／德魯伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519095&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40d086f8-49b6-46e3-8107-41f31591ffd3', 'multiverseId': 519095}, 'multiverseid': 519095}]", "[{'name': 'Ezzawurz-Wegbahner', 'text': 'Reichweite\\nKreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\\n{T}: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Baumhirte, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521736&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86650756-f516-4719-b5df-dcc316ced7ed', 'multiverseId': 521736}, 'multiverseid': 521736}, {'name': 'Canalizador ezzarraíz', 'text': 'Alcance.\\nTe cuesta {X} menos lanzar hechizos de criatura, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\\n{T}: Ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida pueblo-arbóreo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521816&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61310c1c-f4aa-4a0d-b260-4f783471e213', 'multiverseId': 521816}, 'multiverseid': 521816}, {'name': 'Canaliseur des Ezzaracines', 'text': 'Portée\\nLes sorts de créature que vous lancez coûtent {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.\\n{T} : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : sylvin et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521896&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2855d07-b748-4853-97b1-d3f60ad7cffc', 'multiverseId': 521896}, 'multiverseid': 521896}, {'name': 'Radicante Incanalatore', 'text': 'Raggiungere\\nLe magie creatura che lanci costano {X} in meno per essere lanciate, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\\n{T}: Guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Silvantropo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521976&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2494de71-029a-4eb7-9c66-cf10b2c52cfc', 'multiverseId': 521976}, 'multiverseid': 521976}, {'name': 'エザルートの媒介者', 'text': '到達\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\\n{T}：あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522056&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '458b312a-30ea-45f8-a6d1-f50354244e63', 'multiverseId': 522056}, 'multiverseid': 522056}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fain der Vermittler\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{T}, entferne eine Marke von einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{3}{B}: Enttappe Fain den Vermittler.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19dd2256-96e4-45fd-b649-5cbd7ac2bb7e\', \'multiverseId\': 518507}, \'multiverseid\': 518507}, {\'name\': \'Fain, el Negociante\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar una criatura: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{T}, remover un contador de una criatura que controlas: Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{3}{B}: Endereza a Fain, el Negociante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5f027b-5e3e-4543-93b6-e8e3cd957c24\', \'multiverseId\': 518578}, \'multiverseid\': 518578}, {\'name\': \'Faïn, le courtier\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur d\'une créature que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Créez un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol.\\n{3}{B} : Dégagez Faïn, le courtier.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518649&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df624cb1-9d06-49c8-9ff1-a54ba496b520\', \'multiverseId\': 518649}, \'multiverseid\': 518649}, {\'name\': \'Fain, il Mediatore\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino da una creatura che controlli: Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare.\\n{3}{B}: STAPpa Fain, il Mediatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd9476d9-65a3-4c40-997f-f024179e4754\', \'multiverseId\': 518720}, \'multiverseid\': 518720}, {\'name\': \'仲介人、フェイン\', \'text\': \'{T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n{T}, あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上からカウンター１個を取り除く：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持ち白であり黒である２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{3}{B}：仲介人、フェインをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e24bd7-eaea-44bf-9d4f-83b3b9cca774\', \'multiverseId\': 518791}, \'multiverseid\': 518791}, {\'name\': \'Fain, o Negociador\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\\n{T}, remova um marcador de uma criatura que você controla: Crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\\n{T}, sacrifique um artefato: Crie uma ficha de criatura Nanquíneo branca e preta 2/1 com voar.\\n{3}{B}: Desvire Fain, o Negociador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35727eb-f23f-4f70-8831-82b1b9c290a1\', \'multiverseId\': 518862}, \'multiverseid\': 518862}, {\'name\': \'Фейн, Торговец\', \'text\': \'{T}, пожертвуйте существо: положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо.\\n{T}, удалите один жетон с существа под вашим контролем: создайте одну фишку Клада.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте артефакт: создайте одну фишку существа 2/1 белый и черный Чернильник с Полетом.\\n{3}{B}: разверните Фейна, Торговца.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a90b93a-4d85-4529-9092-d7de8e26160c\', \'multiverseId\': 518933}, \'multiverseid\': 518933}, {\'name\': \'掮客斐恩\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲一个生物：在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n{T}，从由你操控的生物上移去一个指示物：派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n{T}，牺牲一个神器：派出一个2/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的墨灵衍生生物。\\n{3}{B}：重置掮客斐恩。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d29b49f3-e69e-4a76-8ef1-58e786ebb9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 519004}, \'multiverseid\': 519004}, {\'name\': \'掮客斐恩\', \'text\': \'{T}，犧牲一個生物：在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n{T}，從由你操控的生物上移去一個指示物：派出一個珍寶衍生物。\\n{T}，犧牲一個神器：派出一個2/1，白黑雙色，具飛行異能的墨靈衍生生物。\\n{3}{B}：重置掮客斐恩。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c992576-a2a4-4c13-acf0-691501f989c8\', \'multiverseId\': 519075}, \'multiverseid\': 519075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fain der Vermittler\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{T}, entferne eine Marke von einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{3}{B}: Enttappe Fain den Vermittler.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb48425-00a4-401c-8bcb-803c6e6d23ca\', \'multiverseId\': 521716}, \'multiverseid\': 521716}, {\'name\': \'Fain, el Negociante\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar una criatura: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{T}, remover un contador de una criatura que controlas: Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{3}{B}: Endereza a Fain, el Negociante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f285510-0f28-41e7-bca5-3a0ae78f9519\', \'multiverseId\': 521796}, \'multiverseid\': 521796}, {\'name\': \'Faïn, le courtier\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur d\'une créature que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Créez un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol.\\n{3}{B} : Dégagez Faïn, le courtier.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b76e0bc-e9e2-49d9-809e-87495aa090bb\', \'multiverseId\': 521876}, \'multiverseid\': 521876}, {\'name\': \'Fain, il Mediatore\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino da una creatura che controlli: Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare.\\n{3}{B}: STAPpa Fain, il Mediatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67647081-35eb-4379-9a6e-979424a7a3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 521956}, \'multiverseid\': 521956}, {\'name\': \'仲介人、フェイン\', \'text\': \'{T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n{T}, あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上からカウンター１個を取り除く：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持ち白であり黒である２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{3}{B}：仲介人、フェインをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6f23b7-f160-4d8e-90f1-d3102acde361\', \'multiverseId\': 522036}, \'multiverseid\': 522036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldon vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Artefakt ist. Er erhält Eile. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie wird zu mir zurückkehren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519452&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7f5255-db7e-400e-beab-c78e409c6245\', \'multiverseId\': 519452}, \'multiverseid\': 519452}, {\'name\': \'Feldon del tercer camino\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}: Crea una ficha que es una copia de la carta de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio, excepto que es un artefacto además de sus otros tipos. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ella regresará a mí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36569ebf-72bf-45a6-b42c-c12f3c9079c0\', \'multiverseId\': 519700}, \'multiverseid\': 519700}, {\'name\': \'Feldonn de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': "{2}{R}, {T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. Il acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Elle me reviendra. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519948&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf07ade-9572-42bc-b8a0-81042043d18f\', \'multiverseId\': 519948}, \'multiverseid\': 519948}, {\'name\': \'Feldon del Terzo Cammino\', \'text\': "{2}{R}, {T}: Crea una pedina che è una copia di una carta creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero, tranne che è un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Ha rapidità. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La riporterò al mio fianco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb8826b0-73cd-4326-bf80-fe46f7a65b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 520196}, \'multiverseid\': 520196}, {\'name\': \'第三の道のフェルドン\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトであることを除き、それのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女は私の元に戻ってくるさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07da2ede-a16e-4286-8574-850207a8f0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 520444}, \'multiverseid\': 520444}, {\'name\': \'Feldon da Terceira Via\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do card de criatura alvo em seu cemitério, exceto por ela ser um artefato além de seus outros tipos. Ela ganha ímpeto. Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Ela voltará para mim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293ea51c-bdb0-4f8a-84ba-6950a4ff1b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 520692}, \'multiverseid\': 520692}, {\'name\': \'Фелдон Третьего Пути\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}: создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией целевой карты существа на вашем кладбище, но при этом являющуюся артефактом в дополнение к своим другим типам. Она получает Ускорение. Пожертвуйте ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Она вернется ко мне».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c32a7a56-dbb7-4c90-8d5d-76b27673cf00\', \'multiverseId\': 520940}, \'multiverseid\': 520940}, {\'name\': \'蹊径会的费顿\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}，{T}：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌之复制品，但它额外具有神器此类别。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「她会再度回到我身边。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b60eac-440a-404a-a30f-a15b2eaf8ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 521188}, \'multiverseid\': 521188}, {\'name\': \'蹊徑會的費頓\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}，{T}：派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為目標在你墳墓場中的生物牌之複製品，但它額外具有神器此類別。它獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「她會再度回到我身邊。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e306733c-5cb9-4d63-b510-00d5e5ab0801\', \'multiverseId\': 521436}, \'multiverseid\': 521436}]', "[{'name': 'Feldschmiede', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519561&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '145732e0-8f79-454f-aefe-75f4720e0dcd', 'multiverseId': 519561}, 'multiverseid': 519561}, {'name': 'Forja del campo de batalla', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519809&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5495e993-0083-417f-be59-386db870954d', 'multiverseId': 519809}, 'multiverseid': 519809}, {'name': 'Forge de campagne', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520057&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a26dd011-732e-4036-a83e-4abb7d3ab0e9', 'multiverseId': 520057}, 'multiverseid': 520057}, {'name': 'Forgia da Campo', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. La Forgia da Campo ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520305&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1828e37b-9d21-4234-a81b-40ede1bf0051', 'multiverseId': 520305}, 'multiverseid': 520305}, {'name': '戦場の鍛冶場', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520553&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '195ded6e-1712-4967-a26d-2976983d56da', 'multiverseId': 520553}, 'multiverseid': 520553}, {'name': 'Forjaria do Campo de Batalha', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Forjaria do Campo de Batalha causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520801&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5d2f3f4-f31b-4f49-bfe6-d6cdc0d9aafe', 'multiverseId': 520801}, 'multiverseid': 520801}, {'name': 'Кузница на Поле Боя', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {W}. Кузница на Поле Боя наносит вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521049&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ccaeb6f-9ba3-450f-b102-5d52b5405a13', 'multiverseId': 521049}, 'multiverseid': 521049}, {'name': '战场融炉', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。战场融炉对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521297&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2e100e3-d6ea-4a6f-b48b-951698286500', 'multiverseId': 521297}, 'multiverseid': 521297}, {'name': '戰場鎔爐', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。戰場鎔爐對你造成1點傷害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521545&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00f2708d-6874-4195-bd4f-f7fc0c51d062', 'multiverseId': 521545}, 'multiverseid': 521545}]", '[{\'name\': \'Felisa, Fangzahn von Silberkiel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Mentor\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt und falls eine Marke auf ihr lag, erzeuge X getappte 2/1 weiße und schwarze Tintling-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Marken ist, die auf ihr lagen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521678&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8208aa2c-bcc9-4cd0-a115-bc33fa35f50c\', \'multiverseId\': 521678}, \'multiverseid\': 521678}, {\'name\': \'Felisa, colmillo de Plumargéntum\', \'text\': \'Vuela., mentor.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, si tenía contadores sobre ella, crea X fichas de criatura Tintícola blancas y negras 2/1 giradas con la habilidad de volar, donde X es la cantidad de contadores que tenía sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c31bbfa-fae6-4b10-878e-df5aba45df97\', \'multiverseId\': 521758}, \'multiverseid\': 521758}, {\'name\': \'Félisa, croc de Plumargent\', \'text\': "Vol, mentor\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, si elle avait des marqueurs sur elle, créez X jetons de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol engagés, X étant le nombre de marqueurs qu\'elle avait sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e0b497-6035-4038-8489-be1a01098953\', \'multiverseId\': 521838}, \'multiverseid\': 521838}, {\'name\': \'Felisa, Zanna di Pennargento\', \'text\': \'Volare, mentore\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, se aveva segnalini, crea X pedine creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianche e nere con volare TAPpate, dove X è il numero di segnalini che aveva.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bc5da6-0905-4be7-a288-f8e39be3d602\', \'multiverseId\': 521918}, \'multiverseid\': 521918}, {\'name\': \'シルバークイルの牙、フェリーサ\', \'text\': \'飛行、教導\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それの上にカウンターが置かれていた場合、飛行を持ち白であり黒である２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体をタップ状態で生成する。Ｘはそれの上に置かれていたカウンターの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bcc7a56-7548-4bf7-ab0d-4402171ee4d1\', \'multiverseId\': 521998}, \'multiverseid\': 521998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felisa, Fangzahn von Silberkiel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMentor (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, deren Stärke niedriger ist.)\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt und falls eine Marke auf ihr lag, erzeuge X getappte 2/1 weiße und schwarze Tintling-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Marken ist, die auf ihr lagen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518318&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b66522-00a4-4574-8bb4-88982c388310\', \'multiverseId\': 518318}, \'multiverseid\': 518318}, {\'name\': \'Felisa, colmillo de Plumargéntum\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMentor. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura atacante objetivo con menor fuerza.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, si tenía contadores sobre ella, crea X fichas de criatura Tintícola blancas y negras 2/1 giradas con la habilidad de volar, donde X es la cantidad de contadores que tenía sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c28e62-ca05-4699-8c9d-2c23b37d5ce6\', \'multiverseId\': 518328}, \'multiverseid\': 518328}, {\'name\': \'Félisa, croc de Plumargent\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMentor (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature attaquante ciblée de force inférieure.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, si elle avait des marqueurs sur elle, créez X jetons de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol engagés, X étant le nombre de marqueurs qu\'elle avait sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727f87e4-658b-412f-9941-5d01ee2e73b5\', \'multiverseId\': 518338}, \'multiverseid\': 518338}, {\'name\': \'Felisa, Zanna di Pennargento\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nMentore (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura attaccante bersaglio con forza inferiore.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, se aveva segnalini, crea X pedine creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianche e nere con volare TAPpate, dove X è il numero di segnalini che aveva.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429cb33b-82b2-48a1-a701-5b6c8cdc22fa\', \'multiverseId\': 518348}, \'multiverseid\': 518348}, {\'name\': \'シルバークイルの牙、フェリーサ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n教導（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、パワーがこれよりも小さい攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それの上にカウンターが置かれていた場合、飛行を持ち白であり黒である２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体をタップ状態で生成する。Ｘはそれの上に置かれていたカウンターの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'064bc22e-0640-43a8-b3d3-441b5cac572f\', \'multiverseId\': 518358}, \'multiverseid\': 518358}, {\'name\': \'Felisa, Presa de Platinopena\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMentor (Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura atacante alvo com poder inferior.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura não ficha que você controla morrer, se ela tinha marcadores, crie X fichas de criatura Nanquíneo branca e preta 2/1 viradas com voar , sendo X o número de marcadores que a criatura que morreu tinha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'529b4d92-aced-4a96-b3cd-df982df2c19e\', \'multiverseId\': 518368}, \'multiverseid\': 518368}, {\'name\': \'Фелиса, Клык Сильверквилла\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nНаставник (Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое атакующее существо с меньшим значением силы.)\\nКаждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо под вашим контролем умирает, если на нем были жетоны, создайте X повернутых фишек существа 2/1 белый и черный Чернильник с Полетом, где X — количество жетонов, бывших на существе.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fef3d291-663a-4514-8c01-3b4db8cedc07\', \'multiverseId\': 518378}, \'multiverseid\': 518378}, {\'name\': \'银毫之牙斐莉莎\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n训导（每当此生物攻击时，在目标进行攻击且力量小于它的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，若其上有指示物，则派出X个已横置的2/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的墨灵衍生生物，X为死去生物上的指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3d3b26-c39f-472e-ab13-30b404d43fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 518388}, \'multiverseid\': 518388}, {\'name\': \'銀毫之牙斐莉莎\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n訓導（每當此生物攻擊時，在目標進行攻擊且力量小於它的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。）\\n每當一個由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去時，若其上有指示物，則派出X個已橫置的2/1，白黑雙色，具飛行異能的墨靈衍生生物，X為死去生物上的指示物數量。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～吸血鬼／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbf6ed8-dee5-4bc7-8887-e1e194352e98\', \'multiverseId\': 518398}, \'multiverseid\': 518398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Festung der Monstertöter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0, Wachsamkeit und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Hof ist zu jeder Stunde des Tages beleuchtet, damit die Nacht niemals in ihren Mauern Einzug hält.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5606c87-84c1-40cb-b51e-67b5242b7341\', \'multiverseId\': 519601}, \'multiverseid\': 519601}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza de asesinos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana las habilidades de vigilancia y prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Sus patios están iluminados en todo momento para que nunca caiga la noche entre sus muros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c840ce6-4e23-4242-966c-5b66cee21c51\', \'multiverseId\': 519849}, \'multiverseid\': 519849}, {\'name\': \'Forteresse des tueurs\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T} : Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert la vigilance et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Ses cours intérieures sont éclairées à toute heure, de façon à ce que la nuit ne tombe jamais entre ses murs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4dcb5d-7fad-498d-8837-e77b7a8cfcdc\', \'multiverseId\': 520097}, \'multiverseid\': 520097}, {\'name\': \'Fortezza degli Assassini\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha cautela e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi cortili sono illuminati a ogni ora del giorno, affinché la notte non possa mai penetrare le sue mura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf7ed2a-4288-4277-ab57-7b51e8527dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 520345}, \'multiverseid\': 520345}, {\'name\': \'処刑者の要塞\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{R}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け警戒と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'壁の隙間にすら夜を忍び込ませまいと、その庭は常に灯りに照らされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f714155d-e12d-4b55-acff-85e9b0ade8f7\', \'multiverseId\': 520593}, \'multiverseid\': 520593}, {\'name\': \'Fortaleza dos Matadores\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: A criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha vigilância e ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Seus pátios estão sempre iluminados para que a noite jamais penetre suas muralhas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a5ae04-ce95-4ab6-ab48-ca70e5e3ef4d\', \'multiverseId\': 520841}, \'multiverseid\': 520841}, {\'name\': \'Цитадель Охотников за Нечистью\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: целевое существо получает +2/+0, Бдительность и Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Внутренние дворы замка освещаются постоянно, чтобы ночь не смогла пробраться в его стены.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61320262-afbe-41cf-bcd8-18f9f08887a7\', \'multiverseId\': 521089}, \'multiverseid\': 521089}, {\'name\': \'克星城塞\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{R}{W}，{T}：直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得警戒与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'其庭院一整天都点着灯，因此夜晚在其围墙内永不会来临。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da92c4c-2f9d-4427-a713-4494bbcdccff\', \'multiverseId\': 521337}, \'multiverseid\': 521337}, {\'name\': \'剋星城塞\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{R}{W}，{T}：直到回合結束，目標生物得+2/+0且獲得警戒與敏捷異能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'其庭院一整天都點著燈，因此夜晚在其圍牆內永不會來臨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cb9b9dd-0120-4029-8548-9016f1aedcc2\', \'multiverseId\': 521585}, \'multiverseid\': 521585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feurige Zugabe\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte. Wenn du auf diese Weise eine Nichtland-Karte abwirfst, fügt die Feurige Zugabe einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags der abgeworfenen Karte zu.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186ffa45-0f96-4f26-9a4c-1331426e9e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 518518}, \'multiverseid\': 518518}, {\'name\': \'Bis ardiente\', \'text\': \'Descarta una carta, luego roba una carta. Cuando descartes una carta que no sea tierra de esta manera, el Bis ardiente hace una cantidad de daño igual al valor de maná de esa carta a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e00ab458-1955-4e4c-80af-8a8f151fe602\', \'multiverseId\': 518589}, \'multiverseid\': 518589}, {\'name\': \'Rappel enflammé\', \'text\': "Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte. Quand vous vous défaussez d\'une carte non-terrain de cette manière, le Rappel enflammé inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la valeur de mana de cette carte à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518660&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d992f4e-1ab3-4dca-bab9-b7639de67203\', \'multiverseId\': 518660}, \'multiverseid\': 518660}, {\'name\': \'Bis Fiammante\', \'text\': \'Scarta una carta, poi pesca una carta. Quando scarti una carta non terra in questo modo, il Bis Fiammante infligge a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al valore di mana di quella carta.\\nTempesta (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni magia lanciata prima in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a978dc05-8ea8-4649-a9c9-3b5f6c91601b\', \'multiverseId\': 518731}, \'multiverseid\': 518731}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の再演\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を捨て、その後カード１枚を引く。あなたがこれにより土地でないカード１枚を捨てたとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。焦熱の再演はそれに、そのカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、これを、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文の数に等しい回数コピーする。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed96492-61a5-4e91-8195-306d82c566df\', \'multiverseId\': 518802}, \'multiverseid\': 518802}, {\'name\': \'Bis Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Descarte um card e depois compre um card. Quando você descarta um card não de terreno dessa forma, Bis Flamejante causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao valor de mana daquele card à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\\nRajada (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica conjurada antes dela neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9c6769c-1001-4b17-9de2-1d73293a470d\', \'multiverseId\': 518873}, \'multiverseid\': 518873}, {\'name\': \'Огненная Реприза\', \'text\': "Сбросьте карту, затем возьмите карту. Когда вы сбрасываете таким образом карту, не являющуюся землей, Огненная Реприза наносит целевому существу или planeswalker\'у повреждения, равные мановой ценности той карты.\\nШторм (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое заклинание, разыгранное в этом ходу до него.)", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7665373d-681b-48a2-af4d-1bb47cdadcba\', \'multiverseId\': 518944}, \'multiverseid\': 518944}, {\'name\': \'火热返场\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，然后抓一张牌。当你以此法弃掉一张非地牌时，火热返场对目标生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于所弃之牌的法术力值。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7516368c-2dc1-43ba-ba2a-cad8faa4be67\', \'multiverseId\': 519015}, \'multiverseid\': 519015}, {\'name\': \'火熱返場\', \'text\': \'棄一張牌，然後抽一張牌。當你以此法棄掉一張非地牌時，火熱返場對目標生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於所棄之牌的魔法力值。\\n風暴（當施放此咒語時，本回合於它之前每施放過一個咒語，便將此咒語複製一次。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c803c25-1ce1-4beb-a705-fef6f6c5ce7e\', \'multiverseId\': 519086}, \'multiverseid\': 519086}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feurige Zugabe\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte. Wenn du auf diese Weise eine Nichtland-Karte abwirfst, fügt die Feurige Zugabe einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags der abgeworfenen Karte zu.\\nSturm\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521727&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3562f5-0c8f-4e97-9072-e59570df6727\', \'multiverseId\': 521727}, \'multiverseid\': 521727}, {\'name\': \'Bis ardiente\', \'text\': \'Descarta una carta, luego roba una carta. Cuando descartes una carta que no sea tierra de esta manera, el Bis ardiente hace una cantidad de daño igual al valor de maná de esa carta a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\nTormenta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c083df36-e3b8-48f6-82e8-1b05024f9403\', \'multiverseId\': 521807}, \'multiverseid\': 521807}, {\'name\': \'Rappel enflammé\', \'text\': "Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte. Quand vous vous défaussez d\'une carte non-terrain de cette manière, le Rappel enflammé inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la valeur de mana de cette carte à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\nDéluge", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c071b13-5666-4a9c-bcf1-1d47d0f0b484\', \'multiverseId\': 521887}, \'multiverseid\': 521887}, {\'name\': \'Bis Fiammante\', \'text\': \'Scarta una carta, poi pesca una carta. Quando scarti una carta non terra in questo modo, il Bis Fiammante infligge a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al valore di mana di quella carta.\\nTempesta\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e80c1d-9e38-4710-ad07-d62b9dd86688\', \'multiverseId\': 521967}, \'multiverseid\': 521967}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の再演\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を捨て、その後カード１枚を引く。あなたがこれにより土地でないカード１枚を捨てたとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。焦熱の再演はそれに、そのカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\nストーム\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b15fb636-3994-4ec5-8b94-ccb94c6991b3\', \'multiverseId\': 522047}, \'multiverseid\': 522047}]', "[{'name': 'Feuriger Fall', 'text': 'Der Feuriger Fall fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1}{R} ({1}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jund weidet sich an den Unvorbereiteten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519453&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f13a5fb-f105-4b14-9dab-e381998bf40a', 'multiverseId': 519453}, 'multiverseid': 519453}, {'name': 'Caída ardiente', 'text': 'La Caída ardiente hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}{R}. ({1}{R}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Jund disfruta con los sorprendidos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519701&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '526a529e-b7c0-487c-8ac9-a9acdcd05604', 'multiverseId': 519701}, 'multiverseid': 519701}, {'name': 'Chute ardente', 'text': 'La Chute ardente inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1}{R} ({1}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Jund festoie des ingénus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519949&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f1306b0-37da-48ee-9266-76e69ae61669', 'multiverseId': 519949}, 'multiverseid': 519949}, {'name': 'Rovina Impetuosa', 'text': 'La Rovina Impetuosa infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nCicloterra base {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Jund banchetta con gli sprovveduti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520197&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a9aa69f-3968-4a25-a690-3483aeb5e5b5', 'multiverseId': 520197}, 'multiverseid': 520197}, {'name': '焦熱の落下', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の落下はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}{R} （{1}{R}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ジャンドは不注意な者をご馳走とする。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520445&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bd0da09-b0ad-487b-a8c2-31a1ee4f4c9f', 'multiverseId': 520445}, 'multiverseid': 520445}, {'name': 'Queda Ardente', 'text': 'Queda Ardente causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\nReciclar terreno básico {1}{R} ({1}{R}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Jund alimenta-se dos incautos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520693&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87678341-2642-40d0-930e-3c69fac5373e', 'multiverseId': 520693}, 'multiverseid': 520693}, {'name': 'Огненный Провал', 'text': 'Огненный Провал наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу.\\nЦикл базовых земель {1}{R} ({1}{R}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.)', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Джанд лакомится неподготовленными душами.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520941&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9be8fe1-8707-4bb4-a89a-fe87dd16f09e', 'multiverseId': 520941}, 'multiverseid': 520941}, {'name': '暴落', 'text': '暴落对目标生物造成5点伤害。\\n循环基本地{1}{R}（{1}{R}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '猝不及防者会是勇得的食物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521189&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5480fb50-2c91-467a-a0c3-3ad4d3a3fb55', 'multiverseId': 521189}, 'multiverseid': 521189}, {'name': '暴落', 'text': '暴落對目標生物造成5點傷害。\\n循環基本地{1}{R}（{1}{R}，棄掉此牌：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。）', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '猝不及防者會是勇得的食物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521437&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2f3d2a1-54fc-40ee-bb95-0f288ac7e75d', 'multiverseId': 521437}, 'multiverseid': 521437}]", '[{\'name\': \'Flinkschmied-Genie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Flinkschmiede springen gerne von einem Projekt zum nächsten und verlassen sich auf Geistesblitze statt auf gründliche Nachforschungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469ce565-893d-4e91-b94a-b62fe7e461da\', \'multiverseId\': 519461}, \'multiverseid\': 519461}, {\'name\': \'Genio forjacélere\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los forjacéleres siempre están dispuestos a saltar de un proyecto a otro; confían en su inspiración más que en una investigación rigurosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f08c68-f5cb-4e70-a63d-100694066f2c\', \'multiverseId\': 519709}, \'multiverseid\': 519709}, {\'name\': \'Génie forgevif\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les forgevifs ont tendance à passer d\'un projet à l\'autre, en se fiant à leurs éclairs de génie plutôt qu\'à des recherches consciencieuses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519957&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9b965d-3bc7-4427-bf16-6aa015df68f9\', \'multiverseId\': 519957}, \'multiverseid\': 519957}, {\'name\': \'Genio Tempralesto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I tempralesti passano avidamente da un progetto al seguente, affidandosi più a lampi di genio che a ricerche approfondite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de1afad-6c5c-4337-8797-35c8fe4ce108\', \'multiverseId\': 520205}, \'multiverseid\': 520205}, {\'name\': \'天才速製職人\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは「カード１枚を捨てる。その後、カード１枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'速製職人は次々と別の作品を手掛けたがる。入念な研究よりも、その場の思いつきを重視するのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4598e0-758c-4ee0-9a25-df2ee416500e\', \'multiverseId\': 520453}, \'multiverseid\': 520453}, {\'name\': \'Gênio Veloferreiro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um artefato entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os veloferreiros estão sempre prontos para pular de um projeto para o outro, seguindo seus lampejos de inspiração, em vez da pesquisa cuidadosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b39ac807-463d-4f34-ac52-839ff2f04494\', \'multiverseId\': 520701}, \'multiverseid\': 520701}, {\'name\': \'Проворный Гений-Кузнец\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда артефакт выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Проворные кузнецы охотно бросают одну работу и берутся за другую, полагаясь на приступы вдохновения, а не на тщательные исследования.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae1b1aa0-edcd-4b4a-80a1-ebe49491c76f\', \'multiverseId\': 520949}, \'multiverseid\': 520949}, {\'name\': \'迅匠天才\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'迅匠总是迫不及待地想投入下一个计画，全凭灵感迸发而非审慎研究。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d046cc-f5ca-4adb-8260-f0385a7d5f18\', \'multiverseId\': 521197}, \'multiverseid\': 521197}, {\'name\': \'迅匠天才\', \'text\': \'每當一個神器在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以棄一張牌。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'迅匠總是迫不及待地想投入下一個計畫，全憑靈感迸發而非審慎研究。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddcd527-a018-47c6-b676-3b015ca2a2bf\', \'multiverseId\': 521445}, \'multiverseid\': 521445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch der Rastlosigkeit\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler angegriffen wird, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein. Jeder Gegner, der den Spieler angreift, tut dasselbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'Ein unbedachtes Geräusch lockt so manch rastlose Seelen an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0622d6a-e4d8-4e54-ac35-68f0c3effe62\', \'multiverseId\': 519421}, \'multiverseid\': 519421}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de disturbio\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado sea atacado, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2. Cada oponente que ataque a ese jugador también crea una ficha igual.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'Los sonidos de la vida atraen a muchas almas perturbadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aae9a80-c5a6-4312-896d-901b52a4a2c9\', \'multiverseId\': 519669}, \'multiverseid\': 519669}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de perturbation\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté est attaqué, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie. Chaque adversaire attaquant ce joueur fait de même.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': "Un écho de vie attire bon nombre d\'âmes tourmentées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e6a39a-d467-4d6c-9924-93a389213482\', \'multiverseId\': 519917}, \'multiverseid\': 519917}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione del Turbamento\', \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato viene attaccato, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera. Ogni avversario che attacca quel giocatore fa lo stesso.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': "Il suono della vita attira più di un\'anima inquieta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07186b6-ce38-450d-b77a-bff4e216f4a8\', \'multiverseId\': 520165}, \'multiverseid\': 520165}, {\'name\': \'騒然の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントされているプレイヤーが攻撃されるたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。そのプレイヤーを攻撃している各対戦相手はそれぞれ同じことを行う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'命の調べは無数の安息なき魂を引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cffe7ad0-09e9-4d48-b151-272974f4d27b\', \'multiverseId\': 520413}, \'multiverseid\': 520413}, {\'name\': \'Maldição do Distúrbio\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado for atacado, crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2. Cada oponente que estiver atacando aquele jogador faz o mesmo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'Os sons da vida atraem muitas almas inquietas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03fabc6c-f677-4ab3-bc66-e996f1753a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 520661}, \'multiverseid\': 520661}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Беспокойства\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованного игрока атакуют, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби. То же самое делает каждый оппонент, атакующий того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'Звуки жизни манят множество беспокойных душ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'890d0193-c72b-4794-b793-3dfd2f1e0958\', \'multiverseId\': 520909}, \'multiverseid\': 520909}, {\'name\': \'惊扰诅咒\', \'text\': \'结附于牌手\\n每当所结附的牌手被攻击时，你派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。每位正向该牌手进行攻击的对手亦如此。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'生者之声招引各路不息亡魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b191467-32ae-4954-a969-e9638af94d43\', \'multiverseId\': 521157}, \'multiverseid\': 521157}, {\'name\': \'驚擾詛咒\', \'text\': \'結附於玩家\\n每當所結附的玩家被攻擊時，你派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。每位正向該玩家進行攻擊的對手亦如此。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'生者之聲招引各路不息亡魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8042174e-b084-40f6-ac55-cd122815658c\', \'multiverseId\': 521405}, \'multiverseid\': 521405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des Borstenviehs\', \'text\': \'Schicke X Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Kreatur erzeugt ihr Beherrscher einen 2/2 grünen Wildschwein-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Und wieder wurde eine bevorstehende Schlacht mit lautem Grunzen abgewendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a11ad66b-a1c1-4f2a-9656-7e19a842cd44\', \'multiverseId\': 519401}, \'multiverseid\': 519401}, {\'name\': \'Maldición porcina\', \'text\': \'Exilia X criaturas objetivo. Por cada criatura exiliada de esta manera, su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Jabalí verde 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Otra batalla inminente acallada por profusos gruñidos y hozares despreocupados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26127e57-ee87-42db-bae1-ec36fae8e26d\', \'multiverseId\': 519649}, \'multiverseid\': 519649}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction du pourceau\', \'text\': \'Exilez X créatures ciblées. Pour chaque créature exilée de cette manière, son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Sanglier.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une autre bataille imminente se solda par des couinements porcins et des frottements de groin insouciants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968f3686-7871-4c22-83c2-3c8d1b535cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 519897}, \'multiverseid\': 519897}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione dei Maiali\', \'text\': \'Esilia X creature bersaglio. Per ogni creatura esiliata in questo modo, il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Cinghiale 2/2 verde.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Un\'altra battaglia imminente si spense in un intenso grufolare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11120b72-7ffe-409f-843f-d8694a89afdc\', \'multiverseId\': 520145}, \'multiverseid\': 520145}, {\'name\': \'豚の呪い\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーＸ体を対象とする。それらを追放する。それのコントローラーはこれにより追放されたクリーチャー１体につき１体の緑の２/２の猪・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'鼻を鳴らす音と気楽に地面を掘り返す喧噪に包まれ、また一つ差し迫った戦争が鎮静化された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b5573c2-b529-42e5-a8ae-ae1955f21e38\', \'multiverseId\': 520393}, \'multiverseid\': 520393}, {\'name\': \'Maldição do Suíno\', \'text\': \'Exile X criaturas alvo. Para cada criatura exilada desta forma, seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Javali verde 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Outra batalha iminente evitada com grunhidos e focinhos ocupados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe0f08c-f770-4a33-81aa-c403241b27af\', \'multiverseId\': 520641}, \'multiverseid\': 520641}, {\'name\': \'Превращение в Свиней\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X целевых существ. За каждое существо, изгнанное таким образом, контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 2/2 зеленый Вепрь.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Вместо неминуемой битвы в очередной раз раздалось деловитое сопение и беспечное хрюканье.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c730d6ed-91fc-4378-8302-f22cc69858e6\', \'multiverseId\': 520889}, \'multiverseid\': 520889}, {\'name\': \'野猪之咒\', \'text\': \'放逐X个目标生物。对每个以此法放逐的生物而言，其操控者派出一个2/2绿色野猪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'另一场迫在眉睫的战役，在乱嗅和随意拱土之间消弭于无形。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37f818fa-34de-4924-9d73-039d1ebf081c\', \'multiverseId\': 521137}, \'multiverseid\': 521137}, {\'name\': \'野豬之咒\', \'text\': \'放逐X個目標生物。對每個以此法放逐的生物而言，其操控者派出一個2/2綠色野豬衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'另一場迫在眉睫的戰役，在亂嗅和隨意拱土之間消弭於無形。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a050fa07-59c2-407a-a48b-95dca42ff80e\', \'multiverseId\': 521385}, \'multiverseid\': 521385}]', '[{\'name\': \'Formbarer Stahl\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Formbaren Stahl als Kopie eines beliebigen Artefakts im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Tüftler lagerte eine Stange davon in einem Verlies voller Münzen. Bisher hat er sie noch nicht wiederfinden können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d22aa29-434e-4f83-8ca3-e94cbc33840c\', \'multiverseId\': 519544}, \'multiverseid\': 519544}, {\'name\': \'Acero esculpido\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Acero esculpido entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier artefacto en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un artífice dejó caer uno en una bóveda llena de monedas. Todavía está buscándolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcb917a8-eca8-46fa-978f-7b779644d286\', \'multiverseId\': 519792}, \'multiverseid\': 519792}, {\'name\': \'Acier sculpteur\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Acier sculpteur arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quel artefact sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Une artificière en a laissé tomber un dans un coffre rempli de pièces de cuivre... Elle l\'y cherche encore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520040&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1efb3ae-eb6e-4278-aedc-66895ac1e473\', \'multiverseId\': 520040}, \'multiverseid\': 520040}, {\'name\': \'Acciaio da Scolpire\', \'text\': "Puoi far entrare l\'Acciaio da Scolpire nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi artefatto sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Un\'artefice una volta ne fece cadere uno in una stanza piena di monete. Deve ancora ritrovarlo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68cf809b-1079-41a8-a17a-aeb2917da19f\', \'multiverseId\': 520288}, \'multiverseid\': 520288}, {\'name\': \'彫り込み鋼\', \'text\': \'あなたは彫り込み鋼を、戦場にあるアーティファクト１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ある時、一人の工匠がこいつを金貨の倉庫に落とした。彼女は未だにそれを見つけられていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'758f1ecd-d012-4d09-ab66-96b5c999332d\', \'multiverseId\': 520536}, \'multiverseid\': 520536}, {\'name\': \'Aço Esculpível\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Aço Esculpível entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de qualquer artefato no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma vez, uma artífice derrubou um desses num cofre cheio de moedas. Não achou até hoje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2b92cdd-fd87-4a80-96e2-12ff04ed6ddd\', \'multiverseId\': 520784}, \'multiverseid\': 520784}, {\'name\': \'Изменчивая Сталь\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заставить Изменчивую Сталь выйти на поле битвы в качестве копии любого артефакта на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Однажды кусок такой стали уронили в подземелье, полное монет. До сих пор ищут.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f05db77-7366-44de-953f-64b9f1af9c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 521032}, \'multiverseid\': 521032}, {\'name\': \'塑型钢\', \'text\': \'你可以使塑型钢当成战场上任一神器的复制品来进入战场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'某位神器师不慎把它掉落在摆满钱币的地窖中。她到现在还没能把它找出来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb8a04c5-2baf-4b60-b7fe-7272ac14334c\', \'multiverseId\': 521280}, \'multiverseid\': 521280}, {\'name\': \'塑型鋼\', \'text\': \'你可以使塑型鋼當成戰場上任一神器的複製品來進入戰場。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'某位神器師不慎把它掉落在擺滿錢幣的地窖中。她到現在還沒能把它找出來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04633ddd-c5cd-410f-b35d-19e5a6411691\', \'multiverseId\': 521528}, \'multiverseid\': 521528}]', "[{'name': 'Fraktal-Zaumzeug', 'text': 'Wenn das Fraktal-Zaumzeug ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn und lege das Fraktal-Zaumzeug an ihn an.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, verdopple die Anzahl der +1/+1-Marken auf ihr.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518528&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdb6d3db-0611-4807-8413-ece24e36439a', 'multiverseId': 518528}, 'multiverseid': 518528}, {'name': 'Arnés de fractal', 'text': 'Cuando el Arnés de fractal entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y anéxale el Arnés de fractal.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nEquipar {2}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518599&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68033474-e90d-40e7-a48e-06929bfe6679', 'multiverseId': 518599}, 'multiverseid': 518599}, {'name': 'Harnais de fractale', 'text': 'Quand le Harnais de fractale arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui et attachez-lui le Harnais de fractale.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518670&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7494aed-f961-4db7-9ea1-01bd364f3636', 'multiverseId': 518670}, 'multiverseid': 518670}, {'name': 'Briglie del Frattale', 'text': 'Quando le Briglie del Frattale entrano nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e assegnale le Briglie del Frattale.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518741&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9a85860-14d1-44c6-8586-7dc4f6ccf04b', 'multiverseId': 518741}, 'multiverseid': 518741}, {'name': 'フラクタルの装具', 'text': 'フラクタルの装具が戦場に出たとき、緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置き、フラクタルの装具をそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの個数を２倍にする。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518812&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64d6ed1b-f228-412a-a52c-51ca47d9fa5f', 'multiverseId': 518812}, 'multiverseid': 518812}, {'name': 'Arnês Fractal', 'text': 'Quando Arnês Fractal entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela e anexe Arnês Fractal a ela.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, dobre o número de marcadores +1/+1 nela.\\nEquipar {2}', 'type': 'Artefato — Equipamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518883&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f68ef255-dfb2-46de-b4e6-6f35bc6383d2', 'multiverseId': 518883}, 'multiverseid': 518883}, {'name': 'Фрактальная Упряжь', 'text': 'Когда Фрактальная Упряжь выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1 и прикрепите к ней Фрактальную Упряжь.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, удвойте количество жетонов +1/+1 на нем.\\nСнарядить {2}', 'type': 'Артефакт — Снаряжение', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518954&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '946e3ce1-6a0a-4362-bec1-1f6fb3609d5d', 'multiverseId': 518954}, 'multiverseid': 518954}, {'name': '分灵挽具', 'text': '当分灵挽具进战场时，派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物，并将分灵挽具装备于其上。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，将其上的+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\\n佩带{2}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519025&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1052ed1d-1679-4417-bee9-1578116e50d8', 'multiverseId': 519025}, 'multiverseid': 519025}, {'name': '分靈挽具', 'text': '當分靈挽具進戰場時，派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物，並將分靈挽具裝備於其上。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，將其上的+1/+1指示物數量加倍。\\n佩帶{2}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519096&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31548d82-eaba-4947-b215-ce625fe63367', 'multiverseId': 519096}, 'multiverseid': 519096}]", "[{'name': 'Fraktal-Zaumzeug', 'text': 'Wenn das Fraktal-Zaumzeug ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn und lege das Fraktal-Zaumzeug an ihn an.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, verdopple die Anzahl der +1/+1-Marken auf ihr.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521737&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4952817b-ab58-49ca-ac1c-d549bb05209f', 'multiverseId': 521737}, 'multiverseid': 521737}, {'name': 'Arnés de fractal', 'text': 'Cuando el Arnés de fractal entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y anéxale el Arnés de fractal.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nEquipar {2}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521817&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8eefade4-88bf-4afb-8fdf-5343d4252418', 'multiverseId': 521817}, 'multiverseid': 521817}, {'name': 'Harnais de fractale', 'text': 'Quand le Harnais de fractale arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui et attachez-lui le Harnais de fractale.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521897&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12b8bdeb-61e8-45c4-8d4a-34bc48c8a0a0', 'multiverseId': 521897}, 'multiverseid': 521897}, {'name': 'Briglie del Frattale', 'text': 'Quando le Briglie del Frattale entrano nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e assegnale le Briglie del Frattale.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521977&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1c8be89-9c98-4d8d-a636-7033af5d5589', 'multiverseId': 521977}, 'multiverseid': 521977}, {'name': 'フラクタルの装具', 'text': 'フラクタルの装具が戦場に出たとき、緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置き、フラクタルの装具をそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの個数を２倍にする。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522057&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab9775a1-09b6-40eb-8fa5-173c6f6b44d2', 'multiverseId': 522057}, 'multiverseid': 522057}]", '[{\'name\': \'Freche Plagiatorin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine oder mehrere Marken auf eine Kreatur legt, die er kontrolliert, legt er dieselbe Anzahl solcher Marken auf die Freche Plagiatorin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich erkenne eine gute Idee, wenn ich sie sehe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20573b3a-d50c-4818-bd0d-cf7153f10042\', \'multiverseId\': 518504}, \'multiverseid\': 518504}, {\'name\': \'Plagiadora osada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSiempre que un oponente ponga uno o más contadores sobre una criatura que controla, pone esa misma cantidad y los mismos tipos de contadores sobre la Plagiadora osada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sé cuándo algo es una buena idea".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b2bdb85-cf1a-4945-bbb5-0fd01cea9649\', \'multiverseId\': 518575}, \'multiverseid\': 518575}, {\'name\': \'Plagiaire audacieuse\', \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire met au moins un marqueur sur une créature qu\'il contrôle, il met le même nombre et les mêmes sortes de marqueurs sur la Plagiaire audacieuse.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Je sais reconnaître une bonne idée quand j\'en vois une. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518646&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd7537e-17fd-4f7d-a196-9ff95b0255cd\', \'multiverseId\': 518646}, \'multiverseid\': 518646}, {\'name\': \'Plagiaria Ardita\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario mette uno o più segnalini su una creatura che controlla, mette lo stesso numero e tipo di segnalini sulla Plagiaria Ardita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"So riconoscere le buone idee."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ebb380-f24e-403a-bfc3-0a358901f6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 518717}, \'multiverseid\': 518717}, {\'name\': \'厚かましい盗用者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手１人が、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上にカウンター１個以上を置くたび、そのプレイヤーは厚かましい盗用者の上にそれと同じ個数の同じ種類のカウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「いいアイディアは、一目見れば分かる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8cb242-6660-47ba-a358-1b856a4ed474\', \'multiverseId\': 518788}, \'multiverseid\': 518788}, {\'name\': \'Plagiadora Ousada\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nToda vez que um oponente coloca um ou mais marcadores em uma criatura que ele controla, ele coloca o mesmo número e tipo de marcadores em Plagiadora Ousada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu reconheço uma boa ideia quando vejo uma."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea92bad6-245b-4407-953e-a0da48229d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 518859}, \'multiverseid\': 518859}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкий Плагиатор\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент кладет один или несколько жетонов на существо под своим контролем, он кладет столько же жетонов такого же типа на Дерзкого Плагиатора.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Хорошую идею я сразу распознаю».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5eefb5c-86f8-47b9-8ba2-ab8829e327d5\', \'multiverseId\': 518930}, \'multiverseid\': 518930}, {\'name\': \'大胆剽窃徒\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n每当任一对手在一个由其操控的生物上放置一个或数个指示物时，他在大胆剽窃徒上放置相同数量和种类的指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「当我遇到好想法时，我也有个好想法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ba0163-db0d-4457-8e3d-3d6c9c803ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 519001}, \'multiverseid\': 519001}, {\'name\': \'大膽剽竊徒\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n每當任一對手在一個由其操控的生物上放置一個或數個指示物時，他在大膽剽竊徒上放置相同數量和種類的指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「當我遇到好想法時，我也有個好想法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd47586-e963-48bc-8744-c0d1f202a0f1\', \'multiverseId\': 519072}, \'multiverseid\': 519072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Freche Plagiatorin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine oder mehrere Marken auf eine Kreatur legt, die er kontrolliert, legt er dieselbe Anzahl solcher Marken auf die Freche Plagiatorin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a726f1-3c00-4fb7-b239-a9ed8666adae\', \'multiverseId\': 521713}, \'multiverseid\': 521713}, {\'name\': \'Plagiadora osada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSiempre que un oponente ponga uno o más contadores sobre una criatura que controla, pone esa misma cantidad y los mismos tipos de contadores sobre la Plagiadora osada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7c2f08-a2ac-4b6e-8c66-5c90640f0479\', \'multiverseId\': 521793}, \'multiverseid\': 521793}, {\'name\': \'Plagiaire audacieuse\', \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire met au moins un marqueur sur une créature qu\'il contrôle, il met le même nombre et les mêmes sortes de marqueurs sur la Plagiaire audacieuse.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c49cbb-dd61-4467-a289-c44a72aa2174\', \'multiverseId\': 521873}, \'multiverseid\': 521873}, {\'name\': \'Plagiaria Ardita\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario mette uno o più segnalini su una creatura che controlla, mette lo stesso numero e tipo di segnalini sulla Plagiaria Ardita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa9faa9-2bf0-4a24-b024-a2d4e83ebc94\', \'multiverseId\': 521953}, \'multiverseid\': 521953}, {\'name\': \'厚かましい盗用者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手１人が、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上にカウンター１個以上を置くたび、そのプレイヤーは厚かましい盗用者の上にそれと同じ個数の同じ種類のカウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a1dcab-fe1f-4527-b551-53426e289da1\', \'multiverseId\': 522033}, \'multiverseid\': 522033}]', '[{\'name\': \'Futter für den Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jener bleibenden Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf abscheulichen Schwingen und blutigem Wind wird sich der Schwarm erheben."\\n—Inschrift einer Himmelsfestung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519427&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6e66a5-73f8-4d34-878f-6bfb64ec4775\', \'multiverseId\': 519427}, \'multiverseid\': 519427}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar al enjambre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El enjambre se alzará con alas repugnantes y viento ensangrentado".\\n—Inscripción de aerorruina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b172a7c-f48a-4709-a5ea-821ea05ab526\', \'multiverseId\': 519675}, \'multiverseid\': 519675}, {\'name\': "Nourrir l\'essaim", \'text\': "Détruisez une créature ciblée ou un enchantement ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'essaim s\'envolera sur ses ailes infâmes, porté par un vent sanglant. »\\n—Inscription sur un fort céleste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e144e4-78f8-46b5-9c53-7517b67fd802\', \'multiverseId\': 519923}, \'multiverseid\': 519923}, {\'name\': \'Nutrire lo Sciame\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio controllati da un avversario. Perdi punti vita pari al valore di mana di quel permanente.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Su ali spregevoli e vento sanguinario, lo sciame si innalzerà."\\n—Iscrizione dell\\\'enclave celeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af24b852-1ce0-461e-9c18-d2d24361ae89\', \'multiverseId\': 520171}, \'multiverseid\': 520171}, {\'name\': \'大群への給餌\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしている、クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは、そのパーマネントのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「不快な翼と血の風により大群が起きるだろう。」\\n――スカイクレイブの碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e77857f-1328-48e9-a383-b1a7a72c231e\', \'multiverseId\': 520419}, \'multiverseid\': 520419}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar o Enxame\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o encantamento alvo que um oponente controla. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana daquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Em vis asas e sangrentos ventos, o enxame ascenderá."\\n— Epígrafe no Enclave Celeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffed8cd1-afcc-42ae-b29c-d1753401500f\', \'multiverseId\': 520667}, \'multiverseid\': 520667}, {\'name\': \'Накормить Рой\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо или чары под контролем оппонента. Вы теряете количество жизней, равное мановой ценности того перманента.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Рой взлетит на крыльях жестокости навстречу кровавому ветру».\\n— надпись на небесном анклаве\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e539d7-ccf8-4b4c-a13d-f9b5a97ab1d2\', \'multiverseId\': 520915}, \'multiverseid\': 520915}, {\'name\': \'喂饱虫群\', \'text\': \'消灭目标由对手操控的生物或结界。你失去等同于该永久物之法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「邪翼蔽日，血雨腥风，虫群必将崛起。」\\n～空境铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac7ece3-bb9d-41b0-8d23-14a29fc081e8\', \'multiverseId\': 521163}, \'multiverseid\': 521163}, {\'name\': \'餵飽蟲群\', \'text\': \'消滅目標由對手操控的生物或結界。你失去等同於該永久物之魔法力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「邪翼蔽日，血雨腥風，蟲群必將崛起。」\\n～空境銘文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f68341d-f763-47d0-811a-18b1a8a6ba3b\', \'multiverseId\': 521411}, \'multiverseid\': 521411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnishaufen\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Schädlinge, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen und grünen Schädling-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Schädlinge ernähren sich von Aas, von Schlamm und voneinander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d77a7eb-23fe-499d-a950-1fe2ee53e4a7\', \'multiverseId\': 518503}, \'multiverseid\': 518503}, {\'name\': \'Montículo de plagas\', \'text\': \'Las Plagas atacantes que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura Plaga negra y verde 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, ganas 1 vida".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Las plagas se alimentan de carroña, barro y de otras plagas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cdebf64-4fee-4d82-b847-90a952e9b3d6\', \'multiverseId\': 518574}, \'multiverseid\': 518574}, {\'name\': \'Monticule fléau\', \'text\': "Les parasites attaquants que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et ont la menace.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire et verte Parasite avec « Quand cette créature meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les nuisibles se nourrissent de charogne, de boue et les uns des autres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518645&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'519306dd-a1df-486f-a7c9-9859fb2e7557\', \'multiverseId\': 518645}, \'multiverseid\': 518645}, {\'name\': "Cumulo dell\'Avvizzimento", \'text\': \'Le Pesti attaccanti che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno minacciare.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, crea una pedina creatura Peste 1/1 nera e verde con "Quando questa creatura muore, guadagni 1 punto vita".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le pesti si nutrono di carcasse e fango, ma non disdegnano il cannibalismo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c461f8ac-2850-4830-a670-83cf06705d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 518716}, \'multiverseid\': 518716}, {\'name\': \'荒廃の塚\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべての邪魔者は＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持ち黒であり緑である１/１の邪魔者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'害獣は屍肉や泥やお互いを食べる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e521123e-5391-4c47-8ccd-bbd592846ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 518787}, \'multiverseid\': 518787}, {\'name\': \'Monte de Praga\', \'text\': \'As Pestes atacantes que você controla recebem +1/+0 e têm ameaçar.\\nToda vez que uma criatura não ficha que você controla morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Peste preta e verde 1/1 com "Quando esta criatura morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida".\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'As pragas se alimentam de carniça, de lama e umas das outras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff2102ef-8065-4be4-acbf-b34493814ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 518858}, \'multiverseid\': 518858}, {\'name\': \'Куча Паразитов\', \'text\': \'Атакующие Вредители под вашим контролем получают +1/+0 и имеют Угрозу.\\nКаждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо под вашим контролем умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 черный и зеленый Вредитель со способностью «Когда это существо умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь».\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Вредители питаются падалью, грязью и друг другом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01692a0-68e9-47e9-bd7d-f001c037eace\', \'multiverseId\': 518929}, \'multiverseid\': 518929}, {\'name\': \'枯萎土丘\', \'text\': \'由你操控且进行攻击的害虫得+1/+0且具有威慑异能。\\n每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个1/1，黑绿双色的害虫衍生生物，且具有「当此生物死去时，你获得1点生命。」\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'害虫的食物包括：腐肉、污泥、彼此。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b42444bf-51ad-49a8-a674-5ec504c63a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 519000}, \'multiverseid\': 519000}, {\'name\': \'枯萎土丘\', \'text\': \'由你操控且進行攻擊的害蟲得+1/+0且具有威懾異能。\\n每當一個由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去時，派出一個1/1，黑綠雙色的害蟲衍生生物，且具有「當此生物死去時，你獲得1點生命。」\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'害蟲的食物包括：腐肉、污泥、彼此。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8a62a2-41fb-46a2-b102-5085652880eb\', \'multiverseId\': 519071}, \'multiverseid\': 519071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäulnishaufen\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Schädlinge, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 und haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen und grünen Schädling-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521712&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a69657a-d038-4eba-a083-bb99f2d37aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 521712}, \'multiverseid\': 521712}, {\'name\': \'Montículo de plagas\', \'text\': \'Las Plagas atacantes que controlas obtienen +1/+0 y tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura Plaga negra y verde 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, ganas 1 vida".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be690b9-4578-4c1c-b202-8b549978d8ba\', \'multiverseId\': 521792}, \'multiverseid\': 521792}, {\'name\': \'Monticule fléau\', \'text\': "Les parasites attaquants que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 et ont la menace.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire et verte Parasite avec « Quand cette créature meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f9fbc3-2887-4172-b46b-0725cb7a2fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 521872}, \'multiverseid\': 521872}, {\'name\': "Cumulo dell\'Avvizzimento", \'text\': \'Le Pesti attaccanti che controlli prendono +1/+0 e hanno minacciare.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, crea una pedina creatura Peste 1/1 nera e verde con "Quando questa creatura muore, guadagni 1 punto vita".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c9fd6b-1242-4a6f-ba98-4eca3ac84708\', \'multiverseId\': 521952}, \'multiverseid\': 521952}, {\'name\': \'荒廃の塚\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべての邪魔者は＋１/＋０の修整を受け威迫を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持ち黒であり緑である１/１の邪魔者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4d1138-6f46-4b90-b3fb-44a8e4113e57\', \'multiverseId\': 522032}, \'multiverseid\': 522032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Für immer zusammen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Für immer zusammen ins Spiel kommt, wende Beistand 2 an. (Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.)\\n{1}: Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der mindestens eine Marke liegt. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, bringe sie auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d86f0572-c474-4273-9b5b-3b93ec0622f2\', \'multiverseId\': 519391}, \'multiverseid\': 519391}, {\'name\': \'Juntos para siempre\', \'text\': \'Cuando Juntos para siempre entre al campo de batalla, apoya 2. (Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.)\\n{1}: Elige una criatura objetivo que tenga un contador sobre ella. Cuando la criatura muera este turno, regresa esa carta a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7160ed5-135a-4f96-b9bd-8d244cc0de9e\', \'multiverseId\': 519639}, \'multiverseid\': 519639}, {\'name\': \'Ensemble pour toujours\', \'text\': "Quand Ensemble pour toujours arrive sur le champ de bataille, soutenez 2. (Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.)\\n{1} : Choisissez une créature ciblée avec un marqueur sur elle. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, renvoyez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67aa9cd9-28aa-48d1-a1e2-b36604cd024a\', \'multiverseId\': 519887}, \'multiverseid\': 519887}, {\'name\': \'Per Sempre Insieme\', \'text\': \'Quando Per Sempre Insieme entra nel campo di battaglia, soccorri 2. (Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.)\\n{1}: Scegli una creatura bersaglio con un segnalino. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, fai tornare quella carta in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5815c54-5f5d-4db8-9a67-d43549902c87\', \'multiverseId\': 520135}, \'multiverseid\': 520135}, {\'name\': \'いつまでも共に\', \'text\': \'いつまでも共にが戦場に出たとき、支援２を行う。（クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\\n{1}：カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4261f5-7413-4ee1-8494-efa38b518dc0\', \'multiverseId\': 520383}, \'multiverseid\': 520383}, {\'name\': \'Juntos para Sempre\', \'text\': \'Quando Juntos para Sempre entrar no campo de batalha, suporte 2. (Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo.)\\n{1}: Escolha uma criatura alvo com um marcador. Quando aquela criatura morrer neste turno, devolva aquele card para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef772d4-4d60-4984-8a1c-82027b246668\', \'multiverseId\': 520631}, \'multiverseid\': 520631}, {\'name\': \'Навеки Вместе\', \'text\': \'Когда Навеки Вместе выходит на поле битвы, используйте Содействие 2. (Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ.)\\n{1}: выберите целевое существо с жетоном на нем. Когда то существо умирает в этом ходу, верните ту карту в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a8fab9-6baa-485a-a3aa-17b4345a3083\', \'multiverseId\': 520879}, \'multiverseid\': 520879}, {\'name\': \'永结同心\', \'text\': \'当永结同心进战场时，支援2。（在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}：选择目标其上有指示物的生物。本回合中，当该生物死去时，将该牌移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06114be5-3418-4ba5-9832-7a133827b50d\', \'multiverseId\': 521127}, \'multiverseid\': 521127}, {\'name\': \'永結同心\', \'text\': \'當永結同心進戰場時，支援2。（在至多兩個目標生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}：選擇目標其上有指示物的生物。本回合中，當該生物死去時，將該牌移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59298792-db5b-415f-a93f-e604d8d3aedf\', \'multiverseId\': 521375}, \'multiverseid\': 521375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gargoyle des Heiligtums\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Gargoyle des Heiligtums ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Als ihre Ätherium-Vorräte zur Neige gingen, mussten die Mechaniker ihre Gargoylen immer weiter ausschicken, um Nachschub zu erhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519385&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0dee275-5bbd-4c67-9b49-0b98c61dbb6d\', \'multiverseId\': 519385}, \'multiverseid\': 519385}, {\'name\': \'Gárgola del santuario\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Gárgola del santuario entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gárgola\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando sus reservas de eterium menguaron, los mecanistas enviaron gárgolas más y más lejos para encontrar restos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a428418-fe78-4b8d-a612-865f86504e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 519633}, \'multiverseid\': 519633}, {\'name\': \'Gargouille du sanctuaire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Gargouille du sanctuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : gargouille\', \'flavor\': "Leurs réserves d\'étherium disparaissant rapidement, les mécanistes envoyèrent les gargouilles toujours plus loin pour en récupérer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f678d8d-6b16-46d3-94df-c4e2e7dc2d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 519881}, \'multiverseid\': 519881}, {\'name\': \'Gargoyle del Santuario\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Gargoyle del Santuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Man mano che le loro scorte di eterium si riducevano, i meccanicisti inviavano i gargoyle sempre più lontano in cerca di materiale di recupero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ec382e7-b5d2-4c37-a2d8-ff5c74774f24\', \'multiverseId\': 520129}, \'multiverseid\': 520129}, {\'name\': \'聖域のガーゴイル\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n聖域のガーゴイルが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': \'エーテリウムの供給が少なくなるにつれ、商人は廃物を求めてガーゴイルをより遠くへと送り込むようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'825b27cc-f664-4f03-9c62-aae43d6211f3\', \'multiverseId\': 520377}, \'multiverseid\': 520377}, {\'name\': \'Gárgula do Santuário\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Gárgula do Santuário entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Gárgula\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme seu suprimento de etherium escasseava, os mecanistas mandavam as gárgulas cada vez mais longe em busca de sucata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f569485c-ecaf-413d-a23c-8593a59bc4c0\', \'multiverseId\': 520625}, \'multiverseid\': 520625}, {\'name\': \'Горгулья Святилища\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Горгулья Святилища выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевую карту артефакта из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Горгулья\', \'flavor\': \'По мере того как запасы эфирия подходили к концу, маги-механики отправляли горгулий все дальше и дальше на поиски того, что можно переработать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266df980-0347-4d4d-8f05-35db10a3cd30\', \'multiverseId\': 520873}, \'multiverseid\': 520873}, {\'name\': \'圣所石像鬼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当圣所石像鬼进战场时，你可以将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'机械师在乙金存量不足时，会派出石像鬼到遥远彼方搜寻可用材料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'add67912-3766-42ed-b6c7-84aef1567c61\', \'multiverseId\': 521121}, \'multiverseid\': 521121}, {\'name\': \'聖所石像鬼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當聖所石像鬼進戰場時，你可以將目標神器牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'機械師在乙金存量不足時，會派出石像鬼到遙遠彼方搜尋可用材料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a400945a-6364-4945-abdc-d4787e831a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 521369}, \'multiverseid\': 521369}]', "[{'name': 'Garruk der Urjäger', 'text': '+1: Erzeuge einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n−3: Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\n−6: Erzeuge für jedes Land, das du kontrollierst, einen 6/6 grünen Wurm-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Garruk', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519473&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43f429a4-fa84-43ad-9b1c-a46333e26667', 'multiverseId': 519473}, 'multiverseid': 519473}, {'name': 'Garruk, cazador primordial', 'text': '+1: Crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\\n−3: Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\\n−6: Crea una ficha de criatura Sierpe verde 6/6 por cada tierra que controlas.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Garruk', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519721&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8bb2068-e182-4a99-8ad5-557fb35975f9', 'multiverseId': 519721}, 'multiverseid': 519721}, {'name': 'Garruk, chasseur primordial', 'text': '+1 : Créez un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\\n-3 : Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\n-6 : Créez un jeton de créature 6/6 verte Guivre pour chaque terrain que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Garruk', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519969&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02731795-f642-4689-b369-534f1abd2082', 'multiverseId': 519969}, 'multiverseid': 519969}, {'name': 'Garruk, Cacciatore Primitivo', 'text': '+1: Crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\\n-3: Pesca un numero di carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\\n-6: Crea una pedina creatura Wurm 6/6 verde per ogni terra che controlli.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Garruk', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520217&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6dad37a-1311-4fd9-965c-c1a43f7e366e', 'multiverseId': 520217}, 'multiverseid': 520217}, {'name': '原初の狩人、ガラク', 'text': '+1：緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n-3：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n-6：あなたがコントロールしている土地１つにつき１体の、緑の６/６のワーム・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ガラク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520465&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e896d6ac-08f7-4b01-96cf-e790cdb0091d', 'multiverseId': 520465}, 'multiverseid': 520465}, {'name': 'Garruk, Caçador Primal', 'text': '+1: Crie uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 3/3.\\n−3: Compre uma quantidade de cards equivalente ao maior poder entre as criaturas que você controla.\\n−6: Crie uma ficha de criatura Vorme verde 6/6 para cada terreno que você controla.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário — Garruk', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520713&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61675283-d05b-4fbe-ad09-29fa926ca673', 'multiverseId': 520713}, 'multiverseid': 520713}, {'name': 'Гаррук, Первобытный Охотник', 'text': '+1: создайте одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь.\\n—3: возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению силы среди существ под вашим контролем.\\n—6: создайте одну фишку существа 6/6 зеленый Вурм за каждую землю под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Легендарный Planeswalker — Гаррук', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520961&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79797cea-bbcc-4782-893d-dce1321fdb8e', 'multiverseId': 520961}, 'multiverseid': 520961}, {'name': '原初猎人贾路', 'text': '+1：派出一个3/3绿色野兽衍生生物。\\n−3：抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n−6：你每操控一个地，便派出一个6/6绿色亚龙衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～贾路', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521209&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f1ee0dc-4b03-4e4c-9bcc-0bc8c8d0d496', 'multiverseId': 521209}, 'multiverseid': 521209}, {'name': '原初獵人賈路', 'text': '+1：派出一個3/3綠色野獸衍生生物。\\n−3：抽若干牌，其數量等同於由你操控的生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n−6：你每操控一個地，便派出一個6/6綠色亞龍衍生生物。', 'type': '傳奇鵬洛客 ～賈路', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521457&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2e8aabb-fb50-463b-baf9-05a69d7c1cab', 'multiverseId': 521457}, 'multiverseid': 521457}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f2e160a-fba0-4727-8080-e5dd64c4d24a\', \'multiverseId\': 519534}, \'multiverseid\': 519534}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es el maná sino una posibilidad, una idea a la que todavía no se ha dado forma?".\\n—Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad2628f-fd3c-4bb3-a79a-58c8f32cabc3\', \'multiverseId\': 519782}, \'multiverseid\': 519782}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6610c6cc-fb5a-4d39-aa91-3141fec071b3\', \'multiverseId\': 520030}, \'multiverseid\': 520030}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329a8d11-0008-4167-aff4-f033aa726080\', \'multiverseId\': 520278}, \'multiverseid\': 520278}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1adbe93-61e3-4cf9-a8a9-09fa913e3fde\', \'multiverseId\': 520526}, \'multiverseid\': 520526}, {\'name\': \'Pedra da Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Pedra da Mente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é o mana senão o possível, uma ideia à qual ainda não se deu forma?"\\n— Jhoira, mestre artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be745aa9-d607-469a-a990-8ee4a1b66309\', \'multiverseId\': 520774}, \'multiverseid\': 520774}, {\'name\': \'Камень Разума\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Камень Разума: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Что есть мана, как не возможность, не идея, еще не обретшая форму?»\\n— Джойра, мастер-механик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4de9b460-806d-47e4-8179-36fa6c090c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 521022}, \'multiverseid\': 521022}, {\'name\': \'心灵石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲心灵石：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「法术力是尚无定形的理念，那这无穷的可能性又是什么？」\\n～神器大师尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2613577c-9fe3-4481-b515-f374256b9e33\', \'multiverseId\': 521270}, \'multiverseid\': 521270}, {\'name\': \'心靈石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲心靈石：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法力是尚無定形的理念，那這無窮的可能性又是什麼？」\\n～神器大師尤依菈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30dd5fd-7289-4609-a898-24ff27bfcbe0\', \'multiverseId\': 521518}, \'multiverseid\': 521518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenwirbel\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und lege dann zwei Karten aus deiner Hand in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Mizzium-Sphärenfeld trug ihren Geist tief in das Gedankenfeld, in dem man nur die seltensten Genius-Partikel — reifen Früchten gleich — pflücken konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519398&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c560fb5-f321-412e-8482-cea97a920dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 519398}, \'multiverseid\': 519398}, {\'name\': \'Inspiración súbita\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas y luego pon dos cartas de tu mano en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El conjunto de esferas de mízzium hundió su mente en las profundidades del campo del pensamiento, donde solo se pueden encontrar las más raras motas de ingenio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0524f827-9c5d-441e-8e37-655eac787c90\', \'multiverseId\': 519646}, \'multiverseid\': 519646}, {\'name\': \'Remue-méninges\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes et mettez ensuite deux cartes de votre main au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La batterie de sphères de mizzium conduisit son esprit dans les profondeurs du champ mental, où attendent d\'être cueillis les rarissimes éclairs de génie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519894&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa24aa9-69b9-41a2-b562-97d17a9506d2\', \'multiverseId\': 519894}, \'multiverseid\': 519894}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi metti due carte dalla tua mano in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'arsenale delle sfere di Mizzium fece volare i suoi pensieri lontano, in un luogo dove solo i granelli più rari della ricchezza d\'ingegno possono essere estirpati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'247a878c-c855-4793-834f-9c5a23671489\', \'multiverseId\': 520142}, \'multiverseid\': 520142}, {\'name\': \'渦まく知識\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札からカード２枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'あるかないかの光明を求め、彼女の精神はミジウム球配列によって思考場の深みへと誘われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d886e57d-f42a-46bb-9f22-248bda9bb556\', \'multiverseId\': 520390}, \'multiverseid\': 520390}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade Cerebral\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards. Depois, coloque dois cards de sua mão no topo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A matriz de mizzium-esfera levou sua mente às profundezas do campo das ideias, de onde somente as partículas mais raras de genialidade podem ser colhidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d85b5f-8934-489b-a8a5-48135342242b\', \'multiverseId\': 520638}, \'multiverseid\': 520638}, {\'name\': \'Мозговой Штурм\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты, затем положите две карты из вашей руки на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Кольцо из миззиевых сфер заставило ее разум погрузиться в бездны поля мыслей, где можно было выловить редчайшие частицы гениальности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef5acd9-0e6d-43b0-87de-6a92221c5788\', \'multiverseId\': 520886}, \'multiverseid\': 520886}, {\'name\': \'脑力激荡\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌，然后将两张牌从你手上以任意顺序置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'整排的米捷球助她的心灵深探思想领域，寻访其间智慧灵光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0da569aa-bbe6-429d-87ad-56bf3d9bab6b\', \'multiverseId\': 521134}, \'multiverseid\': 521134}, {\'name\': \'腦力激盪\', \'text\': \'抽三張牌，然後從你手上將兩張牌以任意順序置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'整排的米捷球助她的心靈深探思想領域，尋訪其間智慧靈光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8fa82fd-26f1-42af-8d9c-8832d5b87ade\', \'multiverseId\': 521382}, \'multiverseid\': 521382}]', "[{'name': 'Gedenkstätte der Genialität', 'text': 'Die Gedenkstätte der Genialität kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, opfere die Gedenkstätte der Genialität: Ziehe zwei Karten.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519584&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7e2ba7c-4a2f-4d08-b4cc-129d6e53f411', 'multiverseId': 519584}, 'multiverseid': 519584}, {'name': 'Monumento al ingenio', 'text': 'El Monumento al ingenio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, sacrificar el Monumento al ingenio: Roba dos cartas.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519832&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab515394-1701-41ef-8db4-7f40ea7a92e9', 'multiverseId': 519832}, 'multiverseid': 519832}, {'name': 'Mémorial au génie', 'text': 'Le Mémorial au génie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mémorial au génie : Piochez deux cartes.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520080&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc4376d7-e676-45b7-889d-f66b279176c8', 'multiverseId': 520080}, 'multiverseid': 520080}, {'name': 'Monumento al Genio', 'text': 'Il Monumento al Genio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, Sacrifica il Monumento al Genio: Pesca due carte.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520328&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8447991-6af1-4b10-a2c0-ac39c8f9e48f', 'multiverseId': 520328}, 'multiverseid': 520328}, {'name': '天才の記念像', 'text': '天才の記念像はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\n{4}{U}, {T}, 天才の記念像を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520576&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4031f69-72f8-4443-b6a9-103e7641996c', 'multiverseId': 520576}, 'multiverseid': 520576}, {'name': 'Memorial à Genialidade', 'text': 'Memorial à Genialidade entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, sacrifique Memorial à Genialidade: Compre dois cards.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520824&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7c6b672-35b2-4cf9-8012-22e40babe1d6', 'multiverseId': 520824}, 'multiverseid': 520824}, {'name': 'Памятник Гениальности', 'text': 'Памятник Гениальности выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, пожертвуйте Памятник Гениальности: возьмите две карты.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521072&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '682616aa-96f3-4ec2-9eff-03f9e4992df5', 'multiverseId': 521072}, 'multiverseid': 521072}, {'name': '智行纪念碑', 'text': '智行纪念碑须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n{4}{U}，{T}，牺牲智行纪念碑：抓两张牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521320&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '712ce7e6-7403-4277-bd6b-bc3c71726532', 'multiverseId': 521320}, 'multiverseid': 521320}, {'name': '智行紀念碑', 'text': '智行紀念碑須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n{4}{U}，{T}，犧牲智行紀念碑：抽兩張牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521568&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29a194cd-e555-4618-8d75-51313f0b09c4', 'multiverseId': 521568}, 'multiverseid': 521568}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiger Troll\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Gefräßige Troll ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge so viele Speise-Spielsteine, wie du Gegner hast. (Speise-Spielsteine sind Artefakte mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\\n{1}{G}, opfere eine andere bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist: Der Gefräßige Troll erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Troll\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c80564-d326-4dd8-afa4-44be0aa22827\', \'multiverseId\': 519501}, \'multiverseid\': 519501}, {\'name\': \'Trol glotón\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Trol glotón entre al campo de batalla, crea una cantidad de fichas de Comida igual a la cantidad de oponentes que tienes. (Las fichas de Comida son artefactos con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas.")\\n{1}{G}, sacrificar otro permanente que no sea tierra: El Trol glotón obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trol\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd4ae9b3-b077-4480-b4a7-4718b42268d6\', \'multiverseId\': 519749}, \'multiverseid\': 519749}, {\'name\': \'Troll glouton\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Troll glouton arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un nombre de jetons Nourriture égal au nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez. (Les jetons Nourriture sont des artefacts avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\\n{1}{G}, sacrifiez un autre permanent non-terrain : Le Troll glouton gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : troll\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519997&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b55cece1-25e0-4815-9c0a-0a5b79344b10\', \'multiverseId\': 519997}, \'multiverseid\': 519997}, {\'name\': \'Troll Ingordo\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Troll Ingordo entra nel campo di battaglia, crea un numero di pedine Cibo pari al numero di avversari che hai. (Le pedine Cibo sono artefatti con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifica un altro permanente non terra: Il Troll Ingordo prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Troll\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c34246d-2a50-467d-a589-95a3bf113d39\', \'multiverseId\': 520245}, \'multiverseid\': 520245}, {\'name\': \'大食いトロール\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n大食いトロールが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の人数に等しい数の食物・トークンを生成する。（食物・トークンとは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n{1}{G}, 土地でもこれでもないパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、大食いトロールは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トロール\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e4a6e38-0de6-46ad-b399-cf11f07e38f3\', \'multiverseId\': 520493}, \'multiverseid\': 520493}, {\'name\': \'Trol Glutão\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Trol Glutão entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma quantidade de fichas de Comida igual ao número de oponentes que você tem. (As fichas de Comida são artefatos com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\\n{1}{G}, sacrifique outra permanente não de terreno: Trol Glutão recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trol\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d56101-7d92-4dad-a2e2-82276443acba\', \'multiverseId\': 520741}, \'multiverseid\': 520741}, {\'name\': \'Прожорливый Тролль\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Прожорливый Тролль выходит на поле битвы, создайте количество фишек Еды, равное числу имеющихся у вас оппонентов. (Фишки Еды — это артефакты со способностью «{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: вы получаете 3 жизни».)\\n{1}{G}, пожертвуйте другой не являющийся землей перманент: Прожорливый Тролль получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тролль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ddf7d1-7338-4df9-abb0-1d4e60bdea1a\', \'multiverseId\': 520989}, \'multiverseid\': 520989}, {\'name\': \'暴食巨魔\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当暴食巨魔进战场时，派出若干食品衍生物，其数量等同于你的对手数量。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\\n{1}{G}，牺牲另一个非地永久物：暴食巨魔得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'556b5bdf-287a-4a82-b460-2ec908c2f69c\', \'multiverseId\': 521237}, \'multiverseid\': 521237}, {\'name\': \'暴食巨魔\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當暴食巨魔進戰場時，派出若干食品衍生物，其數量等同於你的對手數量。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，犧牲此神器：你獲得3點生命」的神器。）\\n{1}{G}，犧牲另一個非地永久物：暴食巨魔得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b491e97-88ed-4cdc-8603-afbd6735edd6\', \'multiverseId\': 521485}, \'multiverseid\': 521485}]', "[{'name': 'Gejagter Lammasu', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Gejagte Lammasu ins Spiel kommt, erzeugt ein Gegner deiner Wahl einen 4/4 schwarzen Schrecken-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Lammasu', 'flavor': 'Die Lammasu waren die Herrscher der Steppen, bevor die Stadt sich ausdehnte. Jetzt bevölkern sie den Himmel über Ravnica, aber ihre Erzfeinde haben sie nicht vergessen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519377&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '727d5e58-05b5-4f4b-9d7e-8122f02b54d1', 'multiverseId': 519377}, 'multiverseid': 519377}, {'name': 'Lammasu perseguido', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Lammasu perseguido entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo crea una ficha de criatura Horror negra 4/4.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lammasu', 'flavor': 'Los lammasu dominaban las estepas antes de que creciera la ciudad. Ahora vagan por los cielos de Rávnica, pero sus antiguos enemigos no los han olvidado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519625&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '822478dd-c49c-4954-a12f-469ef3f4313c', 'multiverseId': 519625}, 'multiverseid': 519625}, {'name': 'Lamassu au rabais', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Lamassu au rabais arrive sur le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé crée un jeton de créature 4/4 noire Horreur.', 'type': 'Créature : lamassu', 'flavor': 'Les lamassus dominaient les velds avant la croissance de la cité. Désormais, ils parcourent les cieux de Ravnica, mais leurs anciens ennemis ne les ont pas oubliés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519873&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af346bc5-4851-49eb-b3f2-6b3962a26cd7', 'multiverseId': 519873}, 'multiverseid': 519873}, {'name': 'Lammasu Braccato', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Lammasu Braccato entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio crea una pedina creatura Orrore 4/4 nera.', 'type': 'Creatura — Lammasu', 'flavor': 'I lammasu dominavano i veld prima che la città si espandesse. Ora solcano i cieli di Ravnica, ma i loro antichi nemici non li hanno dimenticati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520121&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78860c5f-53d2-4a8c-8b36-a48aee3f65a1', 'multiverseId': 520121}, 'multiverseid': 520121}, {'name': '狩り立てられたラマスー', 'text': '飛行\\n狩り立てられたラマスーが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは黒の４/４のホラー・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ラマスー', 'flavor': '都市が発展する前は、ラマスーが平原を支配していた。今でも彼らはラヴニカの空を飛んでいるが、昔からの敵はそれを忘れてはいない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520369&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84250a18-54cf-4481-a836-af6046499e1b', 'multiverseId': 520369}, 'multiverseid': 520369}, {'name': 'Lammasu Caçado', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Lammasu Caçado entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo cria uma ficha de criatura Horror preta 4/4.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lammasu', 'flavor': 'Os lammasus governavam as relvas antes do crescimento da cidade. Agora eles perambulam pelos céus de Ravnica, mas seus antigos inimigos não se esqueceram deles.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520617&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f187f2a-3246-4061-8416-92b73b567ed6', 'multiverseId': 520617}, 'multiverseid': 520617}, {'name': 'Загнанный Ламмасу', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Загнанный Ламмасу выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент создает одну фишку существа 4/4 черный Ужас.', 'type': 'Существо — Ламмасу', 'flavor': 'Перед тем как здесь вырос город, вельдом правили ламмасу. Теперь они парят в небесах Равники, но древние враги их не забыли.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520865&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc769da5-ee99-4af0-96af-d461dfce94a3', 'multiverseId': 520865}, 'multiverseid': 520865}, {'name': '遭缉拉玛苏', 'text': '飞行\\n当遭缉拉玛苏进战场时，目标对手派出一个4/4黑色惊惧兽衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～拉玛苏', 'flavor': '早在城市矗立之前，拉玛苏便统治着草原；现今它们遨游于拉尼卡的天空，但其宿敌可还没忘记它们。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521113&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9325d6a3-09cf-4c28-a3eb-a8b3da719c93', 'multiverseId': 521113}, 'multiverseid': 521113}, {'name': '遭緝拉瑪蘇', 'text': '飛行\\n當遭緝拉瑪蘇進戰場時，目標對手派出一個4/4黑色驚懼獸衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～拉瑪蘇', 'flavor': '早在城市矗立之前，拉瑪蘇便統治著草原；現今牠們遨遊於拉尼卡的天空，但其宿敵可還沒忘記牠們。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521361&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c712d59-baf9-4b11-8841-4902d2542a08', 'multiverseId': 521361}, 'multiverseid': 521361}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gelebtes Wissen\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Gelebte Wissen ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Gelebten Wissens sind gleich dem Manabetrag der ins Exil geschickten Karte.\\nImmer wenn das Gelebte Wissen Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du es opfern. Falls du dies tust, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771455e9-aa5d-4202-a311-17c1529f4418\', \'multiverseId\': 519404}, \'multiverseid\': 519404}, {\'name\': \'Sabiduría viva\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Sabiduría viva entra al campo de batalla, exilia una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de tu cementerio.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia de la Sabiduría viva son iguales al valor de maná de la carta exiliada.\\nSiempre que la Sabiduría viva haga daño de combate, puedes sacrificarla. Si lo haces, puedes lanzar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b9fcee-5520-44c6-8d04-2bdfef277b18\', \'multiverseId\': 519652}, \'multiverseid\': 519652}, {\'name\': \'Sapience vivante\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Sapience vivante arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière.\\nLa force et l\'endurance de la Sapience vivante sont chacune égales à la valeur de mana de la carte exilée.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Sapience vivante inflige des blessures de combat, vous pouvez la sacrifier. Si vous faites ainsi, vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca0dd50-debf-4413-9aa4-97138a89e115\', \'multiverseId\': 519900}, \'multiverseid\': 519900}, {\'name\': \'Sapere Vivente\', \'text\': \'Mentre il Sapere Vivente entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero.\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Sapere Vivente sono pari al valore di mana della carta esiliata.\\nOgniqualvolta il Sapere Vivente infligge danno da combattimento, puoi sacrificarlo. Se lo fai, puoi lanciare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4695090-2d7a-4072-8556-5ff34d25e859\', \'multiverseId\': 520148}, \'multiverseid\': 520148}, {\'name\': \'生ける伝承\', \'text\': \'生ける伝承が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を追放する。\\n生ける伝承のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、その追放したカードのマナ総量に等しい。\\n生ける伝承が戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは「これを生け贄に捧げ、その追放したカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc63c154-7a9e-43bc-8e6c-5c659829a5b0\', \'multiverseId\': 520396}, \'multiverseid\': 520396}, {\'name\': \'Conhecimento Vivo\', \'text\': \'Conforme Conhecimento Vivo entrar no campo de batalha, exile um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço do seu cemitério.\\nO poder e resistência de Conhecimento Vivo são iguais ao valor de mana do card exilado.\\nToda vez que Conhecimento Vivo causa dano de combate, você pode sacrificá-lo. Se fizer isso, você poderá conjurar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd9785a-dcee-4619-8935-2f5cb5cc704a\', \'multiverseId\': 520644}, \'multiverseid\': 520644}, {\'name\': \'Живая Летопись\', \'text\': \'При выходе Живой Летописи на поле битвы изгоните карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища.\\nСила и выносливость Живой Летописи равны мановой ценности изгнанной карты.\\nКаждый раз, когда Живая Летопись наносит боевые повреждения, вы можете пожертвовать ее. Если вы это делаете, вы можете разыграть ту изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ddc376d-5134-4ce6-8441-07746b9aa44d\', \'multiverseId\': 520892}, \'multiverseid\': 520892}, {\'name\': \'自行识库\', \'text\': \'于自行识库进战场时，从你的坟墓场放逐一张瞬间或法术牌。\\n自行识库的力量和防御力各等同于所放逐之牌的法术力值。\\n每当自行识库造成战斗伤害时，你可以将它牺牲。若你如此作，你可以施放所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6f1a8a-8a5f-450f-b564-f5ec9ec1cadf\', \'multiverseId\': 521140}, \'multiverseid\': 521140}, {\'name\': \'自行識庫\', \'text\': \'於自行識庫進戰場時，從你的墳墓場放逐一張瞬間或巫術牌。\\n自行識庫的力量和防禦力各等同於所放逐之牌的魔法力值。\\n每當自行識庫造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以將它犧牲。若你如此作，你可以施放所放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～聖者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2889d30-8936-42df-ab9d-0f21adea511d\', \'multiverseId\': 521388}, \'multiverseid\': 521388}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geometrischer Nexus\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, lege so viele Ladungsmarken auf den Geometrischen Nexus, wie der Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs beträgt.\\n{6}, {T}, entferne alle Ladungsmarken vom Geometrischen Nexus: Erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ladungsmarken ist, die auf diese Weise entfernt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bc2f1e-5334-44b4-8ed5-602bb1ac05ee\', \'multiverseId\': 518544}, \'multiverseid\': 518544}, {\'name\': \'Nexo geométrico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon una cantidad de contadores de carga sobre el Nexo geométrico igual al valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\n{6}, {T}, remover todos los contadores de carga del Nexo geométrico: Crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de carga removidos de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1888afd6-5de9-49c8-a37c-ec44827f7fa5\', \'multiverseId\': 518615}, \'multiverseid\': 518615}, {\'name\': \'Nexus géométrique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un nombre de marqueurs « charge » égal à la valeur de mana de ce sort sur le Nexus géométrique.\\n{6}, {T}, retirez tous les marqueurs « charge » du Nexus géométrique : Créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « charge » retirés de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'378e63e1-d469-46e1-b10c-ad19f61aa7f4\', \'multiverseId\': 518686}, \'multiverseid\': 518686}, {\'name\': \'Fulcro Geometrico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti sul Fulcro Geometrico un numero di segnalini carica pari al valore di mana di quella magia.\\n{6}, {T}, Rimuovi tutti i segnalini carica dal Fulcro Geometrico: Crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il numero di segnalini carica rimossi in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2577a3df-eb45-4fc1-a42b-c6966c51d008\', \'multiverseId\': 518757}, \'multiverseid\': 518757}, {\'name\': \'幾何学的結合体\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、幾何学的結合体の上に、その呪文のマナ総量に等しい個数の蓄積カウンターを置く。\\n{6}, {T}, 幾何学的結合体の上からすべての蓄積カウンターを取り除く：緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはこれにより取り除かれた蓄積カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e255d6f-9196-497c-bd12-90474bc49e59\', \'multiverseId\': 518828}, \'multiverseid\': 518828}, {\'name\': \'Nexo Geométrico\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, coloque em Nexo Geométrico um número de marcadores de carga igual ao valor de mana daquela mágica.\\n{6}, {T}, remova todos os marcadores de carga de Nexo Geométrico: Crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela, sendo X o número de marcadores de carga removidos dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b285a4-3ff9-496b-9a4d-77c0ad2a3642\', \'multiverseId\': 518899}, \'multiverseid\': 518899}, {\'name\': \'Геометрическое Ядро\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, положите на Геометрическое Ядро жетоны заряда в количестве, равном мановой ценности того заклинания.\\n{6}, {T}, удалите все жетоны заряда с Геометрического Ядра: создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1, где X — количество жетонов заряда, удаленных таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c72db0-e9e9-4d98-9309-4f098d3f4fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 518970}, \'multiverseid\': 518970}, {\'name\': \'几何连接点\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手施放瞬间或法术咒语时，在几何连接点上放置数量等同于该咒语法术力值的充电指示物。\\n{6}，{T}，从几何连接点上移去所有充电指示物：派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为以此法移去的充电指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3ea4fbf-2ae6-4e23-b253-84f34cd882ff\', \'multiverseId\': 519041}, \'multiverseid\': 519041}, {\'name\': \'幾何連接點\', \'text\': \'每當任一玩家施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，在幾何連接點上放置數量等同於該咒語魔法力值的充電指示物。\\n{6}，{T}，從幾何連接點上移去所有充電指示物：派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為以此法移去的充電指示物數量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f93414bf-1216-4608-b6ca-4eac4be22f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 519112}, \'multiverseid\': 519112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geometrischer Nexus\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, lege so viele Ladungsmarken auf den Geometrischen Nexus, wie der Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs beträgt.\\n{6}, {T}, entferne alle Ladungsmarken vom Geometrischen Nexus: Erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ladungsmarken ist, die auf diese Weise entfernt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521753&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae449f8c-cd19-453f-bd2e-f4f535dfe38e\', \'multiverseId\': 521753}, \'multiverseid\': 521753}, {\'name\': \'Nexo geométrico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon una cantidad de contadores de carga sobre el Nexo geométrico igual al valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\n{6}, {T}, remover todos los contadores de carga del Nexo geométrico: Crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de carga removidos de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4def83f-8cea-4a33-92e2-0a9c07009455\', \'multiverseId\': 521833}, \'multiverseid\': 521833}, {\'name\': \'Nexus géométrique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un nombre de marqueurs « charge » égal à la valeur de mana de ce sort sur le Nexus géométrique.\\n{6}, {T}, retirez tous les marqueurs « charge » du Nexus géométrique : Créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « charge » retirés de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6053880e-6773-41ed-be65-38b165b30830\', \'multiverseId\': 521913}, \'multiverseid\': 521913}, {\'name\': \'Fulcro Geometrico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti sul Fulcro Geometrico un numero di segnalini carica pari al valore di mana di quella magia.\\n{6}, {T}, Rimuovi tutti i segnalini carica dal Fulcro Geometrico: Crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il numero di segnalini carica rimossi in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e281e92b-9045-4acf-baed-504a58db3147\', \'multiverseId\': 521993}, \'multiverseid\': 521993}, {\'name\': \'幾何学的結合体\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、幾何学的結合体の上に、その呪文のマナ総量に等しい個数の蓄積カウンターを置く。\\n{6}, {T}, 幾何学的結合体の上からすべての蓄積カウンターを取り除く：緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはこれにより取り除かれた蓄積カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb87f7e2-a6d6-4c13-82e9-3001dcc4a740\', \'multiverseId\': 522073}, \'multiverseid\': 522073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerissener Anstifter\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, nicht geblockt werden. Stachle die Kreatur an. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich? Ich bin nur ein unschuldiger Zuschauer!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'288b910c-04bc-4c4d-98fd-eec3d82ddd6c\', \'multiverseId\': 518499}, \'multiverseid\': 518499}, {\'name\': \'Instigador astuto\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Hasta tu próximo turno, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente no puede ser bloqueada. Incita a esa criatura. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Yo? Pero ¡si solo pasaba por aquí!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b713cdc-962f-4c3f-9d16-4ba8182e02dd\', \'multiverseId\': 518570}, \'multiverseid\': 518570}, {\'name\': \'Instigateur sournois\', \'text\': "{U}, {T} : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle ne peut pas être bloquée. Incitez cette créature. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Moi ? Mais je ne faisais que passer ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518641&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795b95bd-6263-4a8b-82ff-2ee3bc375ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 518641}, \'multiverseid\': 518641}, {\'name\': \'Istigatore Subdolo\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario non può essere bloccata. Sprona quella creatura. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quella creatura attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Io? Sono solo un passante innocente!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25c8e548-bb4b-4b72-8f02-6512799171bd\', \'multiverseId\': 518712}, \'multiverseid\': 518712}, {\'name\': \'枉惑な扇動者\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたの次のターンまで、それはブロックされない。そのクリーチャーを使嗾する。（あなたの次のターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「僕？偶然ここにいただけで無関係さ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375af710-4bfa-4b4b-9e99-1f4e0a451a29\', \'multiverseId\': 518783}, \'multiverseid\': 518783}, {\'name\': \'Instigador Ardiloso\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Até seu próximo turno, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla não pode ser bloqueada. Atice aquela criatura. (Até seu próximo turno, aquela criatura ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu? Eu sou só um espectador inocente!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'614e88e1-b48b-4f81-a9ac-601c184880c3\', \'multiverseId\': 518854}, \'multiverseid\': 518854}, {\'name\': \'Коварный Подстрекатель\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: до вашего следующего хода целевое существо под контролем оппонента не может быть заблокировано. Разъярите то существо. (До вашего следующего хода то существо атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Я? Да я просто рядом стоял!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6896c4dd-900a-49f2-9172-b748a3cd6eac\', \'multiverseId\': 518925}, \'multiverseid\': 518925}, {\'name\': \'狡黠煽动师\', \'text\': \'{U}，{T}：直到你的下一个回合，目标由对手操控的生物不能被阻挡。煽惑该生物。（直到你的下一个回合，该生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我？不过是个无辜路人罢了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edec54f2-b887-48d7-9532-b9aeb17dcc5b\', \'multiverseId\': 518996}, \'multiverseid\': 518996}, {\'name\': \'狡黠煽動師\', \'text\': \'{U}，{T}：直到你的下一個回合，目標由對手操控的生物不能被阻擋。煽惑該生物。（直到你的下一個回合，該生物每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我？不過是個無辜路人罷了！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52f91f64-86f8-4017-843c-feca41e0f0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 519067}, \'multiverseid\': 519067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerissener Anstifter\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, nicht geblockt werden. Stachle die Kreatur an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521708&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67118c8-233b-4697-b73f-b085fe04bafc\', \'multiverseId\': 521708}, \'multiverseid\': 521708}, {\'name\': \'Instigador astuto\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Hasta tu próximo turno, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente no puede ser bloqueada. Incita a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d700a33e-dec5-414f-a226-babac9bf06e1\', \'multiverseId\': 521788}, \'multiverseid\': 521788}, {\'name\': \'Instigateur sournois\', \'text\': "{U}, {T} : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle ne peut pas être bloquée. Incitez cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a01a0103-b3b0-4617-af7b-6ea244dd509f\', \'multiverseId\': 521868}, \'multiverseid\': 521868}, {\'name\': \'Istigatore Subdolo\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario non può essere bloccata. Sprona quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f69725-2ec7-48a2-848f-1d18921aefcd\', \'multiverseId\': 521948}, \'multiverseid\': 521948}, {\'name\': \'枉惑な扇動者\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたの次のターンまで、それはブロックされない。そのクリーチャーを使嗾する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b9af5d-210e-4f80-92ea-8e6009880e98\', \'multiverseId\': 522028}, \'multiverseid\': 522028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschenk des Paradieses\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nWenn das Geschenk des Paradieses ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519474&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6bf77bc-351b-42a3-b32c-ab0ebe0dfd38\', \'multiverseId\': 519474}, \'multiverseid\': 519474}, {\'name\': \'Obsequio del paraíso\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nCuando el Obsequio del paraíso entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "{T}: Agrega dos manás de un color cualquiera".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b0a0145-76c4-4730-981f-1afd1561af6a\', \'multiverseId\': 519722}, \'multiverseid\': 519722}, {\'name\': \'Don de paradis\', \'text\': "Enchanter : terrain\\nQuand le Don de paradis arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\nLe terrain enchanté a « {T} : Ajoutez deux manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519970&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45eac2f7-6b6e-497a-ad24-c68e83beb541\', \'multiverseId\': 519970}, \'multiverseid\': 519970}, {\'name\': \'Dono del Paradiso\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nQuando il Dono del Paradiso entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.\\nLa terra incantata ha "{T}: Aggiungi due mana di un qualsiasi colore".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e8b4e3-bbc8-4fbe-9d76-26c77fb9c904\', \'multiverseId\': 520218}, \'multiverseid\': 520218}, {\'name\': \'楽園の贈り物\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\n楽園の贈り物が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\nエンチャントしている土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a839ca0-2d64-456e-95d2-8bc4ac30dc5f\', \'multiverseId\': 520466}, \'multiverseid\': 520466}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva do Paraíso\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nQuando Dádiva do Paraíso entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\nO terreno encantando tem "{T}: Adicione dois manas de uma cor à sua escolha."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae5c1ca-4fed-427a-a4ec-3e8a4ec500b8\', \'multiverseId\': 520714}, \'multiverseid\': 520714}, {\'name\': \'Дарованный Рай\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nКогда Дарованный Рай выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни.\\nЗачарованная земля имеет способность «{T}: добавьте две маны любого одного цвета».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea98420f-2366-47c7-8c48-55155d1579f6\', \'multiverseId\': 520962}, \'multiverseid\': 520962}, {\'name\': \'天堂赋礼\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n当天堂赋礼进战场时，你获得3点生命。\\n所结附的地具有「{T}：加两点任意颜色的单色法术力。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f66a892-9b22-4b07-8139-7709026026c2\', \'multiverseId\': 521210}, \'multiverseid\': 521210}, {\'name\': \'天堂賦禮\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n當天堂賦禮進戰場時，你獲得3點生命。\\n所結附的地具有「{T}：加兩點任意顏色的單色魔法力。」\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a76f5c08-48a1-4ef5-84e1-7d37196793ab\', \'multiverseId\': 521458}, \'multiverseid\': 521458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschickte Taschendiebin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Geschickte Taschendiebin ins Spiel kommt, wird jeder Spielstein, der in diesem Zug unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners erzeugt würde, stattdessen unter deiner Kontrolle erzeugt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'Besitztümer anzuhäufen, ist das oberste Gebot unter den Piraten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dac3fb0-63bc-4fa8-89d7-8401cc0ba340\', \'multiverseId\': 519400}, \'multiverseid\': 519400}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuela habilidosa\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Ladronzuela habilidosa entre al campo de batalla, cada ficha que fuera a ser creada bajo el control de un oponente este turno, en vez de eso, se crea bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'La posesión es un 110 % del código pirata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2478252e-ba36-4133-8b32-734528686913\', \'multiverseId\': 519648}, \'multiverseid\': 519648}, {\'name\': \'Coupe-bourse astucieuse\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Coupe-bourse astucieuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque jeton qui devrait être créé sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire ce tour-ci est créé sous votre contrôle à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': \'Le larcin est la première et unique règle du code des pirates.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b87af10-9e7c-44d2-8983-0c39bcb6d9db\', \'multiverseId\': 519896}, \'multiverseid\': 519896}, {\'name\': \'Tagliaborse Astuta\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Tagliaborse Astuta entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni pedina che sta per essere creata sotto il controllo di un avversario in questo turno viene invece creata sotto il tuo controllo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Arraffa" è la prima e unica regola del codice dei pirati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197917da-6d61-4814-bd50-bbbe1d236ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 520144}, \'multiverseid\': 520144}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な巾着切り\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n狡猾な巾着切りが戦場に出たとき、このターン、対戦相手のコントロール下で生成される各トークンは、代わりに、あなたのコントロール下で生成される。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'占有こそ海賊の心得そのものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5090eda5-14b0-43a4-9745-df557c8b47c4\', \'multiverseId\': 520392}, \'multiverseid\': 520392}, {\'name\': \'Ladra Astuta\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Ladra Astuta entra no campo de batalha, cada ficha que seria criada sob o controle de um oponente neste turno é, em vez disso, criada sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': \'A posse é 110% do código da pirataria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02a7ade-9002-4b31-a304-6d7b7ff400fe\', \'multiverseId\': 520640}, \'multiverseid\': 520640}, {\'name\': \'Находчивая Карманница\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Находчивая Карманница выходит на поле битвы, каждая фишка, которая должна быть создана под контролем оппонента в этом ходу, создается под вашим контролем вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пират\', \'flavor\': \'Завладение имуществом — это одиннадцать десятых пиратского кодекса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea3d7d8-677e-4c36-ab61-63b85c16cb06\', \'multiverseId\': 520888}, \'multiverseid\': 520888}, {\'name\': \'狡智扒手\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当狡智扒手进战场时，所有将于本回合中在对手操控下派出的衍生物，改为在你的操控下派出之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'海盗铁则：现实占有，尽归我手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7441befe-9e9b-4f17-b588-fa714bce1aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 521136}, \'multiverseid\': 521136}, {\'name\': \'狡智扒手\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當狡智扒手進戰場時，所有將於本回合中在對手操控下派出的衍生物，改為在你的操控下派出之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／海盜\', \'flavor\': \'海盜鐵則：現實佔有，盡歸我手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7a3a28-5a1f-46ab-9e13-2a4933f7481d\', \'multiverseId\': 521384}, \'multiverseid\': 521384}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschmack des Todes\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler opfert drei Kreaturen. Du erzeugst drei Speise-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Schärfe das Messer und lass die Trauer aus.\\nDrei Glockenschläge rufen zum grausigen Schmaus."\\n—Beschwörungsformel der Grabhügelhexen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c41e14-dc0c-4ff9-89b6-76cc1058518f\', \'multiverseId\': 519439}, \'multiverseid\': 519439}, {\'name\': \'Probar la muerte\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador sacrifica tres criaturas. Tú creas tres fichas de Comida. (Son artefactos con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Afila el cuchillo, pon a tus lagrimas fin.\\nTres campanas invitan al macabro festín".\\n—Sortilegio de las brujas de los túmulos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6024618-d388-42aa-ab53-17d1f60e699d\', \'multiverseId\': 519687}, \'multiverseid\': 519687}, {\'name\': \'Goût de mort\', \'text\': \'Chaque joueur sacrifie trois créatures. Vous créez trois jetons Nourriture. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Affûtez le couteau et faites un deuil minimal.\\nTrois carillons sonnent un doux festin sépulcral. »\\n—Incantation de l\'envoûteuse des tumulus", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519935&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a9cccd-eb99-49c6-bf9c-bfe2da232364\', \'multiverseId\': 519935}, \'multiverseid\': 519935}, {\'name\': \'Assaggio di Morte\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore sacrifica tre creature. Crei tre pedine Cibo. (Sono artefatti con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Affila il coltello e compiangi il più avvilito.\\nTre rintocchi per celebrare il dolce, macabro convito."\\n—Incantesimo delle streghe dei tumuli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'074aa74a-6e6a-449c-8b6a-7a9a26d89ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 520183}, \'multiverseid\': 520183}, {\'name\': \'死の味\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、クリーチャー３体を生け贄に捧げる。あなたは食物・トークン３つを生成する。（それらは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ナイフを研いで少しの嘆き。\\n呼び鈴三つは、楽しく不気味な宴の合図。」\\n――墳丘の魔女の詠唱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a53cf0c-b87f-4f3b-8826-551d8c5e809f\', \'multiverseId\': 520431}, \'multiverseid\': 520431}, {\'name\': \'Gostinho de Morte\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador sacrifica três criaturas. Você cria três fichas de Comida. (Elas são artefatos com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Afie a faca e lamente por fim.\\nTrês carrilhões soam o doce e sombrio festim."\\n— Encantamento de bruxa da mamoa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ee3290-ea0c-4a80-93bf-0bb6a75e322b\', \'multiverseId\': 520679}, \'multiverseid\': 520679}, {\'name\': \'Вкус Смерти\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок жертвует три существа. Вы создаете три фишки Еды. (Они являются артефактами со способностью «{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: вы получаете 3 жизни».)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Свой нож заточи, не горюй на весь мир.\\nТри звонких удара возвестят жуткий пир».\\n— заклинание курганных ведьм\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4a1ce2-4474-4e7c-960f-f4e5d3d764b8\', \'multiverseId\': 520927}, \'multiverseid\': 520927}, {\'name\': \'死亡滋味\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各牺牲三个生物。你派出三个食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「磨快手中刀具勿念悲伤过去，\\n耳闻悼铃三响静待苦宴就绪。」\\n～荒野巫婆咒文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071b17d7-030d-4671-a97f-2670a56217eb\', \'multiverseId\': 521175}, \'multiverseid\': 521175}, {\'name\': \'死亡滋味\', \'text\': \'每位玩家各犧牲三個生物。你派出三個食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，犧牲此神器：你獲得3點生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「磨快手中刀具勿念悲傷過去，\\n耳聞悼鈴三響靜待苦宴就緒。」\\n～荒野巫婆咒文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5362c1f2-ab74-435d-a7c7-9f6511a4fae5\', \'multiverseId\': 521423}, \'multiverseid\': 521423}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gespenstisches Gefängnis\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die dich angreift und die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl die Körper der Geister ätherisch waren, lernte Agnur bald, dass ihre Klingen ziemlich hart und scharf wie Rasiermesser waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519375&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1acc5524-fd40-43db-b0f7-631b51c975b6\', \'multiverseId\': 519375}, \'multiverseid\': 519375}, {\'name\': \'Prisión fantasmagórica\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque los cuerpos de los espíritus eran etéreos, Agnur pronto cayó en la cuenta de que sus espadas eran muy sólidas... y afiladas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9002c5c4-23d7-4e8d-bcfd-e59031a42dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 519623}, \'multiverseid\': 519623}, {\'name\': \'Prison fantomale\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les esprits avaient beau avoir un corps éthéré, Agnur découvrit bien assez tôt que leurs lames étaient bien matérielles, et bien aiguisées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9e1df31-7155-43e5-b3c2-c11af9bc0a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 519871}, \'multiverseid\': 519871}, {\'name\': \'Prigione Spettrale\', \'text\': \'Le creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Anche se i corpi degli spiriti erano eterei, Agnur scoprì presto che le loro lame erano piuttosto solide... e affilate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caec8681-7be0-4f33-a6a3-06cffb355164\', \'multiverseId\': 520119}, \'multiverseid\': 520119}, {\'name\': \'亡霊の牢獄\', \'text\': \'あなたを攻撃しているクリーチャーの各コントローラーがそれぞれその１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、クリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'その霊体は空気のようだったが、アグナーは程なくしてその剣が非常に硬く、そして非常に鋭いことを知った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f155c018-e17b-4ad1-8228-b202ef58008d\', \'multiverseId\': 520367}, \'multiverseid\': 520367}, {\'name\': \'Prisão Fantasmagórica\', \'text\': \'As criaturas não podem atacá-lo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2} para cada criatura daquele controlador que está atacando você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Embora os corpos dos espíritos fossem etéreos, Agnur descobriu rapidamente que suas lâminas eram bem sólidas. E igualmente afiadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5119b9-fb88-4230-93a1-03f432e763a2\', \'multiverseId\': 520615}, \'multiverseid\': 520615}, {\'name\': \'Призрачная Темница\', \'text\': \'Существа не могут атаковать вас, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {2} за каждое из атакующих вас существ под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Духи были бестелесными, но Агнур скоро понял, что клинки у них вполне реальные — и острые, как бритва.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ae3c14-9e89-4116-ad92-ba063fcff1cc\', \'multiverseId\': 520863}, \'multiverseid\': 520863}, {\'name\': \'魂魅拘禁\', \'text\': \'对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{2}，否则它不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'虽然鬼魂的身躯虚若无物，但阿格努很快就晓得它们手中的刀剑真实存在～且锋利无比。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431146ff-db63-4654-bb4c-e88aee0ce6c9\', \'multiverseId\': 521111}, \'multiverseid\': 521111}, {\'name\': \'魂魅拘禁\', \'text\': \'對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{2}，否則它不能攻擊你。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'雖然鬼魂的身軀虛若無物，但阿格努很快就曉得它們手中的刀劍真實存在～且鋒利無比。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dee4882b-75b2-42bd-97f6-c8bf6e8127ad\', \'multiverseId\': 521359}, \'multiverseid\': 521359}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestaltungsverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert.)\\nMische deine Bibliothek und decke dann von oben Karten auf, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte aufdeckst. Schicke die Karte ins Exil und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79820d50-32fb-424e-bd09-f4ca95d5eebf\', \'multiverseId\': 518516}, \'multiverseid\': 518516}, {\'name\': \'Técnica creativa\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia.)\\nBaraja tu biblioteca y luego muestra cartas de su parte superior hasta que muestres una carta que no sea tierra. Exilia esa carta y pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes lanzar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3dfcff-1afd-49a9-9763-1cb79efde0f1\', \'multiverseId\': 518587}, \'multiverseid\': 518587}, {\'name\': \'Technique de création\', \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi.)\\nMélangez votre bibliothèque, puis révélez les cartes du dessus jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte non-terrain. Exilez cette carte et mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518658&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83be2831-7223-462c-b58e-13509e1d44dd\', \'multiverseId\': 518658}, \'multiverseid\': 518658}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica Creativa\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta.)\\nRimescola il tuo grimorio, poi rivela carte dalla cima finché non riveli una carta non terra. Esilia quella carta e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi lanciare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f34d311-67a7-4699-8b7f-658c13532996\', \'multiverseId\': 518729}, \'multiverseid\': 518729}, {\'name\': \'創造の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。」を選んでもよい。）\\nライブラリーを切り直す。その後、土地でないカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを追放し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。あなたはその追放されたカードをマナ・コストを支払わずに唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17fd27c9-46d6-42d6-b588-05154e778870\', \'multiverseId\': 518800}, \'multiverseid\': 518800}, {\'name\': \'Técnica Criativa\', \'text\': \'Demonstrar (Quando você conjura esta mágica, você pode copiá-la. Se fizer isso, escolha um oponente para copiá-la também.)\\nEmbaralhe seu grimório e depois revele cards do topo até revelar um card não de terreno. Exile aquele card e coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória. Você pode conjurar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df1ed71-325a-42c4-8aec-d81de4a7ab67\', \'multiverseId\': 518871}, \'multiverseid\': 518871}, {\'name\': \'Техника Творчества\', \'text\': \'Демонстрация (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, вы можете скопировать его. Если вы это делаете, выберите оппонента, который также скопирует его.)\\nПеретасуйте вашу библиотеку, затем показывайте карты с ее верха, пока вы не покажете не являющуюся землей карту. Изгоните ту карту и положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке. Вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ad276f-1077-48c1-a323-59a5471235ec\', \'multiverseId\': 518942}, \'multiverseid\': 518942}, {\'name\': \'创新技艺\', \'text\': \'示范（当你施放此咒语时，你可以将其复制。若你如此作，则选择一位对手一同复制。）\\n将你的牌库洗牌，然后从牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张非地牌为止。放逐该牌，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。你可以施放所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0159c162-578e-4648-8582-689d6d59415f\', \'multiverseId\': 519013}, \'multiverseid\': 519013}, {\'name\': \'創新技藝\', \'text\': \'示範（當你施放此咒語時，你可以將其複製。若你如此作，則選擇一位對手一同複製。）\\n將你的牌庫洗牌，然後從牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張非地牌為止。放逐該牌，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。你可以施放所放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33b23c2-9c02-4f6b-a2fb-33765a742392\', \'multiverseId\': 519084}, \'multiverseid\': 519084}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestaltungsverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert.)\\nMische deine Bibliothek und decke dann von oben Karten auf, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte aufdeckst. Schicke die Karte ins Exil und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521725&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a0ceac-d677-4f83-b9ea-990335b78474\', \'multiverseId\': 521725}, \'multiverseid\': 521725}, {\'name\': \'Técnica creativa\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia.)\\nBaraja tu biblioteca y luego muestra cartas de su parte superior hasta que muestres una carta que no sea tierra. Exilia esa carta y pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes lanzar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb39cee9-ffa4-486d-b0a7-acb0c79549f9\', \'multiverseId\': 521805}, \'multiverseid\': 521805}, {\'name\': \'Technique de création\', \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi.)\\nMélangez votre bibliothèque, puis révélez les cartes du dessus jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte non-terrain. Exilez cette carte et mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38600a57-04c1-4bba-b25b-7e95ac1ddae7\', \'multiverseId\': 521885}, \'multiverseid\': 521885}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica Creativa\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta.)\\nRimescola il tuo grimorio, poi rivela carte dalla cima finché non riveli una carta non terra. Esilia quella carta e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi lanciare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140d1065-af16-4af2-b89e-f5e852888246\', \'multiverseId\': 521965}, \'multiverseid\': 521965}, {\'name\': \'創造の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人をにもこれをコピーさせる。」を選んでもよい。）\\nライブラリーを切り直す。その後、土地でないカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを追放し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。あなたはその追放されたカードをマナ・コストを支払わずに唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'956690cf-a6bb-4bb2-abf3-d90943fb8848\', \'multiverseId\': 522045}, \'multiverseid\': 522045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewundenes Orakel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Gewundene Orakel ins Spiel kommt, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, bringe sie ins Spiel. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Das Orakel verkörpert alles, was für Simic typisch ist: Häutung bedeutet ewigen Fortschritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e68e7a-4129-4a73-a0b6-8bf960b5826e\', \'multiverseId\': 519495}, \'multiverseid\': 519495}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo serpenteante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Oráculo serpenteante entre al campo de batalla, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, ponla en el campo de batalla. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo víbora\', \'flavor\': \'Restos serpentinos de la naturaleza dirigidos por un cuerpo de pensamiento y progreso, los oráculos son la viva representación de todo lo simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb191416-573d-4ca2-accb-af5ce5d0f9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 519743}, \'multiverseid\': 519743}, {\'name\': \'Oracle annelé\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Oracle annelé arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, mettez cette carte dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : serpent et elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "Une nature reptilienne et un corps de pensées et de progrès : les oracles étaient à l\'image de Simic.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519991&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eadf8957-1446-498c-ac69-1f4b6422610a\', \'multiverseId\': 519991}, \'multiverseid\': 519991}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo Acciambellato\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Oracolo Acciambellato entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra, mettila sul campo di battaglia. Altrimenti, aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'Sinuose vestigia della natura controllate da un corpo di pensieri e sviluppo; gli oracoli incarnano tutto ciò che è Simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8479fbd6-1315-48ef-aad2-43e075c1ccfd\', \'multiverseId\': 520239}, \'multiverseid\': 520239}, {\'name\': \'とぐろ巻きの巫女\', \'text\': \'とぐろ巻きの巫女が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それが土地・カードであるなら、それを戦場に出す。そうでないなら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'曲がりくねる自然の面影が思考と進歩へとつながっている巫女の姿は、まさしくシミックそのものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0da311fc-d335-4250-9fca-e4f518765530\', \'multiverseId\': 520487}, \'multiverseid\': 520487}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo Enroscado\', \'text\': \'Quando Oráculo Enroscado entrar no campo de batalha, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de terreno, coloque-o no campo de batalha. Do contrário, coloque aquele card em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Remanescentes anguiformes da natureza dominados por um corpo de pensamentos e progresso, os oráculos representam tudo o que é simic.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bedd51-e554-4b64-9c37-bc10c9d578b0\', \'multiverseId\': 520735}, \'multiverseid\': 520735}, {\'name\': \'Извивающийся Оракул\', \'text\': \'Когда Извивающийся Оракул выходит на поле битвы, покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта земли, положите ее на поле битвы. В противном случае положите ту карту в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Змея Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Эти оракулы воплощают суть Симиков — извивающиеся останки природы, ведомые телом, полным мысли и прогресса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bcc017e-b3fc-4016-980f-090497fc6496\', \'multiverseId\': 520983}, \'multiverseid\': 520983}, {\'name\': \'盘卷先知\', \'text\': \'当盘卷先知进战场时，展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则将之放进战场。若否，则将该牌置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛇／妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'可思考与创造的身体引导着阴险的自然残存者；此先知正是析米克的具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ee2951-26d9-4759-8869-89b2f9fb4b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 521231}, \'multiverseid\': 521231}, {\'name\': \'盤捲先知\', \'text\': \'當盤捲先知進戰場時，展示你的牌庫頂牌。若它是地牌，則將之放進戰場。若否，則將該牌置於你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛇／妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'可思考與創造的身體引導著陰險的自然殘存者；此先知正是析米克的具現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c98f342f-0566-4412-8b09-7833074214e6\', \'multiverseId\': 521479}, \'multiverseid\': 521479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideon, Champion des Rechts\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege für jede Kreatur, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert, eine Loyalitätsmarke auf Gideon, Champion des Rechts.\\n0: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird Gideon, Champion des Rechts, eine Mensch-Soldat-Kreatur mit Stärke und Widerstandskraft gleich der Anzahl an Loyalitätsmarken auf ihm und er erhält Unzerstörbarkeit. Er ist immer noch ein Planeswalker. Verhindere allen Schaden, der ihm in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\\n−15: Schicke alle anderen bleibenden Karten ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4595cb-61b9-4fd5-85eb-718603bf3ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 519376}, \'multiverseid\': 519376}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, campeón de la justicia\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador de lealtad sobre Gideon, campeón de la justicia por cada criatura que controla el oponente objetivo.\\n0: Hasta el final del turno, Gideon, campeón de la justicia se convierte en una criatura Soldado Humano con fuerza y resistencia iguales a la cantidad de contadores de lealtad sobre él y gana la habilidad de indestructible. Sigue siendo un planeswalker. Prevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer este turno.\\n−15: Exilia todos los demás permanentes.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba9c1727-6b5e-4e5e-9498-e5be11800332\', \'multiverseId\': 519624}, \'multiverseid\': 519624}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Champion de la justice\', \'text\': "+1 : Mettez un marqueur « loyauté » sur Gideon, Champion de la justice pour chaque créature contrôlée par un adversaire ciblé.\\n0 : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, Gideon, Champion de la justice devient une créature Humain et Soldat dont la force et l\'endurance sont chacune égales au nombre de marqueurs « loyauté » sur lui et il acquiert l\'indestructible. Il est toujours un planeswalker. Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient lui être infligées ce tour-ci.\\n-15 : Exilez tous les autres permanents.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72060029-5261-4706-9c9b-f7e9c9e95918\', \'multiverseId\': 519872}, \'multiverseid\': 519872}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Campione di Giustizia\', \'text\': \'+1: Metti un segnalino fedeltà su Gideon, Campione di Giustizia per ogni creatura controllata da un avversario bersaglio.\\n0: Fino alla fine del turno, Gideon, Campione di Giustizia diventa una creatura Soldato Umano con forza e costituzione pari al numero di segnalini fedeltà su di esso e ha indistruttibile. È ancora un planeswalker. Previeni tutto il danno che gli verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.\\n-15: Esilia tutti gli altri permanenti.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b26602c-789b-45fd-9a3f-67da463f3dba\', \'multiverseId\': 520120}, \'multiverseid\': 520120}, {\'name\': \'正義の勇者ギデオン\', \'text\': \'+1：対戦相手１人を対象とする。正義の勇者ギデオンの上に、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１個の忠誠カウンターを置く。\\n0：ターン終了時まで、正義の勇者ギデオンは人間・兵士・クリーチャーになり、破壊不能を得る。これのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれこれの上に置かれている忠誠カウンターの数に等しい。これはプレインズウォーカーでもある。このターン、これが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\n-15：これ以外のすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ギデオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec20da6-128c-4118-963b-5a881eca3936\', \'multiverseId\': 520368}, \'multiverseid\': 520368}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Campeão da Justiça\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador de lealdade em Gideon, Campeão da Justiça, para cada criatura que o oponente alvo controla.\\n0: Até o final do turno, Gideon, Campeão da Justiça, torna-se uma criatura Humano Soldado com poder e resistência iguais ao número de marcadores de lealdade nele e ganha indestrutível. Ele ainda é um planeswalker. Previna todo o dano que seria causado a ele neste turno.\\n−15: Exile todas as outras permanentes.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b64aea-f497-463f-9896-495e49a1dd88\', \'multiverseId\': 520616}, \'multiverseid\': 520616}, {\'name\': \'Гидеон, Поборник Справедливости\', \'text\': "+1: положите один жетон верности на Гидеона, Поборника Справедливости за каждое существо под контролем целевого оппонента.\\n0: до конца хода Гидеон, Поборник Справедливости становится существом Человек Солдат, сила и выносливость которого равны количеству жетонов верности на нем, и получает Неразрушимость. При этом он остается planeswalker\'ом. Предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены ему в этом ходу.\\n−15: изгоните все другие перманенты.", \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Гидеон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b7a2f9-1639-4c6a-b53e-0b1a6d625fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 520864}, \'multiverseid\': 520864}, {\'name\': \'正义斗士基定\', \'text\': \'+1：目标对手每操控一个生物，便在正义斗士基定上放置一个忠诚指示物。\\n0：直到回合结束，正义斗士基定成为人类／士兵生物，其力量和防御力各等同于其上的忠诚指示物数量，且获得不灭异能。他仍是鹏洛客。防止本回合中将对他造成的所有伤害。\\n−15：放逐所有其他永久物。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～基定\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2083aad6-027a-48c5-a74f-37f7cebe669c\', \'multiverseId\': 521112}, \'multiverseid\': 521112}, {\'name\': \'正義鬥士基定\', \'text\': \'+1：目標對手每操控一個生物，便在正義鬥士基定上放置一個忠誠指示物。\\n0：直到回合結束，正義鬥士基定成為人類／士兵生物，其力量和防禦力各等同於其上的忠誠指示物數量，且獲得不滅異能。他仍是鵬洛客。防止本回合中將對他造成的所有傷害。\\n−15：放逐所有其他永久物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～基定\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693d3885-2c9f-40f5-b656-6c65a704a94a\', \'multiverseId\': 521360}, \'multiverseid\': 521360}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gipfel der Macht\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du davon Zaubersprüche wirken.\\nFalls dieser Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand gewirkt wurde, erzeuge zehn Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ich verlange, soll geschehen."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519441&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cea861bb-c837-42ee-ae00-b72c823484ef\', \'multiverseId\': 519441}, \'multiverseid\': 519441}, {\'name\': \'Cúspide del poder\', \'text\': \'Exilia las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar hechizos de entre ellas.\\nSi este hechizo fue lanzado desde tu mano, agrega diez manás de un color cualquiera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo será como yo lo desee".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d5328a-2cf1-4c6e-b387-1bf304dd9b12\', \'multiverseId\': 519689}, \'multiverseid\': 519689}, {\'name\': \'Zénith du pouvoir\', \'text\': "Exilez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer des sorts parmi elles.\\nSi ce sort a été lancé depuis votre main, ajoutez dix manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est ma volonté, donc ce sera une réalité. »\\n—Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519937&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b391f6d-16b9-4004-b152-fd3a2b311192\', \'multiverseId\': 519937}, \'multiverseid\': 519937}, {\'name\': \'Apice del Potere\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare magie scelte tra esse.\\nSe questa magia è stata lanciata dalla tua mano, aggiungi dieci mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni mio desiderio si compie."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab27fb4b-8160-42f1-86cb-bba0efe47e71\', \'multiverseId\': 520185}, \'multiverseid\': 520185}, {\'name\': \'力の頂点\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード７枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはその中から呪文を唱えてもよい。\\nこの呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、好きな色１色のマナ10点を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我が望めば、その通りになる。」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e576e160-3549-4128-8d6b-441556e56fed\', \'multiverseId\': 520433}, \'multiverseid\': 520433}, {\'name\': \'Ápice do Poder\', \'text\': \'Exile os sete cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar mágicas dentre eles.\\nSe esta mágica foi conjurada de sua mão, adicione dez manas de uma cor à sua escolha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Como eu desejar, assim será."\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70dabd39-845d-4d6f-84f5-8896410f49b8\', \'multiverseId\': 520681}, \'multiverseid\': 520681}, {\'name\': \'Вершина Могущества\', \'text\': \'Изгоните семь верхних карт вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыгрывать находящиеся среди них заклинания.\\nЕсли это заклинание было разыграно из вашей руки, добавьте десять ман любого одного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Как я пожелаю, так и будет».\\n— Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4854771a-b33a-467b-a3d1-592a7d8fc657\', \'multiverseId\': 520929}, \'multiverseid\': 520929}, {\'name\': \'无上力量\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的七张牌。直到回合结束，你可以从其中施放咒语。\\n如果此咒语是从你手上施放，则加十点任意颜色的单色法术力。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「吾之所欲，必能成型。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce0a8c5-46b3-499f-be1b-76110796f095\', \'multiverseId\': 521177}, \'multiverseid\': 521177}, {\'name\': \'無上力量\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌庫頂的七張牌。直到回合結束，你可以從其中施放咒語。\\n如果此咒語是從你手上施放，則加十點任意顏色的單色魔法力。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「吾之所欲，必能成型。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47a8088f-7361-4327-84c1-af31033c5d4e\', \'multiverseId\': 521425}, \'multiverseid\': 521425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glanzgeschliffener Hirsch\', \'text\': \'{3}, opfere den Glanzgeschliffenen Hirsch: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'Von Göttern geschmiedet, um unter Sterblichen zu wandeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f999a4-9436-4559-bb36-538783982e1e\', \'multiverseId\': 519521}, \'multiverseid\': 519521}, {\'name\': \'Venado bruñido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrificar el Venado bruñido: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por manos divinas para deambular por los reinos mortales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb3839b0-2ca3-4064-b087-449896056a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 519769}, \'multiverseid\': 519769}, {\'name\': \'Cerf bruni\', \'text\': "{3}, sacrifiez le Cerf bruni : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : élan\', \'flavor\': \'Forgé par des mains divines pour sillonner les royaumes des mortels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520017&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d63c4e-a4a0-42ee-89e3-f65daf1b90c9\', \'multiverseId\': 520017}, \'multiverseid\': 520017}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunito\', \'text\': \'{3}, Sacrifica il Cervo Brunito: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forgiato da mani divine per vagare tra i reami mortali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3189cb-521f-4e43-adad-49edf555d983\', \'multiverseId\': 520265}, \'multiverseid\': 520265}, {\'name\': \'つややかな雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}, つややかな雄鹿を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'定命の者の世界をさまようため、天界の者の手により創られた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b8cf39-ea83-4a55-baa4-f19036658fbc\', \'multiverseId\': 520513}, \'multiverseid\': 520513}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrifique Cervo Brunido: Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por mãos divinas para vagar pelos reinos mortais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94a93d92-af86-47e1-a49d-a7f71aa12b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 520761}, \'multiverseid\': 520761}, {\'name\': \'Сверкающий Олень\', \'text\': \'{3}, пожертвуйте Сверкающего Оленя: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'Выкован божественными руками, чтобы ходить по землям смертных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48eaf02-0704-4160-a1a6-424df02f9359\', \'multiverseId\': 521009}, \'multiverseid\': 521009}, {\'name\': \'光洁雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}，牺牲光洁雄鹿：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'由神明之手铸造，在凡人领域游荡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962ab4df-757e-4511-bb37-5ad525df261c\', \'multiverseId\': 521257}, \'multiverseid\': 521257}, {\'name\': \'光潔雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}，犧牲光潔雄鹿：從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'由神明之手鑄造，在凡人領域遊蕩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f802f8e1-91a3-47cb-a745-75eac493a7da\', \'multiverseId\': 521505}, \'multiverseid\': 521505}]', "[{'name': 'Golgari-Verrottungsfarm', 'text': 'Die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519574&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcae44ab-78de-48a5-a518-3fac7233cc65', 'multiverseId': 519574}, 'multiverseid': 519574}, {'name': 'Granja de podredumbre golgari', 'text': 'La Granja de podredumbre golgari entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Granja de podredumbre golgari entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519822&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48b87d4d-946e-444d-bdb9-96602502fee4', 'multiverseId': 519822}, 'multiverseid': 519822}, {'name': 'Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari', 'text': 'La Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520070&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66eb359e-1e3d-4c52-8ced-fcd739918b72', 'multiverseId': 520070}, 'multiverseid': 520070}, {'name': 'Mortificio Golgari', 'text': 'Il Mortificio Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Mortificio Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520318&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e20912e6-225b-426d-ba87-ccc274f213a9', 'multiverseId': 520318}, 'multiverseid': 520318}, {'name': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場', 'text': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nゴルガリの腐敗農場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520566&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76c8afb4-403f-48b5-be82-c45a5b07745f', 'multiverseId': 520566}, 'multiverseid': 520566}, {'name': 'Fazenda de Podridão Golgari', 'text': 'Fazenda de Podridão Golgari entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Fazenda de Podridão Golgari entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520814&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4176d9a8-caf2-42b5-b9d2-76c2f88bf0c5', 'multiverseId': 520814}, 'multiverseid': 520814}, {'name': 'Гнилостная Ферма Голгари', 'text': 'Гнилостная Ферма Голгари выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Гнилостная Ферма Голгари выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521062&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94a3831f-7127-4747-87a2-3c385db50a1b', 'multiverseId': 521062}, 'multiverseid': 521062}, {'name': '葛加理腐尸农场', 'text': '葛加理腐尸农场须横置进战场。\\n当葛加理腐尸农场进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{B}{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521310&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '402dcbe4-a01f-4804-bd2a-209a9c5a1388', 'multiverseId': 521310}, 'multiverseid': 521310}, {'name': '葛加理腐屍農場', 'text': '葛加理腐屍農場須橫置進戰場。\\n當葛加理腐屍農場進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{B}{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521558&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04decc60-b31e-4877-bd1c-32f60f0823a7', 'multiverseId': 521558}, 'multiverseid': 521558}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grabgeläute des Schuldners\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Für einen kurzen Moment war da nur das Gefühl von Ruhe. Dann hörte er das Geräusch seiner eigenen Schritte. Er seufzte und schielte in das Gleißen, das auf ihn zukam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f05e3b1b-95e5-41f3-8581-a4984b2680e8\', \'multiverseId\': 519498}, \'multiverseid\': 519498}, {\'name\': \'Llamada del deudor\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Por un instante es consciente solo de una sensación de reposo. Inmediatamente después, escucha sus propios pasos cansados. Suspiró y miró de reojo el brillo que tenía delante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6ba9b3-1fe4-464b-963a-8abc6ca828b5\', \'multiverseId\': 519746}, \'multiverseid\': 519746}, {\'name\': \'Glas des consignataires\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Il sommeillait à moitié, perdu dans ses pensées, quand il entendit soudain des pas résonner. Soupirant, il plissa les yeux pour tenter de distinguer quelque chose dans l\'aura de lumière.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519994&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2eb363-fabd-447e-9728-ad3846d7b365\', \'multiverseId\': 519994}, \'multiverseid\': 519994}, {\'name\': \'Rintocco dei Debitori\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Per un momento percepì solo un senso di riposo. Un attimo dopo, udì il rumore dei suoi stessi passi arrancanti. Sospirò e socchiuse gli occhi per la luce accecante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c1e8d01-bea9-4834-a575-9d76f348fec5\', \'multiverseId\': 520242}, \'multiverseid\': 520242}, {\'name\': \'債務者の弔鐘\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'最初は安らぎのみがあった。次には自分自身の足音が聞こえてきた。彼はため息をつくと、その眼光を目を細めて見つめた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff7be72-7fe3-402e-af0c-d163f7b924a4\', \'multiverseId\': 520490}, \'multiverseid\': 520490}, {\'name\': \'Agouro dos Devedores\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Inicialmente, sentiu apenas uma sensação de repouso. Logo depois, ouviu seus próprios passos cansados. Suspirou e franziu os olhos na direção da claridade adiante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8895c9ae-d12d-42d5-824a-c0e234beac3f\', \'multiverseId\': 520738}, \'multiverseid\': 520738}, {\'name\': \'Погребальный Звон Должника\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки положите целевую карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва — только чувство упокоения. Затем возник звук его собственных усталых шагов. Он вздохнул и прищурился на ослепительный свет, открывшийся впереди.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b3b753-7d87-49ef-b780-d1b6dd5f0a6e\', \'multiverseId\': 520986}, \'multiverseid\': 520986}, {\'name\': \'负债者丧钟\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'对所谓永眠而言，这只是片刻醒转。之后他听到自己蹒跚的步伐，叹口气，瞪着前方的强光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a7f24a9-5802-486b-aa90-689ab144c639\', \'multiverseId\': 521234}, \'multiverseid\': 521234}, {\'name\': \'負債者喪鐘\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，將目標生物牌在你的操控下從墳墓場放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'對所謂永眠而言，這只是片刻醒轉。之後他聽到自己蹣跚的步伐，嘆口氣，瞪著前方的強光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177c20c5-2990-4113-a7c3-1ba8aec8f93f\', \'multiverseId\': 521482}, \'multiverseid\': 521482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Granitblick\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger, die kein Land ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Golgari-Wiederverwerter verachten die Gorgos, da ihretwegen so viele gute Nährstoffe zu Stein werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab16b94d-7d53-4b6a-a2d6-6fcda6f8e84b\', \'multiverseId\': 519500}, \'multiverseid\': 519500}, {\'name\': \'Mirada de granito\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de X o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los recobradores golgari desprecian a las gorgonas, ofendidos por la pérdida de tantos nutrientes encerrados en piedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb98d37a-9e56-4b28-afa8-2806cf3833c6\', \'multiverseId\': 519748}, \'multiverseid\': 519748}, {\'name\': \'Regard de granit\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les récupérateurs de Golgari n\'ont que mépris pour les gorgones au nom de tous ces précieux nutriments sottement pétrifiés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519996&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80681227-c007-452f-9fc7-d70f85ba0533\', \'multiverseId\': 519996}, \'multiverseid\': 519996}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo di Granito\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I recuperatori Golgari non sopportano le gorgoni, infastiditi dalla perdita di tutto quel nutrimento rinchiuso in pietra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4f5fc34-6cd6-4a0b-8875-6ab2529e8f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 520244}, \'multiverseid\': 520244}, {\'name\': \'花崗岩の凝視\', \'text\': \'マナ総量がＸ以下で土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゴルガリの回収者達はゴルゴンのことを不愉快に思っている。大量の良質な栄養分が石にされてしまったことが勿体なく、口惜しいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c634b43-979a-484c-b64c-bb696837f329\', \'multiverseId\': 520492}, \'multiverseid\': 520492}, {\'name\': \'Olhar de Granito\', \'text\': \'Destrua cada permanente não de terreno com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os recuperadores golgari detestam as górgonas, lamentando a perda de tantos nutrientes bons encerrados em pedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee4a6ba-ac6e-44ff-a64c-bf464b1224c1\', \'multiverseId\': 520740}, \'multiverseid\': 520740}, {\'name\': \'Гранитный Взор\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте каждый не являющийся землей перманент с мановой ценностью Х или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Утилизаторы из Роя Голгари не любят горгон: им не дает покоя мысль о том, что столько питательных веществ превращается в камень.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02adc7b-6ba9-4c69-bc95-6eae03898446\', \'multiverseId\': 520988}, \'multiverseid\': 520988}, {\'name\': \'化岩瞪视\', \'text\': \'消灭所有法术力值等于或小于X的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'葛加理回收师痛恨蛇发妖，因为有太多养分封死在石头中，实在浪费。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b21b4f7e-2a3d-4c9a-b403-098a5ed9eabb\', \'multiverseId\': 521236}, \'multiverseid\': 521236}, {\'name\': \'化岩瞪視\', \'text\': \'消滅所有魔法力值等於或小於X的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'葛加理回收師痛恨蛇髮妖，因為有太多養分封死在石頭中，實在浪費。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'136fd773-4277-4198-858b-f134a9dd64bf\', \'multiverseId\': 521484}, \'multiverseid\': 521484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Große Schmelze\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, Urquell des geschmolzenen Metalls, Tempel der Goblinhorde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d9c2ee3-b5c4-4b81-8a2d-10e44ec41fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 519575}, \'multiverseid\': 519575}, {\'name\': \'Gran horno\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, manantial del metal fundido, templo de la horda de trasgos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d8a170-ef8c-4c03-87fc-2e9e0155f06b\', \'multiverseId\': 519823}, \'multiverseid\': 519823}, {\'name\': \'Grand Fourneau\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, puits sourcier de métal en fusion, temple des hordes gobelines.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'112e2156-3ed5-4401-9637-2c2dc2a03dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 520071}, \'multiverseid\': 520071}, {\'name\': \'Grande Fornace\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Kuldotha, fonte del metallo fuso, tempio dell\'orda dei goblin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fcb6244-72f3-40c9-8dae-c6db05f78ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 520319}, \'multiverseid\': 520319}, {\'name\': \'大焼炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'カルドーサ、溶けた金属の噴き出すゴブリンの群落の寺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81e8ad9-400b-4501-8b98-17309c5bf910\', \'multiverseId\': 520567}, \'multiverseid\': 520567}, {\'name\': \'Grande Fornalha\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Kuldotha, a fonte do metal fundido, o templo da horda goblin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae6b4e5-c0e0-4556-b10b-e14edfbc6ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 520815}, \'multiverseid\': 520815}, {\'name\': \'Великое Горнило\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {R}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Кулдота, источник расплавленного металла, храм орды гоблинов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3807baf8-af3d-498e-90c5-a2bb237edb2a\', \'multiverseId\': 521063}, \'multiverseid\': 521063}, {\'name\': \'大熔炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器地\', \'flavor\': \'库度沙，熔铁的泉源，鬼怪大军的庙堂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad56234-42bd-4522-8bb7-2639cfb30de9\', \'multiverseId\': 521311}, \'multiverseid\': 521311}, {\'name\': \'大熔爐\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器地\', \'flavor\': \'庫度沙，熔鐵的泉源，鬼怪大軍的廟堂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'967d22d9-9051-40d0-8637-f80718e074e3\', \'multiverseId\': 521559}, \'multiverseid\': 521559}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gyome der Meisterkoch\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du so viele Speise-Spielsteine, wie in diesem Zug Nichtspielsteinkreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind.\\n{1}, opfere eine Speise: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Troll, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3996f4-58b4-4281-ba54-aa4875f796b1\', \'multiverseId\': 518321}, \'multiverseid\': 518321}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, chef maestro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una cantidad de fichas de Comida igual a la cantidad de criaturas que no sean fichas que hiciste que entraran al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno.\\n{1}, sacrificar una Comida: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Gírala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo trol\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e346a5c7-ab62-45ba-821f-3c0ec3f1b711\', \'multiverseId\': 518331}, \'multiverseid\': 518331}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, maître queux\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un nombre de jetons Nourriture égal au nombre de créatures non-jeton que vous avez fait arriver sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.\\n{1}, sacrifiez une nourriture : Une créature ciblée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : troll et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede5e44f-2c54-40dd-a397-826b93931f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 518341}, \'multiverseid\': 518341}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, Capo Cuoco\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea un numero di pedine Cibo pari al numero di creature non pedina che hai fatto entrare nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.\\n{1}, Sacrifica un Cibo: Una creatura bersaglio ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. TAPpala.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Troll\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f9c50a3-80fd-40ea-82a5-e0f3a375aae2\', \'multiverseId\': 518351}, \'multiverseid\': 518351}, {\'name\': \'練達の料理人、ギヨーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがこのターンにあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出したトークンでないクリーチャーの数に等しい数の食物・トークンを生成する。\\n{1}, 食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — トロール・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a255215c-546a-4fdf-bef3-34b36b31b82d\', \'multiverseId\': 518361}, \'multiverseid\': 518361}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, Mestre Cuca\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nNo início de sua etapa final, crie um número de fichas de Comida igual ao número de criaturas não ficha que entraram no campo de batalha sob seu controle neste turno.\\n{1}, sacrifique uma Comida: A criatura alvo ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. Vire-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Trol Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e49c58cc-5d0c-4552-a568-18f7c0d87698\', \'multiverseId\': 518371}, \'multiverseid\': 518371}, {\'name\': \'Гийом, Старший Повар\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага создайте количество фишек Еды, равное числу не являющихся фишками существ, вышедших на поле битвы под вашим контролем в этом ходу.\\n{1}, пожертвуйте Еду: целевое существо получает Неразрушимость до конца хода. Поверните его.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Тролль Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'428ab610-66da-4d89-b6cb-8b31b451523d\', \'multiverseId\': 518381}, \'multiverseid\': 518381}, {\'name\': \'主厨纪尧姆\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，派出若干食品衍生物，其数量等同于本回合中在你操控下进战场之非衍生物的生物数量。\\n{1}，牺牲一个食品：目标生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。将之横置。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨魔／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ead17c-a89f-4fb3-b5ab-650feda839c4\', \'multiverseId\': 518391}, \'multiverseid\': 518391}, {\'name\': \'主廚紀堯姆\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，派出若干食品衍生物，其數量等同於本回合中在你操控下進戰場之非衍生物的生物數量。\\n{1}，犧牲一個食品：目標生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。將之橫置。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～巨魔／邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05fe7561-630b-4375-9bf2-a0fd687184e3\', \'multiverseId\': 518401}, \'multiverseid\': 518401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gyome der Meisterkoch\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du so viele Speise-Spielsteine, wie in diesem Zug Nichtspielsteinkreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen sind.\\n{1}, opfere eine Speise: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Troll, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd8c513-37ea-41ca-a611-b2d8a2c2d73d\', \'multiverseId\': 521681}, \'multiverseid\': 521681}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, chef maestro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una cantidad de fichas de Comida igual a la cantidad de criaturas que no sean fichas que hiciste que entraran al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno.\\n{1}, sacrificar una Comida: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Gírala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo trol\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b57d299-c902-451b-9470-34c5fc54423a\', \'multiverseId\': 521761}, \'multiverseid\': 521761}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, maître queux\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un nombre de jetons Nourriture égal au nombre de créatures non-jeton que vous avez fait arriver sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.\\n{1}, sacrifiez une nourriture : Une créature ciblée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : troll et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'553c358b-c8f1-4b28-b876-e8af2facc547\', \'multiverseId\': 521841}, \'multiverseid\': 521841}, {\'name\': \'Gyome, Capo Cuoco\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea un numero di pedine Cibo pari al numero di creature non pedina che hai fatto entrare nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.\\n{1}, Sacrifica un Cibo: Una creatura bersaglio ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. TAPpala.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Troll\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee966c32-3700-40f5-919b-247e72338f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 521921}, \'multiverseid\': 521921}, {\'name\': \'料理長、ギヨーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがこのターンにあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出した、トークンでないクリーチャーの数に等しい数の食物・トークンを生成する。\\n{1}, 食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — トロール・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b847feb6-f922-4c6c-8b50-ad96a07a9a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 522001}, \'multiverseid\': 522001}]', '[{\'name\': \'Habgier\', \'text\': \'{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Was ist schon ein Splitter der eigenen Seele, verglichen mit unvorstellbarem Reichtum?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d959e9f2-61af-42cc-8aba-9bc56e3d93a5\', \'multiverseId\': 519428}, \'multiverseid\': 519428}, {\'name\': \'Avaricia\', \'text\': \'{B}, pagar 2 vidas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'¿Qué es un fragmento de tu propia alma si lo comparas con riquezas inimaginables?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9123d380-e055-44e0-b2d9-67ed2cd26cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 519676}, \'multiverseid\': 519676}, {\'name\': \'Avidité\', \'text\': \'{B}, payez 2 points de vie : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Que vaut une partie de votre âme comparée à une fortune inimaginable ?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6730fc99-2382-4b15-a1d6-071526e86a12\', \'multiverseId\': 519924}, \'multiverseid\': 519924}, {\'name\': \'Cupidigia\', \'text\': \'{B}, Paga 2 punti vita: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Cos\'è il frammento di un\'anima paragonato a una ricchezza inimmaginabile?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7ff64e-f261-484c-b03c-03d1c594a729\', \'multiverseId\': 520172}, \'multiverseid\': 520172}, {\'name\': \'強欲\', \'text\': \'{B}, ２点のライフを支払う：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'想像を超える富に比べれば、魂の小片など何の価値があろうか？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3025b659-36a0-4bd8-a8ac-39b6f4d278fa\', \'multiverseId\': 520420}, \'multiverseid\': 520420}, {\'name\': \'Cobiça\', \'text\': \'{B}, pague 2 pontos de vida: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O que é uma fração da alma comparada a riquezas inimagináveis?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0057c02f-8cfe-45f7-9176-31e11bb21dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 520668}, \'multiverseid\': 520668}, {\'name\': \'Жадность\', \'text\': \'{B}, заплатите 2 жизни: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Что значит осколок чьей-то души по сравнению с невообразимым богатством?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'355eb6fa-e1f4-4b4d-a196-09995c3d2fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 520916}, \'multiverseid\': 520916}, {\'name\': \'贪婪\', \'text\': \'{B}，支付2点生命：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'与超乎想象的巨额财富相比，微乎其微的高贵心灵又值几何？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6668cce9-803d-4995-9b60-07829c94bbe0\', \'multiverseId\': 521164}, \'multiverseid\': 521164}, {\'name\': \'貪婪\', \'text\': \'{B}，支付2點生命：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'與超乎想像的巨額財富相比，微乎其微的高貴心靈又值幾何？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e87884-90e3-4313-8826-fc90214de488\', \'multiverseId\': 521412}, \'multiverseid\': 521412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Harztropfen-Wald\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G}.)\\nDer Harztropfen-Wald kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{G}, {T}: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du zwei oder mehr grüne bleibende Karten kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79cc5aae-82c5-4242-9953-8cc3218f964b\', \'multiverseId\': 519596}, \'multiverseid\': 519596}, {\'name\': \'Bosque savia rezumada\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G}.)\\nEl Bosque savia rezumada entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{G}, {T}: Ganas 1 vida. Activa esto solo si controlas dos o más permanentes verdes.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49f3fa9-99ec-4d0b-b14d-15c4450d3e08\', \'multiverseId\': 519844}, \'multiverseid\': 519844}, {\'name\': \'Forêt de Suintesève\', \'text\': "({T} : Ajoutez {G}.)\\nLa Forêt de Suintesève arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{G}, {T} : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins deux permanents verts.", \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b8aa0e4-4b4d-4658-a76f-224e39ccc4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 520092}, \'multiverseid\': 520092}, {\'name\': \'Bosco della Linfa Gocciolante\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G}.)\\nIl Bosco della Linfa Gocciolante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{G}, {T}: Guadagni 1 punto vita. Attiva solo se controlli due o più permanenti verdi.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9dc4b7-bf74-4c0a-b990-8f5f5e72f5f7\', \'multiverseId\': 520340}, \'multiverseid\': 520340}, {\'name\': \'樹液染みの森\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}を加える。）\\n樹液染みの森はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{G}, {T}：あなたは１点のライフを得る。あなたが緑のパーマネント２つ以上をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e096cf-6e1b-4c77-ad3e-3e96c99ed278\', \'multiverseId\': 520588}, \'multiverseid\': 520588}, {\'name\': \'Floresta de Seiva Gotejante\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G}.)\\nFloresta da Seiva Gotejante entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{G}, {T}: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida. Ative somente se você controlar duas ou mais permanentes verdes.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e21307-d9c2-43eb-a013-53dd9c082bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 520836}, \'multiverseid\': 520836}, {\'name\': \'Лес Светящейся Смолы\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {G}.)\\nЛес Светящейся Смолы выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{G}, {T}: вы получаете 1 жизнь. Активируйте, только если вы контролируете не менее двух зеленых перманентов.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Лес\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d25b7a0-1e93-4f9f-b151-9ab6e21e8684\', \'multiverseId\': 521084}, \'multiverseid\': 521084}, {\'name\': \'渗汁树林\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}。）\\n渗汁树林须横置进战场。\\n{G}，{T}：你获得1点生命。只能于你操控两个或更多绿色永久物时起动。\', \'type\': \'地 ～树林\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d8d806-12e1-497f-8be6-5a1e6c6821d4\', \'multiverseId\': 521332}, \'multiverseid\': 521332}, {\'name\': \'滲汁樹林\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}。）\\n滲汁樹林須橫置進戰場。\\n{G}，{T}：你獲得1點生命。只能於你操控兩個或更多綠色永久物時起動。\', \'type\': \'地 ～樹林\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11826d0e-da24-4fd8-935b-503004df2d03\', \'multiverseId\': 521580}, \'multiverseid\': 521580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heilverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert. Spieler können neue Ziele für ihre Kopien bestimmen.)\\nBringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jener Karte dazu. Schicke das Heilverfahren ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f1cccc-f497-4db4-bf28-d0a047e93dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 518530}, \'multiverseid\': 518530}, {\'name\': \'Técnica sanadora\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia. Los jugadores pueden elegir nuevos objetivos para sus copias.)\\nRegresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de esa carta. Exilia la Técnica sanadora.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b88aa8ab-f302-4f4d-94cd-a4d5d97e0cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 518601}, \'multiverseid\': 518601}, {\'name\': \'Technique de guérison\', \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi. Les joueurs peuvent choisir de nouvelles cibles pour leurs copies.)\\nRenvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de cette carte. Exilez la Technique de guérison.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e0b7773-c423-4a0f-9504-92931d3515a8\', \'multiverseId\': 518672}, \'multiverseid\': 518672}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Guarigione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta. I giocatori possono scegliere nuovi bersagli per le proprie copie.)\\nRiprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Guadagni punti vita pari al valore di mana di quella carta. Esilia la Tecnica di Guarigione.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532275dd-e046-4dd2-9b10-7f2d171753f8\', \'multiverseId\': 518743}, \'multiverseid\': 518743}, {\'name\': \'治癒の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。両プレイヤーは自分のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたはそのカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを得る。治癒の技を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e500aec3-f610-463c-922d-32338032e42e\', \'multiverseId\': 518814}, \'multiverseid\': 518814}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de Cura\', \'text\': \'Demonstrar (Quando você conjura esta mágica, você pode copiá-la. Se fizer isso, escolha um oponente para copiá-la também. Os jogadores podem escolher novos alvos para as próprias cópias.)\\nDevolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana daquele card. Exile Técnica de Cura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d15f1fbd-8bcc-4478-aec9-ede7821d7fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 518885}, \'multiverseid\': 518885}, {\'name\': \'Техника Исцеления\', \'text\': \'Демонстрация (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, вы можете скопировать его. Если вы это делаете, выберите оппонента, который также скопирует его. Игроки могут выбрать новые цели для своих копий.)\\nВерните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Вы получаете количество жизней, равное мановой ценности той карты. Изгоните Технику Исцеления.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2208485d-c710-4988-88e5-62c0c5649856\', \'multiverseId\': 518956}, \'multiverseid\': 518956}, {\'name\': \'疗伤技艺\', \'text\': \'示范（当你施放此咒语时，你可以将其复制。若你如此作，则选择一位对手一同复制。牌手可以为各自的复制品选择新的目标。）\\n将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。你获得等同于该牌法术力值的生命。放逐疗伤技艺。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b438bd3-6ec8-4c6c-be38-595353b673c9\', \'multiverseId\': 519027}, \'multiverseid\': 519027}, {\'name\': \'療傷技藝\', \'text\': \'示範（當你施放此咒語時，你可以將其複製。若你如此作，則選擇一位對手一同複製。玩家可以為各自的複製品選擇新的目標。）\\n將目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。你獲得等同於該牌魔法力值的生命。放逐療傷技藝。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f6782e-3f18-484c-9dbc-80870be1e1cd\', \'multiverseId\': 519098}, \'multiverseid\': 519098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heilverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert. Spieler können neue Ziele für ihre Kopien bestimmen.)\\nBringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jener Karte dazu. Schicke das Heilverfahren ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521739&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9cb6953-f099-410d-a88c-cea1d8a4a38d\', \'multiverseId\': 521739}, \'multiverseid\': 521739}, {\'name\': \'Técnica sanadora\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia. Los jugadores pueden elegir nuevos objetivos para sus copias.)\\nRegresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de esa carta. Exilia la Técnica sanadora.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b13c9396-4523-45d6-9a22-93fb555f340b\', \'multiverseId\': 521819}, \'multiverseid\': 521819}, {\'name\': \'Technique de guérison\', \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi. Les joueurs peuvent choisir de nouvelles cibles pour leurs copies.)\\nRenvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de cette carte. Exilez la Technique de guérison.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5d53d6-cbdd-4db8-bf41-64a6e5bc53d9\', \'multiverseId\': 521899}, \'multiverseid\': 521899}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Guarigione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta. I giocatori possono scegliere nuovi bersagli per le proprie copie.)\\nRiprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Guadagni punti vita pari al valore di mana di quella carta. Esilia la Tecnica di Guarigione.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca2aa4a-ffae-4aba-8bcc-caeffe9ecda6\', \'multiverseId\': 521979}, \'multiverseid\': 521979}, {\'name\': \'治癒の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。両プレイヤーは自分のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたはそのカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを得る。治癒の技を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f491ff2-46af-443c-a67a-ce7ce8165e23\', \'multiverseId\': 522059}, \'multiverseid\': 522059}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexenklinik\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Ein Kommandeur deiner Wahl erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die medizinischen Einrichtungen von Blütenwelk stehen allen Studenten offen. Nur wenige nehmen das Angebot an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250da960-03bb-4ae2-94ed-aab94cbe8933\', \'multiverseId\': 518548}, \'multiverseid\': 518548}, {\'name\': \'Clínica de la bruja\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: El comandante objetivo gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de otras escuelas están invitados a las instalaciones médicas de Flosmarcitus. No muchos las visitan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2607e094-602f-41df-84c5-106d859163e7\', \'multiverseId\': 518619}, \'multiverseid\': 518619}, {\'name\': "Dispensaire de l\'envoûteuse", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Un commandant ciblé acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les étudiants des autres universités sont invités à faire un tour dans les établissements médicaux de Flestrefleur. Peu le font.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518690&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdcace1-2c5a-4e27-a714-9e2f9008326c\', \'multiverseId\': 518690}, \'multiverseid\': 518690}, {\'name\': \'Infermeria della Strega\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Un comandante bersaglio ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Gli studenti di altre accademie sono invitati a visitare le strutture mediche di Germoglioscuro. Non molti accettano l\'invito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0e1a3bf-f4e1-4494-ba16-b14586eee7a1\', \'multiverseId\': 518761}, \'multiverseid\': 518761}, {\'name\': \'魔女の診療所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：統率者１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'他の大学から来た生徒はウィザーブルームの医療施設に行くよう勧められるが、そうする者は滅多にいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847b18e0-bac4-4778-9a12-6a0aa47b3075\', \'multiverseId\': 518832}, \'multiverseid\': 518832}, {\'name\': \'Clínica da Bruxa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: O comandante alvo ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os alunos de outras faculdades são convidados a visitar os centros médicos de Murchaflor. Não são muitos os que aceitam o convite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab549c17-b3a1-416b-88ca-0beb5d1c1262\', \'multiverseId\': 518903}, \'multiverseid\': 518903}, {\'name\': \'Ведьмина Клиника\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: целевой командир получает Цепь жизни до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Студентов с других факультетов часто приглашают посетить медицинские учреждения Визерблума. Соглашаются немногие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597ebe5d-38df-430e-b3f4-1964c56f5045\', \'multiverseId\': 518974}, \'multiverseid\': 518974}, {\'name\': \'巫师诊所\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：目标指挥官获得系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'靡华学院广邀其他学院学生前来自己的医疗设施参观。应约者寥寥无几。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c42a35-1b05-4d39-bebc-5adfe77e672a\', \'multiverseId\': 519045}, \'multiverseid\': 519045}, {\'name\': \'巫師診所\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：目標指揮官獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'靡華學院廣邀其他學院學生前來自己的醫療設施參觀。應約者寥寥無幾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eecfd22-444a-46ce-90ed-a534121897b3\', \'multiverseId\': 519116}, \'multiverseid\': 519116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexenklinik\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Ein Kommandeur deiner Wahl erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521756&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1fcdb69-432c-4829-96e1-58183cc558a6\', \'multiverseId\': 521756}, \'multiverseid\': 521756}, {\'name\': \'Clínica de la bruja\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: El comandante objetivo gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf73245-96f7-4e11-8eec-5a9894c03c16\', \'multiverseId\': 521836}, \'multiverseid\': 521836}, {\'name\': "Dispensaire de l\'envoûteuse", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Un commandant ciblé acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144fac8c-e687-4f91-8ec2-0c6c773ad84b\', \'multiverseId\': 521916}, \'multiverseid\': 521916}, {\'name\': \'Infermeria della Strega\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Un comandante bersaglio ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eee414d-a4db-4319-88ff-e9fada184a70\', \'multiverseId\': 521996}, \'multiverseid\': 521996}, {\'name\': \'魔女の診療所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：統率者１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1037b0b2-b371-4d23-91a4-2f880659a00c\', \'multiverseId\': 522076}, \'multiverseid\': 522076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterlistige Rhetorik\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner dich und/oder einen oder mehrere Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil ist, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2ae7e87-be0a-43d1-85fe-5e69565ba6a0\', \'multiverseId\': 518505}, \'multiverseid\': 518505}, {\'name\': \'Retórica astuta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente te ataque a ti y/o a uno o más planeswalkers que controlas, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8285dd1-eed6-4086-a150-ff7203094757\', \'multiverseId\': 518576}, \'multiverseid\': 518576}, {\'name\': \'Rhétorique rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque et/ou attaque au moins un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour la lancer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518647&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7d2800-18e4-4529-a574-8347f3cf4e96\', \'multiverseId\': 518647}, \'multiverseid\': 518647}, {\'name\': \'Retorica Arguta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario attacca te e/o uno o più planeswalker che controlli, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di quel giocatore. Puoi giocare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciarla.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd6bb9d-2a53-485f-b0c0-94027fce9f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 518718}, \'multiverseid\': 518718}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な弁論\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体以上を攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよく、あなたはそれを唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92e18fba-d591-4d06-8917-b21c2c76b635\', \'multiverseId\': 518789}, \'multiverseid\': 518789}, {\'name\': \'Retórica Sagaz\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente atacar você e/ou um ou mais planeswalkers que você controla, exile o card do topo do grimório daquele jogador. Você pode jogar aquele card enquanto ele permanecer exilado, e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'235ba1e8-2988-4762-a468-724c4d674177\', \'multiverseId\': 518860}, \'multiverseid\': 518860}, {\'name\': \'Хитроумная Риторика\', \'text\': "Каждый раз, когда оппонент атакует вас и/или одного или нескольких planeswalker\'ов под вашим контролем, изгоните верхнюю карту библиотеки того игрока. Вы можете разыграть ту карту, пока она остается в изгнании, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание той карты, как если бы это была мана любого цвета.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850b1298-9f7a-4805-b380-9f268b9a7eda\', \'multiverseId\': 518931}, \'multiverseid\': 518931}, {\'name\': \'花言巧语\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手攻击你和／或由你操控的一个或数个鹏洛客时，放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放它的费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b6a2c88-bb02-4a6d-ae4e-a4a12f993c75\', \'multiverseId\': 519002}, \'multiverseid\': 519002}, {\'name\': \'花言巧語\', \'text\': \'每當任一對手攻擊你和／或由你操控的一個或數個鵬洛客時，放逐該玩家的牌庫頂牌。於該牌持續放逐的時段內，你可以使用該牌，且你可以將魔法力視同任意顏色的魔法力來支付施放它的費用。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0bebcc4-358c-4efe-8912-14dc516f8f88\', \'multiverseId\': 519073}, \'multiverseid\': 519073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterlistige Rhetorik\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner dich und/oder einen oder mehrere Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil ist, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba689a9b-c446-43cd-a47b-dda8f3df80af\', \'multiverseId\': 521714}, \'multiverseid\': 521714}, {\'name\': \'Retórica astuta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente te ataque a ti y/o a uno o más planeswalkers que controlas, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982f088b-61e6-46ed-8acb-b99eda19ddd4\', \'multiverseId\': 521794}, \'multiverseid\': 521794}, {\'name\': \'Rhétorique rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque et/ou attaque au moins un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour la lancer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'193728f5-feb0-4965-a865-1dd6f1db7c50\', \'multiverseId\': 521874}, \'multiverseid\': 521874}, {\'name\': \'Retorica Arguta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario attacca te e/o uno o più planeswalker che controlli, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di quel giocatore. Puoi giocare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciarla.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e34b960c-9d47-4c59-92ef-7a6add2a5ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 521954}, \'multiverseid\': 521954}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な弁論\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体以上を攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよく、あなたはそれを唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ef09b5-80b0-47d3-a7d9-cb14f43d301f\', \'multiverseId\': 522034}, \'multiverseid\': 522034}]', "[{'name': 'Hoher Markt', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Wenn man es hier nicht kriegen kann, dann nirgendwo auf keiner Welt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519576&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e629e06-88e6-4adc-bfe1-d2c08cb1d12a', 'multiverseId': 519576}, 'multiverseid': 519576}, {'name': 'Mercado alto', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 1 vida.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Si no lo tienen aquí, no lo tienen en ningún mundo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519824&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff1e8a1c-b69b-4ccf-b563-52adbb9d38de', 'multiverseId': 519824}, 'multiverseid': 519824}, {'name': 'Haut marché', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Si vous ne le trouvez pas là, vous ne le trouverez nulle part.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520072&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2760c88-4532-47f6-92c9-f08866ee6219', 'multiverseId': 520072}, 'multiverseid': 520072}, {'name': 'Mercato Principale', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Guadagni 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Se non lo trovi qui, non lo troverai in nessun altro mondo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520320&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '145ccc31-6b73-4081-8afe-67b5471e122e', 'multiverseId': 520320}, 'multiverseid': 520320}, {'name': '高級市場', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'ここで手に入らないなら、どの世界へ行っても手に入らないよ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520568&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c1998d7-ba39-4f87-a652-3c8d20d81db2', 'multiverseId': 520568}, 'multiverseid': 520568}, {'name': 'Mercado Alto', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Se não encontrares aqui, não encontras em mundo nenhum.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520816&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d9d1ec4-0dc5-4ab5-9b48-9e73b593f5c8', 'multiverseId': 520816}, 'multiverseid': 520816}, {'name': 'Верхний Рынок', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте существо: вы получаете 1 жизнь.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Если этого не найти здесь, то не найти ни в одном из миров.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521064&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c56ccf9-2516-4057-bad6-9334471dde5f', 'multiverseId': 521064}, 'multiverseid': 521064}, {'name': '最高市场', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，牺牲一个生物：你获得1点生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '若是还有这里弄不到的东西，那么恐怕走遍天下也弄不着了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521312&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e1f157e-216e-46af-91d3-203978a7a665', 'multiverseId': 521312}, 'multiverseid': 521312}, {'name': '最高市場', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，犧牲一個生物：你獲得1點生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '若是還有這裡弄不到的東西，那麼恐怕走遍天下也弄不著了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521560&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1eba974-f670-435b-887d-90bd58a30a9a', 'multiverseId': 521560}, 'multiverseid': 521560}]", "[{'name': 'Hornissenkönigin', 'text': 'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn die Hornissenkönigin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit und Todesberührung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519476&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cf816a4-7627-4e56-ae1d-531a22ea70d5', 'multiverseId': 519476}, 'multiverseid': 519476}, {'name': 'Avispa reina', 'text': 'Vuela, toque mortal.\\nCuando la Avispa reina entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura Insecto verdes 1/1 con las habilidades de volar y toque mortal.', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519724&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44927534-634d-49fe-91d0-2270aa118d60', 'multiverseId': 519724}, 'multiverseid': 519724}, {'name': 'Reine des frelons', 'text': 'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand la Reine des frelons arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 verte Insecte avec le vol et le contact mortel.', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519972&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ead9a27-8283-4d66-a069-835c421eed7e', 'multiverseId': 519972}, 'multiverseid': 519972}, {'name': 'Regina dei Calabroni', 'text': 'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando la Regina dei Calabroni entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura Insetto 1/1 verdi con volare e tocco letale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520220&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73388478-8cc1-4514-a617-a8767007653c', 'multiverseId': 520220}, 'multiverseid': 520220}, {'name': '女王スズメバチ', 'text': '飛行、接死\\n女王スズメバチが戦場に出たとき、飛行と接死を持つ緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520468&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f6a207d-0272-445a-b90c-2dba13ecc558', 'multiverseId': 520468}, 'multiverseid': 520468}, {'name': 'Vespa Rainha', 'text': 'Voar, toque mortífero\\nQuando Vespa Rainha entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura Inseto verde 1/1 com voar e toque mortífero.', 'type': 'Criatura — Inseto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520716&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '518c2955-4192-44d2-a8b9-3fcdbcb92518', 'multiverseId': 520716}, 'multiverseid': 520716}, {'name': 'Царица Шершней', 'text': 'Полет, Смертельное касание\\nКогда Царица Шершней выходит на поле битвы, создайте четыре фишки существа 1/1 зеленое Насекомое с Полетом и Смертельным касанием.', 'type': 'Существо — Насекомое', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520964&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e384bd0-fa73-4e03-9502-cc5d54c8c94d', 'multiverseId': 520964}, 'multiverseid': 520964}, {'name': '蜂后', 'text': '飞行，死触\\n当蜂后进战场时，派出四个1/1绿色，具飞行与死触异能的昆虫衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521212&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03037371-751a-4363-bcad-70c656982cd4', 'multiverseId': 521212}, 'multiverseid': 521212}, {'name': '蜂后', 'text': '飛行，死觸\\n當蜂后進戰場時，派出四個1/1綠色，具飛行與死觸異能的昆蟲衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～昆蟲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521460&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7baa93e-a0f8-4c92-bf0b-3f0802082183', 'multiverseId': 521460}, 'multiverseid': 521460}]", "[{'name': 'Hornissennest', 'text': 'Verteidiger\\nImmer wenn dem Hornissennest Schaden zugefügt wird, erzeuge entsprechend viele 1/1 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit und Todesberührung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519475&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ddd495d-d2f9-401e-8b04-c7a42d5f6846', 'multiverseId': 519475}, 'multiverseid': 519475}, {'name': 'Avispero', 'text': 'Defensor.\\nSiempre que el Avispero reciba daño, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Insecto verdes 1/1 con las habilidades de volar y toque mortal.', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519723&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce22483d-caaf-4a89-8175-c7115b953486', 'multiverseId': 519723}, 'multiverseid': 519723}, {'name': 'Nid de frelons', 'text': 'Défenseur\\nÀ chaque fois que le Nid de frelons subit des blessures, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 verte Insecte avec le vol et le contact mortel.', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519971&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aae99eed-2391-4478-9be8-9505b2063e3a', 'multiverseId': 519971}, 'multiverseid': 519971}, {'name': 'Nido di Calabroni', 'text': 'Difensore\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno al Nido di Calabroni, crea altrettante pedine creatura Insetto 1/1 verdi con volare e tocco letale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520219&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52852c7c-d854-473f-a09e-40a0541ad873', 'multiverseId': 520219}, 'multiverseid': 520219}, {'name': 'スズメバチの巣', 'text': '防衛\\nスズメバチの巣がダメージを受けるたび、その点数に等しい数の、飛行と接死を持つ緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520467&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b53a08d-1754-4202-826c-f2104cdafeef', 'multiverseId': 520467}, 'multiverseid': 520467}, {'name': 'Vespeiro', 'text': 'Defensor\\nToda vez que Vespeiro sofrer dano, crie uma quantidade equivalente de fichas de criatura Inseto verde 1/1 com voar e toque mortífero.', 'type': 'Criatura — Inseto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520715&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17312618-8be7-4305-bf6d-34ba2ebc60c3', 'multiverseId': 520715}, 'multiverseid': 520715}, {'name': 'Гнездо Шершней', 'text': 'Защитник\\nКаждый раз, когда Гнезду Шершней наносятся повреждения, создайте столько же фишек существа 1/1 зеленое Насекомое с Полетом и Смертельным касанием.', 'type': 'Существо — Насекомое', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520963&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a800fee3-9d3d-457b-84ee-26b654dcab6c', 'multiverseId': 520963}, 'multiverseid': 520963}, {'name': '黄蜂巢', 'text': '守军\\n每当黄蜂巢受到伤害时，派出等量的1/1绿色，具飞行与死触异能的昆虫衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521211&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2005eac0-26c4-4bcf-a28d-7e2cde2070a4', 'multiverseId': 521211}, 'multiverseid': 521211}, {'name': '黃蜂巢', 'text': '守軍\\n每當黃蜂巢受到傷害時，派出等量的1/1綠色，具飛行與死觸異能的昆蟲衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～昆蟲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521459&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b523989b-6bce-4666-bce3-ac4d4803c744', 'multiverseId': 521459}, 'multiverseid': 521459}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hortschmelzender Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{R}: Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl. Der Hortschmelzende Drache erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Artefakts ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Er sammelt die wertvollen Metalle und wandelt dann den Rest in Treibgas um.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519456&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc899bb1-2fac-4712-bd07-04ef0ac63d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 519456}, \'multiverseid\': 519456}, {\'name\': \'Dragón fundetesoros\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{R}: Destruye el artefacto objetivo. El Dragón fundetesoros obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es el valor de maná de ese artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Colecciona los metales preciosos, y luego convierte el resto en propulsor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ca7f68-ce7f-40e1-ad0f-3ae0225b7dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 519704}, \'multiverseid\': 519704}, {\'name\': \'Dragon fondeur de butin\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{3}{R} : Détruisez un artefact ciblé. Le Dragon fondeur de butin gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la valeur de mana de cet artefact.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Il récupère les métaux précieux et transforme ensuite le reste en carburant.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519952&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'239193b4-6bdc-4994-ade8-91fa6c436b48\', \'multiverseId\': 519952}, \'multiverseid\': 519952}, {\'name\': \'Drago Fonditesori\', \'text\': "Volare\\n{3}{R}: Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio. Il Drago Fonditesori prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il valore di mana di quell\'artefatto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Accumula metalli preziosi e poi converte il resto in propellente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d06b21c5-b89d-40e6-a88e-176f7f0ffbdd\', \'multiverseId\': 520200}, \'multiverseid\': 520200}, {\'name\': \'蔵製錬のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{R}：アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。ターン終了時まで、蔵製錬のドラゴンは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはそのアーティファクトのマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'彼は貴重な金属を集め、残りを噴気へと変える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81335c5a-6194-4253-ace8-ef05516bacf3\', \'multiverseId\': 520448}, \'multiverseid\': 520448}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Fundidor de Tesouro\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{R}: Destrua o artefato alvo. Dragão Fundidor de Tesouro recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o valor de mana daquele artefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Ele coleta os metais preciosos e depois converte o restante em combustível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e956c919-9e76-4728-9b03-c03e51a3099b\', \'multiverseId\': 520696}, \'multiverseid\': 520696}, {\'name\': \'Дракон, Плавильщик Кладов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{3}{R}: уничтожьте целевой артефакт. Дракон, Плавильщик Кладов получает +X/+0 до конца хода, где Х — мановая ценность того артефакта.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Он собирает драгоценные металлы, а затем преобразует все остальное в топливо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1561ffc-bf9c-4f8b-8097-47fb8ee21824\', \'multiverseId\': 520944}, \'multiverseid\': 520944}, {\'name\': \'炼储巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{3}{R}：消灭目标神器。炼储巨龙得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为该神器的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'他收集贵金属，然后将其他的转化为推进燃料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9801bc52-59c1-4dbb-9d88-226dd1f2446b\', \'multiverseId\': 521192}, \'multiverseid\': 521192}, {\'name\': \'鍊儲巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{R}：消滅目標神器。鍊儲巨龍得+X/+0直到回合結束，X為該神器的魔法力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'他收集貴金屬，然後將其他的轉化為推進燃料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bba3807-f19b-454b-82de-fa1f8061e52b\', \'multiverseId\': 521440}, \'multiverseid\': 521440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hydra-Brutwächterin\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Monstrum X. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nWenn die Hydra-Brutwächterin monströs wird, erzeuge X X/X grüne Hydra-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519477&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c84ff6-cee6-4b3a-a661-369e0d66227f\', \'multiverseId\': 519477}, \'multiverseid\': 519477}, {\'name\': \'Hidra ama de la progenie\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Monstruosidad X. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nCuando la Hidra ama de la progenie se convierta en monstruosa, crea X fichas de criatura Hidra verdes X/X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db00b59-ec99-4d13-92e9-3df85a26999d\', \'multiverseId\': 519725}, \'multiverseid\': 519725}, {\'name\': \'Maître de couvée hydre\', \'text\': "{X}{X}{G} : Monstruosité X. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nQuand le Maître de couvée hydre devient monstrueux, créez X jetons de créature X/X verte Hydre.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519973&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78cc3d91-8bd3-4fdc-843d-0e5678f2b0cb\', \'multiverseId\': 519973}, \'multiverseid\': 519973}, {\'name\': \'Idra Protettrice della Covata\', \'text\': "{X}{X}{G}: Mostruosità X. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nQuando l\'Idra Protettrice della Covata diventa mostruosa, crea X pedine creatura Idra X/X verdi.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2bd48ce-2454-4bae-ab5d-f5ed3a34ebd3\', \'multiverseId\': 520221}, \'multiverseid\': 520221}, {\'name\': \'ハイドラの繁殖主\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}：怪物化Ｘを行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\nハイドラの繁殖主が怪物的になったとき、緑のＸ/Ｘのハイドラ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc0c6b54-8398-43c3-a1c5-2376cc583cea\', \'multiverseId\': 520469}, \'multiverseid\': 520469}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Criadeira\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Monstruosidade X. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nQuando Hidra Criadeira se tornar monstruosa, crie X fichas de criatura Hidra verde X/X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe2b411-b1aa-4187-b2ba-7a856bb3b8aa\', \'multiverseId\': 520717}, \'multiverseid\': 520717}, {\'name\': \'Гидра-Породительница\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Чудовищность X. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него X жетонов +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nКогда Гидра-Породительница становится чудовищной, создайте X фишек существа X/X зеленая Гидра.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d754a55-c74f-43b9-945c-72c9e6d5a534\', \'multiverseId\': 520965}, \'multiverseid\': 520965}, {\'name\': \'护卵多头龙\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}：蛮化X。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。）\\n当护卵多头龙蛮化时，派出X个X/X绿色多头龙衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e3c94e-ea70-42d9-8696-54a348315ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 521213}, \'multiverseid\': 521213}, {\'name\': \'護卵多頭龍\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}：蠻化X。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物且它已蠻化。）\\n當護卵多頭龍蠻化時，派出X個X/X綠色多頭龍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29856423-7696-47a4-9937-b2a311bb5f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 521461}, \'multiverseid\': 521461}]', "[{'name': 'Höhlen von Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}. Die Höhlen von Koilos fügen dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519566&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6aebf4f-424f-4c11-9773-9e000f81f658', 'multiverseId': 519566}, 'multiverseid': 519566}, {'name': 'Cuevas de Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}. Las Cuevas de Koilos te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519814&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c737bafc-e3a8-42eb-952b-2d01d8832703', 'multiverseId': 519814}, 'multiverseid': 519814}, {'name': 'Cavernes de Koïlos', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}. Les Cavernes de Koïlos vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520062&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2882945-ebb2-4269-becb-5e28f7ca2b78', 'multiverseId': 520062}, 'multiverseid': 520062}, {'name': 'Caverne di Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}. Le Caverne di Koilos ti infliggono 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520310&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fff1cefe-5b6d-40da-b0d8-6c0154f196e6', 'multiverseId': 520310}, 'multiverseid': 520310}, {'name': 'コイロスの洞窟', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。コイロスの洞窟はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520558&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c415cb6a-dca8-41d1-9515-11d3d8594ccf', 'multiverseId': 520558}, 'multiverseid': 520558}, {'name': 'Cavernas de Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}. Cavernas de Koilos causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520806&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '178d7eab-bb28-41b6-ba94-da3c3ed67a0f', 'multiverseId': 520806}, 'multiverseid': 520806}, {'name': 'Пещеры Койлоса', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {W} или {B}. Пещеры Койлоса наносят вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521054&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a8f2660-df4b-43d7-bfae-29db5eb6398b', 'multiverseId': 521054}, 'multiverseid': 521054}, {'name': '喀洛斯洞窟', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。喀洛斯洞窟对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521302&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4a2c13b-63b4-419c-a6b1-131e4b165fc3', 'multiverseId': 521302}, 'multiverseid': 521302}, {'name': '喀洛斯洞窟', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。喀洛斯洞窟對你造成1點傷害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521550&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d2366b0-44d5-4c02-a31f-81106204d115', 'multiverseId': 521550}, 'multiverseid': 521550}]", "[{'name': 'Höllisches Präsent', 'text': 'Bestimme einen Gegner. Du und jener Spieler opfert je eine Kreatur. Jeder Spieler, der auf diese Weise eine Kreatur geopfert hat, zieht zwei Karten.\\nBestimme einen Gegner. Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, dann bringt jener Spieler eine Kreaturenkarte aus seinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519429&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1801969-4a1b-4d05-8f29-57acc8afce3e', 'multiverseId': 519429}, 'multiverseid': 519429}, {'name': 'Ofrenda infernal', 'text': 'Elige un oponente. Ese jugador y tú sacrifican una criatura cada uno. Cada jugador que sacrificó una criatura de esta manera roba dos cartas.\\nElige un oponente. Regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, luego ese jugador regresa una carta de criatura de su cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519677&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9dd0c29-eae0-438c-bff6-6bfe391fff94', 'multiverseId': 519677}, 'multiverseid': 519677}, {'name': 'Offrande infernale', 'text': 'Choisissez un adversaire. Ce joueur et vous sacrifiez chacun une créature. Chaque joueur qui a sacrifié une créature de cette manière pioche deux cartes.\\nChoisissez un adversaire. Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière, puis ce joueur renvoie sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature depuis son cimetière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519925&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1ae5a64-211f-4fa1-b416-45069314c5e9', 'multiverseId': 519925}, 'multiverseid': 519925}, {'name': 'Offerta Infernale', 'text': 'Scegli un avversario. Tu e quel giocatore sacrificate ognuno una creatura. Ogni giocatore che ha sacrificato una creatura in questo modo pesca due carte.\\nScegli un avversario. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero, poi quel giocatore rimette sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal suo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520173&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dcec3f20-de56-40f3-a046-999ad6eef97f', 'multiverseId': 520173}, 'multiverseid': 520173}, {'name': '冥府の捧げ物', 'text': '対戦相手１人を選ぶ。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。これによりクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げた各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード２枚を引く。\\n対戦相手１人を選ぶ。あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520421&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ff481c4-a975-4f99-ab53-aa56944d1162', 'multiverseId': 520421}, 'multiverseid': 520421}, {'name': 'Oferenda Infernal', 'text': 'Escolha um oponente. Você e aquele jogador sacrificam, cada um, uma criatura. Cada jogador que sacrificou uma criatura dessa forma compra dois cards.\\nEscolha um oponente. Devolva um card de criatura de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha, depois aquele jogador devolve um card de criatura do próprio cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520669&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc9157b2-02c2-4474-9bf6-fa3d868c0bf2', 'multiverseId': 520669}, 'multiverseid': 520669}, {'name': 'Дьявольское Подношение', 'text': 'Выберите оппонента. Вы и тот игрок жертвуете по существу. Каждый игрок, который таким образом пожертвовал существо, берет две карты.\\nВыберите оппонента. Верните карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы, затем тот игрок возвращает карту существа из своего кладбища на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520917&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '434bcc3b-f4e0-4dc9-99a0-3b218fbf2f3c', 'multiverseId': 520917}, 'multiverseid': 520917}, {'name': '炼狱乐施', 'text': '选择一位对手。你和该牌手各牺牲一个生物。每位以此法牺牲生物的牌手各抓两张牌。\\n选择一位对手。将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，然后该牌手将一张生物牌从其坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521165&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6156830-c5b4-45f3-8d22-38e103373e93', 'multiverseId': 521165}, 'multiverseid': 521165}, {'name': '煉獄樂施', 'text': '選擇一位對手。你和該玩家各犧牲一個生物。每位以此法犧牲生物的玩家各抽兩張牌。\\n選擇一位對手。將一張生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場，然後該玩家將一張生物牌從其墳墓場移回戰場。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521413&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03fb2166-9db2-4c4f-a162-64aadfd8fda8', 'multiverseId': 521413}, 'multiverseid': 521413}]", '[{\'name\': \'In Betracht ziehen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück. Du kannst mischen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer sich heute vorbereitet, gewinnt morgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b45524fa-43c8-4988-8646-31797d58c564\', \'multiverseId\': 519408}, \'multiverseid\': 519408}, {\'name\': \'Reflexionar\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego regrésalas en cualquier orden. Puedes bajajar.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El mañana pertenece a quienes hoy se preparan para él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20c28fc-f056-4887-876c-7b247680e9f6\', \'multiverseId\': 519656}, \'multiverseid\': 519656}, {\'name\': \'Contemplation\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous pouvez mélanger.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'avenir appartient à ceux qui s\'y préparent la veille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'398130d1-787e-42d6-9901-b576bca34e84\', \'multiverseId\': 519904}, \'multiverseid\': 519904}, {\'name\': \'Ponderare\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine. Puoi rimescolare.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il domani appartiene a quelli che oggi si preparano per esso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa04d02-4794-4d15-aeba-e3ba4a4f7bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 520152}, \'multiverseid\': 520152}, {\'name\': \'思案\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード３枚を見て、その後、望む順番で戻す。あなたはライブラリーを切り直してもよい。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'明日という日は、今日それを迎える準備をしている者のためにある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'281ff87a-4d35-409b-985c-2a7e6b9656fd\', \'multiverseId\': 520400}, \'multiverseid\': 520400}, {\'name\': \'Ponderar\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo do seu grimório e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem. Você pode embaralhar.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O amanhã pertence aos que se preparam para ele hoje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25b1db1-af95-4a17-800a-26bf27c513f3\', \'multiverseId\': 520648}, \'multiverseid\': 520648}, {\'name\': \'Размышления\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите их обратно в любом порядке. Вы можете перетасовать библиотеку.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Завтра принадлежит тем, кто готовится к нему сегодня.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5a04e0-927c-4c2f-b440-c0a196f4e3d6\', \'multiverseId\': 520896}, \'multiverseid\': 520896}, {\'name\': \'沉思\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将它们以任意顺序放回。你可以洗牌。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'明日属于今天就为它作好准备的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f4d5c89-9414-4d47-9592-e80fb0560228\', \'multiverseId\': 521144}, \'multiverseid\': 521144}, {\'name\': \'沉思\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將它們以任意順序放回。你可以洗牌。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'明日屬於今天就為它作好準備的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96fb2805-d5af-44da-bd5e-6295ed870c84\', \'multiverseId\': 521392}, \'multiverseid\': 521392}]', '[{\'name\': \'In den Zeiten wühlen\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nSchaue dir die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d29b8b6-da64-4fcd-b630-f2b0e8480f10\', \'multiverseId\': 519402}, \'multiverseid\': 519402}, {\'name\': \'Hurgar en el tiempo\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nMira las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce21a89-f5c0-4de1-adbc-986bcde71998\', \'multiverseId\': 519650}, \'multiverseid\': 519650}, {\'name\': \'Fouille temporelle\', \'text\': "Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nRegardez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519898&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246ad783-2f61-4181-9197-c42d58539afe\', \'multiverseId\': 519898}, \'multiverseid\': 519898}, {\'name\': \'Scavare nel Tempo\', \'text\': \'Esumare (Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nGuarda le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi due di quelle carte alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293e2a44-8094-4de8-a796-81f42b4f3d46\', \'multiverseId\': 520146}, \'multiverseid\': 520146}, {\'name\': \'時を越えた探索\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードはそれぞれ{1}を支払う。）\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード７枚を見る。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a5edb38-690a-4ffe-94ac-0e4d43e8e6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 520394}, \'multiverseid\': 520394}, {\'name\': \'Revirar o Tempo\', \'text\': \'Esquadrinhar (Cada card que você exila de seu cemitério quando conjura esta mágica paga por {1}.)\\nOlhe os sete cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque dois deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d678ea-4d05-48d9-9022-83a661913a13\', \'multiverseId\': 520642}, \'multiverseid\': 520642}, {\'name\': \'Поиски во Времени\', \'text\': \'Выкапывание (Каждая карта, которую вы изгоняете из вашего кладбища при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПосмотрите семь верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Положите две из них в вашу руку, а остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e864d8d8-096f-4660-ab09-777e8614f0b3\', \'multiverseId\': 520890}, \'multiverseid\': 520890}, {\'name\': \'历时挖掘\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你于施放此咒语时每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n检视你牌库顶的七张牌。将其中两张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c648c0e-ae60-4eae-a0bd-23be5115b2ba\', \'multiverseId\': 521138}, \'multiverseid\': 521138}, {\'name\': \'歷時挖掘\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你於施放此咒語時每從你墳墓場中放逐一張牌，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n檢視你牌庫頂的七張牌。將其中兩張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f05998e6-6e5e-4b1e-86e3-6b01d8e3c4db\', \'multiverseId\': 521386}, \'multiverseid\': 521386}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno-Projekt\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDas Inferno-Projekt kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Gesamtsumme der Manabeträge von Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Kunst, die aus solch rohen Emotionen entsteht, entwickelt oft ein Eigenleben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9442be58-0f86-44ef-b546-76e3e108b4e9\', \'multiverseId\': 518519}, \'multiverseid\': 518519}, {\'name\': \'Proyecto infernal\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Proyecto infernal entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él, donde X es el valor de maná total de las cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'El arte que nace de un sentimiento tan puro suele cobrar vida propia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d643243-a122-46e5-8d75-29f0c8284ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 518590}, \'multiverseid\': 518590}, {\'name\': \'Projet de fournaise\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLe Projet de fournaise arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant la valeur de mana totale des cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Une œuvre d\'art née d\'une émotion aussi brute finit souvent par prendre vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518661&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'790e93dd-e383-46c9-b11f-ab92c6fe06fa\', \'multiverseId\': 518661}, \'multiverseid\': 518661}, {\'name\': \'Progetto Inferno\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nIl Progetto Inferno entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il valore di mana totale delle carte istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': "L\'arte che nasce da emozioni così forti prende spesso vita propria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195165d2-32c6-49ff-b8f4-220f07108479\', \'multiverseId\': 518732}, \'multiverseid\': 518732}, {\'name\': \'業火の課題\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n業火の課題は＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはあなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードのマナ総量の合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'むき出しの感情が作り出したものは、しばしば制御が利かなくなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ede6b1-e9b2-43de-9a1e-73b423f22629\', \'multiverseId\': 518803}, \'multiverseid\': 518803}, {\'name\': \'Projeto Inferno\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nProjeto Inferno entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1, sendo X o valor de mana total dos cards de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'A arte nascida de emoções tão viscerais muitas vezes ganha vida própria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca492a9-d6ce-4327-8e6f-889b34192a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 518874}, \'multiverseid\': 518874}, {\'name\': \'Инфернальный Проект\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nИнфернальный Проект выходит на поле битвы с Х жетонами +1/+1 на нем, где Х — суммарная мановая ценность карт мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Искусство, порожденное такими необузданными эмоциями, нередко обретает свою собственную жизнь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2137e46a-ef41-4fef-a01f-59899d913344\', \'multiverseId\': 518945}, \'multiverseid\': 518945}, {\'name\': \'炼狱作品\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n炼狱作品进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为你坟墓场中所有瞬间和法术牌的法术力值总和。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'源自原初情感的艺术作品，通常会自成体裁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8e9199-12ea-4cde-b954-cde7a0f8a8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 519016}, \'multiverseid\': 519016}, {\'name\': \'煉獄作品\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n煉獄作品進戰場時上面有X個+1/+1指示物，X為你墳墓場中所有瞬間和巫術牌的魔法力值總和。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'源自原初情感的藝術作品，通常會自成體裁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862507ef-54b7-4067-96fe-7f235ec9d7de\', \'multiverseId\': 519087}, \'multiverseid\': 519087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno-Projekt\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDas Inferno-Projekt kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Gesamtsumme der Manabeträge von Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521728&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d57e33-1600-4fd3-8f57-0ee86cd126dd\', \'multiverseId\': 521728}, \'multiverseid\': 521728}, {\'name\': \'Proyecto infernal\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Proyecto infernal entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él, donde X es el valor de maná total de las cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be074d4-d872-425b-97b0-72fe75037ae9\', \'multiverseId\': 521808}, \'multiverseid\': 521808}, {\'name\': \'Projet de fournaise\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLe Projet de fournaise arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant la valeur de mana totale des cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca35185-da7d-4ebb-bf9b-5cb8991dffc1\', \'multiverseId\': 521888}, \'multiverseid\': 521888}, {\'name\': \'Progetto Inferno\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nIl Progetto Inferno entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il valore di mana totale delle carte istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db770faa-127b-4714-9a0d-69cad7dd0740\', \'multiverseId\': 521968}, \'multiverseid\': 521968}, {\'name\': \'業火の課題\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n業火の課題は＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはあなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードのマナ総量の合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8861274c-3c00-4128-b203-d71d8559fe36\', \'multiverseId\': 522048}, \'multiverseid\': 522048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inkarnationsverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert.)\\nDu millst fünf Karten. Bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Stelle dich deiner Angst, aber lass dich nicht von ihr beherrschen. Du hast jetzt das Sagen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2742c14e-e291-4f7f-bf62-5667dbbb99b6\', \'multiverseId\': 518508}, \'multiverseid\': 518508}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de encarnación\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia.)\\nMuele cinco cartas, luego regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja aflorar tus miedos, pero que no te controlen. Ahora tú los dominas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d96e3fc4-304a-405f-98c3-0968a8deaee1\', \'multiverseId\': 518579}, \'multiverseid\': 518579}, {\'name\': "Technique d\'incarnation", \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi.)\\nMeulez cinq cartes, puis renvoyez une carte de créature sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Fais sortir ta peur, mais ne la laisse pas te contrôler. C\'est toi qui es aux commandes maintenant. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518650&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8512c56-a53a-4379-8cba-b7517c68bbe9\', \'multiverseId\': 518650}, \'multiverseid\': 518650}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Incarnazione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta.)\\nMacina cinque carte, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Libera la tua paura, ma non lasciare che ti controlli. Sei tu che comandi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f80386ce-28b6-46ae-9c2f-31d4af3ef990\', \'multiverseId\': 518721}, \'multiverseid\': 518721}, {\'name\': \'具現の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。」を選んでもよい。）\\nカード５枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自身の恐れを引き出しなさい。でもそれに支配されないように。あなたがそれを管理するのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3828fd1-ad4d-4380-bef3-c32f45b1d74c\', \'multiverseId\': 518792}, \'multiverseid\': 518792}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de Incarnação\', \'text\': \'Demonstrar (Quando você conjura esta mágica, você pode copiá-la. Se fizer isso, escolha um oponente para copiá-la também.)\\nTriture cinco cards e, depois, devolva um card de criatura de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Evoque seu medo, mas não deixe que ele controle você. Agora é você quem manda."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba2d296-a172-481d-bb9e-a0870159f323\', \'multiverseId\': 518863}, \'multiverseid\': 518863}, {\'name\': \'Техника Воплощения\', \'text\': \'Демонстрация (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, вы можете скопировать его. Если вы это делаете, выберите оппонента, который также скопирует его.)\\nСкрутите пять карт, затем верните карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Призови свой страх, но не позволяй ему управлять тобой. Сейчас ты главная».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26e33fc-8eb2-4779-9e1b-415d0d360bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 518934}, \'multiverseid\': 518934}, {\'name\': \'转生技艺\', \'text\': \'示范（当你施放此咒语时，你可以将其复制。若你如此作，则选择一位对手一同复制。）\\n磨五张牌，然后将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「引出自己的恐惧，但别受其操控。现在换你试试。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd1b692-13eb-4078-85c9-3605a5cae136\', \'multiverseId\': 519005}, \'multiverseid\': 519005}, {\'name\': \'轉生技藝\', \'text\': \'示範（當你施放此咒語時，你可以將其複製。若你如此作，則選擇一位對手一同複製。）\\n磨五張牌，然後將一張生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「引出自己的恐懼，但別受其左右。現在換你試試。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935aabf8-19be-4cd5-9011-6b1103b2157e\', \'multiverseId\': 519076}, \'multiverseid\': 519076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inkarnationsverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert.)\\nDu millst fünf Karten. Bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629b5995-8046-4e11-b3bd-e629228f1fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 521717}, \'multiverseid\': 521717}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de encarnación\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia.)\\nMuele cinco cartas, luego regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dfdfad2-1388-4801-8c09-c7c19ae20654\', \'multiverseId\': 521797}, \'multiverseid\': 521797}, {\'name\': "Technique d\'incarnation", \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi.)\\nMeulez cinq cartes, puis renvoyez une carte de créature sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470bd680-6501-4371-ab31-1a0118dabc69\', \'multiverseId\': 521877}, \'multiverseid\': 521877}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Incarnazione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta.)\\nMacina cinque carte, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a87892f-baed-4ab4-9070-f6752ae8b8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 521957}, \'multiverseid\': 521957}, {\'name\': \'具現の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。」を選んでもよい。）\\nカード５枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54212cd4-da33-4701-9f92-43f891c431c8\', \'multiverseId\': 522037}, \'multiverseid\': 522037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inkubationsdruidin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, das ein Land, das du kontrollierst, produzieren könnte. Falls mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke auf der Inkubationsdruidin liegt, erzeuge stattdessen drei Mana dieses Typs.\\n{3}{G}{G}: Adaptieren 3. (Falls keine +1/+1-Marken auf dieser Kreatur liegen, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed01d152-1a2c-4683-8118-1fdbda4e86a7\', \'multiverseId\': 519478}, \'multiverseid\': 519478}, {\'name\': \'Druida de la incubación\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier tipo que pueda producir una tierra que controlas. Si la Druida de la incubación tiene un contador +1/+1 sobre ella, en vez de eso, agrega tres manás de ese tipo.\\n{3}{G}{G}: Adaptar 3. (Si esta criatura no tiene contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ae40a9-9113-4bc5-9582-6fdc30582e18\', \'multiverseId\': 519726}, \'multiverseid\': 519726}, {\'name\': "Druidesse d\'incubation", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quel type qu\'un terrain que vous contrôlez pourrait produire. Si la Druidesse d\'incubation a un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle, ajoutez trois manas de ce type à la place.\\n{3}{G}{G} : Adaptez 3. (Si cette créature n\'a pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e611b34f-5cbb-406c-814d-c4ee46bc48b2\', \'multiverseId\': 519974}, \'multiverseid\': 519974}, {\'name\': "Druida dell\'Incubazione", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi tipo che una terra che controlli potrebbe produrre. Se la Druida dell\'Incubazione ha un segnalino +1/+1, aggiungi invece tre mana di quel tipo.\\n{3}{G}{G}: Adattamento 3. (Se questa creatura non ha segnalini +1/+1, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98db5699-01d4-4494-b638-aa8edda5059f\', \'multiverseId\': 520222}, \'multiverseid\': 520222}, {\'name\': \'培養ドルイド\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできるタイプのうち望むタイプのマナ１点を加える。培養ドルイドの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているなら、代わりにそのタイプのマナ３点を加える。\\n{3}{G}{G}：順応３を行う。（このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae5373e-ebe9-43ba-b096-7d7ca7f4b929\', \'multiverseId\': 520470}, \'multiverseid\': 520470}, {\'name\': \'Druida da Incubação\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer tipo que um terreno que você controla possa gerar. Se Druida da Incubação tiver um marcador +1/+1, em vez disso, adicione três manas daquele tipo.\\n{3}{G}{G}: Adaptar 3. (Se esta criatura não tiver marcadores +1/+1, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 nela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6347f95-5aed-4ee0-b01d-ed474a8a7d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 520718}, \'multiverseid\': 520718}, {\'name\': \'Друид Инкубации\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого типа, который могла бы произвести земля под вашим контролем. Если на Друиде Инкубации есть жетон +1/+1, вместо этого добавьте три маны того типа.\\n{3}{G}{G}: адаптируйте 3. (Если на этом существе нет жетонов +1/+1, положите на него три жетона +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7241ba1-33ed-4078-9cb1-5d0461388e8e\', \'multiverseId\': 520966}, \'multiverseid\': 520966}, {\'name\': \'护育德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其类别为由你操控的地能产生之任一类别。如果护育德鲁伊上有+1/+1指示物，则改为加三点该类别的法术力。\\n{3}{G}{G}：演化3。（如果此生物上没有+1/+1指示物，则在其上放置三个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61db836-7041-42f4-bd22-60b7c665ec3c\', \'multiverseId\': 521214}, \'multiverseid\': 521214}, {\'name\': \'護育德魯伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其類別為由你操控的地能產生之任一類別。如果護育德魯伊上有+1/+1指示物，則改為加三點該類別的魔法力。\\n{3}{G}{G}：演化3。（如果此生物上沒有+1/+1指示物，則在其上放置三個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47caafea-2274-41bc-ae9d-0ede5a815d72\', \'multiverseId\': 521462}, \'multiverseid\': 521462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierender Refrain\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten. Schicke den Inspirierenden Refrain mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {2}{U} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {2}{U} bezahlen, sie ins Exil schicken und drei Zeitmarken auf sie legen. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke sie, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c69ee1-2d56-4748-a054-ce5e07e88e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 518494}, \'multiverseid\': 518494}, {\'name\': \'Estribillo inspirador\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas. Exilia el Estribillo inspirador con tres contadores de tiempo sobre él.\\nSuspender 3—{2}{U}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta de tu mano, puedes pagar {2}{U} y exiliarla con tres contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2df56b0-10b9-4f17-8480-d657027d9fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 518565}, \'multiverseid\': 518565}, {\'name\': \'Refrain inspirateur\', \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes. Exilez le Refrain inspirateur avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur lui.\\nSuspension 3 — {2}{U} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {2}{U} et l\'exiler avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, lancez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518636&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259750b3-786b-4d7b-8652-b0e6f1bef2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 518636}, \'multiverseid\': 518636}, {\'name\': \'Ritornello Ispiratore\', \'text\': "Pesca due carte. Esilia il Ritornello Ispiratore con tre segnalini tempo su di esso.\\nSospendere 3—{2}{U} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {2}{U} ed esiliarla con tre segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, lancia la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ffbcf88-2132-4444-8519-70db8bc22126\', \'multiverseId\': 518707}, \'multiverseid\': 518707}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞のリフレイン\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引く。鼓舞のリフレインを時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機３―{2}{U}（あなたはこのカードをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{2}{U}を支払って時間カウンター３個を置いた状態で追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa0ea5fd-6373-4a9e-bf22-89a78896fd22\', \'multiverseId\': 518778}, \'multiverseid\': 518778}, {\'name\': \'Refrão Inspirador\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards. Exile Refrão Inspirador com três marcadores temporais.\\nSuspender 3 — {2}{U} (Em vez de conjurar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {2}{U} e exilá-lo com três marcadores temporais. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando o último for removido, conjure-o sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'403d0fb2-d3f7-4d33-92fe-4ff4b3f832da\', \'multiverseId\': 518849}, \'multiverseid\': 518849}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновляющий Рефрен\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты. Изгоните Вдохновляющий Рефрен с тремя временными жетонами на нем.\\nОтсрочка 3 — {2}{U} (Вместо того, чтобы разыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {2}{U} и изгнать ее с тремя временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда удален последний временной жетон, разыграйте эту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69609928-2008-45ed-b323-891b0ffaca86\', \'multiverseId\': 518920}, \'multiverseid\': 518920}, {\'name\': \'启迪旋律\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。放逐启迪旋律，且上面有三个计时指示物。\\n延缓3～{2}{U}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{2}{U}并将它放逐，且上面有三个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'605ff66d-01db-46c7-97ef-b7a33bffd511\', \'multiverseId\': 518991}, \'multiverseid\': 518991}, {\'name\': \'啟迪旋律\', \'text\': \'抽兩張牌。放逐啟迪旋律，且上面有三个計時指示物。\\n延緩3～{2}{U}（除了從你手中施放此牌，你可以支付{2}{U}並將它放逐，且上面有三個計時指示物。在你的維持開始時，從其上移去一個計時指示物。當移去最後一個時，施放它且不需支付其魔法力費用。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11deb83b-5e11-426b-a75b-351c0badd22b\', \'multiverseId\': 519062}, \'multiverseid\': 519062}]', "[{'name': 'Inspirierender Refrain', 'text': 'Ziehe zwei Karten. Schicke den Inspirierenden Refrain mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {2}{U}', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521703&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '542edb18-533b-4ab1-8e1f-a43161f9584a', 'multiverseId': 521703}, 'multiverseid': 521703}, {'name': 'Estribillo inspirador', 'text': 'Roba dos cartas. Exilia el Estribillo inspirador con tres contadores de tiempo sobre él.\\nSuspender 3—{2}{U}.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521783&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03b3ea1e-faa0-41da-96da-7f11c0fe41e9', 'multiverseId': 521783}, 'multiverseid': 521783}, {'name': 'Refrain inspirateur', 'text': 'Piochez deux cartes. Exilez le Refrain inspirateur avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur lui.\\nSuspension 3 — {2}{U}', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521863&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29c325f6-1913-4451-9197-4329ac768d93', 'multiverseId': 521863}, 'multiverseid': 521863}, {'name': 'Ritornello Ispiratore', 'text': 'Pesca due carte. Esilia il Ritornello Ispiratore con tre segnalini tempo su di esso.\\nSospendere 3—{2}{U}', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521943&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1257f914-c56d-4719-b6a9-48a23532455b', 'multiverseId': 521943}, 'multiverseid': 521943}, {'name': '鼓舞のリフレイン', 'text': 'カード２枚を引く。鼓舞のリフレインを時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機３―{2}{U}', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522023&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28a71843-aebc-4b1d-b552-133503df521a', 'multiverseId': 522023}, 'multiverseid': 522023}]", '[{\'name\': \'Instabiler Obelisk\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, opfere den Instabilen Obelisken: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Zerfall ist wie das letzte Aufbäumen einer längst vergangenen Zivilisation, die es nicht ertragen kann, in Vergessenheit zu geraten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'942b6215-7b62-46b9-9567-ec2b5918904a\', \'multiverseId\': 519555}, \'multiverseid\': 519555}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco inestable\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrificar el Obelisco inestable: Destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su derrumbamiento es como la insolencia de una civilización largo tiempo extinta y ofendida por haber sido olvidada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db1538b3-87ee-42c2-8f78-746d510304a1\', \'multiverseId\': 519803}, \'multiverseid\': 519803}, {\'name\': \'Obélisque instable\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Obélisque instable : Détruisez un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Son effondrement est l\'ultime attaque d\'une civilisation disparue qui refuse de sombrer dans l\'oubli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef97179-e461-4ce2-9332-111e000a4ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 520051}, \'multiverseid\': 520051}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco Instabile\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Obelisco Instabile: Distruggi un permanente bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo crollo è il monito stizzito di una civiltà scomparsa da tempo che non sopporta di essere dimenticata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9082a5d7-febe-467b-aaf2-f4ff70829904\', \'multiverseId\': 520299}, \'multiverseid\': 520299}, {\'name\': \'不安定なオベリスク\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{7}, {T}, 不安定なオベリスクを生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その崩壊は、遠い昔に死に絶えた文明が忘れ去られることへの不満を表す足掻きのようであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d32997-b679-4b07-a40d-901cbe518399\', \'multiverseId\': 520547}, \'multiverseid\': 520547}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco Instável\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifique Obelisco Instável: Destrua a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seu colapso é como o fustigar de uma civilização há muito morta que ressente o esquecimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b75412f-9699-44a8-82e6-b27d0c10dbb0\', \'multiverseId\': 520795}, \'multiverseid\': 520795}, {\'name\': \'Нестабильный Обелиск\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, пожертвуйте Нестабильный Обелиск: уничтожьте целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Его падение — как последний удар давно погибшей цивилизации, которая отказывается быть забытой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78420077-e18f-4939-bb8a-faf52b9ee99a\', \'multiverseId\': 521043}, \'multiverseid\': 521043}, {\'name\': \'不稳定石碑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{7}，{T}，牺牲不稳定石碑：消灭目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'远古文明若遭后人遗忘，定会带来惨烈后果以警醒世人。此座石碑之坍塌亦然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c81601e-96da-49fb-8023-d84944089020\', \'multiverseId\': 521291}, \'multiverseid\': 521291}, {\'name\': \'不穩定石碑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{7}，{T}，犧牲不穩定石碑：消滅目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'遠古文明若遭後人遺忘，定會帶來慘烈後果以警醒世人。此座石碑之坍塌亦然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddc6c494-9ed6-4566-a2c8-ed2406461daa\', \'multiverseId\': 521539}, \'multiverseid\': 521539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Dampfwerk\', \'text\': \'Das Izzet-Dampfwerk kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Izzet-Dampfwerk ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e779358b-b1b0-440a-ad6e-f65c651991b9\', \'multiverseId\': 519577}, \'multiverseid\': 519577}, {\'name\': \'Calderas ízzet\', \'text\': \'Las Calderas ízzet entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Calderas ízzet entren al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de07de95-1969-42c7-81fd-05bbc0fd0db3\', \'multiverseId\': 519825}, \'multiverseid\': 519825}, {\'name\': "Chaufferie d\'Izzet", \'text\': "La Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d75d2b-7c68-4ed2-a65f-80d5f73712c0\', \'multiverseId\': 520073}, \'multiverseid\': 520073}, {\'name\': \'Ebollitori Izzet\', \'text\': \'Gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'766252b3-e33a-4314-892b-b036bd9095c1\', \'multiverseId\': 520321}, \'multiverseid\': 520321}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの煮沸場\', \'text\': \'イゼットの煮沸場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nイゼットの煮沸場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ea504b-3be6-402c-b27d-62fb7c7d81ae\', \'multiverseId\': 520569}, \'multiverseid\': 520569}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet\', \'text\': \'Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7071aa9d-1623-440e-881d-7c24bbcba3eb\', \'multiverseId\': 520817}, \'multiverseid\': 520817}, {\'name\': \'Котельная Иззетов\', \'text\': \'Котельная Иззетов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Котельная Иззетов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d397f19a-42cc-40c5-94e4-d708913b734f\', \'multiverseId\': 521065}, \'multiverseid\': 521065}, {\'name\': \'伊捷炼炉厂\', \'text\': \'伊捷炼炉厂须横置进战场。\\n当伊捷炼炉厂进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92538f3-5d27-4e68-9dd0-31589f155f61\', \'multiverseId\': 521313}, \'multiverseid\': 521313}, {\'name\': \'伊捷煉爐廠\', \'text\': \'伊捷煉爐廠須橫置進戰場。\\n當伊捷煉爐廠進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c4bde8-1370-4d06-829b-c5ef54a947a2\', \'multiverseId\': 521561}, \'multiverseid\': 521561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Petschaft der Izzet erhält immer wieder ein neues Aussehen, und jedes Mal wird es einem schmeichelnden Portrait von Niv-Mizzet ähnlicher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'083938a7-87b5-47b4-bc93-23acf5bffeb5\', \'multiverseId\': 519530}, \'multiverseid\': 519530}, {\'name\': \'Sello ízzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Sello ízzet se rediseña a menudo, y cada vez se parece más a un retrato de Niv-Mízzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc8af295-8d61-4aef-82c3-ad9fa7962d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 519778}, \'multiverseid\': 519778}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Izzet", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le cachet d\'Izzet est régulièrement modifié pour ressembler de plus en plus à un portrait miniature de Niv-Mizzet.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520026&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a410a6e-5eb2-4487-9d63-46b8468a2ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 520026}, \'multiverseid\': 520026}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Izzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il sigillo Izzet viene ridisegnato spesso, ogni volta più simile a un vanesio ritratto di Niv-Mizzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdaf7f0-455e-4ed4-b200-60c52eaabf8b\', \'multiverseId\': 520274}, \'multiverseid\': 520274}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットの印鑑はしばしばデザインし直され、そのたびにニヴ＝ミゼットの虚栄に満ちた肖像に近づいていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c1a13f0-a2b0-4053-a7e3-6f2def64f426\', \'multiverseId\': 520522}, \'multiverseid\': 520522}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Izzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O Sinete Izzet é freqüentemente redesenhado, e cada vez se parece mais com Niv-Mizzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98f80e9-791b-49b8-ac1b-c396e81459f4\', \'multiverseId\': 520770}, \'multiverseid\': 520770}, {\'name\': \'Печать Иззетов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Печать Иззетов постоянно переделывают, и с каждым разом она все больше напоминает миниатюрное изображение Нив-Миззета.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19208df0-e272-48cf-8cca-7aea44339929\', \'multiverseId\': 521018}, \'multiverseid\': 521018}, {\'name\': \'伊捷印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'伊捷印记的设计经常变化，每次都更接近尼米捷浮华的画像。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767d9997-ff71-41d2-80db-55e1fa0f5da9\', \'multiverseId\': 521266}, \'multiverseid\': 521266}, {\'name\': \'伊捷印記\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'伊捷印記的設計經常變化，每次都更接近尼米捷浮華的畫像。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3d0f51b-038c-4b1c-aab1-4df7a1982a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 521514}, \'multiverseid\': 521514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagender Trygon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Jagende Trygon einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die der Spieler kontrolliert, zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Trygonen, die von umgewandelter Magie in der Luft gehalten werden, sind auf dauernder Jagd nach Quellen ihres magischen Antriebs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b0d100c-6a57-42f0-bedc-1e1e6e895f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 519514}, \'multiverseid\': 519514}, {\'name\': \'Depredador trygon\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Depredador trygon haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes destruir el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Sostenidos por magia metabolizada, los trygons están hambrientos buscando fuentes de su alimento místico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7e1704-cbeb-43d0-a802-db871ae9337c\', \'multiverseId\': 519762}, \'multiverseid\': 519762}, {\'name\': \'Clavelade prédatrice\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Clavelade prédatrice inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez détruire un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Maintenues dans les airs par la magie qu\'elles ont métabolisée, les clavelades sont avides d\'énergie mystique.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520010&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'854a6486-c904-497a-a1f2-51874ba03bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 520010}, \'multiverseid\': 520010}, {\'name\': \'Predatore Trigone\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Predatore Trigone infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi distruggere un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Sostenuti dalla magia metabolizzata, i trigoni sono famelici cacciatori di fonti di energia mistica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b9ccde1-1f5c-4d23-b030-0f4a82231540\', \'multiverseId\': 520258}, \'multiverseid\': 520258}, {\'name\': \'三角エイの捕食者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n三角エイの捕食者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'代謝魔法で浮かんでいる三角エイは、魔力を満たすための源に貪欲だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36788bcd-271f-4d22-b3d3-a22d356d245c\', \'multiverseId\': 520506}, \'multiverseid\': 520506}, {\'name\': \'Arraia Predadora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Arraia Predadora causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode destruir o artefato ou encantamento alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Suspensas no ar por uma mágica metabolizada, as arraias são ávidas por fontes de combustível místico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d07504-61f3-4c47-9b1d-75bdc1ed0fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 520754}, \'multiverseid\': 520754}, {\'name\': \'Манта-Хищник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Манта-Хищник наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете уничтожить целевой артефакт или чары под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Манты держатся в воздухе благодаря поглощенной магии и постоянно алчут нового магического топлива.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9c6bdc8-6fa2-4ca3-80b8-cccc69b51b8a\', \'multiverseId\': 521002}, \'multiverseid\': 521002}, {\'name\': \'掠食飞鳐\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当掠食飞鳐对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以消灭目标由该牌手操控的神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'飞鳐依赖消耗性法术在空中飞翔，为补充魔力燃料来源而不断掠食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f18eb27-ed4b-477d-8063-4c82d2389f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 521250}, \'multiverseid\': 521250}, {\'name\': \'掠食飛鰩\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當掠食飛鰩對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以消滅目標由該玩家操控的神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'飛鰩依賴消耗性魔法在空中飛翔，為補充魔力燃料來源而不斷掠食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a53af67-ee0f-4283-943b-afc4d3052274\', \'multiverseId\': 521498}, \'multiverseid\': 521498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jaya Ballard\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge {R}{R}{R}. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Spontanzauber oder Hexereien zu wirken.\\n+1: Wirf bis zu drei Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\\n−8: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Du kannst Spontanzauber und Hexereien aus deinem Friedhof wirken. Falls ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Jaya\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519458&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6bc4084-59a8-45a4-b264-d7c233633b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 519458}, \'multiverseid\': 519458}, {\'name\': \'Jaya Ballard\', \'text\': \'+1: Agrega {R}{R}{R}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\\n+1: Descarta hasta tres cartas. Luego, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\\n−8: Obtienes un emblema con "Puedes lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro desde tu cementerio. Si un hechizo lanzado de esta manera fuera a ir a tu cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Jaya\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1af455df-5300-464e-bc8d-21efc312c78f\', \'multiverseId\': 519706}, \'multiverseid\': 519706}, {\'name\': \'Jaya Ballard\', \'text\': "+1 : Ajoutez {R}{R}{R}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'éphémère ou de rituel.\\n+1 : Défaussez-vous de jusqu\'à trois cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes.\\n-8 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Vous pouvez lancer des sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel depuis votre cimetière. Si un sort lancé de cette manière devait être mis dans votre cimetière, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Jaya\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46eac136-410d-40ff-9111-404b69cf3268\', \'multiverseId\': 519954}, \'multiverseid\': 519954}, {\'name\': \'Jaya Ballard\', \'text\': \'+1: Aggiungi {R}{R}{R}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie istantaneo o stregoneria.\\n+1: Scarta fino a tre carte, poi pesca altrettante carte.\\n-8: Ottieni un emblema con "Puoi lanciare magie istantaneo e stregoneria dal tuo cimitero. Se una magia lanciata in questo modo sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero, invece esiliala."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Jaya\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f6e233-59a8-4fae-81a6-4a542bae8538\', \'multiverseId\': 520202}, \'multiverseid\': 520202}, {\'name\': \'ヤヤ・バラード\', \'text\': \'+1：{R}{R}{R}を加える。このマナは、インスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。\\n+1：カード最大３枚を捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n−8：あなたは「あなたはあなたの墓地からインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えてもよい。これにより唱えた呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ヤヤ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5e34e10-e317-400a-a599-e25765069600\', \'multiverseId\': 520450}, \'multiverseid\': 520450}, {\'name\': \'Jaya Ballard\', \'text\': \'+1: Adicione {R}{R}{R}. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas instantâneas ou feitiços.\\n+1: Descarte até três cards e depois compre uma quantidade equivalente de cards.\\n−8: Você recebe um emblema com "Você pode conjurar mágicas instantâneas e feitiços do seu cemitério. Se uma mágica conjurada desta forma seria colocada em seu cemitério, em vez disso, exile-a."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Jaya\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'424558a7-444b-41b3-a7e7-bd09ee07c3aa\', \'multiverseId\': 520698}, \'multiverseid\': 520698}, {\'name\': \'Джайя Баллард\', \'text\': \'+1: добавьте {R}{R}{R}. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание мгновенных заклинаний или заклинаний волшебства.\\n+1: сбросьте не более трех карт, затем возьмите столько же карт.\\n—8: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Вы можете разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания и заклинания волшебства из вашего кладбища. Если разыгранное таким образом заклинание должно быть положено на ваше кладбище, изгоните его вместо этого».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Джайя\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0635ea-e548-4102-b6f4-4fd428c46341\', \'multiverseId\': 520946}, \'multiverseid\': 520946}, {\'name\': \'雅亚巴拉德\', \'text\': \'+1：加{R}{R}{R}。此法术力只能用来施放瞬间或法术咒语。\\n+1：弃至多三张牌，然后抓等量的牌。\\n−8：你获得具有以下异能的徽记～「你可以从你的坟墓场中施放瞬间与法术咒语。如果以此法施放的咒语将置入你的坟墓场，则改为将其放逐。」\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～雅亚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e34896c-e821-421b-ad28-b01a41362f62\', \'multiverseId\': 521194}, \'multiverseid\': 521194}, {\'name\': \'雅亞巴拉德\', \'text\': \'+1：加{R}{R}{R}。此魔法力只能用來施放瞬間或巫術咒語。\\n+1：棄至多三張牌，然後抽等量的牌。\\n−8：你獲得具有以下異能的徽記～「你可以從你的墳墓場中施放瞬間與巫術咒語。如果以此法施放的咒語將置入你的墳墓場，則改為將其放逐。」\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～雅亞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d90e3a3-71f2-49a8-8319-a300b52e3ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 521442}, \'multiverseid\': 521442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen der Obwalter\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nMetallkunst — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+0, solange du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Solange in meinen Händen noch ein Schwert ist, gibt es noch Hoffnung für ein wieder gereinigtes Mirrodin."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3afa24-d04a-4fff-956f-a519f898f02e\', \'multiverseId\': 519503}, \'multiverseid\': 519503}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, el prevaleciente\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nMetalurgia — Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +3/+0 mientras controles tres o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras tenga una espada en mi mano, habrá esperanza de un Mirrodin puro".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72412f8-c1f7-4598-893e-4e388f6c49c1\', \'multiverseId\': 519751}, \'multiverseid\': 519751}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, le Triomphant\', \'text\': \'Initiative\\nArt des métaux — Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+0 tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Tant que j\'ai encore une lame en main, l\'espoir d\'un Mirrodin purifié perdure. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519999&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98091a27-9039-45f7-9651-8a3f908377d2\', \'multiverseId\': 519999}, \'multiverseid\': 519999}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, il Trionfatore\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nMetallurgia — Le creature che controlli prendono +3/+0 fintanto che controlli tre o più artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Finché impugnerò una lama, ci sarà speranza di vedere di nuovo un Mirrodin puro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d6f7d3-25b5-4547-9e54-dcd9cfd3fdb3\', \'multiverseId\': 520247}, \'multiverseid\': 520247}, {\'name\': \'覇者、ジョー・カディーン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n金属術 ― あなたがアーティファクト３つ以上をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私の手に剣がある限り、清純なるミラディンを取り戻す希望は残っている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac968019-0c96-436b-b014-98f2ab6c1805\', \'multiverseId\': 520495}, \'multiverseid\': 520495}, {\'name\': \'Jor Kadeen, o Prevalente\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nMaestria com metais — As criaturas que você controla receberão +3/+0 enquanto você controlar três ou mais artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto minha mão empunhar uma espada, haverá esperança de uma Mirrodin pura novamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113b5f1b-1c2c-4fc3-ae47-392b8cf80dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 520743}, \'multiverseid\': 520743}, {\'name\': \'Джор Каден, Одолеватель\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nРабота по металлу — Существа под вашим контролем получают +3/+0, пока вы контролируете не менее трех артефактов.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Пока рука моя сжимает клинок, есть надежда на вновь безупречный Мирродин».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d32c1a5-6cc5-46a5-b10b-93c305683e95\', \'multiverseId\': 520991}, \'multiverseid\': 520991}, {\'name\': \'百胜尤克定\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n金技～只要你操控三个或更多神器，由你操控的生物便得+3/+0。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「只要我手上握着剑，就有希望再见到纯净秘罗地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43c3f7f0-65a2-43a9-857a-90067cf903cd\', \'multiverseId\': 521239}, \'multiverseid\': 521239}, {\'name\': \'百勝尤克定\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n金技～只要你操控三個或更多神器，由你操控的生物便得+3/+0。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「只要我手上握著劍，就有希望再見到純淨秘羅地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d93712d9-9a6c-42e2-bd97-de196718734d\', \'multiverseId\': 521487}, \'multiverseid\': 521487}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampfkalligraph\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nTintlinge können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen deiner Gegner angreift, erzeugt der angreifende Spieler einen getappten 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, der jenen Gegner angreift.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518481&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b11b577-051b-4833-8f8d-908e7e9114a0\', \'multiverseId\': 518481}, \'multiverseid\': 518481}, {\'name\': \'Calígrafo de combate\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLos Tintícolas no pueden atacarte a ti o a los planeswalkers que controlas.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque a uno de tus oponentes, ese jugador atacante crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 girada con la habilidad de volar que está atacando a ese oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'272bfa67-7fff-4828-bf34-86230a57459f\', \'multiverseId\': 518552}, \'multiverseid\': 518552}, {\'name\': \'Calligraphe de combat\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes encrelins ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque un de vos adversaires, ce joueur attaquant crée un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol engagé qui attaque cet adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518623&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30459cd-4559-4819-9b29-307f9bc3bd62\', \'multiverseId\': 518623}, \'multiverseid\': 518623}, {\'name\': \'Calligrafo da Combattimento\', \'text\': "Volare\\nGli Scarabocchi non possono attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore attacca uno dei tuoi avversari, quel giocatore attaccante crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare TAPpata che attacca quell\'avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbdc4552-3d0d-48b5-b1f6-5af543c509de\', \'multiverseId\': 518694}, \'multiverseid\': 518694}, {\'name\': \'戦闘書家\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nすべての墨獣は、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\\nプレイヤー１人があなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、その攻撃プレイヤーは、飛行を持ち白であり黒である２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を、タップ状態かつその攻撃されたプレイヤーを攻撃している状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02340bee-b38e-44ab-ad2c-2331a507f4ed\', \'multiverseId\': 518765}, \'multiverseid\': 518765}, {\'name\': \'Calígrafo de Combate\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNanquíneos não podem atacar você nem planeswakers que você controla.\\nToda vez que um jogador ataca um de seus oponentes, aquele jogador atacante cria uma ficha de criatura Nanquíneo branca e preta 2/1 com voar virada e atacando aquele oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082daf7e-3d60-4ac1-bae9-32d2f3be9f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 518836}, \'multiverseid\': 518836}, {\'name\': \'Боевой Каллиграф\', \'text\': "Полет\\nЧернильники не могут атаковать вас или planeswalker\'ов под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок атакует одного из ваших оппонентов, тот атакующий игрок создает одну повернутую фишку существа 2/1 белый и черный Чернильник с Полетом, которая атакует того оппонента.", \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397564e4-e2cb-45d9-803a-9e84ee2955b5\', \'multiverseId\': 518907}, \'multiverseid\': 518907}, {\'name\': \'战斗弄墨师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n墨灵不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。\\n每当一位牌手攻击你的任一对手时，该攻击牌手派出一个横置的2/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的墨灵衍生生物，且正向该对手进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d5c10db-ba1f-4b18-bf2b-0b3d80dac094\', \'multiverseId\': 518978}, \'multiverseid\': 518978}, {\'name\': \'戰鬥弄墨師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n墨靈不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客。\\n每當一位玩家攻擊你的任一對手時，該攻擊玩家派出一個橫置的2/1，白黑雙色，具飛行異能的墨靈衍生生物，且正向該對手進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a8cb45-1899-4ed5-b189-f317889bd939\', \'multiverseId\': 519049}, \'multiverseid\': 519049}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampfkalligraph\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nTintlinge können weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen deiner Gegner angreift, erzeugt der angreifende Spieler einen getappten 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, der jenen Gegner angreift.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521690&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c885eab-4af9-460c-b323-13bf0658b2ed\', \'multiverseId\': 521690}, \'multiverseid\': 521690}, {\'name\': \'Calígrafo de combate\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLos Tintícolas no pueden atacarte a ti o a los planeswalkers que controlas.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque a uno de tus oponentes, ese jugador atacante crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 girada con la habilidad de volar que está atacando a ese oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0db0d85-0fb3-4727-8b2b-af67097df3ca\', \'multiverseId\': 521770}, \'multiverseid\': 521770}, {\'name\': \'Calligraphe de combat\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes encrelins ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque un de vos adversaires, ce joueur attaquant crée un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol engagé qui attaque cet adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aeb7704-9b2e-435a-898b-648eb7b774aa\', \'multiverseId\': 521850}, \'multiverseid\': 521850}, {\'name\': \'Calligrafo da Combattimento\', \'text\': "Volare\\nGli Scarabocchi non possono attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore attacca uno dei tuoi avversari, quel giocatore attaccante crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare TAPpata che attacca quell\'avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce480b0-c66f-4e1b-89ae-f63029210b47\', \'multiverseId\': 521930}, \'multiverseid\': 521930}, {\'name\': \'戦闘書家\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nすべての墨獣は、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\\nプレイヤー１人があなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、その攻撃プレイヤーは、飛行を持ち白であり黒である２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を、タップ状態かつその攻撃されたプレイヤーを攻撃している状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93332a04-4b25-40a1-bc3c-cce9904f516a\', \'multiverseId\': 522010}, \'multiverseid\': 522010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kapsel des Verbanners\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, opfere die Kapsel des Verbanners: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich finde ihre Symmetrie angenehm. Sie schafft anstößigen Unrat aus der Welt und beseitigt sich selbst gleich mit."\\n—Dolomarus, Aufsichtführender der Reinen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519372&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38cb973-2b0b-4273-853a-0f20194efccd\', \'multiverseId\': 519372}, \'multiverseid\': 519372}, {\'name\': \'Cápsula del disipador\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, sacrificar la Cápsula del disipador: Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Su simetría es placentera. Elimina desechos de nuestro mundo al mismo tiempo que se destruye".\\n—Dolomarus, supervisor de los Puros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9162dce3-740a-44dc-b2ab-f61ed1826a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 519620}, \'multiverseid\': 519620}, {\'name\': \'Capsule du dissipateur\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez la Capsule du dissipateur : Détruisez un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Je trouve sa symétrie agréable. Elle élimine les impuretés choquantes de notre monde tout en se débarrassant d\'elle-même. »\\n—Dolomarus, questeur de la Pureté", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'137c678b-a292-4e18-a132-3190efb53f45\', \'multiverseId\': 519868}, \'multiverseid\': 519868}, {\'name\': \'Capsula del Dissipatore\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica la Capsula del Dissipatore: Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Trovo che la sua simmetria sia piacevole. Elimina rifiuti ripugnanti dal nostro mondo mentre smaltisce se stesso."\\n—Dolomarus, Censore della Pulizia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbcc132-ac4f-4c5d-abf9-c99c5f9a9a2d\', \'multiverseId\': 520116}, \'multiverseid\': 520116}, {\'name\': \'祓い士の薬包\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, 祓い士の薬包を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「この対称性は好ましいな。自身を失い、同時にこの世界の有害な廃棄物を消し去るのだから。」\\n――清浄の代理人、ドロマールス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19350051-434b-4935-8c79-efc764f9bf0c\', \'multiverseId\': 520364}, \'multiverseid\': 520364}, {\'name\': \'Cápsula do Dispersor\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, sacrifique Cápsula do Dispersor: Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu acho sua simetria muito agradável. Ela retira do mundo a imundície ofensiva enquanto se dispersa."\\n— Dolomarus, Inspetor da Limpeza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ebb5f80-b069-4337-858a-134195647657\', \'multiverseId\': 520612}, \'multiverseid\': 520612}, {\'name\': \'Капсула Рассеивателя\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Капсулу Рассеивателя: уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Меня радует симметрия ее действия. Она освобождает наш мир от отвратительных нечистот и при этом самоуничтожается».\\n— Доломарус, Проктор Очищенных\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fddfbc9e-9ec1-4501-9158-275e7e2917c6\', \'multiverseId\': 520860}, \'multiverseid\': 520860}, {\'name\': \'驱散者坠盒\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}，牺牲驱散者坠盒：消灭目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这对称性相当有趣：它把带有攻击性又不该存于世上的东西与它本身一同处理掉。」\\n～理净师多洛马勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3d1e41-469a-4eb7-9e4b-94e09a5c4fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 521108}, \'multiverseid\': 521108}, {\'name\': \'驅散者墜盒\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}，{T}，犧牲驅散者墜盒：消滅目標神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「這對稱性相當有趣：它把帶有攻擊性又不該存於世上的東西與它本身一同處理掉。」\\n～理淨師多洛馬勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11537b17-75bf-4006-b235-e3ab2b7610c2\', \'multiverseId\': 521356}, \'multiverseid\': 521356}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karte des Archäomagiers\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Karte des Archäomagiers ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Ebene-Standardlandkarten, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\\nImmer wenn ein Land unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt und falls jener Spieler mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518479&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f1db6c-0bb8-40ea-9d55-c849a2d0338e\', \'multiverseId\': 518479}, \'multiverseid\': 518479}, {\'name\': \'Mapa de arqueomante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Mapa de arqueomante entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de Llanura básicas, muéstralas, ponlas en tu mano y luego baraja.\\nSiempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, si ese jugador controla más tierras que tú, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c383ca91-a439-44bd-aec0-d3001bb01ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 518550}, \'multiverseid\': 518550}, {\'name\': "Carte de l\'archéomancien", \'text\': "Quand la Carte de l\'archéomancien arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de plaine de base, révélez-les, mettez-les dans votre main, puis mélangez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, si ce joueur contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18f1646f-6c78-445c-b831-0ab51452e5ca\', \'multiverseId\': 518621}, \'multiverseid\': 518621}, {\'name\': "Mappa dell\'Archeomante", \'text\': "Quando la Mappa dell\'Archeomante entra nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte Pianura base, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\\nOgniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, se quel giocatore controlla più terre di te, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5260c0d1-bf46-403e-960e-172b1ff4c2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 518692}, \'multiverseid\': 518692}, {\'name\': \'古術師の地図\', \'text\': \'古術師の地図が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n土地１つが対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのプレイヤーがあなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたはあなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'651f2b77-e301-4dc1-a283-15c767ac0a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 518763}, \'multiverseid\': 518763}, {\'name\': \'Mapa do Arqueomante\', \'text\': \'Quando Mapa do Arqueomante entrar no campo de batalha procure em seu grimório até dois cards de Planície básica, revele-os e coloque-os em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.\\nToda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente, se aquele jogador controla mais terrenos que você, você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7b998e-ba63-470e-b9fa-fbf83dc2177e\', \'multiverseId\': 518834}, \'multiverseid\': 518834}, {\'name\': \'Карта Археоманта\', \'text\': \'Когда Карта Археоманта выходит на поле битвы, найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовой Равнины, покажите их, положите их в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\\nКаждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под контролем оппонента, если тот игрок контролирует больше земель, чем вы, то вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'270b0680-2329-44fe-ae7a-3d110f84652b\', \'multiverseId\': 518905}, \'multiverseid\': 518905}, {\'name\': \'古语术士地图\', \'text\': \'当古语术士地图进战场时，从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本的平原牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后洗牌。\\n每当一个地在对手的操控下进战场时，若该牌手操控的地比你多，则你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea392b00-1e2e-44a9-bfa2-6038c6f791ef\', \'multiverseId\': 518976}, \'multiverseid\': 518976}, {\'name\': \'古語術士地圖\', \'text\': \'當古語術士地圖進戰場時，從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本的平原牌，展示這些牌，將它們置於你手上，然後洗牌。\\n每當一個地在對手的操控下進戰場時，若該玩家操控的地比你多，則你可以將一張地牌從你手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e2e0c3-76fa-4620-a0ad-c9008ea71e3f\', \'multiverseId\': 519047}, \'multiverseid\': 519047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karte des Archäomagiers\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Karte des Archäomagiers ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Ebene-Standardlandkarten, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\\nImmer wenn ein Land unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt und falls jener Spieler mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521688&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ba5d56-2ee7-4a7e-b371-4af56dc33275\', \'multiverseId\': 521688}, \'multiverseid\': 521688}, {\'name\': \'Mapa de arqueomante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Mapa de arqueomante entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de Llanura básicas, muéstralas, ponlas en tu mano y luego baraja.\\nSiempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, si ese jugador controla más tierras que tú, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5797e4cd-2597-4892-a110-a18337dcf0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 521768}, \'multiverseid\': 521768}, {\'name\': "Carte de l\'archéomancien", \'text\': "Quand la Carte de l\'archéomancien arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de plaine de base, révélez-les, mettez-les dans votre main, puis mélangez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, si ce joueur contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deabe626-2464-45ff-b47f-15ee5f93ed79\', \'multiverseId\': 521848}, \'multiverseid\': 521848}, {\'name\': "Mappa dell\'Archeomante", \'text\': "Quando la Mappa dell\'Archeomante entra nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte Pianura base, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\\nOgniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, se quel giocatore controlla più terre di te, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bd3070e-c929-4804-877f-330ee97fb7c5\', \'multiverseId\': 521928}, \'multiverseid\': 521928}, {\'name\': \'古術師の地図\', \'text\': \'古術師の地図が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n土地１つが対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのプレイヤーがあなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたはあなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c88a871-03ff-415f-b8ea-459735c6f0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 522008}, \'multiverseid\': 522008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaseto, Orochi-Erzmagier\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden. Falls die Kreatur eine Ophis ist, erhält sie +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ophis, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Unser verehrter Vorfahre Seshiro segnete uns mit Gift und großen Zähnen und noch größerer Weisheit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6a4827e-20d0-46af-b328-ae24ef3efbf1\', \'multiverseId\': 519504}, \'multiverseid\': 519504}, {\'name\': \'Kasheto, archimago orochi\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno. Si esa criatura es una Víbora, obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero víbora\', \'flavor\': \'"Seshiro, nuestro venerable ancestro, nos regaló un conocimiento más poderoso que el veneno y los colmillos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca18b914-2c3d-4629-9423-10897be08891\', \'multiverseId\': 519752}, \'multiverseid\': 519752}, {\'name\': \'Kaseto, archimage orochi\', \'text\': "{G}{U} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci. Si cette créature est un serpent, elle gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : serpent et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Seshiro, notre vénérable ancêtre, nous a transmis des préceptes plus importants que le venin et les crocs. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520000&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb23d572-191d-4732-b776-affd9cb54d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 520000}, \'multiverseid\': 520000}, {\'name\': \'Kaseto, Arcimago Orochi\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno. Se quella creatura è un Serpente, prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'"Il nostro venerabile antenato Seshiro ci ha concesso una saggezza che supera il veleno e le zanne."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47850c83-9672-4775-818e-c672bc003524\', \'multiverseId\': 520248}, \'multiverseid\': 520248}, {\'name\': \'大蛇の大魔導師、かせ斗\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。そのクリーチャーが蛇であるなら、ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 蛇・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの崇拝するご先祖様であらせられるせし郎様は、毒や牙を超えた英知を我らに授けてくださいました。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68702ef-5a57-4280-8f6a-68391d682a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 520496}, \'multiverseid\': 520496}, {\'name\': \'Kaseto, Arquimago Orochi\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno. Se aquela criatura for uma Cobra, ela receberá +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Cobra Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Nosso venerável ancestral Seshiro nos deu uma sabedoria maior do que peçonha e presas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39f1b0a-c04d-408d-8413-5bce8945dcdc\', \'multiverseId\': 520744}, \'multiverseid\': 520744}, {\'name\': \'Касето, Архимаг Орочи\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу. Если то существо является Змеей, оно получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Змея Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Наш почтенный предок Сесиро дал нам мудрость большую, чем яд и клыки».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9355a411-b686-4399-a1a7-f711d45db1a2\', \'multiverseId\': 520992}, \'multiverseid\': 520992}, {\'name\': \'蛇人大法师加濑斗\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。如果该生物是蛇，则它得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～蛇／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们崇敬的先祖濑四郎留给我们的智慧比毒液和獠牙更强大。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'462f1b9d-6ad0-43a8-9f45-ecab7f4974d1\', \'multiverseId\': 521240}, \'multiverseid\': 521240}, {\'name\': \'蛇人大法師加瀨斗\', \'text\': \'{G}{U}：目標生物本回合不能被阻擋。如果該生物是蛇，則它得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～蛇／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我們崇敬的先祖瀨四郎留給我們的智慧比毒液和獠牙更強大。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb9fa40-0f28-472b-b5ed-4238b0e257d2\', \'multiverseId\': 521488}, \'multiverseid\': 521488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kettenreaktion\', \'text\': \'Die Kettenreaktion fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen im Spiel ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir bereiten uns auch auf das Unwahrscheinliche vor, falls mal der Blitz an einem Ort doppelt oder überall gleichzeitig einschlägt."\\n—Nundari, Hauptmann der Miliz von Seetor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519444&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d2384c-61ce-49de-9fed-a63015a49fef\', \'multiverseId\': 519444}, \'multiverseid\': 519444}, {\'name\': \'Reacción en cadena\', \'text\': \'La Reacción en cadena hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Entrenamos para lo improbable, como un relámpago cayendo dos veces en el mismo lugar, o cayendo en todos lados al mismo tiempo".\\n—Nundari, capitán de la milicia de Portal Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cacc96b-f15e-4068-a907-a384b5684e47\', \'multiverseId\': 519692}, \'multiverseid\': 519692}, {\'name\': \'Réaction en chaîne\', \'text\': \'La Réaction en chaîne inflige X blessures à chaque créature, X étant le nombre de créatures sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous nous entraînons à confronter l\'improbable, comme la foudre frappant deux fois au même endroit, ou partout à la fois. »\\n—Nundari, capitaine de la milice de Porte des Mers", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c9ec2a-6af9-4930-9466-2fafb46626d6\', \'multiverseId\': 519940}, \'multiverseid\': 519940}, {\'name\': \'Reazione a Catena\', \'text\': \'La Reazione a Catena infligge X danni a ogni creatura, dove X è il numero di creature sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci addestriamo per affrontare l\\\'improbabile, come un fulmine che colpisca lo stesso luogo due volte od ogni luogo contemporaneamente."\\n—Nundari, capitano di milizia di Portale Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7cdeb82-c49c-4d96-8070-be6e86a9bad2\', \'multiverseId\': 520188}, \'multiverseid\': 520188}, {\'name\': \'連鎖反応\', \'text\': \'連鎖反応は各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは戦場にあるクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はありえなさそうなことに対して訓練をしています。雷が同じ場所に二度落ちるとか、そこらじゅうに同時に落ちるとか。」\\n――海門の民兵隊長、ナンダーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4cd253-db87-49ad-a306-8084ff72584a\', \'multiverseId\': 520436}, \'multiverseid\': 520436}, {\'name\': \'Reação em Cadeia\', \'text\': \'Reação em Cadeia causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura, sendo X o número de criaturas no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós treinamos para o improvável, como um raio atingir o mesmo lugar duas vezes ou atingir todos os lugares de uma vez só."\\n— Nundari, capitão da milícia de Portão Marinho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0a2379d-1c92-48b7-a817-3f682966a3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 520684}, \'multiverseid\': 520684}, {\'name\': \'Цепная Реакция\', \'text\': \'Цепная Реакция наносит X повреждений каждому существу, где X — количество существ на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы готовимся к маловероятному: например, если молния вдруг ударит дважды в одно и то же место, или же, наоборот, сразу везде».\\n— Нундари, капитан мореградского ополчения\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916b6b4e-ab37-462f-bcfd-06071112bf5d\', \'multiverseId\': 520932}, \'multiverseid\': 520932}, {\'name\': \'连锁反应\', \'text\': \'连锁反应对每个生物各造成X点伤害，X为战场上的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的训练是要应付不可能的事，例如闪电两次都落在同一个地方，或是一次落在所有地方。」\\n～海户义勇军队长努达力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8934d388-a5de-403a-9d09-b11c16d5b65b\', \'multiverseId\': 521180}, \'multiverseid\': 521180}, {\'name\': \'連鎖反應\', \'text\': \'連鎖反應對每個生物各造成X點傷害，X為戰場上的生物數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的訓練是要應付不可能的事，例如閃電兩次都落在同一個地方，或是一次落在所有地方。」\\n～海戶義勇軍隊長努達力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48d52ceb-e46f-406d-af58-0f915221375f\', \'multiverseId\': 521428}, \'multiverseid\': 521428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knisternder Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Stärke des Knisternden Sceadas ist gleich der Gesamtanzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil oder in deinem Friedhof befinden.\\nWenn der Knisternde Sceada ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'199e37ff-7f84-4df5-9581-b2638cabb44f\', \'multiverseId\': 519496}, \'multiverseid\': 519496}, {\'name\': \'Draco chisporroteante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa fuerza del Draco chisporroteante es igual a la cantidad total de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio y en el exilio de las cuales eres propietario.\\nCuando el Draco chisporroteante entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba93f8fa-0e56-4498-b734-79d7da5bee5f\', \'multiverseId\': 519744}, \'multiverseid\': 519744}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn crépitant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force du Drakôn crépitant est égale au nombre total de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous possédez en exil et dans votre cimetière.\\nQuand le Drakôn crépitant arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519992&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b37c9240-fcda-4a28-8443-1662f1aba3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 519992}, \'multiverseid\': 519992}, {\'name\': \'Draghetto Crepitante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa forza del Draghetto Crepitante è pari al numero totale di carte istantaneo e stregoneria che possiedi in esilio e nel tuo cimitero.\\nQuando il Draghetto Crepitante entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c8ee9c7-6465-48cd-b3fc-4ed5cf5f056b\', \'multiverseId\': 520240}, \'multiverseid\': 520240}, {\'name\': \'弾けるドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n弾けるドレイクのパワーは、追放領域やあなたの墓地にあり、あなたがオーナーであり、インスタントやソーサリーであるカードの数に等しい。\\n弾けるドレイクが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f85cbb68-3a2b-4e1c-8981-3a4e3d3181f0\', \'multiverseId\': 520488}, \'multiverseid\': 520488}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete Fagulhante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nO poder de Dragonete Fagulhante é igual ao número de cards de mágica instantânea e de feitiço que você possui no exílio e em seu cemitério.\\nQuando Dragonete Fagulhante entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0436b33-682a-419a-9b36-116347550920\', \'multiverseId\': 520736}, \'multiverseid\': 520736}, {\'name\': \'Трескучий Дрейк\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nСила Трескучего Дрейка равна суммарному количеству принадлежащих вам карт мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства в изгнании и на вашем кладбище.\\nКогда Трескучий Дрейк выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87114f76-5e03-4a89-b14c-d990d78de9ff\', \'multiverseId\': 520984}, \'multiverseid\': 520984}, {\'name\': \'爆响龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n爆响龙兽的力量等同于放逐区中由你拥有之瞬间与法术牌数量和你坟墓场中这两类牌数量的加总。\\n当爆响龙兽进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db9de5f-fe25-4593-86be-816d3616cf39\', \'multiverseId\': 521232}, \'multiverseid\': 521232}, {\'name\': \'爆響龍獸\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n爆響龍獸的力量等同於放逐區中由你擁有之瞬間與巫術牌數量和你墳墓場中這兩類牌數量的加總。\\n當爆響龍獸進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3c1591c-d43e-4c94-a397-0ddb39c3a06d\', \'multiverseId\': 521480}, \'multiverseid\': 521480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Schicke alle Karten aus allen Friedhöfen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Erst wenn nur noch Knochen übrig sind, endet der Fluch des Umherirrens und der ewige Schlaf beginnt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519597&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae450164-00df-4a86-a9de-ec384e601e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 519597}, \'multiverseid\': 519597}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos de los carroñeros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: Exilia todas las cartas de todos los cementerios.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando ya no exista ni un rastro de carne, la maldición de los errantes terminará. Entonces, los muertos podrán descansar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a3f707-1963-4a08-8aec-4ac81ccea018\', \'multiverseId\': 519845}, \'multiverseid\': 519845}, {\'name\': \'Terrains des charognards\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Exilez toutes les cartes de tous les cimetières.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': "Quand le dernier lambeau de chair se détache, la Malédiction d\'errance est rompue. Le mort peut enfin reposer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82538ca0-c0bb-4c76-9b25-c394e8e2df73\', \'multiverseId\': 520093}, \'multiverseid\': 520093}, {\'name\': \'Territorio degli Sciacalli\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica un Deserto: Esilia tutte le carte da tutti i cimiteri.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': "La Maledizione della Peregrinazione cessa quando viene strappato l\'ultimo brandello di carne. Solo allora i morti possono riposare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53fcf569-33c8-4467-bf3d-617c1b093260\', \'multiverseId\': 520341}, \'multiverseid\': 520341}, {\'name\': \'屍肉あさりの地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：すべての墓地からすべてのカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'肉の最後の一片がなくなると放浪の呪いが解け、死者は安眠を許される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812a9244-9fd8-4109-9c0e-8d467344ff9c\', \'multiverseId\': 520589}, \'multiverseid\': 520589}, {\'name\': \'Território dos Necrófagos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique um Deserto: Exile todos os cards de todos os cemitérios.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o último vestígio de carne é removido, a Maldição da Errância termina. Então os mortos podem ter seu sono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef442282-7571-4d8e-a63e-5d3b2842ec71\', \'multiverseId\': 520837}, \'multiverseid\': 520837}, {\'name\': \'Земли Падальщиков\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пустыню: изгоните все карты из всех кладбищ.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': \'Когда исчезает последний иссохший клочок плоти, Проклятие Скитальцев перестает действовать. Лишь тогда мертвый может уснуть вечным сном.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d14a7e4a-15ed-4ea9-bb6e-97c581b30ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 521085}, \'multiverseid\': 521085}, {\'name\': \'荒骨咒土\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：放逐所有坟墓场中的所有牌。\', \'type\': \'地 ～沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'随着最后一丝血肉消蚀殆尽，漂浪诅咒终于止歇。亡者遂可安息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0652876-716f-46fc-b3f8-bdecc31a8345\', \'multiverseId\': 521333}, \'multiverseid\': 521333}, {\'name\': \'荒骨咒土\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，犧牲一個沙漠：放逐所有墳墓場中的所有牌。\', \'type\': \'地 ～沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'隨著最後一絲血肉消蝕殆盡，漂浪詛咒終於止歇。亡者遂可安息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5654cb-f465-4d33-bc80-f85f01d540d2\', \'multiverseId\': 521581}, \'multiverseid\': 521581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegerischer Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erhält jede andere Kreatur, die einen deiner Gegner angreift, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca0624c-7aaf-4aca-a1cb-84ce60870dca\', \'multiverseId\': 519379}, \'multiverseid\': 519379}, {\'name\': \'Ímpetu marcial\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, cada otra criatura que esté atacando a uno de tus oponentes obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a0d9640-0d95-49f2-8435-f2150bc94b70\', \'multiverseId\': 519627}, \'multiverseid\': 519627}, {\'name\': \'Impetus martial\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, chaque autre créature qui attaque un de vos adversaires gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25bfb0fb-a05d-4a97-9e28-e30f0e509a03\', \'multiverseId\': 519875}, \'multiverseid\': 519875}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Marziale\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, ogni altra creatura che sta attaccando uno dei tuoi avversari prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a14c20b-58f0-4971-8bd5-c0715a0f62f8\', \'multiverseId\': 520123}, \'multiverseid\': 520123}, {\'name\': \'軍部の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これ以外で対戦相手を攻撃しているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64a840d-abda-45fa-8fe8-da05af80e033\', \'multiverseId\': 520371}, \'multiverseid\': 520371}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Marcial\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, cada outra criatura que está atacando um de seus oponentes recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221dbd10-2e1b-4ba6-9f8a-bf6e3d1988fd\', \'multiverseId\': 520619}, \'multiverseid\': 520619}, {\'name\': \'Боевое Побуждение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, все другие существа, атакующие любого из ваших оппонентов, получают по +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baa38065-b47a-4e7b-a768-be35208a49b3\', \'multiverseId\': 520867}, \'multiverseid\': 520867}, {\'name\': \'尚武促动\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且已煽惑。（它每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，每个正向你的任一对手进行攻击之其他生物各得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ce476b-76b1-4ce4-bdb6-f7cc0d93ce6a\', \'multiverseId\': 521115}, \'multiverseid\': 521115}, {\'name\': \'尚武促動\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且已煽惑。（它每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n每當所結附的生物攻擊時，每個正向你的任一對手進行攻擊之其他生物各得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2744963-0ca8-425d-9e66-acab506cc4f3\', \'multiverseId\': 521363}, \'multiverseid\': 521363}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Eingriff\', \'text\': \'Sekundenbruchteil (Solange dieser Zauberspruch sich auf dem Stapel befindet, können Spieler keine Zaubersprüche wirken oder Fähigkeiten aktivieren, die keine Manafähigkeiten sind.)\\nZerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt diese Spruchrollen beiseite, es sind unnatürliche Waffen. Herz, Köpfchen und zwei Fäuste reichen aus."\\n—Zyd, Kamahldruide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519481&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e81286-64ef-4e3e-832e-67834f25e83e\', \'multiverseId\': 519481}, \'multiverseid\': 519481}, {\'name\': \'Abrazo krosano\', \'text\': \'Fracción de segundo. (Mientras este hechizo esté en la pila, los jugadores no pueden lanzar hechizos o activar habilidades que no sean habilidades de maná.)\\nDestruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Abandona esas armas sobrenaturales, esos pergaminos. El corazón, la mente y el puño son suficientes".\\n—Zyd, druida kamahlita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb5e2096-ca4c-47a9-84f8-02870e222eab\', \'multiverseId\': 519729}, \'multiverseid\': 519729}, {\'name\': \'Poigne krosiane\', \'text\': \'Fraction de seconde (Tant que ce sort est sur la pile, les joueurs ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts ou activer de capacités qui ne sont pas des capacités de mana.)\\nDétruisez un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Abandonnez ces armes surnaturelles, ces parchemins. Un cœur, un esprit et des poings suffisent. »\\n—Zyd, druide kamahlite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519977&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e4039e-9b30-47ad-ad59-b7de24ef23d8\', \'multiverseId\': 519977}, \'multiverseid\': 519977}, {\'name\': \'Stretta di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Battibaleno (Fintanto che questa magia è in pila, i giocatori non possono lanciare magie o attivare abilità che non siano abilità di mana.)\\nDistruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Rinuncia a queste armi innaturali, queste pergamene. Il cuore, la mente e i pugni sono sufficienti."\\n—Zyd, druido di Kamahl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16ce0414-6f9e-4339-b4b2-fe04167e9b05\', \'multiverseId\': 520225}, \'multiverseid\': 520225}, {\'name\': \'クローサの掌握\', \'text\': \'刹那（この呪文がスタック上にあるかぎり、プレイヤーは呪文を唱えられず、マナ能力でない起動型能力を起動できない。）\\nアーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自然に反する武器や巻物など手放しなさい。心臓と心と拳で十分ではありませんか。」\\n――カマール教のドルイド、ジド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'450238da-d8a9-4e8c-8b72-8e8c7c7071ec\', \'multiverseId\': 520473}, \'multiverseid\': 520473}, {\'name\': \'Garra Krosana\', \'text\': \'Fração de segundo (Enquanto esta mágica estiver na pilha, os jogadores não poderão conjurar mágicas ou ativar habilidades que não sejam habilidades de mana.)\\nDestrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Desista dessas armas artificiais, desses pergaminhos. O coração, a mente e o punho bastam."\\n— Zyd, druida kamahliano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93cfdd01-0b7d-4fe7-ae1e-a410fb298848\', \'multiverseId\': 520721}, \'multiverseid\': 520721}, {\'name\': \'Кросанская Хватка\', \'text\': \'Мгновение ока (Пока это заклинание находится в стеке, игроки не могут разыгрывать заклинания или активировать способности, которые не являются мана-способностями.)\\nУничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Откажитесь от этого неестественного оружия, от этих свитков. Вам хватит сердца, разума и кулаков».\\n— Зид, друид Камаля\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d210d6b-981e-416d-ba84-6441b118edc3\', \'multiverseId\': 520969}, \'multiverseid\': 520969}, {\'name\': \'克洛萨之攫\', \'text\': \'转瞬（只要此咒语在堆叠上，牌手便不能施放咒语或起动不是法术力异能的异能。）\\n消灭目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「放弃那些违逆自然的武器与卷轴吧。心，意，拳，这便够了。」\\n～卡马尔宗德鲁伊季德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f40008-f1c1-4f75-b4fa-2de9b2553dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 521217}, \'multiverseid\': 521217}, {\'name\': \'克洛薩之攫\', \'text\': \'轉瞬（只要此咒語在堆疊上，玩家便不能施放咒語或起動不是魔法力異能的異能。）\\n消滅目標神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「放棄那些違逆自然的武器與卷軸吧。心，意，拳，這便夠了。」\\n～卡馬爾宗德魯伊季德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50042e87-03de-486f-81e2-06581f4997cb\', \'multiverseId\': 521465}, \'multiverseid\': 521465}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm die andere auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519470&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4234cf51-1036-4683-9d0a-b09d39c6b393\', \'multiverseId\': 519470}, \'multiverseid\': 519470}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16963d8d-39eb-4258-bcf2-e3b47d43a96b\', \'multiverseId\': 519718}, \'multiverseid\': 519718}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et l\'autre dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519966&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68de8e3e-e9f5-44a6-8267-2fb3bb284a14\', \'multiverseId\': 519966}, \'multiverseid\': 519966}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'840c0faa-a5dc-4671-8c91-0303fd83a2a3\', \'multiverseId\': 520214}, \'multiverseid\': 520214}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1cec3d7-12cc-475b-a7d4-7905bb4027e7\', \'multiverseId\': 520462}, \'multiverseid\': 520462}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as sementes possuem um elo em comum que as une através da eternidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87a398e1-75a2-4003-995d-9ac547b800d5\', \'multiverseId\': 520710}, \'multiverseid\': 520710}, {\'name\': \'Культивировать\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, покажите те карты, положите одну из них на поле битвы повернутой, а другую — в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Все семена связаны прочными узами, взывая друг к другу через бесконечность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'640f4cc4-23d9-41f3-84c6-410690e1470a\', \'multiverseId\': 520958}, \'multiverseid\': 520958}, {\'name\': \'栽培\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将一张横置放进战场，另一张则置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'所有种子都互相连结成一体，永远地彼此呼唤着。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0278f6a-8b43-4d56-99d6-2d06b0e997d2\', \'multiverseId\': 521206}, \'multiverseid\': 521206}, {\'name\': \'栽培\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，展示這些牌，將一張橫置放進戰場，另一張則置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'所有種子都互相連結成一體，永遠地彼此呼喚著。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae63d82d-e3dc-42de-975a-f9d4019f0cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 521454}, \'multiverseid\': 521454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kühne Duellantin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments deckt du und ein Gegner deiner Wahl jeweils die oberste Karte der eigenen Bibliothek auf. Jeder von euch verliert Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags der Karte, die vom jeweils anderen Spieler aufgedeckt wurde. Jeder von euch nimmt die Karte, die er aufgedeckt hat, auf seine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09b01036-ea97-4c00-bf0b-ff03384e2a30\', \'multiverseId\': 518509}, \'multiverseid\': 518509}, {\'name\': \'Duelista aplicada\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, tú y el oponente objetivo muestran cada uno la primera carta de su biblioteca. Cada uno pierde una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de la carta que muestra el otro jugador. Cada uno pone la carta que mostró en su mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df4434e3-de7e-4abc-a8e3-ca4cc44d0875\', \'multiverseId\': 518580}, \'multiverseid\': 518580}, {\'name\': \'Duelliste passionnée\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, un adversaire ciblé et vous révélez chacun la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous perdez chacun un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de la carte révélée par l\'autre joueur. Vous mettez chacun la carte que vous avez révélée dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518651&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63b9f4d7-1994-4249-91b6-51fe70245468\', \'multiverseId\': 518651}, \'multiverseid\': 518651}, {\'name\': \'Duellante Acuta\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, tu e un avversario bersaglio rivelate la prima carta dei vostri grimori. Ognuno di voi perde punti vita pari al valore di mana della carta rivelata dall\'altro. Ognuno di voi aggiunge alla propria mano la carta che ha rivelato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70f3d31-148f-47c1-a041-f68a840e4013\', \'multiverseId\': 518722}, \'multiverseid\': 518722}, {\'name\': \'鋭敏な決闘者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれ、他方が公開したカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失い、自分が公開したカードを自分の手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db751463-69b9-469b-a85d-a1820960086a\', \'multiverseId\': 518793}, \'multiverseid\': 518793}, {\'name\': \'Duelista Ávida\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você e o oponente alvo revelam cada um o card do topo de seu próprio grimório. Cada um de vocês perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana do card revelado pelo outro jogador. Cada um de vocês coloca o card que revelou em sua própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c830ded-87f8-45bc-8477-35406f318989\', \'multiverseId\': 518864}, \'multiverseid\': 518864}, {\'name\': \'Ловкая Дуэлянтка\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки вы и целевой оппонент показываете верхнюю карту своей библиотеки. Каждый из вас теряет жизни в количестве, равном мановой ценности карты, показанной другим игроком. Каждый из вас кладет свою показанную карту себе в руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1fb257-80da-4a5d-b3a4-f41b6fd28725\', \'multiverseId\': 518935}, \'multiverseid\': 518935}, {\'name\': \'敏锐斗客\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你和目标对手各展示自己的牌库顶牌。你们各失去等同于对方所展示之牌法术力值的生命。你们各将所展示的牌置于自己手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37fed14e-60eb-4835-8c77-e1291bdc8b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 519006}, \'multiverseid\': 519006}, {\'name\': \'敏銳鬥客\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，你和目標對手各展示自己的牌庫頂牌。你們各失去等同於對方所展示之牌魔法力值的生命。你們各將所展示的牌置於自己手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5cdc09-2e43-4610-a043-eb5f0d12d2f7\', \'multiverseId\': 519077}, \'multiverseid\': 519077}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kühne Duellantin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments deckt du und ein Gegner deiner Wahl jeweils die oberste Karte der eigenen Bibliothek auf. Jeder von euch verliert Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags der Karte, die vom jeweils anderen Spieler aufgedeckt wurde. Jeder von euch nimmt die Karte, die er aufgedeckt hat, auf seine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8594df7d-bd1e-49d8-b618-a6dafbb1023c\', \'multiverseId\': 521718}, \'multiverseid\': 521718}, {\'name\': \'Duelista aplicada\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, tú y el oponente objetivo muestran cada uno la primera carta de su biblioteca. Cada uno pierde una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de la carta que muestra el otro jugador. Cada uno pone la carta que mostró en su mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf06c9dd-f668-4190-9256-15008d22a509\', \'multiverseId\': 521798}, \'multiverseid\': 521798}, {\'name\': \'Duelliste passionnée\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, un adversaire ciblé et vous révélez chacun la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous perdez chacun un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de la carte révélée par l\'autre joueur. Vous mettez chacun la carte que vous avez révélée dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f1afbee-4a39-4c80-9ab3-1c0f7a1d6321\', \'multiverseId\': 521878}, \'multiverseid\': 521878}, {\'name\': \'Duellante Acuta\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, tu e un avversario bersaglio rivelate la prima carta dei vostri grimori. Ognuno di voi perde punti vita pari al valore di mana della carta rivelata dall\'altro. Ognuno di voi aggiunge alla propria mano la carta che ha rivelato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce13723b-4108-4e8b-8652-4b58cb96bacc\', \'multiverseId\': 521958}, \'multiverseid\': 521958}, {\'name\': \'鋭敏な決闘者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれ、他方が公開したカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失い、自分が公開したカードを自分の手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c04664e-9055-4478-ba62-fc7c32b1fcf0\', \'multiverseId\': 522038}, \'multiverseid\': 522038}]', "[{'name': 'Laelia, neu geschmiedete Klinge', 'text': 'Eile\\nImmer wenn Laelia, neu geschmiedete Klinge, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere Karten aus deiner Bibliothek und/oder aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Laelia.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518520&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ca7c8f6-5e95-4ed7-8163-fab0caed10a4', 'multiverseId': 518520}, 'multiverseid': 518520}, {'name': 'Laelia, la Hoja Reforjada', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nSiempre que Laelia, la Hoja Reforjada ataque, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\\nSiempre que exilies una o más cartas de tu biblioteca y/o cementerio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Laelia.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero espíritu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518591&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d02b64b-d77a-46e5-97b0-590ceb38734f', 'multiverseId': 518591}, 'multiverseid': 518591}, {'name': 'Laelia, la lame reforgée', 'text': 'Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Laelia, la lame reforgée attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous exilez au moins une carte de votre bibliothèque et/ou de votre cimetière, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Laelia.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : esprit et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518662&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b469e22-c6dd-4f73-a49b-f173637ff9da', 'multiverseId': 518662}, 'multiverseid': 518662}, {'name': 'Laelia, la Lama Riforgiata', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Laelia, la Lama Riforgiata attacca, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta esili una o più carte dal tuo grimorio e/o dal tuo cimitero, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Laelia.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Spirito', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518733&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d087f05-f2da-42c2-95c6-7fc38aaafb85', 'multiverseId': 518733}, 'multiverseid': 518733}, {'name': '再鍛の刃、ラエリア', 'text': '速攻\\n再鍛の刃、ラエリアが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたがあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地からカード１枚以上を追放するたび、再鍛の刃、ラエリアの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518804&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9f0cf4a-f9df-443d-8cf1-8a03b02c4a7b', 'multiverseId': 518804}, 'multiverseid': 518804}, {'name': 'Laelia, a Lâmina Reforjada', 'text': 'Ímpeto\\nToda vez que Laelia, a Lâmina Reforjada, atacar, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card neste turno.\\nToda vez que você exilar um ou mais cards de seu grimório e/ou cemitério, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Laelia.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Espírito Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518875&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f10b4d9-6a5f-4d92-b505-b2490bdb9967', 'multiverseId': 518875}, 'multiverseid': 518875}, {'name': 'Лаэлия, Перекованный Клинок', 'text': 'Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Лаэлия, Перекованный Клинок атакует, изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы изгоняете одну или несколько карт из вашей библиотеки и/или из вашего кладбища, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Лаэлию.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Дух Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518946&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b37140a-0b35-4475-9132-7149f3411c5a', 'multiverseId': 518946}, 'multiverseid': 518946}, {'name': '重铸利锋拉耶梨', 'text': '敏捷\\n每当重铸利锋拉耶梨攻击时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\\n每当你从你的牌库和／或你的坟墓场放逐一张或数张牌时，在拉耶梨上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～精怪／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519017&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc4fbc23-2671-4472-a347-accf4e7131aa', 'multiverseId': 519017}, 'multiverseid': 519017}, {'name': '重鑄利鋒拉耶梨', 'text': '敏捷\\n每當重鑄利鋒拉耶梨攻擊時，放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\\n每當你從你的牌庫和／或你的墳墓場放逐一張或數張牌時，在拉耶梨上放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '傳奇生物 ～精靈／戰士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519088&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e4c1aec-22c9-49e6-860d-19dadb9a6a2f', 'multiverseId': 519088}, 'multiverseid': 519088}]", "[{'name': 'Laelia, neu geschmiedete Klinge', 'text': 'Eile\\nImmer wenn Laelia, neu geschmiedete Klinge, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\\nImmer wenn du eine oder mehrere Karten aus deiner Bibliothek und/oder aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Laelia.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521729&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5be6c89c-8517-4b19-8259-9a10d2d6910d', 'multiverseId': 521729}, 'multiverseid': 521729}, {'name': 'Laelia, la Hoja Reforjada', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nSiempre que Laelia, la Hoja Reforjada ataque, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\\nSiempre que exilies una o más cartas de tu biblioteca y/o cementerio, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Laelia.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero espíritu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521809&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '724a35c7-8e2c-441d-8aa3-ade96f02abbe', 'multiverseId': 521809}, 'multiverseid': 521809}, {'name': 'Laelia, la lame reforgée', 'text': 'Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Laelia, la lame reforgée attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous exilez au moins une carte de votre bibliothèque et/ou de votre cimetière, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Laelia.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : esprit et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521889&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '913a9222-3c0f-45e8-8d21-e75c658f6d05', 'multiverseId': 521889}, 'multiverseid': 521889}, {'name': 'Laelia, la Lama Riforgiata', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Laelia, la Lama Riforgiata attacca, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta esili una o più carte dal tuo grimorio e/o dal tuo cimitero, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Laelia.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Spirito', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521969&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3d26aef-2a78-4cae-9927-87c9a4314a02', 'multiverseId': 521969}, 'multiverseid': 521969}, {'name': '再鍛の刃、ラエリア', 'text': '速攻\\n再鍛の刃、ラエリアが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたがあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地からカード１枚以上を追放するたび、再鍛の刃、ラエリアの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522049&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94fffd39-cdf5-42ef-aa56-97ac6bbd44b2', 'multiverseId': 522049}, 'multiverseid': 522049}]", '[{\'name\': \'Laichender Krake\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Krake, ein Leviathan, ein Oktopus oder eine Schlange, den bzw. die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 9/9 blauen Krake-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hätte nie gedacht, mal eine Kreatur zu Gesicht zu bekommen, die Gyruda klein und harmlos aussehen lässt!"\\n—Lukka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7b6cf75-725d-45b8-a171-85a7764dbba4\', \'multiverseId\': 518500}, \'multiverseid\': 518500}, {\'name\': \'Kraken engendrador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Kraken, Leviatán, Pulpo o Serpiente que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Kraken azul 9/9.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Jamás imaginé que vería a una criatura que hiciese parecer pequeña e inofensiva a Gyruda!".\\n—Lukka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5352ad7d-054e-49c5-83ef-6ade80f6d06c\', \'multiverseId\': 518571}, \'multiverseid\': 518571}, {\'name\': \'Kraken frayant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un kraken, un léviathan, une pieuvre ou un grand serpent que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 9/9 bleue Kraken.", \'type\': \'Créature : kraken\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'aurais jamais imaginé poser les yeux sur une créature qui ferait paraître Gyruda petit et inoffensif ! »\\n—Lukka", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518642&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b740c3-d905-43b1-8932-38910367bef7\', \'multiverseId\': 518642}, \'multiverseid\': 518642}, {\'name\': \'Kraken Procreante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Kraken, Leviatano, Piovra o Serpe che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina creatura Kraken 9/9 blu.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': \'"Non avrei mai immaginato di vedere con i miei occhi una creatura simile... Gyruda al confronto sembra piccolo e innocuo!"\\n—Lukka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2b12d6-c3c8-4883-aaa1-63073614ceeb\', \'multiverseId\': 518713}, \'multiverseid\': 518713}, {\'name\': \'産卵するクラーケン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている、海蛇１体かクラーケン１体かタコ１体かリバイアサン１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、青の９/９のクラーケン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': \'「こんなものを目にすることがあるとは想像もしていなかった。ジャイルーダが小さく無害に思えるような生き物とは！」\\n――ルーカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9001d6a8-016d-4be6-a36c-accbe901aa5c\', \'multiverseId\': 518784}, \'multiverseid\': 518784}, {\'name\': \'Kraken Procriante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um Kraken, Leviatã, Polvo ou Serpente que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de criatura Kraken azul 9/9.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamais imaginei que veria uma criatura que faz Gyruda parecer pequeno e inofensivo!"\\n— Lukka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b213abe2-8c9c-4c1b-9ee6-3519af0d96a5\', \'multiverseId\': 518855}, \'multiverseid\': 518855}, {\'name\': \'Кракен-Породитель\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Кракен, Левиафан, Спрут или Змей под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте одну фишку существа 9/9 синий Кракен.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кракен\', \'flavor\': \'«Никогда бы не подумал, что увижу существо, по сравнению с которым Джайруда кажется маленькой и безобидной!»\\n— Лукка\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6909a2dc-4272-4042-9309-a6f044531347\', \'multiverseId\': 518926}, \'multiverseid\': 518926}, {\'name\': \'孳息巨海兽\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的巨海兽，海怪，章鱼或巨蛇对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个9/9蓝色巨海兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': \'「真没想过，我还能亲眼见到这么大的生物。翟鲁达比起来根本是个小可爱！」\\n～卢卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0179e68f-7ce2-4b6d-84da-f9c6046d4e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 518997}, \'multiverseid\': 518997}, {\'name\': \'孳息巨海獸\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的巨海獸，海怪，章魚或巨蛇對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出一個9/9藍色巨海獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨海獸\', \'flavor\': \'「真沒想過，我還能親眼見到這麼大的生物。翟魯達比起來根本是個小可愛！」\\n～盧卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea1a06c-67cb-4abc-80be-50869bea9954\', \'multiverseId\': 519068}, \'multiverseid\': 519068}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laichender Krake\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Krake, ein Leviathan, ein Oktopus oder eine Schlange, den bzw. die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 9/9 blauen Krake-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e342b884-d900-4179-9385-9a3fa5a0d116\', \'multiverseId\': 521709}, \'multiverseid\': 521709}, {\'name\': \'Kraken engendrador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Kraken, Leviatán, Pulpo o Serpiente que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Kraken azul 9/9.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32e9d02-9720-47c3-ba0f-d076815fecf6\', \'multiverseId\': 521789}, \'multiverseid\': 521789}, {\'name\': \'Kraken frayant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un kraken, un léviathan, une pieuvre ou un grand serpent que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 9/9 bleue Kraken.", \'type\': \'Créature : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bce008-46e5-4299-87fb-442702297a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 521869}, \'multiverseid\': 521869}, {\'name\': \'Kraken Procreante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Kraken, Leviatano, Piovra o Serpe che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina creatura Kraken 9/9 blu.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbc9ce5-e903-474b-a797-e56da0031ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 521949}, \'multiverseid\': 521949}, {\'name\': \'産卵するクラーケン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている、海蛇１体かクラーケン１体かタコ１体かリバイアサン１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、青の９/９のクラーケン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d2bd1d-caf7-406c-8b78-c634885cb2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 522029}, \'multiverseid\': 522029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lauernde Leonidin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Lauernde Leonidin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme geheim einen Gegner.\\nOffenbare den bestimmten Spieler: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dich angreift, ins Exil, falls sie vom bestimmten Spieler kontrolliert wird. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519388&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07075c5e-146d-475c-854e-a0371f96bacf\', \'multiverseId\': 519388}, \'multiverseid\': 519388}, {\'name\': \'Leonina al acecho\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Leonina al acecho entre al campo de batalla, elige un oponente en secreto.\\nMostrar el jugador que elegiste: Exilia la criatura objetivo que te está atacando si está bajo el control del jugador elegido. Activa esto solo una vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24aebf06-80c1-4520-a21a-e2429066aab5\', \'multiverseId\': 519636}, \'multiverseid\': 519636}, {\'name\': \'Léonine en chasse\', \'text\': "Quand la Léonine en chasse arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez secrètement un adversaire.\\nRévélez le joueur choisi : Exilez une créature ciblée qui vous attaque si elle est contrôlée par le joueur choisi. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et archer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb0ae1f3-34b7-4264-a0c0-88d82e954d7c\', \'multiverseId\': 519884}, \'multiverseid\': 519884}, {\'name\': \'Leonid in Agguato\', \'text\': \'Quando la Leonid in Agguato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli segretamente un avversario.\\nRivela quale giocatore hai scelto: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che ti sta attaccando se è controllata dal giocatore scelto. Attiva solo una volta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a37fff6e-0f01-4f27-96bc-ebbf2a50895c\', \'multiverseId\': 520132}, \'multiverseid\': 520132}, {\'name\': \'忍び寄るレオニン\', \'text\': \'忍び寄るレオニンが戦場に出たとき、秘密裏に対戦相手１人を選ぶ。\\nそのあなたが選んだプレイヤーを公開する：あなたを攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その選ばれたプレイヤーがそれをコントロールしているなら、それを追放する。起動できるのは１回だけである。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・射手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec9c626-3072-4c9e-a04c-24c916538842\', \'multiverseId\': 520380}, \'multiverseid\': 520380}, {\'name\': \'Leonina à Espreita\', \'text\': \'Quando Leonina à Espreita entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um oponente secretamente.\\nRevele o jogador que você escolheu: Exile a criatura alvo que está atacando você se ela for controlada pelo jogador escolhido. Ative uma única vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92ad0e7-d0e5-419f-8c6f-64b44301f10e\', \'multiverseId\': 520628}, \'multiverseid\': 520628}, {\'name\': \'Леонинка-Следопыт\', \'text\': \'Когда Леонинка-Следопыт выходит на поле битвы, тайно выберите оппонента.\\nПокажите, какого игрока вы выбрали: изгоните целевое атакующее вас существо, если его контролирует выбранный игрок. Активируйте только один раз.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Лучник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4c2dfe-bac3-426d-a9db-0b05b992b6b0\', \'multiverseId\': 520876}, \'multiverseid\': 520876}, {\'name\': \'潜行狮族\', \'text\': \'当潜行狮族进战场时，私下选择一位对手。\\n公布所选牌手：如果目标正向你进行攻击的生物由该牌手操控，则放逐之。只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a668d764-f268-4424-b0ef-149fb4301266\', \'multiverseId\': 521124}, \'multiverseid\': 521124}, {\'name\': \'潛行獅族\', \'text\': \'當潛行獅族進戰場時，私下選擇一位對手。\\n公布所選玩家：如果目標正向你進行攻擊的生物由該玩家操控，則放逐之。只能起動一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8b5dd7-8987-4f07-a0ad-4021d82486d2\', \'multiverseId\': 521372}, \'multiverseid\': 521372}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebkuchenhaus\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G}.)\\nDas Lebkuchenhaus kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst drei oder mehr andere Wälder.\\nWenn das Lebkuchenhaus ungetappt ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af86b73-17aa-410c-b702-8ccfbc572944\', \'multiverseId\': 519573}, \'multiverseid\': 519573}, {\'name\': \'Casita de dulces\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G}.)\\nLa Casita de dulces entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles otros tres o más Bosques.\\nCuando la Casita de dulces entre al campo de batalla enderezada, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d211b63-d2e9-4c42-9b0d-a2803b9f97f3\', \'multiverseId\': 519821}, \'multiverseid\': 519821}, {\'name\': "Cabane en pain d\'épices", \'text\': "({T} : Ajoutez {G}.)\\nLa Cabane en pain d\'épices arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins trois autres forêts.\\nQuand la Cabane en pain d\'épices arrive sur le champ de bataille dégagée, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19c38dc-1dee-4267-be47-27aca20b78ae\', \'multiverseId\': 520069}, \'multiverseid\': 520069}, {\'name\': \'Casetta di Pan di Zenzero\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G}.)\\nLa Casetta di Pan di Zenzero entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli tre o più altre Foreste.\\nQuando la Casetta di Pan di Zenzero entra nel campo di battaglia STAPpata, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3b83d4-2565-447f-b5a9-0209dc7d71cb\', \'multiverseId\': 520317}, \'multiverseid\': 520317}, {\'name\': \'お菓子の小屋\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}を加える。）\\nあなたがこれ以外の森３つ以上をコントロールしているのでないかぎり、お菓子の小屋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nお菓子の小屋がアンタップ状態で戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2}, {T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1290e6da-0673-4b6a-b2d2-a2a3a69a24ce\', \'multiverseId\': 520565}, \'multiverseid\': 520565}, {\'name\': \'Casinha de Doces\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G}.)\\nCasinha de Doces entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle três ou mais outras Florestas.\\nQuando Casinha de Doces entrar no campo de batalha desvirada, crie uma ficha de Comida. (Ela é um artefato com "{2}, {T}, sacrifique este artefato: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.")\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'373987cf-6fec-491c-b71f-ba8a85469ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 520813}, \'multiverseid\': 520813}, {\'name\': \'Пряничный Домик\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {G}.)\\nПряничный Домик выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если под вашим контролем менее трех других Лесов.\\nКогда Пряничный Домик выходит на поле битвы развернутым, создайте одну фишку Еды. (Она является артефактом со способностью «{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: вы получаете 3 жизни».)\', \'type\': \'Земля — Лес\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5535f498-ab78-487b-9926-11d7ab2e9342\', \'multiverseId\': 521061}, \'multiverseid\': 521061}, {\'name\': \'姜饼木房\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}。）\\n除非你操控三个或更多其他树林，否则姜饼木房须横置进战场。\\n当姜饼木房进战场且未横置时，派出一个食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'地 ～树林\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9c4865-1714-4218-b9e6-1353be8f8456\', \'multiverseId\': 521309}, \'multiverseid\': 521309}, {\'name\': \'薑餅木房\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}。）\\n除非你操控三個或更多其他樹林，否則薑餅木房須橫置進戰場。\\n當薑餅木房進戰場且未橫置時，派出一個食品衍生物。（食品衍生物是具有「{2}，{T}，犧牲此神器：你獲得3點生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'地 ～樹林\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f627bc0e-f1df-48d1-8632-6d6c2c105987\', \'multiverseId\': 521557}, \'multiverseid\': 521557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leuchtender Springbrunnen\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Leuchtende Springbrunnen ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle Völker schätzen einen Ort, an dem sich ein müder Wanderer erquicken kann."\\n—Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec7fe628-123f-459c-9e10-ba6d56d92542\', \'multiverseId\': 519593}, \'multiverseid\': 519593}, {\'name\': \'Fuente radiante\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Fuente radiante entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Todas las culturas valoran un lugar en el que el viajero exhausto pueda beber en paz".\\n—Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7968c5-d838-4a32-bd42-a57a4c60827f\', \'multiverseId\': 519841}, \'multiverseid\': 519841}, {\'name\': \'Fontaine radieuse\', \'text\': \'Quand la Fontaine radieuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Tous les peuples chérissent un lieu où les voyageurs fatigués peuvent s\'abreuver en paix. »\\n—Ajani Crinièredor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0de64c-d72c-420c-b6f9-7eb5a2d2454d\', \'multiverseId\': 520089}, \'multiverseid\': 520089}, {\'name\': \'Fontana Radiosa\', \'text\': \'Quando la Fontana Radiosa entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti i popoli custodiscono un luogo dove il viaggiatore stanco può dissetarsi in pace."\\n—Ajani Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d06b5534-8cea-4abc-8c5a-7fc2eb73e882\', \'multiverseId\': 520337}, \'multiverseid\': 520337}, {\'name\': \'光輝の泉\', \'text\': \'光輝の泉が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「疲れ果てた旅人が安心して水を飲める場所は、すべての者にとっての宝である。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221bd269-dbab-40a3-9639-eb0f2151b45b\', \'multiverseId\': 520585}, \'multiverseid\': 520585}, {\'name\': \'Fonte Radiante\', \'text\': \'Quando Fonte Radiante entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos os povos valorizam um lugar onde um viajante cansado possa beber em paz."\\n— Ajani Juba D\\\'ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171570fc-87ae-4485-9907-bfdd70586b59\', \'multiverseId\': 520833}, \'multiverseid\': 520833}, {\'name\': \'Лучезарный Фонтан\', \'text\': \'Когда Лучезарный Фонтан выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Для усталого путника нет ничего желаннее места, где он может спокойно напиться воды».\\n— Златогривый Аджани\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c693379-0ef0-4ffc-bac1-b2d609d327a4\', \'multiverseId\': 521081}, \'multiverseid\': 521081}, {\'name\': \'华光喷泉\', \'text\': \'当华光喷泉进战场时，你获得2点生命。\\n{T}：加{C}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「每个人都重视疲惫的旅人能安心喝水的地方。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62cdf342-1da6-41d8-a6da-bd5b7aca1e54\', \'multiverseId\': 521329}, \'multiverseid\': 521329}, {\'name\': \'華光噴泉\', \'text\': \'當華光噴泉進戰場時，你獲得2點生命。\\n{T}：加{C}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「每個人都重視疲憊的旅人能安心喝水的地方。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'826e25f9-3fa8-4c6b-8ba9-379a2b62c264\', \'multiverseId\': 521577}, \'multiverseid\': 521577}]', "[{'name': 'Leylinien-Lauerer', 'text': 'Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Bestie', 'flavor': 'Er ernährt sich von den dunklen Energien, die durch die Tiefen der Welt wabern — und von Kreaturen, die von der Ley-Linie angezogen werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519505&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02ad6df3-bba5-4764-840e-252f7a98c97b', 'multiverseId': 519505}, 'multiverseid': 519505}, {'name': 'Rondador de la línea mística', 'text': 'Toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia pesadilla', 'flavor': 'Se alimenta de las energías oscuras que fluyen por el mundo profundo... y de cualquier criatura atraída por el magnetismo de la línea mística.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519753&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '648609d9-06c7-4ff5-85fe-c7d8c6216d85', 'multiverseId': 519753}, 'multiverseid': 519753}, {'name': 'Rôdeur des lignes ley', 'text': 'Contact mortel, lien de vie\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.', 'type': 'Créature : cauchemar et bête', 'flavor': 'Il se nourrit des énergies sombres qui traversent les profondeurs du monde... et de toute autre créature ayant été attirée par les lignes ley.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520001&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c97dd16-1817-4ab0-bc7f-4668834df144', 'multiverseId': 520001}, 'multiverseid': 520001}, {'name': 'Predatore della Leyline', 'text': 'Tocco letale, legame vitale\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia Incubo', 'flavor': 'Si nutre delle energie oscure che fluiscono nel mondo delle profondità, oltre che delle altre creature attirate dalla forza della leyline.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520249&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '187a70b9-bcaa-4e35-8306-166c18465c13', 'multiverseId': 520249}, 'multiverseid': 520249}, {'name': '力線をうろつくもの', 'text': '接死、絆魂\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ナイトメア・ビースト', 'flavor': '世界の深いところから流れてくる闇のエネルギーと、力線に惹かれて迷い込む他の生き物を餌としている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520497&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '275cd115-ffec-4dca-a3ba-b6d35c8eabae', 'multiverseId': 520497}, 'multiverseid': 520497}, {'name': 'Espreitador da Linha de Força', 'text': 'Toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.', 'type': 'Criatura — Pesadelo Besta', 'flavor': 'Ele se alimenta das energias sombrias que correm pelo mundo das profundezas... e de qualquer outra criatura atraída pela linha de força.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520745&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c7a1e22-a12f-4e7c-b53d-117c86a12244', 'multiverseId': 520745}, 'multiverseid': 520745}, {'name': 'Охотник Невидимых Лучей', 'text': 'Смертельное касание, Цепь жизни\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.', 'type': 'Существо — Кошмар Зверь', 'flavor': 'Он питается темной энергией, что течет во чреве мира, — и любыми живыми существами, которых приманили невидимые лучи.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520993&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71196ec9-84c8-424e-9cd8-51f19bff3e07', 'multiverseId': 520993}, 'multiverseid': 520993}, {'name': '地脉游掠兽', 'text': '死触，系命\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。', 'type': '生物 ～梦魇／野兽', 'flavor': '它吸食飘荡在地底世界的黑暗能量～以及任何其他被地脉吸引而来的生物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521241&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b2e496a-68c2-4a25-952e-dea9db47511d', 'multiverseId': 521241}, 'multiverseid': 521241}, {'name': '地脈遊掠獸', 'text': '死觸，繫命\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。', 'type': '生物 ～夢魘／野獸', 'flavor': '它吸食飄蕩在地底世界的黑暗能量～以及任何其他被地脈吸引而來的生物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521489&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b44ec6b-46c5-4f9d-a553-0dbc29422bbb', 'multiverseId': 521489}, 'multiverseid': 521489}]", "[{'name': 'Lied des Brodelns', 'text': 'Erzeuge {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'In ihren Manaritualen gedenken die Vulshok des Tages, an dem die rote Sonne aus der Oberfläche Mirrodins ausbrach, um ihren Platz am Himmel einzunehmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519462&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31f802a6-88d0-47d5-a6a9-968a794ddb2b', 'multiverseId': 519462}, 'multiverseid': 519462}, {'name': 'Canción hirviente', 'text': 'Agrega {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los rituales de maná vúlshok rememoran el día en que el sol rojo brotó a través de la superficie de Mirrodin y ocupó su lugar en los cielos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519710&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e69d9c0e-722a-49e1-8b8c-130e6f5dded3', 'multiverseId': 519710}, 'multiverseid': 519710}, {'name': 'Chant bouillonnant', 'text': 'Ajoutez {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les rites de mana des vulshoks commémorent le jour où le soleil rouge jaillit de la surface de Mirrodin pour prendre sa place dans les cieux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519958&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcb5a39f-a800-4d79-b87c-7eb035b0c123', 'multiverseId': 519958}, 'multiverseid': 519958}, {'name': 'Canzone Ribollente', 'text': 'Aggiungi {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I rituali del mana vulshok si rifanno ai giorni in cui il sole rosso fuoriuscì dalla superficie di Mirrodin per prendere posto in cielo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520206&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b8ed6b2-36b2-48d3-b99b-5c460aff1804', 'multiverseId': 520206}, 'multiverseid': 520206}, {'name': '煮えたぎる歌', 'text': '{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}を加える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ミラディンの地表を焼き尽くす赤い太陽が天に昇る日、ヴァルショクの儀式は一日中響き渡る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520454&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cdf012c-e914-4521-b630-49052638e84d', 'multiverseId': 520454}, 'multiverseid': 520454}, {'name': 'Canção Fervilhante', 'text': 'Adicione {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os rituais de mana dos vulshoques são um eco do dia em que o sol vermelho eclodiu pela superfície de Mirrodin para chegar ao seu lugar no céu.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520702&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a22cd193-f666-4153-8186-6db9ccfb17ea', 'multiverseId': 520702}, 'multiverseid': 520702}, {'name': 'Песнь Кипения', 'text': 'Добавьте {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Ритуалы маны вулшоков напоминают о том дне, когда красное солнце прорвалось сквозь поверхность Мирродина, чтобы занять свое место в небесах.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520950&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9708c59-e9eb-4e1e-bab3-9f6240e94bd6', 'multiverseId': 520950}, 'multiverseid': 520950}, {'name': '热血战歌', 'text': '加{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '当红太阳自秘罗地升起，瓦许克人的法术力祭仪声响便开始回荡终日。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521198&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0542073c-1b45-4bc8-8359-74bdb759bd8c', 'multiverseId': 521198}, 'multiverseid': 521198}, {'name': '熱血戰歌', 'text': '加{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '當紅太陽自秘羅地升起，瓦許克人的魔法力祭儀聲響便開始迴蕩終日。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521446&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da23b2ea-db24-44e7-8388-6823300716c8', 'multiverseId': 521446}, 'multiverseid': 521446}]", "[{'name': 'Llanowar-Ödland', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Das Llanowar-Ödland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519580&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bf238b1-59b4-448b-9b58-47a256b65648', 'multiverseId': 519580}, 'multiverseid': 519580}, {'name': 'Yermos de Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. Los Yermos de Llanowar te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519828&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e669331-c980-4505-8bba-e7cb9e8e06a5', 'multiverseId': 519828}, 'multiverseid': 519828}, {'name': 'Landes de Llanowar', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. Les Landes de Llanowar vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520076&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd4e70b0-a61a-4e1b-812e-5806720c5071', 'multiverseId': 520076}, 'multiverseid': 520076}, {'name': 'Distese di Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}. Le Distese di Llanowar ti infliggono 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520324&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f803f229-abee-4d5d-a568-452535709e4f', 'multiverseId': 520324}, 'multiverseid': 520324}, {'name': 'ラノワールの荒原', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。ラノワールの荒原はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520572&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd5578b4-9b40-48a4-acbd-2c2e65eb8a50', 'multiverseId': 520572}, 'multiverseid': 520572}, {'name': 'Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}. Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520820&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b66d5e31-db55-4f03-9718-2759daf21641', 'multiverseId': 520820}, 'multiverseid': 520820}, {'name': 'Лановарские Пустоши', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}. Лановарские Пустоши наносят вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521068&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2970f775-5048-43ff-816f-f10ee2673e13', 'multiverseId': 521068}, 'multiverseid': 521068}, {'name': '罗堰荒野', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。罗堰荒野对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521316&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe487815-ab49-4268-a59e-7237be0b67c8', 'multiverseId': 521316}, 'multiverseid': 521316}, {'name': '羅堰荒野', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。羅堰荒野對你造成1點傷害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521564&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4141d45f-54db-4bbd-8b14-c5c299869f6d', 'multiverseId': 521564}, 'multiverseid': 521564}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lohnende Ausfahrt\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nZiehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zahllose Freuden treiben auf der Oberfläche, doch darunter strömen dunkle Machenschaften.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac54c1b-51d6-4674-8472-cc83149ead00\', \'multiverseId\': 519416}, \'multiverseid\': 519416}, {\'name\': \'Crucero del tesoro\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nRoba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Incontables maravillas flotan en la superficie; mientras, en las profundidades se urden oscuras maquinaciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1fcd578-cd28-48d2-b76d-886ac1a2573c\', \'multiverseId\': 519664}, \'multiverseid\': 519664}, {\'name\': \'Fortune des mers\', \'text\': \'Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nPiochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que d\'innombrables délices dérivent à la surface, de sombres machinations se cachent dans les profondeurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c11722d-3047-4d7b-964f-498ed91b52fa\', \'multiverseId\': 519912}, \'multiverseid\': 519912}, {\'name\': \'Traversata Sfarzosa\', \'text\': \'Esumare (Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nPesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Infinite delizie scivolano in superficie, sopra correnti profonde di oscuri intrighi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67f5542b-fab1-4eda-a473-8f8ba654742f\', \'multiverseId\': 520160}, \'multiverseid\': 520160}, {\'name\': \'宝船の巡航\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードはそれぞれ{1}を支払う。）\\nカード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無数の歓楽が水面上に浮かぶ間も、暗き陰謀が水面下で展開されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2fdd61a-fb61-4e59-bc1a-d672211a708d\', \'multiverseId\': 520408}, \'multiverseid\': 520408}, {\'name\': \'Cruzeiro do Tesouro\', \'text\': \'Esquadrinhar (Cada card que você exila de seu cemitério quando conjura esta mágica paga por {1}.)\\nCompre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto incontáveis prazeres flutuam na superfície, planos malignos correm por baixo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0411cef-f1b8-4022-b3b9-ab0f0d0eae91\', \'multiverseId\': 520656}, \'multiverseid\': 520656}, {\'name\': \'Плаванье за Сокровищами\', \'text\': \'Выкапывание (Каждая карта, которую вы изгоняете из вашего кладбища при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nВозьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Бесчисленные удовольствия манят своим видом, но в глубинах творятся черные замыслы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11192cdd-df21-4990-8dad-fe47b6b3a2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 520904}, \'multiverseid\': 520904}, {\'name\': \'宝船巡游\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你于施放此咒语时每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'金玉漂流在外，阴谋勾画其间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'845d21b9-474c-4974-bd28-d6cb7dc91548\', \'multiverseId\': 521152}, \'multiverseid\': 521152}, {\'name\': \'寶船巡遊\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你於施放此咒語時每從你墳墓場中放逐一張牌，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'金玉漂流在外，陰謀勾畫其間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a82f5a5-66fa-4d92-a7a7-e08f71707fa9\', \'multiverseId\': 521400}, \'multiverseid\': 521400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Losheel, Gelehrte der Mechanik\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der angreifenden Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elefant, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a07ed88-ea3d-44e9-8986-3a6953040ea9\', \'multiverseId\': 518485}, \'multiverseid\': 518485}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, erudita mecánica\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer a las criaturas artefacto atacantes que controlas.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c633ee-e495-4344-9ba5-7c89cc17dae1\', \'multiverseId\': 518556}, \'multiverseid\': 518556}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, érudite en mécanique\', \'text\': "Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux créatures-artefacts attaquantes que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éléphant et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518627&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a6b7aac-2c8f-409b-b3ac-42a3af6af5fb\', \'multiverseId\': 518627}, \'multiverseid\': 518627}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, Studiosa di Meccanica\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto alle creature artefatto attaccanti che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b54000-0c5b-45d6-ab2b-b48731714a0a\', \'multiverseId\': 518698}, \'multiverseid\': 518698}, {\'name\': \'機械細工の学者、ロシール\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーが受けるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\\nアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体以上があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 象・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8f0f4a-15e5-47d7-8923-50bb2abf471a\', \'multiverseId\': 518769}, \'multiverseid\': 518769}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, Erudita da Mecânica\', \'text\': \'Previna todo dano de combate que seria causado a criaturas artefato atacantes que você controla.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas artefato entrarem no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elefante Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63cf5f70-8164-40b3-916f-f1c201611458\', \'multiverseId\': 518840}, \'multiverseid\': 518840}, {\'name\': \'Лосхил, Мастерица Механизмов\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены атакующим артефактам существам под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда одно или несколько артефактов существ выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, возьмите карту. Эта способность срабатывает только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Слон Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667e9f1d-ef91-4521-a00c-ec34cc6580ad\', \'multiverseId\': 518911}, \'multiverseid\': 518911}, {\'name\': \'发条学者萝绣\', \'text\': \'防止由你操控且正进行攻击之神器生物将受到的所有战斗伤害。\\n每当一个或数个神器生物在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～象／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb85ec2f-8503-42d1-8c7d-dfb27c46d1b3\', \'multiverseId\': 518982}, \'multiverseid\': 518982}, {\'name\': \'發條學者蘿繡\', \'text\': \'防止由你操控且正進行攻擊之神器生物將受到的所有戰鬥傷害。\\n每當一個或數個神器生物在你的操控下進戰場時，抽一張牌。此異能每回合只會觸發一次。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～象／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'193db938-d4a7-40e6-96b5-2a04fc80ddd5\', \'multiverseId\': 519053}, \'multiverseid\': 519053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Losheel, Gelehrte der Mechanik\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der angreifenden Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elefant, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521694&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2022f2f4-f74b-4c2a-aa42-eb85ee3f57b8\', \'multiverseId\': 521694}, \'multiverseid\': 521694}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, erudita mecánica\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer a las criaturas artefacto atacantes que controlas.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa0344a-5bcf-4e29-9623-ca809459c59f\', \'multiverseId\': 521774}, \'multiverseid\': 521774}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, érudite en mécanique\', \'text\': "Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux créatures-artefacts attaquantes que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éléphant et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd397f43-a32d-4034-b926-86a534fb032c\', \'multiverseId\': 521854}, \'multiverseid\': 521854}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, Studiosa di Meccanica\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto alle creature artefatto attaccanti che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e19169d9-8120-431b-87b4-f14a42c5cc80\', \'multiverseId\': 521934}, \'multiverseid\': 521934}, {\'name\': \'機械細工の学者、ロシール\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーが受けるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\\nアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体以上があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 象・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75679106-8a90-4e50-a870-bf803c987ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 522014}, \'multiverseid\': 522014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loxodon-Kriegshammer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+0, hat Lebensverknüpfung und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Schmied muss seine Waffe mit einem Teil seiner Seele erfüllen — dessen sind die Phyrexianer nicht fähig."\\n—Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'230ec580-c5aa-4b42-ac7c-d823999d3028\', \'multiverseId\': 519532}, \'multiverseid\': 519532}, {\'name\': \'Martillo de guerra loxodón\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+0 y tiene las habilidades de arrollar y vínculo vital.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un herrero debe imbuir en su arma parte de su alma... Algo de lo que los pirexianos son incapaces".\\n—Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a763d881-a95c-479d-afee-8b00978a14d9\', \'multiverseId\': 519780}, \'multiverseid\': 519780}, {\'name\': \'Marteau de guerre loxodon\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +3/+0 et a le piétinement et le lien de vie.\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Un façonneur doit imprégner son arme d\'une partie de son âme — ce dont les Phyrexians sont bien incapables. »\\n—Melira", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520028&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8eb2645-80a3-4115-883d-57cc452027d1\', \'multiverseId\': 520028}, \'multiverseid\': 520028}, {\'name\': \'Martello da Guerra Lossodonte\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+0 e ha travolgere e legame vitale.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'artefice deve infondere nella sua arma parte della propria anima: un processo impossibile per gli orrori di Phyrexia."\\n—Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98e9a674-91b3-40c3-992f-665769416dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 520276}, \'multiverseid\': 520276}, {\'name\': \'ロクソドンの戦槌\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受けトランプルと絆魂を持つ。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「造り士は武器に自分の魂の一部を埋め込まなくてはならないの。これはファイレクシア人にはできない芸当だけどね。」\\n――メリーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e1cb1f5-8254-4405-b5b6-f6de89b4ace9\', \'multiverseId\': 520524}, \'multiverseid\': 520524}, {\'name\': \'Martelo de Batalha dos Loxodontes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+0 e tem atropelar e vínculo com a vida.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Um artífice precisa imbuir sua arma com parte da própria alma, algo que os phyrexianos são incapazes de fazer."\\n— Melira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53b9a04-025e-4aa6-913e-4db503f63343\', \'multiverseId\': 520772}, \'multiverseid\': 520772}, {\'name\': \'Локсодонский Боевой Молот\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+0 и имеет Пробивной удар и Цепь жизни.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'«Мастер должен вложить в оружие частицу своей души — это искусство, неподвластное фирексийцам».\\n— Мелира\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041298e8-c04e-4009-83f8-b07e9e03accc\', \'multiverseId\': 521020}, \'multiverseid\': 521020}, {\'name\': \'象族战锤\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+0且具有践踏与系命异能。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「巧匠打造武器时必定会将心血甚至灵魂灌注其中～这一点非瑞克西亚人永远没法做到。」\\n～梅梨莱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55dc0dd2-129c-4392-bb8c-c73e7f801d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 521268}, \'multiverseid\': 521268}, {\'name\': \'象族戰鎚\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+3/+0且具有踐踏與繫命異能。\\n佩帶{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「巧匠打造武器時必定會將心血甚至靈魂灌注其中～這一點非瑞克西亞人永遠沒法做到。」\\n～梅梨萊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b14688-d91a-489e-a725-68c7816d248d\', \'multiverseId\': 521516}, \'multiverseid\': 521516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magierring-Netzwerk\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine Speichermarke auf das Magierring-Netzwerk.\\n{T}, entferne eine beliebige Anzahl an Speichermarken vom Magierring-Netzwerk: Erzeuge {C} für jede auf diese Weise entfernte Speichermarke.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f29b12-84bc-4c19-a9a3-1745ba483820\', \'multiverseId\': 519583}, \'multiverseid\': 519583}, {\'name\': \'Red de anillos mágicos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador de almacenaje sobre la Red de anillos mágicos.\\n{T}, remover cualquier cantidad de contadores de almacenaje de la Red de anillos mágicos: Agrega {C} por cada contador de almacenaje removido de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d223a7f8-8f45-4b22-8341-ad61f0ecdccc\', \'multiverseId\': 519831}, \'multiverseid\': 519831}, {\'name\': \'Réseau des Anneaux du Mage\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « stock » sur le Réseau des Anneaux du Mage.\\n{T}, retirez n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs « stock » du Réseau des Anneaux du Mage : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « stock » retiré de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ab8e0f1-e95d-459f-b94b-ac06755c53f0\', \'multiverseId\': 520079}, \'multiverseid\': 520079}, {\'name\': \'Rete di Anelli Magici\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino magazzino sulla Rete di Anelli Magici.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un qualsiasi numero di segnalini magazzino dalla Rete di Anelli Magici: Aggiungi {C} per ogni segnalino magazzino rimosso in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45db8a61-d07a-4cff-bb9b-0dcbdc4e2708\', \'multiverseId\': 520327}, \'multiverseid\': 520327}, {\'name\': \'魔道士輪の魔力網\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：魔道士輪の魔力網の上に貯蔵カウンター１個を置く。\\n{T}, 魔道士輪の魔力網の上から望む数の貯蔵カウンターを取り除く：これにより取り除いた貯蔵カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2e33be-f454-4593-be6d-5927a50beec0\', \'multiverseId\': 520575}, \'multiverseid\': 520575}, {\'name\': \'Rede dos Anéis de Mago\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Coloque um marcador de estocagem em Rede dos Anéis de Mago.\\n{T}, remova qualquer número de marcadores de estocagem de Rede dos Anéis de Mago: Adicione {C} para cada marcador de estocagem removido dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaff67ea-82e1-45d3-b52c-72df6dd4bde7\', \'multiverseId\': 520823}, \'multiverseid\': 520823}, {\'name\': \'Сеть Магических Колец\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: положите один накопительный жетон на Сеть Магических Колец.\\n{T}, удалите любое количество накопительных жетонов с Сети Магических Колец: добавьте {C} за каждый накопительный жетон, удаленный таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d92062-5704-4f9c-9056-f5ec295e97ff\', \'multiverseId\': 521071}, \'multiverseid\': 521071}, {\'name\': \'法师环塔魔力网\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：在法师环塔魔力网上放置一个储藏指示物。\\n{T}，从法师环塔魔力网上移去任意数量的储藏指示物：每以此法移去一个储藏指示物，便加{C}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3da6e2e8-1b80-4ba8-a0a5-9ebb0f6ad031\', \'multiverseId\': 521319}, \'multiverseid\': 521319}, {\'name\': \'法師環塔魔力網\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：在法師環塔魔力網上放置一個儲藏指示物。\\n{T}，從法師環塔魔力網上移去任意數量的儲藏指示物：每以此法移去一個儲藏指示物，便加{C}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb4e05c-03db-4236-939d-5c4b39533ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 521567}, \'multiverseid\': 521567}]', "[{'name': 'Magisterin der Bewertung', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWille des Konzils — Wenn die Magisterin der Bewertung ins Spiel kommt, stimmt jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, für Gnade oder Verdammung. Falls Gnade mehr Stimmen erhält, bringt jeder Spieler alle Kreaturenkarten aus seinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Falls Verdammung mehr Stimmen erhält oder die Abstimmung mit Gleichstand endet, zerstöre alle Kreaturen außer der Magisterin der Bewertung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Engel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519506&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c7e9ce7-46bb-4942-9b07-5e73ee4dc959', 'multiverseId': 519506}, 'multiverseid': 519506}, {'name': 'Magíster de la valía', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nVoluntad del consejo — Cuando la Magíster de la valía entre al campo de batalla, comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota gracia o condenación. Si gracia consigue más votos, cada jugador regresa cada carta de criatura de su cementerio al campo de batalla. Si condenación consigue más votos o el voto acaba en empate, destruye todas las criaturas que no sean la Magíster de la valía.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ángel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519754&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da36ab6e-95dc-4dbc-9859-577a5179515a', 'multiverseId': 519754}, 'multiverseid': 519754}, {'name': 'Magister de la valeur', 'text': 'Vol\\nVolonté du conseil — Quand la Magister de la valeur arrive sur le champ de bataille, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour grâce ou condamnation. Si grâce gagne plus de votes, chaque joueur renvoie sur le champ de bataille chaque carte de créature de son cimetière. Si condamnation gagne plus de votes ou que les votes sont à égalité, détruisez toutes les créatures autres que la Magister de la valeur.', 'type': 'Créature : ange', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520002&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2728f74c-2b49-4439-a6e1-ac6423483bd2', 'multiverseId': 520002}, 'multiverseid': 520002}, {'name': 'Magister dei Meritevoli', 'text': 'Volare\\nVolontà del concilio — Quando la Magister dei Meritevoli entra nel campo di battaglia, a partire da te, ogni giocatore vota grazia o condanna. Se la grazia ottiene più voti, ogni giocatore rimette sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte creatura dal proprio cimitero. Se la condanna ottiene più voti o il voto è un pareggio, distruggi tutte le creature diverse dalla Magister dei Meritevoli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Angelo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520250&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2297f406-a67e-4941-9605-84eeb90894dd', 'multiverseId': 520250}, 'multiverseid': 520250}, {'name': '真価の宗匠', 'text': '飛行\\n議決 ― 真価の宗匠が戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーはそれぞれ「恩寵」または「糾弾」のいずれかに投票する。「恩寵」がより多くの票を得たなら、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の墓地からすべてのクリーチャー・カードを戦場に戻す。「糾弾」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だったなら、真価の宗匠以外のすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520498&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a10bc68-3377-43c4-9131-af985d95f4a9', 'multiverseId': 520498}, 'multiverseid': 520498}, {'name': 'Magistrada do Mérito', 'text': 'Voar\\nVontade do conselho — Quando Magistrada do Mérito entra no campo de batalha, a começar por você, cada jogador vota em graça ou condenação. Se graça receber mais votos, cada jogador devolve cada card de criatura do próprio cemitério para o campo de batalha. Se condenação receber mais votos ou houver empate, destrua todas as criaturas, exceto Magistrada do Mérito.', 'type': 'Criatura — Anjo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520746&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2be4ba5-7a6f-49e9-accb-643dfc9a0fac', 'multiverseId': 520746}, 'multiverseid': 520746}, {'name': 'Магистр Достоинства', 'text': 'Полет\\nВоля совета — Когда Магистр Достоинства выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок, начиная с вас, голосует за милость или приговор. Если милость набирает больше голосов, каждый игрок возвращает каждую карту существа из своего кладбища на поле битвы. Если приговор набирает больше голосов или голосование заканчивается вничью, уничтожьте все существа, кроме Магистра Достоинства.', 'type': 'Существо — Ангел', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520994&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79cc3070-e11e-43d5-97dc-98239d90775c', 'multiverseId': 520994}, 'multiverseid': 520994}, {'name': '品格范师', 'text': '飞行\\n议定～当品格范师进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「恩典」或「定罪」。若恩典票数较多，则每位牌手各将其坟墓场中所有生物牌移回战场。若定罪票数较多或两者同为最多，则消灭品格范师以外的所有生物。', 'type': '生物 ～天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521242&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03e36e97-d30d-4089-9cfb-83d2b6ab9ab9', 'multiverseId': 521242}, 'multiverseid': 521242}, {'name': '品格範師', 'text': '飛行\\n議定～當品格範師進戰場時，由你開始，每位玩家各投票選擇「恩典」或「定罪」。若恩典票數較多，則每位玩家各將其墳墓場中所有生物牌移回戰場。若定罪票數較多或兩者同為最多，則消滅品格範師以外的所有生物。', 'type': '生物 ～天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521490&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f6a7237-bd6b-4931-97eb-c4ea57048f8f', 'multiverseId': 521490}, 'multiverseid': 521490}]", '[{\'name\': \'Makelloser Talisman\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Werkzeuge und Handwerker können zerstört werden, aber der Akt des Erschaffens bleibt unberührt."\\n—Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc95b72b-c7da-4e16-9807-1102bba31abb\', \'multiverseId\': 519541}, \'multiverseid\': 519541}, {\'name\': \'Talismán prístino\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}. Ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las herramientas y artesanos pueden ser destruidos, pero el acto de creación es inviolable".\\n—Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d612b15-b33d-4cf1-8466-f747953c1964\', \'multiverseId\': 519789}, \'multiverseid\': 519789}, {\'name\': \'Talisman immaculé\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Les outils et les artisans peuvent être détruits, mais l\'acte de création reste pur. »\\n—Elspeth Tirel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520037&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64197450-137c-49e3-ae8c-c450f529794f\', \'multiverseId\': 520037}, \'multiverseid\': 520037}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Integro\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli attrezzi e gli artigiani possono essere distrutti, ma l\\\'atto della creazione è inviolato."\\n—Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f54f883-dd7f-42fa-a01d-6d2c5a01585d\', \'multiverseId\': 520285}, \'multiverseid\': 520285}, {\'name\': \'清純のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「道具や職人は失われます。だけど、創造の行いは犯されません。」\\n――エルズペス・ティレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d26ad3d8-b75d-4c57-ac61-2c16a337e045\', \'multiverseId\': 520533}, \'multiverseid\': 520533}, {\'name\': \'Talismã Imaculado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}. Você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Ferramentas e artesãos podem ser destruídos, mas não se viola o ato da criação."\\n— Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de9c30b-e6df-466e-91a6-4244052eae6b\', \'multiverseId\': 520781}, \'multiverseid\': 520781}, {\'name\': \'Нетронутый Талисман\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}. Вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Можно уничтожить и инструменты, и мастеров, но акт создания останется нетронутым».\\n— Элспет Тирел\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b7b61d-7f93-4e56-b4f8-aea5a653f715\', \'multiverseId\': 521029}, \'multiverseid\': 521029}, {\'name\': \'纯净饰符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「工具与工匠可能会毁灭，但创作此行为将生生不息。」\\n～艾紫培提瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ee24fea-16c7-4fe5-bee3-e1108ba60cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 521277}, \'multiverseid\': 521277}, {\'name\': \'純淨飾符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「工具與工匠可能會毀滅，但創作此行為將生生不息。」\\n～艾紫培提瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96447de3-4060-47cf-9120-5df57d794088\', \'multiverseId\': 521525}, \'multiverseid\': 521525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Manageysir\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge {R} für jedes getappte Land, das deine Gegner kontrollieren.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Quecksilbersee zischte und brodelte ob der Schmach. Der Vulshok-Schamane lächelte nur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519459&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c40af6-0b3f-41c6-a266-5716400e7ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 519459}, \'multiverseid\': 519459}, {\'name\': \'Géiser de maná\', \'text\': \'Agrega {R} por cada tierra girada que controlen tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El mar de mercurio siseó y burbujeó ante la ofensa. El chamán vúlshok solo sonrió.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23cddb79-db81-461a-8e5a-851b876218ad\', \'multiverseId\': 519707}, \'multiverseid\': 519707}, {\'name\': \'Geyser de mana\', \'text\': \'Ajoutez {R} pour chaque terrain engagé que vos adversaires contrôlent.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La Mer de Vif-argent bouillonnait d\'indignation. Le shamane vulshok se contenta de sourire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b319ee1-3cc1-4042-8ec5-007c4718fb97\', \'multiverseId\': 519955}, \'multiverseid\': 519955}, {\'name\': \'Geyser di Mana\', \'text\': \'Aggiungi {R} per ogni terra TAPpata che i tuoi avversari controllano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Il Mare di Mercurio sibilò e gorgogliò d\'indignazione. Lo sciamano Vulshok si limitò a sorridere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e86bea-0449-4d58-bb23-2e7c97bcdc85\', \'multiverseId\': 520203}, \'multiverseid\': 520203}, {\'name\': \'マナ噴出\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているタップ状態の土地１つにつき{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'水銀海は辱めに対しては乱れ泡を立てる。ヴァルショクのシャーマンは微笑むのみ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692b9ea8-e130-47e3-925e-0a12da81c081\', \'multiverseId\': 520451}, \'multiverseid\': 520451}, {\'name\': \'Gêiser de Mana\', \'text\': \'Adicione {R} para cada terreno virado que seus oponentes controlam.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O Mar de Mercúrio ferveu e borbulhou ante à indignidade. O xamã vulshoque apenas sorriu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b2d6b6-1f6e-4015-9a6f-ca3a33b453ff\', \'multiverseId\': 520699}, \'multiverseid\': 520699}, {\'name\': \'Гейзер Маны\', \'text\': \'Добавьте {R} за каждую повернутую землю под контролем ваших оппонентов.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Море Живого Серебра шипело и пузырилось от возмущения. Шаман вулшоков лишь улыбнулся.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9865f9-25a8-4f85-87b5-f87d888c04ca\', \'multiverseId\': 520947}, \'multiverseid\': 520947}, {\'name\': \'法术力喷发\', \'text\': \'所有对手每操控一个已横置的地，你便加{R}。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'水银海因此侮辱而骚动起来；瓦许克祭师仅浅浅一笑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac945e7c-5fbb-4485-aaa6-e9eca3aa381f\', \'multiverseId\': 521195}, \'multiverseid\': 521195}, {\'name\': \'魔法力噴發\', \'text\': \'所有對手每操控一個已橫置的地，你便加{R}。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'水銀海因此侮辱而騷動起來；瓦許克祭師僅淺淺一笑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f50fba-670b-4b52-963a-fd6fbf81f5cd\', \'multiverseId\': 521443}, \'multiverseid\': 521443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Manaverschlingende Hydra\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch wirkt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Manaverschlingende Hydra.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd9b309a-8669-4c85-96c0-7e86e4a6bd60\', \'multiverseId\': 519482}, \'multiverseid\': 519482}, {\'name\': \'Hidra manainsaciable\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que un jugador lance un hechizo, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hidra manainsaciable.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f33020-860c-4aaf-890e-3f73ef204740\', \'multiverseId\': 519730}, \'multiverseid\': 519730}, {\'name\': \'Hydre avaleuse de mana\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre avaleuse de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519978&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c489b0e-a257-4cb2-8f83-70e64eb683ee\', \'multiverseId\': 519978}, \'multiverseid\': 519978}, {\'name\': \'Idra Divoramana\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Idra Divoramana.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f17e40-cffa-4bcc-82e8-1cdc2446e8e0\', \'multiverseId\': 520226}, \'multiverseid\': 520226}, {\'name\': \'マナ喰らいのハイドラ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nプレイヤーが呪文を唱えるたび、マナ喰らいのハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b450186-72a8-480f-98df-6859cd34b5c8\', \'multiverseId\': 520474}, \'multiverseid\': 520474}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Devoradora de Mana\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hidra Devoradora de Mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81276ec9-e176-4c67-8f38-c47e09bda623\', \'multiverseId\': 520722}, \'multiverseid\': 520722}, {\'name\': \'Гидра, Пожирательница Маны\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает заклинание, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Гидру, Пожирательницу Маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b381fd-f288-44f7-8060-9e50d4424fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 520970}, \'multiverseid\': 520970}, {\'name\': \'吞魔多头龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当任一牌手施放咒语时，在吞魔多头龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54f9ac7-1de7-4ef4-91f9-40b1b96323ac\', \'multiverseId\': 521218}, \'multiverseid\': 521218}, {\'name\': \'吞魔多頭龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n每當任一玩家施放咒語時，在吞魔多頭龍上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a3b090-abb2-484a-9485-117230ba5ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 521466}, \'multiverseid\': 521466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b9d394-4ede-4c86-aae0-fc60245be76c\', \'multiverseId\': 519587}, \'multiverseid\': 519587}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175d11ad-f7d3-471d-b354-f348cf8f3f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 519835}, \'multiverseid\': 519835}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520083&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c88f62-172a-4de7-b66d-e5b497fea807\', \'multiverseId\': 520083}, \'multiverseid\': 520083}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c491ae5-7a80-4638-b2b5-e11f3ee777a0\', \'multiverseId\': 520331}, \'multiverseid\': 520331}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから同じ土地タイプを持つ基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca3a268-8533-4e13-84ab-05e1739ed7fc\', \'multiverseId\': 520579}, \'multiverseid\': 520579}, {\'name\': \'Paisagem Infinita\', \'text\': \'Paisagem Infinita entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Paisagem Infinita: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico que compartilhem um tipo de terreno, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4385b228-d366-4127-99b2-39563f056cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 520827}, \'multiverseid\': 520827}, {\'name\': \'Многоликий Ландшафт\', \'text\': \'Многоликий Ландшафт выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Многоликий Ландшафт: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, у которых есть одинаковый тип земли, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df5e360-e516-4711-a081-e0f629cf2ec4\', \'multiverseId\': 521075}, \'multiverseid\': 521075}, {\'name\': \'繁茂地境\', \'text\': \'繁茂地境须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲繁茂地境：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张具共通地类别的基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd2d022e-9c04-40f1-9997-f8ff811fb346\', \'multiverseId\': 521323}, \'multiverseid\': 521323}, {\'name\': \'繁茂地境\', \'text\': \'繁茂地境須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，犧牲繁茂地境：從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張具共通地類別的基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'443b3073-e920-4514-aaa4-3c3b2cc2ac10\', \'multiverseId\': 521571}, \'multiverseid\': 521571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meister-Biomagier\', \'text\': \'Jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit so vielen zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie die Stärke des Meister-Biomagiers beträgt, und zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen als Mutant.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Natur ist ein wunderbarer Ingenieur, aber für meinen Geschmack arbeitet sie viel zu langsam."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c588752-baa4-4441-b24a-fb69286c8984\', \'multiverseId\': 519507}, \'multiverseid\': 519507}, {\'name\': \'Maestro biomante\', \'text\': \'Cada otra criatura que controlas entra al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 adicionales igual a la fuerza del Maestro biomante y como un Mutante además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza es una ingeniera magnífica, pero trabaja muy despacio para mi gusto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2eaa02-8d03-4149-8bc8-8e254282f2b2\', \'multiverseId\': 519755}, \'multiverseid\': 519755}, {\'name\': \'Maître biomancien\', \'text\': \'Chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires égal à la force du Maître biomancien et comme un mutant en plus de ses autres types.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« La nature est une merveilleuse créatrice, mais elle travaille bien trop lentement à mon goût. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520003&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5b2654b-8cc4-482e-9b72-0794eb4ac375\', \'multiverseId\': 520003}, \'multiverseid\': 520003}, {\'name\': \'Gran Biomante\', \'text\': \'Ogni altra creatura che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 addizionali pari alla forza del Gran Biomante e come Mutante in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La natura è un ingegnere meraviglioso, ma lavora troppo lentamente per i miei gusti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8516a9c6-e440-4970-9895-bbba7b328043\', \'multiverseId\': 520251}, \'multiverseid\': 520251}, {\'name\': \'練達の生術師\', \'text\': \'これ以外であなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、練達の生術師のパワーに等しい数の追加の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれるとともに、他のタイプに加えてミュータントでもある状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「自然は素晴らしい技術者だが、私からすれば仕事があまりに遅すぎる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85c99bcd-490c-474b-86ae-881c8aa0794c\', \'multiverseId\': 520499}, \'multiverseid\': 520499}, {\'name\': \'Biomante Mestre\', \'text\': \'Cada outra criatura que você controla entra no campo de batalha com uma quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 adicionais equivalente ao poder de Biomante Mestre e como Mutante além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"A natureza é uma engenheira maravilhosa, mas trabalha devagar demais para o meu gosto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af398e6-a6c5-4455-b1a3-9d27f8f73b01\', \'multiverseId\': 520747}, \'multiverseid\': 520747}, {\'name\': \'Искусный Биомант\', \'text\': \'Каждое другое существо под вашим контролем выходит на поле битвы с количеством дополнительных жетонов +1/+1 на нем, равным силе Искусного Биоманта, и как Мутант в дополнение к своим другим типам.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Конечно, лучший создатель — это сама природа, вот только больно уж медленно она работает».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c115b18a-3633-4ba1-aaf4-f8504a22471f\', \'multiverseId\': 520995}, \'multiverseid\': 520995}, {\'name\': \'生机大师\', \'text\': \'每个由你操控的其他生物进战场时，上面均额外有数量等同于生机大师之力量的+1/+1指示物，且额外具有突变体此类别。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「大自然是了不起的工程师，但其进度过慢，不符我的需求。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'803b5d82-b22d-4193-960d-f49cfa64dcc0\', \'multiverseId\': 521243}, \'multiverseid\': 521243}, {\'name\': \'生機大師\', \'text\': \'每個由你操控的其他生物進戰場時，上面均額外其數量等同於生機大師之力量的+1/+1指示物，且額外具有突變體此類別。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「大自然是了不起的工程師，但其進度過慢，不符我的需求。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6b7f46-3c01-46a0-a44d-ba6b69d35dc8\', \'multiverseId\': 521491}, \'multiverseid\': 521491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Metallurgische Beschwörungen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen X/X farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\\n{3}{U}{U}, schicke die Metallurgischen Beschwörungen ins Exil: Bringe alle Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du sechs oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d4eee95-5f19-47f3-adce-5a4040137dea\', \'multiverseId\': 519405}, \'multiverseid\': 519405}, {\'name\': \'Invocaciones metalúrgicas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora X/X, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\n{3}{U}{U}, exiliar las Invocaciones metalúrgicas: Regresa todas las cartas de instantáneo o de conjuro de tu cementerio a tu mano. Activa esto solo si controlas seis o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68cb93f2-b136-40b3-a0c2-6c6581f8c7e8\', \'multiverseId\': 519653}, \'multiverseid\': 519653}, {\'name\': \'Invocations métallurgiques\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Construction, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\n{3}{U}{U}, exilez les Invocations métallurgiques : Renvoyez toutes les cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins six artefacts.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c50fe239-1a4d-49d2-96d6-f0fb9a876952\', \'multiverseId\': 519901}, \'multiverseid\': 519901}, {\'name\': \'Evocazioni Metallurgiche\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto X/X incolore, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia.\\n{3}{U}{U}, Esilia le Evocazioni Metallurgiche: Riprendi in mano tutte le carte istantaneo e stregoneria dal tuo cimitero. Attiva solo se controlli sei o più artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a7b4a49-c5e1-4cae-8b90-ebb2e2317433\', \'multiverseId\': 520149}, \'multiverseid\': 520149}, {\'name\': \'機械医学的召喚\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、無色のＸ/Ｘの構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\n{3}{U}{U}, 機械医学的召喚を追放する：あなたの墓地からインスタントやソーサリーであるすべてのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたがアーティファクト６つ以上をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'193b0f9b-efd2-4869-9d10-0eb77e482a18\', \'multiverseId\': 520397}, \'multiverseid\': 520397}, {\'name\': \'Invocações Metalúrgicas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Constructo incolor X/X, sendo X o valor de mana daquela mágica.\\n{3}{U}{U}, exile Invocações Metalúrgicas: Devolva todos os cards de mágica instantânea e de feitiço de seu cemitério para sua mão. Ative somente se você controlar seis ou mais artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c4edea3-4c2c-43cf-94d2-0811f5a33712\', \'multiverseId\': 520645}, \'multiverseid\': 520645}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Металлурга\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа X/X бесцветная Конструкция, где X — мановая ценность того заклинания.\\n{3}{U}{U}, изгоните Призыв Металлурга: верните все карты мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Активируйте, только если вы контролируете не менее шести артефактов.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8da0d183-d429-4f9a-86d3-1276432bf636\', \'multiverseId\': 520893}, \'multiverseid\': 520893}, {\'name\': \'冶金召唤\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个X/X无色组构体衍生神器生物，X为该咒语的法术力值。\\n{3}{U}{U}，放逐冶金召唤：将所有瞬间与法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。只能于你操控六个或更多神器时起动。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a676fed2-9552-4f9b-ae6c-4a99a0e68566\', \'multiverseId\': 521141}, \'multiverseid\': 521141}, {\'name\': \'冶金召喚\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，派出一個X/X無色組構體衍生神器生物，X為該咒語的魔法力值。\\n{3}{U}{U}，放逐冶金召喚：將所有瞬間與巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。只能於你操控六個或更多神器時起動。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95c535f-3e57-4b4e-bc9c-1dba920f7d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 521389}, \'multiverseid\': 521389}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meteorgolem\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Meteorgolem ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Der Einschlag ließ die Soldaten erzittern — dann erhob sich etwas aus dem Krater.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362132ca-b201-48fb-b3a7-5f61aae1848b\', \'multiverseId\': 519533}, \'multiverseid\': 519533}, {\'name\': \'Gólem meteoro\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gólem meteoro entre al campo de batalla, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'El impacto dispersó a los soldados y, después, algo emergió del cráter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02e4ba8-fcbb-4508-8aed-8b090d9209c1\', \'multiverseId\': 519781}, \'multiverseid\': 519781}, {\'name\': \'Golem météoritique\', \'text\': "Quand le Golem météoritique arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "L\'impact dispersa les soldats, puis quelque chose émergea du cratère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520029&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9050ba4d-6ecc-4d71-a58a-d0f30b5b493f\', \'multiverseId\': 520029}, \'multiverseid\': 520029}, {\'name\': \'Golem Meteora\', \'text\': \'Quando il Golem Meteora entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': "L\'impatto disperse i soldati, poi dal cratere emerse qualcosa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fed8ab9-b6e4-43c2-ac0e-9372aeaa2565\', \'multiverseId\': 520277}, \'multiverseid\': 520277}, {\'name\': \'隕石ゴーレム\', \'text\': \'隕石ゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'その衝撃で兵士たちは散り散りになった。すると、その穴から何かが現れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32cb3b12-5f0d-4f61-be9f-6db6616cd723\', \'multiverseId\': 520525}, \'multiverseid\': 520525}, {\'name\': \'Golem Meteórico\', \'text\': \'Quando Golem Meteórico entrar no campo de batalha, destrua a permanente alvo não de terreno que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'O impacto dispersou os soldados. Então algo surgiu da cratera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da2d035-bc80-4668-bd6a-0c6b24a1b281\', \'multiverseId\': 520773}, \'multiverseid\': 520773}, {\'name\': \'Метеоритный Голем\', \'text\': \'Когда Метеоритный Голем выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'От удара солдаты разлетелись в стороны, а потом что-то поднялось из кратера.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac2b3dd-26eb-45d5-bb41-809c7d042c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 521021}, \'multiverseid\': 521021}, {\'name\': \'陨石魔像\', \'text\': \'当陨石魔像进战场时，消灭目标由对手操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'冲击将士兵四散震飞～随后坑中有人影起身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f516109e-b34e-4f5b-b92a-32c3b1837fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 521269}, \'multiverseid\': 521269}, {\'name\': \'隕石魔像\', \'text\': \'當隕石魔像進戰場時，消滅目標由對手操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'衝擊將士兵四散震飛～隨後坑中有人影起身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67751e2e-1f46-4094-8de8-8fce73c3c037\', \'multiverseId\': 521517}, \'multiverseid\': 521517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mikokoro, Mitte des Meeres\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Jeder Spieler zieht eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Mitte des Meeres, Auge der Welt, Schrein der Erleuchtung. Antwort auf alle Fragen und Heilung für alle Krankheiten. Fahre hin und kehre neu zurück."\\n—Pergamentrest aus den Ruinen von Minamo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295e3c5f-1593-4463-9c25-91b46444e188\', \'multiverseId\': 519585}, \'multiverseid\': 519585}, {\'name\': \'Mikokoro, centro del mar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Cada jugador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Centro del mar, ojo del mundo, altar de sabiduría. Busca en él las respuestas. Busca en él la curación. Búscalo y regresa transformado".\\n—Fragmento de pergamino de las ruinas de Minamo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5fabc70-6370-408d-815c-eb3e9e37bb5f\', \'multiverseId\': 519833}, \'multiverseid\': 519833}, {\'name\': \'Mikokoro, Centre de la mer\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Chaque joueur pioche une carte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Centre de la mer, Œil du monde, Reliquaire de l\'illumination. Il répond à toutes les questions. Il soigne tous les maux. Trouvez-le et vous en reviendrez transformé. »\\n—Fragment de parchemin trouvé dans les ruines de Minamo", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520081&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98abb2c0-ee1b-40bf-b2e3-3fe4fb195504\', \'multiverseId\': 520081}, \'multiverseid\': 520081}, {\'name\': \'Mikokoro, Centro del Mare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Ogni giocatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'"Centro del Mare, Occhio del Mondo, Santuario dell\\\'Illuminazione. Cerca in esso risposte. Cerca in esso guarigione. Cercalo e torna trasformato."\\n—Frammento di pergamena dalle rovine di Minamo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f72ae65-42bf-439c-b2ce-0f313d606919\', \'multiverseId\': 520329}, \'multiverseid\': 520329}, {\'name\': \'海の中心、御心\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'「大海の中心、世界の目、悟りの寺院。答えの為にそを探す。癒しの為にそを探す。そを探し、形変えて戻しぬ。」\\n――水面院の廃墟の巻物の断片より\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efec1b91-e10d-406d-82e4-15f56aa67104\', \'multiverseId\': 520577}, \'multiverseid\': 520577}, {\'name\': \'Mikokoro, Centro do Mar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Cada jogador compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Centro do Mar, Olho do Mundo, Sacrário de Esclarecimento. Procure-o para respostas. Procure-o para curar. Procure-o e volte transformado."\\n— Fragmento de pergaminho das ruínas de Minamo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e81259-8b30-4a9f-918b-651967066327\', \'multiverseId\': 520825}, \'multiverseid\': 520825}, {\'name\': \'Микокоро, Середина Моря\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: каждый игрок берет карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарная Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Середина Моря, Око Мира, Храм Просвещения. Отыщи его, чтобы найти ответы. Отыщи его, чтобы излечиться. Отыщи его — и вернись преображенным».\\n— фрагмент свитка из руин Минамо\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94fcee83-55db-4f46-b035-3ac9e95cc7a6\', \'multiverseId\': 521073}, \'multiverseid\': 521073}, {\'name\': \'海中天地御心\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：每位牌手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': \'「御心是汪洋的中心，世界的眼睛，启蒙的殿堂。该地有所有问题的解答，所有伤痛的解药。之后你将超凡而归。」\\n～水面院废墟的断简残篇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb3a2b47-c92e-406d-bf62-c7f7dda45cef\', \'multiverseId\': 521321}, \'multiverseid\': 521321}, {\'name\': \'海中天地御心\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：每位玩家各抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇地\', \'flavor\': \'「御心是汪洋的中心，世界的眼睛，啟蒙的殿堂。該地有所有問題的解答，所有傷痛的解藥。之後你將超凡而歸。」\\n～水面院廢墟的斷簡殘篇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb7b5f26-a85f-4e64-b9d8-1797d12d7054\', \'multiverseId\': 521569}, \'multiverseid\': 521569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitreißender Refrain\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge {R} für jede Karte auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlierst du dieses Mana nicht, sowie Segmente und Phasen enden. Schicke den Mitreißenden Refrain mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {1}{R} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {1}{R} bezahlen und sie mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil schicken. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke sie, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63fa5d8-c26c-4f31-ab98-32b5f6531d18\', \'multiverseId\': 518523}, \'multiverseid\': 518523}, {\'name\': \'Estribillo estimulante\', \'text\': \'Agrega {R} por cada carta en la mano del oponente objetivo. Hasta el final del turno, no pierdes ese maná en cuanto terminan los pasos y las fases. Exilia el Estribillo estimulante con tres contadores de tiempo sobre él.\\nSuspender 3—{1}{R}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta de tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{R} y exiliarla con tres contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ab2c42-5b03-40b2-96f8-cf009a501d8d\', \'multiverseId\': 518594}, \'multiverseid\': 518594}, {\'name\': \'Refrain entraînant\', \'text\': "Ajoutez {R} pour chaque carte dans la main d\'un adversaire ciblé. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous ne perdez pas ce mana au moment où les étapes et les phases se terminent. Exilez le Refrain entraînant avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur lui.\\nSuspension 3 — {1}{R} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{R} et l\'exiler avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, lancez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a709f10-4d0e-4eab-a142-17b9eacb5fad\', \'multiverseId\': 518665}, \'multiverseid\': 518665}, {\'name\': \'Ritornello Stimolante\', \'text\': "Aggiungi {R} per ogni carta nella mano di un avversario bersaglio. Fino alla fine del turno, non perdi questo mana al termine di ogni fase o sottofase. Esilia il Ritornello Stimolante con tre segnalini tempo su di esso.\\nSospendere 3—{1}{R} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {1}{R} ed esiliarla con tre segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, lancia la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'803975c4-d4d6-4be9-9c97-1a228839f5b8\', \'multiverseId\': 518736}, \'multiverseid\': 518736}, {\'name\': \'熱狂のリフレイン\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの手札にあるカード１枚につき{R}を加える。ターン終了時まで、このマナはステップやフェイズの終了に際して無くならない。熱狂のリフレインを時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機３―{1}{R}（あなたはこのカードをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{1}{R}を支払って時間カウンター３個を置いた状態で追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f74038-bd48-4218-9614-580bdf5c555c\', \'multiverseId\': 518807}, \'multiverseid\': 518807}, {\'name\': \'Refrão Estimulante\', \'text\': \'Adicione {R} para cada card na mão do oponente alvo. Até o final do turno, você não perde esse mana quando as etapas e fases terminam. Exile Refrão Estimulante com três marcadores temporais.\\nSuspender 3 — {1}{R} (Em vez de conjurar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {1}{R} e exilá-lo com três marcadores temporais. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando o último for removido, conjure-o sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc865aa9-3b35-4096-9afa-aa5a2c01cab3\', \'multiverseId\': 518878}, \'multiverseid\': 518878}, {\'name\': \'Будоражащий Рефрен\', \'text\': \'Добавьте {R} за каждую карту в руке целевого оппонента. До конца хода вы не теряете эту ману по окончании шагов и фаз. Изгоните Будоражащий Рефрен с тремя временными жетонами на нем.\\nОтсрочка 3 — {1}{R} (Вместо того, чтобы разыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {1}{R} и изгнать ее с тремя временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда удален последний временной жетон, разыграйте эту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5995c5a0-b857-42ab-aa35-fca9809cf09a\', \'multiverseId\': 518949}, \'multiverseid\': 518949}, {\'name\': \'醒神旋律\', \'text\': \'目标对手每有一张手牌，便加{R}。直到回合结束，你不会因步骤与阶段结束失去这份法术力。放逐醒神旋律，且上面有三个计时指示物。\\n延缓3～{1}{R}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{1}{R}并将它放逐，且上面有三个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8577a06-6abe-40cb-a247-fead253eec74\', \'multiverseId\': 519020}, \'multiverseid\': 519020}, {\'name\': \'醒神旋律\', \'text\': \'目標對手每有一張手牌，便加{R}。直到回合結束，你不會因步驟與階段結束失去這份魔法力。放逐醒神旋律，且上面有三个計時指示物。\\n延緩3～{1}{R}（除了從你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{1}{R}並將它放逐，且上面有三個計時指示物。在你的維持開始時，從其上移去一個計時指示物。當移去最後一個時，施放它且不需支付其魔法力費用。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b53c23bc-4e66-4348-8be4-dea9e4c35b04\', \'multiverseId\': 519091}, \'multiverseid\': 519091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitreißender Refrain\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge {R} für jede Karte auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlierst du dieses Mana nicht, sowie Segmente und Phasen enden. Schicke den Mitreißenden Refrain mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {1}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521732&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62363b80-ee11-4bb8-8c33-652fd1cb5225\', \'multiverseId\': 521732}, \'multiverseid\': 521732}, {\'name\': \'Estribillo estimulante\', \'text\': \'Agrega {R} por cada carta en la mano del oponente objetivo. Hasta el final del turno, no pierdes ese maná en cuanto terminan los pasos y las fases. Exilia el Estribillo estimulante con tres contadores de tiempo sobre él.\\nSuspender 3—{1}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30e3871-08f7-4db0-a8f2-f3c4c1f1c8bb\', \'multiverseId\': 521812}, \'multiverseid\': 521812}, {\'name\': \'Refrain entraînant\', \'text\': "Ajoutez {R} pour chaque carte dans la main d\'un adversaire ciblé. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous ne perdez pas ce mana au moment où les étapes et les phases se terminent. Exilez le Refrain entraînant avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur lui.\\nSuspension 3 — {1}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521892&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0008a5a-a5ed-497a-bcba-4f8729913612\', \'multiverseId\': 521892}, \'multiverseid\': 521892}, {\'name\': \'Ritornello Stimolante\', \'text\': \'Aggiungi {R} per ogni carta nella mano di un avversario bersaglio. Fino alla fine del turno, non perdi questo mana al termine di ogni fase o sottofase. Esilia il Ritornello Stimolante con tre segnalini tempo su di esso.\\nSospendere 3—{1}{R}\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d8d5fb2-541f-468c-aee4-2d753b091fff\', \'multiverseId\': 521972}, \'multiverseid\': 521972}, {\'name\': \'熱狂のリフレイン\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの手札にあるカード１枚につき{R}を加える。ターン終了時まで、このマナはステップやフェイズの終了に際して無くならない。熱狂のリフレインを時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機３―{1}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4c22ff-ba50-47cd-bce7-521cceb631cf\', \'multiverseId\': 522052}, \'multiverseid\': 522052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Moderranken-Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Helden der Vergangenheit nähren unseren Geist durch ihr Vorbild — und unsere Pflanzen durch ihren Verfall."\\n—Jeddeg, Philosoph der Gräber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732e437a-e9c2-443c-b306-d6e65e03d811\', \'multiverseId\': 519508}, \'multiverseid\': 519508}, {\'name\': \'Recuperación de las parramohosas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas muera, ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los héroes del pasado nutren nuestros espíritus con su ejemplo... y nuestras cosechas con su descomposición".\\n—Jeddeg, filósofo de las tumbas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7285da85-7738-4b40-878d-49eeab9110bb\', \'multiverseId\': 519756}, \'multiverseid\': 519756}, {\'name\': \'Reboisement de moiselierre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Les héros du passé nourrissent nos esprits de leur exemple... et nos champs par leur décomposition. »\\n—Jeddeg, philosophe des tombes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520004&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0492ec60-8618-4552-adea-bbcd5f4711dc\', \'multiverseId\': 520004}, \'multiverseid\': 520004}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicazione delle Liane Saprofaghe\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli eroi del passato nutrono i nostri spiriti con il loro esempio... e i nostri campi con la loro decomposizione."\\n—Jeddeg, filosofo sepolcrale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e1d77b-56a6-4763-8cb7-c75c8ad969be\', \'multiverseId\': 520252}, \'multiverseid\': 520252}, {\'name\': \'腐れ蔦の再生\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを得て、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「過去の英雄は模範により我々の精神を滋養し、また腐敗により我々の作物を滋養する。」\\n――墓の哲人、ジェデグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727ba677-5e47-43d1-83ee-11c4a01ef9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 520500}, \'multiverseid\': 520500}, {\'name\': \'Recuperação das Gavinhas Bolorentas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida e compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Os heróis do passado nutrem nossos espíritos pelo exemplo... e nossas safras pela decomposição."\\n— Jeddeg, filósofo dos túmulos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a62de2-65ee-493b-982c-20b6759886ee\', \'multiverseId\': 520748}, \'multiverseid\': 520748}, {\'name\': \'Притязания Гниющих Лоз\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь и берете карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Герои прошлого питают наш дух своим примером, а наш урожай — своим разложением».\\n— Джеддег, могильный философ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be3cc281-13da-4a5a-abae-83c35434600f\', \'multiverseId\': 520996}, \'multiverseid\': 520996}, {\'name\': \'腐蔓复碧\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「过往英雄的光辉事迹鼓舞我们精神，腐败肉身滋养我们成长。」\\n～墓地哲人杰葛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6880c39-d220-4334-9dd4-4c7520fcc192\', \'multiverseId\': 521244}, \'multiverseid\': 521244}, {\'name\': \'腐蔓復碧\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物死去時，你獲得1點生命且抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「過往英雄的光輝事蹟鼓舞我們精神，腐敗肉身滋養我們成長。」\\n～墓地哲人傑葛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa821111-03d4-4cd1-9c74-d725fad128fc\', \'multiverseId\': 521492}, \'multiverseid\': 521492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Monolog-Steuer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner seinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkt, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine unaufgeforderten Worte bereichern uns alle. Bitte, fahre fort."\\n—Yold, Professor für Kryptoreliktologie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518486&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94818dc0-72ad-4f84-a52f-72618aaaf1c9\', \'multiverseId\': 518486}, \'multiverseid\': 518486}, {\'name\': \'Precio del monólogo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance su segundo hechizo cada turno, creas una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"No solicitamos tus palabras, mas nos enriquecen. Continúa, por favor".\\n—Yold, profesor de criptorreliquiología\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a091afbe-f10a-47d4-b0ff-365da4bb29c6\', \'multiverseId\': 518557}, \'multiverseid\': 518557}, {\'name\': \'Taxe sur le monologue\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Vos paroles importunes nous enrichissent tous. Continuez. »\\n—Yold, professeur en cryptorelicologie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef72926-43bd-4b57-930c-d27fc124c16d\', \'multiverseId\': 518628}, \'multiverseid\': 518628}, {\'name\': \'Tassa del Monologo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia la sua seconda magia in ogni turno, tu crei una pedina Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le tue parole non richieste ci arricchiscono. Prego, continua."\\n—Yold, professore di criptoreliquiologia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1bcfb0c-7dc4-467e-869a-be221222a327\', \'multiverseId\': 518699}, \'multiverseid\': 518699}, {\'name\': \'独演の代償\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が各ターンの自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「君の無駄話は我々を豊かにしてくれる。そのまま続けたまえ。」\\n――秘遺物学の教授、ヨルド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5446c905-f26b-4c43-9957-26baf722b0af\', \'multiverseId\': 518770}, \'multiverseid\': 518770}, {\'name\': \'Taxa de Monólogo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente conjura sua segunda mágica a cada turno, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Você nos enriquece com suas palavras inoportunas. Por favor, continue."\\n— Yold, professor de criptorrelicologia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57b68606-46a5-477e-99f8-eb1374932c45\', \'multiverseId\': 518841}, \'multiverseid\': 518841}, {\'name\': \'Налог на Монолог\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда оппонент разыгрывает свое второе заклинание в каждом ходу, вы создаете одну фишку Клада.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Твои непрошеные слова нас всех обогащают. Не стесняйся, продолжай».\\n— Йолд, профессор криптореликвологии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259de13b-012c-44b4-bc70-c8ad0f4ba2ef\', \'multiverseId\': 518912}, \'multiverseid\': 518912}, {\'name\': \'赘言税\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放每回合中其第二个咒语时，你派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「你的自说自话让大家获益匪浅。务请继续。」\\n～古物密码学教授游尔德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee74f490-049d-411c-acc0-d58ac8079b47\', \'multiverseId\': 518983}, \'multiverseid\': 518983}, {\'name\': \'贅言稅\', \'text\': \'每當任一對手施放每回合中其第二個咒語時，你派出一個珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「您的自說自話讓大家獲益匪淺。務請繼續。」\\n～古物密碼學教授游爾德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ead5cb-47fe-4e38-a1d4-31cd8afec3b5\', \'multiverseId\': 519054}, \'multiverseid\': 519054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Monolog-Steuer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner seinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkt, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521695&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038fd6f1-fa39-48f1-90cc-b8b25c444308\', \'multiverseId\': 521695}, \'multiverseid\': 521695}, {\'name\': \'Precio del monólogo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance su segundo hechizo cada turno, creas una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d8add0-5497-47b1-b9eb-cc6769c67b77\', \'multiverseId\': 521775}, \'multiverseid\': 521775}, {\'name\': \'Taxe sur le monologue\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2014e4-de91-49ce-a1d7-6829850b002a\', \'multiverseId\': 521855}, \'multiverseid\': 521855}, {\'name\': \'Tassa del Monologo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia la sua seconda magia in ogni turno, tu crei una pedina Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61571173-086f-4239-8791-2450b020b624\', \'multiverseId\': 521935}, \'multiverseid\': 521935}, {\'name\': \'独演の代償\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が各ターンの自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86d7e8a-e5b7-40b3-8d38-0830cd5015ad\', \'multiverseId\': 522015}, \'multiverseid\': 522015}]', "[{'name': 'Mooswurz-Brücke', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Falls die Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, eine Gesamtstärke von 10 oder mehr haben, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519586&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '187a2f6f-cea0-46dc-9f6a-eaf64dc70bfc', 'multiverseId': 519586}, 'multiverseid': 519586}, {'name': 'Puente de hierba musgo', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza total de 10 o más.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519834&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49f0fb5b-f1a4-4c04-988a-615cca9c0a13', 'multiverseId': 519834}, 'multiverseid': 519834}, {'name': 'Pont de fangemousse', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{G}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force totale supérieure ou égale à 10.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520082&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afd62b02-86d9-46b3-af80-d31f76aa0911', 'multiverseId': 520082}, 'multiverseid': 520082}, {'name': 'Ponte Muscoso', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se le creature che controlli hanno una forza totale pari o superiore a 10.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520330&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb123aae-ab5c-4221-9c37-d62342ef1791', 'multiverseId': 520330}, 'multiverseid': 520330}, {'name': '苔汁の橋', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの合計が10以上であるなら、あなたはその追放されているカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520578&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5692bbd-8863-4869-8254-0b3d07f8ed70', 'multiverseId': 520578}, 'multiverseid': 520578}, {'name': 'Ponte Musgomosto', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se as criaturas que você controla tiverem poder total igual ou superior a 10.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520826&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00de405d-92a8-462c-872b-02f6a251ac7c', 'multiverseId': 520826}, 'multiverseid': 520826}, {'name': 'Мост Ползучего Мха', 'text': 'Укрытие (Эта земля выходит на поле битвы повернутой. Когда она это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\n{T}: добавьте {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: вы можете разыграть ту изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости, если суммарная сила существ под вашим контролем равна 10 или более.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521074&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcc9279b-2ea7-416c-9c18-51841900bb3a', 'multiverseId': 521074}, 'multiverseid': 521074}, {'name': '苔草桥', 'text': '掩蔽（此地须横置进战场。当它进战场时，检视你牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌置于你牌库底。）\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{G}，{T}：如果由你操控之生物的力量总和等于或大于10，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521322&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddd6000e-ec75-481a-a39a-4eebb1318b25', 'multiverseId': 521322}, 'multiverseid': 521322}, {'name': '苔草橋', 'text': '掩蔽（此地須橫置進戰場。當它進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌置於你牌庫底。）\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{G}，{T}：如果由你操控之生物的力量總和等於或大於10，則你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521570&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a329be42-d273-48e6-a2c9-66b51647d924', 'multiverseId': 521570}, 'multiverseid': 521570}]", '[{\'name\': \'Muse des Windgeflüsters\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die dich angreift und die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Stimme ist die der Rache, kalt und unbarmherzig."\\n—Akroma, rächender Engel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519394&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42af2218-c07d-464e-a5dd-d494b62ba594\', \'multiverseId\': 519394}, \'multiverseid\': 519394}, {\'name\': \'Musa nacida del viento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Su voz es justicia, clara e implacable".\\n—Akroma, vengadora angélica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30ea23f-0e5a-4051-ada5-cf72c4f530e6\', \'multiverseId\': 519642}, \'multiverseid\': 519642}, {\'name\': \'Muse née des vents\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Sa voix est celle de la justice, claire et implacable. »\\n—Akroma, vengeresse angélique\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cdd480f-8c7b-4106-87c1-3fc98558b450\', \'multiverseId\': 519890}, \'multiverseid\': 519890}, {\'name\': \'Musa Eologena\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLe creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua voce è la giustizia, chiara e implacabile."\\n—Akroma, vendicatrice angelica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad57417-c6f7-4883-8b51-8a036b3cb882\', \'multiverseId\': 520138}, \'multiverseid\': 520138}, {\'name\': \'風生まれの詩神\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたを攻撃しているクリーチャーの各コントローラーがそれぞれその１体につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、クリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の声は、正義であり純潔であり冷酷なのだ。」\\n――復讐の天使アクローマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'852e1038-b7bc-4732-8d72-677822da317e\', \'multiverseId\': 520386}, \'multiverseid\': 520386}, {\'name\': \'Musa Nascida do Vento\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs criaturas não podem atacá-lo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2} para cada criatura daquele controlador que está atacando você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"A voz dela é a justiça, clara e incansável."\\n— Akroma, vingadora angélica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a44c3964-9a6b-4940-8061-e6fe751645d2\', \'multiverseId\': 520634}, \'multiverseid\': 520634}, {\'name\': \'Муза, Рожденная из Ветра\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nСущества не могут атаковать вас, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {2} за каждое атакующее вас существо под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«Ее голос — это правосудие, четкое и беспощадное».\\n— Акрома, ангел-мстительница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ac0b5b-8678-4984-bdaf-b230b701e748\', \'multiverseId\': 520882}, \'multiverseid\': 520882}, {\'name\': \'风生谬思\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{2}，否则它不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「她的声音蕴含正义，清晰而不息。」\\n～雪仇天使爱若玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952cc3c8-af4f-46b8-9a01-c58c6f17b9ee\', \'multiverseId\': 521130}, \'multiverseid\': 521130}, {\'name\': \'風生謬思\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{2}，否則它不能攻擊你。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'「她的聲音蘊含正義，清晰而不息。」\\n～雪仇天使愛若瑪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc918c96-8153-426f-8c97-b8867ae907bb\', \'multiverseId\': 521378}, \'multiverseid\': 521378}]', '[{\'name\': \'Musenstrudel\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Nimm danach alle Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa1c6296-e193-4e72-b5e2-b2b5576fcffe\', \'multiverseId\': 518495}, \'multiverseid\': 518495}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice de ensueño\', \'text\': \'Exilia las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, pon las cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b868e1c0-3394-46b6-b016-8a3175ded008\', \'multiverseId\': 518566}, \'multiverseid\': 518566}, {\'name\': \'Vortex de muse\', \'text\': "Exilez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez ensuite les cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518637&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cfcb98-60d1-43da-9bf9-f298e2b3b2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 518637}, \'multiverseid\': 518637}, {\'name\': \'Vortice Ispiratore\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelta tra esse senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi aggiungi alla tua mano le carte istantaneo e stregoneria esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20330b25-58e3-45ff-a76c-6a6dd99cc64d\', \'multiverseId\': 518708}, \'multiverseid\': 518708}, {\'name\': \'詩神の渦\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードＸ枚を追放する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下でインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、これにより追放して唱えなかった、インスタントやソーサリーであるすべてのカードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ddb0567-454b-4395-aa4e-ae0e854df90e\', \'multiverseId\': 518779}, \'multiverseid\': 518779}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice da Musa\', \'text\': \'Exile os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X dentre eles sem pagar seu custo de mana. Depois, coloque os cards de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço exilados que não foram conjurados dessa forma em sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6457ea9a-3900-4bac-8e74-e07c8f96a0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 518850}, \'multiverseid\': 518850}, {\'name\': \'Вихрь Вдохновения\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть находящееся среди них мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства с мановой ценностью не более X без уплаты его мана-стоимости. Затем положите изгнанные карты мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства, не разыгранные таким образом, в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38cf0853-db97-42ac-a7d6-969887a1cdb3\', \'multiverseId\': 518921}, \'multiverseid\': 518921}, {\'name\': \'思灵漩涡\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以从其中施放一个法术力值等于或小于X的瞬间或法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后将所有以此法放逐且未施放的瞬间和法术牌置于你手上，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8d4db1-9b13-4d5f-9a09-0e4168326e82\', \'multiverseId\': 518992}, \'multiverseid\': 518992}, {\'name\': \'思靈漩渦\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌庫頂的X張牌。你可以從其中施放一個魔法力值等於或小於X的瞬間或巫術咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。然後將所有以此法放逐且未施放的瞬間和巫術牌置於你手上，其餘則以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834ac32b-5f04-4bc4-8711-01bc720d3128\', \'multiverseId\': 519063}, \'multiverseid\': 519063}]', '[{\'name\': \'Musenstrudel\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Nimm danach alle Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521704&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f0c6e8-29c1-4dbc-b639-581c6a9d5668\', \'multiverseId\': 521704}, \'multiverseid\': 521704}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice de ensueño\', \'text\': \'Exilia las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, pon las cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d43c95-0c5d-494e-85f4-e942ad27adbf\', \'multiverseId\': 521784}, \'multiverseid\': 521784}, {\'name\': \'Vortex de muse\', \'text\': "Exilez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez ensuite les cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aaaf601-1f57-44ef-a5b5-d383646ccd1c\', \'multiverseId\': 521864}, \'multiverseid\': 521864}, {\'name\': \'Vortice Ispiratore\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X scelta tra esse senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi aggiungi alla tua mano le carte istantaneo e stregoneria esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b25c1467-86b5-4780-99f0-0ab113ac0357\', \'multiverseId\': 521944}, \'multiverseid\': 521944}, {\'name\': \'詩神の渦\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードＸ枚を追放する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下でインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、これにより追放して唱えなかった、インスタントやソーサリーであるすべてのカードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e58af0a-a514-4133-84df-d45910506483\', \'multiverseId\': 522024}, \'multiverseid\': 522024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mutierende Biomasse\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Rückschritt zu uralten Erscheinungsformen? Ein kurzer Blick auf künftige Evolutionen? Oder eine flüchtige Veränderung der Gegenwart?"\\n—Vorel von der Hülsenklade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb4b2f39-16ee-4d16-9fa5-878ce583fbec\', \'multiverseId\': 519492}, \'multiverseid\': 519492}, {\'name\': \'Mutación de la biomasa\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de X/X hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Una regresión a las viejas costumbres? ¿Un indicio de evoluciones futuras? ¿O una fugaz alteración del presente?".\\n—Vorel del Clado de la Vaina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d103ef5a-2bfe-4a97-b893-35d9b33bad4d\', \'multiverseId\': 519740}, \'multiverseid\': 519740}, {\'name\': \'Mutation de biomasse\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de X/X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Régression vers d\'anciennes formes ? Avant-goût d\'évolutions futures ? Ou altération fugace de l\'instant présent ? »\\n—Vorel du Cladus Coque", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519988&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeba7135-ea7f-44ae-98d0-4772be0cef6d\', \'multiverseId\': 519988}, \'multiverseid\': 519988}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione della Biomassa\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno forza e costituzione base X/X fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una regressione ad antiche forme? Un assaggio di evoluzioni future? O un\\\'instabile alterazione del presente?"\\n—Vorel del Clade del Carapace\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e91fb6-db7a-4252-95b0-2ea4d7429a68\', \'multiverseId\': 520236}, \'multiverseid\': 520236}, {\'name\': \'生体料の突然変異\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーの基本のパワーとタフネスはＸ/Ｘになる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「太古の姿への先祖返りか？来たる進化の兆候か？それとも現在が束の間の変化を見せているのか？」\\n――育殻組のヴォレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a388bc9b-eb34-4846-abaa-35a1f7177ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 520484}, \'multiverseid\': 520484}, {\'name\': \'Mutação de Biomassa\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm poder e resistência básicos X/X até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma regressão a formas antigas? Um lampejo de evoluções futuras? Ou uma alteração efêmera do presente?"\\n— Vorel da Cepa do Casco\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49552acb-d648-4493-839e-527adf549bac\', \'multiverseId\': 520732}, \'multiverseid\': 520732}, {\'name\': \'Мутация Биомассы\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем имеют базовую силу и выносливость X/X до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Возвращение к старым видам? Пример будущих эволюций? Или просто мимолетное изменение настоящего?»\\n— Ворел из Клады Оболочки\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd101db9-d008-45bc-b352-b264b68ac259\', \'multiverseId\': 520980}, \'multiverseid\': 520980}, {\'name\': \'巨量突变\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物之基础力量与防御力为X/X直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「退化为古老形态？窥见未来进化？或是将现在短暂改变？」\\n～壳进化组的沃瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa854c53-e072-4208-8c8d-620a8b853a56\', \'multiverseId\': 521228}, \'multiverseid\': 521228}, {\'name\': \'巨量突變\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物之基礎力量與防禦力為X/X直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「退化為古老形態？窺見未來進化？或是將現在短暫改變？」\\n～殼進化組的沃瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab2f41c-d31b-466d-bc94-8390df51dacd\', \'multiverseId\': 521476}, \'multiverseid\': 521476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mycosynth-Urquell\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Mycosynth-Urquell ins Spiel kommt oder aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Öl erzeugte das Mycosynth. Das Mycosynth erzeugte das Neue Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c1c4ac-5156-41b4-a8b1-ed9284d067d4\', \'multiverseId\': 519535}, \'multiverseid\': 519535}, {\'name\': \'Manantial de micosintético\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Manantial de micosintético entre al campo de batalla o vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El aceite creó el micosintético. El micosintético creó Nueva Pirexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f12819a-1149-41b5-9c85-11399f6ea813\', \'multiverseId\': 519783}, \'multiverseid\': 519783}, {\'name\': \'Source de mycosynthèse\', \'text\': \'Quand la Source de mycosynthèse arrive sur le champ de bataille ou est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Le pétrole créa la mycosynthèse. La mycosynthèse créa la Nouvelle Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520031&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687f1b2b-9eb5-486d-899b-9eaed21c64db\', \'multiverseId\': 520031}, \'multiverseid\': 520031}, {\'name\': \'Sorgente di Micosinti\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sorgente di Micosinti entra nel campo di battaglia o viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'olio creò i micosinti. I micosinti crearono la Nuova Phyrexia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f308b2-a616-4cad-8a3a-6aff8f0cc31d\', \'multiverseId\': 520279}, \'multiverseid\': 520279}, {\'name\': \'マイコシンスの水源\', \'text\': \'マイコシンスの水源が戦場に出たか戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'油はマイコシンスを生み出した。マイコシンスは新ファイレクシアを生み出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5389c1cb-624c-4673-ac9d-af76cc5ccaa2\', \'multiverseId\': 520527}, \'multiverseid\': 520527}, {\'name\': \'Fonte do Micossintetizador\', \'text\': \'Quando Fonte do Micossintetizador entra no campo de batalha ou é colocado num cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo em sua mão e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O óleo criou o micossintetizador. O micossintetizador criou a Nova Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5338f257-053b-4e88-a26f-26f496ee0bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 520775}, \'multiverseid\': 520775}, {\'name\': \'Источник Микосинтов\', \'text\': \'Когда Источник Микосинтов выходит на поле битвы или попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, показать ее, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Масло сотворило микосинты. Микосинты сотворили Новую Фирексию.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d41315b-16e3-4760-b42d-ada566f8008f\', \'multiverseId\': 521023}, \'multiverseid\': 521023}, {\'name\': \'构生菌涌泉\', \'text\': \'当构生菌涌泉进战场或从战场进入坟墓场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'烁油带来构生菌。构生菌带来新非瑞克西亚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548392a0-a662-4563-b697-580cc2833962\', \'multiverseId\': 521271}, \'multiverseid\': 521271}, {\'name\': \'構生菌湧泉\', \'text\': \'當構生菌湧泉進戰場或從戰場進入墳墓場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'爍油帶來構生菌。構生菌帶來新非瑞克西亞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7b40a3-575f-4a0b-9481-4c2ee0fcf9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 521519}, \'multiverseid\': 521519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Myr-Kampfkugel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 farblose Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nImmer wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel angreift, kannst du X ungetappte Myr, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Myr-Kampfkugel +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges und fügt dem Spieler oder Planeswalker, den sie angreift, X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Myr, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c291966a-7fd9-4980-98e3-d49ec87971d1\', \'multiverseId\': 519536}, \'multiverseid\': 519536}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de batalla myr\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Esfera de batalla myr entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura artefacto Myr incoloras 1/1.\\nSiempre que la Esfera de batalla myr ataque, puedes girar X Myr enderezados que controlas. Si lo haces, la Esfera de batalla myr obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno y hace X puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker al que está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e43a9f-9b3b-4510-9482-8e111bdcc8bc\', \'multiverseId\': 519784}, \'multiverseid\': 519784}, {\'name\': \'Sphère de bataille myr\', \'text\': "Quand la Sphère de bataille myr arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Sphère de bataille myr attaque, vous pouvez engager X myrs dégagés que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, la Sphère de bataille myr gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et inflige X blessures au joueur ou planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : myr et construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520032&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1316be2b-f761-4656-889d-edf32ed65de1\', \'multiverseId\': 520032}, \'multiverseid\': 520032}, {\'name\': \'Sfera da Battaglia Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sfera da Battaglia Myr entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura artefatto Myr 1/1 incolori.\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfera da Battaglia Myr attacca, puoi TAPpare X Myr STAPpati che controlli. Se lo fai, la Sfera da Battaglia Myr prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno e infligge X danni al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57f0fc4-2899-4495-9af1-63a9f977bc5e\', \'multiverseId\': 520280}, \'multiverseid\': 520280}, {\'name\': \'マイアの戦闘球\', \'text\': \'マイアの戦闘球が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。\\nマイアの戦闘球が攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態のマイアＸ体をタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、マイアの戦闘球は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受け、これが攻撃しているプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア・構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3905969-687d-428e-90d2-6d2854900330\', \'multiverseId\': 520528}, \'multiverseid\': 520528}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de Batalha Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando Esfera de Batalha Myr entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura artefato Myr incolor 1/1.\\nToda vez que Esfera de Batalha Myr ataca, você pode virar X Myr desvirados que você controla. Se fizer isso, Esfera de Batalha Myr receberá +X/+0 até o final do turno e causará X pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Myr Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ff6a02-f801-4f8d-ad8c-e574f1c38cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 520776}, \'multiverseid\': 520776}, {\'name\': \'Боевой Шар Миэров\', \'text\': "Когда Боевой Шар Миэров выходит на поле битвы, создайте четыре фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Миэр.\\nКаждый раз, когда Боевой Шар Миэров атакует, вы можете повернуть X неповернутых Миэров под вашим контролем. Если вы это делаете, Боевой Шар Миэров получает +X/+0 до конца хода и наносит X повреждений игроку или planeswalker\'у, которого атакует.", \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Миэр Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a250e0-586c-4d56-ae54-8587bcd19915\', \'multiverseId\': 521024}, \'multiverseid\': 521024}, {\'name\': \'秘耳斗球\', \'text\': \'当秘耳斗球进战场时，派出四个1/1无色秘耳衍生神器生物。\\n每当秘耳斗球攻击时，你可以横置X个由你操控且未横置的秘耳。若你如此作，则秘耳斗球得+X/+0直到回合结束，并对其所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～秘耳／组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cd78f26-32d2-4cca-9a34-0c377e8b2901\', \'multiverseId\': 521272}, \'multiverseid\': 521272}, {\'name\': \'秘耳鬥球\', \'text\': \'當秘耳鬥球進戰場時，派出四個1/1無色秘耳衍生神器生物。\\n每當秘耳鬥球攻擊時，你可以橫置X個由你操控且未橫置的秘耳。若你如此作，則秘耳鬥球得+X/+0直到回合結束，並對其所攻擊的玩家或鵬洛客造成X點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～秘耳／組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b75f54-6391-4e5f-9f66-293abcdf7f59\', \'multiverseId\': 521520}, \'multiverseid\': 521520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtstahl-Mutation\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur ist eine Insekt-Artefaktkreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 0/1. Sie hat Unzerstörbarkeit und verliert alle anderen Fähigkeiten, Kartentypen und Kreaturentypen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Unendlich machtlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111530c9-2c48-483f-abcc-f237360547ae\', \'multiverseId\': 519370}, \'multiverseid\': 519370}, {\'name\': \'Mutación de acero oscuro\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada es una criatura artefacto Insecto con fuerza y resistencia base de 0/1, tiene la habilidad de indestructible y pierde todas sus otras habilidades, tipos de carta y tipos de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Infinitamente inofensiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8763006a-711e-4248-906b-423368186347\', \'multiverseId\': 519618}, \'multiverseid\': 519618}, {\'name\': \'Mutation de sombracier\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée est une créature-artefact Insecte avec une force et une endurance de base de 0/1 et elle a l\'indestructible. Elle perd toutes ses autres capacités, ses types de carte et types de créature.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Infiniment impuissante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bab6f53-0f79-411f-ac0c-669d7c871171\', \'multiverseId\': 519866}, \'multiverseid\': 519866}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione di Darksteel\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata è una creatura artefatto Insetto con forza e costituzione base 0/1, ha indistruttibile e perde tutte le altre abilità, i tipi di carta e i tipi di creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Senza il benché minimo potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c7f796-f0fd-49a2-a1ac-2c3bee93d476\', \'multiverseId\': 520114}, \'multiverseid\': 520114}, {\'name\': \'ダークスティールの突然変異\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、破壊不能を持ち基本のパワーとタフネスが０/１の昆虫・アーティファクト・クリーチャーであり、その他すべての能力、カード・タイプ、クリーチャー・タイプを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'際限なき無力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e23b74-edb7-4a0e-a363-88374b4ddedd\', \'multiverseId\': 520362}, \'multiverseid\': 520362}, {\'name\': \'Mutação de Aço Negro\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada é uma criatura artefato Inseto com poder e resistência básicos 0/1, tem indestrutível e perde todas as outras habilidades, tipos de card e tipos de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Infinitamente impotente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ec0652-7d54-48cd-aac9-49e9b7d5e354\', \'multiverseId\': 520610}, \'multiverseid\': 520610}, {\'name\': \'Мутация Темной Стали\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо является артефактом существом Насекомое с базовыми силой и выносливостью 0/1, имеет Неразрушимость и теряет все другие способности, типы карты и типы существа.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Бесконечно бессильна.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be31b59-4985-464d-98b4-8e065692dff8\', \'multiverseId\': 520858}, \'multiverseid\': 520858}, {\'name\': \'玄铁异变\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物是昆虫神器生物，其基础力量与防御力为0/1，具有不灭异能，且失去所有其他异能、牌张类别和生物类别。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'无力至极。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce15ce45-8c04-41b8-9930-94cebcea7dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 521106}, \'multiverseid\': 521106}, {\'name\': \'玄鐵異變\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物是昆蟲神器生物，其基礎力量與防禦力為0/1，具有不滅異能，且失去所有其他異能、牌張類別與生物類別。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'無力至極。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c754119-3b81-41dd-b449-895c268f524e\', \'multiverseId\': 521354}, \'multiverseid\': 521354}]', "[{'name': 'Nachtstahl-Zitadelle', 'text': 'Unzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.', 'type': 'Artefakt, Land', 'flavor': 'Bauten aus Nachtstahl werden weder durch Angriffe noch durch Alterung geschwächt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519568&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1b4c646-b1c4-491e-b3ee-d7df341ae8f1', 'multiverseId': 519568}, 'multiverseid': 519568}, {'name': 'Ciudadela de acero oscuro', 'text': 'Indestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.', 'type': 'Tierra artefacto', 'flavor': 'Las estructuras construidas con acero oscuro no ceden ante el asalto ni ante el paso del tiempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519816&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d45ea4e-0681-45f7-9830-f43cfc42c583', 'multiverseId': 519816}, 'multiverseid': 519816}, {'name': 'Citadelle de sombracier', 'text': 'Indestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.', 'type': 'Terrain-artefact', 'flavor': 'Les édifices en sombracier défient les assauts et le temps.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520064&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83d250b7-1c38-4770-b30c-96ee3bc5be35', 'multiverseId': 520064}, 'multiverseid': 520064}, {'name': 'Roccaforte di Darksteel', 'text': 'Indistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.', 'type': 'Terra Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Le strutture di darksteel sono impervie sia agli attacchi sia al passare del tempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520312&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73604b1b-8ad1-4205-b4ef-dbf00c26b862', 'multiverseId': 520312}, 'multiverseid': 520312}, {'name': 'ダークスティールの城塞', 'text': '破壊不能\\n{T}：{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・土地', 'flavor': 'ダークスティールで造られた構造物は、攻撃にも年月にも屈することはない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520560&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '916e9213-23c9-43da-b31b-18dd2f6e45db', 'multiverseId': 520560}, 'multiverseid': 520560}, {'name': 'Cidadela de Aço Negro', 'text': 'Indestrutível\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.', 'type': 'Terreno Artefato', 'flavor': 'As estruturas construídas com aço negro não cedem a ataques nem ao tempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520808&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5348ad6-2a78-4dde-9485-603449b26053', 'multiverseId': 520808}, 'multiverseid': 520808}, {'name': 'Цитадель Темной Стали', 'text': 'Неразрушимость\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.', 'type': 'Артефакт Земля', 'flavor': 'Строения из темной стали неподвластны ни осадам, ни времени.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521056&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6de02b27-da5a-4411-b81c-1f0db037e562', 'multiverseId': 521056}, 'multiverseid': 521056}, {'name': '玄铁殿堂', 'text': '不灭\\n{T}：加{C}。', 'type': '神器地', 'flavor': '玄铁所建之物，不受战事侵袭，不留岁月痕迹。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521304&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad45e5f7-417c-4cff-a728-446996af3223', 'multiverseId': 521304}, 'multiverseid': 521304}, {'name': '玄鐵殿堂', 'text': '不滅\\n{T}：加{C}。', 'type': '神器地', 'flavor': '玄鐵所建之物，不受戰事侵襲，不留歲月痕跡。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521552&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cddbd8e-af8d-468b-ba2f-1d5925c7fc80', 'multiverseId': 521552}, 'multiverseid': 521552}]", '[{\'name\': \'Naru Meha, die Meisterzauberin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn Naru Meha, die Meisterzauberin, ins Spiel kommt, kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl, den bzw. die du kontrollierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nAndere Zauberer, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519407&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77782852-e867-4e97-88cf-1e5e321c2119\', \'multiverseId\': 519407}, \'multiverseid\': 519407}, {\'name\': \'Naru Meha, maga experta\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando Naru Meha, maga experta entre al campo de batalla, copia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo que controlas. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nLos otros Hechiceros que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb903759-a0f1-4c13-b46a-b7395e98f382\', \'multiverseId\': 519655}, \'multiverseid\': 519655}, {\'name\': \'Naru Meha, maître sorcier\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand Naru Meha, maître sorcier arrive sur le champ de bataille, copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nLes autres sorciers que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33d7ef71-044f-48e0-a5c6-69ff540b779a\', \'multiverseId\': 519903}, \'multiverseid\': 519903}, {\'name\': \'Naru Meha, Maga Insegnante\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando Naru Meha, Maga Insegnante entra nel campo di battaglia, copia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio che controlli. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nGli altri Maghi che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf9288f-0c8f-4904-bf79-6d4f2505735d\', \'multiverseId\': 520151}, \'multiverseid\': 520151}, {\'name\': \'練達の魔術師、ナル・メハ\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n練達の魔術師、ナル・メハが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてインスタントかソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nこれ以外であなたがコントロールしているすべてのウィザードは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b49b0140-125b-4e7c-bc7b-5b261ba19ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 520399}, \'multiverseid\': 520399}, {\'name\': \'Naru Meha, Maga Mestra\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Naru Meha, Maga Mestra, entrar no campo de batalha, copie a mágica instantânea ou o feitiço alvo que você controla. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\nOs outros Magos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9290390a-ec55-4836-bc49-8da4241ca30d\', \'multiverseId\': 520647}, \'multiverseid\': 520647}, {\'name\': \'Нару Меха, Верховная Волшебница\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Нару Меха, Верховная Волшебница выходит на поле битвы, скопируйте целевое мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства под вашим контролем. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\\nДругие Чародеи под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e70c40-f9a9-4559-bffa-a3e7829d25e1\', \'multiverseId\': 520895}, \'multiverseid\': 520895}, {\'name\': \'魔法大师娜鲁梅哈\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当魔法大师娜鲁梅哈进战场时，复制目标由你操控的瞬间或法术咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n由你操控的其他法术师得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e38924-a4de-417b-9d9b-13f6623f8411\', \'multiverseId\': 521143}, \'multiverseid\': 521143}, {\'name\': \'魔法大師娜魯梅哈\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當魔法大師娜魯梅哈進戰場時，複製目標由你操控的瞬間或巫術咒語。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\\n由你操控的其他魔法師得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8bb7e1-c49f-4e8a-8781-d7752bd461bc\', \'multiverseId\': 521391}, \'multiverseid\': 521391}]', '[{\'name\': \'Neu deuten\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du kannst einen Zauberspruch mit gleichem oder kleineren Manabetrag aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit ein wenig mehr Fingerspitzengefühl könnte deine Arbeit wirklich spektakulär sein. Lass es mich dir zeigen."\\n—Nassari, Dekan der Prismari-Fakultät\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a81f8b79-6a7e-49b2-aeb0-1649ae2f59d9\', \'multiverseId\': 518540}, \'multiverseid\': 518540}, {\'name\': \'Reinterpretar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de tu mano con valor de maná igual o menor sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu obra podría ser espectacular si tuviese un poco más de estilo. Mira, así".\\n—Nassari, decana de Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a778849-ebe4-4582-be3d-b89b586c8fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 518611}, \'multiverseid\': 518611}, {\'name\': \'Réinterpréter\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Cela manque un tout petit peu de verve, mais votre travail pourrait être spectaculaire. Laissez-moi vous montrer. »\\n—Nassari, doyen de Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518682&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e268de-2b82-4e63-977b-a2013b22e7d8\', \'multiverseId\': 518682}, \'multiverseid\': 518682}, {\'name\': \'Reinterpretare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Puoi lanciare una magia con un valore di mana pari o inferiore dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Con il giusto tocco di stile, il tuo lavoro potrebbe essere davvero magnifico. Lascia che ti mostri."\\n—Nassari, decano di Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ec73d7-9756-4c1d-9fed-758e3b157ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 518753}, \'multiverseid\': 518753}, {\'name\': \'再解釈\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。あなたはあなたの手札からマナ総量がそれ以下の呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「少々手を加えるだけで、この作品は素晴らしいものになる。見ていなさい。」\\n――プリズマリの学部長、ナサーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'009fa4ce-fe7f-49eb-bf03-d015f3ff5678\', \'multiverseId\': 518824}, \'multiverseid\': 518824}, {\'name\': \'Reinterpretar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Você pode conjurar uma mágica com valor de mana igual ou inferior sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Com um pouco mais de estilo seu trabalho seria realmente espetacular. Permita-me demonstrar."\\n— Nassari, decano de Prismari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aa0ccf1-31a6-41d4-bad8-9732ed1554a4\', \'multiverseId\': 518895}, \'multiverseid\': 518895}, {\'name\': \'Реинтерпретация\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Вы можете разыграть заклинание с такой же или меньшей мановой ценностью из вашей руки без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Немножко украсить, и твоя работа станет по-настоящему зрелищной. Давай я покажу».\\n— Нассари, декан Призмари\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667e63e0-5aa0-4345-80aa-03b6bb0caace\', \'multiverseId\': 518966}, \'multiverseid\': 518966}, {\'name\': \'重新诠释\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值相等或较小的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「只需再多加些许天分，你的作品定能精彩绝伦。这就让你看看。」\\n～粹丽院长纳撒理\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb40571-1a70-4e08-bad8-e80519b4f161\', \'multiverseId\': 519037}, \'multiverseid\': 519037}, {\'name\': \'重新詮釋\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。你可以從你手上施放一個魔法力值相等或較小的咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「只需再多加些許天分，你的作品定能精彩絕倫。這就讓你看看。」\\n～粹麗院長納撒理\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ff544e-4852-4d2c-80cd-1c8db9f746a3\', \'multiverseId\': 519108}, \'multiverseid\': 519108}]', "[{'name': 'Neu deuten', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du kannst einen Zauberspruch mit gleichem oder kleineren Manabetrag aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521749&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fed73b02-c290-4e11-8c4f-d57f92840a26', 'multiverseId': 521749}, 'multiverseid': 521749}, {'name': 'Reinterpretar', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de tu mano con valor de maná igual o menor sin pagar su coste de maná.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521829&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26fccea6-ba29-47c3-a77f-50d9391469dd', 'multiverseId': 521829}, 'multiverseid': 521829}, {'name': 'Réinterpréter', 'text': 'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Vous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521909&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1517c366-0578-402a-a326-d1b45a9e035c', 'multiverseId': 521909}, 'multiverseid': 521909}, {'name': 'Reinterpretare', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Puoi lanciare una magia con un valore di mana pari o inferiore dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521989&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3962658-c169-43aa-9e65-f775870fa23c', 'multiverseId': 521989}, 'multiverseid': 521989}, {'name': '再解釈', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。あなたはあなたの手札からマナ総量がそれ以下の呪文１つをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522069&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa35e558-2d60-4ae3-9330-508b308038f0', 'multiverseId': 522069}, 'multiverseid': 522069}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nils, Hüter der Disziplin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments bestimmst du für jeden Spieler bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, und legst eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\\nJede Kreatur, auf der mindestens eine Marke liegt, kann weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {X}, wobei X die Anzahl an Marken auf der Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cea892a-c7dd-448b-beb0-19cb97a0ccf4\', \'multiverseId\': 518487}, \'multiverseid\': 518487}, {\'name\': \'Nils, ejecutor de la disciplina\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, por cada jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\nCada criatura con uno o más contadores sobre ella no puede atacarte a ti o a los planeswalkers que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {X}, donde X es la cantidad de contadores sobre esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f678cd-ac7f-4d17-82b4-5d59827fdaca\', \'multiverseId\': 518558}, \'multiverseid\': 518558}, {\'name\': \'Nils, argousin de la discipline\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, pour chaque joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\nChaque créature avec au moins un marqueur sur elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {X}, X étant le nombre de marqueurs sur cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a75e27ac-f84c-446e-a41e-a5ff73134bdb\', \'multiverseId\': 518629}, \'multiverseid\': 518629}, {\'name\': \'Nils, Tutore della Disciplina\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, per ogni giocatore, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\nOgni creatura con uno o più segnalini non può attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {X}, dove X è il numero di segnalini su quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c297a0-6fbc-4d74-8b96-7f9f33905e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 518700}, \'multiverseid\': 518700}, {\'name\': \'規律の執行者、ニルス\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nカウンター１個以上が置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それのコントローラーが{X}を支払わないかぎり、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。Ｘはそのクリーチャーの上に置かれているカウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e518759d-a0fd-4cad-bd59-9f7b514071b5\', \'multiverseId\': 518771}, \'multiverseid\': 518771}, {\'name\': \'Nils, Impositor da Disciplina\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, para cada jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla.\\nCada criatura com um marcador ou mais não pode atacar você nem planeswalkers que você controla, a menos que seu controlador pague {X}, sendo X o número de marcadores naquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a9d357-0401-4f7f-b72f-d3c00a666797\', \'multiverseId\': 518842}, \'multiverseid\': 518842}, {\'name\': \'Нильс, Блюститель Дисциплины\', \'text\': "В начале вашего заключительного шага для каждого игрока положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо под контролем того игрока.\\nКаждое существо с одним или несколькими жетонами на нем не может атаковать вас или planeswalker\'ов под вашим контролем, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {X}, где X — количество жетонов на том существе.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119cb6cf-ad89-482c-88f5-bd2e5c7f8746\', \'multiverseId\': 518913}, \'multiverseid\': 518913}, {\'name\': \'规纪巡查倪尔兹\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，为每位牌手各进行以下流程～在至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n对每个其上有一个或更多指示物的生物而言，除非其操控者支付{X}，否则它不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客，X为该生物上的指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7a2fbe-abf0-490a-8515-1daac78cf110\', \'multiverseId\': 518984}, \'multiverseid\': 518984}, {\'name\': \'規紀巡查倪爾茲\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，為每位玩家各進行以下流程～在至多一個目標由該玩家操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n對每個其上有一個或更多指示物的生物而言，除非其操控者支付{X}，否則它不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客，X為該生物上的指示物數量。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda4a5a2-c17d-4126-a285-8ceb3a1e7a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 519055}, \'multiverseid\': 519055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nils, Hüter der Disziplin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments bestimmst du für jeden Spieler bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, und legst eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\\nJede Kreatur, auf der mindestens eine Marke liegt, kann weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {X}, wobei X die Anzahl an Marken auf der Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521696&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb167f74-c799-41ca-a8fc-7642b691dadd\', \'multiverseId\': 521696}, \'multiverseid\': 521696}, {\'name\': \'Nils, ejecutor de la disciplina\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, por cada jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\nCada criatura con uno o más contadores sobre ella no puede atacarte a ti o a los planeswalkers que controlas a menos que su controlador pague {X}, donde X es la cantidad de contadores sobre esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ba13c3-fcec-49ff-b650-9c39752696a0\', \'multiverseId\': 521776}, \'multiverseid\': 521776}, {\'name\': \'Nils, argousin de la discipline\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, pour chaque joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\nChaque créature avec au moins un marqueur sur elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {X}, X étant le nombre de marqueurs sur cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521856&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fcd404-b906-410d-9d3a-0c2391c7aeb5\', \'multiverseId\': 521856}, \'multiverseid\': 521856}, {\'name\': \'Nils, Tutore della Disciplina\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, per ogni giocatore, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\nOgni creatura con uno o più segnalini non può attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {X}, dove X è il numero di segnalini su quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58c0916-6d03-4cbc-bb54-1cac011b19ab\', \'multiverseId\': 521936}, \'multiverseid\': 521936}, {\'name\': \'規律の執行者、ニルス\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nカウンター１個以上が置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それのコントローラーが{X}を支払わないかぎり、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。Ｘはそのクリーチャーの上に置かれているカウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc8e3ab-ec19-4963-86ef-584a217369ef\', \'multiverseId\': 522016}, \'multiverseid\': 522016}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nissas Erneuerung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach. Du erhältst 7 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem sie wieder mit der Welt verbunden war, spürte Nissa, wie Zendikars Macht sie durchströmte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519484&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe20726b-f4d6-460c-a9aa-ac0f9646d37c\', \'multiverseId\': 519484}, \'multiverseid\': 519484}, {\'name\': \'Renovación de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja. Ganas 7 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una vez restablecida su conexión con el plano, Nissa sintió que el poder de Zendikar vibraba a través de ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c09138c8-886d-44f1-a401-c88bdd63b72e\', \'multiverseId\': 519732}, \'multiverseid\': 519732}, {\'name\': \'Renouveau de Nissa\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez. Vous gagnez 7 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'De nouveau connectée au plan, Nissa sentit la puissance de Zendikar déferler en elle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519980&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8537d7c-7ff1-42bf-83dd-c2d98422aa19\', \'multiverseId\': 519980}, \'multiverseid\': 519980}, {\'name\': \'Rinnovamento di Nissa\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola. Guadagni 7 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo aver recuperato il suo legame con il piano, Nissa sentì il potere di Zendikar crescere dentro di lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d986d8-451f-4cc1-861b-08cf7c894f5f\', \'multiverseId\': 520228}, \'multiverseid\': 520228}, {\'name\': \'ニッサの復興\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。あなたは７点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼女と次元の繋がりが回復し、ゼンディカーの活力が自身を通じて湧き出すのをニッサは感じた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea7abb7-ac98-4ea2-951e-981b0c9c80d4\', \'multiverseId\': 520476}, \'multiverseid\': 520476}, {\'name\': \'Renovação de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Procure até três cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe. Você ganha 7 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Com sua ligação com o plano restaurada, Nissa sentiu o poder de Zendikar invadi-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ded2cc7-f675-48d0-b419-2a971a784bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 520724}, \'multiverseid\': 520724}, {\'name\': \'Обновление Ниссы\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более трех карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте библиотеку. Вы получаете 7 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Нисса чувствовала, как течет через нее сила Зендикара. Ее связь с землей восстановилась.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5aa373-f275-4e29-8437-190f28432f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 520972}, \'multiverseid\': 520972}, {\'name\': \'妮莎重光\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。你获得7点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'妮莎恢复与赞迪卡的联系之后，她感受到时空力量在她全身翻腾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f00788-88ea-4b19-8053-d46752141538\', \'multiverseId\': 521220}, \'multiverseid\': 521220}, {\'name\': \'妮莎重光\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多三張基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。你獲得7點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'妮莎恢復與贊迪卡的聯繫之後，她感受到時空力量在她全身翻騰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84689f31-d06e-404c-9053-f56502a67106\', \'multiverseId\': 521468}, \'multiverseid\': 521468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nissas Expedition\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0902942-db1e-43af-b4c5-0c6d27ac5851\', \'multiverseId\': 519483}, \'multiverseid\': 519483}, {\'name\': \'Expedición de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4364e0c-d6bf-4510-9b86-41023b19ea27\', \'multiverseId\': 519731}, \'multiverseid\': 519731}, {\'name\': \'Expédition de Nissa\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519979&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e71bc2-7eae-4d30-9e5f-30e0ae943f17\', \'multiverseId\': 519979}, \'multiverseid\': 519979}, {\'name\': \'Spedizione di Nissa\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82b7225-347e-461d-a802-af0257806ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 520227}, \'multiverseid\': 520227}, {\'name\': \'ニッサの探検\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5334f13f-3350-4030-a694-688661462dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 520475}, \'multiverseid\': 520475}, {\'name\': \'Expedição de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nProcure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34781ac4-b44c-4aef-8e44-d2b9ca84595b\', \'multiverseId\': 520723}, \'multiverseid\': 520723}, {\'name\': \'Экспедиция Ниссы\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88cce757-89f3-431a-b679-ec8436de1284\', \'multiverseId\': 520971}, \'multiverseid\': 520971}, {\'name\': \'妮莎的探险\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a217a99-3160-4a12-85d6-a7df8c665146\', \'multiverseId\': 521219}, \'multiverseid\': 521219}, {\'name\': \'妮莎的探險\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f6bbacb-882d-4a27-ab0c-fc95aa2dec09\', \'multiverseId\': 521467}, \'multiverseid\': 521467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Novijen, Herz des Fortschritts\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T}: Lege auf jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug ins Spiel gekommen ist, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Der unnatürliche Druck, den diese Stadt auf alle Lebensformen ausübt, wird am besten von Lebensformen ausgehalten, die sich mit unnatürlicher Geschwindigkeit anpassen."\\n—Momir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4532d268-57f0-4ac0-8b2f-737afc0afd64\', \'multiverseId\': 519588}, \'multiverseid\': 519588}, {\'name\': \'Novijen, corazón del progreso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que entró al campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"La presión artificial de la vida en esta ciudad es mejor soportada por formas de vida que se adaptan con rapidez sobrenatural".\\n—Mómir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d19a90-bb22-4173-b30c-35b90574cea8\', \'multiverseId\': 519836}, \'multiverseid\': 519836}, {\'name\': \'Novijen, le Cœur du progrès\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature qui est arrivée sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Le stress surnaturel de la vie dans cette cité est mieux supporté par des formes de vie qui s\'adaptent à une vitesse surnaturelle. »\\n—Momir Vig", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1974812-45f6-4a6e-b6ac-ca22d299376f\', \'multiverseId\': 520084}, \'multiverseid\': 520084}, {\'name\': \'Novijen, Cuore del Progresso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che è entrata nel campo di battaglia in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Le pressioni innaturali della vita in questa città vengono sopportate meglio dalle creature con un\\\'innaturale capacità di adattamento."\\n—Momir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b60724-367e-4c4d-bf1a-7384b597983f\', \'multiverseId\': 520332}, \'multiverseid\': 520332}, {\'name\': \'進化の中心、ノヴィジェン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{G}{U}, {T}：このターンに戦場に出た各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「この都市の生命にかかる不自然な圧力に最も耐えられるのは、不自然な素早さで適合できる生命体だ。」\\n――モミール・ヴィグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca891a0-672d-497b-8cf2-4b88dda17e07\', \'multiverseId\': 520580}, \'multiverseid\': 520580}, {\'name\': \'Novijen, Coração do Progresso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que entrou no campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"As pressões antinaturais da vida nesta cidade são suportadas melhor pelas formas de vida que se adaptam com rapidez antinatural."\\n— Momir Vig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58fb0066-0326-4bfd-9d07-1f0f2d4c437a\', \'multiverseId\': 520828}, \'multiverseid\': 520828}, {\'name\': \'Новиен, Центр Прогресса\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо, которое вышло на поле битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«В этом городе неестественные нагрузки на организм лучше всего переносятся жизненными формами, способными приспосабливаться с неестественной скоростью».\\n— Момир Виг\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e481498-6c88-4c22-a2b2-90ac5263401e\', \'multiverseId\': 521076}, \'multiverseid\': 521076}, {\'name\': \'进展中枢诺维研\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{G}{U}，{T}：在每个本回合进战场的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「这城市对生命造成了违逆自然的压力，最能忍受的生命则能以违逆自然之速度来适应。」\\n～莫秘维\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75fd610b-fbef-4269-8968-2416c7df4d9c\', \'multiverseId\': 521324}, \'multiverseid\': 521324}, {\'name\': \'進展中樞諾維研\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{G}{U}，{T}：在每個本回合進戰場的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「這城市對生命造成了違逆自然的壓力，最能忍受的生命則能以違逆自然之速度來適應。」\\n～莫秘維\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d369d866-6ab0-49ed-8204-e8c079df2cbf\', \'multiverseId\': 521572}, \'multiverseid\': 521572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis der Wiederentflammte\', \'text\': \'+1: Du ziehst eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n−3: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n−8: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl erhält ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Spieler eine Karte zieht, verlierst du 2 Lebenspunkte."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519432&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f81aac-e728-4ba5-9ca3-7ad6aa26d3de\', \'multiverseId\': 519432}, \'multiverseid\': 519432}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis reavivado\', \'text\': \'+1: Robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\\n−3: Destruye la criatura objetivo.\\n−8: El oponente objetivo obtiene un emblema con "Siempre que un jugador robe una carta, pierdes 2 vidas".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa70271-d203-4f52-bb13-ea02726fede9\', \'multiverseId\': 519680}, \'multiverseid\': 519680}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis ravivé\', \'text\': "+1 : Vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\n-3 : Détruisez une créature ciblée.\\n−8 : Un adversaire ciblé gagne un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un joueur pioche une carte, vous perdez 2 points de vie. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519928&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9fb98fc-0608-4fed-9a73-30c8a484ef05\', \'multiverseId\': 519928}, \'multiverseid\': 519928}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis della Fiamma Rinnovata\', \'text\': \'+1: Pesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\\n-3: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\\n−8: Un avversario bersaglio ottiene un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta un giocatore pesca una carta, perdi 2 punti vita".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185a9bfb-874a-4b95-85d1-0091dbb5dad1\', \'multiverseId\': 520176}, \'multiverseid\': 520176}, {\'name\': \'灯の再覚醒、オブ・ニクシリス\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\\n-3：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n-8：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「プレイヤーがカード１枚を引くたび、あなたは２点のライフを失う。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ニクシリス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1701db29-982f-44fe-96ee-267af42f2146\', \'multiverseId\': 520424}, \'multiverseid\': 520424}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis Reaceso\', \'text\': \'+1: Você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\\n−3: Destrua a criatura alvo.\\n-8: O oponente alvo recebe um emblema com: "Toda vez que um jogador compra um card, você perde 2 pontos de vida."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f042ee75-f567-436a-b9c5-bbdab764259d\', \'multiverseId\': 520672}, \'multiverseid\': 520672}, {\'name\': \'Об-Никсилис, Вспыхнувший Вновь\', \'text\': \'+1: вы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\\n—3: уничтожьте целевое существо.\\n−8: целевой оппонент получает эмблему со способностью «Каждый раз, когда игрок берет карту, вы теряете 2 жизни».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Никсилис\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e95ac8f-a531-484d-84be-b80d7dd64854\', \'multiverseId\': 520920}, \'multiverseid\': 520920}, {\'name\': \'火花重燃的欧尼希兹\', \'text\': \'+1：你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\\n−3：消灭目标生物。\\n−8：目标对手获得具有以下异能的徽记～「每当任一牌手抓一张牌时，你失去2点生命。」\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～尼希兹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615d48e3-0765-4278-a7f3-e5334bd302a7\', \'multiverseId\': 521168}, \'multiverseid\': 521168}, {\'name\': \'火花重燃的歐尼希茲\', \'text\': \'+1：你抽一張牌且失去1點生命。\\n-3：消滅目標生物。\\n-8：目標對手獲得具有以下異能的徽記～「每當任一玩家抽一張牌時，你失去2點生命。」\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～尼希茲\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac40d976-dade-45cc-892c-a92628631c4b\', \'multiverseId\': 521416}, \'multiverseid\': 521416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oktavia, Lebendige These\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {8} weniger, falls sich acht oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof befinden.\\nAbwehr {8}\\nMagiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, hat eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 8/8 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Oktopus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ed5b4c-09ec-4642-aa0b-7eb2988fbd6d\', \'multiverseId\': 518496}, \'multiverseid\': 518496}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, tesis viviente\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {8} menos lanzar este hechizo si tienes ocho o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nRebatir {8}.\\nHechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, la criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 8/8 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pulpo elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a49e0f3-97db-4f6a-8eff-723a9256b6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 518567}, \'multiverseid\': 518567}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, thèse vivante\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {8} de moins à lancer si vous avez au moins huit cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nParade {8}\\nSorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 8/8 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et pieuvre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518638&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec6b427-228d-4c6f-acf6-3d078306a264\', \'multiverseId\': 518638}, \'multiverseid\': 518638}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, Tesi Vivente\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {8} in meno per essere lanciata se hai otto o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria nel tuo cimitero.\\nEgida {8}\\nArtemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, una creatura bersaglio ha forza e costituzione base 8/8 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Piovra Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa227eb-da4b-4b8b-aeb0-dcf18c5b5e4e\', \'multiverseId\': 518709}, \'multiverseid\': 518709}, {\'name\': \'生ける卒論、オクタヴィア\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーであるカード８枚以上があるなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{8}少なくなる。\\n護法{8}\\n魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは８/８になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・タコ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e305e7-f8e5-4e4d-8fcb-4071faf94855\', \'multiverseId\': 518780}, \'multiverseid\': 518780}, {\'name\': \'Octávia, Tese Viva\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {8} a menos para ser conjurada se você tiver oito ou mais cards de mágica instantânea e/ou de feitiço em seu cemitério.\\nSalvaguarda {8}\\nMagifício — Toda vez que você conjura ou copia uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, a criatura alvo tem poder e resistência básicos 8/8 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elemental Polvo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a465189-7542-482a-a193-697d357d51de\', \'multiverseId\': 518851}, \'multiverseid\': 518851}, {\'name\': \'Октавия, Живая Диссертация\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {8} меньше, если на вашем кладбище есть восемь или больше карт мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства.\\nОберег {8}\\nЧародейство — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете или копируете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, целевое существо имеет базовую силу и выносливость 8/8 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Элементаль Спрут\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d7a3941-e422-4acc-82d4-87c03f37dc6c\', \'multiverseId\': 518922}, \'multiverseid\': 518922}, {\'name\': \'活体论文八爪薇\', \'text\': \'如果你坟墓场中有八张或更多瞬间和／或法术牌，则此咒语减少{8}来施放。\\n守护{8}\\n魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，目标生物的基础力量与防御力为8/8直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素／章鱼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9185a8e3-464c-4c77-bb85-aad9fb50918b\', \'multiverseId\': 518993}, \'multiverseid\': 518993}, {\'name\': \'活體論文八爪薇\', \'text\': \'如果你墳墓場中有八張或更多瞬間和／或巫術牌，則此咒語減少{8}來施放。\\n守護{8}\\n魔藝～每當你施放或複製瞬間或巫術咒語時，目標生物的基礎力量與防禦力為8/8直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～元素／章魚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327ba056-c2a6-4462-8751-5a3cd6607ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 519064}, \'multiverseid\': 519064}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oktavia, Lebendige These\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {8} weniger, falls sich acht oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof befinden.\\nAbwehr {8}\\nMagiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, hat eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 8/8 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Oktopus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8066dd56-f0a2-4f4a-a5a6-86cfbe156c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 521705}, \'multiverseid\': 521705}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, tesis viviente\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {8} menos lanzar este hechizo si tienes ocho o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nRebatir {8}.\\nHechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, la criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 8/8 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pulpo elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bacebbd8-2150-4d96-8a04-51cf1b3086d4\', \'multiverseId\': 521785}, \'multiverseid\': 521785}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, thèse vivante\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {8} de moins à lancer si vous avez au moins huit cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nParade {8}\\nSorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 8/8 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et pieuvre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46088377-58c2-4361-91b1-13f489b63c99\', \'multiverseId\': 521865}, \'multiverseid\': 521865}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, Tesi Vivente\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {8} in meno per essere lanciata se hai otto o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria nel tuo cimitero.\\nEgida {8}\\nArtemagica — Ogniqualvolta lanci o copi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, una creatura bersaglio ha forza e costituzione base 8/8 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Piovra Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477847ea-c33b-4c63-bdba-dd163643b3f5\', \'multiverseId\': 521945}, \'multiverseid\': 521945}, {\'name\': \'生ける卒論、オクタヴィア\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーであるカード８枚以上があるなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{8}少なくなる。\\n護法{8}\\n魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるかコピーするたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは８/８になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・タコ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481b1688-f0dc-474e-b096-15b7827cfff1\', \'multiverseId\': 522025}, \'multiverseid\': 522025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Opalpalast\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs. Falls du dieses Mana verwendest, um deinen Kommandeur zu wirken, kommt er mit so vielen zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie er in dieser Partie aus der Kommandozone gewirkt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bdb51e4-bcfd-4742-a6a6-21acac99bf78\', \'multiverseId\': 519589}, \'multiverseid\': 519589}, {\'name\': \'Palacio de ópalo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Si usas este maná para lanzar a tu comandante, este entra al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre él adicionales igual a la cantidad de veces que se lanzó desde la zona de mando este juego.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bceb7a-67e2-4459-b374-269f5c4913cb\', \'multiverseId\': 519837}, \'multiverseid\': 519837}, {\'name\': "Palais d\'opale", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1},{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Si vous dépensez ce mana pour lancer votre commandant, il arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires égal au nombre de fois qu\'il a été lancé depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'652609bd-7920-4ce0-988a-430232c5ecaa\', \'multiverseId\': 520085}, \'multiverseid\': 520085}, {\'name\': "Palazzo d\'Opale", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Se spendi questo mana per lanciare il tuo comandante, entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 addizionali pari al numero di volte che è stato lanciato dalla zona di comando in questa partita.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9fc3208-873a-4152-8c92-f2c634b6ae01\', \'multiverseId\': 520333}, \'multiverseid\': 520333}, {\'name\': \'オパールの宮殿\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたがあなたの統率者を唱えるためにこのマナを支払ったなら、その統率者は追加で、このゲームでそれが統率領域から唱えられた回数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eeef8cb-4e14-45e2-9455-bb0f14bcbea9\', \'multiverseId\': 520581}, \'multiverseid\': 520581}, {\'name\': \'Palácio de Opala\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante. Se você gastar este mana para conjurar seu comandante, este entra no campo de batalha com um número de marcadores +1/+1 adicionais igual ao número de vezes em que foi conjurado da zona de comando neste jogo.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710ebfd5-f480-474b-b43a-18ca577179e2\', \'multiverseId\': 520829}, \'multiverseid\': 520829}, {\'name\': \'Опаловый Дворец\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира. Если вы тратите эту ману на разыгрывание вашего командира, он выходит на поле битвы с количеством дополнительных жетонов +1/+1 на нем, равным числу его разыгрываний из зоны командования в этой партии.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc434e0-429c-483b-a9d0-17340bfdd483\', \'multiverseId\': 521077}, \'multiverseid\': 521077}, {\'name\': \'清辉宫殿\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。如果你将此法术力用来施放你的指挥官，则它进战场时上面额外有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于本盘游戏中从统帅区施放过它的次数。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7543c105-2419-46c9-b36d-94470b911cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 521325}, \'multiverseid\': 521325}, {\'name\': \'清輝宮殿\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。如果你將此魔法力用來施放你的指揮官，則它進戰場時上面額外有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於本盤遊戲中從統帥區施放過它的次數。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'095fbf0a-76b1-4544-b875-246cc1b6cd00\', \'multiverseId\': 521573}, \'multiverseid\': 521573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Opfergabe\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, mischt sie in seine Bibliothek und zieht dann zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein reicheres Volk könnte zwar mehr geben, aber nie genug."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd27e926-8572-42d1-a6b9-a6b943ffc401\', \'multiverseId\': 519380}, \'multiverseid\': 519380}, {\'name\': \'Oblación\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo que no sea tierra lo baraja en su biblioteca, luego roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un pueblo más rico podría dar más, pero nunca podría dar tanto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e3e57f-bed2-434b-8041-5e575145a1f8\', \'multiverseId\': 519628}, \'multiverseid\': 519628}, {\'name\': \'Oblation\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire d\'un permanent non-terrain ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et pioche ensuite deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Un peuple plus riche pourrait donner plus, mais il ne donnerait jamais autant de lui-même. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ba31ea-9c66-4bc4-8d50-32c266d42994\', \'multiverseId\': 519876}, \'multiverseid\': 519876}, {\'name\': \'Obolo\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente non terra bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le persone più ricche possono dare di più, ma non potranno mai dare così tanto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c235e6f-f3bf-423b-a587-9bf3ead830e8\', \'multiverseId\': 520124}, \'multiverseid\': 520124}, {\'name\': \'奉納\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーは、それを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「裕福な人ほどより多く出せるはずなのに、人並みに出すことさえしない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55da8263-7e00-4248-8947-a28e17dd4ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 520372}, \'multiverseid\': 520372}, {\'name\': \'Oblação\', \'text\': \'O dono da permanente alvo não de terreno a embaralha no próprio grimório e depois compra dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Um povo mais rico poderia dar mais, mas jamais poderia dar tanto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e045d4-0969-4664-a9c8-d3dfb3434e34\', \'multiverseId\': 520620}, \'multiverseid\': 520620}, {\'name\': \'Подношение\', \'text\': \'Владелец целевого не являющегося землей перманента втасовывает его в свою библиотеку, затем берет две карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Богатый может пожертвовать больше, но он никогда не сможет пожертвовать так много».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51aa53a-0f62-4a30-b3f8-41fa131503be\', \'multiverseId\': 520868}, \'multiverseid\': 520868}, {\'name\': \'奉献\', \'text\': \'选择目标非地永久物。其拥有者将它洗入其牌库，然后抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「富人能给得更多，但永无法如此慷慨。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90d3d3a-ab90-4187-8dd4-6fff7086862f\', \'multiverseId\': 521116}, \'multiverseid\': 521116}, {\'name\': \'奉獻\', \'text\': \'選擇目標非地永久物。其擁有者將它洗入其牌庫，然後抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「富人能給得更多，但永無法如此慷慨。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'312d6351-2ec6-4ef6-9816-a5dc1069b739\', \'multiverseId\': 521364}, \'multiverseid\': 521364}]', "[{'name': 'Oran-Rief, das Riesenholz', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, das Riesenholz, kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{T}: Lege auf jede grüne Kreatur, die in diesem Zug ins Spiel gekommen ist, eine +1/+1-Marke.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519590&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f1bd2db-0b34-49d1-a400-733a4ca1a27f', 'multiverseId': 519590}, 'multiverseid': 519590}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, el Bosque Extenso', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, el Bosque Extenso entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura verde que entró al campo de batalla este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519838&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8e37c7c-ed29-4b5e-a7a3-d4dfec16a281', 'multiverseId': 519838}, 'multiverseid': 519838}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, le Vastebois', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, le Vastebois arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature verte qui est arrivée sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520086&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd293d12-1899-4df0-812f-7f8f9af203eb', 'multiverseId': 520086}, 'multiverseid': 520086}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, il Boscovasto', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, il Boscovasto entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura verde che è entrata nel campo di battaglia in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520334&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08ceb5ee-aa18-469e-b22c-ea2b336ba0f5', 'multiverseId': 520334}, 'multiverseid': 520334}, {'name': '巨森、オラン＝リーフ', 'text': '巨森、オラン＝リーフはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{T}：このターンに戦場に出た緑の各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520582&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '881589ff-df24-42d3-821b-1342613c048e', 'multiverseId': 520582}, 'multiverseid': 520582}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, a Matavasta', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, a Matavasta, entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura verde que entrou no campo de batalha neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520830&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30a722b3-b642-4b7c-b963-392a2f04987b', 'multiverseId': 520830}, 'multiverseid': 520830}, {'name': 'Оран-Риф, Широколесье', 'text': 'Оран-Риф, Широколесье выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}.\\n{T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое зеленое существо, которое вышло на поле битвы в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521078&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86965b8d-acda-4c34-a10e-82b104803f52', 'multiverseId': 521078}, 'multiverseid': 521078}, {'name': '广林欧兰黎', 'text': '广林欧兰黎须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{T}：在每个本回合进战场的绿色生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521326&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36aa3b8c-6ac7-476d-ba72-eff49046b7a5', 'multiverseId': 521326}, 'multiverseid': 521326}, {'name': '廣林歐蘭黎', 'text': '廣林歐蘭黎須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{T}：在每個本回合進戰場的綠色生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521574&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0cea5b4-57a6-4309-988c-fe2f983d77b8', 'multiverseId': 521574}, 'multiverseid': 521574}]", '[{\'name\': \'Oreskos-Erforscherin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Oreskos-Erforscherin ins Spiel kommt, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu X Ebene-Karten, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Spielern ist, die mehr Länder kontrollieren als du. Zeige die Karten offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71340be2-d0c5-4ff7-957b-58117ef28bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 519381}, \'multiverseid\': 519381}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora de Oreskos\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Exploradora de Oreskos entre al campo de batalla, busca en tu biblioteca hasta X cartas de Llanura, donde X es la cantidad de jugadores que controlan más tierras que tú. Muestra esas cartas, ponlas en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2595104b-e124-4523-91de-8aee09cb1b94\', \'multiverseId\': 519629}, \'multiverseid\': 519629}, {\'name\': "Exploratrice d\'Oreskos", \'text\': "Quand l\'Exploratrice d\'Oreskos arrive sur le champ de bataille, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à X cartes de plaine, X étant le nombre de joueurs qui contrôlent plus de terrains que vous. Révélez ces cartes, mettez-les dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1454afa-de52-405e-8093-b19d75b9859b\', \'multiverseId\': 519877}, \'multiverseid\': 519877}, {\'name\': \'Esploratrice di Oreskos\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Esploratrice di Oreskos entra nel campo di battaglia, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a X carte Pianura, dove X è il numero di giocatori che controllano più terre di te. Rivela quelle carte e aggiungile alla tua mano, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bb6488-ec78-41ec-8950-db5cd2ee88ff\', \'multiverseId\': 520125}, \'multiverseid\': 520125}, {\'name\': \'オレスコスの探険者\', \'text\': \'オレスコスの探険者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード最大Ｘ枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。Xはあなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしているプレイヤーの人数に等しい。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9e9701-b420-4df4-9b24-ee2b316d1485\', \'multiverseId\': 520373}, \'multiverseid\': 520373}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora de Oreskos\', \'text\': \'Quando Exploradora de Oreskos entrar no campo de batalha, procure em seu grimório até X cards de Planície, sendo X o número de jogadores que controlam mais terrenos que você. Revele aqueles cards, coloque-os em sua mão e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106846fd-b085-4379-8183-e99f20b90799\', \'multiverseId\': 520621}, \'multiverseid\': 520621}, {\'name\': \'Исследовательница из Ореска\', \'text\': \'Когда Исследовательница из Ореска выходит на поле битвы, найдите в вашей библиотеке не более X карт Равнин, где X — количество игроков, контролирующих больше земель, чем вы. Покажите те карты, положите их в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Разведчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8750da80-a8fe-4ba3-80b5-e04f0b1d95c2\', \'multiverseId\': 520869}, \'multiverseid\': 520869}, {\'name\': \'俄瑞恣探险家\', \'text\': \'当俄瑞恣探险家进战场时，从你的牌库中搜寻至多X张平原牌，X为操控之地比你多的牌手数量。展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0584a16-cc7d-4d40-8e5b-09adcf68b3c5\', \'multiverseId\': 521117}, \'multiverseid\': 521117}, {\'name\': \'俄瑞恣探險家\', \'text\': \'當俄瑞恣探險家進戰場時，從你的牌庫中搜尋至多X張平原牌，X為操控之地比你多的玩家數量。展示這些牌，將它們置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f2271b-72fe-4fd0-9b98-14c6a01588f7\', \'multiverseId\': 521365}, \'multiverseid\': 521365}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Advokistin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kann jeder Spieler zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur legen, die er kontrolliert. Falls ein Spieler dies tut, können Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert, bis zu deinem nächsten Zug weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Die Orzhov sind nicht an Reue, sondern ausschließlich an Tilgung interessiert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519382&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81eb32f7-9223-4ddd-8742-d3c9322b79c2\', \'multiverseId\': 519382}, \'multiverseid\': 519382}, {\'name\': \'Abogada orzhov\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada jugador puede poner dos contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controla. Si un jugador lo hace, las criaturas que controla ese jugador no pueden atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker\\nque controlas hasta tu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los orzhov no buscan el arrepentimiento, solo la retribución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc33100-278b-4319-840d-64fd0c54a30e\', \'multiverseId\': 519630}, \'multiverseid\': 519630}, {\'name\': "Avoquiste d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, chaque joueur peut mettre deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature qu\'il contrôle. Si un joueur fait ainsi, les créatures que ce joueur contrôle ne peuvent pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "Les Orzhov se moquent du repentir, ils s\'intéressent seulement au remboursement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eda60ad-1517-4f77-9e6d-0a57304daaa0\', \'multiverseId\': 519878}, \'multiverseid\': 519878}, {\'name\': \'Fautrice Orzhov\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni giocatore può mettere due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura che controlla. Se un giocatore lo fa, le creature controllate da quel giocatore non possono attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli fino al tuo prossimo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Agli Orzhov non interessa il pentimento, solo il pagamento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9a53200-0005-45e8-8461-0cc852ce4ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 520126}, \'multiverseid\': 520126}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの弁護士\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置いてもよい。プレイヤーがそうしたなら、あなたの次の\\nターンまで、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーではあなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'オルゾフは謝罪を求めず、返済を求める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a205d46d-8e37-43a9-b187-6404bf754fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 520374}, \'multiverseid\': 520374}, {\'name\': \'Advoquista Orzhov\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, cada jogador pode colocar dois marcadores +1/+1 em uma criatura que ele controla. Se um jogador fizer isso, as criaturas que aquele jogador controla não poderão atacar você nem planeswalkers que você controla até seu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'Aos orzhov não importa que alguém se arrependa, só que alguém pague.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909ddccd-603f-462d-8964-ee1f9bf3a5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 520622}, \'multiverseid\': 520622}, {\'name\': \'Орзов-Проповедник\', \'text\': "В начале вашего шага поддержки каждый игрок может положить два жетона +1/+1 на существо под своим контролем. Если игрок это делает, то существа под контролем того игрока не могут атаковать вас или planeswalker\'ов под вашим контролем до вашего следующего хода.", \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Советник\', \'flavor\': \'Орзовам нет дела до покаяния. Их заботит только возвращение долгов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d857f2-2dca-4677-a1b8-4a8413eb15d3\', \'multiverseId\': 520870}, \'multiverseid\': 520870}, {\'name\': \'欧佐夫倡议人\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，每位牌手各可以在一个由其操控的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。若有牌手如此作，则直到你的下一个回合，由该牌手操控的生物不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'欧佐夫并不在乎你是否悔过，只在乎你是否赔过。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd95d42e-6e57-4405-9bb3-71736f7c830d\', \'multiverseId\': 521118}, \'multiverseid\': 521118}, {\'name\': \'歐佐夫倡議人\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，每位玩家各可以在一個由其操控的生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。若有玩家如此作，則直到你的下一個回合，由該玩家操控的生物不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／參謀\', \'flavor\': \'歐佐夫並不在乎你是否悔過，只在乎你是否賠過。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81efe0e2-b125-4aee-8a18-1a91b05f9504\', \'multiverseId\': 521366}, \'multiverseid\': 521366}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Basilika\', \'text\': \'Die Orzhov-Basilika kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Orzhov-Basilika ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e02194-4c14-4384-85ca-52854072160a\', \'multiverseId\': 519591}, \'multiverseid\': 519591}, {\'name\': \'Basílica orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basílica orzhov entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Basílica orzhov entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63aa7c1-c544-422b-af63-67caf0e08e5d\', \'multiverseId\': 519839}, \'multiverseid\': 519839}, {\'name\': "Basilique d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520087&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45acc5b6-c9a1-494d-a173-fcae0e8eaf4b\', \'multiverseId\': 520087}, \'multiverseid\': 520087}, {\'name\': \'Basilica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99524ccc-45ef-4bda-bed6-16cf040dcb05\', \'multiverseId\': 520335}, \'multiverseid\': 520335}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの聖堂\', \'text\': \'オルゾフの聖堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nオルゾフの聖堂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d46d57a0-27fa-4939-bf59-04a6fd3a595c\', \'multiverseId\': 520583}, \'multiverseid\': 520583}, {\'name\': \'Basílica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Basílica Orzhov entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Basílica Orzhov entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d19c68-a4b0-4cd2-b429-454536a4bb49\', \'multiverseId\': 520831}, \'multiverseid\': 520831}, {\'name\': \'Базилика Дома Орзов\', \'text\': \'Базилика Дома Орзов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Базилика Дома Орзов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45750399-c54b-4427-9879-551c9d19e32f\', \'multiverseId\': 521079}, \'multiverseid\': 521079}, {\'name\': \'欧佐夫大殿\', \'text\': \'欧佐夫大殿须横置进战场。\\n当欧佐夫大殿进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6154979-d8a3-4f6c-b006-93a80a3312ab\', \'multiverseId\': 521327}, \'multiverseid\': 521327}, {\'name\': \'歐佐夫大殿\', \'text\': \'歐佐夫大殿須橫置進戰場。\\n當歐佐夫大殿進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f581f0-4975-46b8-a93d-204d4da9a514\', \'multiverseId\': 521575}, \'multiverseid\': 521575}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Siegel hat unterschiedliche Bedeutungen, je nach Form und Material. Manche tragen es als Statussymbol, andere als Zeichen ihrer Schuld.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a23d5e-f84c-4656-9e5e-8c13a3c7d68b\', \'multiverseId\': 519537}, \'multiverseid\': 519537}, {\'name\': \'Sello orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El sello tiene distintos significados dependiendo de su forma y presentación. Mientras algunos lo llevan como un símbolo de status, en otros indica una deuda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68406c72-dde0-4b6e-98fc-a3896e5b4957\', \'multiverseId\': 519785}, \'multiverseid\': 519785}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Orzhov", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La forme et la présentation du cachet sont aussi importantes que le cachet en lui-même. Pour certains, c\'est un signe extérieur de leur statut. Pour d\'autres, c\'est un signe extérieur de dette.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d673b91f-9281-4302-941d-c71715d94d59\', \'multiverseId\': 520033}, \'multiverseid\': 520033}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il sigillo ha un diverso significato in base alla forma e alla presentazione. Mentre alcuni lo indossano per indicare il loro status, altri lo indossano per indicare un debito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad27339-bcb3-458d-a700-07d4f925673e\', \'multiverseId\': 520281}, \'multiverseid\': 520281}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'印章はその形によって異なる意味を持つ。地位の証として身につけるものもいれば、負債の証として身につけるものもいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481dbf99-c5d8-4793-9872-8a1450500716\', \'multiverseId\': 520529}, \'multiverseid\': 520529}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O símbolo tem significados diferentes dependendo de sua forma e apresentação. Enquanto alguns o usam como sinal de status, para outros é um sinal de dívida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4869a6ac-fdd0-410a-81d9-1f753b5f10c6\', \'multiverseId\': 520777}, \'multiverseid\': 520777}, {\'name\': \'Печать Дома Орзов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'В зависимости от формы и стиля печать может означать разные вещи. Некоторые носят её в знак своего высокого положения, а некоторые — как символ долговой кабалы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f947aac0-9da9-415d-b6ba-9fffd25be1bf\', \'multiverseId\': 521025}, \'multiverseid\': 521025}, {\'name\': \'欧佐夫印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'此印记外观样式与佩戴形式不同，其代表涵义也大不一样。有人将其作为地位的象征，而有人则视为负债的标志。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68e95a2-dbe8-4b99-bc70-d48b1f7ffb85\', \'multiverseId\': 521273}, \'multiverseid\': 521273}, {\'name\': \'歐佐夫印記\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'此印記外觀樣式與佩戴形式不同，其代表涵義也大不一樣。有人將其作為地位的象徵，而有人則視為負債的標誌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f6edf26-8fed-48d8-ada6-0ef802b9af19\', \'multiverseId\': 521521}, \'multiverseid\': 521521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Osgir der Rekonstrukteur\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{1}, opfere ein Artefakt: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{X}, {T}, schicke eine Artefaktkarte mit Manabetrag X aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge zwei Spielsteine, die Kopien der ins Exil geschickten Karte sind. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Riese, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518324&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b09f2b2-5014-4142-95ae-5e8e4aeadf4e\', \'multiverseId\': 518324}, \'multiverseid\': 518324}, {\'name\': \'Ósgir, el Reconstructor\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{1}, sacrificar un artefacto: La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{X}, {T}, exiliar una carta de artefacto con valor de maná de X de tu cementerio: Crea dos fichas que son copias de la carta exiliada. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143e1791-3f7c-403e-a24c-3df85527337e\', \'multiverseId\': 518334}, \'multiverseid\': 518334}, {\'name\': \'Osgir, le reconstructeur\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{1}, sacrifiez un artefact : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{X}, {T}, exilez une carte d\'artefact avec une valeur de mana de X depuis votre cimetière : Créez deux jetons qui sont des copies de la carte exilée. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : géant et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518344&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da06db14-12bc-49d8-8086-f0b1d549a44e\', \'multiverseId\': 518344}, \'multiverseid\': 518344}, {\'name\': \'Osgir, il Ricostruttore\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{1}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{X}, {T}, Esilia una carta artefatto con valore di mana pari a X dal tuo cimitero: Crea due pedine che sono copie della carta esiliata. Attiva solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23626a20-2b02-4735-b0c0-306ab907e08a\', \'multiverseId\': 518354}, \'multiverseid\': 518354}, {\'name\': \'再構築者、オスギル\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{X}, {T}, あなたの墓地からマナ総量がＸのアーティファクト・カード１枚を追放する：その追放されたカードのコピーであるトークン２つを生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 巨人・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d2e3da1-5d59-48ff-a0cf-278c91677e04\', \'multiverseId\': 518364}, \'multiverseid\': 518364}, {\'name\': \'Osgir, o Reconstrutor\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\n{1}, sacrifique um artefato: A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\\n{X}, {T}, exile um card de artefato com valor de mana X em seu cemitério: Crie duas fichas que sejam cópias do card exilado. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Gigante Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b345a8-9fd2-4841-926b-0fee5963a2ed\', \'multiverseId\': 518374}, \'multiverseid\': 518374}, {\'name\': \'Осгир, Реконструктор\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\n{1}, пожертвуйте артефакт: целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\\n{X}, {T}, изгоните карту артефакта с мановой ценностью X из вашего кладбища: создайте две фишки, являющиеся копиями изгнанной карты. Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гигант Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1251a578-afa7-42c5-b363-7a0dc3eecba3\', \'multiverseId\': 518384}, \'multiverseid\': 518384}, {\'name\': \'重建师奥席格\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}，牺牲一个神器：目标由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\\n{X}，{T}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张法术力值为X的神器牌：派出两个衍生物，这些衍生物为所放逐之牌的复制品。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨人／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90937091-ec68-4b7b-a0c4-52e58d6c5660\', \'multiverseId\': 518394}, \'multiverseid\': 518394}, {\'name\': \'重建師奧席格\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}，犧牲一個神器：目標由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。\\n{X}，{T}，從你的墳墓場放逐一張魔法力值為X的神器牌：派出兩個衍生物，這些衍生物為所放逐之牌的複製品。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～巨人／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'952083bb-6491-4ea4-a442-91f73cc01a96\', \'multiverseId\': 518404}, \'multiverseid\': 518404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Osgir der Rekonstrukteur\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{1}, opfere ein Artefakt: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{X}, {T}, schicke eine Artefaktkarte mit Manabetrag X aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge zwei Spielsteine, die Kopien der ins Exil geschickten Karte sind. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Riese, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521684&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4dfe1ac-7bf9-404c-9f27-34714554e775\', \'multiverseId\': 521684}, \'multiverseid\': 521684}, {\'name\': \'Ósgir, el Reconstructor\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{1}, sacrificar un artefacto: La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{X}, {T}, exiliar una carta de artefacto con valor de maná de X de tu cementerio: Crea dos fichas que son copias de la carta exiliada. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d1624b-f69a-4e42-87bc-b105fee4c02a\', \'multiverseId\': 521764}, \'multiverseid\': 521764}, {\'name\': \'Osgir, le reconstructeur\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{1}, sacrifiez un artefact : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{X}, {T}, exilez une carte d\'artefact avec une valeur de mana de X depuis votre cimetière : Créez deux jetons qui sont des copies de la carte exilée. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : géant et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d9cc16-67fa-49d6-b137-54cd23b60575\', \'multiverseId\': 521844}, \'multiverseid\': 521844}, {\'name\': \'Osgir, il Ricostruttore\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{1}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{X}, {T}, Esilia una carta artefatto con valore di mana pari a X dal tuo cimitero: Crea due pedine che sono copie della carta esiliata. Attiva solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d70199c-e92a-4be1-b43a-0c45791b87af\', \'multiverseId\': 521924}, \'multiverseid\': 521924}, {\'name\': \'再構築者、オスギル\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{1}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{X}, {T}, あなたの墓地からマナ総量がＸのアーティファクト・カード１枚を追放する：その追放されたカードのコピーであるトークン２つを生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 巨人・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21004e5c-9d20-44cb-b7dc-a79e879e9ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 522004}, \'multiverseid\': 522004}]', '[{\'name\': \'Palette des Elementalisten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit {X} in seinen Manakosten wirkst, lege zwei Ladungsmarken auf die Palette des Elementalisten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C} für jede Ladungsmarke auf der Palette des Elementalisten. Verwende dieses Mana nur für Kosten, die {X} enthalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e50d85bb-c3c8-4012-8e80-25e228266f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 518543}, \'multiverseid\': 518543}, {\'name\': \'Paleta de elementalista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo con {X} en su coste de maná, pon dos contadores de carga sobre la Paleta de elementalista.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{T}: Agrega {C} por cada contador de carga sobre la Paleta de elementalista. Usa este maná solo para costes que contengan {X}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d47c38-70a1-4373-85ee-1da5b5d35c61\', \'multiverseId\': 518614}, \'multiverseid\': 518614}, {\'name\': "Palette d\'élémentaliste", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec {X} dans son coût de mana, mettez deux marqueurs « charge » sur la Palette d\'élémentaliste.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Palette d\'élémentaliste. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour des coûts qui contiennent {X}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518685&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ffa1501-9736-49c7-833f-b8708c598a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 518685}, \'multiverseid\': 518685}, {\'name\': "Tavolozza dell\'Elementalista", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia con {X} nel suo costo di mana, metti due segnalini carica sulla Tavolozza dell\'Elementalista.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} per ogni segnalino carica sulla Tavolozza dell\'Elementalista. Spendi questo mana solo per costi che contengono {X}.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9583d0ee-34b5-4951-bc2e-afe392c7e304\', \'multiverseId\': 518756}, \'multiverseid\': 518756}, {\'name\': \'精霊術士のパレット\', \'text\': \'あなたがマナ・コストに{X}を含む呪文を唱えるたび、精霊術士のパレットの上に蓄積カウンター２個を置く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{T}：精霊術士のパレットの上に置かれている蓄積カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。このマナは{X}を含むコストにのみ使用できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e9619f-3c73-4a4e-be80-22c44c469ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 518827}, \'multiverseid\': 518827}, {\'name\': \'Palheta do Elementalista\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica com {X} no custo de mana, coloque dois marcadores de carga em Palheta do Elementalista.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{T}: Adicione {C} para cada marcador de carga em Palheta do Elementalista. Gaste este mana somente em custos que contenham {X}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4224d06-f5f4-47a1-95fa-ee39c093c118\', \'multiverseId\': 518898}, \'multiverseid\': 518898}, {\'name\': \'Палитра Мага Стихий\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, в мана-стоимости которого есть {X}, положите два жетона заряда на Палитру Мага Стихий.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{T}: добавьте {C} за каждый жетон заряда на Палитре Мага Стихий. Тратьте эту ману только на уплату стоимостей, содержащих {X}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'922e2c57-ec51-422a-9a11-0900c0953cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 518969}, \'multiverseid\': 518969}, {\'name\': \'元素师材料盘\', \'text\': \'每当你施放法术力费用中包含{X}的咒语时，在元素师材料盘上放置两个充电指示物。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{T}：元素师材料盘上每有一个充电指示物，便加{C}。此法术力只能用来支付包含{X}的费用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5604ec-77cf-42b6-acba-f3ea0746ecb1\', \'multiverseId\': 519040}, \'multiverseid\': 519040}, {\'name\': \'元素師材料盤\', \'text\': \'每當你施放魔法力費用中包含{X}的咒語時，在元素師材料盤上放置兩個充電指示物。\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{T}：元素師材料盤上每有一個充電指示物，便加{C}。此魔法力只能用來支付包含{X}的費用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c952ea53-f1e0-44d4-8bbd-5cb117bebff4\', \'multiverseId\': 519111}, \'multiverseid\': 519111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Palette des Elementalisten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit {X} in seinen Manakosten wirkst, lege zwei Ladungsmarken auf die Palette des Elementalisten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C} für jede Ladungsmarke auf der Palette des Elementalisten. Verwende dieses Mana nur für Kosten, die {X} enthalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521752&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'220260ff-d782-4054-b3f7-4fcd6fd34eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 521752}, \'multiverseid\': 521752}, {\'name\': \'Paleta de elementalista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo con {X} en su coste de maná, pon dos contadores de carga sobre la Paleta de elementalista.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{T}: Agrega {C} por cada contador de carga sobre la Paleta de elementalista. Usa este maná solo para costes que contengan {X}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5f9e8f-4829-4ab2-a654-4bdb5d67fd90\', \'multiverseId\': 521832}, \'multiverseid\': 521832}, {\'name\': "Palette d\'élémentaliste", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec {X} dans son coût de mana, mettez deux marqueurs « charge » sur la Palette d\'élémentaliste.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Palette d\'élémentaliste. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour des coûts qui contiennent {X}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a30c6bd9-b2ce-4ef9-aece-fb693253ec0f\', \'multiverseId\': 521912}, \'multiverseid\': 521912}, {\'name\': "Tavolozza dell\'Elementalista", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia con {X} nel suo costo di mana, metti due segnalini carica sulla Tavolozza dell\'Elementalista.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} per ogni segnalino carica sulla Tavolozza dell\'Elementalista. Spendi questo mana solo per costi che contengono {X}.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab21be41-99c0-4bc0-a417-b9564e471472\', \'multiverseId\': 521992}, \'multiverseid\': 521992}, {\'name\': \'精霊術士のパレット\', \'text\': \'あなたがマナ・コストに{X}を含む呪文を唱えるたび、精霊術士のパレットの上に蓄積カウンター２個を置く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{T}：精霊術士のパレットの上に置かれている蓄積カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。このマナは{X}を含むコストにのみ使用できる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81deda6e-cdd6-49eb-84ce-2e0dde14d411\', \'multiverseId\': 522072}, \'multiverseid\': 522072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradiesfeder\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Paradiesfeder ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch der bestimmten Farbe wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein letzter Hauch des Paradieses in einer untergegangenen Welt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eddc149-d503-4033-9fb6-447c3f1b9cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 519538}, \'multiverseid\': 519538}, {\'name\': \'Pluma del paraíso\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Pluma del paraíso entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nSiempre que un jugador lance un hechizo del color elegido, puedes ganar 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un último vestigio de paraíso en un mundo caído.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38457536-aad2-4acc-9d50-99b25f987222\', \'multiverseId\': 519786}, \'multiverseid\': 519786}, {\'name\': \'Panache de paradis\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Panache de paradis arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort de la couleur choisie, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur choisie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La dernière douceur du paradis dans un monde déchu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520034&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f112ab-c359-4ba9-9f8c-8423c076035e\', \'multiverseId\': 520034}, \'multiverseid\': 520034}, {\'name\': \'Piuma del Paradiso\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Piuma del Paradiso entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia del colore scelto, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Un ultimo ciuffo di paradiso in un mondo decaduto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a622adf-a7b1-4ed1-99c9-40f904a7539f\', \'multiverseId\': 520282}, \'multiverseid\': 520282}, {\'name\': \'極楽の羽飾り\', \'text\': \'極楽の羽飾りが戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\nプレイヤーがその選ばれた色の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\\n{T}：その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'落ちぶれた世界の中の、楽園の最後の一欠片。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbbc797-9dca-4058-b7aa-7570479c418e\', \'multiverseId\': 520530}, \'multiverseid\': 520530}, {\'name\': \'Pluma do Paraíso\', \'text\': \'Conforme Pluma do Paraíso entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nToda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica da cor escolhida, você poderá ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Um último alento de paraíso em um mundo decaído.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688ad71b-bf5b-4c40-bc5a-6448608e329d\', \'multiverseId\': 520778}, \'multiverseid\': 520778}, {\'name\': \'Райское Перо\', \'text\': \'При выходе Райского Пера на поле битвы выберите цвет.\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает заклинание выбранного цвета, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману выбранного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Последний след рая в погибшем мире.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb169179-67f3-4337-a61d-264e87b0e1b3\', \'multiverseId\': 521026}, \'multiverseid\': 521026}, {\'name\': \'天堂羽饰\', \'text\': \'于天堂羽饰进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n每当任一牌手施放该色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加一点该色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'天堂在破败世界中仅留此一缕。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156ffb3e-1299-42a4-ac49-3345921da9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 521274}, \'multiverseid\': 521274}, {\'name\': \'天堂羽飾\', \'text\': \'於天堂羽飾進戰場時，選擇一種顏色。\\n每當任一玩家施放該色咒語時，你可以獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加一點該色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'天堂在破敗世界中僅留此一縷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245c9a0d-070a-4e0c-ba57-54af9105dea7\', \'multiverseId\': 521522}, \'multiverseid\': 521522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradoxon-Zone\', \'text\': \'Die Paradoxon-Zone kommt mit einer Wachstumsmarke ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments verdoppelst du die Anzahl an Wachstumsmarken auf der Paradoxon-Zone. Erzeuge dann einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Wachstumsmarken auf der Paradoxon-Zone ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7bca729-fc13-4364-a1a7-09b07aac0734\', \'multiverseId\': 518531}, \'multiverseid\': 518531}, {\'name\': \'Zona de paradojas\', \'text\': \'La Zona de paradojas entra al campo de batalla con un contador de crecimiento sobre ella.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, duplica la cantidad de contadores de crecimiento sobre la Zona de paradojas. Luego crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de crecimiento sobre la Zona de paradojas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ee3939-9057-4267-be23-785b0108f70e\', \'multiverseId\': 518602}, \'multiverseid\': 518602}, {\'name\': \'Zone paradoxale\', \'text\': \'La Zone paradoxale arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « croissance » sur elle.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, doublez le nombre de marqueurs « croissance » sur la Zone paradoxale. Créez ensuite un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « croissance » sur la Zone paradoxale.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518673&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b244022c-dc87-4697-8bca-15d2ff5099d3\', \'multiverseId\': 518673}, \'multiverseid\': 518673}, {\'name\': \'Zona del Paradosso\', \'text\': "La Zona del Paradosso entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino crescita.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, raddoppia il numero di segnalini crescita sulla Zona del Paradosso. Poi crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il numero di segnalini crescita sulla Zona del Paradosso.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906d816e-6607-4b78-806b-188c68f8fd48\', \'multiverseId\': 518744}, \'multiverseid\': 518744}, {\'name\': \'逆説の領域\', \'text\': \'逆説の領域は成長カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、逆説の領域の上に置かれている成長カウンターの個数を２倍にする。その後、緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘは逆説の領域の上に置かれている成長カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4b9f756-2e67-4a43-9e3c-0b9af800df51\', \'multiverseId\': 518815}, \'multiverseid\': 518815}, {\'name\': \'Zona de Paradoxo\', \'text\': \'Zona de Paradoxo entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de crescimento.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, dobre o número de marcadores de crescimento em Zona de Paradoxo. Em seguida, crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela, sendo X o número de marcadores de crescimento em Zona de Paradoxo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e10fa16-d1d7-41be-b681-4b6cb806fa92\', \'multiverseId\': 518886}, \'multiverseid\': 518886}, {\'name\': \'Зона Парадоксов\', \'text\': \'Зона Парадоксов выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном роста на ней.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага удвойте количество жетонов роста на Зоне Парадоксов. Затем создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1, где X — количество жетонов роста на Зоне Парадоксов.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b3d5fbc-ad92-4833-81f9-a56932a12656\', \'multiverseId\': 518957}, \'multiverseid\': 518957}, {\'name\': \'奇诡区域\', \'text\': \'奇诡区域进战场时上面有一个生长指示物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，将奇诡区域上的生长指示物数量加倍。然后派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为奇诡区域上的生长指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d6fb07-616c-41c4-ad12-cbe08d6feea7\', \'multiverseId\': 519028}, \'multiverseid\': 519028}, {\'name\': \'奇詭區域\', \'text\': \'奇詭區域進戰場時上面有一個生長指示物。\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，將奇詭區域上的生長指示物數量加倍。然後派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為奇詭區域上的生長指示物數量。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb0c26b4-f657-453d-97b6-96bb28f2e319\', \'multiverseId\': 519099}, \'multiverseid\': 519099}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradoxon-Zone\', \'text\': \'Die Paradoxon-Zone kommt mit einer Wachstumsmarke ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments verdoppelst du die Anzahl an Wachstumsmarken auf der Paradoxon-Zone. Erzeuge dann einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Wachstumsmarken auf der Paradoxon-Zone ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'347bfbd9-f3e0-4672-aa48-6ca11b00cfab\', \'multiverseId\': 521740}, \'multiverseid\': 521740}, {\'name\': \'Zona de paradojas\', \'text\': \'La Zona de paradojas entra al campo de batalla con un contador de crecimiento sobre ella.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, duplica la cantidad de contadores de crecimiento sobre la Zona de paradojas. Luego crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de crecimiento sobre la Zona de paradojas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'899e425a-88f5-4194-aee7-b9ae5a898f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 521820}, \'multiverseid\': 521820}, {\'name\': \'Zone paradoxale\', \'text\': \'La Zone paradoxale arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « croissance » sur elle.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, doublez le nombre de marqueurs « croissance » sur la Zone paradoxale. Créez ensuite un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « croissance » sur la Zone paradoxale.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4c605d-2871-4c96-aec9-a2c11f763f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 521900}, \'multiverseid\': 521900}, {\'name\': \'Zona del Paradosso\', \'text\': "La Zona del Paradosso entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino crescita.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, raddoppia il numero di segnalini crescita sulla Zona del Paradosso. Poi crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il numero di segnalini crescita sulla Zona del Paradosso.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1309776-09c2-454e-9875-43273997840d\', \'multiverseId\': 521980}, \'multiverseid\': 521980}, {\'name\': \'逆説の領域\', \'text\': \'逆説の領域は成長カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、逆説の領域の上に置かれている成長カウンターの個数を２倍にする。その後、緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘは逆説の領域の上に置かれている成長カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ce32822-3d6f-4816-88eb-ff0dda418ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 522060}, \'multiverseid\': 522060}]', "[{'name': 'Parasitischer Impuls', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, verliert ihr Beherrscher 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519433&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d67a7ab-ab48-4ecc-9b56-e6af686307ab', 'multiverseId': 519433}, 'multiverseid': 519433}, {'name': 'Ímpetu parasitario', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, su controlador pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519681&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd92ad1e0-d462-4587-8a23-ed929194b4ae', 'multiverseId': 519681}, 'multiverseid': 519681}, {'name': 'Impetus parasitaire', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, son contrôleur perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519929&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4283b7d1-b785-44a8-bcdb-d35872d5d544', 'multiverseId': 519929}, 'multiverseid': 519929}, {'name': 'Impeto Parassitario', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, il suo controllore perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520177&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98d922e3-2660-47d7-a37e-9c7b38af9632', 'multiverseId': 520177}, 'multiverseid': 520177}, {'name': '寄生の推進力', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それのコントローラーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520425&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e86d8549-2cbf-4e34-a556-82c694e4e93f', 'multiverseId': 520425}, 'multiverseid': 520425}, {'name': 'Ímpeto Parasitário', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, seu controlador perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520673&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '169e8551-8c15-4d0c-9a17-7b8357dab476', 'multiverseId': 520673}, 'multiverseid': 520673}, {'name': 'Паразитическое Побуждение', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, контролирующий его игрок теряет 2 жизни, а вы получаете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520921&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f80cb96d-8c84-4858-b02b-20e6aba8fbdc', 'multiverseId': 520921}, 'multiverseid': 520921}, {'name': '寄生促动', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，其操控者失去2点生命，且你获得2点生命。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521169&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d4dc7c2-3661-4856-b6ba-3488c2e54d78', 'multiverseId': 521169}, 'multiverseid': 521169}, {'name': '寄生促動', 'text': '結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n每當所結附的生物攻擊時，其操控者失去2點生命，且你獲得2點生命。', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521417&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0c5e463-7641-4b68-9d44-2ea03e5ea8d4', 'multiverseId': 521417}, 'multiverseid': 521417}]", '[{\'name\': \'Pflichtgelübde\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Wachsamkeit und kann weder dich noch Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bevorzuge Loyalität aus Respekt und nicht aufgrund von Magie. Aber man tut, was nötig ist."\\n—Kaalia von der Weite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519393&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d17d4845-f448-4dbc-8250-e16afbe521a2\', \'multiverseId\': 519393}, \'multiverseid\': 519393}, {\'name\': \'Promesa de servicio\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2, tiene la habilidad de vigilancia y no puede atacarte a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Prefiero que la lealtad sea una cuestión de respeto, no de magia. Pero uno hace lo que debe".\\n—Kaalia de la Vastedad\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac313526-95d5-4345-ab40-f3a31c7e1654\', \'multiverseId\': 519641}, \'multiverseid\': 519641}, {\'name\': \'Vœu de devoir\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2, a la vigilance et elle ne peut pas vous attaquer ou attaquer des planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Je préfère que la loyauté soit une question de respect, pas de magie. Mais parfois, il faut se plier aux exigences... »\\n—Kaalia de l\'Immensité", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5b9f33-05b7-41f9-a94a-f650d55fd6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 519889}, \'multiverseid\': 519889}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento del Dovere\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2, ha cautela e non può attaccare te o i planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Preferisco che la lealtà sia una questione di rispetto, non di magia. Ma ognuno fa ciò che deve."\\n—Kaalia della Vastità\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c379b6d-dfb3-48e3-b6f4-fa2f987e7983\', \'multiverseId\': 520137}, \'multiverseid\': 520137}, {\'name\': \'義務の誓約\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、警戒を持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「忠誠ってのは尊敬から来るものである方がいいね。魔法じゃなくて。ただ、やらなきゃいけないことをやる奴は必要なんだよね。」\\n――巨大なるカーリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a5ebe4-b947-4610-9363-0368241b9529\', \'multiverseId\': 520385}, \'multiverseid\': 520385}, {\'name\': \'Voto do Dever\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2, tem vigilância e não pode atacar você nem planeswalkers que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Prefiro que a lealdade seja questão de respeito, não de magia. Mas a gente faz o que tem que fazer."\\n— Kaalia da Vastidão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58a928c-3e76-4612-be12-b91cbfbf32ef\', \'multiverseId\': 520633}, \'multiverseid\': 520633}, {\'name\': \'Обет Служения\', \'text\': "Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2, имеет\\nБдительность и не может атаковать вас или\\nplaneswalker\'ов под вашим контролем.", \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Я предпочитаю верность, основанную на уважении, а не на магии. Но каждый делает то, что должен».\\n— Каалия из Бескрайних земель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e340572-3aa7-4f4b-99cd-600b28c0d03e\', \'multiverseId\': 520881}, \'multiverseid\': 520881}, {\'name\': \'义务之誓约\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2，具有警戒异能，且不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然我理想中的忠诚是尊敬他人的真心，而非受制魔法的假意，但有时只能不得已而为之。」\\n～穹境的卡莉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da785d6-579e-4059-92a6-ed2c5410acba\', \'multiverseId\': 521129}, \'multiverseid\': 521129}, {\'name\': \'義務之誓約\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2，具有警戒異能，且不能攻擊你或由你操控的鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「雖然我理想中的忠誠是尊敬他人的真心，而非受制魔法的假意，但有時只能不得已而為之。」\\n～穹境的卡莉雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ff2985-b8ce-444b-bd4a-3f05ff00b7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 521377}, \'multiverseid\': 521377}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexias Kern\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Also ist selbst das Herz unserer Welt verfallen."\\n—Koth vom Hammerclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f8740ff-824b-4746-b457-ce47cf43fdca\', \'multiverseId\': 519592}, \'multiverseid\': 519592}, {\'name\': \'Núcleo de Pirexia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Así que incluso el corazón de nuestro mundo ha caído."\\n—Koth del Martillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6229f1-cc13-46d4-bb5a-1ce1b3ce9024\', \'multiverseId\': 519840}, \'multiverseid\': 519840}, {\'name\': \'Noyau de Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Donc, même le cœur de notre monde a succombé. »\\n—Koth du Marteau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f66abc0-d83d-46ca-ad16-dd99268f7bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 520088}, \'multiverseid\': 520088}, {\'name\': \'Nucleo di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Quindi anche il cuore del nostro mondo ha ceduto."\\n—Koth del Martello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f043676-54bf-4700-bede-dd5b0f02e8dd\', \'multiverseId\': 520336}, \'multiverseid\': 520336}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの核\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの世界の中心すら屈服してしまった。」\\n――槌のコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd07f8e-5e7e-41d8-8940-561156613108\', \'multiverseId\': 520584}, \'multiverseid\': 520584}, {\'name\': \'Núcleo de Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique um artefato: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Então, até o coração de nosso mundo sucumbiu."\\n— Koth do Martelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7914f50-4978-4d64-9559-5acc09a16ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 520832}, \'multiverseid\': 520832}, {\'name\': \'Ядро Фирексии\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте артефакт: вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Итак, даже сердце нашего мира не устояло пред врагом».\\n— Кос из племени Молота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5ee396-8da9-4034-a5f4-cc4e7a229d97\', \'multiverseId\': 521080}, \'multiverseid\': 521080}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亚核心\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲一个神器：你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「原来连我们世界的心脏都屈服了。」\\n～锤族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a7cde8-53f1-46c0-a2e4-f6f718ebe757\', \'multiverseId\': 521328}, \'multiverseid\': 521328}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亞核心\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲一個神器：你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「原來連我們世界的心臟都屈服了。」\\n～鎚族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02d9dea-6287-4e43-8e8f-3f556faee02e\', \'multiverseId\': 521576}, \'multiverseid\': 521576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pia Nalaar\', \'text\': \'Wenn Pia Nalaar ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{1}{R}: Eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{1}, opfere ein Artefakt: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff643035-f6ee-4be3-bfd5-deee8009c392\', \'multiverseId\': 519460}, \'multiverseid\': 519460}, {\'name\': \'Pia Nalaar\', \'text\': \'Cuando Pia Nalaar entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{1}{R}: La criatura artefacto objetivo obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{1}, sacrificar un artefacto: La criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'633985d4-b04c-4116-94a9-cebc3ab8ef73\', \'multiverseId\': 519708}, \'multiverseid\': 519708}, {\'name\': \'Pia Nalaàr\', \'text\': "Quand Pia Nalaàr arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\n{1}{R} : Une créature-artefact ciblée gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{1}, sacrifiez un artefact : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519956&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f6ae6d-b591-45c6-b79b-da19fc80f29c\', \'multiverseId\': 519956}, \'multiverseid\': 519956}, {\'name\': \'Pia Nalaar\', \'text\': \'Quando Pia Nalaar entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\\n{1}{R}: Una creatura artefatto bersaglio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{1}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2a9a00-dc8a-4b82-847a-feb2a8aef9bf\', \'multiverseId\': 520204}, \'multiverseid\': 520204}, {\'name\': \'ピア・ナラー\', \'text\': \'ピア・ナラーが戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}{R}：アーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{1}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e90c64-1cff-4c12-ba75-d28790ac8354\', \'multiverseId\': 520452}, \'multiverseid\': 520452}, {\'name\': \'Pia Nalaar\', \'text\': \'Quando Pia Nalaar entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Tóptero incolor 1/1 com voar.\\n{1}{R}: A criatura artefato alvo recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\n{1}, sacrifique um artefato: A criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38486748-030f-44d4-9fab-1e87fd98698e\', \'multiverseId\': 520700}, \'multiverseid\': 520700}, {\'name\': \'Пия Налаар\', \'text\': \'Когда Пия Налаар выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\\n{1}{R}: целевой артефакт существо получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\\n{1}, пожертвуйте артефакт: целевое существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f56d444-dd27-435c-b263-4d1a4e18c952\', \'multiverseId\': 520948}, \'multiverseid\': 520948}, {\'name\': \'琵雅纳拉\', \'text\': \'当琵雅纳拉进战场时，派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\\n{1}{R}：目标神器生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n{1}，牺牲一个神器：目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ab56b5-f930-460f-92c7-98659d6e8795\', \'multiverseId\': 521196}, \'multiverseid\': 521196}, {\'name\': \'琵雅納拉\', \'text\': \'當琵雅納拉進戰場時，派出一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。\\n{1}{R}：目標神器生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。\\n{1}，犧牲一個神器：目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a674c54b-6782-4e15-a1ed-0dd4d4dc0353\', \'multiverseId\': 521444}, \'multiverseid\': 521444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pilzrücken-Stampfer\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, kannst du den Pilzrücken-Stampfer aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7efed3fe-64b3-4dd4-ac67-c2590cd79e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 518535}, \'multiverseid\': 518535}, {\'name\': \'Pantanoso espaldabrotes\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste vidas este turno, puedes lanzar el Pantanoso espaldabrotes desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f7a7520-9ae8-4d53-8f22-5706d235d13b\', \'multiverseId\': 518606}, \'multiverseid\': 518606}, {\'name\': \'Traînailleur germéchine\', \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné des points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez lancer le Traînailleur germéchine depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : fongus et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518677&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6775c9-df15-41c4-b680-3c33d0cbbe1c\', \'multiverseId\': 518677}, \'multiverseid\': 518677}, {\'name\': \'Micopalustre Germinodorso\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato punti vita in questo turno, puoi lanciare il Micopalustre Germinodorso dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c9d5418-a3be-4e7f-85dd-6ef4f43d3e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 518748}, \'multiverseid\': 518748}, {\'name\': \'発芽背のトラッジ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがライフを得ていた場合、あなたはあなたの墓地から発芽背のトラッジを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ef9711-154f-41a2-ad75-19c204b96ce6\', \'multiverseId\': 518819}, \'multiverseid\': 518819}, {\'name\': \'Rojo Fungidórseo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para ser conjurada, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\\nAtropelar\\nNo início de sua etapa final, se você ganhou pontos de vida neste turno, você pode conjurar Rojo Fungidórseo de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d030cf-fa6d-482d-a22f-0e5a4076de7d\', \'multiverseId\': 518890}, \'multiverseid\': 518890}, {\'name\': \'Обросший Болотник\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {X} меньше, где X — количество жизней, полученных вами в этом ходу.\\nПробивной удар\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага, если вы получали жизни в этом ходу, то вы можете разыграть Обросшего Болотника из вашего кладбища.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5adaba6-497f-4345-bcec-7f257b9b97b6\', \'multiverseId\': 518961}, \'multiverseid\': 518961}, {\'name\': \'孢背楚吉兽\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\\n践踏\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过生命，则你可以从你的坟墓场中施放孢背楚吉兽。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌／野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d47358aa-9389-4d7e-8b86-3541bf2b5806\', \'multiverseId\': 519032}, \'multiverseid\': 519032}, {\'name\': \'孢背楚吉獸\', \'text\': \'此咒語減少{X}來施放，X為你本回合中獲得過的生命數量。\\n踐踏\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，若你本回合中獲得過生命，則你可以從你的墳墓場中施放孢背楚吉獸。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌／野獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9499d5-e787-43a4-9187-f665af2aa3cf\', \'multiverseId\': 519103}, \'multiverseid\': 519103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pilzrücken-Stampfer\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, kannst du den Pilzrücken-Stampfer aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae783c6-5d35-46e3-bc8e-3823783c782c\', \'multiverseId\': 521744}, \'multiverseid\': 521744}, {\'name\': \'Pantanoso espaldabrotes\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste vidas este turno, puedes lanzar el Pantanoso espaldabrotes desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd717437-2b82-43c1-b51e-dbd3ff9ed726\', \'multiverseId\': 521824}, \'multiverseid\': 521824}, {\'name\': \'Traînailleur germéchine\', \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné des points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez lancer le Traînailleur germéchine depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : fongus et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bc4db0-100d-47f9-915f-b96486e456c0\', \'multiverseId\': 521904}, \'multiverseid\': 521904}, {\'name\': \'Micopalustre Germinodorso\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato punti vita in questo turno, puoi lanciare il Micopalustre Germinodorso dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb5df805-3ad6-4e3e-8637-a17afe55916f\', \'multiverseId\': 521984}, \'multiverseid\': 521984}, {\'name\': \'発芽背のトラッジ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがライフを得ていた場合、あなたはあなたの墓地から発芽背のトラッジを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb8591c-ce84-4e02-87c7-dde8d74039d5\', \'multiverseId\': 522064}, \'multiverseid\': 522064}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plaxwerfender Frosch\', \'text\': \'Pfropfen 3 (Diese Kreatur kommt mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke von dieser Kreatur auf die neue Kreatur bewegen.)\\n{2}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, erhält Verhülltheit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Frosch, Mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05333ca-d891-42b5-9eee-226fa1e233c5\', \'multiverseId\': 519509}, \'multiverseid\': 519509}, {\'name\': \'Renacuajo lanzaplax\', \'text\': \'Injertar 3. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla, puedes mover un contador +1/+1 de esta criatura a esa.)\\n{2}: La criatura objetivo con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella gana la habilidad de velo hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante rana\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0cfa2e7-06aa-4c53-b826-750f27701cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 519757}, \'multiverseid\': 519757}, {\'name\': \'Grenouilleau lanceplax\', \'text\': "Greffe 3 (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez déplacer un marqueur +1/+1 de cette créature sur elle.)\\n{2} : Une créature ciblée avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle acquiert le linceul jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)", \'type\': \'Créature : grenouille et mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520005&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b84ae736-6aef-424b-9544-6815fd5d0ddb\', \'multiverseId\': 520005}, \'multiverseid\': 520005}, {\'name\': \'Ranolingio Sputaplax\', \'text\': "Innesto 3 (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1. Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi spostare su quella creatura un segnalino +1/+1 da questa creatura.)\\n{2}: Una creatura bersaglio con un segnalino +1/+1 ha velo fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Rana\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f5c2d5-15af-48c7-8857-8ca42d525274\', \'multiverseId\': 520253}, \'multiverseid\': 520253}, {\'name\': \'粘体投げの小蛙\', \'text\': \'移植３（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンター３個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。これ以外のクリーチャー１体が戦場に出るたび、あなたはこのクリーチャーの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個をそれの上に移動してもよい。）\\n{2}：＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは被覆を得る。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カエル・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116bcc81-bc52-4289-b946-37aab3337f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 520501}, \'multiverseid\': 520501}, {\'name\': \'Sapo Lança-plax\', \'text\': \'Enxerto 3 (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores +1/+1. Toda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha, você pode mover um marcador +1/+1 desta criatura para aquela.)\\n{2}: A criatura alvo com um marcador +1/+1 ganha manto até o final do turno. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sapo Mutante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362a9de6-f158-4380-8e76-0d6aba424907\', \'multiverseId\': 520749}, \'multiverseid\': 520749}, {\'name\': \'Плаксовый Лягушонок\', \'text\': \'Прививка 3 (Это существо выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами +1/+1. Каждый раз, когда другое существо выходит на поле битвы, вы можете переместить на него один жетон +1/+1 с этого существа).\\n{2}: целевое существо с жетоном +1/+1 на нем получает Пелену до конца хода. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лягушка Мутант\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c2c8bf8-9339-4266-9be5-c3524b6354f3\', \'multiverseId\': 520997}, \'multiverseid\': 520997}, {\'name\': \'护板蛙兽\', \'text\': \'接殖3（此生物进战场时上面有三个+1/+1指示物。每当另一个生物进战场时，你可以将此生物上的一个+1/+1指示物移到前者上。）\\n{2}：目标其上有+1/+1指示物的生物获得帷幕异能直到回合结束。（它不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛙／突变体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'685d1ecb-8ace-4983-98a8-848ec6166700\', \'multiverseId\': 521245}, \'multiverseid\': 521245}, {\'name\': \'護板蛙獸\', \'text\': \'接殖3（此生物進戰場時上面有三個+1/+1指示物。每當另一個生物進戰場時，你可以將此生物上的一個+1/+1指示物移到前者上。）\\n{2}：目標其上有+1/+1指示物的生物獲得帷幕異能直到回合結束。（它不能成為咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛙／突變體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999d1a76-1182-459e-9e57-6dbaf423a8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 521493}, \'multiverseid\': 521493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polyederarchiv\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere das Polyederarchiv: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Du beginnst, den wahren Zweck der Polyeder zu verstehen", sagte Ugin. „Die Eldrazi können eingesperrt werden."\\n„Wir wissen ja, wie gut es das letzte Mal funktioniert hat …", antwortete Jace trocken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b618dc-79f1-4171-9190-145774e17bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 519527}, \'multiverseid\': 519527}, {\'name\': \'Edro de almacenaje\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro de almacenaje: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Estás comenzando a entender el verdadero propósito de los edros", dijo Ugin. "Los Eldrazi pueden ser encerrados".\\n"¿Y qué tal funcionó el sistema la última vez?", preguntó Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79da70ac-928c-45db-8ac9-c012934f3ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 519775}, \'multiverseid\': 519775}, {\'name\': \'Archive hèdron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Archive hèdron : Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Tu commences à comprendre le véritable rôle des hèdrons, dit Ugin. Les Eldrazi peuvent être emprisonnés. »\\n« Et comment cela s\'est-il fini la dernière fois ? » demanda Jace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520023&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1538c780-8abf-44ea-b4d6-6871749af2fe\', \'multiverseId\': 520023}, \'multiverseid\': 520023}, {\'name\': "Archivio nell\'Edro", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Archivio nell\'Edro: Pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai iniziando a comprendere la vera funzione degli edri," disse Ugin. "Gli Eldrazi possono essere imprigionati."\\n"E l\\\'ultima volta ha funzionato?" chiese Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24188baa-2ee2-4fa7-8a82-999d08d29480\', \'multiverseId\': 520271}, \'multiverseid\': 520271}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の記録庫\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 面晶体の記録庫を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは言った。「おぬしは面晶体の本来の目的を理解し始めておる。エルドラージを封じることができるのだ。」\\n「それで、前回はどうなったのですか？」ジェイスが訊いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1339b15-dd55-44d4-af4c-41b3b28ffa8e\', \'multiverseId\': 520519}, \'multiverseid\': 520519}, {\'name\': \'Arquivo de Edro\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Arquivo de Edro: Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Você começou a entender o verdadeiro propósito dos edros", disse Ugin. "Os Eldrazi podem ser aprisionados."\\n"E como é que isso acabou da última vez?", perguntou Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e898ee-0d5d-425e-ab8c-018812188f79\', \'multiverseId\': 520767}, \'multiverseid\': 520767}, {\'name\': \'Эдр-Архив\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Эдр-Архив: возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты начинаешь понимать истинное назначение эдров, — сказал Уджин. — Эльдрази можно пленить».\\n«И чем это закончилось в прошлый раз?» — ответил Джейс.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e453c8bd-faf5-4d14-a18a-8a2aadd8924d\', \'multiverseId\': 521015}, \'multiverseid\': 521015}, {\'name\': \'晶石档案\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲晶石档案：抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你已经开始明白晶石真正的用途了，」乌金说。「我们可以将奥札奇禁锢起来。」\\n「那上一次是怎么做到的？」杰斯问道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1e949d-08fa-447f-ac45-669db0e782c6\', \'multiverseId\': 521263}, \'multiverseid\': 521263}, {\'name\': \'晶石檔案\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，犧牲晶石檔案：抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你已經開始明白晶石真正的用途了，」烏金說。「我們可以將奧札奇禁錮起來。」\\n「那上一次是怎麼做到的？」傑斯問道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ca36b6-3ddc-41d4-a87c-34cdbce52430\', \'multiverseId\': 521511}, \'multiverseid\': 521511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preis des Ehrgeizes\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst drei Karten und verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Seine erste Welt zu erobern, ist am schwersten, aber Übung macht den Meister."\\n—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519417&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd4f55cf-67a7-4c6c-9bea-7f63baa7e751\', \'multiverseId\': 519417}, \'multiverseid\': 519417}, {\'name\': \'El precio de la ambición\', \'text\': \'Robas tres cartas y pierdes 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Conquistar tu primer mundo es el paso más difícil, al fin y al cabo. Después, mi poder crecía a medida que sometía plano tras plano, apoderándome de cualquier cosa que facilitase la siguiente invasión".\\n—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a42bc695-f44a-40bf-b021-1ca29f4f91ca\', \'multiverseId\': 519665}, \'multiverseid\': 519665}, {\'name\': "Le prix de l\'ambition", \'text\': \'Vous piochez trois cartes et vous perdez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est toujours la première conquête qui est la plus difficile. À chaque nouveau monde, mon pouvoir s\'est accru, rendant chaque conquête plus aisée que la précédente. »\\n—Ob Nixilis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42088936-095d-4183-8599-3d12a191b21c\', \'multiverseId\': 519913}, \'multiverseid\': 519913}, {\'name\': "Costo dell\'Ambizione", \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte e perdi 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La conquista del primo mondo, tutto sommato, è la più difficile. Nei viaggi da un piano all\\\'altro il mio potere si è rafforzato, rendendo ogni vittoria più semplice della precedente."\\n—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d62e7c3-4317-4b6a-86ca-64dedfb49713\', \'multiverseId\': 520161}, \'multiverseid\': 520161}, {\'name\': \'野望の代償\', \'text\': \'あなたはカード３枚を引き、３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「つまるところ最初の世界の征服が最も困難である。他の世界へと移り、次の征服をより容易にするものを手に入れていくことで、我の力は増大していった。」\\n――オブ・ニクシリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91aad861-ceff-498e-8479-69d12018182c\', \'multiverseId\': 520409}, \'multiverseid\': 520409}, {\'name\': \'Custo da Ambição\', \'text\': \'Você compra três cards e perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Conquistar o primeiro mundo é o mais difícil, afinal. Meu poder crescia conforme eu passava de um mundo a outro, tomando qualquer coisa que facilitasse a conquista seguinte."\\n— Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3c0313-b483-4055-bfbd-d315841ad496\', \'multiverseId\': 520657}, \'multiverseid\': 520657}, {\'name\': \'Цена Честолюбия\', \'text\': \'Вы берете три карты и теряете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Сложнее всего — захватить самый первый мир. Потом, когда я путешествовал между мирами, мое могущество только росло — я забирал себе всё, чтобы следующая битва была проще».\\n— Об-Никсилис\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b422a37-69da-4806-8452-1bcc5ffac092\', \'multiverseId\': 520905}, \'multiverseid\': 520905}, {\'name\': \'野心的代价\', \'text\': \'你抓三张牌且失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「到头来，还是第一个世界最难征服。随着我在世界之间穿行，我的力量愈发强大；无论向哪里下手，都会让下一次更为轻松。」\\n～欧尼希兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245eaa3a-820e-43c0-844f-37309910d50c\', \'multiverseId\': 521153}, \'multiverseid\': 521153}, {\'name\': \'野心的代價\', \'text\': \'你抽三張牌且失去3點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「到頭來，還是第一個世界最難征服。隨著我在世界之間穿行，我的力量愈發強大；無論向哪裡下手，都會讓下一次更為輕鬆。」\\n～歐尼希茲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f20a28c-b259-4a42-b8ad-b0b4d83d4a18\', \'multiverseId\': 521401}, \'multiverseid\': 521401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Puls der Essenz\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Jede Kreatur erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges -X/-X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nichts ist so erfrischend und beharrlich widerstandsfähig wie die reine Lebensenergie."\\n—Valentin, Dekan der Blütenwelk-Fakultät\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ffc2c0-5d04-4b53-95e2-a245110c30f0\', \'multiverseId\': 518506}, \'multiverseid\': 518506}, {\'name\': \'Pulso de esencia\', \'text\': \'Ganas 2 vidas. Cada criatura obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay nada tan vigorizador y agresivo como la pura energía de la vida".\\n—Valentin, decano de Flosmarcitus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d166b6cf-9775-43b6-85fb-13b31b22a5d6\', \'multiverseId\': 518577}, \'multiverseid\': 518577}, {\'name\': "Pulsation d\'essence", \'text\': "Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Chaque créature gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Rien n\'est plus vivifiant et aveuglément agressif que l\'énergie pure de la vie. »\\n—Valentin, doyen de Flestrefleur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73167173-29ba-416b-b8ba-7c47b394c311\', \'multiverseId\': 518648}, \'multiverseid\': 518648}, {\'name\': "Pulsazione dell\'Essenza", \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita. Ogni creatura prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è nulla di più rinvigorente e ostinatamente combattivo della pura energia vitale."\\n—Valentin, decano di Germoglioscuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e5de6a-a5d3-4cb5-ae4d-0941f6660ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 518719}, \'multiverseid\': 518719}, {\'name\': \'本質の脈動\', \'text\': \'あなたは２点のライフを得る。ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「純粋な生命のエネルギーほど、活発で、頑なに好戦的なものは他にない。」\\n――ウィザーブルームの学部長、ヴァレンティン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ca11e6-576e-4351-9ec1-5968156cb8dd\', \'multiverseId\': 518790}, \'multiverseid\': 518790}, {\'name\': \'Pulso da Essência\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 2 pontos de vida. Cada criatura recebe -X/-X até o final do turno, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há nada mais revigorante e obstinadamente agressivo do que a energia pura da vida."\\n— Valentin, decano de Murchaflor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bddb0525-5bf4-4912-b1dd-1b71768da6ae\', \'multiverseId\': 518861}, \'multiverseid\': 518861}, {\'name\': \'Биение Сущности\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 2 жизни. Каждое существо получает -X/-X до конца хода, где X — количество жизней, полученных вами в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Нет ничего настолько бодрящего и упрямо воинственного, как чистая энергия жизни».\\n— Валентин, декан Визерблума\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d80b5b-a11b-47ac-9777-794145021f82\', \'multiverseId\': 518932}, \'multiverseid\': 518932}, {\'name\': \'菁华脉动\', \'text\': \'你获得2点生命。每个生物各得-X/-X直到回合结束，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「生命的纯粹能量既能焕发活力，又会顽强争胜，世间无他物能及。」\\n～靡华院长瓦伦丁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d48353a-dc31-4be4-b79e-f1294130db7c\', \'multiverseId\': 519003}, \'multiverseid\': 519003}, {\'name\': \'菁華脈動\', \'text\': \'你獲得2點生命。每個生物各得-X/-X直到回合結束，X為你本回合中獲得過的生命數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「生命的純粹能量既能煥發活力，又會頑強爭勝，世間無他物能及。」\\n～靡華院長瓦倫丁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284f288e-9eba-4849-b8d4-831add4e3bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 519074}, \'multiverseid\': 519074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Puls der Essenz\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Jede Kreatur erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges -X/-X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703214fd-76d1-4183-b635-b17384fa97e8\', \'multiverseId\': 521715}, \'multiverseid\': 521715}, {\'name\': \'Pulso de esencia\', \'text\': \'Ganas 2 vidas. Cada criatura obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f316f3-d6be-470d-bea4-31b79a57b264\', \'multiverseId\': 521795}, \'multiverseid\': 521795}, {\'name\': "Pulsation d\'essence", \'text\': "Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Chaque créature gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521875&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e851add8-6aa6-49b6-a30e-542f8be8a859\', \'multiverseId\': 521875}, \'multiverseid\': 521875}, {\'name\': "Pulsazione dell\'Essenza", \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita. Ogni creatura prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c139d612-94c7-4ca8-b324-7afc28b024a1\', \'multiverseId\': 521955}, \'multiverseid\': 521955}, {\'name\': \'本質の脈動\', \'text\': \'あなたは２点のライフを得る。ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118afa3f-1f18-41e5-b228-b022510bc75d\', \'multiverseId\': 522035}, \'multiverseid\': 522035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Puls von Murasa\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Du erhältst 6 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Kleine Blume wachse, blühe, auf dem Grabe ohne Mühe. Kleiner Krieger kämpfe wacker, erstehe auf vom Totenacker."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3176f37b-02bd-4baf-a2f4-8bb1a03c7f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 519485}, \'multiverseid\': 519485}, {\'name\': \'Pulso de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura o de tierra objetivo de un cementerio a la mano de su propietario. Ganas 6 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Pequeño tallo marchito y rugoso, asoma la cabeza de tu túmulo rocoso. Guerrero del bosque con ramas de musgo, revive de nuevo y líbranos del yugo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52671ed-55e5-4c67-8533-78524b4cd3d2\', \'multiverseId\': 519733}, \'multiverseid\': 519733}, {\'name\': \'Pulsation de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ou de terrain ciblée depuis un cimetière dans la main de son propriétaire. Vous gagnez 6 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ondule et pousse petit végétal, élève-toi de ta tombe rocheuse. Tranche et combat petit guerrier, renais pour tous nous libérer. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519981&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afcef632-1437-41fc-8b08-68feab1880a9\', \'multiverseId\': 519981}, \'multiverseid\': 519981}, {\'name\': \'Battito di Murasa\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una carta creatura o terra bersaglio da un cimitero in mano al suo proprietario. Guadagni 6 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Piccolo fiore, germoglia e sboccia, innalzati da questa tua tomba di roccia. Piccolo guerriero, squarcia e combatti, rinasci per liberarci tutti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b19ec06-b1ec-42eb-b491-3ba72ff5c7f2\', \'multiverseId\': 520229}, \'multiverseid\': 520229}, {\'name\': \'ムラーサの胎動\', \'text\': \'墓地からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたは６点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「可憐な花の千々に咲き、なれの墓より茂るごと、試練の兵よ戻り来て、共に再び戦わん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cabdfe20-d665-4cc9-8dde-d45d7405990b\', \'multiverseId\': 520477}, \'multiverseid\': 520477}, {\'name\': \'Pulsação de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura ou de terreno alvo de um cemitério para a mão de seu dono. Você ganha 6 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pequena flor, brota e desabrocha. Deixa esta tumba de rocha. Pequeno guerreiro, venha lutar. Renasça para nos libertar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2146074f-f9c6-4e8a-a306-0daede6277e2\', \'multiverseId\': 520725}, \'multiverseid\': 520725}, {\'name\': \'Пульс Мурасы\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа или земли из кладбища в руку ее владельца. Вы получаете 6 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Цветочек маленький, расти, из каменной могилы поднимись. Воитель маленький, руби, и чтобы защитить нас — вновь родись».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550576ea-ff9a-4d5b-832d-7d385400c708\', \'multiverseId\': 520973}, \'multiverseid\': 520973}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒的脉动\', \'text\': \'将目标生物或地牌从坟墓场移回其拥有者手上。你获得6点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「幼枝新芳，伸展绽放，嶙峋石冢缠碧藤。幼少勇将，劈敌征战，复苏人世救众生。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6805ae13-f74b-41fd-8329-f363827416c4\', \'multiverseId\': 521221}, \'multiverseid\': 521221}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒的脈動\', \'text\': \'將目標生物或地牌從墳墓場移回其擁有者手上。你獲得6點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「幼枝新芳，伸展綻放，嶙峋石塚纏碧藤。幼少勇將，劈敵征戰，復甦人世救眾生。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8527800-bc19-4502-bd73-0214f3f2b919\', \'multiverseId\': 521469}, \'multiverseid\': 521469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Regentin der Nekropolis\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Jarad hält sich für den König der Unterstadt, dabei ist er nur der König der Fäulnis."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519430&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f0c359-a986-48f9-b2bc-d7799b4aadb6\', \'multiverseId\': 519430}, \'multiverseid\': 519430}, {\'name\': \'Regente de la necrópolis\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A Jarad le gusta pensar que es el rey de la subciudad, pero no es más que el rey de la podredumbre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60200413-7236-47a2-9637-900500604cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 519678}, \'multiverseid\': 519678}, {\'name\': \'Régente de la nécropole\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Jarad s\'imagine roi de la Citerraine, mais il ne règne que sur la pourriture. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519926&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160250b8-d4f1-4c8c-9135-a1904989ebd7\', \'multiverseId\': 519926}, \'multiverseid\': 519926}, {\'name\': \'Reggente della Necropoli\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Jarad si crede il re della città sepolta, ma è solo il re del marciume."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe96a5e9-3ddf-4587-a502-e4a0bda635d0\', \'multiverseId\': 520174}, \'multiverseid\': 520174}, {\'name\': \'死滅都市の執政\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それの上にその点数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「ジャラドは自分を地底街の王だと思い込んでいるけれど、あんなのは腐れの王に過ぎないわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c6965c-dd3f-4301-827a-a1a6295d50db\', \'multiverseId\': 520422}, \'multiverseid\': 520422}, {\'name\': \'Regente da Necrópole\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque uma quantidade equivalente de marcadores +1/+1 nela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Jarad acha que é o rei do submundo, mas é rei somente da podridão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb356455-fab5-455f-9a35-51a3b2028240\', \'multiverseId\': 520670}, \'multiverseid\': 520670}, {\'name\': \'Регент Некрополя\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите на него столько же жетонов +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Джарад объявил себя королем подземного города, но он всего лишь король гниения».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b4f0813-3277-4dbf-a33e-ed4fc94284aa\', \'multiverseId\': 520918}, \'multiverseid\': 520918}, {\'name\': \'古陵寝摄政\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，在该生物上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「贾雷自诩为地底城之王，但他只不过是个腐臭之王。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'861d6088-6c06-4f31-81ac-fa22781bce5b\', \'multiverseId\': 521166}, \'multiverseid\': 521166}, {\'name\': \'古陵寢攝政\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一個由你操控的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在該生物上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「賈雷自詡為地底城之王，但他只不過是個腐臭之王。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f6c97d-8892-49f5-82ba-123b5452486b\', \'multiverseId\': 521414}, \'multiverseid\': 521414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reinigende Nova\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre alle Kreaturen.\\n• Zerstöre alle Artefakte und Verzauberungen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Allerletzte, was die Dämonen erblickten, war Gnade in ihrer reinsten Form.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c0fbf39-52a7-498e-9e51-0b347e3293ba\', \'multiverseId\': 519369}, \'multiverseid\': 519369}, {\'name\': \'Nova purificadora\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye todas las criaturas.\\n• Destruye todos los artefactos y encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En sus últimos instantes, los demonios presenciaron la gracia en su forma más pura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7eac74e-5e99-4197-a875-386b083a416d\', \'multiverseId\': 519617}, \'multiverseid\': 519617}, {\'name\': \'Nova purificatrice\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez toutes les créatures.\\n• Détruisez tous les artefacts et tous les enchantements.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans leurs derniers instants, les démons contemplèrent la grâce à l\'état pur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0440fff4-2460-4181-8d5d-3bea1686e9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 519865}, \'multiverseid\': 519865}, {\'name\': \'Nova Purificatrice\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n● Distruggi tutte le creature.\\n● Distruggi tutti gli artefatti e gli incantesimi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Negli ultimi momenti di vita, i demoni contemplarono la grazia nella sua forma più pura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8cce58-42a1-4d1d-8aa1-9cbc3d63e87d\', \'multiverseId\': 520113}, \'multiverseid\': 520113}, {\'name\': \'浄化の輝き\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n• すべてのアーティファクトとすべてのエンチャントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最期の瞬間、悪魔たちは恩寵の本来の姿を見上げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1552063-6438-4bf0-8eb5-34710ab43046\', \'multiverseId\': 520361}, \'multiverseid\': 520361}, {\'name\': \'Nova Purificadora\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua todas as criaturas.\\n• Destrua todos os artefatos e encantamentos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nos momentos finais, os demônios contemplaram a graça em sua forma mais pura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0957b916-44b5-4a54-93aa-bd5b07786743\', \'multiverseId\': 520609}, \'multiverseid\': 520609}, {\'name\': \'Очистительная Вспышка\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте все существа.\\n• Уничтожьте все артефакты и чары.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В последние секунды жизни демоны узрели милосердие в его чистейшем виде.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385c79e1-a496-4cb4-8b4a-52f16254abe7\', \'multiverseId\': 520857}, \'multiverseid\': 520857}, {\'name\': \'涤净散华\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭所有生物。\\n•消灭所有神器和结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在生命的最后时刻，恶魔仰望天空，眼中只见至纯光辉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'162879c1-5c76-4575-9b5e-26d569ed763d\', \'multiverseId\': 521105}, \'multiverseid\': 521105}, {\'name\': \'滌淨散華\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•消滅所有生物。\\n•消滅所有神器和結界。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在生命的最後時刻，惡魔仰望天空，眼中只見至純光輝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e911c928-0588-46bf-bb63-4b24ada21e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 521353}, \'multiverseid\': 521353}]', '[{\'name\': \'Replikationsritual\', \'text\': \'Bonus {5} (Du kannst zusätzlich {5} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nErzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl ist. Falls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, erzeuge stattdessen fünf solcher Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519411&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe377e1-b94f-4e2d-9e44-61d363dc0974\', \'multiverseId\': 519411}, \'multiverseid\': 519411}, {\'name\': \'Rito de replicación\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {5}. (Puedes pagar {5} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nCrea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura objetivo. Si este hechizo fue estimulado, en vez de eso, crea cinco de esas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff35ee5-eac5-4101-90f1-553caec5cb0a\', \'multiverseId\': 519659}, \'multiverseid\': 519659}, {\'name\': \'Rite de duplication\', \'text\': "Kick {5} (Vous pouvez payer {5} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nCréez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature ciblée. Si ce sort a été kické, créez cinq de ces jetons à la place.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b43063-1f5c-4530-97b9-02de15518969\', \'multiverseId\': 519907}, \'multiverseid\': 519907}, {\'name\': \'Rito di Riproduzione\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {5} (Puoi pagare {5} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nCrea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura bersaglio. Se questa magia è stata potenziata, crea invece cinque di quelle pedine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b21bc7ec-e872-4779-bb36-c804037ddf6b\', \'multiverseId\': 520155}, \'multiverseid\': 520155}, {\'name\': \'複製の儀式\', \'text\': \'キッカー{5}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{5}を支払ってもよい。）\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。この呪文がキッカーされていたなら、代わりに、そのトークン５体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06edcf0e-0f2b-4899-9186-81c733e72e55\', \'multiverseId\': 520403}, \'multiverseid\': 520403}, {\'name\': \'Rito de Replicação\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {5} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {5} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nCrie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura alvo. Se esta mágica tiver sido reforçada, em vez disso, crie cinco dessas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50d20b9-921a-42d1-b74f-cab70a609aed\', \'multiverseId\': 520651}, \'multiverseid\': 520651}, {\'name\': \'Обряд Репликации\', \'text\': \'Усилитель {5} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {5}.)\\nСоздайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией целевого существа. Если это заклинание получило Усилитель, вместо этого создайте пять таких фишек.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f75909c1-69b3-42e2-a9de-1abc27f1f8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 520899}, \'multiverseid\': 520899}, {\'name\': \'模造仪式\', \'text\': \'增幅{5}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{5}。）\\n派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标生物之复制品。如果此咒语已增幅，则改为派出五个此类衍生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924c96ab-9537-4d61-bb29-0ffd24d87a9d\', \'multiverseId\': 521147}, \'multiverseid\': 521147}, {\'name\': \'模造儀式\', \'text\': \'增幅{5}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{5}。）\\n派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為目標生物之複製品。如果此咒語已增幅，則改為派出五個此類衍生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f58472-0896-4228-95de-01a2121f0f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 521395}, \'multiverseid\': 521395}]', '[{\'name\': \'Replikationsverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert. Spieler können neue Ziele für ihre Kopien bestimmen.)\\nErzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c003234-aecf-4701-9653-4bdb85eda523\', \'multiverseId\': 518498}, \'multiverseid\': 518498}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de replicación\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia. Los jugadores pueden elegir nuevos objetivos para sus copias.)\\nCrea una ficha que es una copia del permanente objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'537707fc-36e6-4ee0-94ae-57e813692ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 518569}, \'multiverseid\': 518569}, {\'name\': \'Technique de reproduction\', \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi. Les joueurs peuvent choisir de nouvelles cibles pour leurs copies.)\\nCréez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518640&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a26c96-a6bd-4360-a449-799ec4ab89f7\', \'multiverseId\': 518640}, \'multiverseid\': 518640}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Riproduzione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta. I giocatori possono scegliere nuovi bersagli per le proprie copie.)\\nCrea una pedina che è una copia di un permanente bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a0500b2-f250-4620-9305-8ebe71b6ee8b\', \'multiverseId\': 518711}, \'multiverseid\': 518711}, {\'name\': \'複製の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。両プレイヤーは自分のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つを対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ebf6963-55cd-4328-8549-f5aa3cbd92dd\', \'multiverseId\': 518782}, \'multiverseid\': 518782}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de Replicação\', \'text\': \'Demonstrar (Quando você conjura esta mágica, você pode copiá-la. Se fizer isso, escolha um oponente para copiá-la também. Os jogadores podem escolher novos alvos para as próprias cópias.)\\nCrie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da permanente alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d56a78-6f1e-4bef-8380-52a264a3ea5b\', \'multiverseId\': 518853}, \'multiverseid\': 518853}, {\'name\': \'Техника Повторения\', \'text\': \'Демонстрация (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, вы можете скопировать его. Если вы это делаете, выберите оппонента, который также скопирует его. Игроки могут выбрать новые цели для своих копий.)\\nСоздайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией целевого перманента под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32dc5320-3343-419e-b18b-3ef0a7181709\', \'multiverseId\': 518924}, \'multiverseid\': 518924}, {\'name\': \'复造技艺\', \'text\': \'示范（当你施放此咒语时，你可以将其复制。若你如此作，则选择一位对手一同复制。牌手可以为各自的复制品选择新的目标。）\\n派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控的永久物之复制品。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2002af0-2e83-4634-8ed9-39fcabea28fc\', \'multiverseId\': 518995}, \'multiverseid\': 518995}, {\'name\': \'複造技藝\', \'text\': \'示範（當你施放此咒語時，你可以將其複製。若你如此作，則選擇一位對手一同複製。玩家可以為各自的複製品選擇新的目標。）\\n派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為目標由你操控的永久物之複製品。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc62044c-5c28-4994-a7b9-23bc990b16a8\', \'multiverseId\': 519066}, \'multiverseid\': 519066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Replikationsverfahren\', \'text\': \'Demonstrieren (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du ihn kopieren. Falls du dies tust, bestimme einen Gegner, der ihn ebenfalls kopiert. Spieler können neue Ziele für ihre Kopien bestimmen.)\\nErzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521707&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff4faa5-30da-4cfc-9806-d73a1f61984e\', \'multiverseId\': 521707}, \'multiverseid\': 521707}, {\'name\': \'Técnica de replicación\', \'text\': \'Demostrar. (Cuando lances este hechizo, puedes copiarlo. Si lo haces, elige un oponente que también lo copia. Los jugadores pueden elegir nuevos objetivos para sus copias.)\\nCrea una ficha que es una copia del permanente objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387b8f7f-d43e-4578-aec4-c35632d68fc3\', \'multiverseId\': 521787}, \'multiverseid\': 521787}, {\'name\': \'Technique de reproduction\', \'text\': "Démonstration (Quand vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez le copier. Si vous faites ainsi, choisissez un adversaire pour qu\'il le copie aussi. Les joueurs peuvent choisir de nouvelles cibles pour leurs copies.)\\nCréez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc0c040-dea4-4644-823e-5101874fe3b5\', \'multiverseId\': 521867}, \'multiverseid\': 521867}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica di Riproduzione\', \'text\': \'Dimostrare (Quando lanci questa magia, puoi copiarla. Se lo fai, scegli un avversario che la copia a sua volta. I giocatori possono scegliere nuovi bersagli per le proprie copie.)\\nCrea una pedina che è una copia di un permanente bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ceca6a-dc43-4514-b798-585a426b27f6\', \'multiverseId\': 521947}, \'multiverseid\': 521947}, {\'name\': \'複製の技\', \'text\': \'実演（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたは「これをコピーし、対戦相手１人にもこれをコピーさせる。両プレイヤーは自分のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つを対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f24bf38-34d8-4d0b-95a6-812fcafe754c\', \'multiverseId\': 522027}, \'multiverseid\': 522027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Riffwürmchen\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Riffwürmchen stirbt, erzeuge einen 3/3 blauen Fisch-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 6/6 blauen Wal-Kreaturenspielstein mit ,Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 9/9 blauen Krake-Kreaturenspielstein.\\\'"\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Würmchen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6dcb1f-1300-4a7a-8cee-5d98a6bd65e7\', \'multiverseId\': 519410}, \'multiverseid\': 519410}, {\'name\': \'Gusano de arrecife\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gusano de arrecife muera, crea una ficha de criatura Pez azul 3/3 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, crea una ficha de criatura Ballena azul 6/6 con \\\'Cuando esta criatura muera, crea una ficha de criatura Kraken azul 9/9\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gusano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32eefb06-cd35-4f94-a6f9-5a6fa804df80\', \'multiverseId\': 519658}, \'multiverseid\': 519658}, {\'name\': \'Ver de récif\', \'text\': "Quand le Ver de récif meurt, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 bleue Poisson avec « Quand cette créature meurt, créez un jeton de créature 6/6 bleue Baleine avec \'Quand cette créature meurt, créez un jeton de créature 9/9 bleue Kraken.\' »", \'type\': \'Créature : ver\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8954072-7882-4640-8368-640553ff5e81\', \'multiverseId\': 519906}, \'multiverseid\': 519906}, {\'name\': \'Verme della Scogliera\', \'text\': \'Quando il Verme della Scogliera muore, crea una pedina creatura Pesce 3/3 blu con "Quando questa creatura muore, crea una pedina creatura Balena 6/6 blu con \\\'Quando questa creatura muore, crea una pedina creatura Kraken 9/9 blu\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Verme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d5b481f-f77c-4978-bbfb-1bfaed41e8f4\', \'multiverseId\': 520154}, \'multiverseid\': 520154}, {\'name\': \'浅瀬蟲\', \'text\': \'浅瀬蟲が死亡したとき、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、『このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、青の９/９のクラーケン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。』を持つ青の６/６の鯨・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ青の３/３の魚・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蟲\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4878d28e-f499-4bea-a317-057bec43e870\', \'multiverseId\': 520402}, \'multiverseid\': 520402}, {\'name\': \'Verme do Recife\', \'text\': \'Quando Verme do Recife morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Peixe azul 3/3 com "Quando esta criatura morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Baleia azul 6/6 com \\\'Quando esta criatura morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Kraken azul 9/9.\\\'"\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Verme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7783af75-1bf2-444c-9c55-2030527dcdc6\', \'multiverseId\': 520650}, \'multiverseid\': 520650}, {\'name\': \'Рифовый Червь\', \'text\': \'Когда Рифовый Червь умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 3/3 синяя Рыба со способностью «Когда это существо умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 6/6 синий Кит со способностью „Когда это существо умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 9/9 синий Кракен"».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Червь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c75031-2aa7-45b9-988c-be6b48bf3222\', \'multiverseId\': 520898}, \'multiverseid\': 520898}, {\'name\': \'暗礁水蛆\', \'text\': \'当暗礁水蛆死去时，派出一个3/3蓝色的鱼衍生生物，且具有「当此生物死去时，派出一个6/6蓝色鲸鱼衍生生物，且具有『当此生物死去时，派出一个9/9蓝色巨海兽衍生生物。』」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蠕虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19597003-c02b-42d4-943a-340be2a8995d\', \'multiverseId\': 521146}, \'multiverseid\': 521146}, {\'name\': \'暗礁水蛆\', \'text\': \'當暗礁水蛆死去時，派出一個3/3藍色的魚衍生生物，且具有「當此生物死去時，派出一個6/6藍色鯨魚衍生生物，且具有『當此生物死去時，派出一個9/9藍色巨海獸衍生生物。』」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蠕蟲\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4150d374-99f0-4c72-a827-4236cd600ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 521394}, \'multiverseid\': 521394}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rionya die Feuertänzerin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du X Spielsteine, die Kopien einer anderen Kreatur deiner Wahl sind, die du kontrollierst, wobei X gleich eins plus der Anzahl an Spontanzaubern und Hexereien ist, die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e12c373-300e-4d5c-a603-72d5842bde2b\', \'multiverseId\': 518522}, \'multiverseid\': 518522}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, bailarina de fuego\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea X fichas que son copias de otra criatura objetivo que controlas, donde X es uno más la cantidad de hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro que lanzaste este turno. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Exílialas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc03219b-8318-420d-b9e5-60e895aa043a\', \'multiverseId\': 518593}, \'multiverseid\': 518593}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, danseuse du feu\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez X jetons qui sont des copies d\'une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, X étant un plus le nombre de sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancés ce tour-ci. Ils acquièrent la célérité. Exilez-les au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518664&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5e39b3-99d2-44b1-8c39-2b4fcfb5dd6c\', \'multiverseId\': 518664}, \'multiverseid\': 518664}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, Danzatrice del Fuoco\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea X pedine che sono copie di un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli, dove X è uno più il numero di magie istantaneo e stregoneria che hai lanciato in questo turno. Queste pedine hanno rapidità. Esiliale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba9433e1-2b75-45f1-8b84-1eed85be1666\', \'multiverseId\': 518735}, \'multiverseid\': 518735}, {\'name\': \'炎の踊り手、リオーニャ\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、これ以外であなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはこのターンにあなたが唱えた、インスタントやソーサリーである呪文の数に１を足した値に等しい。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e276a661-93d7-42f8-acde-0036c87ee2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 518806}, \'multiverseid\': 518806}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, Dançarina do Fogo\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, crie X fichas que sejam cópias de outra criatura alvo que você controla, sendo X igual a um mais o número de mágicas instantâneas e feitiços que você conjurou neste turno. Elas ganham ímpeto. Exile-as no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a89e602-5470-41ef-9fea-49967e429d15\', \'multiverseId\': 518877}, \'multiverseid\': 518877}, {\'name\': \'Риония, Огненная Танцовщица\', \'text\': \'В начале боя во время вашего хода создайте X фишек, являющихся копиями другого целевого существа под вашим контролем, где X — один плюс количество мгновенных заклинаний и заклинаний волшебства, которые вы разыграли в этом ходу. Они получают Ускорение. Изгоните их в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'843710ed-a1a2-49ca-9062-786ddef8c6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 518948}, \'multiverseid\': 518948}, {\'name\': \'舞火莉昂雅\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，派出X个为另一个目标由你操控的生物之复制品的衍生物，X为你本回合中施放过的瞬间和法术咒语数量加一。它们获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们放逐。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91fc7d35-0c2d-4dbe-b347-1a6d508444b1\', \'multiverseId\': 519019}, \'multiverseid\': 519019}, {\'name\': \'舞火莉昂雅\', \'text\': \'在你回合的戰鬥開始時，派出X個為另一個目標由你操控的生物之複製品的衍生物，X為你本回合中施放過的瞬間和巫術咒語數量加一。它們獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它們放逐。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e09ae1-96c9-4011-91d5-7df4f665bae5\', \'multiverseId\': 519090}, \'multiverseid\': 519090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rionya die Feuertänzerin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du X Spielsteine, die Kopien einer anderen Kreatur deiner Wahl sind, die du kontrollierst, wobei X gleich eins plus der Anzahl an Spontanzaubern und Hexereien ist, die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f854e6e4-5270-407f-a713-b0634921ee1b\', \'multiverseId\': 521731}, \'multiverseid\': 521731}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, bailarina de fuego\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea X fichas que son copias de otra criatura objetivo que controlas, donde X es uno más la cantidad de hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro que lanzaste este turno. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Exílialas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7adcb5b7-2276-4fa5-8420-fb555002c091\', \'multiverseId\': 521811}, \'multiverseid\': 521811}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, danseuse du feu\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez X jetons qui sont des copies d\'une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, X étant un plus le nombre de sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancés ce tour-ci. Ils acquièrent la célérité. Exilez-les au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15005fcb-f565-4569-ab20-91b67220ca71\', \'multiverseId\': 521891}, \'multiverseid\': 521891}, {\'name\': \'Rionya, Danzatrice del Fuoco\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea X pedine che sono copie di un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli, dove X è uno più il numero di magie istantaneo e stregoneria che hai lanciato in questo turno. Queste pedine hanno rapidità. Esiliale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf020d72-d12c-4fe7-b1d3-cd573a9c9612\', \'multiverseId\': 521971}, \'multiverseid\': 521971}, {\'name\': \'炎の踊り手、リオーニャ\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、これ以外であなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはこのターンにあなたが唱えた、インスタントやソーサリーである呪文の数に１を足した値に等しい。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed2ddb8-b524-4b25-b167-67ed1bb932c5\', \'multiverseId\': 522051}, \'multiverseid\': 522051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ritter der weißen Orchidee\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nWenn der Ritter der weißen Orchidee ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef47d53-f3c7-4fc8-b006-ceb9cdc6527c\', \'multiverseId\': 519378}, \'multiverseid\': 519378}, {\'name\': \'Caballero de la Orquídea Blanca\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuando el Caballero de la Orquídea Blanca entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'774bbb32-60c3-4c23-99e2-b35d37e85290\', \'multiverseId\': 519626}, \'multiverseid\': 519626}, {\'name\': "Chevalier de l\'Orchidée blanche", \'text\': "Initiative\\nQuand le Chevalier de l\'Orchidée blanche arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ab87b3a-b520-4efc-be35-09eeacc1a3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 519874}, \'multiverseid\': 519874}, {\'name\': "Cavaliere dell\'Orchidea Bianca", \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nQuando il Cavaliere dell\'Orchidea Bianca entra nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, metterla sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b5fd0c-8d21-43e5-85b4-1ed4dfec43d2\', \'multiverseId\': 520122}, \'multiverseid\': 520122}, {\'name\': \'白蘭の騎士\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n白蘭の騎士が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72dffe7-d89e-4cd3-85af-423ac6c7cfc4\', \'multiverseId\': 520370}, \'multiverseid\': 520370}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro da Orquídea Branca\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nQuando Cavaleiro da Orquídea Branca entra no campo de batalha, se um oponente controla mais terrenos que você, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de Planície, colocá-lo no campo de batalha e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1d4ef0-31d9-46ad-b7ac-188862b17848\', \'multiverseId\': 520618}, \'multiverseid\': 520618}, {\'name\': \'Рыцарь Белой Орхидеи\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКогда Рыцарь Белой Орхидеи выходит на поле битвы, если под контролем оппонента больше земель, чем под вашим контролем, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, положить ее на поле битвы, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92af3b5-8755-4fce-9a62-495043c2c867\', \'multiverseId\': 520866}, \'multiverseid\': 520866}, {\'name\': \'白兰骑士\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n当白兰骑士进战场时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2fa2d71-0a35-4fa9-8ce7-a89634910e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 521114}, \'multiverseid\': 521114}, {\'name\': \'白蘭騎士\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n當白蘭騎士進戰場時，若某對手操控的地比你多，則你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張平原牌，將之放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b36d031-30ae-4af0-963b-74e412b06c53\', \'multiverseId\': 521362}, \'multiverseid\': 521362}]', "[{'name': 'Ruinenschleifer', 'text': 'Bedrohlich\\nWenn der Ruinenschleifer stirbt, kann jeder Spieler alle Karten aus seiner Hand abwerfen und sieben Karten ziehen.\\nGebirgsumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirge-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518524&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f556a350-caa4-4518-b184-7c61d6e9333c', 'multiverseId': 518524}, 'multiverseid': 518524}, {'name': 'Demoledora de ruinas', 'text': 'Amenaza.\\nCuando la Demoledora de ruinas muera, cada jugador puede descartar su mano y robar siete cartas.\\nCiclo de montaña {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Montaña, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518595&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce257525-d7ce-4124-8078-4d6821e31e3c', 'multiverseId': 518595}, 'multiverseid': 518595}, {'name': 'Broyeur de ruines', 'text': 'Menace\\nQuand le Broyeur de ruines meurt, chaque joueur peut se défausser de sa main et piocher sept cartes.\\nRecyclage de montagne {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de montagne, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518666&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1dbf552-dc66-48f5-9155-5b873b39f701', 'multiverseId': 518666}, 'multiverseid': 518666}, {'name': 'Tritarovine', 'text': 'Minacciare\\nQuando il Tritarovine muore, ogni giocatore può scartare la propria mano e pescare sette carte.\\nCiclomontagna {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Montagna, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518737&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '786fcadb-a751-453e-88f9-786e7217fade', 'multiverseId': 518737}, 'multiverseid': 518737}, {'name': '遺跡掘削機', 'text': '威迫\\n遺跡掘削機が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ「自分の手札を捨て、カード７枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\\n山サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから山・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518808&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b18c28c9-ba0a-439c-8813-ffb7139a2886', 'multiverseId': 518808}, 'multiverseid': 518808}, {'name': 'Moedor de Ruínas', 'text': 'Ameaçar\\nQuando Moedor de Ruínas morre, cada jogador pode descartar a própria mão e comprar sete cards.\\nReciclar montanha {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de Montanha, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.)', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518879&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f8c25d0-68e3-4ba4-8a3e-010f5fe4da7c', 'multiverseId': 518879}, 'multiverseid': 518879}, {'name': 'Истиратель Руин', 'text': 'Угроза\\nКогда Истиратель Руин умирает, каждый игрок может сбросить свою руку и взять семь карт.\\nЦикл Гор {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Горы, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.)', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518950&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9deb516-d2bf-41ad-a3af-26d2b1bef0d6', 'multiverseId': 518950}, 'multiverseid': 518950}, {'name': '遗迹碾磨工', 'text': '威慑\\n当遗迹碾磨工死去时，每位牌手各可以弃掉其手牌并抓七张牌。\\n循环山脉{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张山脉牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519021&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc6644d0-2bb0-4a92-bb5c-58ec15b8f189', 'multiverseId': 519021}, 'multiverseid': 519021}, {'name': '遺跡碾磨工', 'text': '威懾\\n當遺跡碾磨工死去時，每位玩家各可以棄掉其手牌並抽七張牌。\\n循環山脈{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張山脈牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。）', 'type': '神器生物 ～組構體', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519092&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4caf9dfb-eef3-49ac-821f-a923c3cccb4a', 'multiverseId': 519092}, 'multiverseid': 519092}]", "[{'name': 'Ruinenschleifer', 'text': 'Bedrohlich\\nWenn der Ruinenschleifer stirbt, kann jeder Spieler alle Karten aus seiner Hand abwerfen und sieben Karten ziehen.\\nGebirgsumwandlung {2}', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521733&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4abbcdf7-eaa9-4e70-9184-46682c85c030', 'multiverseId': 521733}, 'multiverseid': 521733}, {'name': 'Demoledora de ruinas', 'text': 'Amenaza.\\nCuando la Demoledora de ruinas muera, cada jugador puede descartar su mano y robar siete cartas.\\nCiclo de montaña {2}.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521813&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8070c13-f721-4eda-9ae0-705365f00283', 'multiverseId': 521813}, 'multiverseid': 521813}, {'name': 'Broyeur de ruines', 'text': 'Menace\\nQuand le Broyeur de ruines meurt, chaque joueur peut se défausser de sa main et piocher sept cartes.\\nRecyclage de montagne {2}', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521893&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c48635bf-4cc7-4c0b-b6e6-217c010500f1', 'multiverseId': 521893}, 'multiverseid': 521893}, {'name': 'Tritarovine', 'text': 'Minacciare\\nQuando il Tritarovine muore, ogni giocatore può scartare la propria mano e pescare sette carte.\\nCiclomontagna {2}', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521973&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec5a98a7-7af8-4cc5-a444-c0748f5ddf3e', 'multiverseId': 521973}, 'multiverseid': 521973}, {'name': '遺跡掘削機', 'text': '威迫\\n遺跡掘削機が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ「自分の手札を捨て、カード７枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\\n山サイクリング{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522053&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06506787-1089-4632-b336-5bd2195725e8', 'multiverseId': 522053}, 'multiverseid': 522053}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle\', \'text\': \'Die Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Die Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle werden bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 grünen und blauen Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Fluchsicherheit. Sie sind immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519582&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c358ae-b800-41f9-9721-1a0e7c450485\', \'multiverseId\': 519582}, \'multiverseid\': 519582}, {\'name\': \'Cascada estruendosa\', \'text\': \'La Cascada estruendosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: La Cascada estruendosa se convierte en una criatura Elemental verde y azul 3/3 con la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050a63bd-45ae-476f-bf5b-9fc0ef280b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 519830}, \'multiverseid\': 519830}, {\'name\': \'Chutes mugissantes\', \'text\': "Les Chutes mugissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U} : Les Chutes mugissantes deviennent une créature 3/3 verte et bleue Élémental avec la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85456383-bbd5-47ec-ae5d-5878b3843273\', \'multiverseId\': 520078}, \'multiverseid\': 520078}, {\'name\': \'Cascate Roboanti\', \'text\': \'Le Cascate Roboanti entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Le Cascate Roboanti diventano una creatura Elementale 3/3 verde e blu con anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. Sono ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c7fb0f-14ad-4a79-a8dc-0fa55d4b7186\', \'multiverseId\': 520326}, \'multiverseid\': 520326}, {\'name\': \'伐採地の滝\', \'text\': \'伐採地の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\\n{2}{G}{U}：ターン終了時まで、伐採地の滝は呪禁を持ち緑であり青である３/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ae473b-33ac-4d9e-a8ed-c4994c30ddce\', \'multiverseId\': 520574}, \'multiverseid\': 520574}, {\'name\': \'Quedas Estrondosas\', \'text\': \'Quedas Estrondosas entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Quedas Estrondosas torna-se uma criatura Elemental verde e azul 3/3 com resistência a magia até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b184eb6-c884-461c-8695-4b3369b81290\', \'multiverseId\': 520822}, \'multiverseid\': 520822}, {\'name\': \'Рокочущие Водопады\', \'text\': \'Рокочущие Водопады выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Рокочущие Водопады становятся существом 3/3 зеленый и синий Элементаль с Порчеустойчивостью до конца хода. При этом они остаются землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6b59f5-b966-46cb-9163-add13dc1450a\', \'multiverseId\': 521070}, \'multiverseid\': 521070}, {\'name\': \'林木瀑布\', \'text\': \'林木瀑布须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。\\n{2}{G}{U}：林木瀑布成为3/3，绿蓝双色，具辟邪异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b99fb4ad-fd9f-4b00-b509-d6ce5c9066ee\', \'multiverseId\': 521318}, \'multiverseid\': 521318}, {\'name\': \'林木瀑布\', \'text\': \'林木瀑布須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。\\n{2}{G}{U}：林木瀑布成為3/3，綠藍雙色，具辟邪異能的元素生物直到回合結束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecefd377-f81f-41a3-b4a7-cebde020caab\', \'multiverseId\': 521566}, \'multiverseid\': 521566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruxa, geduldiger Professor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Ruxa, geduldiger Professor, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl ohne Fähigkeiten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nKreaturen ohne Fähigkeiten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nDu kannst Kreaturen ohne Fähigkeiten, die du kontrollierst, ihren Kampfschaden zuweisen lassen, als ob sie nicht geblockt würden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906a3369-c9ce-4b97-91dd-af2b83dbe94e\', \'multiverseId\': 518533}, \'multiverseid\': 518533}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, profesor paciente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Ruxa, profesor paciente entre al campo de batalla o ataque, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo sin habilidades de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nLas criaturas que controlas sin habilidades obtienen +1/+1.\\nPuedes hacer que las criaturas que controlas sin habilidades hagan su daño de combate como si no hubieran sido bloqueadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida oso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d13727-97ee-4c94-8086-7dd996c26fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 518604}, \'multiverseid\': 518604}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, professeur patient\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Ruxa, professeur patient arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, renvoyez une carte de créature sans capacité ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nLes créatures sans capacité que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nVous pouvez faire que les créatures sans capacité que vous contrôlez attribuent leurs blessures de combat comme si elles n\'étaient pas bloquées.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ours et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2546d2ca-7f2a-407b-96ab-6498705b51f5\', \'multiverseId\': 518675}, \'multiverseid\': 518675}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, Professore Paziente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Ruxa, Professore Paziente entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio senza abilità dal tuo cimitero.\\nLe creature senza abilità che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nPuoi far assegnare alle creature senza abilità che controlli il loro danno da combattimento come se non fossero state bloccate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Orso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018b039a-43b2-46d1-a55f-6d4f20d270f4\', \'multiverseId\': 518746}, \'multiverseid\': 518746}, {\'name\': \'忍耐強い教授、ラクサ\', \'text\': \'忍耐強い教授、ラクサが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地から能力を持たないクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて能力を持たないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたは、あなたがコントロールしていて能力を持たないすべてのクリーチャーが与える戦闘ダメージを、それらのクリーチャーがブロックされなかったかのように割り振ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04445ac0-82ab-4f41-a23b-445630318b91\', \'multiverseId\': 518817}, \'multiverseid\': 518817}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, Professor Paciente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Ruxa, Professor Paciente, entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, devolva o card de criatura alvo sem habilidades de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nAs criaturas que você controla sem habilidades recebem +1/+1.\\nVocê pode fazer com que as criaturas que você controla sem habilidades atribuam o próprio dano de combate como se não tivessem sido bloqueadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Urso Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb16298-5624-4047-a9ba-138b476bc64f\', \'multiverseId\': 518888}, \'multiverseid\': 518888}, {\'name\': \'Рукса, Терпеливый Профессор\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Рукса, Терпеливый Профессор выходит на поле битвы или атакует, верните целевую карту существа без способностей из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nСущества без способностей под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nВы можете заставить существа без способностей под вашим контролем распределять боевые повреждения, как если бы они не были заблокированы.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Медведь Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9713cd51-d3e8-461c-9c85-2e01a1e6beb9\', \'multiverseId\': 518959}, \'multiverseid\': 518959}, {\'name\': \'耐心教授鲁克夏\', \'text\': \'每当耐心教授鲁克夏进战场或攻击时，将目标不具异能的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n由你操控且不具异能的生物得+1/+1。\\n你可以使由你操控且不具异能的生物视同未受阻挡地分配战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～熊／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0433ec9b-334a-4d55-a502-d139ccd529fc\', \'multiverseId\': 519030}, \'multiverseid\': 519030}, {\'name\': \'耐心教授魯克夏\', \'text\': \'每當耐心教授魯克夏進戰場或攻擊時，將目標不具異能的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\n由你操控且不具異能的生物得+1/+1。\\n你可以使由你操控且不具異能的生物如同未受阻擋地分配戰鬥傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～熊／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e2b6f37-d60f-4bc3-ae49-a26239096fd5\', \'multiverseId\': 519101}, \'multiverseid\': 519101}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruxa, geduldiger Professor\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Ruxa, geduldiger Professor, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl ohne Fähigkeiten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nKreaturen ohne Fähigkeiten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nDu kannst Kreaturen ohne Fähigkeiten, die du kontrollierst, ihren Kampfschaden zuweisen lassen, als ob sie nicht geblockt würden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83c3f4d0-833b-402a-8d4c-f68d38fa92fc\', \'multiverseId\': 521742}, \'multiverseid\': 521742}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, profesor paciente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Ruxa, profesor paciente entre al campo de batalla o ataque, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo sin habilidades de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nLas criaturas que controlas sin habilidades obtienen +1/+1.\\nPuedes hacer que las criaturas que controlas sin habilidades hagan su daño de combate como si no hubieran sido bloqueadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida oso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07a03a18-d36b-4775-a76b-edd1d055b855\', \'multiverseId\': 521822}, \'multiverseid\': 521822}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, professeur patient\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Ruxa, professeur patient arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, renvoyez une carte de créature sans capacité ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nLes créatures sans capacité que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nVous pouvez faire que les créatures sans capacité que vous contrôlez attribuent leurs blessures de combat comme si elles n\'étaient pas bloquées.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ours et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7952e01d-d763-40d5-a729-d0fe9e997057\', \'multiverseId\': 521902}, \'multiverseid\': 521902}, {\'name\': \'Ruxa, Professore Paziente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Ruxa, Professore Paziente entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio senza abilità dal tuo cimitero.\\nLe creature senza abilità che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nPuoi far assegnare alle creature senza abilità che controlli il loro danno da combattimento come se non fossero state bloccate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Orso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9d522ac-0683-4d89-a343-01eafa98cdca\', \'multiverseId\': 521982}, \'multiverseid\': 521982}, {\'name\': \'忍耐強い教授、ラクサ\', \'text\': \'忍耐強い教授、ラクサが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地から能力を持たないクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて能力を持たないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたは、あなたがコントロールしていて能力を持たないすべてのクリーチャーが与える戦闘ダメージを、それらのクリーチャーがブロックされなかったかのように割り振ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8cced1c-52b7-4e4e-aae1-9fe39b9a047e\', \'multiverseId\': 522062}, \'multiverseid\': 522062}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückkehr des Wildsprechers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\n• Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Fluch ist gebrochen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519488&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ed7a4df-d6da-4e25-8d9d-b6edf462cf80\', \'multiverseId\': 519488}, \'multiverseid\': 519488}, {\'name\': \'Regreso del Portavoz Salvaje\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas.\\n• Las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas obtienen +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ha roto la maldición".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09089183-c748-4f05-8f91-6ff7a7889029\', \'multiverseId\': 519736}, \'multiverseid\': 519736}, {\'name\': \'Retour du Languebestion\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez.\\n• Les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La malédiction est brisée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519984&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9539ba76-43c7-43db-9c3f-1896e140725b\', \'multiverseId\': 519984}, \'multiverseid\': 519984}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno di Lingua Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Pesca carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature non Umano che controlli.\\n• Le creature non Umano che controlli prendono +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La maledizione è stata spezzata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f33b4f6-05bd-4188-999c-1dfda1754c81\', \'multiverseId\': 520232}, \'multiverseid\': 520232}, {\'name\': \'野生語りの帰還\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャーのパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「呪いは解けた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d1ee33-28b8-4ee2-b61e-8b1968732ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 520480}, \'multiverseid\': 520480}, {\'name\': \'Retorno do Falabravo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Compre uma quantidade de cards igual ao maior poder entre as criaturas não Humano que você controla.\\n• As criaturas não Humano que você controla recebem +3/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A maldição foi quebrada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f5f34b1-ea63-464d-b4b1-dd44bcecf7a9\', \'multiverseId\': 520728}, \'multiverseid\': 520728}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение Дикоречивого\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению силы среди не являющихся Человеком существ под вашим контролем.\\n• Не являющиеся Человеком существа под вашим контролем получают +3/+3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Проклятье снято».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935fe992-aa8c-40a1-b0e4-5f1d273deeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 520976}, \'multiverseid\': 520976}, {\'name\': \'召兽使复归\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的非人类生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n•由你操控的非人类生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「诅咒失效了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66a5842-edcc-4e8c-ac64-f6930bb3a321\', \'multiverseId\': 521224}, \'multiverseid\': 521224}, {\'name\': \'召獸使復歸\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n‧抽若干牌，其數量等同於由你操控的非人類生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n‧由你操控的非人類生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「詛咒失效了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'527ba589-5ce8-46d5-81c6-84f1e2c1bf50\', \'multiverseId\': 521472}, \'multiverseid\': 521472}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sangumagier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, kannst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte abwirft, kannst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53aa5e35-bc40-406f-973d-7dd6eaca75ef\', \'multiverseId\': 519435}, \'multiverseid\': 519435}, {\'name\': \'Sangromante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, puedes ganar 3 vidas.\\nSiempre que un oponente descarte una carta, puedes ganar 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd95a1a4-9668-4aae-9d91-34260fc8d1cc\', \'multiverseId\': 519683}, \'multiverseid\': 519683}, {\'name\': \'Sangromancienne\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, vous pouvez gagner 3 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire se défausse d\'une carte, vous pouvez gagner 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292193c4-9b8b-4188-93bf-ed5455bf30c9\', \'multiverseId\': 519931}, \'multiverseid\': 519931}, {\'name\': \'Ematomante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, puoi guadagnare 3 punti vita.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario scarta una carta, puoi guadagnare 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895ebc62-0a60-4efb-8434-936b4b1cb017\', \'multiverseId\': 520179}, \'multiverseid\': 520179}, {\'name\': \'吸血術士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは３点のライフを得てもよい。\\n対戦相手がカード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたは３点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d35652f-f4ec-4fda-9260-cdf518682cab\', \'multiverseId\': 520427}, \'multiverseid\': 520427}, {\'name\': \'Sangromante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla morre, você pode ganhar 3 pontos de vida.\\nToda vez que um oponente descarta um card, você pode ganhar 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dff1bec-cdcf-4a72-b665-4db5f657c561\', \'multiverseId\': 520675}, \'multiverseid\': 520675}, {\'name\': \'Сангромант\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под контролем оппонента умирает, вы можете получить 3 жизни.\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент сбрасывает карту, вы можете получить 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1275d789-3fa0-4f42-bb34-13fbee2d220d\', \'multiverseId\': 520923}, \'multiverseid\': 520923}, {\'name\': \'鲜血术士\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，你可以获得3点生命。\\n每当任一对手弃一张牌时，你可以获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029fc6d5-c9a6-4feb-a2e6-99c01d3779f9\', \'multiverseId\': 521171}, \'multiverseid\': 521171}, {\'name\': \'鮮血術士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一個由對手操控的生物死去時，你可以獲得3點生命。\\n每當任一對手棄一張牌時，你可以獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295c5112-c01f-4134-9d03-c08ba143c93e\', \'multiverseId\': 521419}, \'multiverseid\': 521419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schamanische Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nWildheit — Du erhältst für jede Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du kontrollierst, 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Erst das Geflüster längst vergangener Tage. Dann Visionen von zukünftigen Ereignissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebd5675c-753d-4040-8638-e6352b3e5701\', \'multiverseId\': 519489}, \'multiverseid\': 519489}, {\'name\': \'Revelación chamánica\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada criatura que controlas.\\nFerocidad — Ganas 4 vidas por cada criatura que controlas con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Primero llegaron los susurros de los días pasados. Después, las visiones de lo que aún no había ocurrido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a1df851-8aa1-4bf2-84a5-559aa9a0d664\', \'multiverseId\': 519737}, \'multiverseid\': 519737}, {\'name\': \'Révélation shamanique\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nFérocité — Vous gagnez 4 points de vie pour chaque créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4 que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "D\'abord des murmures des jours passés. Puis des visions des événements à venir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519985&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca717d8-22f4-493c-89d4-210b6fad829e\', \'multiverseId\': 519985}, \'multiverseid\': 519985}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Sciamanica\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nFerocia — Guadagni 4 punti vita per ogni creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4 che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Prima, sussurri di tempi antichi. Poi, visioni di cose a venire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12dadaf0-54a4-4b95-b99b-6b38f9e81081\', \'multiverseId\': 520233}, \'multiverseid\': 520233}, {\'name\': \'巫師の天啓\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１枚のカードを引く。\\n獰猛 ― あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてパワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体につき４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最初に古き時代からの囁きあり。そして、これより起こることの幻視が続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54a672e-8e67-4124-b0f0-194fde9c1e73\', \'multiverseId\': 520481}, \'multiverseid\': 520481}, {\'name\': \'Revelação Xamânica\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada criatura que você controla.\\nFeroz — Você ganha 4 pontos de vida para cada criatura que você controla com poder igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Primeiro, sussurros dos tempos antigos. Depois, visões do porvir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d1cb52-12fa-450a-a408-f157d2484924\', \'multiverseId\': 520729}, \'multiverseid\': 520729}, {\'name\': \'Откровение Шамана\', \'text\': \'Возьмите одну карту за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\nСвирепость — Вы получаете 4 жизни за каждое существо с силой не менее 4 под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва шепот о древних временах. Затем видения о грядущем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'150334e3-6d14-40c4-b9cd-8224505c0fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 520977}, \'multiverseid\': 520977}, {\'name\': \'祭师启示\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，便抓一张牌。\\n威猛～你每操控一个力量等于或大于4的生物，便获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'先是呢喃细语述说远古过往。后有万千景象展现动荡未来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f12bd98-4280-4355-b779-a271e76a30de\', \'multiverseId\': 521225}, \'multiverseid\': 521225}, {\'name\': \'祭師啟示\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個生物，便抽一張牌。\\n威猛～你每操控一個力量等於或大於4的生物，便獲得4點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'先是呢喃細語述說遠古過往。後有萬千景象展現動盪未來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83efdd1-7b81-4403-bd9c-6b6ff349ddaf\', \'multiverseId\': 521473}, \'multiverseid\': 521473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schillernde Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Schillernde Sphinx einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt jener Spieler Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Danach legt der Spieler alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3407fde0-e832-453a-824b-ff797569bfd7\', \'multiverseId\': 518492}, \'multiverseid\': 518492}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge deslumbrante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Esfinge deslumbrante haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, ese jugador pone las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de su biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82cfd861-9bfd-4f80-bd49-8aa5da971208\', \'multiverseId\': 518563}, \'multiverseid\': 518563}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx éblouissant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sphinx éblouissant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Ce joueur met ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518634&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de1e3ac-cf3f-42a7-bc4a-50565b0f5b62\', \'multiverseId\': 518634}, \'multiverseid\': 518634}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Affascinante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfinge Affascinante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia carte dalla cima del suo grimorio fino a che non esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi quel giocatore mette in fondo al suo grimorio in ordine casuale le carte esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef464f9-6700-4ab4-8e7a-d64abc0eb339\', \'multiverseId\': 518705}, \'multiverseid\': 518705}, {\'name\': \'幻惑のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n幻惑のスフィンクスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカードが追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより追放されて唱えられなかったカードを自分のライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b72a5b-be3b-46ce-a1ec-a89071bd8212\', \'multiverseId\': 518776}, \'multiverseid\': 518776}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge Ofuscante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Esfinge Ofuscante causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador exila cards do topo do próprio grimório até exilar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço. Você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Depois, aquele jogador coloca os cards exilados que não foram conjurados dessa forma no fundo do próprio grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f5acc74-b17f-4faa-a72e-af94ea34c12c\', \'multiverseId\': 518847}, \'multiverseid\': 518847}, {\'name\': \'Ослепительный Сфинкс\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Ослепительный Сфинкс наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгонит карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Затем тот игрок кладет изгнанные карты, не разыгранные таким образом, в низ своей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4fd8b60-cf1a-467a-a2b9-e1f23ad401f0\', \'multiverseId\': 518918}, \'multiverseid\': 518918}, {\'name\': \'炫目史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当炫目史芬斯对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后该牌手将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以随机顺序置于其牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f82a33ae-ccb9-4f97-bdc4-a3fbcfeba0fc\', \'multiverseId\': 518989}, \'multiverseid\': 518989}, {\'name\': \'眩目史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當眩目史芬斯對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家從其牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張瞬間或巫術牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。然後該玩家將所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以隨機順序置於其牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8878775d-2508-4367-9f2a-486dd42bf694\', \'multiverseId\': 519060}, \'multiverseid\': 519060}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schillernde Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Schillernde Sphinx einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt jener Spieler Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Danach legt der Spieler alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521701&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b57ad214-58cc-47b6-807c-8c70e4daea7c\', \'multiverseId\': 521701}, \'multiverseid\': 521701}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge deslumbrante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Esfinge deslumbrante haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, ese jugador pone las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de su biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975dd4b4-5e37-4f34-8b62-df8bfe6553e1\', \'multiverseId\': 521781}, \'multiverseid\': 521781}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx éblouissant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sphinx éblouissant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Ce joueur met ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a329501c-723e-4633-a33a-eeb959d6461d\', \'multiverseId\': 521861}, \'multiverseid\': 521861}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Affascinante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfinge Affascinante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia carte dalla cima del suo grimorio fino a che non esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi quel giocatore mette in fondo al suo grimorio in ordine casuale le carte esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'330ebbaf-84f8-49a3-945d-bd3159f82f6e\', \'multiverseId\': 521941}, \'multiverseid\': 521941}, {\'name\': \'幻惑のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n幻惑のスフィンクスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカードが追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより追放されて唱えられなかったカードを自分のライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6dd174-cc53-466a-b777-e054dd093ac8\', \'multiverseId\': 522021}, \'multiverseid\': 522021}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichweg der Diebe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Dieben verbreiteten sich rasch Gerüchte von einem Labyrinth ohne Mauern und einem Schatz von unermesslichem Wert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c350c9-cc6b-407c-892d-c6c5f5ecf675\', \'multiverseId\': 519595}, \'multiverseid\': 519595}, {\'name\': \'Pasaje del bribón\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los ladrones se extendió enseguida el rumor de un laberinto sin muros y de un premio más allá de todas las expectativas de riqueza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dfaf8a1-d255-48b7-9dab-476147b03776\', \'multiverseId\': 519843}, \'multiverseid\': 519843}, {\'name\': \'Passage des malandrins\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La rumeur d\'un labyrinthe sans parois et d\'un trésor inestimable se répandit rapidement chez les malandrins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520091&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb1a1fcc-316b-42f2-886d-0a8a09ffef02\', \'multiverseId\': 520091}, \'multiverseid\': 520091}, {\'name\': \'Passaggio dei Farabutti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tra i ladri si diffusero rapidamente voci che parlavano di un labirinto senza muri e di un bottino oltre ogni immaginazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e61e6f9-1597-4764-beff-4bc32cd5f137\', \'multiverseId\': 520339}, \'multiverseid\': 520339}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の道\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'泥棒達の間では、想像を絶する宝が眠る壁のない迷宮についての噂が瞬く間に広まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24aae299-d2e5-4e5e-814d-aa7d26e5592b\', \'multiverseId\': 520587}, \'multiverseid\': 520587}, {\'name\': \'Passagem do Ladino\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os boatos sobre um labirinto sem paredes com um tesouro de inestimável valor se espalharam rapidamente entre os ladrões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86257cde-9bcb-4b13-a606-b3827b2b363e\', \'multiverseId\': 520835}, \'multiverseid\': 520835}, {\'name\': \'Разбойничий Проход\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Среди воров быстро распространились слухи о лабиринте без стен, скрывающем сокровище невообразимой ценности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca622e9-7dd6-4847-8649-066d0f23bfe9\', \'multiverseId\': 521083}, \'multiverseid\': 521083}, {\'name\': \'浪客小径\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{4}，{T}：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'这谣言很快在小偷之间传开：有座无墙的迷宫，藏有价值无可计量的宝藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8a1610-6fcf-4721-bda3-85360daf7e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 521331}, \'multiverseid\': 521331}, {\'name\': \'浪客小徑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{4}，{T}：目標生物本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'這謠言很快在小偷之間傳開：有座無牆的迷宮，藏有價值無可計量的寶藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e7f5c1-9e50-4f58-adba-6728a1e05db4\', \'multiverseId\': 521579}, \'multiverseid\': 521579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlüssel zur Stadt\', \'text\': \'{T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn der Schlüssel zur Stadt enttappt wird, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es wäre ein Unglück, würde der Schlüssel in die falschen Hände gelangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582b8883-bf5f-4dda-84c3-9b0dac780da6\', \'multiverseId\': 519531}, \'multiverseid\': 519531}, {\'name\': \'Llave de la ciudad\', \'text\': \'{T}, descartar una carta: Hasta una criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\\nSiempre que la Llave de la ciudad se enderece, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Sería una pena que la llave cayese en las manos equivocadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412718d8-abec-4e9d-b767-72d8c1bea526\', \'multiverseId\': 519779}, \'multiverseid\': 519779}, {\'name\': \'Clé de la ville\', \'text\': "{T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Jusqu\'à une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Clé de la ville devient dégagée, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Il serait fâcheux que cette clé tombe entre de mauvaises mains.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2d1500-5150-45a1-a11c-4df153c871ea\', \'multiverseId\': 520027}, \'multiverseid\': 520027}, {\'name\': \'Chiave della Città\', \'text\': \'{T}, Scarta una carta: Fino a una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta la Chiave della Città viene STAPpata, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Sarebbe spiacevole se la chiave finisse nelle mani sbagliate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d7b206-11ac-4063-92cc-41b1b2581284\', \'multiverseId\': 520275}, \'multiverseid\': 520275}, {\'name\': \'街の鍵\', \'text\': \'{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\\n街の鍵がアンタップ状態になるたび、あなたは「{2}を支払い、その後、カード１枚を引く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'この鍵が悪者の手に渡ったら大変なことになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7ed079-b31b-4b41-b382-d34f957937f4\', \'multiverseId\': 520523}, \'multiverseid\': 520523}, {\'name\': \'Chave da Cidade\', \'text\': \'{T}, descarte um card: Até uma criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\\nToda vez que Chave da Cidade é desvirada, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seria uma pena se a chave caísse nas mãos erradas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f8c675-2718-46a3-8126-6956da8a7958\', \'multiverseId\': 520771}, \'multiverseid\': 520771}, {\'name\': \'Ключ от Города\', \'text\': \'{T}, сбросьте карту: до одного целевого существа не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\\nКаждый раз, когда Ключ от Города разворачивается, вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Страшно подумать, что случится, если этот ключ попадет не в те руки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901034ac-995e-4b44-890a-8fc3889d3c27\', \'multiverseId\': 521019}, \'multiverseid\': 521019}, {\'name\': \'入城钥匙\', \'text\': \'{T}，弃一张牌：至多一个目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\\n每当入城钥匙成为未横置时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'钥匙要落入不法之徒手中，那就糟了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571efb9b-4dec-40a3-91a3-3154fb256a71\', \'multiverseId\': 521267}, \'multiverseid\': 521267}, {\'name\': \'入城鑰匙\', \'text\': \'{T}，棄一張牌：至多一個目標生物本回合不能被阻擋。\\n每當入城鑰匙成為未橫置時，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'鑰匙要落入不法之徒手中，那就糟了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a92620b8-7e89-4870-96a6-520ee9201afc\', \'multiverseId\': 521515}, \'multiverseid\': 521515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schnelle Hybridisierung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden. Der Beherrscher der Kreatur erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Frosch-Eidechse-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben deine Lebensessenz mit der mehrerer Kreaturen gleichzeitig vermischt. Gern geschehen."\\n—Sprecher Trifon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519409&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f98f02a-05d5-49c3-a547-4af5e9623943\', \'multiverseId\': 519409}, \'multiverseid\': 519409}, {\'name\': \'Hibridación rápida\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerada. El controlador de esa criatura crea una ficha de criatura Lagarto Rana verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Hemos fusionado tu esencia vital con la de varias criaturas a la vez. De nada".\\n—Portavoz Trifón\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888a870b-ccf4-4876-be85-698b6dcc46eb\', \'multiverseId\': 519657}, \'multiverseid\': 519657}, {\'name\': \'Hybridation rapide\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée. Le contrôleur de cette créature crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Grenouille et Lézard.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons fusionné votre essence vitale avec celle de plusieurs autres créatures. Ne nous remerciez pas. »\\n—Orateur Trifon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd36125-87df-4d73-9fe7-fb1bbe4b4134\', \'multiverseId\': 519905}, \'multiverseid\': 519905}, {\'name\': \'Ibridazione Rapida\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerata. Il controllore di quella creatura crea una pedina creatura Lucertola Rana 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Abbiamo unito la tua essenza vitale a quella di diverse altre creature. Non c\\\'è di che."\\n—Oratore Trifon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c920887b-c7df-4f4f-8b95-f9519e7bcf06\', \'multiverseId\': 520153}, \'multiverseid\': 520153}, {\'name\': \'急速混成\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。それは再生できない。そのクリーチャーのコントローラーは、緑の３/３のカエル・トカゲ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私達はお前の生命の本質を複数の生物のそれと一気に合体させたのだ。礼は言わんでいい。」\\n――議長トリファン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e0b3aa8-33c5-411b-be24-f6e0aa35608d\', \'multiverseId\': 520401}, \'multiverseid\': 520401}, {\'name\': \'Hibridação Veloz\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Ela não pode ser regenerada. O controlador daquela criatura cria uma ficha de criatura Sapo Lagarto verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Fundimos sua essência vital com a de várias criaturas ao mesmo tempo. De nada."\\n— Orador Trifon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad674c6c-702e-4f81-a18f-6398a83e89c2\', \'multiverseId\': 520649}, \'multiverseid\': 520649}, {\'name\': \'Ускоренное Скрещивание\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Оно не может быть регенерировано. Контролирующий то существо игрок создает одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленая Лягушка Ящер.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы объединили твою жизненную сущность с сущностями еще нескольких существ. Можешь не благодарить».\\n— Оратор Трефон\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d442f8fc-275e-49ad-a837-5af8464937bb\', \'multiverseId\': 520897}, \'multiverseid\': 520897}, {\'name\': \'顿成杂种\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。它不能重生。该生物的操控者派出一个3/3绿色蛙／蜥蜴衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们已经将你的生命精华和多个生物的生命精华同时融合。不用谢我。」\\n～议长柴方\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275bd391-c3e2-4784-8eb4-57de9010dc13\', \'multiverseId\': 521145}, \'multiverseid\': 521145}, {\'name\': \'頓成雜種\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。它不能重生。該生物的操控者派出一個3/3綠色蛙／蜥蜴衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我們已經將你的生命精華和多個生物的生命精華同時融合。不用謝我。」\\n～議長柴方\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64d8ab4-f912-4a4d-a17d-6af53842a449\', \'multiverseId\': 521393}, \'multiverseid\': 521393}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrottfischer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Schrottfischer oder ein anderes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl mit niedrigerem Manabetrag aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2630a93b-9afb-4d68-8c89-2a1f30c87f1b\', \'multiverseId\': 519543}, \'multiverseid\': 519543}, {\'name\': \'Arrastrero de chatarra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Arrastrero de chatarra u otro artefacto que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa a tu mano una carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio con menor valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbe4896-f1a7-48e6-a4f5-c8ed50cae832\', \'multiverseId\': 519791}, \'multiverseid\': 519791}, {\'name\': \'Charrieur de ferraille\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Charrieur de ferraille ou un autre artefact que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez dans votre main une carte d\'artefact avec une valeur de mana inférieure ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520039&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ecb9dd1-c456-49c2-b00e-ef31a2ccc959\', \'multiverseId\': 520039}, \'multiverseid\': 520039}, {\'name\': \'Collettore di Rottami\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Collettore di Rottami o un altro artefatto che controlli vengono messi in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio nel tuo cimitero con valore di mana inferiore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d84aa14-f9cb-406f-b81f-8618bca51de8\', \'multiverseId\': 520287}, \'multiverseid\': 520287}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄さらい\', \'text\': \'屑鉄さらいか、これ以外であなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたの墓地からマナ総量がそれより小さいアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e777180e-1603-4ba1-bd59-ca71178ff349\', \'multiverseId\': 520535}, \'multiverseid\': 520535}, {\'name\': \'Arrastador de Sucata\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Arrastador de Sucata ou outro artefato que você controla for colocado num cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, devolva para a sua mão o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério com valor de mana inferior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'214451a9-6c2a-406f-942b-2da43c479d01\', \'multiverseId\': 520783}, \'multiverseid\': 520783}, {\'name\': \'Тральщик-Мусорщик\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Тральщик-Мусорщик или другой артефакт под вашим контролем попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, верните в вашу руку находящуюся на вашем кладбище целевую карту артефакта с меньшей мановой ценностью.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e622d638-fcc9-498d-9e13-21b65fed5e80\', \'multiverseId\': 521031}, \'multiverseid\': 521031}, {\'name\': \'废铁打捞械\', \'text\': \'每当废铁打捞械或另一个由你操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，将目标在你坟墓场中且法术力值小于前述神器的神器牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f22301c-d119-4f83-859e-a87611ba4cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 521279}, \'multiverseid\': 521279}, {\'name\': \'廢鐵打撈械\', \'text\': \'每當廢鐵打撈械或另一個由你操控的神器從戰場進入墳墓場時，將目標在你墳墓場中且魔法力值小於前述神器的神器牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841bd330-7146-4c6d-8107-a772ab32155e\', \'multiverseId\': 521527}, \'multiverseid\': 521527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schuppenwächter-Elite\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schuppenwächter-Elite ins Spiel kommt, wende Kräftigung 2 an. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur mit der geringsten Widerstandskraft unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur angreift, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16bdef42-57f3-48b0-b3a0-196f269061f8\', \'multiverseId\': 519374}, \'multiverseid\': 519374}, {\'name\': \'Guardiascama de élite\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Guardiascama de élite entre al campo de batalla, fortalece 2. (Elige una criatura con la menor resistencia entre las criaturas que controlas y pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella ataque, gira la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b14551-c030-40eb-a681-5ca4d0fbf04c\', \'multiverseId\': 519622}, \'multiverseid\': 519622}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'écaille d\'élite", \'text\': "Quand le Garde d\'écaille d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, renforcement 2. (Choisissez une créature avec l\'endurance la plus faible parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez et mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle attaque, engagez une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1afc3d-629e-4fc5-ba00-0fd35c3830b8\', \'multiverseId\': 519870}, \'multiverseid\': 519870}, {\'name\': "Guardia Scaglia d\'Elite", \'text\': "Quando la Guardia Scaglia d\'Elite entra nel campo di battaglia, sostieni 2. (Scegli una creatura con la costituzione minore tra le creature che controlli e metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli attacca, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50bc742b-7c36-4ec0-ad1d-9a789ad8a125\', \'multiverseId\': 520118}, \'multiverseid\': 520118}, {\'name\': \'鱗衛兵の精鋭\', \'text\': \'鱗衛兵の精鋭が戦場に出たとき、鼓舞２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最も小さいタフネスを持つクリーチャー１体を選び、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad66eff-a891-4e75-803a-acca7f58bb02\', \'multiverseId\': 520366}, \'multiverseid\': 520366}, {\'name\': \'Guarda Escamado de Elite\', \'text\': \'Quando Guarda Escamado de Elite entrar no campo de batalha, revigore 2. (Escolha uma criatura com a menor resistência entre as que você controla e coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nela.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura sob seu controle com um marcador +1/+1 atacar, vire a criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2183a858-1d3d-4f57-8d27-a78543efc353\', \'multiverseId\': 520614}, \'multiverseid\': 520614}, {\'name\': \'Элитный Чешуйчатый Страж\', \'text\': \'Когда Элитный Чешуйчатый Страж выходит на поле битвы, используйте Подмогу 2. (Выберите из существ под вашим контролем существо с наименьшим значением выносливости и положите на него два жетона +1/+1.)\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем с жетоном +1/+1 на нем атакует, поверните целевое существо под контролем защищающегося игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acef5b5-97be-46e3-b661-586f838b3ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 520862}, \'multiverseid\': 520862}, {\'name\': \'精英鳞卫\', \'text\': \'当精英鳞卫进战场时，振励2。（于由你操控的生物中选择一个防御力最低的生物，在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当一个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物攻击时，横置目标由防御牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb7a2e10-5345-40bd-a282-a7080be1686c\', \'multiverseId\': 521110}, \'multiverseid\': 521110}, {\'name\': \'精英鱗衛\', \'text\': \'當精英鱗衛進戰場時，振勵2。（於由你操控的生物中選擇一個防禦力最低的生物，在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。）\\n每當一個由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物攻擊時，橫置目標由防禦玩家操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f70c1dc6-1fd3-4a33-9b7d-2279bb016b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 521358}, \'multiverseid\': 521358}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schutzbrille der Pyromagierin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}. Wenn dieses Mana verwendet wird, um einen roten Spontanzauber oder eine rote Hexerei zu wirken, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Eines Tages hoffe ich Jaya Ballard zu treffen. Wir würden uns bestimmt gut verstehen."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6a037d-d90f-4789-bb23-7d3daae6275d\', \'multiverseId\': 519542}, \'multiverseid\': 519542}, {\'name\': \'Lentes de la piromante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro rojo, copia ese hechizo y puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Espero conocer a Jaya Ballard algún día. Creo que nos llevaríamos bien".\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a7b95d-24de-4c02-aef9-cf2e682941f0\', \'multiverseId\': 519790}, \'multiverseid\': 519790}, {\'name\': \'Lunettes du pyromancien\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R}. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel rouge, copiez ce sort et vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour la copie.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« J\'espère rencontrer Jaya Ballard un de ces jours. Je pense qu\'on s\'entendrait. »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520038&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841ad398-38ed-45a9-a6c5-3d6806042e96\', \'multiverseId\': 520038}, \'multiverseid\': 520038}, {\'name\': \'Occhialoni della Piromante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria rossa, copia quella magia. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Spero di incontrare Jaya Ballard un giorno. Credo che andremmo d\\\'accordo."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8914257-2317-4e51-9b8a-07fc8d3582d1\', \'multiverseId\': 520286}, \'multiverseid\': 520286}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮術師のゴーグル\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。このマナが赤でインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「いつの日かヤヤ・バラードに会ってみたいわね。うまくやっていけそうな気がするの。」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c59978-0a6b-4c00-85e4-45b8491c0a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 520534}, \'multiverseid\': 520534}, {\'name\': \'Óculos da Piromante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R}. Quando aquele mana for gasto para conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço vermelho, copie aquela mágica e você poderá escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu espero conhecer Jaya Ballard algum dia. Acho que vamos nos dar bem."\\n— Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aec3d4c-6ad2-4236-ba30-2cdec2b48170\', \'multiverseId\': 520782}, \'multiverseid\': 520782}, {\'name\': \'Очки Пироманта\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {R}. Когда та мана тратится на разыгрывание красного мгновенного заклинания или заклинания волшебства, скопируйте то заклинание, и вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Я надеюсь, когда-нибудь судьба сведет меня с Джайей Баллард. Думаю, мы поладим».\\n— Чандра Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a82d1f9-cb2f-43e4-bcda-3e276f10684e\', \'multiverseId\': 521030}, \'multiverseid\': 521030}, {\'name\': \'烈焰术士护目镜\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}。当该法术力用来施放红色瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语，且你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我希望有一天能遇到雅亚巴拉德。我想我们会处得很好。」\\n～茜卓纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7deec25e-7ac0-4224-852c-ba95eec17f5a\', \'multiverseId\': 521278}, \'multiverseid\': 521278}, {\'name\': \'烈焰術士護目鏡\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}。當該魔法力用來施放紅色瞬間或巫術咒語時，複製該咒語，且你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我希望有一天能遇到雅亞巴拉德。我想我們會處得很好。」\\n～茜卓納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd799e28-428f-4baf-8a59-542b1106e21d\', \'multiverseId\': 521526}, \'multiverseid\': 521526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarmintelligenz\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, kannst du ihn bzw. sie kopieren. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kinder der Heuschrecken-Gottheit waren zahllos und fraßen sich unaufhaltsam durch die Verteidigung der Stadt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519413&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f964dc92-2d93-413b-a75b-99a2c3e358b8\', \'multiverseId\': 519413}, \'multiverseid\': 519413}, {\'name\': \'Inteligencia de enjambre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, puedes copiar ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los incontables hijos del Dios Langosta devoraron sin cesar todo rastro de protección de la ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c94c61e-4696-4110-bdfb-0504d83cdfbf\', \'multiverseId\': 519661}, \'multiverseid\': 519661}, {\'name\': "Intelligence de l\'essaim", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez copier ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les innombrables enfants du Dieu-Sauterelle dévoraient sans relâche toute trace des protections de la ville.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd7daac-3d0d-43d4-84c9-bf040fe808f0\', \'multiverseId\': 519909}, \'multiverseid\': 519909}, {\'name\': \'Intelligenza dello Sciame\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi copiare quella magia. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La progenie della locusta divina era innumerevole e divorava senza sosta ogni traccia della protezione della città.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08035fe-f2d3-4167-b501-66e770612150\', \'multiverseId\': 520157}, \'multiverseid\': 520157}, {\'name\': \'大群の諜報\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはその呪文をコピーしてもよい。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'蝗の神が送り出した無数の仔虫は、街の守りを跡形もなく食らい尽くした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25fd203f-0ebf-4cd0-a7d3-52ed02ae16fb\', \'multiverseId\': 520405}, \'multiverseid\': 520405}, {\'name\': \'Inteligência do Enxame\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, você pode copiar aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os filhos do Deus Gafanhoto eram inumeráveis e devoravam implacavelmente todo vestígio da proteção da cidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f35179b-29ab-4952-96af-d53afc2cbf0a\', \'multiverseId\': 520653}, \'multiverseid\': 520653}, {\'name\': \'Разум Роя\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, вы можете скопировать то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Бесчисленные дети Бога-Саранчи без устали пожирали последние остатки защиты города.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824f2b16-48a7-4203-b3c7-4b3275d86a55\', \'multiverseId\': 520901}, \'multiverseid\': 520901}, {\'name\': \'虫群智慧\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，你可以复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'蝗虫神的后代无穷无尽，无情地将城市的每一处保护都啃食干净。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7332b22-31fb-4bf3-ad0b-0db1a1fef24c\', \'multiverseId\': 521149}, \'multiverseid\': 521149}, {\'name\': \'蟲群智慧\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，你可以複製該咒語。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'蝗蟲神的後代無窮無盡，無情地將城市的每一處保護都啃食乾淨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7417552-8ead-4d37-b28e-b6a06fc6d1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 521397}, \'multiverseid\': 521397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schädlingsbefall\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre bis zu X Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl. Erzeuge zweimal X 1/1 schwarze und grüne Schädling-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Tausend Jahre Geschichte, zunichte gemacht durch einen kindischen Streich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0acf8b52-02f1-4c76-bda6-891c576609be\', \'multiverseId\': 518532}, \'multiverseid\': 518532}, {\'name\': \'Infestación de plagas\', \'text\': \'Destruye hasta X artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo. Crea el doble de X fichas de criatura Plaga negras y verdes 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, ganas 1 vida".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mil años de historia destrozados por culpa de una broma pueril.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b509143b-78bf-480b-8e06-d1ef6c58383e\', \'multiverseId\': 518603}, \'multiverseid\': 518603}, {\'name\': \'Infestation de parasites\', \'text\': "Détruisez jusqu\'à X artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés. Créez deux fois X jetons de créature 1/1 noire et verte Parasite avec « Quand cette créature meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Mille ans d\'histoire anéantis par une farce puérile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6073b7d2-b7cf-4f76-bdaf-084d14cc30cf\', \'multiverseId\': 518674}, \'multiverseid\': 518674}, {\'name\': \'Infestazione Parassitaria\', \'text\': \'Distruggi fino a X artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio. Crea il doppio di X pedine creatura Peste 1/1 nere e verdi con "Quando questa creatura muore, guadagni 1 punto vita".\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Migliaia di anni di storia buttati al vento da uno scherzo infantile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56ac1e1-d61b-41d1-898a-4859d93659a3\', \'multiverseId\': 518745}, \'multiverseid\': 518745}, {\'name\': \'害獣の侵入\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやエンチャント、合わせて最大Ｘ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。Ｘの２倍に等しい数の、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持ち黒であり緑である１/１の邪魔者・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一千年の歴史が若者の幼稚な行為で瓦解した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7648836d-0960-4952-a552-6eea7f1af33d\', \'multiverseId\': 518816}, \'multiverseid\': 518816}, {\'name\': \'Infestação de Praga\', \'text\': \'Destrua até X artefatos e/ou encantamentos alvo. Crie duas vezes X fichas de criatura Peste preta e verde 1/1 com "Quando esta criatura morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida".\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Mil anos de história perdidos numa pegadinha juvenil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c786eb06-6c50-4c92-a358-a822b7bfd8f2\', \'multiverseId\': 518887}, \'multiverseid\': 518887}, {\'name\': \'Нашествие Вредителей\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте не более X целевых артефактов и/или чар. Создайте в двойном размере X фишек существа 1/1 черный и зеленый Вредитель со способностью «Когда это существо умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь».\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Тысяча лет истории, погубленные одной юношеской проделкой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2edff26-e05d-4a97-99af-a2806654f35d\', \'multiverseId\': 518958}, \'multiverseid\': 518958}, {\'name\': \'害虫侵扰\', \'text\': \'消灭至多X个目标神器和／或结界。派出两倍于X数量的1/1，黑绿双色的害虫衍生生物，且具有「每当此生物死去时，你获得1点生命。」\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'千年历史，全毁于一次年少轻狂的恶作剧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe58205-61df-4bab-b3ed-ceec5fbdcc1a\', \'multiverseId\': 519029}, \'multiverseid\': 519029}, {\'name\': \'害蟲侵擾\', \'text\': \'消滅至多X個目標神器和／或結界。派出兩倍於X數量的1/1，黑綠雙色的害蟲衍生生物，且具有「每當此生物死去時，你獲得1點生命。」\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'千年歷史，全毀於一次年少輕狂的惡作劇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9476b8ed-ab12-49be-8c69-bacef9f41e64\', \'multiverseId\': 519100}, \'multiverseid\': 519100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schädlingsbefall\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre bis zu X Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl. Erzeuge zweimal X 1/1 schwarze und grüne Schädling-Kreaturenspielsteine mit „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521741&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4719e2-08e6-46d1-abfb-c55fafa963be\', \'multiverseId\': 521741}, \'multiverseid\': 521741}, {\'name\': \'Infestación de plagas\', \'text\': \'Destruye hasta X artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo. Crea el doble de X fichas de criatura Plaga negras y verdes 1/1 con "Cuando esta criatura muera, ganas 1 vida".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dddf29c-b31f-4c14-a6fd-5b9ced5aad02\', \'multiverseId\': 521821}, \'multiverseid\': 521821}, {\'name\': \'Infestation de parasites\', \'text\': "Détruisez jusqu\'à X artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés. Créez deux fois X jetons de créature 1/1 noire et verte Parasite avec « Quand cette créature meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe338aa-27af-4fb9-9070-b983cbdafbbb\', \'multiverseId\': 521901}, \'multiverseid\': 521901}, {\'name\': \'Infestazione Parassitaria\', \'text\': \'Distruggi fino a X artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio. Crea il doppio di X pedine creatura Peste 1/1 nere e verdi con "Quando questa creatura muore, guadagni 1 punto vita".\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d4edc5-0482-4ad7-9c8b-c9367025b7a1\', \'multiverseId\': 521981}, \'multiverseid\': 521981}, {\'name\': \'害獣の侵入\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやエンチャント、合わせて最大Ｘ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。Ｘの２倍に等しい数の、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持ち黒であり緑である１/１の邪魔者・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f621cf0-0a55-4017-8b10-a57a375c0598\', \'multiverseId\': 522061}, \'multiverseid\': 522061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schändlicher Pakt\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht X Karten und verliert X Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Silumgars Gedanken sind ein finsteres Labyrinth voller schrecklicher Geheimnisse und raffinierter Fallen."\\n—Siara Drachenzunge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6536b4fa-33cb-4a9f-adda-34beea44a9be\', \'multiverseId\': 519422}, \'multiverseid\': 519422}, {\'name\': \'Pacto abominable\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba X cartas y pierde X vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La mente de Sílumgar es un oscuro laberinto, lleno de secretos siniestros y trampas ocultas".\\n—Siara, la Boca del Dragón\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b581094-9300-4144-ab66-672053013c80\', \'multiverseId\': 519670}, \'multiverseid\': 519670}, {\'name\': \'Pacte damné\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé pioche X cartes et perd X points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'esprit de Silumgar est un labyrinthe obscur, empli de sinistres secrets et de pièges subtils. »\\n—Siara, la Voix du Dragon", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d050c2f6-1f6c-46b6-a2c7-ec2366ee7934\', \'multiverseId\': 519918}, \'multiverseid\': 519918}, {\'name\': \'Patto Deplorevole\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca X carte e perde X punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La mente di Silumgar è un labirinto oscuro, disseminato di tetri segreti e insidiose trappole."\\n—Siara, la Voce del Drago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5377a76-412f-4733-b9f2-8802556b27a8\', \'multiverseId\': 520166}, \'multiverseid\': 520166}, {\'name\': \'禍々しい協定\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「シルムガル様の精神の中は闇の迷宮。不気味な秘密と巧妙な罠がちりばめられているわ。」\\n――龍口のシアラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812331eb-1cee-4d2a-90a4-199ea32da1e4\', \'multiverseId\': 520414}, \'multiverseid\': 520414}, {\'name\': \'Pacto Condenável\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A mente de Silumgar é um labirinto negro, repleto de segredos sombrios e armadilhas engenhosas."\\n— Siara, a Boca do Dragão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39da658a-1897-41e2-af92-fdc81c0b0bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 520662}, \'multiverseid\': 520662}, {\'name\': \'Проклятый Союз\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок берет X карт и теряет X жизней.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Разум Силумгара — темный лабиринт, полный мрачных секретов и коварных ловушек».\\n— Сиара, Уста Дракона\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d752432e-8045-49bb-8999-5bc60dcbd2dc\', \'multiverseId\': 520910}, \'multiverseid\': 520910}, {\'name\': \'背德契约\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓X张牌且失去X点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「席穆嘉的心灵就如同黑暗迷宫，险恶秘密与精巧陷阱遍布其间。」\\n～龙王传令席亚拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99fa694b-52ae-474f-b22a-4134a1e82561\', \'multiverseId\': 521158}, \'multiverseid\': 521158}, {\'name\': \'背德契約\', \'text\': \'目標玩家抽X張牌且失去X點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「席穆嘉的心靈就如同黑暗迷宮，險惡秘密與精巧陷阱遍佈其間。」\\n～龍王傳令席亞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0e221e3-4eef-4b45-9a7f-b4622e699a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 521406}, \'multiverseid\': 521406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schöpferin der Neugier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDu hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nImmer wenn ein Kreaturenspielstein, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518491&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475f5fb7-87c4-4dc1-b282-9d0bd47e7cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 518491}, \'multiverseid\': 518491}, {\'name\': \'Artesana de curiosidades\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\nSiempre que una ficha de criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9ffd74-486c-4185-b8af-16f45fd96af2\', \'multiverseId\': 518562}, \'multiverseid\': 518562}, {\'name\': \'Façonneuse de curiosité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nIl n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un jeton de créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b3cd420-875b-46fe-8a46-50befd396d11\', \'multiverseId\': 518633}, \'multiverseid\': 518633}, {\'name\': \'Artigiana di Curiosità\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nNon hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\nOgniqualvolta una pedina creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd8b42c-fd5c-40dd-a556-c8e39d91faeb\', \'multiverseId\': 518704}, \'multiverseid\': 518704}, {\'name\': \'好奇の造り手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークン１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'035e85ca-2a1a-4784-8b99-c64ec5b1a01e\', \'multiverseId\': 518775}, \'multiverseid\': 518775}, {\'name\': \'Artífice de Curiosidades\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNão há limite para o número máximo de cards em sua mão.\\nToda vez que uma ficha de criatura que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d12541f-0c6e-4f1b-b802-a16f91404be6\', \'multiverseId\': 518846}, \'multiverseid\': 518846}, {\'name\': \'Творец Любопытства\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВаш максимальный размер руки неограничен.\\nКаждый раз, когда фишка существа под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77d4e1b-7a8b-4472-948c-314d7768cf6d\', \'multiverseId\': 518917}, \'multiverseid\': 518917}, {\'name\': \'好奇塑师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n你的手牌数量没有上限。\\n每当一个由你操控的衍生生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35430ab-8a1b-4731-bc15-eee65760fdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 518988}, \'multiverseid\': 518988}, {\'name\': \'好奇塑師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n你的手牌數量沒有上限。\\n每當一個由你操控的衍生生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16803b5d-47a8-4536-b8c7-762128ffcf31\', \'multiverseId\': 519059}, \'multiverseid\': 519059}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schöpferin der Neugier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDu hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nImmer wenn ein Kreaturenspielstein, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521700&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b1ac3bd-2926-4b2f-b358-4026e496f0ca\', \'multiverseId\': 521700}, \'multiverseid\': 521700}, {\'name\': \'Artesana de curiosidades\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\nSiempre que una ficha de criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34bb609a-e070-47ac-aa99-13dece780943\', \'multiverseId\': 521780}, \'multiverseid\': 521780}, {\'name\': \'Façonneuse de curiosité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nIl n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un jeton de créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88bb8007-e3d4-461b-89d6-7625845aa01f\', \'multiverseId\': 521860}, \'multiverseid\': 521860}, {\'name\': \'Artigiana di Curiosità\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nNon hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\nOgniqualvolta una pedina creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824bf77c-b054-44e8-aebb-675950575a24\', \'multiverseId\': 521940}, \'multiverseid\': 521940}, {\'name\': \'好奇の造り手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークン１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64eeb068-1818-4e6d-93e9-d3fc1d8adfce\', \'multiverseId\': 522020}, \'multiverseid\': 522020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenschlinge\', \'text\': \'{W}, opfere die Seelenschlinge: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Körper und Geist sind einander Feind. Sie nutzen jede Gelegenheit, den anderen loszuwerden."\\n—Tariel, Abwäger der Seelen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519387&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090c0d82-0948-4549-ab3c-4a1e272551cd\', \'multiverseId\': 519387}, \'multiverseid\': 519387}, {\'name\': \'Trampa de almas\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrificar la Trampa de almas: Exilia la criatura objetivo que está atacándote a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuerpo y espíritu son enemigos irreconciliables. Usarán cualquier excusa para liberarse del otro".\\n—Tariel, Vengadora de Almas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a49bfcb5-6239-42cd-bf43-0c24cd1bf7c2\', \'multiverseId\': 519635}, \'multiverseid\': 519635}, {\'name\': \'Collet spirituel\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrifiez le Collet spirituel : Exilez une créature ciblée qui vous attaque ou qui attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le corps et l\'esprit sont des ennemis jurés. Ils trouvent toutes les excuses pour se débarrasser l\'un de l\'autre. »\\n—Tariel, héliaste d\'âmes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6952e24c-250c-4e31-a60b-b031647784d0\', \'multiverseId\': 519883}, \'multiverseid\': 519883}, {\'name\': \'Intrappolare Anima\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifica Intrappolare Anima: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che sta attaccando te o un planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Corpo e spirito sono nemici giurati. Sfrutteranno ogni scusa per sbarazzarsi l\\\'uno dell\\\'altro."\\n—Tariel, Censore di Anime\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db225df5-26b6-41bc-a504-5bfec6f18603\', \'multiverseId\': 520131}, \'multiverseid\': 520131}, {\'name\': \'魂の捕獲\', \'text\': \'{W}, 魂の捕獲を生け贄に捧げる：あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「肉体と精神は不倶戴天の敵だ。互いを排除するためならどんな手段でも受け入れる。」\\n――魂を数える者、タリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e3ec9c-c62d-4138-a47e-cfd943480076\', \'multiverseId\': 520379}, \'multiverseid\': 520379}, {\'name\': \'Armadilha para Almas\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrifique Armadilha para Almas: Exile a criatura alvo que está atacando você ou um planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O corpo e o espírito são inimigos jurados. Eles aproveitarão qualquer desculpa para se livrarem um do outro."\\n— Tariel, Víndice das Almas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f82f2c9f-0883-4b04-957f-b23160871736\', \'multiverseId\': 520627}, \'multiverseid\': 520627}, {\'name\': \'Силки Души\', \'text\': "{W}, пожертвуйте Силки Души: изгоните целевое существо, атакующее вас или planeswalker\'а под вашим контролем.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Тело и дух — заклятые враги. Они воспользуются любым предлогом, чтобы избавиться друг от друга».\\n— Тариэль, Разведчица Душ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b0faee-1666-4322-9a6b-b805d8ec503e\', \'multiverseId\': 520875}, \'multiverseid\': 520875}, {\'name\': \'灵魂圈套\', \'text\': \'{W}，牺牲灵魂圈套：放逐目标正向你或由你操控之鹏洛客进行攻击的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「身体与灵魂势不两立。它们会用一切手段来除掉对方。」\\n～判魂天使泰芮尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95f30320-9718-4102-9ae3-0ae0e0c73756\', \'multiverseId\': 521123}, \'multiverseid\': 521123}, {\'name\': \'靈魂圈套\', \'text\': \'{W}，犧牲靈魂圈套：放逐目標正向你或由你操控之鵬洛客進行攻擊的生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「身體與靈魂誓不兩立。它們會用一切手段來除掉對方。」\\n～判魂天使泰芮爾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea2b9bb-004d-4a75-b374-fd088a08e6f9\', \'multiverseId\': 521371}, \'multiverseid\': 521371}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstlose Junkerin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Selbstlose Junkerin ins Spiel kommt, verhindere allen Schaden, der dir in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn Schaden verhindert wird, der dir zugefügt würde, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Selbstlose Junkerin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519386&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5dda79-0ea3-4a59-ab2a-b79fd60d64b0\', \'multiverseId\': 519386}, \'multiverseid\': 519386}, {\'name\': \'Escudera abnegada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Escudera abnegada entre al campo de batalla, prevén todo el daño que se te fuera a hacer este turno.\\nSiempre que se prevenga daño que se te fuera a hacer, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Escudera abnegada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aa3bd2a-887e-4fe1-883a-319bdb85d11b\', \'multiverseId\': 519634}, \'multiverseid\': 519634}, {\'name\': \'Écuyère dévouée\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Écuyère dévouée arrive sur le champ de bataille, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient vous être infligées ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que des blessures qui devaient vous être infligées sont prévenues, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Écuyère dévouée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc73f0d-29eb-44ae-94f6-4cee5e2369d8\', \'multiverseId\': 519882}, \'multiverseid\': 519882}, {\'name\': \'Scudiera Altruista\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Scudiera Altruista entra nel campo di battaglia, previeni tutto il danno che ti verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta il danno che sta per esserti inflitto viene prevenuto, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sulla Scudiera Altruista.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2291ab3-2a6f-44e7-84e6-b0e4a0c5827c\', \'multiverseId\': 520130}, \'multiverseid\': 520130}, {\'name\': \'無私の従者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n無私の従者が戦場に出たとき、このターン、あなたが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\nあなたが受けるダメージが軽減されるたび、無私の従者の上にその点数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca3f6fb-6584-4b21-b1ea-15e515c8314a\', \'multiverseId\': 520378}, \'multiverseid\': 520378}, {\'name\': \'Escudeira Altruísta\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Escudeira Altruísta entrar no campo de batalha, previna todo o dano que seria causado a você neste turno.\\nToda vez que algum dano que seria causado a você for prevenido, coloque uma quantidade equivalente de marcadores +1/+1 em Escudeira Altruísta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'881217f4-ed71-4280-ad41-8eaa00f81577\', \'multiverseId\': 520626}, \'multiverseid\': 520626}, {\'name\': \'Самоотверженная Оруженосица\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Самоотверженная Оруженосица выходит на поле битвы, предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены вам в этом ходу.\\nКаждый раз, когда повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены вам, предотвращаются, положите столько же жетонов +1/+1 на Самоотверженную Оруженосицу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b02a38-cb74-4bb2-87f4-ccaf6f899247\', \'multiverseId\': 520874}, \'multiverseid\': 520874}, {\'name\': \'无私扈从\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当无私扈从进战场时，防止本回合中将对你造成的所有伤害。\\n每当任一效应防止将对你造成的伤害时，在无私扈从上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3842f358-bba6-4e34-84a3-919900fae871\', \'multiverseId\': 521122}, \'multiverseid\': 521122}, {\'name\': \'無私扈從\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當無私扈從進戰場時，防止本回合中將對你造成的所有傷害。\\n每當任一效應防止將對你造成的傷害時，在無私扈從上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48480961-c2d4-45ab-a71c-1cd3ae4560ea\', \'multiverseId\': 521370}, \'multiverseid\': 521370}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sequenzmaschine\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Realität, wenn sie zerlegt wird, ist nur Mathematik."\\n—Deekah, Professorin für Fraktaltheorie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6f1b76-5ca6-41b5-b5e0-2d7277e5ec93\', \'multiverseId\': 518534}, \'multiverseid\': 518534}, {\'name\': \'Motor secuencial\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X de un cementerio. Crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si la analizamos, la realidad es matemática".\\n—Deekah, profesora de teoría de fractales\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851ad9b5-e379-440c-bff9-a9f6b4e5144a\', \'multiverseId\': 518605}, \'multiverseid\': 518605}, {\'name\': \'Moteur séquentiel\', \'text\': "{X}, {T} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana de X d\'un cimetière. Créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La réalité, une fois décomposée, n\'est rien de plus que des mathématiques. »\\n—Deekah, professeur de théorie fractale", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518676&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baef35c4-38b0-4050-a1ad-bebf9a455439\', \'multiverseId\': 518676}, \'multiverseid\': 518676}, {\'name\': \'Macchina a Sequenza\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana X da un cimitero. Crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La realtà, se scissa ai minimi termini, non è che matematica."\\n—Deekah, professoressa di teoria frattale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55daf2d3-725a-4638-a5ae-d01d16709959\', \'multiverseId\': 518747}, \'multiverseid\': 518747}, {\'name\': \'配列エンジン\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}：墓地からマナ総量がＸのクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「子細に分析すれば、現実とはすべて数学だ。」\\n――フラクタル理論の教授、ディーカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c816edd-054c-4248-9ce5-8407d219f553\', \'multiverseId\': 518818}, \'multiverseid\': 518818}, {\'name\': \'Motor Sequencial\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Exile o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana X de um cemitério. Crie uma ficha de criatura Fractal verde e azul 0/0. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A realidade, quando fatorada, é pura matemática."\\n— Deekah, professora de teoria fractal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3173ef9-c5b5-4209-a219-48272229113d\', \'multiverseId\': 518889}, \'multiverseid\': 518889}, {\'name\': \'Машина Последовательностей\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: изгоните из кладбища целевую карту существа с мановой ценностью X. Создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленый и синий Фрактал. Положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1. Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Разложи реальность, и получится простая математика».\\n— Дика, профессор фрактальной теории\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04b6b13-860f-48b6-9106-5a937ed62413\', \'multiverseId\': 518960}, \'multiverseid\': 518960}, {\'name\': \'序列引擎\', \'text\': \'{X}，{T}：将目标法术力值为X的生物牌从坟墓场放逐。派出一个0/0，绿蓝双色的分灵衍生生物。在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「现实，你拆开来看的话，也不过全是数学。」\\n～分灵理论学教授荻卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ffdc15b-73ad-4c70-8a80-e6f81c1bbaec\', \'multiverseId\': 519031}, \'multiverseid\': 519031}, {\'name\': \'序列引擎\', \'text\': \'{X}，{T}：將目標魔法力值為X的生物牌從墳墓場放逐。派出一個0/0，綠藍雙色的分靈衍生生物。在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「現實，你拆開來看的話，也不過全是數學。」\\n～分靈理論學教授荻卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f707e0ac-e0e8-488b-85a1-9f4930a9de4b\', \'multiverseId\': 519102}, \'multiverseid\': 519102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sequenzmaschine\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen und blauen Fraktalwesen-Kreaturenspielstein. Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521743&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c00e14-84d8-4b3b-9e40-0ba5cb826a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 521743}, \'multiverseid\': 521743}, {\'name\': \'Motor secuencial\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X de un cementerio. Crea una ficha de criatura Fractal verde y azul 0/0. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31284694-9297-4517-be4b-6284994f2e99\', \'multiverseId\': 521823}, \'multiverseid\': 521823}, {\'name\': \'Moteur séquentiel\', \'text\': "{X}, {T} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana de X d\'un cimetière. Créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte et bleue Fractale. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326d23d2-931c-47fd-b019-0e8d9a229e92\', \'multiverseId\': 521903}, \'multiverseid\': 521903}, {\'name\': \'Macchina a Sequenza\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}: Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana X da un cimitero. Crea una pedina creatura Frattale 0/0 verde e blu. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb0c3f4-dee1-421c-92cb-3f1e8fc4eabc\', \'multiverseId\': 521983}, \'multiverseid\': 521983}, {\'name\': \'配列エンジン\', \'text\': \'{X}, {T}：墓地からマナ総量がＸのクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。緑であり青である０/０のフラクタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e486f85-4496-40c4-8697-a02d2f582fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 522063}, \'multiverseid\': 522063}]', "[{'name': 'Shivanisches Riff', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}. Das Shivanische Riff fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519599&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37d46210-8305-4b24-ba18-7e6dbd0ed6f2', 'multiverseId': 519599}, 'multiverseid': 519599}, {'name': 'Arrecife shivano', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}. El Arrecife shivano te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519847&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd46b6d0-57d1-4b4f-81b9-ad634e583ee5', 'multiverseId': 519847}, 'multiverseid': 519847}, {'name': 'Brisants shivâns', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}. Les Brisants shivâns vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520095&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04256e45-7dd1-4cc1-abe4-4ea43a6a6f69', 'multiverseId': 520095}, 'multiverseid': 520095}, {'name': 'Barriera di Shiv', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}. La Barriera di Shiv ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520343&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67a4b2e3-684b-44e8-91da-f98e4b2df2cb', 'multiverseId': 520343}, 'multiverseid': 520343}, {'name': 'シヴの浅瀬', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。シヴの浅瀬はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520591&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '565bf0b2-6f7d-4fbf-b677-303814489057', 'multiverseId': 520591}, 'multiverseid': 520591}, {'name': 'Recifes de Shiv', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}. Recifes de Shiv causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520839&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '436d731a-982d-48d2-9e90-6125dfd74e1e', 'multiverseId': 520839}, 'multiverseid': 520839}, {'name': 'Шиванский Риф', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {R}. Шиванский Риф наносит вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521087&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df9d9d15-cb5b-47ce-aefb-8f90acdd1bd3', 'multiverseId': 521087}, 'multiverseid': 521087}, {'name': '西瓦暗礁', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。西瓦暗礁对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521335&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f507bbe-bfac-42c5-a066-c581ba54b9cc', 'multiverseId': 521335}, 'multiverseid': 521335}, {'name': '西瓦暗礁', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。西瓦暗礁對你造成1點傷害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521583&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71da51f7-c08e-456e-8851-dc75594b4d22', 'multiverseId': 521583}, 'multiverseid': 521583}]", '[{\'name\': \'Siegesglockenspiel\', \'text\': \'Enttappe das Siegesglockenspiel während des Enttappsegments jedes anderen Spielers.\\n{T}: Ein Spieler, den du bestimmst, erzeugt {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der bevorzugte Krachmacher der Goblins, seit die Aufseher den Sprengstoff konfisziert haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9287bfb-fd3e-473e-979f-18900a1c285f\', \'multiverseId\': 519557}, \'multiverseid\': 519557}, {\'name\': \'Campanas de la victoria\', \'text\': \'Endereza las Campanas de la victoria durante el paso de enderezar de cada otro jugador.\\n{T}: Un jugador de tu elección agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El cacharro favorito de los trasgos para hacer ruido desde que los guardianes tomaron medidas contra los explosivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd4f9492-cb18-4f19-bc7c-8bc5e3217fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 519805}, \'multiverseid\': 519805}, {\'name\': \'Cloches de la victoire\', \'text\': "Dégagez les Cloches de la victoire pendant l\'étape de dégagement de chaque autre joueur.\\n{T} : Un joueur de votre choix ajoute {C}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La source de bruits préférée des gobelins depuis que les gardes ont confisqué les explosifs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520053&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1b0283-1cc8-4c7f-a4a1-ea9e091d1070\', \'multiverseId\': 520053}, \'multiverseid\': 520053}, {\'name\': \'Campane della Vittoria\', \'text\': \'STAPpa le Campane della Vittoria durante lo STAP di ogni altro giocatore.\\n{T}: Un giocatore a tua scelta aggiunge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La fonte di rumore preferita dai goblin sin da quando i guardiani hanno vietato gli esplosivi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d10f8a1-fed3-4fd5-b3a4-889886a1428d\', \'multiverseId\': 520301}, \'multiverseid\': 520301}, {\'name\': \'勝利の鐘\', \'text\': \'あなた以外の各プレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップに、勝利の鐘をアンタップする。\\n{T}：あなたが選んだプレイヤーは{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリンたちに人気の音の出る応援道具。監視員が爆発物を禁止して以来ずっと使われている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d49d973-a910-4f1b-9421-ab051e69ee45\', \'multiverseId\': 520549}, \'multiverseid\': 520549}, {\'name\': \'Sininhos da Vitória\', \'text\': \'Desvire Sininhos da Vitória durante a etapa de desvirar de cada outro jogador.\\n{T}: Um jogador à sua escolha adiciona {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O fazedor de barulho preferido dos goblins desde que os guardiões proibiram os explosivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb10ed44-e56d-44a0-a243-4d4a13a2ce25\', \'multiverseId\': 520797}, \'multiverseid\': 520797}, {\'name\': \'Колокола Победы\', \'text\': \'Во время шага разворота каждого другого игрока разверните Колокола Победы.\\n{T}: игрок по вашему выбору добавляет {C}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Любимый источник шума гоблинов — с тех пор, как надзиратели строго-настрого запретили взрывчатку.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'418da660-ced1-40b3-acf2-7dbb2a68b39a\', \'multiverseId\': 521045}, \'multiverseid\': 521045}, {\'name\': \'胜利鸣钟\', \'text\': \'于其他牌手的重置步骤中，重置胜利鸣钟。\\n{T}：选择一位牌手，该牌手加{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'自看守取缔爆炸物后，这是鬼怪最爱的噪声制造工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4614bd14-89b6-40b4-9791-070785c348a6\', \'multiverseId\': 521293}, \'multiverseid\': 521293}, {\'name\': \'勝利鳴鐘\', \'text\': \'於其他玩家的重置步驟中，重置勝利鳴鐘。\\n{T}：選擇一位玩家，該玩家加{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'自看守取締爆炸物後，這是鬼怪最愛的噪聲製造工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87397474-4279-4f05-b2cd-7216bab6415d\', \'multiverseId\': 521541}, \'multiverseid\': 521541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silberpein-Ghul\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, bringe den Silberpein-Ghul aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\\n{1}{B}, opfere den Silberpein-Ghul: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Von zwei Formen des Unlebens betroffen zu sein, ist ein schlimmeres Schicksal als der bloße Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519437&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d7b5b4-849a-439e-8b9e-208ac52bfb23\', \'multiverseId\': 519437}, \'multiverseid\': 519437}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago herida plateada\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, regresa el Necrófago herida plateada de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girado.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar el Necrófago herida plateada: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Estar atrapado entre dos formas sin vida es un destino mucho peor que la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800ac4df-1a42-485c-a88d-77ad2f0c8378\', \'multiverseId\': 519685}, \'multiverseid\': 519685}, {\'name\': "Goule piquée à l\'argent", \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, la Goule piquée à l\'argent depuis votre cimetière.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez la Goule piquée à l\'argent : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et vampire\', \'flavor\': \'Se retrouver piégé entre deux formes de non-vie est un sort bien plus cruel que la mort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8b4735-d3e5-45f2-af06-cce5589774b7\', \'multiverseId\': 519933}, \'multiverseid\': 519933}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Argentificato\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpato il Ghoul Argentificato dal tuo cimitero.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica il Ghoul Argentificato: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Essere intrappolati tra due forme di non vita è una sorte peggiore della semplice morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c825c42d-69d7-4183-af4e-bb1eb8f5aad3\', \'multiverseId\': 520181}, \'multiverseid\': 520181}, {\'name\': \'銀打ちのグール\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、あなたの墓地から銀打ちのグールをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\\n{1}{B}, 銀打ちのグールを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'命を持たない二種の存在の間に捕らわれるというのは、単なる死よりも遥かに悪い運命である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0167350-cbd4-4183-9497-008e78eaebb4\', \'multiverseId\': 520429}, \'multiverseid\': 520429}, {\'name\': \'Carniçal Argentificado\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você ganhou 3 pontos de vida ou mais neste turno, devolva Carniçal Argentificado de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifique Carniçal Argentificado: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Estar preso entre duas formas de não vida é um destino pior que uma mera morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa1295c0-10a1-491f-80c0-41912503cc89\', \'multiverseId\': 520677}, \'multiverseid\': 520677}, {\'name\': \'Среброкованый Упырь\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага, если в этом ходу вы получили 3 или более жизней, верните Среброкованого Упыря из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{1}{B}, пожертвуйте Среброкованого Упыря: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'Попасть в ловушку между двумя формами не-жизни — участь куда хуже, чем простая смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929b56e4-0eef-4b17-a5f6-ee440aa61287\', \'multiverseId\': 520925}, \'multiverseid\': 520925}, {\'name\': \'嵌银食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得了3点或更多生命，则将嵌银食尸鬼从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\\n{1}{B}，牺牲嵌银食尸鬼：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'夹在两种不死形体之间，这结局比死去更悲惨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a904e692-3d79-4508-8c59-e3ea79579dba\', \'multiverseId\': 521173}, \'multiverseid\': 521173}, {\'name\': \'嵌銀食屍鬼\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，若你本回合中獲得了3點或更多生命，則將嵌銀食屍鬼從你的墳墓場橫置移回戰場。\\n{1}{B}，犧牲嵌銀食屍鬼：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'夾在兩種不死形體之間，這結局比死去更悲慘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56e2cf1-8edc-4f32-ba0c-fc8fbd395996\', \'multiverseId\': 521421}, \'multiverseid\': 521421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Simic-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Für das Simic-Kombinat ist ihr Siegel nicht nur ein Ehrenemblem, sondern auch ihr Markenzeichen. Wenn man es auf einem biologischen Erzeugnis sieht, steht es für überragende Handwerkskunst, geniale Innovation und noch höhere Kosten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62cf9ef2-e581-4ab3-b75d-287b3e2a2dac\', \'multiverseId\': 519545}, \'multiverseid\': 519545}, {\'name\': \'Sello simic\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Para el Combinado Simic su sello no solo sirve como un emblema de honor, sino como una marca registrada. Esa imagen familiar en cualquier bien biológico asegura una excelente calidad, una innovación ingeniosa y un alto precio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c85cf977-15fa-474d-94c9-75eb308cb58c\', \'multiverseId\': 519793}, \'multiverseid\': 519793}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Simic\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Pour le Cartel de Simic, ce cachet n\'est pas un emblème d\'honneur, mais une marque déposée. Son image reconnue qui apparaît sur tout produit biologique est synonyme de savoir-faire hors du commun, d\'innovation et de prix exorbitant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520041&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e7bf064-9ed9-4969-90f5-8a4fb4180ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 520041}, \'multiverseid\': 520041}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Simic\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Per l\'Alleanza Simic, il sigillo non serve come un emblema ma come un marchio di proprietà. La sua immagine consueta su qualsiasi bene biologico ne attesta la superba fattura, l\'ingegnosa originalità e il costo elevato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da697fb-7828-47c8-ba5d-bae1cdefe4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 520289}, \'multiverseid\': 520289}, {\'name\': \'シミックの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{G}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'シミック連合にとって、紋章は名誉を示すものではなく商標である。この見慣れたシンボルはあらゆる生物学的な消耗品につけられていて、卓絶した技術と独創的な革新と高額な値段を意味している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2834591b-f7a9-4cd6-86c9-299cf2b6f7fd\', \'multiverseId\': 520537}, \'multiverseid\': 520537}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Simic\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Para o Conluio Simic, seu símbolo não é um emblema de honra, mas uma marca distintiva. Sua imagem familiar em qualquer ser biológico é um atestado de suprema arte, inovação engenhosa e alto custo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ab8dba-4a96-4fd4-926e-6b5111f82c98\', \'multiverseId\': 520785}, \'multiverseid\': 520785}, {\'name\': \'Печать Дома Симиков\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {G}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Для Объединения Симиков эта печать — не столько почетный знак, сколько фабричная марка. На любом биологическом товаре она символизирует непревзойденное мастерство, изобретательность, нововведения и повышенную стоимость.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2eb2b3b-ea86-4167-a173-8cdcbce1f861\', \'multiverseId\': 521033}, \'multiverseid\': 521033}, {\'name\': \'析米克印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{G}{U}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'对析米克联合而言，其印记并非荣誉之徽记，而是注册商标。这熟悉图像在任何生体用品上都可见到，证明了为其投资的高超技巧，精妙创意，以及昂贵费用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e083efbe-d462-4a08-b62a-7857a148f31b\', \'multiverseId\': 521281}, \'multiverseid\': 521281}, {\'name\': \'析米克印記\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{G}{U}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'對析米克聯合而言，其印記並非榮譽之徽記，而是註冊商標。這熟悉圖像在任何生體用品上都可見到，證明了為其投資的高超技巧，精妙創意，以及昂貴費用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7960414-8a15-40bb-b057-40c120257102\', \'multiverseId\': 521529}, \'multiverseid\': 521529}]', "[{'name': 'Simic-Wachstumskammer', 'text': 'Die Simic-Wachstumskammer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Simic-Wachstumskammer ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519600&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0635ec54-baca-4526-8b9e-7951b16ec744', 'multiverseId': 519600}, 'multiverseid': 519600}, {'name': 'Cámara de crecimiento simic', 'text': 'La Cámara de crecimiento simic entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cámara de crecimiento simic entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519848&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe271272-9680-4351-b354-0c61f629dac3', 'multiverseId': 519848}, 'multiverseid': 519848}, {'name': 'Chambre de croissance des Simic', 'text': 'La Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520096&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbdcc630-f9a5-459c-87f8-85df87ccc4c6', 'multiverseId': 520096}, 'multiverseid': 520096}, {'name': 'Camera di Coltura Simic', 'text': 'La Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520344&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89335455-87d3-41f5-b9da-a8cda5ca668f', 'multiverseId': 520344}, 'multiverseid': 520344}, {'name': 'シミックの成長室', 'text': 'シミックの成長室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nシミックの成長室が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520592&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd22de020-a6b6-41be-abcf-a5ace00aec40', 'multiverseId': 520592}, 'multiverseid': 520592}, {'name': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic', 'text': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Câmara de Crescimento Simic entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520840&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb84caee-58d2-475c-beff-566db9e20a17', 'multiverseId': 520840}, 'multiverseid': 520840}, {'name': 'Инкубатор Симиков', 'text': 'Инкубатор Симиков выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Инкубатор Симиков выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521088&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbfec902-0267-48d1-a12a-89217b4bbf2d', 'multiverseId': 521088}, 'multiverseid': 521088}, {'name': '析米克生长室', 'text': '析米克生长室须横置进战场。\\n当析米克生长室进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521336&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3585f285-539c-45b6-af36-cac97a4141be', 'multiverseId': 521336}, 'multiverseid': 521336}, {'name': '析米克生長室', 'text': '析米克生長室須橫置進戰場。\\n當析米克生長室進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521584&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3721ff86-c8d9-4899-a12a-fa5670047ec9', 'multiverseId': 521584}, 'multiverseid': 521584}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sintflut-Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Sintflut-Urwesen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof jenes Spielers wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, in diesem Zug auf einen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519403&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4984cd-337c-422e-85b3-4279e85d445d\', \'multiverseId\': 519403}, \'multiverseid\': 519403}, {\'name\': \'Primordial diluviano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Primordial diluviano entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, puedes lanzar hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo del cementerio de ese jugador sin pagar su coste de maná. Si un hechizo lanzado de esta manera fuera a ir a un cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c401ca4-e5e9-4c8c-b02d-ca34e8d9e018\', \'multiverseId\': 519651}, \'multiverseid\': 519651}, {\'name\': \'Primordial diluvien\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Primordial diluvien arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, vous pouvez lancer jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis le cimetière de ce joueur sans payer son coût de mana. Si un sort lancé de cette manière devait être mis dans un cimetière ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d27cf0d-b186-4185-a625-54db0d2e0d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 519899}, \'multiverseid\': 519899}, {\'name\': \'Primordiale Diluviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Primordiale Diluviano entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, puoi lanciare fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal cimitero di quel giocatore senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se una magia lanciata in questo modo sta per essere messa in un cimitero in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2ce132-7eb6-4f09-b18d-0fd2d6a2a1c1\', \'multiverseId\': 520147}, \'multiverseid\': 520147}, {\'name\': \'氾濫の始源体\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n氾濫の始源体が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。このターン、これにより唱えられた呪文が墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6274c5a5-28f0-4fd9-bfa1-89db53ac0f34\', \'multiverseId\': 520395}, \'multiverseid\': 520395}, {\'name\': \'Primordial Diluviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Primordial Diluviano entra no campo de batalha, para cada oponente, você pode conjurar até um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo do cemitério daquele jogador sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se uma mágica conjurada dessa maneira seria colocada num cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c73d1406-b75b-4f24-881e-b5dd33ecbadd\', \'multiverseId\': 520643}, \'multiverseid\': 520643}, {\'name\': \'Первородный Дух Потопа\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Первородный Дух Потопа выходит на поле битвы, для каждого оппонента вы можете разыграть не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из кладбища того игрока без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Если разыгранное таким образом заклинание должно быть положено на кладбище в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880e2f5c-662d-4c61-8cbf-7b71b786ea30\', \'multiverseId\': 520891}, \'multiverseid\': 520891}, {\'name\': \'洪水原祖\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当洪水原祖进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～你可以从其坟墓场中施放至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果以此法施放的咒语于本回合中将置入坟墓场，则改为将其放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf4c789-68e8-4d8a-a654-f4080c568453\', \'multiverseId\': 521139}, \'multiverseid\': 521139}, {\'name\': \'洪水原祖\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當洪水原祖進戰場時，為每位對手各進行以下流程～你可以從其墳墓場中施放至多一張目標瞬間或巫術牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。如果以此法施放的咒語於本回合中將置入墳墓場，則改為將其放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～聖者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacecfec-07b8-4730-a402-f13cf573dbad\', \'multiverseId\': 521387}, \'multiverseid\': 521387}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skrupelloser Wahn\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre zwei nichtschwarze Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Du verlierst 5 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Zweck heiligt die Gewalt. Oder so ähnlich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519434&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2971e5-2fbe-484c-953d-98f639426603\', \'multiverseId\': 519434}, \'multiverseid\': 519434}, {\'name\': \'Rencor imprudente\', \'text\': \'Destruye dos criaturas objetivo que no sean negras. Pierdes 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El fin justifica los miedos. O algo parecido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de118c99-c15a-46ae-abd6-d61c97c259e3\', \'multiverseId\': 519682}, \'multiverseid\': 519682}, {\'name\': \'Rancune téméraire\', \'text\': \'Détruisez deux créatures non-noires ciblées. Vous perdez 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La fin justifie d\'être moyen. Ou quelque chose comme ça. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcef0922-2a4d-4d5a-8192-94c5a7df4d37\', \'multiverseId\': 519930}, \'multiverseid\': 519930}, {\'name\': \'Disprezzo Sconsiderato\', \'text\': \'Distruggi due creature non nere bersaglio. Perdi 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il fine giustifica chi ci va di mezzo. O qualcosa del genere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04944715-83db-4f95-b38e-f3f4694eebed\', \'multiverseId\': 520178}, \'multiverseid\': 520178}, {\'name\': \'無謀な悪意\', \'text\': \'黒でないクリーチャー２体を対象とする。それらを破壊する。あなたは５点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「嘘も拷問。って言わなかったか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae108fc-05eb-46e3-82ba-16cccf7614d8\', \'multiverseId\': 520426}, \'multiverseid\': 520426}, {\'name\': \'Rancor Imprudente\', \'text\': \'Destrua duas criaturas não pretas alvo. Você perde 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O fim se justifica no meio. Ou qualquer coisa assim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70dff43f-0d8c-4480-bd8b-8f52d75388e0\', \'multiverseId\': 520674}, \'multiverseid\': 520674}, {\'name\': \'Безрассудная Злоба\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте два целевых нечерных существа. Вы теряете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Цель оправдывается злобой. Или что-то вроде того».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1501914b-3eeb-4b98-a7ae-28db37310704\', \'multiverseId\': 520922}, \'multiverseid\': 520922}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽恶行\', \'text\': \'消灭两个目标非黑色的生物。你失去5点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「为达目的，宁愿卑劣；或更等而下之。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99eef22a-25ee-4f72-8b0b-66a73e04c3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 521170}, \'multiverseid\': 521170}, {\'name\': \'魯莽惡行\', \'text\': \'消滅兩個目標非黑色的生物。你失去5點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「為達目的，寧願卑劣；或更等而下之。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b7c09e9-3b86-4af3-943b-431b51278840\', \'multiverseId\': 521418}, \'multiverseid\': 521418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnen-Titan\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Sonnen-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9993e856-dc4f-498b-86b6-4a4464cfa7fc\', \'multiverseId\': 519389}, \'multiverseid\': 519389}, {\'name\': \'Titán solar\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Titán solar entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes regresar la carta de permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sol ardiente que nunca se pone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da12f1c1-b37a-4a1b-bf5f-447c2c0697b4\', \'multiverseId\': 519637}, \'multiverseid\': 519637}, {\'name\': \'Titan solaire\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Un soleil brûlant qui ne se couche jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e188a7bd-85bb-4686-8ad9-fe24ab0b043a\', \'multiverseId\': 519885}, \'multiverseid\': 519885}, {\'name\': \'Titano Solare\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano Solare entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sole cocente che non tramonta mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e79a9cf8-ab1c-4ab3-abc7-7e9df1c031ee\', \'multiverseId\': 520133}, \'multiverseid\': 520133}, {\'name\': \'太陽のタイタン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n太陽のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地からマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'沈まない燃え盛る太陽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3177916b-c7c4-4513-99f8-1801cb273b96\', \'multiverseId\': 520381}, \'multiverseid\': 520381}, {\'name\': \'Titã de Sol\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que Titã de Sol entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você pode devolver ao campo de batalha o card de permanente alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Um sol flamejante que nunca se põe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b5f265d-a411-4a0c-9dbd-101965f4eb6e\', \'multiverseId\': 520629}, \'multiverseid\': 520629}, {\'name\': \'Титан Солнца\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКаждый раз, когда Титан Солнца выходит на поле битвы или атакует, вы можете вернуть целевую карту перманента с мановой ценностью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Ослепительное солнце, которое никогда не заходит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df51db0e-1be1-4b85-8056-8c8344d26087\', \'multiverseId\': 520877}, \'multiverseid\': 520877}, {\'name\': \'旭日泰坦\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当旭日泰坦进战场或攻击时，你可以将目标法术力值等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'永不落下的烈日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e89f605d-8593-48e8-95d6-c38b8b6e7c52\', \'multiverseId\': 521125}, \'multiverseid\': 521125}, {\'name\': \'旭日泰坦\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每當旭日泰坦進戰場或攻擊時，你可以將目標魔法力值等於或小於3的永久物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'永不落下的烈日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecd28353-d026-4cda-985f-aa13623a26f4\', \'multiverseId\': 521373}, \'multiverseid\': 521373}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenglut-Regent\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Sonnenglut-Regenten und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir vertrauen auf die Schuppenfürsten. Sie bringen Gerechtigkeit, der niemand entkommen kann."\\n—Urdnan, Dromoka-Krieger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05dd3710-8ff4-480e-9f35-a67f5039b2a0\', \'multiverseId\': 519390}, \'multiverseid\': 519390}, {\'name\': \'Regente abrasador solar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Regente abrasador solar y ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Confiamos en los señores de escamas, pues son portadores de una justicia de la que nadie puede escapar".\\n—Urdnan, guerrero de Drómoka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72fe6e1-9d1a-44b2-be05-256b8947f1c4\', \'multiverseId\': 519638}, \'multiverseid\': 519638}, {\'name\': \'Régent flambesoleil\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Régent flambesoleil et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "« Nous faisons confiance aux seigneurs squameux, porteurs d\'une justice à laquelle nul ne peut échapper. »\\n—Urdnan, guerrier de Dromoka", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2190e9d-7d97-44b8-ba5f-abe9618221a9\', \'multiverseId\': 519886}, \'multiverseid\': 519886}, {\'name\': \'Reggente dal Soffio Solare\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Reggente dal Soffio Solare e guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Confidiamo nei signori delle scaglie, portatori di una giustizia inesorabile."\\n—Urdnan, guerriero Dromoka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a239e2fd-b1b5-4d2d-9435-f919e4d14911\', \'multiverseId\': 520134}, \'multiverseid\': 520134}, {\'name\': \'陽焼の執政\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n対戦相手が呪文を唱えるたび、陽焼の執政の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「何人も逃れることができぬ正義の裁きをもたらす鱗王に、我々は全幅の信頼を置いている。」\\n――ドロモカの戦士、ウルドナン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3255fefe-cb26-4a4e-8a9e-e54f10e42f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 520382}, \'multiverseid\': 520382}, {\'name\': \'Regente da Queimadura Solar\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um oponente conjurar uma mágica, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Regente da Queimadura Solar e ganhe 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'"Confiamos nos senhores escamados, arautos da justiça, dos quais ninguém escapa."\\n— Urdnan, guerreiro de Dromoka\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50afcfb-a32b-418d-b582-faabe5524ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 520630}, \'multiverseid\': 520630}, {\'name\': \'Регент Испепеляющего Солнца\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент разыгрывает заклинание, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Регента Испепеляющего Солнца, и вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы верим в чешуйчатых владык, несущих правосудие, от которого не укрыться никому».\\n— Урднан, дромокский воин\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75a3fb5b-819a-40e4-955a-b36260c5d6c9\', \'multiverseId\': 520878}, \'multiverseid\': 520878}, {\'name\': \'日灼龙侯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当任一对手施放咒语时，在日灼龙侯上放置一个+1/+1指示物，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'「我们相信主持正义的王鳞必能惩罚恶人。」\\n～卓茉卡族战士乌尔德南\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb85625-25c5-4424-86a3-4aa1cac264a9\', \'multiverseId\': 521126}, \'multiverseid\': 521126}, {\'name\': \'日灼龍侯\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當任一對手施放咒語時，在日灼龍侯上放置一個+1/+1指示物，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'「我們相信主持正義的王鱗必能懲罰惡人。」\\n～卓茉卡族戰士烏爾德南\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc0bb63-5c71-4494-a2f6-02cd2b7c07ce\', \'multiverseId\': 521374}, \'multiverseid\': 521374}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenheim, Festung der Legion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Sonnenheim — der robuste Schild, der alles überragende Wachposten, der Sitz der Gerechtigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a3882f-a774-496c-85d2-fdf906ec9469\', \'multiverseId\': 519602}, \'multiverseid\': 519602}, {\'name\': \'Casa Solar, base de la Legión\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Casa Solar. El escudo inquebrantable, el centinela imponente, el trono de la justicia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caf355f9-97b0-41ec-be1e-26bc5e9d4956\', \'multiverseId\': 519850}, \'multiverseid\': 519850}, {\'name\': \'Solcastel, forteresse de la Légion\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T} : Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Solcastel — le bouclier invincible, la sentinelle dominante, le siège de la justice.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8886fe0-ecf7-4913-bc0f-fd469556b1b6\', \'multiverseId\': 520098}, \'multiverseid\': 520098}, {\'name\': \'Sol-Dimora, Rocca della Legione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Sol-Dimora. Lo scudo vigoroso, la sentinella torreggiante, la sede della giustizia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf4393b-5711-471a-b30d-18b9efcfd74e\', \'multiverseId\': 520346}, \'multiverseid\': 520346}, {\'name\': \'軍の要塞、サンホーム\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'サンホーム――頑強な盾であり、そびえ立つ歩哨であり、正義の座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0a0862-748a-424c-88e6-826ae19faeab\', \'multiverseId\': 520594}, \'multiverseid\': 520594}, {\'name\': \'Morada do Sol, Fortaleza da Legião\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: A criatura alvo ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Morada do Sol: vigoroso escudo, sentinela mais elevada, moradia da justiça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c67ac9d-d99e-4636-a69e-130a94c12c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 520842}, \'multiverseid\': 520842}, {\'name\': \'Дом Солнца, Крепость Легиона\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: целевое существо получает Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Дом Солнца — надежный щит, возвышающийся страж, престол справедливости.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e9d94cd-cd44-4538-bb84-c64434f4e35c\', \'multiverseId\': 521090}, \'multiverseid\': 521090}, {\'name\': \'教团要塞阳园\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}{R}{W}，{T}：目标生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'阳园～威武的坚盾，耸立的守卫，正义的王座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557f902a-06f7-4523-b057-a6f600112b31\', \'multiverseId\': 521338}, \'multiverseid\': 521338}, {\'name\': \'教團要塞陽園\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}{R}{W}，{T}：目標生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'陽園～威武的堅盾，聳立的守衛，正義的王座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84bddf54-9885-4ccc-8164-ef078e3399ee\', \'multiverseId\': 521586}, \'multiverseid\': 521586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f0b8cbb-e475-42d0-a763-eaa22551c23d\', \'multiverseId\': 519546}, \'multiverseid\': 519546}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5d26d6-a63b-4d48-b0b7-6c8328295ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 519794}, \'multiverseid\': 519794}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520042&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44807ec1-9f67-40fe-b6d3-0d1fc9a2390a\', \'multiverseId\': 520042}, \'multiverseid\': 520042}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50447a6-2357-4f23-a84e-c6fb0b2d4377\', \'multiverseId\': 520290}, \'multiverseid\': 520290}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e34f3a05-1197-4819-b4a8-a12295642d93\', \'multiverseId\': 520538}, \'multiverseid\': 520538}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Perdeu-se no tempo a antiga arte dos artífices de capturar a luz de uma estrela distante em um anel do mais puro ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b189e10-3805-4686-b379-0c047cbd03e4\', \'multiverseId\': 520786}, \'multiverseid\': 520786}, {\'name\': \'Солнечное Кольцо\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Давно забытое искусство механиков позволяло заключить свет далекой звезды в кольцо из чистейшего золота.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d24a4c3-37cc-4c36-940f-557e56875cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 521034}, \'multiverseid\': 521034}, {\'name\': \'阳光戒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'神器师曾能利用至纯黄金打造的戒指捕获来自遥远星辰的光芒，这门技艺如今早已亡佚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac48887-398a-4acd-a671-7df966e1f57a\', \'multiverseId\': 521282}, \'multiverseid\': 521282}, {\'name\': \'陽光戒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'神器師曾能利用至純黃金打造的戒指捕獲來自遙遠星辰的光芒，這門技藝如今早已亡佚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'628ad6df-af85-45cf-97a7-d853321d1fdb\', \'multiverseId\': 521530}, \'multiverseid\': 521530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnentröpfchen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn dir Schaden zugefügt wird, lege entsprechend viele Ladungsmarken auf das Sonnentröpfchen.\\nZu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments kannst du eine Ladungsmarke vom Sonnentröpfchen entfernen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ca4ccc-6c0d-48eb-81d4-28a04d043f00\', \'multiverseId\': 519551}, \'multiverseid\': 519551}, {\'name\': \'Gota solar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que recibas daño, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores de carga sobre la Gota solar.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, puedes remover un contador de carga de la Gota solar. Si lo haces, ganas 1 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973a69a0-6228-4527-b5f3-bbbd5c53ba0d\', \'multiverseId\': 519799}, \'multiverseid\': 519799}, {\'name\': \'Goutte de soleil\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous subissez des blessures, mettez autant de marqueurs « charge » sur la Goutte de soleil.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, vous pouvez retirer un marqueur « charge » de la Goutte de soleil. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f6ae5b-ba09-4cf5-bfb8-b9b49a41aa2b\', \'multiverseId\': 520047}, \'multiverseid\': 520047}, {\'name\': \'Goccia di Sole\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta ti viene inflitto danno, metti altrettanti segnalini carica sulla Goccia di Sole.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, puoi rimuovere un segnalino carica dalla Goccia di Sole. Se lo fai, guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43aeb087-e454-41c4-875b-51d8dfb977e8\', \'multiverseId\': 520295}, \'multiverseid\': 520295}, {\'name\': \'太陽のしずく\', \'text\': \'あなたがダメージを受けるたび、その点数に等しい数の蓄積カウンターを太陽のしずくの上に置く。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、あなたは太陽のしずくの上から蓄積カウンター１個を取り除いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3923ea9c-f77f-4419-9bec-260a419a9da3\', \'multiverseId\': 520543}, \'multiverseid\': 520543}, {\'name\': \'Gotícula de Sol\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sofrer dano, coloque uma quantidade equivalente de marcadores de carga em Gotícula de Sol.\\nNo início da manutenção de cada jogador, você pode remover um marcador de carga de Gotícula de Sol. Se fizer isso, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'045e0715-8e35-458c-ac6a-81a8e7f7739a\', \'multiverseId\': 520791}, \'multiverseid\': 520791}, {\'name\': \'Капелька Солнца\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вам наносятся повреждения, положите столько же жетонов заряда на Капельку Солнца.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки вы можете удалить один жетон заряда с Капельки Солнца. Если вы это делаете, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fabf2880-b9a7-477c-a488-ed67fef7fc66\', \'multiverseId\': 521039}, \'multiverseid\': 521039}, {\'name\': \'太阳微粒\', \'text\': \'每当你受到伤害时，在太阳微粒上放置等量的充电指示物。\\n在每个维持开始时，你可以从太阳微粒上移去一个充电指示物。若你如此作，则你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37475919-7505-4943-b67c-1db4e9c9d9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 521287}, \'multiverseid\': 521287}, {\'name\': \'太陽微粒\', \'text\': \'每當你受到傷害時，在太陽微粒上放置等量的充電指示物。\\n在每個維持開始時，你可以從太陽微粒上移去一個充電指示物。若你如此作，則你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1eb3521-dbdb-4f0b-9e1b-c25402d32010\', \'multiverseId\': 521535}, \'multiverseid\': 521535}]', "[{'name': 'Spektraler Scheinwerfer', 'text': '{T}: Bestimme einen Spieler. Er erzeugt ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, die er bestimmt.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Die ersten Scheinwerfer wurden als Geschenke und als Symbole der Zusammenarbeit an die bei der Unterzeichnung des Gildenbunds anwesenden Abgesandten übergeben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519548&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b43ff843-32bd-4b06-8625-62a4eb087eb6', 'multiverseId': 519548}, 'multiverseid': 519548}, {'name': 'Farol espectral', 'text': '{T}: Elige un jugador. Ese jugador agrega un maná de cualquier color que elija.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Los primeros faroles espectrales fueron entregados como regalos, símbolos de cooperación, a los emisarios presentes en la firma del Pacto entre Gremios.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519796&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aacf0c22-1245-4101-9786-05f3d6eaab83', 'multiverseId': 519796}, 'multiverseid': 519796}, {'name': 'Projecteur spectral', 'text': '{T} : Choisissez un joueur. Ce joueur ajoute un mana de la couleur de son choix.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Les premiers projecteurs furent offerts en gage de coopération aux émissaires présents lors de la signature du Pacte des Guildes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520044&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30f90009-b5b6-46f5-8a08-0363d24f253f', 'multiverseId': 520044}, 'multiverseid': 520044}, {'name': 'Proiettore Spettrale', 'text': '{T}: Scegli un giocatore. Quel giocatore aggiunge un mana di un qualsiasi colore a sua scelta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'I primi riflettori furono dati come doni, simboli di cooperazione, agli emissari presenti alla firma del Patto delle Gilde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520292&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0e9fcdc-fed6-4f36-b926-7ee4449f8c1b', 'multiverseId': 520292}, 'multiverseid': 520292}, {'name': '幽体の照明灯', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤー１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーは自分が選んだ色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '最初の灯りは、ギルドパクトに署名するために参じた使者にとって贈り物であり、協力の印である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520540&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd09f662-8823-4d6a-aea7-3d25bd2e0684', 'multiverseId': 520540}, 'multiverseid': 520540}, {'name': 'Holofote Espectral', 'text': '{T}: Escolha um jogador. Aquele jogador adiciona um mana de qualquer cor à própria escolha.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Os primeiros holofotes foram dados como presentes, símbolos de cooperação, aos emissários presentes na assinatura do Pacto das Guildas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520788&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '263b107a-0688-4971-a5f7-2ad4bfedd120', 'multiverseId': 520788}, 'multiverseid': 520788}, {'name': 'Призрачный Светильник', 'text': '{T}: выберите игрока. Тот игрок добавляет одну ману любого цвета по своему выбору.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': 'Первые светильники были подарены как символ сотрудничества тем посланникам, которые присутствовали на подписании Договора Гильдий.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521036&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '121bec6f-af5b-4b70-abcd-0b64cf841324', 'multiverseId': 521036}, 'multiverseid': 521036}, {'name': '光谱探照灯', 'text': '{T}：选择一位牌手。该牌手加一点法术力，其颜色由他选择。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '第一批探照灯是赠送给前来签署十会盟的密使，象征着合作无间。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521284&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f7be2d2-54ff-4243-b895-d3eb37714c04', 'multiverseId': 521284}, 'multiverseid': 521284}, {'name': '光譜探照燈', 'text': '{T}：選擇一位玩家。該玩家加一點魔法力，其顏色由他選擇。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '第一批探照燈是贈送給前來簽署十會盟的密使，象徵著合作無間。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521532&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4817b4c4-a90b-412b-93b5-ba253038a91e', 'multiverseId': 521532}, 'multiverseid': 521532}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist im Einklang mit der Essenz ihres Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e83abe5-daed-4471-bb9b-bb03b2f77192\', \'multiverseId\': 519522}, \'multiverseid\': 519522}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Está en armonía con la esencia de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fcbc09b-056e-4887-87d2-390f18ceea77\', \'multiverseId\': 519770}, \'multiverseid\': 519770}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'harmonise avec l\'essence de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520018&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3944c88f-0fd3-4acf-8c05-7789733b1420\', \'multiverseId\': 520018}, \'multiverseid\': 520018}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Si accorda all\'essenza del suo signore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35031488-9baf-4f73-93c0-4d8ad732a237\', \'multiverseId\': 520266}, \'multiverseid\': 520266}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはその主の本質と調和する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce98f3b3-4172-49a8-937d-d7c665e6809c\', \'multiverseId\': 520514}, \'multiverseid\': 520514}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se harmoniza com a essência de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c837b95c-37a9-44e7-830a-2b2cb5761450\', \'multiverseId\': 520762}, \'multiverseid\': 520762}, {\'name\': \'Сфера Командира\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\\nПожертвуйте Сферу Командира: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Она настраивается на сущность хозяина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98929ba-d5fd-4183-9331-a37e8aa67c44\', \'multiverseId\': 521010}, \'multiverseid\': 521010}, {\'name\': \'指挥官法球\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\\n牺牲指挥官法球：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它能与主人的精华同调。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7deea8-674f-4946-885d-ca6c65016bde\', \'multiverseId\': 521258}, \'multiverseid\': 521258}, {\'name\': \'指揮官法球\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。\\n犧牲指揮官法球：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它能與主人的精華同調。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f71554-fe0d-484e-9c33-37f9a567d6af\', \'multiverseId\': 521506}, \'multiverseid\': 521506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stampfergarten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 4/4 grünen Pilzwesen-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sicher, Stampfer riechen nach nassem Tod, aber die Pilze auf ihrem Rücken sind die schmackhafteste Delikatesse in ganz Schilfmoor!"\\n—Gyome, Blütenwelk-Koch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41942c54-de6b-4da1-85c7-5d343af5e482\', \'multiverseId\': 518536}, \'multiverseid\': 518536}, {\'name\': \'Jardín de pantanosos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Bestia Hongo verde 4/4 con la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"De acuerdo, los pantanosos huelen a muerte cenagosa, pero ¡las setas que crecen en sus espaldas son las exquisiteces más ricas de Paramojuncal!".\\n—Gyome, chef de Flosmarcitus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7189c268-e906-4cc9-9a63-72211ac26646\', \'multiverseId\': 518607}, \'multiverseid\': 518607}, {\'name\': \'Jardin des traînailleurs\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Fongus et Bête avec le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est vrai que les traînailleurs puent la mort, mais les champignons qui poussent sur leur dos sont l\'une des denrées les plus savoureuses de Tourbejonc ! »\\n—Gyome, chef cuisinier de Flestrefleur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'027c390c-7b23-493b-8bdb-a1d268d244f6\', \'multiverseId\': 518678}, \'multiverseid\': 518678}, {\'name\': \'Giardino di Micopalustri\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Bestia Fungus 4/4 verde con travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I micopalustri puzzeranno anche di putrido, ma i funghi che hanno sulla schiena sono fra le più gustose prelibatezze di Landa Palustre!"\\n—Gyome, cuoco di Germoglioscuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c130b2-c35b-4625-b1cb-5362200a8bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 518749}, \'multiverseid\': 518749}, {\'name\': \'トラッジの庭\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは「{2}を支払い、トランプルを持つ緑の４/４のファンガス・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「確かにトラッジは湿った死のような臭いがしますが、背中のキノコはセッジムーア最高の珍味ですからね！」\\n――ウィザーブルームの料理人、ギヨーム\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eba7128-8bd2-40be-a53e-8519cd71cabb\', \'multiverseId\': 518820}, \'multiverseid\': 518820}, {\'name\': \'Jardim do Rojo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura Fungo Besta verde 4/4 com atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Claro, os rojos têm um cheiro úmido de morte, mas os cogumelos nas costas deles são a iguaria mais saborosa do Umbrocharco!"\\n— Gyome, mestre-cuca Murchaflor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c180f836-eccb-4ce7-9d0e-2e80ba5fc85e\', \'multiverseId\': 518891}, \'multiverseid\': 518891}, {\'name\': \'Сад Болотников\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 зеленая Плесень Зверь с Пробивным ударом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Да, от болотников несет тиной и смертью, но грибы у них на спине — самый вкусный деликатес во всей Осоковой топи!»\\n— Гийом, повар Визерблума\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8166bf-dfdc-4c1a-9e3a-0f96b943e456\', \'multiverseId\': 518962}, \'multiverseid\': 518962}, {\'name\': \'楚吉兽花园\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则派出一个4/4绿色，具践踏异能的真菌／野兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「没错，虽然楚吉兽闻上去确实有股腐臭味，但它们背上长的蘑菇可是全蓑草原最美味的东西！」\\n～靡华主厨纪尧姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6b7fc8-baba-4488-b0b2-6603f3e9d8b8\', \'multiverseId\': 519033}, \'multiverseid\': 519033}, {\'name\': \'楚吉獸花園\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，則派出一個4/4綠色，具踐踏異能的真菌／野獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「沒錯，雖然楚吉獸聞上去確實有股腐臭味，但它們背上長的蘑菇可是全蓑草原最美味的東西！」\\n～靡華廚師紀堯姆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625b83e9-b5c4-4c29-bf4a-5222688a2092\', \'multiverseId\': 519104}, \'multiverseid\': 519104}]', "[{'name': 'Stampfergarten', 'text': 'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 4/4 grünen Pilzwesen-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521745&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c5d9c75-428d-46f1-9d86-cfc50c861773', 'multiverseId': 521745}, 'multiverseid': 521745}, {'name': 'Jardín de pantanosos', 'text': 'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Bestia Hongo verde 4/4 con la habilidad de arrollar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521825&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '751a2078-e8be-479b-af58-b7b21a5e3fde', 'multiverseId': 521825}, 'multiverseid': 521825}, {'name': 'Jardin des traînailleurs', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Fongus et Bête avec le piétinement.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521905&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5defd57-3c48-4a52-ac33-633b79e1bced', 'multiverseId': 521905}, 'multiverseid': 521905}, {'name': 'Giardino di Micopalustri', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Bestia Fungus 4/4 verde con travolgere.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521985&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edf1a0e9-a807-400a-ac52-af1e6299433a', 'multiverseId': 521985}, 'multiverseid': 521985}, {'name': 'トラッジの庭', 'text': 'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは「{2}を支払い、トランプルを持つ緑の４/４のファンガス・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522065&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77f3b96a-f4c8-40f1-bc29-bcaab57fcd43', 'multiverseId': 522065}, 'multiverseid': 522065}]", '[{\'name\': \'Stechendes Studium\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag eines Kommandeurs ist, den du besitzt und der sich in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel befindet.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Silberkiel-Studienanfänger begrüßen die Unannehmlichkeiten im Klassenzimmer, in dem Wissen, dass sie auf die kommenden Jahre vorbereitet werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c913a995-7f76-447d-84fd-c95e1eb9f58a\', \'multiverseId\': 518511}, \'multiverseid\': 518511}, {\'name\': \'Estudio punzante\', \'text\': \'Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es el valor de maná de un comandante del cual eres propietario en el campo de batalla o en la zona de mando.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de primer año de Plumargéntum aguantan las inclemencias de las clases porque saben que ello les preparará para los años venideros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'488ab12e-68ba-4f6b-9666-295eff8ae675\', \'multiverseId\': 518582}, \'multiverseid\': 518582}, {\'name\': \'Étude piquante\', \'text\': "Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant la valeur de mana d\'un commandant que vous possédez sur le champ de bataille ou dans la zone de commandement.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les étudiants en première année de Plumargent apprécient l\'inconfort pendant les cours sachant que cela les prépare pour les années à venir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518653&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac93ef3-72a7-4ee4-ad36-0519899398ab\', \'multiverseId\': 518653}, \'multiverseid\': 518653}, {\'name\': \'Studio Pungente\', \'text\': \'Pesca X carte e perdi X punti vita, dove X è il valore di mana di un comandante che possiedi sul campo di battaglia o nella zona di comando.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Le matricole di Pennargento accettano il disagio in classe, sapendo che li prepara per gli anni a venire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbe29020-99a6-4584-9e65-61aeb4bfdd24\', \'multiverseId\': 518724}, \'multiverseid\': 518724}, {\'name\': \'刺のある研究\', \'text\': \'あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘは、戦場か統率領域にありあなたがオーナーである統率者１体のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'シルバークイルの一年生は教室での苦痛に喜んで耐える。これからの数年間への準備であると知っているからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b82540-e2dd-41a3-8b66-c0204a48554a\', \'multiverseId\': 518795}, \'multiverseid\': 518795}, {\'name\': \'Estudo Pungente\', \'text\': \'Você compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o valor de mana de um comandante seu no campo de batalha ou na zona de comando.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os calouros de Platinopena aceitam bem o desconforto da sala de aula, cientes de que ele os preparará para os anos seguintes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a503a45-ba89-459d-9865-473dcbbb8218\', \'multiverseId\': 518866}, \'multiverseid\': 518866}, {\'name\': \'Жалящее Обучение\', \'text\': \'Вы берете X карт и теряете X жизней, где Х — мановая ценность принадлежащего вам командира на поле битвы или в зоне командования.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Первокурсники Сильверквилла рады неудобствам на занятиях — для них это возможность подготовиться к последующим годам обучения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e57c3b9-cf04-429f-96bf-2f009492276a\', \'multiverseId\': 518937}, \'multiverseid\': 518937}, {\'name\': \'刺痛苦学\', \'text\': \'你抓X张牌且失去X点生命，X为战场上或统帅区中由你拥有之任一指挥官的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'虽然教室中略有不适，但银毫新生似乎并不介意，因为他们知道这能为未来学业打好基础。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd6424a-250d-4e16-bb53-cc2673894383\', \'multiverseId\': 519008}, \'multiverseid\': 519008}, {\'name\': \'刺痛苦學\', \'text\': \'你抽X張牌且失去X點生命，X為戰場上或統帥區中由你擁有之任一指揮官的魔法力值。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'雖然教室中略有不適，但銀毫新生似乎並不介意，因為他們知道這能為未來學業打好基礎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b20a8fb-3926-423e-8e97-258ecd7362b6\', \'multiverseId\': 519079}, \'multiverseid\': 519079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stechendes Studium\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag eines Kommandeurs ist, den du besitzt und der sich in der Kommandozone oder im Spiel befindet.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521720&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba3e438-3a21-4021-91dd-0714136d5f7d\', \'multiverseId\': 521720}, \'multiverseid\': 521720}, {\'name\': \'Estudio punzante\', \'text\': \'Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es el valor de maná de un comandante del cual eres propietario en el campo de batalla o en la zona de mando.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c665fe3c-f09b-4f68-8b56-9ab7f7431da0\', \'multiverseId\': 521800}, \'multiverseid\': 521800}, {\'name\': \'Étude piquante\', \'text\': "Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant la valeur de mana d\'un commandant que vous possédez sur le champ de bataille ou dans la zone de commandement.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d34ade96-98c8-40dd-a58b-5259d30bd752\', \'multiverseId\': 521880}, \'multiverseid\': 521880}, {\'name\': \'Studio Pungente\', \'text\': \'Pesca X carte e perdi X punti vita, dove X è il valore di mana di un comandante che possiedi sul campo di battaglia o nella zona di comando.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'657a7a66-948b-42d8-9986-cdc596acfb75\', \'multiverseId\': 521960}, \'multiverseid\': 521960}, {\'name\': \'刺のある研究\', \'text\': \'あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘは、戦場か統率領域にありあなたがオーナーである統率者１体のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed873120-91ec-4342-9ac1-bf31df53686c\', \'multiverseId\': 522040}, \'multiverseid\': 522040}]', "[{'name': 'Stilles Dickicht', 'text': 'Das Stille Dickicht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\nUmwandlung {G} ({G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519611&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f7c76f2-aad4-47af-b277-45aa02da408d', 'multiverseId': 519611}, 'multiverseid': 519611}, {'name': 'Maleza tranquila', 'text': 'La Maleza tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\nCiclo {G}. ({G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519859&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31d785da-4adf-4996-bb34-898531866211', 'multiverseId': 519859}, 'multiverseid': 519859}, {'name': 'Halliers tranquilles', 'text': 'Les Halliers tranquilles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\nRecyclage {G} ({G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520107&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c8799ab-ad60-40ca-a435-6f9c04200022', 'multiverseId': 520107}, 'multiverseid': 520107}, {'name': 'Boschetto Tranquillo', 'text': 'Il Boschetto Tranquillo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\nCiclo {G} ({G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520355&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8815d654-89ef-4861-a0b3-265bd3bb04b2', 'multiverseId': 520355}, 'multiverseid': 520355}, {'name': '平穏な茂み', 'text': '平穏な茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\nサイクリング{G}（{G}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520603&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0eccf84-86df-41a2-b34a-8839664e05b9', 'multiverseId': 520603}, 'multiverseid': 520603}, {'name': 'Bosque Sereno', 'text': 'Bosque Sereno entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\nReciclar {G} ({G}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520851&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd777f381-f5b3-45c3-9f13-d51ac6bcd9ef', 'multiverseId': 520851}, 'multiverseid': 520851}, {'name': 'Безмятежная Роща', 'text': 'Безмятежная Роща выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}.\\nЦикл {G} ({G}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521099&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '110ab2b6-9937-4f70-96f6-0e28e347fa2c', 'multiverseId': 521099}, 'multiverseid': 521099}, {'name': '静谧灌丛', 'text': '静谧灌丛须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n循环{G}（{G}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521347&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26f12b6d-a2f4-4a8a-8e64-6469aed13a78', 'multiverseId': 521347}, 'multiverseid': 521347}, {'name': '靜謐灌叢', 'text': '靜謐灌叢須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n循環{G}（{G}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521595&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '963574ba-01f1-4400-98c6-0052cca7d08c', 'multiverseId': 521595}, 'multiverseid': 521595}]", '[{\'name\': \'Stipendienvermittler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Stipendienvermittler ins Spiel kommt, durchsucht jeder Spieler, der weniger Länder kontrolliert als der Spieler, der die meisten Länder kontrolliert, seine Bibliothek nach einer Anzahl an Standardland-Karten, die kleiner oder gleich der Differenz ist, bringt sie getappt ins Spiel und mischt danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e2795c-b8bb-423c-9bc6-95ce1088a967\', \'multiverseId\': 518489}, \'multiverseid\': 518489}, {\'name\': \'Patrocinador de becas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Patrocinador de becas entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador que controla menos tierras que el jugador que controla la mayor cantidad de tierras busca en su biblioteca una cantidad de cartas de tierra básica menor o igual a la diferencia, pone esas cartas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f759f8-015b-43a6-8f7f-2ea23774ab2b\', \'multiverseId\': 518560}, \'multiverseid\': 518560}, {\'name\': "Parrain de bourse d\'études", \'text\': "Quand le Parrain de bourse d\'études arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur qui contrôle moins de terrains que le joueur qui en contrôle le plus cherche dans sa bibliothèque un nombre de cartes de terrain de base inférieur ou égal à la différence, met ces cartes sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélange.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518631&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'376455b2-43fd-4fc8-b3d0-e2deb77efb82\', \'multiverseId\': 518631}, \'multiverseid\': 518631}, {\'name\': \'Patrocinatore Scolastico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Patrocinatore Scolastico entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore che controlla meno terre del giocatore che ne controlla di più passa in rassegna il proprio grimorio per un numero di carte terra base pari o inferiore alla differenza, mette quelle carte sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2595d68a-2a60-474c-b0e5-e544e6be0965\', \'multiverseId\': 518702}, \'multiverseid\': 518702}, {\'name\': \'奨学金寄付者\', \'text\': \'奨学金寄付者が戦場に出たとき、コントロールしている土地の数が、土地を最も多くコントロールしているプレイヤーよりも少ない各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーから、その差以下の枚数の基本土地・カードを探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c118ce08-af7a-4ab2-9240-6acd57914b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 518773}, \'multiverseid\': 518773}, {\'name\': \'Financiador de Bolsas\', \'text\': \'Quando Financiador de Bolsas entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador que controla menos terrenos que o que controla mais procura no próprio grimório um número de cards de terreno básico igual ou inferior à diferença, coloca aqueles cards no campo de batalha virados e, depois, embaralha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3f8079-c477-466e-8555-18ee68979b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 518844}, \'multiverseid\': 518844}, {\'name\': \'Спонсор Стипендий\', \'text\': \'Когда Спонсор Стипендий выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок, под контролем которого меньше земель, чем у игрока, контролирующего наибольшее количество земель, ищет в своей библиотеке карты базовых земель в количестве, меньшем или равном разнице, кладет те карты на поле битвы повернутыми, затем тасует библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Советник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1467432e-9217-4b13-82f0-b457b4d936ed\', \'multiverseId\': 518915}, \'multiverseid\': 518915}, {\'name\': \'奖学金资助人\', \'text\': \'当奖学金资助人进战场时，每位操控地不是最多的牌手，各依他与操控地最多的牌手之间地数量的差距进行以下流程～从其牌库中搜寻数量等于或小于此差额的基本地牌，将这些牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99f68a37-1c2b-45f1-a0a2-300994b78a39\', \'multiverseId\': 518986}, \'multiverseid\': 518986}, {\'name\': \'獎學金資助人\', \'text\': \'當獎學金資助人進戰場時，每位操控地不是最多的玩家，各依他與操控地最多的玩家之間地數量的差距進行以下流程～從其牌庫中搜尋數量等於或小於此差額的基本地牌，將這些牌橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／參謀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f1e273-a42c-4cf7-9649-cffaca5ede9c\', \'multiverseId\': 519057}, \'multiverseid\': 519057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stipendienvermittler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Stipendienvermittler ins Spiel kommt, durchsucht jeder Spieler, der weniger Länder kontrolliert als der Spieler, der die meisten Länder kontrolliert, seine Bibliothek nach einer Anzahl an Standardland-Karten, die kleiner oder gleich der Differenz ist, bringt sie getappt ins Spiel und mischt danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521698&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa291b45-1f2c-4da7-a7ac-198e09c72196\', \'multiverseId\': 521698}, \'multiverseid\': 521698}, {\'name\': \'Patrocinador de becas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Patrocinador de becas entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador que controla menos tierras que el jugador que controla la mayor cantidad de tierras busca en su biblioteca una cantidad de cartas de tierra básica menor o igual a la diferencia, pone esas cartas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7980b32-0136-4816-8735-4993f0f09f14\', \'multiverseId\': 521778}, \'multiverseid\': 521778}, {\'name\': "Parrain de bourse d\'études", \'text\': "Quand le Parrain de bourse d\'études arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur qui contrôle moins de terrains que le joueur qui en contrôle le plus cherche dans sa bibliothèque un nombre de cartes de terrain de base inférieur ou égal à la différence, met ces cartes sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélange.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521858&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548ee94c-dd11-4b10-b49c-70a0bcfb3bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 521858}, \'multiverseid\': 521858}, {\'name\': \'Patrocinatore Scolastico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Patrocinatore Scolastico entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore che controlla meno terre del giocatore che ne controlla di più passa in rassegna il proprio grimorio per un numero di carte terra base pari o inferiore alla differenza, mette quelle carte sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cbf76de-5c5d-4801-93f2-1bdd15501912\', \'multiverseId\': 521938}, \'multiverseid\': 521938}, {\'name\': \'奨学金寄付者\', \'text\': \'奨学金寄付者が戦場に出たとき、コントロールしている土地の数が、土地を最も多くコントロールしているプレイヤーよりも少ない各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーから、その差以下の枚数の基本土地・カードを探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999d7d17-68da-4e7c-a464-3a0ed4f08d52\', \'multiverseId\': 522018}, \'multiverseid\': 522018}]', "[{'name': 'Stoßzahnrufer aus Kazandu', 'text': 'Stufe aufsteigen {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Lege eine Stufenmarke auf diese Karte. Spiele Stufe aufsteigen wie eine Hexerei.)\\nSTUFE 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}: Erzeuge einen 3/3 grünen Elefant-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nSTUFE 6+\\n1/1\\n{T}: Erzeuge zwei 3/3 grüne Elefant-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519479&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93c3d11b-f683-47a7-9e92-9fdf33f376a4', 'multiverseId': 519479}, 'multiverseid': 519479}, {'name': 'Llamacolmillos de Kazandu', 'text': 'Subir de nivel {1}{G}. ({1}{G}: Pon un contador de nivel sobre esta carta. Sube de nivel solo como un conjuro.)\\nNIVEL 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.\\nNIVEL 6+\\n1/1\\n{T}: Crea dos fichas de criatura Elefante verdes 3/3.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519727&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76825b21-8b5f-483e-8b51-d824a4f500d9', 'multiverseId': 519727}, 'multiverseid': 519727}, {'name': 'Meneuse de pachydermes du Kazandou', 'text': 'Montée de niveau {1}{G} ({1}{G} : Mettez un marqueur « niveau » sur cette créature. Ne montez de niveau que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nNIVEAU 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T} : Créez un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Éléphant.\\nNIVEAU 6+\\n1/1\\n{T} : Créez deux jetons de créature 3/3 verte éléphant.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et shamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519975&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fb3dda2-b0c0-4145-9a82-157185170071', 'multiverseId': 519975}, 'multiverseid': 519975}, {'name': 'Convocazanne di Kazandu', 'text': 'Aumentare di livello {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Metti un segnalino livello su questa creatura. Aumenta di livello solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nLIVELLO 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}: Crea una pedina creatura Elefante 3/3 verde.\\nLIVELLO 6+\\n1/1\\n{T}: Crea due pedine creatura Elefante 3/3 verdi.', 'type': 'Creatura — Sciamano Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520223&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c54c551-e60e-4958-bba5-a8a6b7fcf7e3', 'multiverseId': 520223}, 'multiverseid': 520223}, {'name': 'カザンドゥの牙呼び', 'text': 'Lvアップ{1}{G}（{1}{G}：この上にLvカウンター１個を置く。Lvアップはソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nLv ２-５\\n１/１\\n{T}：緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nLv ６＋\\n１/１\\n{T}：緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520471&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c047c369-0bd7-46e2-bdc3-57eb039bd3a5', 'multiverseId': 520471}, 'multiverseid': 520471}, {'name': 'Convocador de Elefante de Kazandu', 'text': 'Subir de nível {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Coloque um marcador de nível nesta criatura. Suba de nível somente como um feitiço.)\\nNÍVEL 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.\\nNÍVEL 6+\\n1/1\\n{T}: Crie duas fichas de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Xamã', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520719&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfba09e5-7bbd-45d4-a9b9-a9e7692d6401', 'multiverseId': 520719}, 'multiverseid': 520719}, {'name': 'Вызывательница Бивней из Казанду', 'text': 'Повышение уровня {1}{G} ({1}{G}: положите один жетон уровня на этот объект. Повышайте уровень только как волшебство.)\\nУРОВЕНЬ 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}: создайте одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Слон.\\nУРОВЕНЬ 6+\\n1/1\\n{T}: создайте две фишки существа 3/3 зеленый Слон.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Шаман', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520967&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'baafd0e8-63a4-424e-ac40-5d47d80bff54', 'multiverseId': 520967}, 'multiverseid': 520967}, {'name': '卡赞度召牙师', 'text': '升级{1}{G}（{1}{G}：在其上放置一个等级指示物。升级的时机视同法术。）\\n等级2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}：派出一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物。\\n等级6+\\n1/1\\n{T}：派出两个3/3绿色的象衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521215&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd11eb612-f8a8-4b09-a246-0d06d9738d79', 'multiverseId': 521215}, 'multiverseid': 521215}, {'name': '卡贊度召牙師', 'text': '升級{1}{G}（{1}{G}：在其上放置一個等級指示物。升級的時機視同巫術。）\\n等級2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}：派出一個3/3綠色的象衍生生物。\\n等級6+\\n1/1\\n{T}：派出兩個3/3綠色的象衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／祭師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521463&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40cde1b9-a924-4e28-90a8-b24e02d7c042', 'multiverseId': 521463}, 'multiverseid': 521463}]", '[{\'name\': \'Strahlende Darstellerin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Strahlende Darstellerin ins Spiel kommt und falls du sie aus deiner Hand gewirkt hast, bestimme einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, der bzw. die nur eine einzelne bleibende Karte oder einen einzelnen Spieler als Ziel hat. Kopiere den Zauberspruch oder die Fähigkeit für jede andere bleibende Karte und jeden anderen Spieler, die bzw. den der Zauberspruch oder die Fähigkeit als Ziel haben könnte. Jede Kopie hat eine unterschiedliche bleibende Karte bzw. einen unterschiedlichen Spieler davon als Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f53777-d94f-494d-9d79-744b485814f3\', \'multiverseId\': 518521}, \'multiverseid\': 518521}, {\'name\': \'Artista brillante\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Artista brillante entre al campo de batalla, si la lanzaste desde tu mano, elige un hechizo o habilidad objetivo que solo haga objetivo a un único permanente o jugador. Copia ese hechizo o habilidad por cada otro permanente o jugador que el hechizo o habilidad pudiera hacer objetivo. Cada copia hace objetivo a uno de esos permanentes o jugadores distintos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b31d92f-6374-4074-ae65-b0f772da7e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 518592}, \'multiverseid\': 518592}, {\'name\': \'Artiste radieuse\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Artiste radieuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous la lancez depuis votre main, choisissez un sort ciblé ou une capacité ciblée qui cible un seul permanent ou joueur. Copiez ce sort ou cette capacité pour chaque autre permanent ou joueur que le sort ou la capacité pourrait cibler. Chaque copie cible un permanent ou joueur différent parmi eux.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518663&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d0d7a4f-bde5-4588-b8f2-3504dc0194b5\', \'multiverseId\': 518663}, \'multiverseid\': 518663}, {\'name\': \'Artista Radiosa\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando l\'Artista Radiosa entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciata dalla tua mano, scegli una magia o un\'abilità bersaglio che bersaglia solo un permanente o un giocatore. Copia quella magia o abilità per ogni altro permanente o giocatore che la magia o abilità poteva bersagliare. Ogni copia bersaglia uno diverso fra quei permanenti e giocatori.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b502644-06ba-4fa7-acda-b6c19adfa88f\', \'multiverseId\': 518734}, \'multiverseid\': 518734}, {\'name\': \'光輝の演者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n光輝の演者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがあなたの手札からこれを唱えていた場合、パーマネント１つかプレイヤー１人のみを対象としている、呪文１つか能力１つを対象とする。それが対象にしたもの以外で対象にできる各パーマネントや各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、それを１回コピーする。各コピーは、それらのパーマネントやプレイヤーのうち別々のものを対象とする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67854303-9d64-410e-ac2c-1235dfd1b428\', \'multiverseId\': 518805}, \'multiverseid\': 518805}, {\'name\': \'Artista Performática Radiante\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Artista Performática Radiante entrar no campo de batalha, se você a conjurou da sua mão, escolha uma mágica ou habilidade alvo que tenha como alvo uma única permanente ou um único jogador. Copie aquela mágica ou habilidade para cada outra permanente/jogador que a mágica ou habilidade possa ter como alvo. Cada cópia terá como alvo uma permanente/jogador diferente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc75b651-27f5-46c6-a95e-bb682dbde1c8\', \'multiverseId\': 518876}, \'multiverseid\': 518876}, {\'name\': \'Лучезарная Исполнительница\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Лучезарная Исполнительница выходит на поле битвы, если вы разыграли ее из вашей руки, выберите целевое заклинание или способность, целью которого(-ой) является только один перманент или игрок. Скопируйте то заклинание или способность за каждый другой перманент или игрока, которые могут быть целями того заклинания или способности. Целью каждой копии является один из тех разных перманентов и игроков.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1babb867-8e3d-4365-b871-33475b085139\', \'multiverseId\': 518947}, \'multiverseid\': 518947}, {\'name\': \'辐光献艺家\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当辐光献艺家进战场时，若你从你手上施放之，则选择目标咒语或异能，且其须仅指定单一永久物或牌手为目标。该咒语或异能每能以一个其他永久物或牌手为目标，便将其复制一次。每个复制品都要以这些永久物和牌手之一为目标，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a27002-f898-41e0-b63c-95a4386ac515\', \'multiverseId\': 519018}, \'multiverseid\': 519018}, {\'name\': \'輻光獻藝家\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當輻光獻藝家進戰場時，若你從你手上施放之，則選擇目標咒語或異能，且其須僅指定單一永久物或玩家為目標。該咒語或異能每能以一個其他永久物或玩家為目標，便將其複製一次。每個複製品都要以這些永久物和玩家之一為目標，且不能重複選擇。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'622224df-cb6f-4876-850b-6711dbf4235a\', \'multiverseId\': 519089}, \'multiverseid\': 519089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Strahlende Darstellerin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Strahlende Darstellerin ins Spiel kommt und falls du sie aus deiner Hand gewirkt hast, bestimme einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, der bzw. die nur eine einzelne bleibende Karte oder einen einzelnen Spieler als Ziel hat. Kopiere den Zauberspruch oder die Fähigkeit für jede andere bleibende Karte und jeden anderen Spieler, die bzw. den der Zauberspruch oder die Fähigkeit als Ziel haben könnte. Jede Kopie hat eine unterschiedliche bleibende Karte bzw. einen unterschiedlichen Spieler davon als Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f97824-58a9-4c22-802d-9babbe0af536\', \'multiverseId\': 521730}, \'multiverseid\': 521730}, {\'name\': \'Artista brillante\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Artista brillante entre al campo de batalla, si la lanzaste desde tu mano, elige un hechizo o habilidad objetivo que solo haga objetivo a un único permanente o jugador. Copia ese hechizo o habilidad por cada otro permanente o jugador que el hechizo o habilidad pudiera hacer objetivo. Cada copia hace objetivo a uno de esos permanentes o jugadores distintos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91cb7030-37a9-40e2-83ed-44708a752f77\', \'multiverseId\': 521810}, \'multiverseid\': 521810}, {\'name\': \'Artiste radieuse\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Artiste radieuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous la lancez depuis votre main, choisissez un sort ciblé ou une capacité ciblée qui cible un seul permanent ou joueur. Copiez ce sort ou cette capacité pour chaque autre permanent ou joueur que le sort ou la capacité pourrait cibler. Chaque copie cible un permanent ou joueur différent parmi eux.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6458ed0-bf8d-4e78-82b8-b51068dcfa78\', \'multiverseId\': 521890}, \'multiverseid\': 521890}, {\'name\': \'Artista Radiosa\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando l\'Artista Radiosa entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciata dalla tua mano, scegli una magia o un\'abilità bersaglio che bersaglia solo un permanente o un giocatore. Copia quella magia o abilità per ogni altro permanente o giocatore che la magia o abilità poteva bersagliare. Ogni copia bersaglia uno diverso fra quei permanenti e giocatori.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be61036-2396-4cd1-8a2d-13c7ff72d7ab\', \'multiverseId\': 521970}, \'multiverseid\': 521970}, {\'name\': \'光輝の演者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n光輝の演者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがあなたの手札からこれを唱えていた場合、パーマネント１つかプレイヤー１人のみを対象としている、呪文１つか能力１つを対象とする。それが対象にしたもの以外で対象にできる各パーマネントや各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、それを１回コピーする。各コピーは、それらのパーマネントやプレイヤーのうち別々のものを対象とする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bfac4a4-cadb-4252-9580-ea420fef047f\', \'multiverseId\': 522050}, \'multiverseid\': 522050}]', '[{\'name\': \'Studiensaal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Wenn du dieses Mana verwendest, um deinen Kommandeur zu wirken, wende Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl ist, wie oft er in dieser Partie aus der Kommandozone gewirkt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2cba789-b744-4237-bfb0-25151bc40315\', \'multiverseId\': 518547}, \'multiverseid\': 518547}, {\'name\': \'Sala de estudio\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Cuando uses este maná para lanzar a tu comandante, adivina X, donde X es la cantidad de veces que se lanzó desde la zona de mando este juego.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd3b10a-95aa-4c3f-a7bf-382e65c720ae\', \'multiverseId\': 518618}, \'multiverseid\': 518618}, {\'name\': "Salle d\'étude", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Quand vous dépensez ce mana pour lancer votre commandant, appliquez regard X, X étant le nombre de fois qu\'il a été lancé depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518689&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2aeaa9-7d2b-4710-8c8d-daf7a0cbcc4d\', \'multiverseId\': 518689}, \'multiverseid\': 518689}, {\'name\': \'Sala di Studio\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Quando spendi questo mana per lanciare il tuo comandante, profetizza X, dove X è il numero di volte che è stato lanciato dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6532bb-88c7-4019-90c7-2e5128cad3d1\', \'multiverseId\': 518760}, \'multiverseid\': 518760}, {\'name\': \'研究堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたがあなたの統率者を唱えるためにこのマナを支払ったとき、占術Ｘを行う。Ｘは、それがこのゲームで統率領域から唱えられた回数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ed82ae-2875-4d54-934e-f77d730c4862\', \'multiverseId\': 518831}, \'multiverseid\': 518831}, {\'name\': \'Salão de Estudos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Quando você gastar este mana para conjurar seu comandante, use vidência X, sendo X o número de vezes em que ele foi conjurado da zona de comando neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5948a9ba-4707-46fe-a5bd-120e2aa26348\', \'multiverseId\': 518902}, \'multiverseid\': 518902}, {\'name\': \'Учебный Зал\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета. Когда вы тратите эту ману на разыгрывание вашего командира, предскажите X, где X — количество его разыгрываний из зоны командования в этой партии.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1a5c4d6-3078-4dd0-931b-281c7cb74009\', \'multiverseId\': 518973}, \'multiverseid\': 518973}, {\'name\': \'自修学堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。当你将此法术力用来施放你的指挥官时，占卜X，X为这盘游戏中从统帅区施放它的次数。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b4edd35-18eb-48fd-af86-1a1474940017\', \'multiverseId\': 519044}, \'multiverseid\': 519044}, {\'name\': \'自修學堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。當你將此魔法力用來施放你的指揮官時，占卜X，X為這盤遊戲中從統帥區施放它的次數。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a511b7d3-29b9-4f11-9560-ac9d9583b37e\', \'multiverseId\': 519115}, \'multiverseid\': 519115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stählerner Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}: Der Stählerne Höllendrache erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{X}: Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag X, die kein Land ist und deren Beherrscher in diesem Zug vom Stählernen Höllendrachen Kampfschaden zugefügt wurde. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea5c1dc-3754-46ec-8792-0dec141f0fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 519549}, \'multiverseid\': 519549}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de acero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}: El Engendro de acero obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{X}: Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de X cuyo controlador haya recibido daño de combate del Engendro de acero este turno. Activa esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1949724-7260-4586-b4df-191066d6d20e\', \'multiverseId\': 519797}, \'multiverseid\': 519797}, {\'name\': "Escouflenfer d\'acier", \'text\': "Vol\\n{2} : L\'Escouflenfer d\'acier gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{X} : Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain avec une valeur de mana de X dont le contrôleur a subi des blessures de combat par l\'Escouflenfer d\'acier ce tour-ci. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ba2445-2c7f-4a87-931f-2a8d8da51f63\', \'multiverseId\': 520045}, \'multiverseid\': 520045}, {\'name\': "Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio", \'text\': "Volare\\n{2}: Il Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{X}: Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari a X al cui controllore è stato inflitto danno da combattimento dal Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio in questo turno. Attiva solo una volta per turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c9fe90-c22c-449f-b56e-98a800a0adc9\', \'multiverseId\': 520293}, \'multiverseid\': 520293}, {\'name\': \'鋼のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、鋼のヘルカイトは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{X}：このターンに鋼のヘルカイトによって戦闘ダメージを受けたプレイヤーがコントロールしていて、マナ総量がＸで、土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f11308d9-c5d0-4561-9913-1b5c5af1e504\', \'multiverseId\': 520541}, \'multiverseid\': 520541}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo de Aço\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}: Dragão Avérneo de Aço recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\n{X}: Destrua cada permanente não de terreno com valor de mana igual a X cujo controlador tenha sofrido dano de combate de Dragão Avérneo de Aço neste turno. Ative apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2188516-e9b6-4b15-a704-ad6f135d650c\', \'multiverseId\': 520789}, \'multiverseid\': 520789}, {\'name\': \'Стальной Змей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{2}: Стальной Змей получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\\n{X}: уничтожьте каждый не являющийся землей перманент с мановой ценностью X под контролем игрока, получившего боевые повреждения от Стального Змея в этом ходу. Активируйте только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919bf56f-8872-46d2-a042-8ad8d1838b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 521037}, \'multiverseid\': 521037}, {\'name\': \'钢铁残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{2}：钢铁残虐者得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n{X}：对本回合已受到钢铁残虐者之战斗伤害的牌手而言，消灭所有由其操控且法术力值为X的非地永久物。每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4bd38f-0343-463e-ab8c-0299f1ea3607\', \'multiverseId\': 521285}, \'multiverseid\': 521285}, {\'name\': \'鋼鐵殘虐者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}：鋼鐵殘虐者得+1/+0直到回合結束。\\n{X}：對本回合已受到鋼鐵殘虐者之戰鬥傷害的玩家而言，消滅所有由其操控且魔法力值為X的非地永久物。每回合只能起動一次。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c42ff1-312a-4619-b2c0-9f031413fca1\', \'multiverseId\': 521533}, \'multiverseid\': 521533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stürmischer Äther\', \'text\': \'Bringe sechs bleibende Karten deiner Wahl, die keine Länder sind, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In Erwartung des Angriffs fand sich die Bürgerwehr auf dem Hauptplatz ein, doch die Riesen kamen nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519396&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d115c77-ee21-4b52-bbd6-c34d16cfa9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 519396}, \'multiverseid\': 519396}, {\'name\': \'Vendaval del éter\', \'text\': \'Regresa seis permanentes objetivo que no sean tierra a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La milicia formó en la plaza central esperando la embestida, pero los gigantes no llegaron a cargar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af59bff-485f-49d6-851f-c732dbf1c9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 519644}, \'multiverseid\': 519644}, {\'name\': "Bourrasque d\'Éther", \'text\': \'Renvoyez six permanents non-terrain ciblés dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "En prévision de l\'assaut, la milice s\'était postée en formation sur la place centrale, mais les géants avaient disparu bien avant d\'y arriver.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519892&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a354c8-fd97-4d5d-91ad-d2483ffb3310\', \'multiverseId\': 519892}, \'multiverseid\': 519892}, {\'name\': \'Burrasca Eterea\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare sei permanenti non terra bersaglio in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "La milizia si dispose in formazione nella piazza centrale in attesa dell\'assalto, ma i giganti non la raggiunsero mai.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21410861-8169-4c06-9518-cce557e8ab5f\', \'multiverseId\': 520140}, \'multiverseid\': 520140}, {\'name\': \'霊気の突風\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント６つを対象とする。それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'猛攻を待つべく中央広場に集合した民兵たちであったが、巨人たちはそこに到達することはなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f75968-bfc4-4c1c-83eb-bad02440d4a2\', \'multiverseId\': 520388}, \'multiverseid\': 520388}, {\'name\': \'Vendaval Etéreo\', \'text\': \'Devolva seis permanentes alvo não de terreno para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A milícia se posicionou na praça central à espera da investida, mas os gigantes nunca chegaram até lá.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14d1aae3-d121-4690-a473-ac8ea61f7154\', \'multiverseId\': 520636}, \'multiverseid\': 520636}, {\'name\': \'Эфирная Буря\', \'text\': \'Верните шесть целевых не являющихся землями перманентов в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Ополчение построилось на центральной площади, ожидая начала резни, но великаны так и не добрались до них.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f8f740-54be-4888-81ad-089c8f6e55cb\', \'multiverseId\': 520884}, \'multiverseid\': 520884}, {\'name\': \'乙太狂风\', \'text\': \'将六个目标非地永久物各移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'义勇兵已在中心广场严阵以待，准备抵御巨人强大攻势，但敌人却从未出现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26044156-5637-4565-b8f3-892174c27b88\', \'multiverseId\': 521132}, \'multiverseid\': 521132}, {\'name\': \'乙太狂風\', \'text\': \'將六個目標非地永久物各移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'義勇兵已在中心廣場嚴陣以待，準備抵禦巨人強大攻勢，但敵人卻從未出現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f25b757-0f04-43d8-bb26-2311b69c5df9\', \'multiverseId\': 521380}, \'multiverseid\': 521380}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sumpfland-Blutmagierin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Anstatt die Manakosten des nächsten Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kannst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags des Zauberspruchs bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'Blutmagie ist mehr Aderlass als Wissenschaft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e562a88-bc38-44cd-acf1-dd6a7ed4c3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 518510}, \'multiverseid\': 518510}, {\'name\': \'Conjurasangre del pantano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: En lugar de pagar el coste de maná del siguiente hechizo que lances este turno, puedes pagar una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'La magia de sangre mana más que la ciencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113172d1-64f0-4902-99be-bf9e9c0952da\', \'multiverseId\': 518581}, \'multiverseid\': 518581}, {\'name\': \'Magesang des marais\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Plutôt que payer le coût de mana du prochain sort que vous lancez ce tour-ci, vous pouvez payer un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "La magie du sang est plus une question d\'artère que de science.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518652&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625eef5d-342e-48a0-a665-89f683771458\', \'multiverseId\': 518652}, \'multiverseid\': 518652}, {\'name\': "Sanguinomante dell\'Acquitrino", \'text\': \'Volare\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Invece di pagare il costo di mana della prossima magia che lanci in questo turno, puoi pagare punti vita pari al valore di mana di quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'La magia del sangue è più arteria che scienza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e598ec0-8b43-4c2f-9fd2-9961d60614c7\', \'multiverseId\': 518723}, \'multiverseid\': 518723}, {\'name\': \'湿地帯の血唱え\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{B}, {T}：あなたはこのターン次に唱える呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、その呪文のマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'血の魔法は術というよりも脈である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eec4241-4178-48ca-82cf-12ebe5f55764\', \'multiverseId\': 518794}, \'multiverseid\': 518794}, {\'name\': \'Conjuradora de Sangue do Charco\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Em vez de pagar o custo de mana da próxima mágica que você conjurar neste turno, você pode pagar uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana da mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'A magia sanguínea é muito mais artéria do que ciência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61bc7a23-cc00-4a62-9ecb-b032772d4c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 518865}, \'multiverseid\': 518865}, {\'name\': \'Болотная Кровопускательница\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{1}{B}, {T}: вместо того, чтобы оплачивать мана-стоимость следующего заклинания, которое вы разыграете в этом ходу, вы можете заплатить жизни в количестве, равном его мановой ценности.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'Магия крови — это пульсирующее искусство, а не точная наука.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=518936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8260782c-d1db-41bd-8f6e-fbe902b365ae\', \'multiverseId\': 518936}, \'multiverseid\': 518936}, {\'name\': \'沼地鲜血法师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{1}{B}，{T}：对你本回合施放的下一个咒语而言，你可以支付等同于其法术力值的生命，而不支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'鲜血魔法比自然科学更令人血脉贲张。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d5b79fd-b833-462f-a5ba-c3854ee27a44\', \'multiverseId\': 519007}, \'multiverseid\': 519007}, {\'name\': \'沼地鮮血法師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{B}，{T}：對你本回合施放的下一個咒語而言，你可以支付等同於其魔法力值的生命，而不支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'鮮血魔法比自然科學更令人血脈賁張。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'437a4683-da86-48a8-89e9-98dc93d086f2\', \'multiverseId\': 519078}, \'multiverseid\': 519078}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sumpfland-Blutmagierin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Anstatt die Manakosten des nächsten Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kannst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags des Zauberspruchs bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521719&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7dabd13-7791-4a5c-a2a2-a8ee3d3b4c13\', \'multiverseId\': 521719}, \'multiverseid\': 521719}, {\'name\': \'Conjurasangre del pantano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: En lugar de pagar el coste de maná del siguiente hechizo que lances este turno, puedes pagar una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45dc153-93d4-4258-8006-0e338315e9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 521799}, \'multiverseid\': 521799}, {\'name\': \'Magesang des marais\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Plutôt que payer le coût de mana du prochain sort que vous lancez ce tour-ci, vous pouvez payer un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521879&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9eb4fc-4c12-4bab-b75f-9bbeebd56041\', \'multiverseId\': 521879}, \'multiverseid\': 521879}, {\'name\': "Sanguinomante dell\'Acquitrino", \'text\': \'Volare\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Invece di pagare il costo di mana della prossima magia che lanci in questo turno, puoi pagare punti vita pari al valore di mana di quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83912874-bae1-406c-83c8-25ccce5068f7\', \'multiverseId\': 521959}, \'multiverseid\': 521959}, {\'name\': \'湿地帯の血唱え\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{B}, {T}：あなたはこのターン次に唱える呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、その呪文のマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=522039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72daf191-8796-4519-9970-a357a88c5a16\', \'multiverseId\': 522039}, \'multiverseid\': 522039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Kreativität\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}. Der Talisman der Kreativität fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Gute Pläne sind nicht zeitaufwendig. Es braucht nur viele schlechte Ideen und ein Ausschlussverfahren."\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa919699-bb9d-41d8-8fbc-ea30f808dc2c\', \'multiverseId\': 519552}, \'multiverseid\': 519552}, {\'name\': \'Talismán de creatividad\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}. El Talismán de creatividad te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las buenas ideas no llevan tiempo. Lo que llevan es un montón de ideas malas anteriores".\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3724686d-0194-4535-8758-cfcdd8903495\', \'multiverseId\': 519800}, \'multiverseid\': 519800}, {\'name\': \'Talisman de créativité\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}. Le Talisman de créativité vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Les bonnes idées n\'ont pas besoin de temps. Elles ont d\'abord besoin de beaucoup de mauvaises idées. »\\n—Ral Zarek", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a758ff5-bef1-49ec-a0ea-d38f0a6f2364\', \'multiverseId\': 520048}, \'multiverseid\': 520048}, {\'name\': \'Talismano della Creatività\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}. Il Talismano della Creatività ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Per le ottime idee non serve tempo. Servono prima un sacco di pessime idee."\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e56fcf-db17-46c2-af07-407e3eaafb4c\', \'multiverseId\': 520296}, \'multiverseid\': 520296}, {\'name\': \'独創のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。独創のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「名案を思いつくのに時間は必要ない。だがその前に大量の没案が必要だ。」\\n――ラル・ザレック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8fe69cb-5eca-4514-97cb-430c92963efb\', \'multiverseId\': 520544}, \'multiverseid\': 520544}, {\'name\': \'Talismã da Criatividade\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}. Talismã da Criatividade causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"As boas ideias não vêm com o tempo. Elas vêm depois de um monte de ideias ruins."\\n— Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ea2e7ee-f1c1-47b3-9f81-059b4f3d6f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 520792}, \'multiverseid\': 520792}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Творчества\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {R}. Амулет Творчества наносит вам 1 повреждение.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Чтобы в голову пришла хорошая идея, не нужно времени. Нужно просто, чтобы сначала пришло множество плохих идей».\\n— Рал Зарек\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'260db5ec-bb0e-42f7-8d68-5e65ed7a79b4\', \'multiverseId\': 521040}, \'multiverseid\': 521040}, {\'name\': \'创新饰符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。创新饰符对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「优质的创想并非由时间堆砌而成，而是由大量糟糕的创想堆砌而成。」\\n～拉尔查雷克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb0e75d-d5e2-4fd2-af77-e570a0000f87\', \'multiverseId\': 521288}, \'multiverseid\': 521288}, {\'name\': \'創新飾符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。創新飾符對你造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「優質的創想並非由時間堆砌而成，而是由大量糟糕的創想堆砌而成。」\\n～拉爾查雷克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c4bef1-2259-47f7-8c01-e528c2a6172e\', \'multiverseId\': 521536}, \'multiverseid\': 521536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Zähigkeit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Der Talisman der Zähigkeit fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der stetige Aufstieg der Unterdrückten ist so unaufhaltsam wie das Wuchern der Ranken auf dem Waldboden."\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f85ad24-e541-42e0-9203-ef43dafb6b37\', \'multiverseId\': 519553}, \'multiverseid\': 519553}, {\'name\': \'Talismán de resiliencia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. El Talismán de resiliencia te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El ascenso perpetuo de los oprimidos es tan inevitable como que las lianas invadan los bosques".\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'504b2cce-96bb-42ed-abe3-a80263925254\', \'multiverseId\': 519801}, \'multiverseid\': 519801}, {\'name\': \'Talisman de résistance\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. Le Talisman de résistance vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'essor perpétuel des opprimés est aussi inévitable que celui des lianes dans une forêt. »\\n—Vraska", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45e5b57-bcc5-4e72-99bf-bcb6035fb51c\', \'multiverseId\': 520049}, \'multiverseid\': 520049}, {\'name\': \'Talismano della Resistenza\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}. Il Talismano della Resistenza ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La continua ribellione degli oppressi è inevitabile come i rampicanti che usurpano la foresta."\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcae7268-c5f5-42b5-aa2a-71ab9a5a6982\', \'multiverseId\': 520297}, \'multiverseid\': 520297}, {\'name\': \'反発のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。反発のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「抑圧された者が蜂起を繰り返すことは避けられないのよ。森につる草がはびこるのと同じさね。」\\n――ヴラスカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96a5741-e122-43c9-b6f7-86398b768cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 520545}, \'multiverseid\': 520545}, {\'name\': \'Talismã da Resiliência\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}. Talismã da Resiliência causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A contínua ascensão dos oprimidos é tão inevitável quanto a das gavinhas que se apossessam de uma floresta."\\n— Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e1784de-9bd6-4c29-a734-48f18998639d\', \'multiverseId\': 520793}, \'multiverseid\': 520793}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Стойкости\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}. Амулет Стойкости наносит вам 1 повреждение.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Восстание угнетенных так же неизбежно, как и лианы, захватывающие лес».\\n— Враска\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c73808b-9d2a-4ce1-94ad-c92c59f46d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 521041}, \'multiverseid\': 521041}, {\'name\': \'复生饰符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。复生饰符对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如同树林无法阻止粗藤细蔓攀附，任谁也不能压制受迫阶层崛起。」\\n～瓦丝卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'883f5c23-1191-4e3b-8c8c-359f0ff1df0f\', \'multiverseId\': 521289}, \'multiverseid\': 521289}, {\'name\': \'復生飾符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。復生飾符對你造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如同樹林無法阻止粗藤細蔓攀附，任誰也不能壓制受迫階層崛起。」\\n～瓦絲卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d1982c2-cce1-4206-ac99-ca180bf5a149\', \'multiverseId\': 521537}, \'multiverseid\': 521537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talrand der Himmelsbeschwörer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Sceada-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ozeane sind riesig, doch der Himmel ist noch größer. Warum sollte ich mich mit einem Königreich zufriedengeben, wo ich doch über beide herrschen kann?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519414&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5453a7b7-e173-44d0-8c74-0246efc2fdae\', \'multiverseId\': 519414}, \'multiverseid\': 519414}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, invocador celeste\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Draco azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Los mares son vastos, pero los cielos lo son más todavía. ¿Por qué contentarse con un reino si puedes dominar ambos?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'426ef7f8-3c5e-4d0c-9c2c-92a38a44899a\', \'multiverseId\': 519662}, \'multiverseid\': 519662}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, invocateur céleste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Drakôn avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« La mer est vaste, mais bien moins que le ciel. Pourquoi se contenter d\'un royaume quand je peux régner sur les deux ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd38d100-6e9f-4d76-b4f1-64803997db16\', \'multiverseId\': 519910}, \'multiverseid\': 519910}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, Evocatore Celeste\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Draghetto 2/2 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"I mari sono immensi, ma i cieli lo sono anche di più. Perché accontentarsi di un regno quando posso governare entrambi?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc19da6-d119-4cb1-a2ce-d3680c651bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 520158}, \'multiverseid\': 520158}, {\'name\': \'空召喚士ターランド\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「海は広大だが、空はそれ以上に広大だ。その両方を統べることができるなら、なぜひとつの王国に満足しようか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bf66c7e-c6d0-47bd-99a3-b9c9e985b1a0\', \'multiverseId\': 520406}, \'multiverseid\': 520406}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, Invocador Celeste\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura Dragonete azul 2/2 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Os mares são vastos, mas os céus são ainda mais. Por que me contentar com um reino quando posso governar ambos?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13149454-6d20-4000-a773-cb46f48b8502\', \'multiverseId\': 520654}, \'multiverseid\': 520654}, {\'name\': \'Талранд, Небесный Вызыватель\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 синий Дрейк с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Море широко, но небеса поистине безбрежны. Почему я должен довольствоваться одной стихией, когда могу повелевать обеими?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce36987f-3ea3-4397-bc84-6add0ea264b2\', \'multiverseId\': 520902}, \'multiverseid\': 520902}, {\'name\': \'空召师陶岚\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个2/2蓝色，具飞行异能的龙兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「大海浩瀚，但天空更加无际。如果我能同时统治两者，又何必只安于其一？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b15e48-2998-4f1d-9eee-3bf028c80316\', \'multiverseId\': 521150}, \'multiverseid\': 521150}, {\'name\': \'空召師陶嵐\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，派出一個2/2藍色，具飛行異能的龍獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「大海浩瀚，但天空更加無際。如果我能同時統治兩者，又何必只安於其一？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c264a510-e235-4597-8a8e-a05898ae39a9\', \'multiverseId\': 521398}, \'multiverseid\': 521398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tausendjähriges Elixier\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Fähigkeiten von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, aktivieren, als ob die Kreaturen Eile hätten.\\n{1}, {T}: Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Paradoxerweise bräuchte man das Stärkungsmittel eines Riesen, um den riesigen Krug an den Mund zu führen, um daraus zu trinken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad35043-2615-4ab4-9e0e-af3084f80173\', \'multiverseId\': 519554}, \'multiverseid\': 519554}, {\'name\': \'Elixir de los mil años\', \'text\': \'Puedes activar las habilidades de las criaturas que controlas como si esas criaturas tuvieran la habilidad de prisa.\\n{1}, {T}: Endereza la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Paradójicamente, para volcar la gigantesca jarra y tomar un trago, necesitas la energía de un tónico de gigante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79dd182a-9b98-4f8e-897b-fe6018e14a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 519802}, \'multiverseid\': 519802}, {\'name\': \'Élixir de mille ans\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez activer les capacités des créatures que vous contrôlez comme si ces créatures avaient la célérité.\\n{1}, {T} : Dégagez une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Paradoxalement, pour soulever l\'énorme broc et y boire, il vous faudrait l\'énergie de ce tonique de géant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3e137a-29e8-4aab-9726-6f10dfc935bb\', \'multiverseId\': 520050}, \'multiverseid\': 520050}, {\'name\': \'Elisir Millenario\', \'text\': \'Puoi attivare le abilità delle creature che controlli come se quelle creature avessero rapidità.\\n{1}, {T}: STAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Paradossalmente, per inclinare quell\'enorme brocca per un sorsetto, avresti bisogno dell\'energia di quel tonico dei giganti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'905090a5-514c-41b9-9ae0-2795b35786b0\', \'multiverseId\': 520298}, \'multiverseid\': 520298}, {\'name\': \'千年霊薬\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの能力を、そのクリーチャーが速攻を持っているかのように起動してもよい。\\n{1}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'矛盾した話だが、巨人の強壮剤をひとすすりするために器を傾けるには、それの助けが要る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'677a395d-b500-4468-a84a-5ee702150dde\', \'multiverseId\': 520546}, \'multiverseid\': 520546}, {\'name\': \'Elixir Milenário\', \'text\': \'Você pode ativar as habilidades das criaturas que você controla como se essas criaturas tivessem ímpeto.\\n{1}, {T}: Desvire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ironicamente, para inclinar o enorme jarro e tomar um gole você precisaria da energia do tônico do gigante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc34131d-351a-423e-af29-d0fe9b9ec6c7\', \'multiverseId\': 520794}, \'multiverseid\': 520794}, {\'name\': \'Тысячелетний Эликсир\', \'text\': \'Вы можете активировать способности существ под вашим контролем, как будто у тех существ есть Ускорение.\\n{1}, {T}: разверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Парадоксально, но для того чтобы наклонить этот огромный кувшин, потребуется заключенная в нем сила напитка гигантов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e52384a-1513-4751-a3da-a37f6b92f485\', \'multiverseId\': 521042}, \'multiverseid\': 521042}, {\'name\': \'千年琼浆\', \'text\': \'对由你操控的生物而言，你可以将其视同具有敏捷异能地来起动其异能。\\n{1}，{T}：重置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'矛盾的是，为了把这巨瓮放斜来饮用，你必须以巨人兴奋剂相助。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'903fab85-2b55-4726-a08d-fb16311903b9\', \'multiverseId\': 521290}, \'multiverseid\': 521290}, {\'name\': \'千年瓊漿\', \'text\': \'對由你操控的生物而言，你可以將其視同具有敏捷異能地來起動其異能。\\n{1}，{T}：重置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'矛盾的是，為了把這巨甕放斜來飲用，你必須以巨人興奮劑相助。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97699ba7-a7b3-4caa-a241-79e4f872b026\', \'multiverseId\': 521538}, \'multiverseid\': 521538}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel der Eingebung', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Eingebung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Eingebung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519605&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f436bb23-c5a5-4974-a2cf-1220b7dcee5e', 'multiverseId': 519605}, 'multiverseid': 519605}, {'name': 'Templo de la epifanía', 'text': 'El Templo de la epifanía entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la epifanía entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519853&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c67e940d-1d9c-4c8f-b1d9-4ba9975f052e', 'multiverseId': 519853}, 'multiverseid': 519853}, {'name': 'Temple de la révélation', 'text': 'Le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520101&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a32cdf20-6f0b-493b-a1e7-67628c089fb8', 'multiverseId': 520101}, 'multiverseid': 520101}, {'name': 'Tempio della Rivelazione', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Rivelazione entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Rivelazione entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520349&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51211b2f-dad0-4de4-a930-3874362d0153', 'multiverseId': 520349}, 'multiverseid': 520349}, {'name': '天啓の神殿', 'text': '天啓の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n天啓の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520597&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a182f888-37cd-43cf-afb1-77c8d6a46f88', 'multiverseId': 520597}, 'multiverseid': 520597}, {'name': 'Templo da Epifania', 'text': 'Templo da Epifania entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo da Epifania entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520845&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74110330-2051-42ef-b139-dde7e575d606', 'multiverseId': 520845}, 'multiverseid': 520845}, {'name': 'Храм Прозрения', 'text': 'Храм Прозрения выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Храм Прозрения выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 1.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {R}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521093&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe013cf3-7bcf-4445-b146-79d8a25e4366', 'multiverseId': 521093}, 'multiverseid': 521093}, {'name': '顿悟殿堂', 'text': '顿悟殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当顿悟殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521341&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4834dae7-6f2c-4dfb-9399-08497bfce986', 'multiverseId': 521341}, 'multiverseid': 521341}, {'name': '頓悟殿堂', 'text': '頓悟殿堂須橫置進戰場。\\n當頓悟殿堂進戰場時，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521589&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c82ed9d-2c63-47f3-93d8-91fdf394940f', 'multiverseId': 521589}, 'multiverseid': 521589}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel der Geheimnisse', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Geheimnisse kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Geheimnisse ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519607&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53107605-31ba-485f-b69a-e31bd6d96403', 'multiverseId': 519607}, 'multiverseid': 519607}, {'name': 'Templo del misterio', 'text': 'El Templo del misterio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del misterio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519855&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cd924c2-17a3-4dff-87ed-d0c691040cd2', 'multiverseId': 519855}, 'multiverseid': 519855}, {'name': 'Temple du mystère', 'text': 'Le Temple du mystère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du mystère arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520103&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8d48dc5-86d0-468e-ace9-c1393154bbff', 'multiverseId': 520103}, 'multiverseid': 520103}, {'name': 'Tempio del Mistero', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Mistero entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Mistero entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520351&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6842c1f-d47e-412f-8a53-c0031334147b', 'multiverseId': 520351}, 'multiverseid': 520351}, {'name': '神秘の神殿', 'text': '神秘の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n神秘の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520599&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ace738b-17ff-410a-964b-d3790e593546', 'multiverseId': 520599}, 'multiverseid': 520599}, {'name': 'Templo do Mistério', 'text': 'Templo do Mistério entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo do Mistério entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520847&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcae3e11-cac1-4da0-9f96-d646294eb422', 'multiverseId': 520847}, 'multiverseid': 520847}, {'name': 'Храм Таинств', 'text': 'Храм Таинств выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Храм Таинств выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 1.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521095&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d927efe-4a43-483e-bf76-69e85bd09451', 'multiverseId': 521095}, 'multiverseid': 521095}, {'name': '神秘殿堂', 'text': '神秘殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当神秘殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521343&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e8dc46a-cf06-44d0-8278-c0a59bed60a2', 'multiverseId': 521343}, 'multiverseid': 521343}, {'name': '神秘殿堂', 'text': '神秘殿堂須橫置進戰場。\\n當神秘殿堂進戰場時，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521591&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06203b22-3561-4ec6-8090-22f965d30e04', 'multiverseId': 521591}, 'multiverseid': 521591}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die, die nichts zum Tempel bringen, nehmen auch nichts fort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09053430-d3b9-4bcb-bd87-cbb06c6ecdaa\', \'multiverseId\': 519609}, \'multiverseid\': 519609}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Activa esto solo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que no traen nada al templo no se llevan nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0acd7f37-fb4c-4ffb-876b-89166a55b667\', \'multiverseId\': 519857}, \'multiverseid\': 519857}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui n\'apportent rien au temple ne remportent rien avec eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f313d5b3-bac2-49a2-9780-cc9cb0a18c58\', \'multiverseId\': 520105}, \'multiverseid\': 520105}, {\'name\': \'Tempio della Dea Fasulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Attiva solo se controlli cinque o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che non portano niente al tempio non ricevono nulla da esso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394e17b2-d26d-4746-9f23-a0a40a0f4779\', \'multiverseId\': 520353}, \'multiverseid\': 520353}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。あなたが土地５つ以上をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'寺院に何も捧げない者は、何も得られない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'497416ce-e54d-481f-a34a-330b1a159df2\', \'multiverseId\': 520601}, \'multiverseid\': 520601}, {\'name\': \'Templo do Falso Deus\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Ative somente se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os que ao templo nada trazem dele nada levam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09044d96-9942-4aca-a2f9-292dfe8c7b71\', \'multiverseId\': 520849}, \'multiverseid\': 520849}, {\'name\': \'Храм Ложного Бога\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}. Активируйте, только если вы контролируете не менее пяти земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Те, кто ничего не приносят в храм, ничего и не забирают.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86529ad-2006-4840-94a4-6ab5d191188b\', \'multiverseId\': 521097}, \'multiverseid\': 521097}, {\'name\': \'伪神殿堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。只能于你操控五个或更多地时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'无诚不灵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9872a47-00de-40f7-90a4-b26c5fa41de6\', \'multiverseId\': 521345}, \'multiverseid\': 521345}, {\'name\': \'偽神殿堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。只能於你操控五個或更多地時起動。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'無誠不靈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=521593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00d1a3b-66ce-466a-bfbf-88d771bcb1de\', \'multiverseId\': 521593}, \'multiverseid\': 521593}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel des Schweigens', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Schweigens kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Schweigens ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519608&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00a31284-c6c0-4241-9abf-3129170f74a6', 'multiverseId': 519608}, 'multiverseid': 519608}, {'name': 'Templo del silencio', 'text': 'El Templo del silencio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del silencio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=519856&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5cdf94e-eb7b-4538-bfdd-1e4384b54447', 'multiverseId': 519856}, 'multiverseid': 519856}, {'name': 'Temple du silence', 'text': 'Le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520104&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f25110f-3ac9-493b-8fac-21f68c8934c1', 'multiverseId': 520104}, 'multiverseid': 520104}, {'name': 'Tempio del Silenzio', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520352&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f458b313-79b6-48f7-8d3c-02821802264f', 'multiverseId': 520352}, 'multiverseid': 520352}, {'name': '静寂の神殿', 'text': '静寂の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n静寂の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=520600&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af29010e-f35e-4561-8d94-97b8d7f8ff26', 'multiverseId': 520600},