This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the amount of life you gained this turn.\\nTrample\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if you gained life this turn, you may cast Sproutback Trudge from your graveyard.', 'Trample\\nAt the beginning of your end step, create a number of Food tokens equal to the number of nontoken creatures you had enter the battlefield under your control this turn.\\n{1}, Sacrifice a Food: Target creature gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it.', 'Trample\\nInferno Project enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the total mana value of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.', 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.', 'Trample\\nWhen Gluttonous Troll enters the battlefield, create a number of Food tokens equal to the number of opponents you have. (Food tokens are artifacts with "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.")\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice another nonland permanent: Gluttonous Troll gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nWhenever a player casts a spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Managorger Hydra.', "Trample\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Erratic Cyclops gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is that spell's mana value.", "Trample\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Bosh, Iron Golem deals damage equal to the sacrificed artifact's mana value to any target.", 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Untap Victory Chimes during each other player's untap step.\\n{T}: A player of your choice adds {C}.", 'Vigilance, protection from creatures\\nWhenever a creature deals combat damage to you, destroy that creature. Create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Sun Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, you may return target permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Vigilance\\n{1}, Sacrifice an artifact: Target creature you control gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\n{X}, {T}, Exile an artifact card with mana value X from your graveyard: Create two tokens that are copies of the exiled card. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Ward {2} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {2}.)\\nIf one or more tokens would be created under your control, twice that many of those tokens are created instead.', 'Ward {2}\\nIf one or more tokens would be created under your control, twice that many of those tokens are created instead.', "When Archaeomancer's Map enters the battlefield, search your library for up to two basic Plains cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.\\nWhenever a land enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, if that player controls more lands than you, you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.", "When Author of Shadows enters the battlefield, exile all cards from all opponents' graveyards. Choose a nonland card exiled this way. You may cast that card for as long as it remains exiled, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast that spell.", "When Champion of Wits enters the battlefield, you may draw cards equal to its power. If you do, discard two cards.\\nEternalize {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie Naga Wizard with no mana cost. Eternalize only as a sorcery.)", "When Coiling Oracle enters the battlefield, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put that card into your hand.", "When Coveted Jewel enters the battlefield, draw three cards.\\n{T}: Add three mana of any one color.\\nWhenever one or more creatures an opponent controls attack you and aren't blocked, that player draws three cards and gains control of Coveted Jewel. Untap it.", 'When Elite Scaleguard enters the battlefield, bolster 2. (Choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put two +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.', 'When Fractal Harness enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 green and blue Fractal creature token. Put X +1/+1 counters on it and attach Fractal Harness to it.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks, double the number of +1/+1 counters on it.\\nEquip {2}', 'When Ichor Wellspring enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Meteor Golem enters the battlefield, destroy target nonland permanent an opponent controls.', 'When Mycosynth Wellspring enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Myr Battlesphere enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens.\\nWhenever Myr Battlesphere attacks, you may tap X untapped Myr you control. If you do, Myr Battlesphere gets +X/+0 until end of turn and deals X damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.", 'When Oreskos Explorer enters the battlefield, search your library for up to X Plains cards, where X is the number of players who control more lands than you. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Pia Nalaar enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\n{1}{R}: Target artifact creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{1}, Sacrifice an artifact: Target creature can't block this turn.", 'When Radiant Fountain enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'When Reef Worm dies, create a 3/3 blue Fish creature token with "When this creature dies, create a 6/6 blue Whale creature token with ‘\\nWhen this creature dies, create a 9/9 blue Kraken creature token.\'"', 'When Scholarship Sponsor enters the battlefield, each player who controls fewer lands than the player who controls the most lands searches their library for a number of basic land cards less than or equal to the difference, puts those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles.', 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', "When Stalking Leonin enters the battlefield, secretly choose an opponent.\\nReveal the player you chose: Exile target creature that's attacking you if it's controlled by the chosen player. Activate only once.", 'When Terastodon enters the battlefield, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'When Thopter Engineer enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\nArtifact creatures you control have haste.', "When Together Forever enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\n{1}: Choose target creature with a counter on it. When that creature dies this turn, return that card to its owner's hand.", 'When Wildfire Devils enters the battlefield and at the beginning of your upkeep, choose a player at random. That player exiles an instant or sorcery card from their graveyard. Copy that card. You may cast the copy without paying its mana cost.', 'When you cast this spell, create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', 'Whenever Blossoming Bogbeast attacks, you gain 2 life. Then creatures you control gain trample and get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the amount of life you gained this turn.', "Whenever Etali, Primal Storm attacks, exile the top card of each player's library, then you may cast any number of spells from among those cards without paying their mana costs.", "Whenever Ruxa, Patient Professor enters the battlefield or attacks, return target creature card with no abilities from your graveyard to your hand.\\nCreatures you control with no abilities get +1/+1.\\nYou may have creatures you control with no abilities assign their combat damage as though they weren't blocked.", 'Whenever Scrap Trawler or another artifact you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return to your hand target artifact card in your graveyard with lesser mana value.', "Whenever Verdant Sun's Avatar or another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Whenever a Kraken, Leviathan, Octopus, or Serpent you control deals combat damage to a player, create a 9/9 blue Kraken creature token.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, you gain 1 life and draw a card.', "Whenever a nontoken creature enters the battlefield under an opponent's control this turn, create a token that's a copy of that creature.", 'Whenever a player casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Forgotten Ancient onto other creatures.', "Whenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, put a number of charge counters on Geometric Nexus equal to that spell's mana value.\\n{6}, {T}, Remove all charge counters from Geometric Nexus: Create a 0/0 green and blue Fractal creature token. Put X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of charge counters removed this way.", 'Whenever an artifact enters the battlefield under your control, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.', "Whenever an opponent attacks you and/or one or more planeswalkers you control, exile the top card of that player's library. You may play that card for as long as it remains exiled, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast it.", 'Whenever an opponent casts their second spell each turn, you create a Treasure token.', "Whenever another nontoken creature you control dies, you may return it to the battlefield face down under its owner's control. It's a Forest land. (It has no other types or abilities.)", 'Whenever one or more creatures attack, you may have target attacking creature gain double strike until end of turn.', "Whenever you cast a spell from your hand, reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is that spell's mana value. You may cast a spell with mana value X or less from among cards revealed this way without paying its mana cost. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", "Whenever you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, put two charge counters on Elementalist's Palette.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{T}: Add {C} for each charge counter on Elementalist's Palette. Spend this mana only on costs that contain {X}.", 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a 0/0 colorless Construct artifact creature token with "This creature gets +1/+1 for each artifact you control."', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create an X/X colorless Construct artifact creature token, where X is that spell's mana value.\\n{3}{U}{U}, Exile Metallurgic Summonings: Return all instant and sorcery cards from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only if you control six or more artifacts.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Whenever you gain life, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Whenever you gain life, put that many +1/+1 counters on Ageless Entity.', 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a 4/4 green Fungus Beast creature token with trample.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {X}, where X is less than or equal to the amount of life you gained. If you do, draw X cards.', "Whenever you're dealt damage, put that many charge counters on Sun Droplet.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, you may remove a charge counter from Sun Droplet. If you do, you gain 1 life.", 'You draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the mana value of a commander you own on the battlefield or in the command zone.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You gain 2 life. Each creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the amount of life you gained this turn.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 1 life for each card in your hand.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may activate abilities of creatures you control as though those creatures had haste.\\n{1}, {T}: Untap target creature.', "You may cast Rout as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it.\\nDestroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'You may have Sculpting Steel enter the battlefield as a copy of any artifact on the battlefield.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Choose another target creature. Put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the amount of life you gained this turn or the amount of life you lost this turn, whichever is greater. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{2}, {T}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token. If it's a land card, put that card onto the battlefield under your control. If it's a noncreature, nonland card, you gain 2 life.", "{2}, {T}: You gain 5 life. Shuffle Elixir of Immortality and your graveyard into their owner's library.", "{2}{R}, {T}: Create a token that's a copy of target creature card in your graveyard, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types. It gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", "{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Dispeller's Capsule: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.", '{3}, Sacrifice Burnished Hart: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{B}, Pay 2 life: Draw a card.', "{G}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn. If that creature is a Snake, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "{T}, Discard a card: Up to one target creature can't be blocked this turn.\\nWhenever Key to the City becomes untapped, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.", '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature.\\n{T}, Remove a counter from a creature you control: Create a Treasure token.\\n{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Create a 2/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying.\\n{3}{B}: Untap Fain, the Broker.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal an artifact card. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. Audacious Reshapers deals damage to you equal to the number of cards revealed this way.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add one mana of any type that a land you control could produce. If Incubation Druid has a +1/+1 counter on it, add three mana of that type instead.\\n{3}{G}{G}: Adapt 3. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put three +1/+1 counters on it.)', '{T}: Add {C}. You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: You gain 1 life.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color. When you spend this mana to cast your commander, scry X, where X is the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Mage-Ring Network.\\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Mage-Ring Network: Add {C} for each storage counter removed this way.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Exile all cards from all graveyards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Each player draws a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Target commander gains lifelink until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}{U}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Cataract: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Unstable Obelisk: Destroy target permanent.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{G}{U}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature that entered the battlefield this turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains vigilance and haste until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Llanowar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Talisman of Resilience deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Yavimaya Coast deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Battlefield Forge deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Shivan Reef deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Talisman of Creativity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Caves of Koilos deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {R}.', '{T}: Add {R}. When that mana is spent to cast a red instant or sorcery spell, copy that spell and you may choose new targets for the copy.', '{T}: Add {R}.\\nAs Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield, you may have it become a copy of any creature on the battlefield until end of turn, except it has haste.', '{T}: Add {W}.', '{T}: Choose a player. That player adds one mana of any color they choose.', '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you created a token this turn.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifice Idol of Oblivion: Create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', '{T}: Draw two cards. Target opponent gains control of Humble Defector. Activate only during your turn.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each artifact creature you control.', "{U}, {T}: Until your next turn, target creature an opponent controls can't be blocked. Goad that creature.", "{U}, {T}: Until your next turn, target creature an opponent controls can't be blocked. Goad that creature. (Until your next turn, that creature attacks each combat if able and attacks a player other than you if able.)", "{W}, Sacrifice Soul Snare: Exile target creature that's attacking you or a planeswalker you control.", '{X}, {T}: Exile target creature card with mana value X from a graveyard. Create a 0/0 green and blue Fractal creature token. Put X +1/+1 counters on it. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, the Sky Asunder deals X damage to target creature with flying.\\nChannel — {X}{G}{G}, Discard Arashi: Arashi deals X damage to each creature with flying.', "{X}{X}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Hydra Broodmaster becomes monstrous, create X X/X green Hydra creature tokens."]
